{"id": "10330", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10330", "title": "Marie Solange Kayisire", "text": "Marie Solange Kayisire ni umunyarwandakazi w'umunyapolitiki akaba ari minisitiri ushinzwe ibikorwa by'ubutabazi, umwanya yajyiyeyo kuwa 02 Werurwe 2020.\nAmavuko..\nMarie Solange Kayisire yavukiye Mu Rwanda.\nUmwuga..\nMarie Solange ni umuyapolitiki ubifitemo uburambe kuko mbere yo kuba minisitiri ushinzwe ibikorwa by'ubutabazi yabanje kuba minisitiri muri Primature ushinzwe imirimo y'inama y'abaminisitiri."}
{"id": "10332", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10332", "title": "Seraphine Mukantabana", "text": "Ubuzima bwite.\nMUKANTABANA SERAPHINE yavutse taliki 23 Mata 1961, avukira mu akarere ka rusizi, intara y'iburengerazuba (ahahoze ari Cyangugu). Yabyawe na Shyirambere Lambert na Kabera Monique, nubwo yavukiye i Cyangugu, yakuriye i Kigali mu Kiyovu kuko yahageze mu 1966. Yize amashuri abanza, ayisumbuye ndetse yiga muri kaminuza Nkuru y'u Rwanda uhereye mu 1983-1988 yiga mu ishami ry'uburezi.\nIbyo yakoze.\nMUKANTABANA SERAPHINE amaze kwiga nyuma yaje guhabwa akazi muri Lycee de Kigali, aba umuyobozi w'amasomo (Prefet des etudes) kuva 1988-1994. Mu 1994 yage guhungira mu cyahoze ari Zaire ubu ni RDC Congo akomereza muri Congo-Brazaville mu 1997, aha niho guverinoma y'icyo gihugu yemereye impunzi zose z'Abanyarwanda kwishyira hamwe maze azibera umuyobozi ahereye 1998-2011. Muri uwo mwaka nibwo yatahutse mu Rwanda nyuma ya mezi 3 gusa, yahawe akazi muri Minisiteri y'imicungire y'ibiza no gucyura impunzi, nyuma yaho agirwa Komiseri muri komisiyo yo gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe abahoze ku rugerero. Muri 2013 agirwa Minisitiri w'ibiza no gucyura impunzi (MIDIMAR). "}
{"id": "10333", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10333", "title": "Claire Karekezi", "text": "Ubuzima bwite.\nDr Karekezi Claire (wavutse 1983) ni inzobere (Docteur) yize iby'imikorere y'ubwonko, kubaga ubwonko ndetse no kuvura indwara zibwibasira n'imitsi ikorana nabwo, ni umwe muri bacye mu banyarwanda wabashije kwiga kubaga ubwonko, ndetse akaba yarahawe n'ibihembo bitandukanye.\nAmashuri yize.\nDr Karekezi Claire (yavukiye i Butare) ariko yaje kwiga mu umujyi wa Kigali aho amashuri yisumbuye yayize muri Lycee Notre Damme de Citeaux akomereza muri Saint Andre aho yize imibare n'ubugenge (sciences) nyuma yerekeza muri Kaminuza y'u Rwanda aho yize ubuvuzi. Dr Karekezi Claire arangije kaminuza i Butare yahisemo kujya kongera ubumenyi mu ishami ryo kubaga ubwonko n'umugongo akaba yarakoreye imenyerezwa muri Suweden, ariko akomeza kwiga kwimenyereza kubaga ubwonko. nyuma akomereza imenyerezamwuga mu Kaminuza ya Oxford mu Bwongereza, nyuma akomereza amaso ye muri Maroco ahiga imyaka 5, muri 2007 yagiye kwiga andi maso muri Canada mukubaga ibibyimba by'ubwonko. Akaba yaragiye kwiga kubaga ubwonko nk'indoto yari afite. Avuga neza Ikinyarwanda, Icyongereza,Igiswahili n'Icyarabu gike.\nUmwuga.\nDr Karekezi Claire ubu akaba ari umuganga mubitaro bya Gisirikare bya kanombe mumujyi wa Kigali aho abaga ubwonko ndetse akanavura indwara zibasirwa n'imitsi.\nDr Claire Karekezi mu mwaka wa 2009 yasoje amahurwa mubijyanye no kubaga ubwonko,hanyuma asoza amasomo yibijyanye nabyo mu mwaka wa 2016 muri Kaminuza yitiriwe Muhamed v.akaba ari nawe mugore wambere wabimburiye abandi mu Rwanda kubigeraho\nIbihembo.\nNumwe mu bagore bahembwe na Forbes nk'umugore w'intangarugero. Igihembo cyizwi nka Academic Excellence Award gihabwa umugore wabaye indashyikirwa mubijyanye n'amasomo ndetse n'ubumenyi, Uretse kuba umuganga m'u Rwanda uyu mugore ni umuyobozi mukuru w'ihuriro ry'abagore bo muri Afurika b'inzobere mukubaga no kuvura ubwonko.\nUmwihariko.\nClaire ni umugore uvura mubitaro bya Gisirikare Ikanombe akaba ari umuhanga mukubaga ubwonkondetse n'imitsi akaba ari \numwe mubagore babavuzi bafawa nkabahanga ndetse n'ikitegererezo mu Rwanda"}
{"id": "10334", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10334", "title": "BWIZA JOLIE", "text": "Bwiza Jolie ni umwe mu bakobwa n'abagore b'abanyarwandakazi bari bari guhatanira ikamba rya nyampinga wa Washington America rya bereye Olympia ho muri USA wari usanzwe ari umunyamideli. Uyu mukobwa wavukiye muri Repubulika Iharanira Demukarasi ya Congo (RDC) ariko akaza gukurira mu Rwanda, yahavuye muri 2016 yerekeza muri Leta zunze Ubumwe za Amerika.Uyu wiyita Jolie Africa ni umunyeshuri muri kaminuza aho ageze mu mwaka wa gatatu yiga \"Political sciences\""}
{"id": "10335", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10335", "title": "Ingabire Deborah", "text": "Uwase Ingabire Deborah ni umuhanzi w'umunyarwandakazi Wamenyekanye kw'izina rya Marina Deborah akomoka mu karere ka Rwamagana mu Rwanda. \nUmwuga.\nIngabire Deborah Wamenyekanye munjyana ya RNB akaba yaramenyekanye muri Gashyantare 2017 ubwo yashyiraga hanze indirimbo ye ya mbere yitwa \"Byarara bibaye\". mugihe abantu bamwibazagaho yahise yumvikana anagaragara mu ndirimbo yamenyekanye cyane yitwa Too Much yahuriyemo n'abandi bahanzi Marina akaba yarinjiye mumuziki asanga inzira ziharuye kuko yabanje kuba mubiganza bya Uncle Austin wari ushinzwe inyungu n'iterambere rye rya muzika nyuma akaba yaraje gushyira umukono kumasezerano yo gukorana n'inzu ya \"The mane\" aba umuhanzi wa mbere iy'inzu yari itangiranye nawe akaba yaramenyekanye kandi kundirimbo nka \"Ni wowe\", \"Madede\" na \"Mbwira\" yakoranye na Kidum.kw'itariki 28 Mata 2021 Ingabire Deborah akaba yaratangaje ko yatandukanye na The Mane yamufashaga m'urugendo rwe rwa muzika.akaba kandi yarashyize umukono ku masezerano yo kwamamariza Catchyz tariki 13 Ukwakira 2021."}
{"id": "10336", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10336", "title": "Nayituriki Helene", "text": "Nayituriki Helene ni umunyarwandakazi, akaba uwihayimana wo mw'idini gaturika mu Rwanda. Umubikira [soeur] Nayituliki yashyizwe mu cyiciro cy'Intwari kubera ibikorwa bye byiza aho yashoboye guhisha abaturage barenga ijana mugihe cya Jenoside ya korewe abatutsi mu Rwanda mu 1994. Akaba yaritangiye uburezi mu Rwanda.\nUbuzima.\nNayituriki Helene \nInama.\nNayituriki Helene"}
{"id": "10337", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10337", "title": "Ingabire Egidie Bibio", "text": "Ingabire Egidie Bibio ni umunyarwandakazi ukora umwuga w'itangazamakuru ku ikigo cy'igihugu cy'itangazamakuru mu Rwanda RBA. Yabaye perezida w'ihuriro ry'abanyamakuru b'igitsina gore mu Rwanda.\nAmateka ajyanye n'umwuga.\nBibio ni umugore ukora mu itangaza makuru mu rurimi rw'ikinyarwanda, akayobora ibiganiro bitandukanye ndetse akaba umuyobozi w'ibiganiro bimwe na bimwe kuri Televiziyo y'u Rwanda(RTV), yabaye kandi umushyushyarugamba ndetse yabaye mu kanama gatora Miss Rwanda 2022, mo mubindi bihe bitandukanye.\nUbuzima Bwite..\nIngabire Egidie Bibio Yavukiye mu Rwanda,yize amashuri yisumbuye mu kigo cy'ababikira kitiriwe mutagaifu Berenadeta i Save mu karere ka Gisagara, aho yize indimi nyuma aza gukomeza muri Kaminuza y'u Rwanda muri Huye niho yakuye Impamyabumenyi y'itangazamakuru, igihe yigaga muri kaminuza yakoraga kuri radiyo Salus ikorera muri uwo mugi wa Huye \nBibio kandi yaje gutorwa nk'umunyamakuru w'umugore ukuriye ihuriro ry'abanyamakuru b'igitsina gore mu Rwanda ku mwanya wa perezida, ari naho yagize umugambi mwiza wo gutoza umugore kuba umunyamakuru no gutinyuka mu buvugizi bwa bagenzi babo nk'abagore mu itangazamakuru.\nKuwa 5 Kanama 2012 Egidiya yasezeranye na Sam Mandela kuba umugore we ndetse no kuzabana akaramata, akaba ari umugore yabyaye abana ndeetse n'abandi arera.\nUbutumwa..\nAbagore barashoboye kandi byose babigeraho iyo bafatanije, icyambere ni ugutinyuka kandi ukagaragaza ibyo ushoboye gukora."}
{"id": "10338", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10338", "title": "Rose Kabuye", "text": "Rose Kabuye (yavutse kuwa 22 Mata 1961 i Muvumba) ni umwe mu ba koloneli basezerewe mu gisirikare cy'u Rwanda, aho akiri umugore wambere wari ufite ipeti ryo hejuru mu ngabo z'igihugu. Ubu akora mu bikorera ku giti cyabo aho ari umuyobozi muri kompanyi yitwa Virunga Logistics and Startech Limited, yigeze no kuba umuyobozi w'umujyi wa Kigali, yabaye kandi ushizwe gutegura ingendo z'abayobozi bakuru b'igihugu, aza gukora mu nteko nshingamategeko. Kubera uruhare yagize mu rugamba rwo kubohora igihugu yahawe umudali n' umukuru w'igihugu Paul Kagame. \nUbuzima bwite.\nRose kabuye yakuriye kandi yiga muri Uganda, yatangiye amahugurwa ya gisirikare mu1986 arangije kwiga muri Kaminuza ya Makelele aho yabonye impamyabushobozi muri politike n'ubuyobozi, yagiye mu ngabo za RPF (Rwandan Patriotic Front) 1980, aza no kuba umwe mu bayobozi muri izo ngabo, aho yabaye umwe mubagize ibiganiro by 'amahoro hagati ya RPF na goverinoma y'u Rwanda yahozeho."}
{"id": "10339", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10339", "title": "NAHIMANA CLEMENCE", "text": "Ubuzima bwite.\nNahimana Clemence ni umuhanzi, umwanditsi w'ikinamico musekeweya, umunyarwenya uzwi nka feruje, umukinnyi muri filime \"Umuturanyi\", akina yitwa Mama Aluphonsina, akaba anafite na sutidiyo itunganya filime n'ikinamico yitwa Dubule C situdiyo (Double C Studio) ari nayo yatunganyije fileme nyinshi zo mu Rwanda.Nahimana ni inararibonye mu by'umuco n'ubuhanzi mu itsinda ry'urubyiruko rwa Africa n'uburayi.Nahimana afite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cy'akabiri cya Kaminuza yakuye muri Kaminuza yu Rwanda yigisha uburezi. akaba amaze imyaka 9 yandika filime.\n= Amashakiro.\n="}
{"id": "10340", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10340", "title": "Johanna Umurungi", "text": "Johanna Umurungi (yavutse ku ya 7 Mata 1996 i Turin, mu Butaliyani) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wo koga mu Rwanda kabuhariwe mu kiciro cya metero 50 n'ikiciro cya metero 100. Umurungi niwe mukobwa woga wahagarariye u Rwanda mu mikino Olempike ya 2016 yabereye i Rio de Janeiro, aho yitabiriye ikiciro cya metero 100. Yagiye kandi mu marushanwa atatu y\u2019isi ndetse na Shampiyona yisi magufi bizwi nka World Championships and a World Short Course Championship.\nAmarushanwa.\nUmurungi yatangiriye mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga yo koga mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga yo mu mazi yo muri 2011, aho yitabiriye ikiciro cya metero 50. Yarangije ku umwanya wa kane kumasegonda 32.68. Igihe cye cyari icya 45 cyihuta mu bakinnyi 51. Yatinze amasegonda 5.85 nyuma y'umukinnyi watsindiye kugera muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza bityo akurwa mu marushanwa. Mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga yo mu mazi yo mu 2013, Umurungi yarushanwe muri metero 50 na metero 100. Mu birori bya metero 50 yoga umwanya wamasegonda 32.35 yabaye uwa 56 yihuta muboga 60. Ntabwo yateye imbere muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza. Mu ikiciro cya metero 100, igihe cye cy'umunota umwe n'amasegonda 10.41 nicyo cya 50 cyihuta muri 53 nabwo ntiyigeze agera muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza. Amarushanwa ya World Short Course ya 2014 niyo Umurungi yarushanwe muri metero 50 na metero 100. Yarangije ku mwanya wa 75 muri rusange mu kwiruka metero 50; hamwe n'amasegonda 32.54; aba uwa 61 muri rusange mu kwiruka metero 100; hamwe n'umunota umwe namasegonda 9.20. Mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga y\u2019amazi yo mu 2015 Umurungi yitabiriye gusa ikiciro cya metero 100. Yoga umwanya w'umunota umwe n'amasegonda 13.14 nabwo ntiyakomeza muri kimwe cya kabiri. \nImikino Olempike ya 2016.\nUmurungi niwe mukobwa woga wahagarariye u Rwanda mu mikino Olempike ya 2016. We hamwe n\u2019umugabo woga Eloi Imaniraguha batoranijwe kugirango bahagararire u Rwanda nyuma yuko komite mpuzamahanga olempike itumiye igihugu kohereza aboga babiri; kuko abakinnyi bo mu Rwanda muri iki cyiciro ntabwo bari basanzwe bujuje ibyangombwa bisanzwe. Umurungi yarushanwe muri metero 100. Mbere yo gusiganwa yabwiye \"The New Times\" ati: \"Nitoje umwaka wose hamwe n'umutoza wanjye, nubwo bitoroshye kuko ntibyoroshye kwiga no gukora siporo icyarimwe, ndashaka gukora uko nshoboye\". Mu isiganwa ryo ku ya 6 Kanama 2016, Umurungi yoze igihe cy'umunota umwe n'amasegonda 11.92. Igihe cya Umurungi nicyo cya kabiri cyatinze mu bakinnyi 44 barangije, Umurungi yarushije uwa Qatari Nada Arkaji,amasegonda arindwi. Igihe cya Umurungi cyatinzeho amasegonda 13.17 kurenza umukinnyi wageze mu cyiciro gikurikiraho. "}
{"id": "10342", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10342", "title": "Maggy Corr\u00eaa", "text": "Maggy Corr\u00eaa ni umwanditsi w'ibitabo ukomoka mu Rwanda ariko utuye mu Busuwisi. Yanditse ibitabo nka\"Tutsie, etc.\" (1998) yanditse igitabo avuga uburyo yakijije nyina muri jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda muri Nyakanga 1994. \nUbuzima.\nCorr\u00eaa yavukiye mu Rwanda, kuri se ukomoka muri Porutugali na nyina w\u2019umunyarwanda. yize mu Rwanda, Kongo no mu Burundi. corr\u00eaa yabaye muri Valais mubusuwisi imyaka irenga makumyabiri. Yashinze kandi ayobora ishuri ry'imbyino imyaka icumi mbere yo kuba umunyamakuru wigenga, yandikira \"Le Nouveau Quotidien\", \"Le Temps\" na \"Le Nouvelliste\". Yakoze kandi nk;umunyamakuru wa radiyo kuri Radio Rh\u00f4ne Valais akaba nuwa televiziyo ya Radio T\u00e9l\u00e9vision Suisse. Yerekanye \"Vanille Fraise\", yakoraga gahunda y'iminota 25 mu cyumweru irimo umukino w'ubumenyi rusange kubijyanye nigitsina, kuva yatangizwa mu Gushyingo 1993 kugeza Gashyantare 1994. \nMuri Gicurasi 1994, Corr\u00eaa yagerageje gukurura ibitekerezo kuri jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda hamwe n'ikinyamakuru cyo mu Busuwisi \"Le Nouveau Quotidien\". Yabaye indorerezi y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye mu ngoro y\u2019igihugu i Geneve. Muri Nyakanga 1994, \"yahisemo guhangana n'ibibazo byose byo kujya mu Rwanda mu gihe cya jenoside yakorewe abatutsi kugira ngo agerageze gukiza nyina; igitabo cye \"Tutsie, etc.\" (1998) ni inkuru y'uru rugendo rudasanzwe\". Igitabo cye cyo mu mwaka wa 2018 \"\u00c0 la lueur de la lampe-temp\u00eate\" (1998) kivuga amateka y'impamo ya Mario Augusto de Jesus du Valle Correia (Mario Corr\u00eaa), mu mpera z'ikinyejana cya 19 yarekuye rwihishwa abacakara ijana mu bukoloni bwa Porutugali muri Angola. "}
{"id": "10344", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10344", "title": "Sandra Nadege Uwayezu", "text": "Sandra Nadege Uwayezu ni umwanditsi n'umusizi w'umunyarwandakazi ufite icyicaro i Kigali. Nadege ni umwanditsi w'ibitabo bitandukanye byakusanyirijwemo imivugo nka ' \"The First creation\"', \"Sense and Sensation\" na \"Light in the Dark\".Yasohotse mubinyamakuru byinshi nk'ikinyamakuru WSA na The Swala Tribe bivuga kubanditsi bakomeye.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nYavukiye kandi akurira i Kigali, umurwa mukuru w'u Rwanda, ubwana bwa Nadege bwarimo uburambe bwo kwigunga no kwiheba, ibyo bikaba byaramuteye imbaraga zo gutangira kwandika ibisigo kugira ngo agaragaze ibitekerezo bye n'urugendo rwo gukira. Amashuri yisumbuye yayarangije muri Saint Andre, kuri ubu akaba akurikirana impamyabumenyi ihanitse ya Business Communication muri kaminuza ya New Hampshire binyuze muri kaminuza ya Kepler ikorera i Kigali. \nUmwuga.\nMu rwego rwo guhangana n\u2019ihungabana no kwiheba biturutse ku ivangura yahuye na ryo mu mashuri yisumbuye, muri 2020 Nadege warangiye asohoye igitabo cye cya mbere yise \"First Creation\", ushobora gufata nk'icyegeranyo cy\u2019imivugo. Nadege yasohoye igitabo cye cya kabiri mu Gushyingo 2021, \"Light In The Dark\", urwibutso rugufi rw'inkuru ye kuva ku myaka 9 kugeza ku myaka 16. "}
{"id": "10345", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10345", "title": "Yolande Mukagasana", "text": "Yolande Mukagasana (wavutse ku ya 6 Nzeri 1954) ni umwanditsi w'umunyarwandakazi yandika mu gifaransa. Yabaye umuforomo na anesthetiste ukora mubitaro bya Kigali. Yahungiye mu Bubiligi mu gihe cya jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994; umugabo we, abana be ndetse nabantu benshi yari azi ko bishwe. Mu Bubiligi, impamyabumenyi ye ntiyigeze imenyekana bityo akora mu rugo. Nyuma yaje kurera bamwe mu bishywa be ababyeyi bishwe hamwe n\u2019imfubyi zo mu Rwanda.\nIbikorwa.\nMukagasana yasubiye mu Rwanda ari kumwe n'umufotozi Alain Kazinierakis. bakora icyegeranyo c\"yitwa Les Blessures du silence\", inkuru zabatangabuhamya kuri jenoside. Bashinze kandi Nyamirambo, point d'appui, umuryango ugamije kwiyubaka. Hamwe nitsinda ry'amakinamico Groupov, yanditse ikinamico \"Rwanda 94\". Yanditse ibitabo bibiri bya \"La mort ne veut pas de moi\" (1997) na \"N'aie pas peur de savoir\" (1999). Yasohoye kandi icyegeranyo \"cy'inkuru De Bouche \u00e0 oreille\" (2003). \"La mort ne veut pas de moi\" yahinduwe mucyongereza nka \"Not Time to Die\" by Zoe Norridge muri 2019. Mu 2002, yahawe igihembo cya Golden Dove for Peace Prize yahawe na Archivio Disarmo. "}
{"id": "10346", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10346", "title": "\u00c9piphanie Nyirabaram\u00e9", "text": "Ipiphanie Nyirabaram\u00e9 (yavutse ku ya 15 Ukuboza 1981 i Butare) ni umukinnyi w'umunyarwanda kabuhariwe muri marato no kwiruka intera ndende. Yahagarariye u Rwanda mu mikino ibiri ya Olempike (2004 muri Atenayi mu Bugereki, na 2008 i Beijing).\nUmwuga.\nNyirabaram\u00e9 yitabiriye bwa mbere mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2004 yabereye muri Atenayi mu Bugereki aho yarangije ku mwanya wa mirongo itanu na kane mu kwiruka muri marato y'abagore, akoresheje igihe cya 2:52:50. Ku rundi ruhande, mu mikino Olempike ye ya kabiri yabereye i Beijing, yarangije marato y'abagore, amasegonda arindwi gusa inyuma ya Zuzana \u0160ar\u00edkov\u00e1 wo muri Silovakiya, akoresheje igihe cye cyiza cya 2:49:32. \nNyirabaram\u00e9 yatsindiye neza mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga ya IAAF ya 2009 yabereye i Berlin mu Budage, ubwo yarangirizaga kwiruka muri marato y'abagore, arangiza ku mwanya wa makumyabiri na gatandatu, afite umwanya wa 2:33:59. Nyirabaram\u00e9 yanashyizeho amateka y'igihugu cye, yari yarakozwe na Marcianna Mukamurenzi mu myaka ya za 90. Nyirabaram\u00e9 yagaragaye muri filime documentaire y'Abanyamerika, \"Umwuka wa Marathon II\", agaragaza imikorere ye muri Marato ya Roma 2012."}
{"id": "10347", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10347", "title": "Salome Nyirarukundo", "text": "--&gt; Nyirarukundo Salome\nSalome Nyirarukundo (yavutse 20 Ukuboza 1997) ni umukinnyi w'umunyarwandakazi kabuhariwe muri marato mu kiciro cyo kwiruka intera ndende.Yitabiriye imikino Olempike ya 2016 yabereye i Rio de Janeiro, muri metero 10,000 z'abagore, arangiza ku mwanya wa 27 akoresheje 32: 07.80. \nAmarushanwa.\n2017 - 2018.\nNyirarukundo nawe ni umukinnyi wiruka marato wamenyereye, kandi yitabiriye amarushanwa akomeye. Yashyizeho igihe cyiza kuri Marathon ya Montreal (2:28:02). Yatsinze amarushanwa menshi mu Ntara ya Qu\u00e9bec, harimo na marato ya Rimouski.\n2019.\nNyirarukundo yagize akazi muri 2019. Mu isiganwa rya Around The Bay 30Km, yaje ku mwanya wa 3 nyuma y'abakinnyi b'indashyikirwa, nubwo yayoboye ibirometero 15 by'isiganwa. Yatsinze isiganwa rya 10km St-Laurent akoresheje iminota 34. Yatwaye umwanya wa kabiri kuri 5k du Lac-Beauport kandi yatsindiye L\u00e9vis Half-Marathon mugihe cya 1h 13 min 59 s. Yarangije ku mwanya wa 4 muri Marato ya Ottawa akoresheje 2 h 30 min hanyuma akora izindi 10km muri lululemon Toronto muminota 34, Hanyuma, yagize izindi ntsinzi ebyiri muri 10km, iya La Baie n'iya Kanada yo gusiganwa ku magare. Nyuma yibyo, yitabiriye Marathon ya Rimouski."}
