{"id": "10352", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10352", "title": "Simbi Nailla", "text": "Ubuzima bwite.\nSimbi Nailla (ufite imwaka 21 y'amavuko, kuko avuka muri 2001) yavukiye mu akarere ka nyarugenge, mu umujyi wa kigali. Avuka mu muryango w'abana 4, abakobwa 3 n'umuhungu umwe.\nAkazi akora.\nSimbi Nailla ni umukobwa w'umunyarwandakazi arimo yinjira mu mwuga wo gukora akazi ko gutunganza amashusho y'indirimbo, aha twavuga indirimbo zimwe na zimwe za banyarwanda yakozeho, amashusho y'indirimbo \"Puculi ya Okama, niwe wagize igitekerezo cy' uko igomba gukorwa mu buryo bwa'amashusho kuva itangiye kugeza irangiye. hari izindi ndirimbo nyinshi nka \"Atansiyo\", \"Helena\", za Platini P cyangwa \"Low Key\" ya Burava, \"Pull up\" ya Toxxyk Kivumbi na Angel Umutoni na \"KK 509 St\" ya Andy Bumuntu, aho nihamwe amaze gutanga umusanzu ukomeye.\nSimbi Nailla yize amashanyarazi mu amashuri yisumbuye, kwiga kukora indirmibo (editing) akaba yaragiye akaba yaragiye abyigira kuri musazawe usanzwe atunganya amashusho y'indirimbo z'abahanzi batandukanye mu Rwanda. Muri 2020 nibyo Simbi Nailla yatangiye bya nyabyo mu gutunganya amashusho."}
{"id": "10353", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10353", "title": "Judith Kanakuze", "text": "Judith Kanakuze (yavutse ku ya 19 Nzeri 1959 - yapfuye ku ya 7 Gashyantare 2010) yari umunyapolitiki w'u Rwanda n'umunyarwandakazi. Yamaze gukora mu nzego nyinshi, zirimo imirire ndetse na serivisi rusange, yabaye umunyapolitiki uzwi nyuma ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda mu 1994, aho yabuze abavandimwe benshi. Kanakuze yashinze ihuriro R\u00e9seau des Femmes kandi arengera uburenganzira bw\u2019umugore mu gihe cy\u2019amasezerano ya Arusha. Yatorewe kuba mu nteko ishinga amategeko y'u Rwanda mu 2003 na 2008. Muri mandat ye, yayoboye \"Rwanda Women Parliamentary Forum\".\nAmateka.\nJudith Kanakuze yavutse19 Nzeri 1959 mu karere ka Rusizi, mu Rwanda. Yabaye umwarimu imyaka ibiri mu ntangiriro yo mu 1980, nyuma yaje kuba inzobere mu mirire. Judith akaba yarabuze abavandimwe benshi muri Genocide yakorewe abatutsi 1994, biciwe mu rusengero rwa Kibuye.\nNyuma y\u2019amakimbirane, yasubiye mu Rwanda avuye mu nkambi y\u2019impunzi i Goma kugira ngo yugurure ihuriro ry\u2019inguzanyo ry\u2019abagore ry\u2019inzobere mu micungire y\u2019imari ndetse anatanga gahunda yo kwigisha no gukemura amakimbirane. Kanakuze yashinze umuryango w\u2019abagore bo hambere R\u00e9seau des Femmes akaba yari umujyanama mu mpera za 90. Kanakuze yari azwi nk'umuyobozi uharanira uburenganzira bw'umugore mu Rwanda, yatoranijwe kugira ngo akore muri komisiyo ishinzwe itegekonshinga ryo mu 2001 mu rwego rwo guharanira uburinganire.n'umwe mu bagore batatu wari uri ku mwanya w'abantu 12.Yatanze ibitekerezo byinshi bijyanye n\u2019uburinganire mu itegeko nshinga, icy'ingenzi muri byo kikaba cyarashyizeho ibipimo by\u2019uburinganire aho abagore bagomba gushyiraho nibura 30% by\u2019imyanya ku nzego zifata ibyemezo mu RwandaImiryango itegamiye kuri leta y\u2019abagore n\u2019abagore ku giti cyabo bongereye Kanakuze kugira ngo bumvishe abandi bagize komisiyo. Abagore bo mu Rwanda batangiye kwinjira muri komite zigenzurwa n\u2019abagabo kandi bamenyekana ku bindi bibazo bitari uburinganire. Kugeza mu 2003, abagore bari bafite kimwe cya kabiri cy'imyanya mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko maze Kanakuze atorerwa umwe muri bo."}
{"id": "10356", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10356", "title": "Tumutoneshe Diane", "text": "Ubuzima bwite.\nTumutoneshe Diane (ufite imyaka yubukure 32 kuko yavutse muri 1990) ni umunyarwandakazi akaba umuyobozi (Managing director) wa Dream Team Football Academy, Asanzwe ari muri komisiyo y'iterambere ry'umupira w'abagore mu Rwanda. Ubu yagizwe umwe mubagize komite ishinzwe gutegura ibikorwa by'umupira w'amaguru w'abagore mu ishyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru muri Afurika,CAF.\nAmashuri yize nibyo akora.\nTumutoneshe Diane muri 2019 yize amasomo y'imicungire ya siporo (Sport Management) muri Leipzig University yo mu Budage. Uyu mubyeyi w'umusiporitifu kuri ubu ari kwiga icyiciro kisumbuyeho muri \"Fifa Master Course\" mu bwongereza (Leicester University), mu butaliyani muri (SDA Bocconi School of Management) no mu Busuwisi muri Neuchatel University yi Zurich.\nIndi mirimo.\nTumuoneshe Diane wari usanzwe muri komisiyo yiterambere ry'umupira w'amaguru w'Abagore mu Rwanda\nkuri ubu numwe mubagize komite ishinzwe gutegura ibikorwa by'umupira w'amaguru w'Abagore mu ishyirahamwe\nry'umupira w'amaguru muri Afurika CAF"}
{"id": "10357", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10357", "title": "Th\u00e9r\u00e8se Muamini", "text": "Th\u00e9r\u00e8se Muamini ni Umwanditsi w'Ibitabo w' Umunyarwandakazi wavukiye mu Rwanda,Kurubu abarizwa mugihugu cy'ubufaransa.\nAmakuru.\nTh\u00e9r\u00e8se Muamini yageze m'Ubufaransa mu mwaka 1976,ubwo yaragiye kubana na mubyarawe wari urwaye SIDA mu mwaka 1982 nibwo mubyarawe yapfuye,Yakiriye umwana w'Umuhungu w'Imyaka 10 muburyo bwokumurera wanduye virusi itera SIDA,yakoraga nk'Umudamu ukora amasuku kugirango agaburire umuryango we.kandi yagombaga guhangana anarwanya ibyari bimukikije,kimwe no kwita kubana be bakabaho mubudahangarwa.\nIbyo Yagiye Akora.\nUbwo yageraga m'Ubufaransa yishimiye kubona uwaba yaza kumufasha murugo,iherezo rye rihinduka ribi mugihe yareraga umwana wanduye indwara ya virusi itera SIDA kandi inshutiye yapfuye izize SIDA, nukuvugango nibwo ibibazo byari bitangiye yagombaga gushaka ahandi aba kuba yajugunywe mu nzu ye yajyanye abandi bana babiri. Th\u00e9r\u00e8se Muamini ibitabo yanditse bigiye bitanduka hari icyo yise. "}
{"id": "10360", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10360", "title": "Isimbi Alliance", "text": "Isimbi Alliance (yavutse tariki 9 Gicurasi 1989) ni umunyarwandakazi w' umubyeyi ufite abana 2 yabyaranye n'umugabo we Gakumba Jean Bosco. Mu buzima bwite ni umukinnyi kazi wa filime wamenyekanye cyane muri filime Rwasa yitwa Nelly, ndetse akaba ari n'umufana ukomeye wa rayon sports fc yo mu Rwanda.\nAkazi akora.\nIsimbi Alliance wamenyekanye muri sinema nyarwanda nka Alliah Cool, ubu yashyizwe mu ihuriro rya aba mbasaderi ba Loni b'amahoro, akaba yaragizwe ambasaderi mu kwizihiza umunsi w'abanyamerika wahariwe abari n'abategarugori bari muri siyansi. Akaba kandi abarizwa mu kigo cy'abanyanayigeriya gifasha abanyempano batandukanye, Ubu Isimbi akaba afite filime ziwe yise Alliah The movie amurikira ku i Rebero munzu izwi ku izina rya Canal olympia. Alliah Cool ni umwe mubagize itsinda rya Kigali Boss Babes, aho kurijyamo ugomba kuba bisaba kuba witeguye gushyira ubuzima bwawe bwite hanze cyane ko tuzaba dukorera Reality TV Show kandi nanone bizasaba kugaruka ku buzima bwacu twite. Ikindi ni uko ugomba kuba mu buzima bujyanye n\u2019ibyo dushaka, ibyo dukina, hanyuma kandi ariko ukaba usanzwe uri inshuti yacu, bakaba bagizwe na bakobwa n'abagore bagera kuri batandatu aribo Gashema Sylvie, Queen Douce, Christella, Camille Yvette, Isimbi Model na Alliah Cool. \nFilime.\nKandi Isimbi akaba yaragabiye u mu minisitiri inka, Isimbi kandi afite amasezerano muri sosiyete ikora ibijyanye na sinema yo muri nigeriya ya One percent International, aho ubu bari gukorana indi ya Accidental Vacation, yayikoranye n\u2019ibyamamare bizwi nka Anita Alaire Afoke Asuoha uzwi nka Real Warri Pikin, Venita Akpofure wamenyekanye ubwo yitabiraga Big Brother ku nshuro yayo kane. "}
{"id": "10362", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10362", "title": "Colette Ruhamya", "text": "Colette Ruhamya wahoze ari umunyamabanga wa leta ushinzwe ingufu n'amazi mu Rwanda.kuwa 27 Kamena mumwaka\nwa 2012 munama y'abaminisitiri yari iyobowe na Nyakubahwa Perezida wa Repuburika yu Rwanda PAUL KAGAME nibwo \nColette Ruhamya yagiriwe ikizere bamugira umuyobozi mukuru wungirije w'ikigo k'igihugu gishinzwe kubungabunga ibidukikije\nmu Rwanda (REMA).\nColette Ruhamya.\nColette Ruhamya ni umwe mu badamu bamamaye cyane muri politiki y'u Rwanda kubera ibikorwa byabo by'indashikirwa bagiye\nbageraho ubwo bari bafite inshingano zahato nahato mubuyobozi. Colette kandi yabaye Umunyamabanga Mukuru wungirije \nw' Ikigo cy'igihugu gishinzwe kubungabunga ibidukikije REMA asimbuye Madamu Rose Mukankomeje.\nKugeza ubu.\nColette Mukankomeje yagizwe umuyobozi mukuru w'ikigo cy'igihugu gisinzwe kubungabunga ibidukikije mu Rwanda\nazamuwe muntera kumwanya w'umuyobozi mukuru wungirije.gusa kugeza ubu ntago ariwe ukiyoboye ikcyo kigo\nubu inshingano zo kuyobora ikigo k'igihugu gishinzwe kubungabunuga ibidukikije mu Rwanda REMA kiyobowe\nna Madam Juliete Kabera.\nImirimo.\nEng Colette Mukankomeje mugihe yari ayoboye ikigo k'igihugu gishinzwe kubungabunga ibidukikije mu Rwanda(REMA)\nyagiye akora imirimo myinshi itandukanye ifitiye igihugu akamaro,abaturage,ndetse n'ibidukikije muri rusange nkaho twagiye\ntwumva aho ubwo yari ayoboye REMA hari inganda zagiye zifungwa zizira kwangiza ibidukikije no kubangamira abaturage\ncyane ko aribo batangaga amakuru zimwe munganda zafunzwe harimo nkuruganda ruherereye mukarere ka Bugesera inyamata\nrwari rushinzwe gutunganya impu rwafunzwe ruzira kumena amazi yanduye nimyanda mu mugezi w'Akagera. "}
{"id": "10366", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10366", "title": "Niwemwiza Marie Anne", "text": "Niwemwiza Marie Anne ni umunyarwandakazi uri mu itangazamakuru kuva muri Mutarama 2008 atangirira kuri radio maria Rwanda, akomereza umwuga w' itangazamakuru ahandi akaba amaze Imyaka 14.\nUbuzima bwite.\nNiwemwiza Marie Anne ni umugore ufite abana 2, aho umugabo we nawe ari umunyamakurukuri wa RBA (Rwanda Broadcasting Agency). Anne Ukora itangazamakuru nk'umwuga aho atanga ibitekerezo bivugira rubanda. \"Iki ni ikimenyetso cy'uko niyemeje gukomera ku bunyarwanda nk'igihango mfitanye n'igihugu n'urungano\" iryo ni rimwe mu ijambo yavuze.\nIbihembo yabonye.\nNiwemwiza Marie Anne umaze imyaka mwinshi ari umunyamakuru kuri KT Radio akora ikiganiro \"Ubyumva ute\", aho yegukanye igihembo ku kiganiro gikorwa neza cya Radio, cyatanzwe n'ishyirahamwe ry'abanyamkuru hizihizwa umunsi w'itangazamakuru. Anne akunze kubarizwa mu icyiciro cy'amakuru. Anne kandi azwi ku mbuga nkoranyambaga nka twitter ku izina rya @annemwiza, aho akurikirwa n'abantu barenga 40,000."}
{"id": "10367", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10367", "title": "Salma Ingabire", "text": "Salma Ingabire\nSalma Ingabire n'umunyarwandakazi akaba yarabaye umuyobozi mukuru wa AC group LTd icyigo cyazanye ikorana buhanga rya tap&amp;Go ryo kwishyura urugendo \nKumodoka ukoresheje ikarita. \nSalma Ingabire ni muntu ki?\nIngabire Salma n'umunyarwandakazi wavukiye mu Rwanda.\nAkaba yaragize uruhare runini muguteza imbere inkorana buhanga hifashishijwe Telefone igendanwa\nMu kubitsa no kubikuza amafaranga akorera ikigo nka Airtel mu Rwanda akaba yarakoranye n'ikinyamakuru cya Wari SA cyo muri Afurika yepfo Ubu akaba ahagarariye amakarita azwi nka visa kandi mu Rwanda.\nIngabire kandi akaba yabonye impamyabumenyi y'icyikiro cya gatatu muri kaminuza ya Exford Brookes yo mugihugu cy'ubwongereza. \nUburambe mukazi.\n.yakoze muri:\n_Airtel Rwanda\n_BPR_Atlas \n_Bank of Africa \n_unit Bank of Africa\n_Ecobank\n_Equity Bank\nakaba ahagarariye n'ibihugu byo mukarere birimo,\nRwanda, Uganda, Tanzania, Kenya, Burundi, Ethiopia\nNa sudani y'epfo. "}
{"id": "10368", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10368", "title": "Jeannette Bayisenge", "text": "Jeannette Bayisenge ni umwarimu wa kaminuza n'umunyapolitiki w'Umunyarwandakazi. Ubushakashatsi bwe bwibanda ku buringanire n'iterambere.\nBayisenge yabaye Minisitiri w'Uburinganire n'Iterambere ry'Umuryango kuva mu 2020 kugeza mu 2023. Nyuma yaho, yabaye Minisitiri w'Abakozi ba Leta n'Umurimo kugeza muri Kamena 2024.\nUbuzima.\nAmashuri.\nBayisenge yize imibereho myiza y'abaturage (\"social work\") muri Kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda. Yahabonye impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya mbere cya kaminuza.\nNyuma yaho, Bayisenge yize iterambere mu bufatanye (\"development cooperation\") muri Kaminuza ya Ewha Womans i Seoul, muri Koreya y\u2019Amajyepfo. Yibanze ku bagore n'iterambere. Yabonye kandi impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga (PhD) mu mibereho myiza y'abaturage. Yayikuye muri Kaminuza ya Gothenburg, muri Suwede.\nUmwuga.\nBayisenge yigishije muri Kaminuza y'u Rwanda. Yari umwarimu mukuru mu Kigo cy'Ubushakashatsi ku Buringanire (\"Center for Gender Studies\"). Icyo kigo kiri muri Koleji y'Ubugeni n'Ubumenyi bw'Imibereho (UR-CASS). Bayisenge yanabaye umuyobozi w'agateganyo w'icyo kigo. Yayoboye kandi Inama Njyanama y'Akarere ka Gasabo.\nMuri Gashyantare 2020, Bayisenge yabaye Minisitiri w'Uburinganire n'Iterambere ry'Umuryango. Yasimbuye Solina Nyirahabimana.\nKu wa 23 Kanama 2023, Bayisenge yagizwe Minisitiri w'Abakozi ba Leta n'Umurimo. Ku wa 28 Kanama 2023, Fanfan Kayirangwa Rwanyindo yamushyikirije ubuyobozi bwa Minisiteri.\nKu wa 14 Kamena 2024, Bayisenge yashyikirije ubuyobozi bwa Minisiteri Jeanne d'Arc Mujawamariya."}
{"id": "10369", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10369", "title": "IRASUBIZA Alliance", "text": "Alliance Irasubiza ni umwe mu bakobwa bahataniraga ikamba rya Nyampinga w' u Rwanda 2020, akaba ari nawe wegukanye ikamba rya Miss popurality rimwe mu makamba afite agaciro mu irushanwa rya Miss Rwanda dore ko rinahabwa umukobwa ukunzwe cyane akaba ashyigikiwe na benshi.Alliance\u00a0 muri iryo rushanwa akaba yarafite umushinga wo kurwanya gutwita kw'abana bato bakiri mu mashuri yisumbuye.\nUmwuga.\nNyuma yuko Alliance abimburiye abakobwa bo mu karere ka Gicumbi kujya muri Miss Rwanda, nibwo yagizwe ambasaderi w'urubyiruko mu karere ka Gicumbi.IRASUBIZA Alliance afite umushinga \u00a0wo kurwanya gutwita kw'abana bato bakiri mumashuri yisumbuye akaba afite icyizere cy'uko azabigeraho.\nIcyo Miss Rwanda ibivugaho.\nHaravugwa byinshi ku bijyanye no gutoranya ubwiza ariko ikintu kimwe cy'ukuri ni uko kwitabira ari umwe bishobora kuba amahirwe meza ku bakobwa kutagaragaza impano zabo nubushobozi bwabo gusa, ahubwo ari no gukoresha urubuga babonye kugirango bagire icyo bahindura mu miryango yabo.\nFata urugero rwa Alliance, wagaragaye nka Miss ukunzwe mu marushanwa ya Miss Rwanda 2020. Kuri we, gutsindira amajwi ya Miss Popularity ntabwo byari ukwambara neza gusa no kumwenyura kuri kamera.\nIbyo Nyaminga avuga Nyuma yo kuba Miss Popularity.\nIrasubiza\u00a0 avuga ko imitekerereze isubiza inyuma ifata abakobwa igomba gutabwa kure.Duhereye ku ijambo genda, yari azi ko ari amahirwe adashobora gufata nk'ukuri abonye uko abantu bamwizera \\baramutora.\nagira ati: \"Byari ibintu byiza cyane kubona abanyarwanda banshyigikira kandi bakantora, banshyira ku rutonde, ariko kandi ni inshingano nahawe.\" Yongeyeho ko n'uburyo yitwara byagombaga guhinduka kuko y'icyizere abantu bari bamugiriye.\nInama.\nIrasubiza aragira inama ababa bagifite uruhare rw\u2019uburinganire bw\u2019inyuma kandi bushingiye ku gitsina kibuza abagore n\u2019abakobwa kureka iyo mitekerereze kuko ntacyo bivuze kandi ikabangamira iterambere. Imitekerereze yashyizwe ahagaragara ko abagore badashobora kugera kuri byinshi nk'uko abagabo bababaye rwose \u201d.Irasubiza yemera ko muri iki gihe, impaka zitagomba kuba ukureba niba abagore babishoboye cyangwa batabishoboye. Byaragaragaye ko iyo abakobwa biyemeje kugera ku ntego zabo, bashobora kubikora.Ati: \u201cUmunsi umwe uzumva ko byatinze, ntushobora gutegereza rero kwitegura kuko igihe kirenze. Niba ufite ikizere, uwo muganira, bagiye kukwizera. Ihe amahirwe wizere. Alliance aragira ati: Ku myaka 23, nta kintu nkifite igihe\u00a0 gikwiye cyo gutangira gukora ikintu. Niba wemera ikintu runaka, niba hari icyo ukunda gukora, jya imbere ubikore kuko hariho abandi bantu babarirwa mu magana batekereza kubintu bimwe.Ati: \u201cUmunsi umwe uzumva ko byatinze, ntushobora gutegereza rero kwitegura kuko igihe kirenze. Niba ufite ikizere, uwo muganira, bagiye kukwizera. Ihe amahirwe wizere."}
{"id": "10371", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10371", "title": "Uwase Delphine", "text": "Uwase Delphine asazwe azwi cyane nka \"soleil\" muri filime Nyarwanda, afite ishuri rya siporo. \nUbuzima bwite.\nUwase Delphine (Ortha) ni umunyarwandakazi wamenyekanye cyane muri filime nyarwanda cyane cyane muri filime y'uruhererekane nka Bamenya. Ubusanzwe Uwase asanzwe ari umukinnyi ukomeye w'umukino wa karate aho amaze imyaka 15 akina uyu mukino akaba anafite umukandara w'umukara. Afite kandi ishuri ryi gisha ibijyanye na siporo, aho ubu iryo shuri rya siporo yaryise \"Kigali Elite Sports Academy\" aho batangiranye na Karate, kungu fu, Taekwondo hamwe na Aerobics. "}
{"id": "10372", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10372", "title": "Nadia Umutoni", "text": "Nadia Umutoni ni umunyamakurukazi ukorera ikigo cy'igihugu cy'itangazamakuru (RBA) mu Rwanda, ni umwanditsi ndetse n'umukinnyi w'ikinamico\" Ni Nyampinga Sakwe\". \nAmashuri yize.\nNadia afite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu bijyanye n'ububanyi n'amahanga yakuye muri kaminuza yigenga ya Kigali (ULK) kuva 2015-1018. yakoze amahugurwa atandukanye kubijyanye no gutara amakuru, kuyavuga no gutanga ibiganiro kuri radio na televiziyo.\nUmwuga.\nUmutoni Nadia afite uburambe mu kazi k'itangazamakuru kuko yakoreye ibinyamakuru bitandukanye kuva afite imyaka 15 aho yakoze ikiganiro cy'urubyiruko mu cyigo mpuzamahanga kitwa Search for common ground in Rwanda, akora ibiganiro bitandukanye kuri television nyarwanda aho akora ibiganiro nka \" Waramutse Rwanda\" ndetse na \"Zoom in\"; akora kandi no kubinyamakuru byandika bikorera kuri murandasi. \nUbuzima bwite.\nNadia yasezeranye mu mategeko n'umukunzi we Malik Shaffy kuwa 20 Ukuboza 2020 kubana nk'umugabo n'umugore ubuziraherezo naho kuwa 21 Kanama 2021 nibwo basezeranye imbere y'Imana ubukwe bubera ku nkengero z'ikiyaga cya Kivu."}
{"id": "10376", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10376", "title": "Mukandayisenga Benitha", "text": "Mukandayisenga Benitha, Umukinnyi w'umunyarwandakazi wabigize umwuga muri volleyball, aho asigaye akina mu ikipe ya kenya commercial Bank, yo muri Kenya.\nUbuzima bwite.\nMukandayisenga Benitha (yavutse 05 werurwe 1994) ni umukinnyi w'umunyamwuga wazamukiye mu ikipe y'ikigo ya Saint Aloys i Rwamagana. akaba yarasinye amasezerano bw'ambere mu kuboza 2017 muri APR VC. nyuma atwara champiyona yu Rwanda muri 2019 nku mukinnyi wiryo rushyanwa. Yabaye umukinnyi w'ambere ufite amasezerano yababigize umwuga mu 2019 muri Alubaniya. yakiniye ikipe y'igihugu y'abafite munsi y'imwaka 17, akinira abafite imwaka 20 ikinira n'ikipe nkuru yu Rwanda.\nIbyo yagezeho.\nUsibye Volleyball yo munzu (indoor volleyyball), Mukandayisenga sanzwe ari n'umukinnyi wa Vollyball yo ku mucanga, aho yitabiriye amarushanwa meshi atandukanye kwisi.Ubu akaba ari mu ikipe ya KCB.\nAmakipe yakiniye.\nMukandayisenga Benatha yakiniye amakipe atadukanye haba hano ku mugabane w'Afurika cyangwa iburayi.Yakiniye ikipye y'ingabo z'igihugu APR VC, Akinira ekipe ya Partizani, isazwe ikina icyiciro cya mbere muri shampiyona ya alubaniya. yakiniye ikipe ya Kaminuza ya UTB, gusa itararambye kuko yaje gusenyuka imaze imyaka 4 gusa. Kuri ubu Mukandayisenga Benitha ari gukinira ikipe ya KCB."}
{"id": "10378", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10378", "title": "Mukamana esperance", "text": "Mukamana Esperance.\nMu Rwanda nahandi kwisi haba ikigo cy'ubutaka gishinzwe imiturire imyubakire nugutanga uburenganzira kuri\nbanyiri ubutaka nonguca akarendane ninduru bihora mubutaka mu Rwanda icyo kigo kiyobowe\nna Mukamana Esperance ni umunyarwandakazi "}
{"id": "10379", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10379", "title": "Zura Karuhimbi", "text": "Karuhimbi Zura (yavutse mu 1925 apfa mu 2018), Ni umunyarwandakazi w'intwari wahawe umudali w'ishimwe wo mu rwego rw'umurinzi, kubera igikorwa cy'ubutwari yakoze mu gihe Genocide yakorerwa abatutsi mu 1994,aho yarokeye abagera kuri 150 yifashishije umuvuzi gakondo ndetse n'imitsindo y'Abakurambere.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nItariki y'amavuko ya Karuhimbi ntiramenyekana,amakuru amwe avuga ashobora kuba yaravutse nko mu 1909, ariko akeka ko yavutse ahagana mu 1925 ariyo tariki yavuzwe ku ndangamuntu ye. Karuhimbi yavutse m'umuryango w'abavuzi ba gakondo mu mudugudu wa Musamo mu Karere ka Ruhango, nko mu rugendo rw'isaha imwe uvuye mu murwa mukuru wa Kigali. Mu gihe cy'Impinduramatwara y'u Rwanda yiboneye ihohoterwa ryakorewe y'abatutsi bikozwe n'ubutegetsi ndetse n'imiryango myinshi y'Abahutu. \nJenoside yo mu 1994 yakorewe Abatutsi.\nMu 1994, Jenoside yakorewe abatutsi hongeye kugaragara ihohoterwa rishingiye ku nyoko muntu ryahitanye abantu abatutsi barenga 800.000, Karuhimbi yari umupfakazi ugeze mu za bukuru. Yafashaga Abatutsi kimwe n'Abarundi ndetse n'Abanyaburayi batatu kwihisha mu mitwe yitwara gisirikare y'Abahutu. Karuhimbi yahishe impunzi mu nzu ye y'ibyumba bibiri, kandi bishoboka ko yari mu mwobo mu murima we. Muri rusange yakijije abantu barenga 100, harimo n'impinja yakijije amaboko ya ba nyina bapfuye. \nMu kurwanya imitwe yitwara gisirikare y'Abahutu ndetse n'Interahamwe, Karuhimbi yavugagako akorana n'imyuka mibi. Kugirango agumane isura ye nk \"umurozi\" yashushanyije ku inzu ye n'ibyatsi karemano.Karuhimbi yavuze ko inzu ye ituwe n'abazimu kandi akangisha ko abagerageza kwinjira bazakuramo imyuka mibi n'uburakari bw'Imana ubwabo. Yashimangiye umuburo we amukubita amaboko yuzuye igikomo anakangisha ko niba hari impunzi ziciwe mu nzu ye noneho abicanyi bari \"gucukura imva zabo\". Interahamwe zagerageje guha ruswa Karuhimbi kugira ngo azemerere kugera iwe ariko aranga. Abari bahungiye iwe bose ndetse hamwe na Karuhimbi barokotse itsemba n'itsembabwoko. \nIbihembo ndetse n'ibigwi.\nNyuma ya jenoside, Karuhimbi yavuze ko yari umukirisitu kandi ko ibikorwa bye by'ubupfumu byari uburyo bwo gukumira ibitero. Mu 2006 yahawe igihembo na Perezida Paul Kagame, kubera uruhare rukomeye mu kurokora abatutsi bahigwaga muri Jenoside. Karuhimbi yaje kwambara umudari igihe cyose, awushyira munsi y'umusego we igihe yari aryamye. Mu myaka ye yakurikiyeho, yakomeje kuba mu nzu imwe yakoreshaga mu gucumbikira impunzi nubwo zasenyutse imyaka. Karuhimbi yapfiriye iwe ku ya 17 Ukuboza 2018. \nUrupfu.\nZura Karuhimbi yitabye Imana muri 2018 iwe kubera uburwayi bw'izabukuru. "}
{"id": "10380", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10380", "title": "Berna Namata", "text": "Berna Namata n'icyamamare mu Rwanda ndetse no muri Afurika y'uburasirazuba ni umugore ukiri muto\nuvuka mu gihugu cya Kenya ariko akaba akorera umwuga we w'itangazamakuru mu Rwanda\nBerna Namata.\nBerna ni inzobere muri Afurika aho uruhare rwe runini yibanda mu guteza imbere ubucuruzi no kuzamura urubuga rwa\ne-learning, Journalism. Berna kandi akora nk'umuyobozi w' ibiro by'ikinyamakuru cyo mu karere National Media Group\ngitambuka buri cyumweru The African rifite icyicaro muri Kenya.\nInyandiko.\nBerna Namata kandi uretse ibiganiro byamamaye cyane bica kuri televiziyo y'u Rwanda (RBA) \nBerna azwi nk'umwanditsi w'inkuru nyinshi mu binyamakuru bitandukanye byinshi bikorera kuri murandasi yagiye yandika. "}
{"id": "10382", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10382", "title": "Ishimwe Herniette", "text": "Ishimwe Herniette Umukinnyi w\u2019ikipe y\u2019igihugu y\u2019u Rwanda mu bagore mu mukino wa Cricket, ujya i Dubai muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Abarabu (UAE) aho yitabira irushanwa mpuzamahanga \u201cFairbreak Global Invitational\u201d ryitabiriwe n\u2019amakipe menshi agizwe n\u2019abakinnyi b\u2019ibihangange ku Isi.\nUbuzima bwite.\nIshimwe Herniette (wavutse 1 Mutarama 2003) usanzwe ari Visi Kapiteni w\u2019ikipe y\u2019igihugu ya Cricket ari mu ikipe yitwa \"The Barmy Army Team\", aho aba ari kumwe n\u2019abandi bakinnyi\u00a0 bakomeye ku\u00a0 Isi\u00a0 bari mu ikipe nkuko bikorwa mu mukino wa Cricket.\nAmarushanwa yitabiriye.\nIshimwe Herniette yitabirye amarushwanwa atadukanye ku isi muri 26 kamena 2019 ryabereye muri nigeria i Abija muri National Stadium, umukino ubanza bahuye nikipe y'igihugu ya Nigeria. Nanone bongeye kwitabira irushanwa i harare, muri Zimbabwe muri Gicurasi 2019,ku mucyino 2 batsinze Mozambike 48 kuri 40, aha yabaye umukinnyi w'umukino. bakomeza batsinda undi mukino wabahuje na Tanzanie.\n= Amashakiro.\n="}
{"id": "10383", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10383", "title": "Uwera Claudine", "text": "Uwera Claudine ni umunyarwandakazi w'umunyapolitiki akaba ni mpuguke mu bukungu ubu akaba na minisitiri Ushinzwe Imiteganyirize bw'ubucuruzi bw'igihe kirambye,muri Minisiteri Y ubucucuzi n'Imali umwanya ariho kuva muri 2018.\nAmashuri yize..\nClaudine Uwera Kuva 2008 kugeza 2013 yabonye impamya bushobozi yikirenga (PHD) yakuye muri kaminuza ya University of Gothenburg muri Sweden mubijyanye N'ubukungu (Economics studies), Ishyirwaho rya Uwera nku muyobozi ni rumwe mu ngero nyinshi z\u2019abanyeshuri beza baturuka mu bihugu biri munziz ya majyambere cyane bafite impamyabumenyi ya kaminuza ya Gothenburg, aho bagira icyo bahinduye byinshi mu bihugu byabo yagize ati \" gukorera igihugu cyanjye mbikoranye umwete kandi mbikoranye umwete. \nImirimo yakoze..\nClaudine Uwera Yakoze imyaka icumi (10years) yigisha muri kaminuza y'uRwanda mwishami ryubukungu.(UR_School of economics). Claudine Uwera yari umuyobozi wa Komisiyo y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019Abana ni ukuvuga Umunyamabanga Nshingwabikorwa wa Komisiyo y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019Abana."}
{"id": "10385", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10385", "title": "Bwiza Emerance", "text": "Bwiza Emerance ni umukobwa w'umunyarwandakazi akaba ari umwanditsi, umuririmbyi n'umuhimbyi w'indirimbo uri kuzamuka mu muziki nyarwanda akaba ari nawe watsinze irushanwa rya \"The Next Diva _Indi Mbuto\" ryabaye ku nshuro yaryo ya mbere. Aho arimo no kwitegura kugaragaza alubumu yakoze ya mbere.\nUbuzima bwite.\nBwiza Emerance (yavutse 09 Kanama 1999) ni umukobwa w'imfura iwabo mu muryango w'abana bane, mu bakobwa babiri n'abahungu babiri. Akaba abana na Nyina na Se mu Mujyi wa Nyamata mu Karere ka Bugesera mu intara y'Iburasirazuba. Yavukiye i Gitarama, ni mu Karere ka Muhanga mu Intara y'Amajyepfo, Imuryango we waje kwimukira i Kigali nyuma bajya gutura i Nyamata.\nAmashuri yize.\nBwiza Emerance amashuri abanza yayize kuri Kigali Harvest mu Murenge wa Kimihurura. Icyiciro rusange yize mu rwunge rw'amashuri rwa Mutagatifu Yozefu, amaze guhitamo ishami ryo kwiga yize igihe gito mu rwunge rw'amashuri rwa Mutagatifu Berinadeta mu karere ka Gisagara, asoreza ayisumbuye mu rwunge rw'amashuri rwa Mutagatifu Aloyizi mu Karere ka Rwamagana mu intara y'Iburasirazuba bw'u Rwanda. Bwiza Emerance yiga mu mwaka wa mbere muri Kaminuza ya Mount Kenya mu ishami ry'ibijyanye n'ubukerarugendo (Hospitality and Tourism Management), aho yatangiye kuhiga mu mwaka 2020. \nIbijyanye n' umuziki.\nUyu mukobwa ukiri muto Bwiza emerance yakuze akunda umuziki ahanini biturutse ku kuba yarajyanaga n'ababyeyi be mu rusengero akishimira uko baririmba. Uko yigiraga hejuru mu myaka ni nako yajyaga kuririmba muri korali zitandukanye zirimo izabana arabikomeza kugeza n'ubu. Uyu mukobwa yaririmbye muri korali kuva ku myaka 8 y'amavuko, ku buryo atazibuka neza amazina. Ndetse muri iki gihe ni umwe mu baririmbyi b'urusengero asengeramo rwakoreraga i kigali nyuma rwimukira i Nyamata. Akaba ashishikajwe cyane no gushyira itafari ku muziki w'abakobwa mu Rwanda, akagaragaza ko ibyo abahungu bakora n'abakobwa babikora mu muziki. Umuhanzikazi Bwiza kandi agiye gukorana indirimbo n'undi muhanzi uzwi mu rwanda witwa Uwineza Josiane uzwi nka Miss Jojo aho amaze imyaka irenga icumi ahagaritse umuziki ndtse n'ibikorwa byawo, ikazaba iri kuri alubumu nshyashya ateganya gusohora muri Nzeri 2023. bwiza akaba ari gutegura igitaramo cyo kwiyereka abo ku ivuko mu karere ka Bugesera aho avuka, bikaba biri mui aubumu ari gutunganya azasohora mu kwezi kwa nzeri. \nIbihembo.\nBwiza Emerance amaze kubona igihembo aho yatsinze irushanwa \"The Next Diva-Indi Mbuto\" ryabaye ku nshuro yaryo ya mbere,aho ryateguwe na KIKAC Music Label. Ibyo byamuhaye amahirwe yo guhita atangira gufashwa n'iyi nzu isanzwe itunganya umuziki ikorana n'abahanzi mukubazamura babamenyekanisha, bakaba barasinyanye amasezerano y'imyaka 5 bakorana, akaba amaze gukoreramo albumu ye ya mbere kugeza ubu atarabonera izina; iyo alubumu izaba ivuga k'urukundo n'ubuzima busanzwe, aho buri ndirimbo izajya isohokana n'amashusho yayo."}
{"id": "10386", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10386", "title": "Marthe Yankurije", "text": "--&gt; Yankurije Marthe\nYankurije Marthe (yavutse 5 Nyakanga 1994) ni umunyarwanda w'umukinnyi wabigize umwuga mukwiiruka intera ndende. Muri 2018, yatsindinze isiganwa ryaberaga u Rwanda muri metero 10,000 na Shampiyona izenguruka igihugu. Yatsinze kandi isiganwa rya kimwe cya kabiri cya marato muri 2021 ya Kigali International Peace Marathon, kandi yitabira mu mikino Olempike mu kiciro cya metero 5000. Yankurije marthe akaba aherutse kwirukanka mu intera ya metero zigera kubihumbi 10000, maze abona umwanya ushimishije ndetse akaba afite umwanya 171 mu bantu birukanka ku isi yose, akaba ari umwanya amaze igihe kubera hari marushwa ryo kwirukanya yitabiriye ku isi.\nUmwuga.\nYankurije ahatanira mu ikipe ya APR Athletics Club; mbere ya 2016, yarushanwe muri Nyamasheke Athletics Club. Yatangiye imikino ngororamubiri afite imyaka 17 Yatangiye muri marathon ya Kigali 2014, arangiza ari uwa gatanu, hanyuma nyuma y'umwaka, yitabira amarushanwa ya Afurika Cross Country 2014, arangiza ari 35. Yaje ku mwanya wa kane mu gice cya kabiri cya marathon muri Kigali International Peace Marathon 2017 maze atsinda 20 kilometres (12\u00a0mi) muri Bugesera marathon. Yankurije yatsindiye metero 10,000 muri Shampiyona yo gusiganwa y'igihugu y'u Rwanda 2018. Muri uwo mwaka, yatsindiye irushanwa ry\u2019igihugu cy\u2019u Rwanda mu kuzenguruka igihugu maze aza ku mwanya wa gatatu mu gice cya kabiri cya marathon muri Kigali International Peace Marathon 2018, na Dar Marathon muri Tanzaniya. \nMuri 2019, yaje ku mwanya wa kabiri muri Kigali International Peace Marathon, maze atsinda 20 kilometres (12\u00a0mi) ibyabaye muri Bugesera na none abisubiramo. Muri uwo mwaka, yitabiriye isiganwa rya metero 10,000 mu mikino nyafurika ya 2019 ; yari umwe mu bakinnyi babiri gusa bo mu Rwanda mu irushanwa. Muri 2020, yatsinze Huye Half Marathon mugihe cya 1:15:15. Yarangije kandi umwanya wa gatatu mu isiganwa rya Trier rya 5 kilometres (3.1\u00a0mi). \nMuri Gicurasi 2021, yitabiriye irushanwa ryo gusiganwa ku maguru muri Zambiya ryabereye i Lusaka, imikino yo gushaka itike yo kuzitabira imikino Olempike ya 2020. Muri kamena, yatsindinze igice cya marathon muri Kigali International Peace Marathon. Kubera iyo mpamvu, yahawe ikarita yo mu Rwanda yo kwitabira imikino Olempike ya 2020. Yarushanwe muri metero 5000 ; yarangije umwanya wa 17 \nUbuzima bwite.\nYankurije yavutse muri Nyakanga 1994. Akomoka mu Karere ka Nyamasheke, mu Rwanda. Kw'ishure, yakinaga umupira w'amaguru hamwe na handball. Yavuye mu ishuri kare, mu mwaka wa kane w'amashuri yisumbuye muri 2012. "}
{"id": "10387", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10387", "title": "Nema Marie Jeanne", "text": "Nema Marie Jeanne asanzwe ari umunyamakuru aho akora kuri Radio Authentic, n'ahandi akaba ari n'umuririmbyi ukomeye mu itorero rya ADEPR aho aririmba mu ma korali akomeye mu Rwanda nka korali Iriba na korali New Melody, n'izindi nyinshi zo muri Kigali aho ari n'umwarimu wa muzika. \nUbuzima bwite.\nNema Marie Jeanne (yavutse 1989) ni umunyarwandakazi, umuririmbyi, umuhanzi, umuvugabutumwa bwiza bwa Kristo Yesu. Ni umugore w'umunyarwanda washakanye n'umugabo witwa Ndayambaje Aim\u00e9 aho basezeranye kubana akaramata muri Mutarama 2017 bamaranye imyaka 7 bakundana, akaba kandi ari umubyeyi w'umwana umwe w'umukobwa.\nAzwi cyane muri korali Iriba yo muri ADEPR Taba mu karere ka Huye kuko ariho n'ababyeyi be batuye, yamamaye mu ndirimbo nka \"Ntakibasha na \"witinya\" bamwe bise \"Yakobo\",Nema akaba ariwe wumvikana cyane muri izo ndirimbo akaba kandi aririmba bihoraho muri korali New Melody, aho ayibereye umuyobozi. Nema ni umuririmbyi ufite ijwi ryiza ndetse n'ubuhanga bigashimangirwa n'uburyo akunze kwiyambazwa cyane n'amakorali atandukanye ngo ayafashe kandi akomeye ya hano mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "10389", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10389", "title": "Joy Mukanyange", "text": "Joy Mukanyange n'umudipolomate w'umunyarwandakazi akaba n'umurwanashyaka kuburenganzira bwa muntu. Yabaye ambasaderi w'u Rwanda muri Tanzaniya nyuma muri Kenya.\nUbuzima.\nJoy Mukanyange yakuriye i Gikongoro arerwa n'umuryango urwanya amakimbirane. Nyuma y\u2019ibitero byibasiye abatutsi mu Rwanda kuko umuryango we wahunze mu 1959 ujya mu nkambi y\u2019impunzi muri Uganda. Nyuma yimukiye mu majyepfo ya Uganda. Yagiye muri kaminuza ya Makerere muri Uganda arangiza afite ubuvanganzo. Mu myaka ya za 1980, yabaye i Nairobi muri Kenya, aho yari umunyamabanga w'ishyirahamwe rya Nyampinga association ryitaga ku mpunzi z'u Rwanda muri Kenya. \nNyuma ya jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda, yabaye Ambasaderi w\u2019u Rwanda muri Tanzaniya kandi yari umuyobozi w\u2019u Rwanda witabiriye igihano cy\u2019uwahoze ari Minisitiri w\u2019intebe muri Nzeri 1998 Jean Kambanda. \numwuga.\nMu 1999 yabaye Ambasaderi w'u Rwanda muri Kenya yayoboye kugeza mu 2002. Mukanyange yahagarariye igihugu cye bihoraho muri UNEP na UNCHS. Muri 2014 yatangaje ko hari iterambere ryiza igihugu cye kimaze gutera mu bijyanye no guteza imbere uburinganire. Ibi byari mu nshingano ze nk'umuvugizi w'ubujyanama kuri politike afite icyicaro i Kigali. yavuze ko Guverinoma y'u Rwanda igizwe na 64% by'abagore, nubwo iyi mibare ihinduka cyane muri guverinoma. 50% by'ubucamanza ni abagore nubwo ari 30% gusa mu nkiko za Gacaca. 98% by'abagore bo mu Rwanda bitaweho mbere yo kubyara kandi abakobwa biyandikisha mu mashuri barenze abahungu kandi bombi bari hejuru - kugeza hejuru ya 95%. "}
{"id": "10391", "revid": "16711", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10391", "title": "Judicaelle Irakoze", "text": "Judicaelle irakoze yavutse taliki ya 14 Mata 1995,ni umurundi akabazwiho kuba aharanire uburenganzira bwabari nab'ategarugori,Akabari n'umwanditsi,akaba Arina rwiyemeza mirimo ibikorwa byiwe byinshi byibanda ku bagore b'abirabura/Abagore b'Abanyafurika,Uburenganzira bw'Abimukura n'impunzi,kwihangira imirimo y'abakobwa bo muri Afurika,akanigisha kubirebana n'imibonano mpuzabitsina n'imyororokere,hamwe n'uburinganire muri rusange.\navugako kugiti cyiwe ntakidashoboka.\nJudicaelle niwe washinze Kandi akaba n'Umuyobozi muri Hitamo wowe,Umuryango uharanira inyungu za Afurika ku bagore n'abakobwa.Judicaelle akora nk'umuhuza bikorwa byo gusesengura no gutegura hamwe igice cyimikorere itandukanye.\njudicaelle yayoboye ibiganiro bitandukanye,yijyeze no kuvugira munama muzamahanga bita Horasis Global,munama zitandukanye z'umunyango w'ubumwe bw'ibihugu byUburayi nzongera ibikorwa bitandukanye muma kaminuza nk'ishuri ry'uburinganire muri kaminuza ya Tufts.\nJudicaelle ni umufatanya bikorwa na komisiyo yubirayi ya 2019 mubijyanye nokureba nabimukira na G20 bakiri bato bahindura isi kuburinganire mu cyiciro cya Global solutions Initiatives yo muri 2019.\nJudicaelle Kandi ni umwanditsi Uzwi ndetse inyandiko ziwe zatangiye ibiganiro byisi yose kuri Decolonization,Yanditse kubitabo binini birimo nka Essense,Press herald Kandi atanga umusanzu muri feminism ny'Afurika."}
{"id": "10392", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10392", "title": "Ishimwe Elyse Sandra", "text": "Umunyarwandakazi Ishimwe Sandra Elyse asazwe aba muri Amerika aherutse guhabwa amakamba menshi harimo n'ikamba ry'igisonga cya Kane yari yariganyijwe muri Miss Africa Arizona iheruka kuba. \nUbuzima bwite.\nIshimwe Sandra Elyse ni umunyarwandakazi\u00a0 afite imyaka 23 ubu aba muri mu Mujyi wa fonixe muri Arizona. Yavukiye mu akarere ka Nyaruguru aba ari naho akurira. Ni umwana wa kabiri mu muryango w\u2019abana bane. Ubwo yari akiri muto, yabonye amahirwe yo kujya kwiga mu Bushinwa nyuma aza kuhava ajya kuba muri British Guiana mu Amarika y'Epho. Nyuma yaje kujya muri Amerika muri Arizona ari naho aba kugeza ubu.\nIbyo akunda.\nIshimwe Sandra Elyse Akunda gutembera, kunguka inshuti nshya, gusoma ibitabo no kuzamuka imisozi. Ubu ari kwiga ibijyanye no kumurika imideli no gukina filime muri John Casablancas Modeling and Acting Agency. Arimo no kwiga Icyiciro cya Kabiri cya kaminuza mu bijyanye n\u2019Ubuzima. Uyu mukobwa avuga neza Ikinyarwanda, Igishinwa, Icyongereza n\u2019Igifaransa.\nAmakamba yose yahawe.\nIshimwe Sandra Elyse yari yabonye amakamba ya Miss Congeniality na The Best Evening Gown muri iri rushanwa. Aya uko ari abiri yiyongereyeho ikamba ry\u2019Igisonga cya Kane.\niri kamba rya 4 barimuhaye nyuma yo gusanga bari babaze amanota ye nabi.\u201cIrushanwa rirangiye ku wa 9 Mata, habayeho gusubiramo kubara amaota yose, dusanga ko hari aho bibeshye ni ko kumugira Igisonga cya Kane.\nUmushinga yari afite.\nUyu Ishimw kuba yahawe iri kamba bivuze ikintu gikomeye kuri we cyane ko rizamufasha mu bikorwa bye. Ati \u201cGuhabwa iri kamba bivuze ikintu gikomeye kuko narariruhiye none birangiye ndibonye kandi kuba ari ikintu nzahorana bizamfasha. Bigiye bituma ntangira ibikorwa by\u2019umushinga nari mfite.\u201d Ibikorwa bye azabitangirira muri Arizona ariko arateganya kubigeza no mu Rwanda. Ati \u201cNintanabasha kuza mu Rwanda nzifashisha inzego zibishinzwe kugira ngo ibikorwa by\u2019umushinga wanjye bigere ku bo byagenewe.\u201d Sandra Elyse Ishimwe afite umushinga ugamije gufasha abategarugori 140 muri Amerika no mu Rwanda.\nMu minsi yashize yavuzeko ko uyu mushinga we waturutse ku buzima bugoye yanyuzemo ariko akaza gufashwa n\u2019umutegarugori bataziranye. Uretse ibyo kandi hari ubuzima abari n\u2019abategarugori banyuzemo mu bihe bikomeye bya COVID-19 ndetse n\u2019ishyirwa mu bikorwa rya gahunda ya \u2018Guma mu rugo\u2019 yatangiye muri Werurwe 2020 ahenshi ku Isi, aho abenshi bakorewe ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina, abangavu benshi batewe inda zitateganyijwe, ingo nyinshi zihura n\u2019ikibazo cy\u2019inzara. \nIbyo byamuteye gutangiza umushinga udaharanira inyungu witwa \u201cThe Ursula Women Foundation\u2019\u2019 uzita kandi ukanateza imbere abari n\u2019abategarugori cyane cyane abagizweho n\u2019ingaruka zaturutse kuri Covid-19. Avuga ko impamvu yahisemo izina \u2018The Ursula Women Foundation ari uko \u201cUrsula\u2019\u2019 ari izina ry\u2019igisimba mu Kinyarwanda bakunze kwita \u201cidubu\u201d. \nNi cyo cya mbere ku Isi kizwiho kuba ahantu hagoranye cyane mu urubura n\u2019ubukonje bwinshi, ariko kikaba kihabaye ibinyejana n\u2019ibinyejana kubera imwe mu myitwarire yacyo irimo kwemera cyangwa kwakira no kwihangana. Ati \u201cUmutegarugori nawe namugereranyije n\u2019iyo nyamaswa yiga kuba ahantu hagoye ariko ntibiyibuze kubaho. Na bo babaho mu buzima bugoye ariko bakabasha gutanga umusanzu ukomeye mu umuryango; ni bo batwita amezi icyenda, bakabyara, bakagira uruhare mu mikurire y\u2019umwana kuko aribo bamukurikirana umunsi ku wundi.\u201d Umuryango The Ursula Women Foundation watangijwe n\u2019uyu mukobwa urateganya guhindurira ubuzima abari n\u2019abategarugori 70 bo mu Mujyi wa Fonixi muri Leta ya Arizona muri Amerika ndetse n\u2019abagera kuri 70 bo mu Rwanda. Uzahera ku bafite imyaka 12 kuzamura mu gihe kingana n\u2019umwaka umwe gusa, ndetse imibare ikazagenda yiyongera ubwo uzagenda wagura ibikorwa byawo mu bihugu bitandukanye hirya no hino ku Isi."}
{"id": "10393", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10393", "title": "Dinah Musindarwezo", "text": "Musindarwezo Dinah ni umunyarwandakazi wamenyekanye mu guharanira uburenganzira bw'umugore. Ni umuyobozi wa politiki n\u2019itumanaho muri Womankind Worldwide, kandi yahoze ari Umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019Umuryango nyafurika ushinzwe iterambere n\u2019itumanaho (FEMNET). Musindarwezo Dinah yashyizwe mu bantu bagera ku 100, bakomeye muri politiki y\u2019uburinganire yabagore n'abagbo ku isi muri politiki mu mwaka wo muri 2018. \nAmasomo.\nMusindarwezo Dinah yize amasomo aho afite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu mu bijyanye n'uburinganire n'iterambere yakuye muri kaminuza nkuru ry\u2019Ubushakashatsi (ya IDS) muri kaminuza ya Sussex, yo mu Bwongereza, ndetse afite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabili cya kaminuza, mu masomo yu bushakashatsi bw\u2019iterambere yakuye muri kaminuza ya Makerere, muri Uganda. Dinah akorera mu itsinda ry\u2019abajyanama b\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ry\u2019Abagore bo mu Burasirazuba ndetse n'amajyepfo ya Afurika, akaba ari umwe mu bagize inama y\u2019ikigega cya Amplify Change Fund, ingingo ya 19 Ibiro by\u2019akarere ka Afurika y'Iburasirazuba n'ihembe rya Afurika hamwe n'Ikigo gishinzwe umuco n\u2019ubuzima kavukire (TICAH).\nUbuzima.\nMusindarwezo mu mwaka wa 2010, yakoraga nk'inzobere mu buringanire bw'umugabo n'umugore muri Noruveje. Muri 2012 yabaye umuyobozi mukuru wa FEMNET, ufite icyicaro muri Kenya. Nk'umuyobozi mukuru wa FEMNET, yagaragaje uburakari muri kamena 2017 mu gikorwa cya perezida wa Tanzaniya John Magufuli cyo gukumira abanyeshuri batwite akababuza kwiga.\nUmwuga.\nMuri Gashyantare 2018, yahamagaye inama y'iminsi ibiri i Addis Abeba kugira ngo abaharanira uburenganzira bw'umugore bo muri Afurika bahabwe ingamba mbere y'inama yari yateguwe na Komisiyo y'Umuryango w'Abibumbye. Musindarwezo yeguye kuri FEMNET muri 2018. Yabaye umuyobozi wa politiki n\u2019itumanaho muri Womankind Worldwide, umuryango ukorera mu Bwongereza ushyigikira imiryango iharanira uburenganzira bw\u2019umugore muri Afurika no muri Aziya. Agezeyo, yerekanye ingaruka zishingiye ku gitsina ziterwa n'umwenda w\u2019ibihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere bifitiye imiryango mpuzamahanga, ndetse no ku buryo buhoro buhoro imiryango itegamiye kuri Leta yajya mu biganiro byo gutera inkunga iterambere ry'umugore. Muri Mata 2020, yahamagariye Umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019Afurika kuganira ku gutinda kwishyura imyenda ku bihugu bigize uyu muryango, kugira ngo ibihugu by\u2019Afurika byibande ku kurwanya icyorezo cya COVID-19. "}
{"id": "10394", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10394", "title": "Nyirambangutse Brigitte", "text": "Dr Nyirambangutse Brigitte.\nDr Nyirambangutse n'umwarimukazi mw'ishuri ry'ibinyabuzima muri kaminuza yu Rwanda,\nAkaba n'umuyobozi wungirije w'ikigo cy'indashyikirwa \nMu binyabuzima no gucunga umutungo kamere byakiriwe na kaminuza y'uRwanda. \nDr Nyirambangutse ni muntu ki?\nDr Nyirambangutse Brigitte yavutse mumwaka wa 1982 akabari Umunyarwandakazi utuye mu gihugu \nCy'u Rwanda. Dr Nyirambangutse akaba ari umuhanga mu bidukikije,afite Uburambe bw' imyaka6 mu bijyanye n' ihindagurika ry' ikirere n'umwaka 1 w' Uburambe akorana n'ikigo cya Global Growth institute mu Rwanda.\nEse Dr Nyirambangutse avuga indimi zingahe??\nDr Nyirambangutse Brigitte avuga indimi 3\n_Ikinyarwanda\n_Icyongereza\n_Igifaransa\nAmashuri yize..\nDr Nyirambangutse Brigitte yigiye amashuri ye muri,Scotland, mu bwongereza no muri Sweden.\nAkaba afite kandi impamyabumenyi ya PHD mu bumenyi bwa kamere ndetse no mu bidukikije, \nAkaba Ari n'umuhanga mu bushakashatsi bw'ibidukikije."}
{"id": "10395", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10395", "title": "Malaika Uwamahoro", "text": "Malaika Uwamahoro (wahoze ari Angel Uwamahoro, yavutse 1990) ni umukinnyi wa filime wavukiye mu Rwanda, kandi ni umusizi, umuririmbyi, ni umuntu ukunda guharanira ubutabera. Aba i Portland, Maine, muri Amerika. \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nUwamahoro yavukiye mu Rwanda mu 1990, avukira mu muryango wahuye n\u2019ingaruka zikomeye z\u2019amateka y\u2019igihugu. Mu 1994, ubwo habaga Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, nyina yahisemo guhungana na we kugira ngo barokoke, berekeza mu Uganda.\nMuri Uganda, babayeho nk\u2019impunzi mu gihe cy\u2019imyaka irindwi. Ubuzima bwo mu buhungiro bwari bugoye, ariko bwamwigishije kwihangana, gukomera ku muco we, no guharanira ejo heza. Uko gukurira mu mahanga byatumye amenya imico itandukanye kandi agira ubumenyi bwagutse ku buzima mpuzamahanga.\nMu 2001, umuryango waje kwimukira muri United States, aho yakomeje amashuri ye. Gukura mu gihugu gishya byamusabye kwiga ururimi n\u2019umuco mushya, ariko byanamufashije kugaragaza impano ye mu bijyanye n\u2019ubuhanzi n\u2019ikinamico.\nNyuma y\u2019amashuri yisumbuye, yinjiye muri Fordham University i New York City, aho yize amasomo y\u2019ikinamico (Theatre Arts) akabona impamyabumenyi ihanitse y\u2019ubuhanzi (Bachelor of Fine Arts). Icyo gihe ni bwo yatangiye kugaragaza neza ko azakoresha ubuhanzi nk\u2019inzira yo kuvuga amateka, gusigasira ukuri no gufasha abandi gusobanukirwa ubuzima bwahuye n\u2019ibikomere by\u2019amateka.\nUmwuga.\nFilime.\nYagaragaye muri filime ya Tomas Petkovski yo muri 2018, \"LoveLess Generation\". Mubiganiro bya tereviziyo byakozwe muri uwo mwaka na Tola Olatunji bise, \"Yankee Hustle\", binagaragaramo Jide Kosoko, Uche Jombo, Kara Rainer n'abandi, akina nka \"Princess\". Muri 2019, yagaragaye muri filime iyobowe n'umukinnyi wa firime ukomoka muri Afuganisitani Atiq Rahimi, \"Our Lady of the Nile\" (Igifaransa: \"Notre-Dame du Nil\"). yongeye kugaragara mu ikinamico yo hanze ya Broadway na Leslie Lewis Sword na Edward Vilga bise,\"Miracle in Rwanda\". Kuri iyikiinamico, yatowe mu cyiciro cyiza cya \"Solo Performance\" muri VIV Award 2019. \nUmuziki\nMu rwego rw\u2019umuziki, Uwamahoro yagaragaye mu mashusho y\u2019indirimbo \"\u201cStickin\u2019 2 You\u201d\" y\u2019umuririmbyi w\u2019Umunyarwanda Mucyo. Iyo ndirimbo yakozwe na Eloi El.\nKugaragara kwe muri ayo mashusho byagaragaje ubufatanye hagati y\u2019abahanzi bo mu nzego zitandukanye, aho yahuje ubunararibonye bwe mu gukina n\u2019ubuhanzi bw\u2019umuziki. Nubwo atazwi cyane nk\u2019umuririmbyi, uruhare rwe muri iyo ndirimbo rwerekanye ko ashobora no kwitabira ibikorwa by\u2019umuziki binyuze mu gukina amashusho (music video appearance) no gufatanya n\u2019abandi bahanzi mu mishinga y\u2019ubuhanzi.\nIbi byagize uruhare mu kumwubakira isura nk\u2019umuhanzi ufite impano nyinshi kandi ushobora gukorana n\u2019abahanzi batandukanye mu guteza imbere ubuhanzi nyarwanda.\nIbisigo.\nYakinnye ku munsi mpuzamahanga wo kwibuka Jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda mu 2017. Yamenyekanye nk'umwe mu bahanzi bitabiriye ibirori bya DanceAfrica 2019. Muri 2020, mugihe cya guma mu rugo, bavugaga ko yanditse igisigo, \"I Don't Mind!\".Yari umwe mu batanze ibiganiro batoranijwe kugira ngo bavugire mu nama y'abagore bayoboye Forbes Woman Africa 2020, yabereye i Durban, muri Afurika y'Epfo. "}
{"id": "10397", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10397", "title": "Alice Rwema", "text": "Alice Rwema ni umunyamategeko akaba n'umukozi wa Leta mu Rwanda, kuva muri Kanama 2014, yabaye umuyobozi wungirije w'inama y'ubutegetsi muri Rwanda Energy Group (REG), sosiyete ikora ibijyanye no kubyaza ingufu, gutanga amasoko, gukwirakwiza no kohereza mu mahanga ibijyanye n'amashanyarazi. Kuva muri Gicurasi 2017, yabaye n'umunyamabanga mukuru w'ikigo cya REG. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nYize muri Kaminuza Nkuru y'u Rwanda ari naho yakuye impamyabumenyi y'Amategeko(Bachelor of Laws) mu 2009. Muri 2014, yahawe impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu by'amategeko, inzobere mu bucuruzi mpuzamahanga, imisoro n'ubucuruzi, yakuye muri kaminuza y'u Rwanda. Mu mwaka wa 2013, yoherejwe mu kigo cy\u2019amategeko mpuzamahanga cya Ashurst LLP mu gihe cy\u2019amezi atatu, yatewe inkunga n\u2019abavoka mpuzamahanga bo muri Afurika ndetse na gahunda mpuzamahanga yo mu Bwongereza ikorera mu Bwongereza ireberera abunganizi mu mategeko muri Afurika. \nUmwuga.\nRwema yabaye umujyanama mu by'amategeko muri Minisiteri y'Ibikorwa Remezo mu Rwanda (Mininfra) kuva muri Gicurasi 2009 kugeza 2013. Kuva mu 2013 kugeza muri Mata 2017, yari umujyanama w\u2019ubucuruzi muri minisitiri w\u2019igihugu ishinzwe ingufu n\u2019amazi muri minisiteri y'ishinzwe ibikorwaremezo.Muri Kanama 2014, yagizwe umuyobozi wungirije wa Rwanda Energy Group Limited, isosiyete ikora ibijyanye na Energy Utility Corporation Limited na Limited Development Company Limited. Kuva muri Gicurasi 2017, yabaye umunyamabanga w'ikigo cya Rwanda Energy Group. Mbere, yari umwe mu bagize inama y\u2019ikigo gishinzwe ingufu n\u2019isuku EWSA. \nIbindi bitekerezo.\nBitewe n'ubuhanga afite mu bijyanye n'amasezerano n'ubucuruzi, yari umujyanama mu by'amategeko muri guverinoma y'u Rwanda mu gihe cyo gutanga isoko ryo kubaka ikibuga cy'indege mpuzamahanga cya Bugesera ubu kirimo kubakwa. Ni n'umuterankunga mu bipimo ngenderwaho bigenga ingufu zirambye, Banki y'isi ifatanya na banki ishinzwe iterambere ry\u2019ingufu zirambye ku rwego mpuzamahanga. Rwema azi neza ikinyarwanda, Igiswahiri, Icyongereza n'Igifaransa. "}
{"id": "10398", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10398", "title": "Uwitonze Sonia Rolland", "text": "Uwitonze Sonia Rolland nu umunyarwandakazi,wabaye Nyampinga w'ubufaransa mu 2000, aka yari yabaye mbere y'aho nyampinga wa Bourgogne mu 1999,bakaba bamwita umwamikazi w'ubwiza, akaba ari umukinnyi wa filime, akaba ari umukozi uhuza umuco w'ubufaransa n'aba Nyarwanda. Akaba yarabaye miss w'Ubufaransa wa 70. Ukunze kwifotoza cyane akandikwa cyane mu binyamakuru byinshi byo mu Bufaransa n'u Rwanda, akaba aherutse gukora Filime ye yerekanywe mu gikorwa cyo kwibuka.\nUbuzima bwite.\nUWITONZE Sonia Rolland (yavutse 11 Gashyantare 1981 avukira I Kigali) \u00a0ni umunyarwandakazi se umubyara akaba ari Jacques Rolland w\u2019umufaransa nyina akaba ari umunyarwandakazi. Mu 1990 baje kuva mu Rwanda bahungira i Burundi, haje kuba intambara y\u2019abaturage maze mu 1994 bimukira mu Bufaransa ari naho batuye, ubu afite nyina gusa mu gihe se yitabye Imana muri 2014. Uwitonze\u00a0 w\u2019imyaka 45, muri 2019 ubwo yaganiraga na Gala Magazine, yavuze ko impamvu akunda kwifotoza yambaye ubusa ari uko aterwa ishema n\u2019umubiri we. Sonia afite abana babiri b'abakobwa yabyaye ku bagabo babiri. Tess ufitwe imyaka 15 yabyaranye na Christophe Rcancourt na Kahina ufite imyaka 11 yabyaranye na Jalil Lespert, yivugiye ko abana be bakoze nkibyo akora ntakibazo ariko icya mbere ari ukubaha urugero rwiza rw'umugore w'umunyembaraga. Kandi akavuga ko atiteguye kongera gushaka ahubwo arimo gukora cyane kugira ngo yiyiteho.\nUrushako.\nUwitonze Sonia Relland yashakanye n'abagabo 2:\nKwamamaza.\nKuva mu 2008, yabaye ambasaderi w\u2019amavuta yo kwisiga yitwa Mixa, Muri 2019, yinjiye muri Guerlain nk\u2019isura ya nshya izajya ikora Makeup na Parufe."}
