{"id": "10407", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10407", "title": "Mukamurenzi Marcianne", "text": "Mukamurenzi Marcianne ni we Munyarwanda wa mbere wahagarariye igihugu mu mikino Olempike iba rimwe mu myaka ine (4) mu 1984 i Los angeles muri Leta zunzu ubumwe za amerika. Yahagaraniye u Rwanda mu mikino myinshi Ku Rwego rw'isi.\nUbuzima bwe bwite.\nMukamurenzi Yavukiye ku gisenyi mu Rwanda kuwa 4 kamena 1959 avukira mu muryango w'abana icyenda, ubu afite imyaka 63. Yatangiye kwitoza ibyo gusiganwa ku maguru nk'umwuga mu mwaka wa1975, aho yari afite imyaka16.\nAmarushanwa yagiyemo.\nHashize imyaka 8 nyuma yaho,Yahagarariye u Rwanda mu mikino Olempike mu mwaka w'1984 i Los angeles muri leta zunzu ubumwe za amerika, Yakinnye n'imikino ya Seoul 1988 na Barcelone 1992, Muri Shampiyona z'isi mu mokino ngororamubiri i Helsinki mu 1983, i Roma mu 1989, n'i Tokyo mu 1991.\nAho yabaye.\nYaje kujya kwitoreza mu Bufaransa mu mwaka 1987, Aranahatura mu munjyi wa Bordeaux kugeza muri 1994 ubwo yagarutse mu Rwanda agiye kubana n'umugabo bari bararushinze mu mwaka 1993. Intambara yahise itera ahugira muri Congo. Nyuma yaje kunga muri Cameroun, abifashijwemo n'uwahoze ari umutoza we Roger Grange abafasha gusubira kwibwra kuba i Bordeaux mu Bufaransa mu mwaka 2003.\nIbihembo yakoreye.\nYegukanye umudali wa zahabu nuw'umuringa muri shampiyona ny'afurika yo gusiganwa metero ibihumbi cumi(10,000) ku maguru mu mwaka wa 1988 na 1989"}
