{"id": "10409", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10409", "title": "Scholastique Mukasonga", "text": "Scholastique Mukasonga ni umwanditsi wavutse mu 1956 mu cyahoze ari intara ya Gikongoro mu Rwanda akaba atuye Mu bufaransa. Muri 2012, Yatsindiye ibihembo bya prix Renaudot na prix Ahmadou-Kourouma kubwigitabo cye \"Our Lady of the Nile\" \".\" Usibye kuba uwahataniye igihembo mpuzamahanga cy\u2019ubuvanganzo cy\u2019ubuvanganzo cya Dublin n\u2019igihembo cy\u2019ibitabo cya Los Angeles Times, Mukasonga yahembwe mu 2014 igihembo cya Seligman cyo kurwanya ivanguramoko ndetse no mu 2015 ahabwa igihembo Soci\u00e9t\u00e9 des gens de lettres. Kuri ubu atuye muri Lower Normandy mu Bufaransa. \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nScholastique Mukasonga yavutse mu 1956 mu majyepfo ashyira uburengerazuba bw'u Rwanda, ku ruzi rwa Rukarara. Mu 1959, gahunda ya mbere yo kurwanya abatutsi yashenye igihugu ituma abatutsi bamwe bahunga. Mu 1960, umuryango we woherejwe hamwe nabandi batutsi benshi i Nyamata mu mu karere ka Bugesera kari kadatuwe, scrubland. Umuryango we wabaga mu nkambi y'impunzi nyuma yo kwirukanwa mu mudugudu wabo, aho yarokotse nubwo yatotejwe ndetse akenda no gukorerwa ubwicanyi. Nyina Stefania yitaye ku bana be, Nubwo umubare muto 10% by'abatutsi wari wemewe gukomeza mumashuri yisumbuye, yabanje kwiga Lyc\u00e9e Notre-Dame-de-Citeaux i Kigali, hanyuma akomereza mu ishuri ry'i Butare. Mukasonga abisobanura agira ati: \"Ni ryo shuri ryonyine ry'abakobwa ryanyemereye gukoresha umwuga wanjye kugira ngo mfashe abandi badafite amahirwe yo kwiga.\"\nMu 1973, abanyeshuri b'Abatutsi birukanwe mu mashuri, hamwe n'abakozi ba Leta b'Abatutsi birukanwa ku mirimo yabo. Kubera iyo mpamvu, byabaye ngombwa ko agenda, ahungira mu Burundi kugira ngo ahunge iterabwoba. Yarangije amasomo ye nk'umukozi ushinzwe imibereho myiza mu Burundi atangira akazi muri UNICEF. Mukasonga yageze mu Bufaransa mu 1992 biba ngombwa ko asubiramo ikizamini cy\u2019abakozi bashinzwe imibereho myiza, kubera ko impamyabumenyi yakiriye mu Burundi itemewe n\u2019ubuyobozi bw\u2019Ubufaransa. Kuva 1996-1997, yari umukozi ushinzwe imibereho myiza y'abanyeshuri ba kaminuza ya Caen. Kuva mu 1998 kugeza ubu, akora imirimo yo guhagararira ubutabera (amategeko) muri Union d\u00e9partementale des association familiales de Calvados (Ishami ry\u2019amashyirahamwe y\u2019imiryango ya Calvados). Kuri ubu atuye ahitwa Normandy.\nMu 1994, abantu 37 bo mu muryango we bishwe muri jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Byatwaye Mukasonga indi myaka 10 kugirango agire ubutwari bwo gusubira mu Rwanda, ibyo yabikoze mu 2004. Muri uru rugendo niho yumvise afite ubushake bwo kwandika igitabo cye cya mbere, igitabo cyandika ku buzima, \"Inyenzi ou les Cafards.\" Inyandiko y'Icyongereza, yahinduwe na Jordan Stump, yiswe \"Cockroaches,\" kandi yatorewe igihembo cy\u2019ibitabo cya Los Angeles Times mu 2016 mu cyiciro cy\u2019ubuzima bwa muntu. Yakurikijeho igitabo cya La Femme aux pieds nus muri 2008. Yabonye igihembo cya Seligmann, avuye muri, yemera imirimo irwanya ivanguramoko no kutoroherana. Mu mwaka wa 2010, yasohoye icyegeranyo cy\u2019inkuru ngufi zitwa L'Iguifou, anegukana igihembo cya Paul Bourdari mu 2011 avuye muri l'Acad\u00e9mie des sciences d'outre-mer ndetse no mu gihembo cya Renaissance kubera Igitabo cye \"Notre-Dame du Nil\", yatsindiye ibihembo bitatu: igihembo cya Ahmadou-Kourouma i Geneve, igihembo cya Oceans France, na prix Renaudot mu 2012. Ubuhinduzi bw'icyongereza bw'iki gitabo, \"Our Lady of the Nile,\", bwatoranijwe nk'imwe mu bitabo icumi byatsindiye igihembo cy\u2019ubuvanganzo bwa Dublin kandi yabaye uwahawe ubufasha ku gihembo cya Emerging Voices mubijyanye n\u2019Imari. Gukora filimi y'iki gitabo byaratangiye iyobowe na Atiq Rahimi.\nMuri 2014, Mukasonga yasohoye igitabo gishya \"Ce que murmurent les collines\" \",\" yatsindiye igihembo Soci\u00e9t\u00e9 des gens de lettres muri 2015 mu. Igitabo cye \"Coeur Tambour\" cyasohotse muri Mutarama 2016 mu cyegeranyo cyera cya Gallimard. Muri kamena 2017, yahawe igihembo kubambasaderi bavuga Igifaransa (Ambassadeurs francophones) i Copenhagen. Muri Werurwe 2018, yasohoye igitabo gishya cyandika ku buzima, \"Un si beau diplomate!\" Prix Bernheim wo muri Fondation du judaisme francais (Fondasiyo y'Abayahudi b'Abafaransa) yamuhaye igihrembo muri 2015 mu rwego rwo kumushimira ibikorwa bye byose. Scholastique Mukasonga ni umwe mu bagize inteko ishinga amategeko ya Prix Deauville Litt\u00e9rature et Musique (Igihembo cya Deauville ku buvanganzo n'umuziki). Yahawe kandi icyubahiro cya Chevalier des Arts et des Lettres, ishimira abagize uruhare runini mu muco muri ibyo bice byombi.\nImirimo.\nMu gitabo cye cyitwa \"Notre-Dame du Nil\", yavuze ishuri ryisumbuye ryubatse ku musozi wa metero 8202, ritari kure y\u2019inkomoko ya Nili. akaba ariho abakobwa bahurira, muguhiramo abanyeshuri umubare w'abatutsi ugarukira kuri 10% by'abanyeshuri. Biboneka ko iyi nkuru ishingiye kubintu byabaye mu buzima: bisa nkaho yavugaga ishuri ryisumbuye rya Notre-Dame de Citeaux i Kigali aho yari umunyeshuri, kandi gukura abanyeshuri b\u2019abatutsi ni byo byari yiboneye mu 1973. igihe yari mu buhungiro mu Burundi. \n\"Ce que murmurent les collines (What the Hills Whisper)\" ni ikusanyirizo ry'inkuru ngufi, zimwe muri zo zishingiye ku mateka y'u Rwanda, yagaragaje uko abandi bashushanya amashusho y'ubuzima bwa buri munsi bw'u Rwanda. Ni igitabo cye cya mbere kitari gishingiye kuri jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda. \"Un Pygm\u00e9e \u00e0 l'\u00e9cole\" ni inkuru ngufi yanditswe na Mukasonga, yanditswe mu 2017 kandi ishyirwa mu cyegeranyo cyiswe \"La rencontre avec l'autre (The encounter with the Other)\"\".\"\nHamwe n'igitabo cye \"Coeur Tambour\" \"(Pounding Heart, Drumming Heart)\" Scholastique Mukasonga yaguye icyerekezo cye uko yavuye mu Rwanda kugera muri Antilles, Amerika no muri Berezile. Igitabo gikurikirana Kitami, umukobwa wabaye umuririmbyi uzwi cyane muri afurika. Tugarutse ku gitabo cya \"Un si beau diplome,\" Mukasonga yigana uburyo se yamushyizeho igitutu kugirango abone impamyabumenyi. Mu buhungiro mu Burundi, Djibouti, hanyuma akaza kugera mu Bufaransa, \"beautiful diploma\" yari 'ingufu zamufashaga kwihanganira guhezwa no kwiheba. Igitabo cye aheruka gusohoka muri Werurwe 2020, igitabo cyitwa \"Kibogo est mont\u00e9 au ciel (Kibogo Yuriye mu kirere)\". Irasebya ikibazo cy'amadini, ivugabutumwa, n'ubunini bifitanye isano n'igihe cy'abakoloni."}
{"id": "10410", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10410", "title": "Beata Uwamaliza Habyarimana", "text": "Beata Uwamaliza Habyarimana Umunyarwandakazi wumunyapolitiki Akaba ni Mpuguke mubukungu (Economist) ukorera politike Mu Rwanda.\nUmwanya muri politike Mu Rwanda..\nBeata Uwamaliza Habyarimana kuva muri Werurwe 2021 Ni Minisitiri ushinzwe Ubucuruzi ni Nganda (trade and industry).\nAmashuri yize..\nkuva 1996 kugeza 2000 Beata Uwamaliza Habyarimana Yabonye Impanya bushobozi yikiciro cya mbere cya kaminuza (bachelor degree in Finance) yakuye muri kaminuza y'uRwanda.\nUwamaliza Kandi yabonye impanya bushobozi yikiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza (Masters degree in Economic Administration) yakuye muri kaminuza ya Maastrich University yo Mubuhorandi. \nAkazi Beata Yakoze mbere yo kuba minisitiri..\nBeata Uwamaliza Habyarimana Afite uburambe bwimyaka cumi nitanu(15years) mubukungu Aho Yabaye Umwe mubayobozi Ba Bank ya Kigali (Bk).\nUwamaliza Kandi yabaye umuyobozi Banki Yagaseke.\nYanakoze Kandi muri Banki yabaturage (BPR) Aho Yari mubayobozi Bayo.\nBeata Uwamaliza Habyarimana Yanakoze mukigo cya Bill and Melinda Gates Foundation."}
{"id": "10411", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10411", "title": "Dr. MUKAMURENZI Solange", "text": "Dr. MUKAMURENZI Solange ni Umuyobozi ushinzwe gutanga serivisi nimiyoborere myiza na JADF mu Nama y'Ubutegetsi y'u Rwanda kuva muri Mata 2021.\nUbuzima bwe bwite.\nMbere yuko aba Umuyobozi wimiyoborere myiza yari Umwarimu muri College of Science and Technology muri kaminuza yu Rwanda. Yabaye kandi Umuhuzabikorwa w\u2019igihugu w\u2019itsinda ry\u2019iterambere ry\u2019u Rwanda muri Minisiteri y\u2019Uburezi. Dr. MUKAMURENZI afite impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga ya PhD muri Informatics yakuye muri kaminuza ya \u00d6rebro muri Suwede. Afite Impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga muri Computer Science and Technology Technology yayikuye muri kaminuza ya Mutagatifu Andereya, mu Bwongereza; impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu iterambere ry'ubuyobozi muri ICT n'ubumenyi muri kaminuza ya Dublin City, Irilande; n'impamyabumenyi ya Bachelor muri Computer Engineering and Technology Technology yakuye mu cyahoze ari Kigali Institute of Science and Technology (KIST), ubu ni kaminuza y'u Rwanda."}
{"id": "10413", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10413", "title": "Mukeka Clementine", "text": "Mukeka Clementinne ni umugore akaba umunyarwandakazi, ni umunyamabanga uhoraho muri Minisiteri y'ububanyi n'amahanga MINAFFET mu Rwanda washyizweho na Perezida wa Repubulika y'u Rwanda Paul Kagame nk'umunyamabanga muri Minisiteri y\u2019ububanyi n\u2019amahanga n\u2019ubutwererane mpuzamahanga ku ya 15 Gicurasi 2020. \nUburezi.\nClementine Mukeka yabyawe n'ababyeyi b'Abanyarwanda. Yize Amashuri abanza nayisumbuye i Burayi. Igitabo kimwe cyizewe kivuga ko Mukeka Afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bijyanye n\u2019ubucuruzi yakuye mu ishuri ry\u2019ubucuruzi rya IDRAC (mu Bufaransa), naho impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bucuruzi bw\u2019ubucuruzi (Major: Economics), yakuye muri kaminuza ya Londere y\u2019Amajyepfo (Ubwongereza). Mukeka yize kandi muri kaminuza ya New York (Amerika) mu masomo mpuzamahanga y\u2019ubucuruzi.\nUmwuga.\nMbere yuko ashyirwaho Mukeka yari yarabaye umujyanama mukuru w\u2019ubucuruzi mu kigo cy\u2019Amerika Gishinzwe iterambere mpuzamahanga (USAID) u Rwanda. Yabaye kandi impuguke mu by'ubukungu n\u2019ubucuruzi muri Ambasade y\u2019Amerika mu Rwanda Mbere yo kwinjira mu butumwa bwa Minisiteri y\u2019ububanyi n\u2019amahanga ya Amerika / Amerika mu Rwanda, yagiye akora imyanya itandukanye mu Bikorera mu Burayi no muri Amerika."}
{"id": "10414", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10414", "title": "Tetero Solange", "text": "Tetero Solange ni umugore w'umunyarwandakazi akaba umunyapolitiki wo mu Rwanda. \nUmwuga.\nSolange Tetero asanzwe akora nk'umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe iterambere muru urubyiruko muRwanda muri Minisitiri w\u2019urubyiruko n\u2019umuco kuva mu 2020. Kuva mu 2015 kugeza 2020 yakoraga muri Imbuto Foundation. \nUbuzima.\nSolange Avuka mu karere ka Karongi, mu murenge wa Rubengera. Yatangiye amashuli abanza Yiga ku ishuli ry\u2019abubatsi ryo mu murenge wa Rubengera ari naho Yavukiye, aha akaba yarahigiye umwaka wa 1, uwa kabiri n\u2019uwa gatatu. Kubera ibibazo byahise bivuka mu muryango we, ikiciro gikurikiyeho cy\u2019amashuli abanza Yagikomereje mu mugi wa Kibuye, mu ishuli ribanza rya Gatwaro. Abantu benshi barahazi kubera stade Gatwaro izwi cyane. Ibyo bigo byombi nibyo nigiyeho amashuli abanza. Solange Mu mashuli abanza rero yize aru umuhanga, yakundaga kwiga, \u00a0kuko ababyeyi be bari abarimu. Iwabo bari abana umunani, we akaba umwana wa 4 ariko kandi akaba ari we wari umukobwa wa mbere. Nk\u2019uko rero iwacu bari abarimu, bakunda kutubwira bati: \u201cbana bacu nta sambu dufite, nta modoka dufite ndetse yewe nta n\u2019ubundi butunzi, bityo umunani tuzaba nta wundi ni uyu nguyu wo kwiga. \nIbihembo.\nYahawe ibihembo Icuro zigera kure ebyiri na Madamu wa perezida wu Rwanda (Jannete Kagame) mu bakobwa bitwaye neza mu gihugu (BPGs) mu 2009 na 2011. Tetero Solange yabaye umuyobozi mukuru muri Minisiteri y\u2019Urubyiruko n\u2019umuco ushinzwe kongerera ubushobozi urubyiruko, aho yagiye avuga mu nama zizahuza urubyiruko hazaba haganirwa ku nsanganyamatsiko yo gufata mu nshingano ahazaza hacu. yabivuze mu inama zabaye ku wa ku wa 19-21, yitabirwaga n\u2019urubyiruko rugera muri 350 muri Intare Conference Arena. Yakomeje avugako hateganyijwe ibiganiro bizafasha urubyiruko kumva imbogamizi Commonwealth n\u2019ikiganiro kizafasha urubyiruko kumva uruhare rukwiye kugira kugira ngo ibikorwa by\u2019umuryango bibashe kuba mu buryo burambye. \nUburezi.\nKuri ubu Tetero akurikirana impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga muri kaminuza ya Suffolk, mu Bwongereza mu buzima rusange kandi afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bijyanye n'ubutaka n'ibidukikije yakuye muri kaminuza y'u Rwanda. Afite impamyabumenyi mu iyamamazabuhinzi riyobowe n\u2019abahinzi no mu buhinzi bwa Digitale kuva mu Buyapani no mu Buholandi. "}
{"id": "10415", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10415", "title": "Bagwire Keza Joannah", "text": "Bagwire Keza Joannah ni umugore w'umunyarwandakazi wegikanye ikamba rya Nyampinga w'umuco mu majonjora yo gushaka nyampinga muri 2015. \nUbuzima.\nBagwire Keza Joannah kuri ubu ni umugore washakanye na Murinzi Michel ku ya 7 Ugushyingo 2021.\nAkazi.\nBagwire Keza Joannah ubusazwe ni umunyamakuru wa Kiss FM, aho yatangiriye uwo mwuga w'itangazamakuru muri 2018 yaje kwimenyereza umwuga kuri (Radio Rwanda RBA), aza kuhava muri 2019 yerekeza kuri Kiss FM. Umwaka urangira wa 2018, yahawe impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya Kaminiza mu bijyanye n'ibarurishamibare yakuye muri Mount Kenya University. \nNyampinga.\nBagwire Keza Joannah yamenyekanye cyane muri 2015 ubwo yegukanaga ikampa rya Nyampinga w'umuco. Nyuma yaho mu kwezi k'Ugushyingo 2015, na bwo yongeye kugaragara cyane ubwo yegukanaga ikamba ry'igisonga cya kane muri nyampinga w'umuco muri Miss Heritage Global muri 2015, aho yari ahanganye n'abakobwa 44 bo mu bihugu bitandukanye ryabereye muri Afrika y'epfo mu mujyi wa Jonesburg."}
{"id": "10416", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10416", "title": "Laetitia Umutoni", "text": "Laetitia Umutoni ni umunyamakuru Akaba afite imyaka 24 \nUmwuga.\nUmutoni kuri ubu ukorana na High Media, isosiyete ikora ibijyanye no gutunganya amashusho, gufotora no gushushanya.Umutoni ni umwe mubagize itsinda riigira inama abakobwa bato mumashuri atandukanye. Iri tsinda kandi rirasaba imisanzu y'amafaranga yo gutera inkunga abakobwa bamwe biga.Umutoni yashishikarijwe kwinjira mu itangazamakuru kuko yakundaga ibyo yabonye kuri TV akumva kuri radiyo. Icyakora, yagize isoni akiri umwana kandi ababyeyi be bahoraga bamuburira ko atazabikora nkumunyamakuru Ugira isoni Umutoni ni umwe mubagize itsinda rigira Inama abakobwa bato mumashuri atandukanye. Iri tsinda kandi rirasaba imisanzu y'amafaranga yo gutera inkunga abakobwa bamwe biga.\nIbihembo.\nYahawe igihembo n' Imbuto Foundation mu 2010 nyuma yo kugaragara mu bakobwa bitwaye neza. nyuma yoguhabwa icyigihembo yarishimye cyane avuga kobimutunguye ahunya agira at:\u201cNakubye kabiri imbaraga zanjye kuko nashakaga kuba indashyikirwa cyane no kwereka abandi bakobwa ko bashobora kubikora kimwe no gushimira abantu bampaye. Sinifuzaga kubatenguha.Yihatiye kuba ku isonga ry\u2019ishuri rye kandi arabigeraho arangije afite itandukaniro n\u2019ishuri ry\u2019itangazamakuru muri kaminuza yu Rwanda.Intsinzi ye ayitirira amahugurwa atandukanye yakuye muri Imbuto Foundation, harimo ubuhanga bwo kuvuga mu ruhame, kuyobora ibiganiro mpaka n'ubuhanga bwo kuyobora.\nAho yize.\nAmashuri abanza yayize mu mujyi yavukiyemo mu Karere ka Rubavu kuri Groupe Scolaire de Gisenyi.Nyuma yinjiye muri Ecole d'Arts de Nyundo mu burezi bwe bwo mu rwego rwiciro rusunga hamwe nicyo bita A' level mu buvanganzo, aho yize icyongereza n'Igifaransa."}
{"id": "10417", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10417", "title": "Isabelle Kalihangabo", "text": "Kalihangabo Isabelle ni umunyapolitiki w'umunyamategeko Akaba kandi ni umunyamabanga Mukuru w'ungirije w\u2019Urwego rw\u2019Igihugu rushinzwe iperereza n'ubugenzacyaha bwa RIB(Rwanda Investigation board) mu Rwanda, bakaba barahawe manda ya kabiri yo kuyobora iki cyigo na Perezida Paul Kagame, Ni umwanya ariho kuva muri 2018. \nUmwuga..\nKalihangabo umunyamategeko wabonye impanya bushobozi Mu mategeko yakuye muri kaminuza y'u Rwanda.\nYabonye Kandi impanya bushobozi yikiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza yakuye muri kaminuza ya Queen Mary University muri London mubijyanye Namategeko Y'ubucucuzi mpuza mahanga.\n2000 inkugeza 2004 Isabelle Kalihangabo Yakoze Mu Rukiko rwikirenge rw'URwanda migice gishinzwe inkiko Gacaca.\n2004 Isabelle Kalihangabo yahawe Umwanya wumucanza murukiko rukuru rw'URwanda.\n2007 Isabelle yagizwe umwunganizi mu Mategeko muri Minisiteri yubutabera\nMuri Werurwe 2014 Isabelle Nyuma yo kubona ubushobozi bwe yazamuwe muntera ajyira umunyamabanga uhoraho nuhagarariye amategeko muri Minisiteri yubutabera y'uRwanda.\nTaliki 09 Mata 2018 Isabelle Kalihangabo yagizwe Na Perezida Umunyamabanga wikigo Cy'iperereza Mu Rwanda (RIB)"}
{"id": "10418", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10418", "title": "Uwimpundu Sandrine", "text": "Uwimpundu Sandrine ni umugore w'umunyarwandakazi akaba umukinnyi wa filime umaze kumenyekana cyane mu Rwanda ku mazina ya Rufonsina.\nUbuzima bwite.\nUwimpundu Sandrine ubundi amazina ye yanyayo ni ayo, aho benshi ku mbuga nkoranyambaga no kuri televisiyo na radiyo azwi nka Rufonsina. Umwana w'umukobwa w'umunyamahane cyane akaba umwana w'umukobwa w'umunyacyaro cyane utewe ishema ryokuvuga ikigoyi (ni ururimi rukoreshwa mu majyaruguru ashyira burengerazuba bw'u Rwanda.) Uwimpundu afite umugabo bashakanye afite n'umwana umwe w'umukobwa akaba ari Mama Gallois izina ry'ububyeyi, akaba asazwe akora akazi umwuga w'ukubudozi.Uwimpundu Sandrine uzwi nka Rufonsina ndetse akaba ubu ari umukinnyi genderwaho muri filime inyura kuri television Rwanda mu cyigo cy'igihugu cy'itangazamakuru RBA, ahoo akina ari umudozi w'imyenda, witwa cyane kukazike ndetse n'abakiriye be abitaho, afite kandi umwana w;umuhugu umwe. \nGukina filime.\nUwimpundu Sandine tuzi kumazina ya Rufonsina uri mu bagore bacye bakina filime mu Rwanda basetsa nkuko abagabo babikora,akaba ari umwe utuma filime Nyarwanda zikundwa. izina Rufonsina ryatumwe amenyekana muri filime ari gukina yatumwe amenyekana cyane, Rufonsina ukunze gukina filime ari umugoyikazi (uvuga ikigoyi). Rufonsina wabaye umukinnyi muri filime Ejo Si Cyera, byamufashije kumenyekana, kakaba ari kamwe mu kamufashije kumenyekana cyane, Ati \" Akantu nkina nkubitana imigeri Seburikokoimigeri,ncanga imigeri ako kantu naragakunze cyane gafite urwego kashyizeho kuko karahererekanyijwe cyane n'abantu bo hanze barampamagaye biti usanzwe ukina karate?, ni gute ukubita umugobo agahunga, bimeze bite?\". Rufonsina umaze imwaka myinshi akina filime isaga 12, gukina filime no gutebya ntabwo ari ibintu ashakisha cyangwa yaba yarize mu mashuri ahubwo ni impano Imana Yamuhaye, yagize Ati \" ushobora kumbwira ngo ngwino nguhe akazi Gukina) nkacishamo ijisho umunota umwe nkahita mbikora binyoroheye. \nUwimpundu Sandrine ubu ari gukina muri filime eshanu icyarimwe, ibyo akabishobora kuko badakina babatunguye kandi abikora bucye bucye. Filime yinjiye no mu rugo rwe kuburyo ibyo akora umugabo we arabikunda ndetse aranamushyigikiye, naho umwana, we w' umukobwa y'ibyariye ntakimwita mama we ahubwo amwita Rusonsi ngwino wirebe dore uri kunyura kuti televiziyo, gusa uwo mwana nawe arabikunda. Rufonsina ucyeneye iterambere rirambye kandi rihoraho afite intego yo kuzaba umukinnyi mpuzamahanga muri filime na cinema ku isi. \nIbihembo.\nUwimpundu Sandrine (Yageze i kigali bwa mbere 2007 akaba yaratangiye gukina filime 2009) yahawe ibihembo bibiri mu Rwanda nk'umukinnyi mwiza wa filime w'umwaka wa 2020, n'umukinnyi mwiza wa byenda gusetsa w'umwaka 2020. Rufonsina amaze gukina filime nyishi zirimo Kibonke Papa Sava, Seburikoko, Ejo si kera, Umuturanyi."}
{"id": "10419", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10419", "title": "Lous and the Yakuza", "text": "Marie-Pierra Kakoma (yavutse 27 Gicurasi 1996), uzwi cyane nka Lous and the Yakuza, ni umuraperi, umwanditsi w'indirimbo n'umunyamideli ukomoka mu Rwanda na Kongo ariko utuye mu Bubiligi. Yamenyekanye cyane nyuma yo gushyira ahagaragara indirimbo ye ya mbere \"Dilemme\" muri Nzeri 2019, ikurikirwa na \"Tout est gore\" mu Kuboza 2019 na \"Solo\" muri Werurwe 2020. Album ye ya mbere, \"Gore\", yakozwe na El Guincho, yasohotse ku ya 16 Ukwakira 2020.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nLous amazina bwite ni Marie-Pierra Kakoma yavukiye i Lubumbashi, muri Zayire (Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo y'ubu) ku ya 27 Gicurasi 1996. Ababyeyi be bari abaganga bakomeye muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo igihe yavukaga. Se w'umunyacongo yari umuganga w'abagore, naho nyina w'umunyarwanda yari umuganga w'abana. Nyina wa Kakoma yafungiwe muri Kongo amezi abiri mu ntambara ya kabiri ya congo mu 1998 azira ubwoko bwe. Se amaze kubona ko nyina arekuwe, bahungiye mu Bubiligi ari kumwe na bashiki ba Kakoma. Kakoma na barumuna be basigaye baje gusanga nyina mu Bubiligi nyuma yimyaka ibiri mu 2000, mugihe se yagumye muri congo. Uyu muryango wimukiye mu Rwanda mu 2005 mbere yo gusubira burundu i Buruseli muri 2011. \nIshyaka rya Kakoma ryo kuririmba ryatangiye akiri muto mu gihe yari akikijwe n'umuziki kubera ko se yakundaga indirimbo za kera za Mozart, Chopin, Vivaldi, na Beethoven bose babanyaburayi. \nYatangiye kwandika umuziki we afite imyaka irindwi. Umuryango we wimukiye mu Bubiligi afite imyaka 15, yatangiye kwandikira Columbia Records yizeye ko azasinyishwa muri label. Ku myaka cumi n'umunani, Kakoma yaciwe intege n'ababyeyi be bamubuza kuba umuririmbyi, ngo abe umuganga, maze afite imyaka cumi n'icyenda, yirukanwa mu rugo iwabo. Mu gihe cyo kubura aho kuba, yabaye mu mihanda amezi menshi mbere yo gutura muri sitidiyo y\u2019umuziki, aho yararaga akandika umuziki, mu gihe yagendaga akora indirimbo zimwe na zimwe. Mu myaka itatu, Kakoma yakoze indirimbo 52, harimo EP zirindwi. Muri 2016, yagaragaye mumashusho y'indirimbo \"BruxellesVie\" yumuhanzi w'umubiligi Damso. \nUmwuga.\nKakoma yakiriye izina \"Lous and the Yakuza arikuye\" ku \"bugingo(soul)\", isoko y'ishyaka rye rya muzika, na \"Yakuza\", umutwe w'abagizi ba nabi wateguwe n'Ubuyapani, izina akoresha mu gusobanura \"crew\" y'abafatanyabikorwa yishingikirizaho mu guhanga umuziki we. Lous yavumbuwe bwa mbere n\u2019ushinzwe kumureberera inyungu, Miguel Fernandez, amaze kubona ko yasohotse kuri interineti. Guhera mu 2017, yamenye ko ashishikajwe no gukora alubumu, asaba inshuti ze magara gushinga itsinda riyishyigikira, yatangiye kuririmbira ahera mu tubari no mu tubyiniro twa nijoro i Buruseli. Mu mpera za 2017, Lous yatumiriwe gukora acoustic ya \"La ChillZone\", nyuma asinya muri Columbia Records ibinyujije muri Sony Music yo mu Bufaransa, afite imyaka 22. Ku ya 15 Kamena 2018, hasohotse \"Le Ridicule Ne Tue Pas\", ku bufatanye bwa Lous na Yakuza n'itsinda rya elegitoroniki rya BSSMNT. \nNyuma y\u2019amezi atandatu ashakisha producer uhuza ibyifuzo bye, Kakoma yahisemo producer El Guincho wo muri Espagne, nyuma yakazi ke ku ndirimbo ya \" Malamente \" ya Rosal\u00eda. Lous yasohoye indirimbo yabo ya mbere \"Dilemme\" ku ya 19 Nzeri 2019, yakozwe na El Guincho na Ponko. Iyi ndirimbo yatumye Kakoma amenyekana cyane, ikusanya miliyoni zirenga 20 kuri Spotify, miliyoni 8.9 zerekanwe kuri YouTube, ikaza ku mwanya wa mbere kuri Spotify Italia ya Viral 50. Amashusho y'indirimbo, yayobowe na Wendy Morgan, yerekana indangamuntu zitandukanye Lous afite ahantu hatandukanye, hagamijwe kwerekana ubuzima bwe kuva muri Congo yerekeza mu Bubiligi. Ku ya 1 Mata 2020, remix irimo umuraperi w\u2019umutaliyani Tha Supreme n\u2019umutaliyani Mara yashyizwe ahagaragara.\nMuri Red Bull Elektropedia Awards 2019, Lous and The Yakuza yegukanye umudari wa feza mu cyiciro cya \"Fresh on the Scene\". Indirimbo ya kabiri ya Lous, \"Tout est gore\", nayo yakozwe na El Guincho, yasohotse ku ya 6 Ukuboza 2019. Iyi ndirimbo imaze kumenyekana nyuma yuko umukinnyi wa filime Issa Rae asakaje amashusho kuri videwo ku mbuga nkoranyambaga. Ku ya 20 Werurwe 2020, Lous yasohoye indirimbo ye ya gatatu yise \"Solo\", hamwe n'amashusho y'indirimbo yakozwe na Wendy Morgan na Kevin Bago. Filime ngufi bifitanye isano, yiswe \"Solo (Itangiriro)\" yasohotse ku ya 14 Mata 2020. Indirimbo zose uko ari eshatu zashyizwe kuri alubumu ye ya mbere, \"Gore\", yakozwe na El Guincho. Ubusanzwe byari biteganijwe ko izasohoka ku ya 5 Kamena 2020, alubumu yaje gutinda kugeza mu mwaka wa 2021. \nKu ya 27 Gashyantare 2020, Kakoma yasinyiye kujya yerekana inzu yimyambariro y'umufaransa Chlo\u00e9. Muri Werurwe 2020, Lous and the Yakuza yashyizwe muri gahunda ya Spotify ya RADAR, igamije kwagura abahanzi ku isi hose binyuze ku mbuga nkoranyambaga. Ku ya 26 Gashyantare 2021, yasohoye indirimbo ye \"Je ne sais pas\", irimo umuraperi wo mu Butaliyani Sfera Ebbasta. Ku ya 4 Werurwe, yaririmbye mu iserukiramuco rya muzika rya Sanremo 2021 muri duet hamwe na Gaia, hamwe n'indirimbo \"Mi sono innamorato di te\" ya Luigi Tenco. Ku ya 8 Kanama, yifatanyije na Woodkid mu birori byo gutanga ihererekanyabubasha kuva mu mikino Olempike ya Tokiyo 2020 yerekeza i Paris 2024. Umuziki wa Kakoma wasobanuwe nk \"\" silky \"ihuza TRAP, R&amp;amp;B, na pop. \nIshusho rusange.\nKakoma azwiho isura rusange, ni ukuvuga ikimenyetso gishushanyijeho ku gahanga, cyasobanuwe nk'inyuguti 'Y' n'akadomo hagati kandi kikagereranya n'ikimenyetso cy'urukundo rwa Prince # 2. Kakoma ubwe yahimbye ikimenyetso, cyiswe \"les mains lev\u00e9es vers le ciel (amaboko yazamuye yerekeza mu kirere)\", nk'ikimenyetso kigamije kugereranya amaboko abiri ahuza isi n'ijuru. Ukwizera kwe kw'idini no kwizera Imana byamubereye intandaro yo kurema ikimenyetso. Lous yamenyekanye kandi kumyambarire ye nuburyo bwe, yakuye ku bahanzi nka FKA Twigs na Erykah Badu. \nUbuzima bwite.\nNk'umwana, Kakoma yakundaga umukino bita 'manga' kandi yabonaga ashishikajwe ninsanganyamatsiko zijyanye namateka ya muntu, cyane cyane ubutwari n'ibikorwa by'intwari, nkibisobanuwe mu byanditswe na Cicero. Mu kubyiruka kwe, yari umukinnyi wa siporo kandi yanakinnye umupira w'amaguru w'abanyamerika imyaka irindwi kubera ko yari ashishikajwe na \"Eyeshield 21\". Kakoma yakoze ubushakashatsi bwo kwandika nk'uburyo bwo kwerekana kuva mu bwana, igihe ashishikajwe no kuba umwanditsi w'ibitabo byamuteye kwandika impapuro zirenga 300 z'uburebure. Usibye umuziki n'imyambarire, Lous n'umuhanga cyane, gushushanya bisanzwe,gushushanya imyenda no gukora 'manga' nibishushanyo mbonera. "}
{"id": "10420", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10420", "title": "Anne-Marie Goumba", "text": "Anne-Marie Goumba (wavutse ku ya 9 Ukwakira 1954), ni umwe mu bagize Inteko ishinga amategeko ya Repubulika ya Centrafrique kandi ni umwe mu bagize Inteko ishinga amategeko ya Pan-Afurika kuva muri Repubulika ya Centrafrique. Ni umupfakazi wuwahoze ari umunyapolitiki muri Repubulika ya Centrafrique Abel Goumba.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nAnne-Marie Mbakondo yavutse ku ya 9 Ukwakira 1954 i Nyanza, mu Rwanda. Yabanje kwiga amashuri makuru muri \u00c9cole Normale Sup\u00e9rieure i Save, mu Rwanda, mbere yo gukomeza kwiga muri Universit\u00e9 Catholique d'Afrique Centrale. Nyuma yaje gukora umurimo wo kwigisha nka mwarimu mu ishami ry\u2019ubuvuzi rya Butare hagati ya 1973 na 1977. Agezeyo, yahuye na Abel Goumba, na we wari umwarimu ku bibazo by'ubuzima rusange, nyuma amugira umugore. \nUmwuga wa politiki.\nUmugabo we yari amaze igihe kinini avugurura ibya politiki muri Repubulika ya Centrafrique, yashinze icyaje guhinduka ishyaka rya Patriotic Front for Progress. Na we yashyigikiye imirimo ya FPP, kandi ahagarara mu matora rusange yo muri Repubulika ya Centrafrique ya 2005 maze atorerwa kuba umudepite mu karere ka gatanu ka Bangui namajwi 37.32% mu matora yo ku ya 8 Gicurasi. Muri ayo matora, umugabo we ntiyabashije gutsinda. Amaze kujya munteko ishinga amategeko ya Repubulika ya Centrafrique, yatowe nk'uhagarariye Repubulika ya Centrafrique mu Nteko ishinga amategeko ya Pan-Afrika. Muri Mutarama 2015, yashimye ibikorwa byo kubungabunga amahoro bikorwa n'u Rwanda, avuga ko mu gihe amaze imyaka 30 muri Repubulika ya Centrafrique, atigera yibagirwa ko yavuye mu Rwanda. Ni umuhuzabikorwa w\u2019umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta witwa Les Flamboyants, ushaka gukumira ihohoterwa rikorerwa abagore n\u2019abana."}
{"id": "10421", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10421", "title": "Ines Mpambara", "text": "Ines Mpambara ni Umunyapolitiki wo mu Rwanda usanzwe akora nka Minisitiri ushinzwe Imirimo y'abaminisitiri kuva muri Werurwe 2020. \nUmwuga.\nKugeza agizwe ushinzwe Imirimo y'abaminisitiri, yari amaze imyaka irenga 10 akora nk'umuyobozi wa Guverinoma mu biro bya Perezida w'u Rwanda. Yabanje kandi gukora muri Minisiteri y\u2019ubuzima aho yakoraga imyanya itandukanye, Mbere yaho yakoraga mu cyahoze ari kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda nk'umwarimu akaba n'umuyobozi w'ishuri ry'itangazamakuru n'itumanaho."}
{"id": "10428", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10428", "title": "Electric skateboard", "text": "Amashanyarazi ya skateboard numuntu utwara abantu ashingiye kuri skateboard. Umuvuduko mubisanzwe ugenzurwa nintoki zidafite intoki zifata kure cyangwa kugendana uburemere bwumubiri hagati yimbere yubuyobozi kugirango bugende imbere ninyuma kugirango feri. Kubijyanye nicyerekezo cyurugendo iburyo cyangwa ibumoso, birahindurwa muguhindura ikibaho kuruhande rumwe cyangwa kurundi. Itondekanya ryibibaho byamashanyarazi (urugero niba byujuje ibisabwa nk \" imodoka ') kandi byemewe gukoreshwa mumihanda cyangwa kaburimbo biratandukanye mubihugu.\nUbwoko bwa Skatebo Yamashanyarazi\nHariho ubwoko bubiri bwibanze bwa skateboard yamashanyarazi kumasoko.\nFastest Electric Skateboard\nBuri mwaka ushize utujyana mubihe bigezweho, bidukeneye guhindura imibereho yacu. Wigeze wumva bavuga ngo, \"Ibibazo bigezweho bikeneye ibisubizo bigezweho\" cyangwa \"Ibihe bigezweho bikenera ibikoresho bigezweho?\" Isi igenda yerekeza kubikoresho byikora byikora, nawe ugomba kubikora. Uyu munsi twakusanyije amakuru kuri kimwe mubintu bigezweho. Nibyo skateboard yamashanyarazi yihuta kwisi.\nUmutekano\nUbubiko busanzwe bwo gucuruza nkibyavuye muri Evolve na Boosted burashobora kugera kumuvuduko wo hejuru wa 20-25mph (32-40kph) muburyo bwihuse, mugihe imbaho ninzobere zishobora kwubakwa na moteri ikomeye cyane kumuvuduko wa 50mph (80kph) no hanze yacyo. Feri isanzwe ishyirwa mubikorwa nka Dynamic feri / Gufata feri biva mumuziga winyuma gusa kandi intera ihagarara irashobora gutandukana cyane hagati ya moteri niziga / ipine.\nHabayeho impanuka nyinshi zica zirimo amashanyarazi ya skateboard hamwe na konti nyinshi zo gusura ibitaro. Ibikoresho byawe birinda harimo ingofero, ivi, inkokora hamwe nudupapuro twamaboko birasabwa kugenda byihuse."}
{"id": "10429", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10429", "title": "Muhutukazi Marie Mediatrice", "text": "Muhutukazi Marie Mediatrice ni umubyeyi w'umunyarwandakazi umenyerewe muri filimi nyarwanda nka Kankwanzi mu runana, ukina filimi zitadukanye kandi akaba ari n'umwe mu bakinnyi b\u2019ikinamico mu Rwanda.\nUbuzima bwite.\nMuhutukazi Marie Mediatrice [wavutse 1964] ni umugore tumenyereye kumazina ya Kankwanzi, yavukiye mu uMujyi wa Kigali, mu akarere ka Nyarugenge. Ni imfura mu bana batatu bavukana nawe. Mu buzima busanzwe ni umubyeyi w\u2019abana babiri[umuhungu n\u2019umukobwa] gusa ntiyagize amahirwe yo gusazana n\u2019umugabo kuko batandukanye ubu buri wese akaba y'ibana ariko by\u2019umwihariko Marie M\u00e9diatrice akaba abana n\u2019aba abana be bombi. Mu amashuri yisumbuye yize Sicial. \nIkinamico na filimi.\nMuhutukazi Marie Mediatrice avuga ko yatangiye kwiyumvamo impano akiri muto gusa akaza kugira amahirwe yo gutangira gukina ikinamico ku mugaragaro mu 1988 ubwo yari afite imyaka 24 y\u2019amavuko.Yagize ati\u201dNatangiye ubuhanzi bw\u2019ikinamico mu 1988. Ni impano nari mfite kuko natangiye kuyiyumvamo nkiri umwana, nyuma ya Jenoside \u00a0yakorewe Abatutsi anjya mu itorero rya Mashirika, \u00a0mu 1998 \u00a0nabwo Urunana ruza gushaka abakinnyi ngiyeyo ndatsinda ninjiramo gutyo.\u201d \nIzina kankwanzi.\nMuhutukazi Marie Mediatrice nka Kankwanzi akigera mu ikinamico Urunana kwitwa iri zina yabanje kubyanga kubera ukuntu yari kujya akina ari umugore ugaragaza ubujiji bwinshi.Yagize ati\u201dMu Urunana bari bari gushaka abakinnyi 8, babanje gutoranye 16 ndatsinda, barongera batoranya abandi 8 nabo mbazamo. Bampaye umwanya wa Kankwanzi\u00a0 ndawanga cyane, nkavuga nti\u2019Ntabwo nakina ndi ikigoryi meze kuriya\u2019 ariko umwanditsi ambwira ko ari nziza ngeze aho ndabyemera.\u201d Yavuze ko hari amahugurwa yari amazemo iminsi bamubwira ko umuhanzi mwiza nta mwanya atakina birangira yemeye gukina ari mu ishusho ya Kankwanzi w\u2019umunyacyaro.Kankwanzi avuga ko bitewe n'uburyo akina ari umugore w'umuturage kandi w' hari abantu benshi baba bumva ko ari nako ateye mu ubuzima busanzwe, gusa ngo iyo bamubonye birabatungura.Yagize ati \u201cHari umuntu wavuye mu Bufaransa w\u2019umuzungukazi na we ukora biriya by\u2019amakinamico, ambwira ko yumvaga ndi umunyacyaro cyane mfite ubujiji nka buriya mba ngaragaza. Na bamwe mu abanyamakuru ba BBC bigeze kuza mu Rwanda bambonye baratangara.\u201d\nIbyo agezeho.\nMuhutukazi Marie Mediatrice nka Kwankwanzi Kankwanzi yemeza ko Urunana rumaze kugira uruhare rukomeye mu iterambere ry\u2019umuryango we, ndetse akaba yariyubakiye inzu akubaka n\u2019izindi zo gukodesha zimwinjiriza amafaranga buri ukwezi. Akina ikinamico abikomatanya na filime ariko yemeza ko Urunana ari rwo rwamufashije cyane kuko filime yagiye akina ari nkeya kandi zikaba zitanabamo amafaranga menshi.Yagize ati\u201dUrunana rumaze kungeza kuri byinshi nabashije kwiyubakira inzu y'iicumbi, narihiye abana amashuri nubaka n\u2019andi mazu yo gukodesha byose kubera kurukomatanya no gukina filime ariko navuga ko uruhare runini ari Urunana kuko muri filime nta mafaranga arimo menshi.\u201dYakinnye muri filime yitwa \u2018Haranira kubaho\u2019, \u2018Zirara zishya\u2019 \u00a0 n\u2019izindi nyinshi ndetse by\u2019umwihariko yananyuze muri Seburikoko ariko ntabwo akigaragaramo kuko mu mwanya yakinagamo yapfuye.\nIbyo akunda.\nMuhutukazi Marie Mediatrice Avuga ko akunda cyane abahanzi bo ha mbere biganjemo Fred\u00e9ric Francois, George Moustaki, Nana Mouskouri n\u2019abandi. Ati \u2018bariya bahanzi baririmba indirimbo zituje z\u2019igifaransa zo ha mbere ndazikunda cyane.\u2019Mu bahanzi bo mu Rwanda b\u2019ubu avuga ko azi Amag The Black, King James, Jay Polly na Knowless.Mu abana be, Kankwanzi yemeza ko umuto umwana w\u2019umukobwa witwa Umwali Aurore \u00a0ari we ugaragaza impano yo gukina ikinamico ndetse bakaba bakinana ari umwana we mu Urunana yitwa Kereri [Claire].Ashishikariza abakuru biyumvamo impano kudatinya kuzigaragaza ndetse akanasaba abandi bamaze kugira aho bagera muri uyu mwuga gushyigikira impano z\u2019abakiri bato nk'abana."}
{"id": "10430", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10430", "title": "Eug\u00e9nie Kayitesi", "text": "Eug\u00e9nie Kayitesi Umunyarwandakazi, Ubu akaba atuye anakorera muri Africa Yepfo, Akaba Nimpuguke mubijyanye Nubuhinzi,ndetse Nubutubuzi bwimyaka.(Food Processing)\nAmashuri yize..\nEug\u00e9nie Kayitesi ifite impamya bushobozi ya Professor yakuye muri kaminuza ya University of Pretoria Mubijyanye Nimitunganyireze nibikomoka mubuhinzi (Consumer and Food science).\nIbihembo Yatwaye..\nEug\u00e9nie Kayitesi yabonye igihembo cya African Women in Agriculture Research Development (AWARD),\nAho yanyuze..\nEug\u00e9nie Yabaye mubagize ikigo Health Equity and Right Organization, (HERO) Ikigo kitagamiye kuri Leta y'uRwanda.\nKayitesi Kandi yabaye Umujyanama wa komite yikigo cya Food Evaluation Research Laboratory (FERL)."}
{"id": "10431", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10431", "title": "Gutera Amashyamba", "text": "Reta y'uRwanda ibinyujije muri minisiteri y'ibidukikije yatangije gahunda yo gutera amashyamba gusigasira ahari kubungabunga amashyamba ya kimeza ndetse ni ikengerezo za yo guhana abangiza amashya no gushyigikira abantu bafite umuhate mu gutera amashyambau Rwanda muri rusange rufite amashyamba ari ku buso bwa hegitari 724,666 ari byo bingana na 30.4%\nIbiti biteye mu Rwanda, 30% ari ibivangwa n\u2019imyaka kandi hakaba hari gahunda yo kubyongera ku buryo muri 2024 bizaba bigeze kuri 85% no kongera ubuso buteyeho amashyamba.\nIntego y'uRwanda mu kongera amashyamba.\nReta y'uRwanda ibinyujije mu kigo cy\u2019igihugu gishinzwe amashyamba kivuga ko u Rwanda rufite intego yo gusubiranya ibice byangiritse bidafite amashyamba no kongera aho yagabanutse, gusarura no gutera andi mashyamba aho atigeze hagamijwe kuyongera.\nUmumaro w' amashyamba ku bidukikije n'urusobe rw'Ibinyabuzima.\nAmashyamba abumbatira urusobe rw'Ibinyabuzima ndetse n'ibimera muri rusange, amashyamba afite umumaro mu guhangana n'ingaruka z'imihindagurikire y'ibihe no guhangana na amapfa nko mugihe cyi izuba cyangwa imvura nyishi muri rusanga."}
{"id": "10432", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10432", "title": "Juliet Kabera", "text": "Juliet Kabera ni Umuyobozi mukuru w'ikigo gishinzwe gucunga ibidukikije mu Rwanda.\nUmwuga.\nJuliet Kabera numuyobozi wikigo gishinzwe Kurinda Ibidukije Mu Rwanda (REMA), Akaba yarashyizweho muri Gicurasi 2020. Mbere yo gushyirwaho, yari afite umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019ibidukikije n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe muri Minisiteri y\u2019ibidukikije. Nyakanga. Juliet yabaye Umuyobozi wa Komite Nyobozi y'Ikigega Cyinshi cya Protokole ya Montreal mu mwaka wa 2019/2020.\nAmashuri Yize.\nJuliet KABERA yahawe impamyabumenyi ya Bachelor muri Siyanse yize ibijyanye na Biochemie yakuye muri kaminuza ya Makerere Kampala, muri Werurwe 2002, naho muri Kamena 2020 arangiza Masters muri Conservation MBA muri kaminuza Nyafurika y'Ubuyobozi.\nIcyo Avuga muguca Amashashi Mu Rwanda.\nKabera yavuze ko uburambe bw\u2019imyanda ya pulasitike bwagaragaje akamaro k\u2019ubufatanye bw\u2019igihugu, uturere ndetse n\u2019amahanga mu rwego rwo kurwanya umwanda.Ati: \"Nyuma y'ibiganiro bikomeye mu mezi ashize, twishimiye intambwe imaze guterwa mu rwego mpuzamahanga rwemewe n'amategeko ku bijyanye no kwanduza plastike\".\nUmushinga w\u2019icyemezo uremera imiterere y\u2019imipaka y\u2019ikibazo cy\u2019umwanda wa pulasitike kandi ko ari ngombwa kuwukemura aho uturuka.Yavuze ko hakenewe gushyirwaho amategeko akomeye na politiki haba ku rwego rw'igihugu ndetse no ku isi hose, agira ati: \u201cKubera ko umwanda wa plastike ari ikibazo cyambukiranya imipaka, dushobora kugikemura dukorera hamwe.\u201d"}
{"id": "10433", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10433", "title": "Mutimura Christine Wekesa", "text": "Ni Umunyamategeko w\u2019umunyarwandakazi\nIbyo wamumenyaho.\nMutimura Christine Wekesa yari ku rutonde rw\u2019abakandida 35 b\u2019abahanga mu by\u2019amategeko bemejwe n\u2019Inama y\u2019abaminisitiri ba EAC (East African Community). yateranye kuwa 4-6 Mata 2022.\nMutimura yakoze mu bunyamabanga bwa (East African Community)EAC ari umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe iby\u2019amategeko. \nMutimura Christine Wekesa yarahiriye inshingano mu gihe (East African Community Justice) EACJ idafite umwanditsi kuko Yufnalis Okubo, yagiye mu kiruhuko cy\u2019izabukuru kuwa 31 Werurwe 2022 afite imyaka 60. Bivuzeko ko azaba akora inshingano z\u2019umwanditsi mukuru mu gihe hagishakishwa umwanditsi mukuru. Umuhango wo kurahiza Mutimura wabereye i Arusha muri Tanzaniya ku cyicaro cy\u2019urukiko rwa (East African Community)EAC, uyoborwa na Perezida warwo Nestor Kayobera n\u2019abandi bacamanza. Ni inshingano nshya z\u2019umwanditsi wungirije w\u2019Urukiko rw\u2019Umuryango wa Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba EAC(East African Community Justice)."}
{"id": "10434", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10434", "title": "Nyandungu Eco-Tourism Park Project", "text": "N'Umushinga washizweho kugirango barebe banashire mubikorwa ikigo gishya aricyo Pariki Nyandungu.\nUko byakozwe.\nKuva muri Nzeri 2018, Minisiteri y\u2019ibidukikije yabinyujije mu kigo gishinzwe imicungire y\u2019ibidukikije mu Rwanda (REMA) yaririmo gutegura Pariki y\u2019imyidagaduro y\u2019igishanga i Nyandungu, kugira ngo itange ahantu ho kwidagadurira mu mijyi, igarure imikorere y\u2019amazi y\u2019igishanga no kongera urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima.Muntangiriro, umushinga wateguwe kurangira mubice bibiri, icyiciro cya mbere cyatangiye kuva 2016 kugeza 2018 cyarimo kwiga no gutegura umushinga, mugihe icyiciro cya kabiri cyatangiye kuva 2018 kugeza 2020 cyari kigamije kwibanda kubikorwa byo kubaka.Ibikorwa byumushinga byarahagaze kubera kongera gukora neza umushinga no guhindura ikigo cyashyiraga mubikorwa byumushinga, kuko nta buhanga bwari bufite bwo gutunganya ubusitani.\nIcyabiteye.\nImpamvu zahagaritse ibikorwa byumushinga harimo imvura idasanzwe itunguranye yateje imyuzure ikabije igira ingaruka kubikorwa byumushinga ndetse no gufunga icyorezo cya Covid-19 hamwe nakazi kashyizweho na leta kugirango ikumire ikwirakwizwa rya coronavirus.Izi mbogamizi zagize ingaruka kubikorwa byumushinga kandi ziyandikisha gutinda kumezi 8, kurugero ko bitazarangira muri 2020 nkuko byari byateganijwe.Ariko, inama hagati ya REMA, rwiyemezamirimo nu mucungezi wibikorwa byumushinga byarangiye wongereye andi mezi atandatu."}
{"id": "10435", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10435", "title": "Umwali Aurore", "text": "Izina ryabaye ikimenyabose ni Claire[cyangwa Kerere], umukobwa wa Kankwanzi na Bushombe bo mu Ikinamico Urunana, amazemo imyaka irenga cumi n\u2019ibiri amazina ye nyakuri ni Umwali Aurore.\nUbuzima.\nClaire cyangwa Kerere Ubusanzwe yitwa Umwali Aurore akaba yaramamaye nka Claire mu ikinamico urunana yanyuraga kuri BBC, [British Broadcasting Corporation], iri zina ni naryo abaturanyi bamuhamagara iwabo i Nyamirambo kuri 40. Yatangiye gukina Urunana yiga mu kiburamwaka mu mwaka wa 2005. Icyo gihe ajya gukina Urunana ntiyari azi ibyo arimo neza nk\u2019umwana wari umaze igihe gito atangiye kwiga kugenda no guca akenge. Yinjiye mu ikinamico ajyanwe n\u2019umubyeyi we Muhutukazi Marie Mediatrice [uwo bakinana nka Kankwanzi [Muhutukazi Marie Mediatrice] ari na we umubyeyi we mu Runana]. Umwali Aurole, ubu yiga mu umwaka wa kane mu ishuri rya Saint Philippe Gikondo riherereye mu Murenge wa Kigarama mu Karere ka Kicukiro, mu ishami ry\u2019ibaruramari. Yavukiye mu mujyi wa Kigali, i Nyamirambo aho ni mu Karere ka Nyarugenge ari naho abana n\u2019umubyeyi we Muhutukazi Marie Mediatrice [Kankwanzi].\nGukina ikinamico.\nUmwali Aurore w\u2019imyaka 17 avuga ko atajya agorwa no gukina ari umukobwa wo mu cyaro, icyamufashije cyane ngo ni uko yatangiye kubikina akiri muto bityo abikuriramo bikiyongeraho ko yumva akunze icyaro.Ati \u201cUretse ko dukina ibyanditse ariko nubwo navukiye mu mujyi wa Kigali ubuzima bw\u2019icyaro ndabukunda, mu gukina ndabanza nkishyira mu buzima bw\u2019icyaro nkabona gukina nk\u2019umwana wo mu cyaro. Iyo Umwali na nyina bari mu rugo mu buzima busanzwe ntiwapfa kumenya ko bakinana mu Runana, gusa hari igihe baterura ikiganiro ukumvamo amajwi yo kwa Bushombe na Kankwanzi (Muhutukazi Marie Mediatrice) i Nyamirambo. Umwali avuga ko kuba yarahawe gukina ari umwana wa Kankwanzi [Muhutukazi Marie Mediatrice] ari na we nyina w\u2019amaraso ngo \u201cBimfasha kwirekura mu gukina.\u201d\nUrunana.\nUmwali Aurore nka Kerere cyangwa Claire yibuka ko akinjira mu ikinamico Urunana, amafaranga ya mbere bamuhembye nyina yamuguriyemo igipupe, gusa amaze guca akenge ari we bacishaho amafaranga yabashije kwigurira igezweho. Hejuru y\u2019inyungu nyinshi yakuye mu Runana, Umwali Aurore avuga ko igikomeye yungutse umuryango mushya ndetse ngo ni byo bimwishyurira ishuri.Ati \u201cIgikomeye nungukiye mu ikinamico Urunana ni uko hari inyigisho batanga ku rubyiruko nanjye nkafataho, harimo n\u2019inyungu z\u2019amafaranga, mbasha kwiyishyurira ishuri kubera gukina.\u201dUmwali avuga ko i Nyamirambo ahafite inshuti z\u2019urungano banafitanye umubano ukomeye hanze y\u2019ikinamico nka Petero, Mutesi, Obama musaza we n'abandi.\nInzozi.\nUmwali Aurore nka Kerere cyangwa Claire inzozi afite harimo kwagura impano ye akazavamo umuntu ukomeye mu ikinamico. Ikindi gikomeye yifuza ni ukuzaba umucuruzi uzwi mu Rwanda agakoresha ubumenyi yakuye mu ishuri. Ati \u201cNumva nacuruza ibintu byo kurya, ngashinga nka alimentation cyangwa byazanshobokera nabonye ubushobozi nkashinga hoteli.\u201d"}
{"id": "10436", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10436", "title": "Clementine Wamariya", "text": "Clementine Wamariya (wavutse mu mwaka 1988) ni umwanditsi w\u2019umunyarwandakazi ariko utuye muri Amerika, akaba n\u2019umuntu uharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu cyane. Yavukiye mu muryango usanzwe i Kigali n'ababyeyi be afite imyaka itandatu kubera Jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda, Yahungiye kwa nyirakuru mu majyepfo y\u2019igihugu ariko ahatirwa kongera guhunga igihe jenoside yibasiraga umuryango wabo ikica nyirakuru. Yahunze igihugu amara imyaka itari mike azenguruka Afurika mbere yo guhabwa viza y'impunzi muri Amerika.\nYatuye hamwe n'umuryango we mu gace ka Chicago maze atangira amashuri afite imyaka cumi n'itatu. Yamenyekanye ku rwego mpuzamahanga mu 2006 binyuze kuri \"Oprah Winfrey Show ubwo yahuraga\" bitunguranye n'ababyeyi be. Amaze kurangiza muri kaminuza ya Yale, yakomeje umwuga wo kuvuga mu ruhame harimo ibiganiro bya TED. Muri 2018, yasohoye igitabo kivuga ibyamubayeho, yise \"The Girl Who Smiled Beads\". Niwe wahawe igihembo cya Alex Awards 2019.\nUbuzima bwe muri make.\nWamariya yavukiye kandi akurira i Kigali, umurwa mukuru w'u Rwanda. Se yari umucuruzi mu bucuruzi bwa tagisi naho nyina yari umuhinzi ahinga imbuto n'indabyo murugo. \nItsembabwoko ryakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda ryatangiye muri Mata 1994, igihe Wamariya yari afite imyaka itandatu. Umuryango watangiye kumva urusaku rwinshi rwatewe n\u2019amasasu, murumuna we Pudi avuga ko ari inkuba, basanga abaturanyi babo badahari. Nyina wa Wamariya amaze kumenya akaga kari kuba, yamwohereje hamwe na mushiki we, Claire, mu majyepfo y\u2019igihugu kugira ngo babane mu isambu ya nyirakuru. Ariko ibyo nabyo ntibyari bifite umutekano, kandi umuryango wibasiwe bikomeye. Igihe abajenosideri bakomanga ku rugi, we na Claire babwiwe na nyirakuru guhunga. Mu guhunga nijoro no kwihisha ku manywa, barokotse bigoranye, bashoboye guhunga igihugu bahinduka impunzi. Benshi mubavandimwe be, harimo na nyirakuru, barishwe. \nAhantu hambere umutekano bawusanze ni mu nkambi yimpunzi mu Burundi, ariko ntibashoboye gutura ahantu hamwe igihe kirekire. ihohoterwa rikorerwa mu nkambi no gushaka ahantu hari itera imbere byatumye bakomeza kwimuka bivuze ko bamaze imyaka myinshi bakora ingendo hagati y'inkambi. Mu myaka itandatu yakurikiyeho bavuye mu Burundi bimukira muri Zayire, Tanzaniya, Malawi, Mozambike, amaherezo baza kugera muri Afurika y'Epfo. Kuva aho, mu 2000, we numuvandimwe we basabye Umuryango mpuzamahanga ushinzwe abimukira kubaha ubufasha, bahabwa viza y'impunzi muri Amerika. Batuye hamwe n'umuryango mu nkengero za Chicago muri Kenilworth. \nUmwuga.\nKugaragara kuri \"Oprah Winfrey Show\".\nWamariya yamenyekanye bwa mbere kurwego mpuzamahanaga ubwo yagaragaraga kuri \"Oprah Winfrey Show\" mu 2006, akiri umunyeshuri muri New Trier. Hamwe na mushiki we Claire, bamusabye kuzagaragara kuri iki kiganiro kugira ngo baganire ku byamubayeho mu gihe cya jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda. Ariko we numuvandimwe we batabizi, Winfrey yari yateguye guhura bitunguranye n'ababyeyi babo. Se na nyina bombi barokotse jenoside,Wamariya yari yaravuganye na bo kuri telefoni, ariko yari amaze imyaka cumi n'ibiri atabonana nabo imbonankubone. Abatunganya iki kiganiro bateguye ingendo z'ababyeyi bava muri Afurika no guhura kwabo kuri tereviziyo. Wamariya yatumiwe nk'umushyitsi mu gitaramo cya \"Oprah\" inshuro eshatu mu myaka yakurikiyeho, kandi uko yagaragaye muri iki kiganiro byatumye yamamaye ku rwego mpuzamahanga. \nWamariya yashishikajwe no kuvugira mu ruhame mu gihe cy'ishuri, kuko yabwiraga abanyeshuri ibyamubayeho. Amaze kugaragara kuri \"Oprah\", abategura ibirori, cyane cyane mu nzego z\u2019ubutabazi, baramutumiraga ngo avuge uko byagenze. Mubikorwa bye harimo ikiganiro cya TED, cyiswe \"War and What Comes After\", \nAmaze kugaragara kuri \"Oprah\", kandi mu gihe yari umunyeshuri i Yale, Wamariya yakoraga ibiganiro byo kuvuga muri Amerika mu nzu ndangamurage y\u2019Urwibutso rwa Holocaust muri Amerika (USHMM). Mu rwego rwo kubimenya, ndetse n\u2019akazi yakoranye n\u2019imiryango y\u2019impunzi i Yale no muri New Haven, muri leta ya Connecticut, yagizwe umuyobozi wa USHMM na Perezida Barack Obama. Yongeye gushyirwaho manda ya kabiri yimyaka itanu muri 2016. \nUbwanditsi.\nAmaze kurangiza icyiciro cye muri Yale Wamariya yimukiye i San Francisco, yahuye n'umunyamakuru \"wa New York Times\" Elizabeth Weil, wari utuye mu gace kamwe. Yabwiye Weil ibyamubayeho, maze bombi batangira gutegura icyegeranyo kirekire bamaranye imyaka ibiri bagikoraho, cyasohotse muri 2018. Umutwe w'igitabo ni \"The Girl Who Smiled Beads\"; ibi bivuga inkuru yabwiwe na nyirasenge akiri umwana. "}
{"id": "10437", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10437", "title": "Mukangira Jacqueline", "text": "Jacqueline Mukangira n'umunyapolitikikazi w'u Rwanda numudipolomate. Kandi Ni Komiseri Mukuru w\u2019u Rwanda mu Buhinde. Nanone kandi yahoze ari Ambasaderi w\u2019u Rwanda mu bihugu by\u2019Amajyaruguru. \nUmwuga.\nMukangira yagizwe Komiseri Mukuru mu gihugu cy'u Buhinde na guverinoma y\u2019u Rwanda ku taliki ya 28 Ugushyingo mu mwaka 2019, agera mu Buhinde ku taliki ya 4 Werurwe mu mwaka wa 2020. Ku taliki ya 21 Gicurasi mu mwaka wa 2021, yashyikirije Perezida w\u2019Ubuhinde Ram Nath Kovid ibaruwa ye y\u2019icyizere mu muhango wakozwe n\u2019inama hifashishijwe uburyo bwikoranabuhanga bwa videwo kubera icyorezo cya COVID-19. We na perezida biyemeje gukorera hamwe kugira ngo barusheho gushimangira umubano w\u2019ibihugu byombi no kungurana ibitekerezo hagati y\u2019u Rwanda na Malidiave. Yavuze ku bintu bidasanzwe bigize umuco w\u2019ubucuruzi bw\u2019u Rwanda ndetse na bimwe mu mishinga ibihugu byombi biteza imbere mu minsi ya vuba. \nMukangira mbere yari yarigeze gukora mu nzego zitandukanye, nk'Umudepite mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko mu mwaka wa 2004 kugeza mu mwaka wa 2007, Ambasaderi w'u Rwanda muri Suwede mu mwaka wa 2007 kugeza mu mwaka wa 2011), n'Umuyobozi Mukuru muri Minisiteri y'Ububanyi n'Amahanga n'Ubutwererane, Amahame remezo n'Ubushakashatsi muri Sena y'u Rwanda. "}
{"id": "10438", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10438", "title": "Mukamasabo Apolonie", "text": "Mukamasabo Appolonie yabaye umuyobozi w'akarere ka Nyamasheke kuva mu mwaka wa 2019, uyu mwanya yawugiyeho asimbuye Kamali Aime Fabien wahoze ayoboye ako karere nyuma akaza kweguzwa n'inama njyanama nyuma yo kumutakariza icyizere, kubera kutuzuza inshingano, kudahuza inzego, hamwe no kutihutisha imyanzuro ifatwa n\u2019inama njyanama. \nMukamasabo Appolonie nawe yaje kweguzwa n'inama njyanama y'akarere ka Nyamasheke, Inama y\u2019Inama Njyanama y\u2019Akarere Nyamasheke yafashe iki cyemezo cyo kwirukana Mukamasabo Appolonie yateranye kuri uyu wa Mbere tariki 28 Kanama 2023. kubera imyitwarire n'imikorere idahwitse.\nPerezida w\u2019Inama Njyanama y\u2019Akarere ka Nyamasheke, Hategekimana Jules Cesar, yabwiye UMUSEKE ko basanze Mukamasabo yaratezutse ku nshingano, hakaba hari ibyo atakoze ndetse n\u2019imyitwarire mibi yatumye atuzuza ibyo yasabwaga. yasimbuwe by'agateganyo nuwari umuyobozi w'akarere wungurije ushinzwe iterambere ry'ubukungu bwana Muhayeyezu Joseph Desire.\nInyandiko.\nhttps://web.archive.org/web/20230829054546/https://umuseke.rw/2023/08/meya-wa-nyamasheke-yirukanywe/"}
{"id": "10439", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10439", "title": "Maniraguha Carine", "text": "Numbona uzanyite umusizi, nunyumva uzanyite igisigo\" - icyo ni icyivugo cya Carine Maniraguha umusizi kugeza ubu ufite igihembo giheruka cy'uwahize abandi bose mu Rwanda.\nUbusizi.\nUbusizi ni ubutunzi bukomeye bw'umuco w'abantu - bwabayeho kuva cyera cyane ku imigabane yose y'isi aho abasizi bungikanya amagambo yuje ubuhanga n'injyana mu gusobanura ibiriho, umuco, ibyishimo, intambara, urukundo, amahoro, n'ibindi.\nManiraguha Carine Kimwe mu bisigo bye gitangaje ni icyo yise \"Nsa nk'umusazi\" aho avuga ku byo areba mu ishusho y'umuntu abandi bita umusazi, ati: \"Ariko uko wasara uko ari ko kose ntabwo ibintu byawe byose biba ari ubusazi.\" avuga ko yahanze icyo gisigo kuko abitwa abasazi n'abiyita abazima babona ibintu ugutandukanye kandi buri wese azi ko uko abibona aribyo bizima. Ati: \"Nanjye nanditse kiriya gisigo nk'umuntu utari gusobanukirwa neza ibyo ndimo kureba, atari uko ari byiza ahubwo hari aho biri kutujyana hatari heza.\" Carine Maniraguha aka yaragaragaye muri filimi nka Seburikoko, filimi Makuta na filimi Ejo si kera zinyura kuri RBA.\n21 WERURWE.\nIshamiry'umuryango w'abibumbye ryita ku uburezi, ubumenyi, n'umuco, UNESCO rivuga ko ariyo mpamvu buri mwaka tariki 21 Werurwe yahariwe kwishimira no gusigarisa ubusizi. Bigendanye n'uyu munsi wa 2022, ukuriye UNESCO yavuze ko \"imbaraga z'ubusizi ntacyo wazigereranya\", kandi ko nk'imvugo ifungura imiryango ku bandi ubusizi ari ubuvanganzo \"bukenewe kurushaho mu bihe bikomeye\".\nUbuzima.\nManiraguha Carine umukobwa w'umunyarwandakazi w'umusizi udasobecyeranya uzwi kandi nka Carine Poet [ufite imyaka 27] ubwo mu 2018 habaye irushanwa Art Rwanda-Ubuhanzi ry'ikigo Imbuto Foundation kuva ku imidugudu kugeza ku rwego rw'igihugu, abagabo n'abagore, Maniraguha Carine aza mu basizi 10 ba mbere, ndetse aza kubarusha aba uwa mbere. Nta rindi riraba kugeza ubu. Carine Poet acyeka ko inganzo ye ayikomora ku mugore wa mbere ufatwa nk'uwatangije ubusizi buriho ubu mu Rwanda - Nyiraruganzu II Nyirarumaga (wabayeho 1500 - 1550) -, nubwo na nyina umubyara afite iyo mpano ariko ngo atigeze ageza mu ruhame. Yagize ati: \"Kugeza ubu igihembo cy'umusizi wa mbere mu Rwanda ni njyewe ugifite.\""}
{"id": "10440", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10440", "title": "Uwera Sarah", "text": "Ni Umunyarwandakazi ukinira ikipe y'Igihugu mu umukino wa kiriketi (criket),yavutse ku itariki 1 Kamena 1996. ikindi ni umuyobozi wa abakinnyi(captain) bakina hamwe nawe mu Ikipe y'igihugu ya kiriketi (criket) yo mu Rwanda.Uwera Sarah mu mwaka 2012 nibwo yatangiye gukina kiriketi (criket) akina mu ikipe y'igihugu cy'uRwanda yabatarengeje imyaka 19.\nIbyo yakoze.\nMu ukwezi 1 mu mwaka 2019 nibwo yamenyekanye cyane mu ikipe y'igihugu yu Rwanda bwambere Women's Twenty20 International (WT20I) m'umukino baribukine ni ikipe ya Nijeriya (Nigeria),Uwera yabafashije munsinzi ya Women's Twenty20 International (WT20I) m'umukino wari wabahuje ni ikipe ya Nijeriya (Nigeria) muri sitade y'igihugu cya Nijeriya ihererye Abuja. mu umwezi kwa Gicurasi 2019 Uwera yakomeje gukuza izina mu irushanwa ryiswe 2019 ICC Women's Qualifier Africa ni amarushanwa yaberaga mugihugu cya Zimbabwe,mu Ukwakira 2019 Uwera nibwo yiswe umuyobozi w'Abakinnyi (captain) kuba bari barabashije gukura ikirenge mumukino bakinnye na Nijeriya.Muri Gicurasi 2021 Uwera Sarah yongeye nanone kwigaragaza nkumuyobozi w'Abakinnyi mu ikipe y'Igihugu mumarushanwa yiswe 2021 Kwibuka Women's T20 Tournament yabereye mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "10441", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10441", "title": "Rwemarika F\u00e9licit\u00e9", "text": "Rwemarika Felicite ushobora kuvuga ko ariwe mu nyarwandakazi wageze hejuru hashoboka muri siporo kandi Rwemarika ni umuryamuryango wa Komite Olempike mpuzamahanga (IOC member) kuva mu mwaka2018.\nUbuzima bwite.\nRwemarika ku ya 9 Werurwe 1958 avukira mu Rwanda"}
{"id": "10442", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10442", "title": "Kubwimana Gertrude", "text": "Kubwimana Gertrude wabaye umukinnyi w\u2019Ikipe y\u2019Igihugu ya Volleyball, yize siporo mu gihe kuri ubu ari mu buyobozi bw\u2019Ishyirahamwe Nyarwanda ry\u2019umukino wa Volleyball.\nkandi yabaye umuyobozi ushinzwe tekinike mu ishyirahamwe ry'umukino wa volleyball mu Rwanda (FRVB) akaba n'umunyamabanga."}
{"id": "10443", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10443", "title": "Somi (African singer)", "text": "Somi (yavutse yitwa Laura Kabasomi Kakoma ku ya 6 Kamena 1981) ni umuririmbyi wahataniye Grammy award wavukiye muri Amerika, umwanditsi w'indirimbo, umwanditsi w'amakinamico, akaba n'umukinnyi wa filimi ukomoka mu Rwanda no muri Uganda.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nSomi yavukiye i Champaign, muri Illinois, mu gihe se yari arangije amasomo ya dogiteri muri kaminuza ya Illinois muri Urbana - Champaign. Igihe Somi yari afite imyaka itatu, umuryango we waje kwimukira i Ndola, muri Zambiya, naho se yakoraga mu muryango mpuzamahanga wita ku buzima. Mu mpera z'imyaka ya za 1980, ubwo se yabaga umwarimu muri kaminuza ya Illinois, basubiye muri Champaign, aho Somi yize mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Kaminuza ndetse na Champaign Central High School. Yabonye impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya mbere cya kaminuza muri Anthropology na African Studies yakuye muri kaminuza ya Illinois muri Urbana - Champaign. Afite kandi impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga yakuye muri kaminuza ya New York 's Tisch School of Arts in Performance Studies.\numwuga.\nMuri 2007, yasohoye alubumu ye ya mbere \"Red Soil in My Eyes\" muri label ya Harmonia Mundi / World Village label bakoranye amasezerano ye ya mbere yo kumufasha mu muziki. Iyi alubum yakunzwe cyane hamwe nindirimbo \"Ingele\" yabonye umwanya wa 10 kuri U.S. World Music Charts muri Amerika mumezi menshi.\nMuri 2009, Somi yasinyanye na label yigenga ya ObliqSound. yahise asohora \"If the Rains Come Firstt\" yasohotse ku ya 27 Ukwakira 2009, hanyuma igatangira kuri no. 2 kuri \"Billboard\" ' iba iya 21 kuri ' Heatseekers chart \"Billboard\". Iyi alubumu igaragaramo umuhanga wo muri Afrika yepfo Hugh Masekela, umujyanama wa Somi umaze igihe kinini. Muri Werurwe 2011, Somi yashyize alubumu ye ya mbere y'ibitaramo kuri Jazz Standard izwi cyane mu mujyi wa New York. Yasohotse kuri Palmetto Records muri Kanama 2011.\nMuri 2013, Somi yasinyanye amasezerano yambere ya label na Sony Music kugirango abe umwe mubahanzi ba mbere kuri jazz imprint Okeh Records. Album ye na label yambere yatangiriye \"The Lagos Music Salon\", igaragaramo abahanzi badasanzwe batsindiye Grammy award nka Angelique Kidjo na Common ndetse ikanagaragara kuri US Jazz Charts, yatewe inkunga n'amezi 18 yamaze i Lagos, muri Nijeriya. Nyuma yo gushimwa cyane no kuba abafana bariyongereye cyane, \"The Huffington Post\" hamwe nibindi bitangazamakuru byise Somi \" Nina Simone mushya\". Muri Werurwe 2017, yasohoye \"Petite Afrique\" nka alubumu ye ya kabiri kuri Okeh Records. Iyi alubumu yatsindiye igihembo cy\u2019amashusho cya NAACP 2018 kubera indirimbo idasanzwe ya Jazz, ni alubum y\u2019umuryango munini w\u2019abimukira bo muri Afurika batuye i Harlem, Umujyi wa New York.\nMuri Nyakanga 2020, Somi yasohoye 'Holy Room - Live kuri Alte Oper' Album ya Live, inagaragaramo Radio Big Band ya Frankfurt, yatorewe igihembo cya Grammy award 2021 cya Album nziza ya Jazz Vocal kandi yegukana igihembo cya 2021 NAACP Image Award nka Album ya Jazz Yamamaye, Vocal.\nIkinamico yambere ya Somi, \"Dreaming Zenzile\", n'umuziki ushingiye kubuzima bwa Miriam Makeba. Yerekanwe bwa mbere muri The Repertory Theatre ya St. Louis muri Nzeri 2021 nyuma yuko igice cya mbere gihagaritswe iminsi itanu mbere kwerekanwa muri Werurwe 2020 kubera icyorezo cya Covid-19. Nkumwanditsi n'umukinnyi, akoresha izina rye ryanyuma akagenda na Somi Kakoma.Kuri ubu Somi atuye mu mujyi wa New York."}
{"id": "10444", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10444", "title": "Nyirahabimana Pascasie", "text": "Uyu ni umwe mu bagore bacye mu Rwanda bize ubumenyi ishami ry'ubugenge (physics), ubu ari gukora PhD ku ikoreshwa ry'ikoranabuhanga mu myigishirize y'ubugenge, abwira abana b'abakobwa bakiri bato amahirwe bo ubu bafite yo kwiga amasomo y'ubumenyi, Yitwa Dr Madame Nyirahabimana Pascasie.\nUbuzima twite.\nDr Nyirahabimana Pascasie, ni umunyarwanda kazi akaba ari umubyeyi w'abana bane, uyu akaba ari mwarimukazi wa kaminuza Nkuru yu Rwanda mu ishami ry'ubugenge avuga ko nawe atatekerezaga ko aziga ubugenge cyangwa ngo agere aho ageze ubu. Madamu Nyirahabimana Pascasie yiga mu mashuri abanza umuntu wari aho wize amashuri menshi yari mwarimu, akumva ko yazaba mwarimu abaye abonye ayo mahirwe. yagize ati \"Twebwe ntabwo twigaga dufite intumbero kuko no kwiga icyo gihe ntibyari byoroshye\". \nMadame Nyirahabimana Pascasie yahise ahagarika amashuri yubaka urugo mu 1995, mu 1996 arabyara umwana ariko yumvikanye n'umugabo we ko agomba gusigarana umwana ankajya kwiga. umugabo we yaramushyigikiye ajya kwiga amashuri ya kaminuza, kandi atanaretse inshingano yo kurera umwana, imirimo ubusanzwe yombi itoroshye kuko isaba umwanya uhagije. Yagize Ati: \"Ibyo rero byatumaga mvuga nti 'ngomba kwiga cyane nkazarangiza amashuri bikamfasha guteza imbere ubuzima bwanjye n'ubw'umuryango wanjye'\". \nUbwo yigaga.\nMadame Nyirahabimana Pascasie nawe nkabandi abana b'abakobwa bose bigaga siyansi yabwiwe amagambo yo kumuca intege, akayumva ariko ntayahe agaciro. yakomeje kubona ubusumbane ubwo hariho ishami ry'ayisumbuyei ryigisha kwita ku muryango, rizwi nka 'familiale', yari nk'umwihariko w'abakobwa, abahungu bakaba aribo biga ibindi, nubwo nyuma byaje guhinduka abana b'abakobwa bakadenda biga andi mashami. Dr nyirahabimana Pascasie ati \"Ibibazo nahuye nabyo bikomeye ni imyumvire y'abantu batandukanye, ntibumvaga uburyo umugore ajya kwiga ubumenyi [sciences] kandi ntibumva uko wabifatikanya n'izindi nshingano zirimo urugo\". Ariko yaragiye yaragiye yiga amashuri yisumbuye arayarangiza, yiga na kaminuza ayirangiza ari imbere y'abandi bose biganaga. Ati: \"Twize turi abanyeshuri 15, ninjye gusa wabonye amanota yo hejuru, rero wakwibaza uti ni gute umuntu ashobora kubona amanota yo hejuru mu bahungu ari abakobwana cyangwa se ari umudamu?\"\nInama atanga.\nDocteur madame Nyirahabimana Pascasie agira inama abakobwa bakiri bato kwiremamo icyizere, kumenya ko bafite ubushobozi bungana n'ubw'abahungu ndetse ko ubu banafite amahirwe. Ati: \"Njyewe nagendaga ntafite uwo ndeba, ariko bo baragenda batureba imbere, ubwoba bafite rero nibatwegere tubafashe kugira ngo ejo aho turi nituhava bazahajye\".\nUNESCO.\nIshami ry'Umuryango w'abibumbye ryita ku uburezi, ubumenyi n'umuco, UNESCO, rivuga ko abagore bari mu bushakashatsi muri siyansi ku isi batagera kuri 30%. Iri shami rivuga kandi ko abagore bari munsi ya 30% ari bo bagera muri za kaminuza mu masomo ya Siyansi, Ikorabuhanga, injeniyeri n'Imibare azwi nka STEM."}
{"id": "10446", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10446", "title": "Mukamabano Gloria", "text": "Mukamabano Gloria ni umugore akaba Umunyarwandakazi w'umunyamakurukazi, Ukora akazi kitangaza makuru ku kigo cy'igihugu cy'itangazamakuru cya RBA.\nUmwuga.\nGrolia ni umunyamakuru uzwi cyane mu ishami ry\u2019amakuru kuri Televiziyo Rwanda. Gloria kandi n'umuhanzikazi ubarizwa mu itsinda ra Bright Girls abarizwamo we na mugenzi we Iradukunda Consolee, Grolia yamenyekanye cyane ubwo yafashaga abahanzi b\u2019abaraperi cyane cyane abo muri Tuff Gangs mu nyikirizo y\u2019indirimbo zabo by\u2019umwihariko mu ndirimbo \u201cUbuto bwanjye\u201dya Fireman. Mukamabano Gloria yakoreye kubitangazamakuru bitandukanye nka Contact Fm ndetse na radio&amp;TV10 asoma amakuru mu gifaransa, akomereza kuri Rayol Fm, ubu ni umuyobozo wa televisiyo ya KC2 mu biganiro.\nAmashuri.\nGloria Mukamabano afite bachelor degree muri journalism and communication ndetse na na Masters muri Development studies.\nMukamabano Gloria ni umubyeyi ufite umugabo ndetse nabana babili, umuhungu ndetse n'umukobwa."}
{"id": "10447", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10447", "title": "Eug\u00e9nie Musayidire", "text": "Eugenie Musayidire, yavutse Ku ya 25 Ukuboza 1952, mu Rwanda,N'umunyarwandakazi uharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu uba mu Budage. Yahawe igihembo mpuzamahanga cya Nuremberg mu burenganzira bwa muntu mu 2007.\nUbuzima Bwite.\nEug\u00e9nie Musayidire ni Umwe mubatutsi bake mu Rwanda. Yahunze mu 1973, igihe yaburiwe ko yenda gufatwa. Yabanje guhungira mu Burundi, akomeza amasomo ye muri kaminuza y\u2019Uburundi mu bijyanye n\u2019ubukungu n\u2019imibereho. Mu 1977, yasabye ubuhungiro muri politiki mu Budage, kandi yitoza kuba umufasha wa farumasi. Yareze Umuryango atura i Siegburg, aho yakoraga mw'Itorero ry'Abaluteriyani Yaje gukora i Bonn.\nYize ko umuryango we wishwe mu gihe cya Genocide yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda mu 1994.: abura nyina, murumuna we na bene wabo benshi kandi baziranye. Inshuti yamuzaniye ibuye, vestige yonyine murugo rw'umuryango we. Yasobanuye ibisobanuro by'aya makuba yandika igitabo cyitwa \"Ma pierre qui parle\", mu 1999.\nEug\u00e9nie Musayidire yiyemeje mu buryo bw'intangarugero mu bwiyunge hagati y'Abahutu n'Abatutsi mu Rwanda. Mu 2001, yasuye igihugu akomokamo, ku nshuro ya mbere kuva yava mu buhungiro. Muri uwo mwaka, yashinze mu Budage ishyirahamwe \" Hoffnung In Ruanda e. v.\u00bb(\u00abIbyiringiro mu Rwanda \"). Abikesheje inkunga y'Itorero ry'Abaporotesitanti b'Abadage, yashinze, mu 2003, i Nyanza, Ikigo gishinzwe kuvura urubyiruko, \"IZERE\", aho abana ndetse n'urubyiruko bahura n'ingaruka za Genocide bitaweho.\nMuri uku kuguma mu Rwanda mu 2001, yashoboye guhura n'umwicanyi wo mu muryango we, wahoze aturanye. Iyi nama nicyifuzo cyo kwiyunga byatumye havuka firime, \"Mama wa Assassin\". Iyi filime yahawe igihembo cya Adolf-Grimme.\nKuwa 30 Nzeri 2007, Eug\u00e9nie Musayidire ahabwa igihembo mpuzamahanga cy\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu cya Nuremberg, gitangwa na Doudou Di\u00e8ne wahoze ari umunyamabanga w\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ku bibazo by\u2019ivanguramoko, ivangura rishingiye ku moko, abanyamahanga no kutoroherana.\nMuri Gicurasi 2015, documentaire yitwa \"Mein Stein spricht\" (\"Ibuye ryanjye rivuga: inzira ndende yo kwiyunga mu Rwanda\"), ku nkuru ya Eug\u00e9nie Musayidire ivugwa kuri televiziyo ARD-alpha "}
{"id": "10448", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10448", "title": "Uwimana Jeannette", "text": "Uwimana Jeannette wa tunguranye mu bataniraga ikamba rya Nyampinga wu Rwanda 2022, ufite ubumuga bwo kutumva no kutavuga ni umwe mu abakobwa batunguranye aho yaje no kwegukana ikamba ry\u2019uwahize abandi kugira umushinga urimo agashya \u2018Miss Innovation.\nUbuzima.\nUwimana Jeannette [yavutse mu 1996] ni umunyarwandakazi umenyekanye cyane vuba aha, nyina yitwa Mukabutera Colette, yavuze ko umwana we yavutse atavuga kandi atumva. Ni imfura mu muryango avukamo, mama yibuka ko yabonye icyo kibazo mfite amezi abiri. yajyanywe ku bitaro bitandukanye nyuma banzura ko atumva kandi atavuga. uyu umukobwa w'i myaka 26, niwe umukobwa wa mbere ufite ubumuga bwo kutumva no kutavuga wateye intambwe yo kwinjira mu irushanwa rya Nyampinga Rwanda.\nAmashuri yize.\nUwimana jeannette yize amashuri yisumbuye mu ikigo gifasha abafite ubumuga cya HVP-Gatagara kandi arateganya gukomeza kaminuza, Uwimana ingorane nyamukuru y'abameze nkawe ari ukumvikana n'abandi kuko ururimi rwabo ari amarenga kandi atazwi na benshi.\nIntego.\nUwimana Jeannette niwe mukobwa wenyine mu abana barindwi bavukana, iwabo ni mu akarere ka Nyanza mu intara y'Amajyepfo, avuga ko \"nakuranye intego yo gukora cyane nkazaba umugore ushoboye, ntitaye ku bumuga bwanjye.\"Ati: \"Nciye muri nyampinga Miss Rwanda, ndashaka guharanira uburenganzira bungana kuri bose no guteza imbere urubyiruko rufite ubumuga. Ikirenzeho, ibyo abahatana basabwa byose; ubwiza, ubwenge n'umuco, nakubwira ntashidikanya ko byose mbyujuje.\" Mukabutera umusemurira mu ururimi rw' amarenga yagize ati: \"Yajyaga ku ishuri ugasanga abana bigana badafite ibikoresho akabaha ibye, ubundi abana badafite amaguru agakunda kubaterura no kubakarabya. \"Ikindi akagira urugwiro rwinshi, nubwo atavuga, aho ari nta rungu riharangwa. Kuva cyera akiri umwana yakundaga ibijyanye n'imideli no kuba Miss Nyampinga.\"\nMiss Rwanda.\nUwimana Jeannette kuva kera yifuzaga kuba Nyampinga Miss Rwanda, Nyuma yo gutera intambwe ya mbere akinjira muri iri rushanwa rya Nyampinga Miss Rwanda, Uwimana Jeannette avuga ko ubu abantu benshi bamushyigikiye, harimo abo mu muryango we, inshuti ze, n'abantu b'iwabo ku ivuko. Uwimana Jeannette avuga ko naba nyampinga muri Miss Rwanda 2022 azaharanira gusaba ko itegeko rirengera abamugaye rishyirwa mu bikorwa maze abafite ubumuga nk'ubwe bakabona ubwisanzure ahatangirwa serivisi, ku mashuri, mu ma banki, mu bitaro, n'ahandi\u2026.Ati: \" Nzakomeza gukora ubukangurambaga kuri ibi ibibazo n'ingorane abafite ubumuga bahura nazo buri munsi.\"Uretse gufashwa gushyira mu ngiro umushinga we, umukobwa wegukanye igihembo cy\u2019ufite uhiga iyindi agenerwa umushahara w\u2019ibihumbi 500 amafaranga yu Rwanda ku ukwezi, ahabwa na Banki ya Kigali."}
{"id": "10451", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10451", "title": "Clarisse Uwineza", "text": "Amavu n'amavuko.\nClarisse Uwineza n'umunyarwandakazi,umuvugabutumwa akaba n'umubyeyi wabana babiri, uyu mugore kandi numunyamakuru ukorera ikigo cy'igihugu cyitangaza makuru (RBA) ukunzwe nabatari bake hano murwanda.\nUmwuga.\nUwineza amaze imyaka irenga 17 yinjiye Umumwuga witangazamakuru akaba yaranaryize muri kaminuza y'ishuri gatolika rya kabgayi (ICK).Yatangiriye akazi kuri Radio Maria Rwanda yahamaze imyaka irindwi ahavuye ajya gukorera kuri Radio salus iherereye mucyahoze ari Butare naho yahamaze imyaka ibiriri ahavuye nibwo yaje gukorera Radio Rwanda kuva (2010) kugera ubungubu Clarisse yumvikana mubiganiro bitandukanye birimo \"kazi ni kazi,Amahumbezina ntarungu\" ntarungu nikiganiro gikunzwe na benshii aho yibanda kukwigisha k'urukundo ndetse no gususurutsa abantu mumasaha y'ijoro.\nIbyutamenye..\nClarisse Uwineza uzwi nka\"Clara\" Uzwi mubiganiro byurukundo mumasaha yijoro kuri Radiyo Rwanda Avuga ko taliki 23 Ukwakira atazayibagirwa mubuzima bwe, kuko iyo Taliki aribwo yibweho Umwana we winfura. gusa Uwo mwana yaje kumubona nyuma y'umwaka nigice ahamagawe numuntu uba hanze Y'Igihugu\nUbuzima bwite.\nMumwaka 2020 nibwo uyumugore yatangiye gukina film aho yagaragaye muri film y'uruhererekane yitwa Indoto na city maid bica kuri Televison Rwanda,iyimampano yogukina film ayifatanya nitangazamakuru ndetse nivugabutumwa, aho afite ubuhamya bwuko yarwaye cancer y'inkondo yumura ndetse anarwaye COVID-19 ubugira kabiri hamwe nabana be babiri."}
{"id": "10454", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10454", "title": "Edith Umulisa", "text": "Edith Umulisa Umunyarwandakazi Akaba numukinnyi Wu mupira wamaguru wakiniye ikipe yigihugu y'uRwanda Amavubi, Ubu akaba ahagarariye umupira wabagore Mwishyirahamwe ry'Umupira wamaguru m'uRwanda (FERWAFA).\nAmavuka ya Edith Umulisa..\nUmulisa wavutse Kuwa 4 Ugushyingo.\nAmakipe yakiniye..\nYakiniye As Kigali Yabagore\n2019,Yakiniye Scandinavia Yabagore\n2018,Yakiniye Amavubi\nImikino nikipe Y'Igihugu..\nUmulisa 16 Mutarama 2014 Yakinnye imikino wambere Wa African women championship qualification first round \n, nikipe Y'Igihugu Yabagore Wabereye Wabahuje na Kenya kuri stade Regionale Inyamirambo Aho batsinze Rwanda 1-0 Kenya Igitego cyatsinzwe kumunota 29min na Alice Niyoyita.\nUmukino wokwishura Wabereye muri Kenya kuri stade ya Kenyatta stadium, mumujyi wa Machakos,Aho batsinzwe na Kenya 2-1Rwanda bavamo kugiteranyo (2-2).\n13Gicurasi 2014 Ikipe Yigihugu y'uRwanda Amavubi Yabagore Yakinnye nikipe Ya Zambia Aho Batsinzwe Zambia 3-0 Rwanda.\n24 Gicurasi 2014 Ikipe Yigihugu y'uRwanda Amavubi Yabagore Yakinnye nikipe Ya Nigeria 4-1 Rwanda, Igitego cyatsinzwe na Clementine Mukamana kumunota wa 53.\nKuwa 7 Kamena 2014 Ikipe Yigihugu y'uRwanda Amavubi Yabagore yagiye gukina ukino wokwishyura muri Nigeria Aho uRwanda rwatsinzwe ibitego Rwanda 0- 8 Nigeria, Ruvamo kugiteranyo kibitego 12-1."}
{"id": "10455", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10455", "title": "Cl\u00e9mentine Dusabejambo", "text": "Marie Cl\u00e9mentine Dusabejambo (wavutse 1987) ni umukinnyi wa firime wo mu Rwanda.\nUbuzima.\nDusabejambo yavukiye i Kigali muri 1987, umwuga we ni ukuba enjeniyeri w'amashanyarazi n'itumanaho. \nIbigwi.\nFilime ngufi ya \"Dusabejambo, Lyiza\" yatsindiye igihembo cya bronze cya Tanit mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Carthage mu 2012. Filime ye ngufi \"A Place for Myself\" (2016) yavuze amateka y'umukobwa ukiri muto ukomoka mu Rwanda urwaye albinism, uhanganye n\u2019ivangura n\u2019agasuzuguro yakorewe mu ishuri ribanza. Dusabejambo yashimishijwe niyi ngingo nyuma yo kumva amakuru y\u2019ubwicanyi bwakorewe abantu barwaye alibinism muri Tanzaniya. Iyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere muri Goethe Institut i Kigali, kandi yerekanwe mu iserukiramuco rya Filime ryabirabura rya Toronto 2017. Yabonye ibihembo bitatu, harimo igihembo cya Ousmane Sembene, mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Zanzibar (ZIFF), kandi yegukanye igihembo cya bronze cya Tanit mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Carthage mu 2016. Yatowe kandi muri Filime Nziza mu bihembo bya Afurika bya Filime 2017, kandi yegukanye igihembo cya Thomas Sankara muri FESPACO 2017. \n\"Icyasha\" (2018) yibanze kumuhungu wimyaka 12, wifuzaga kwinjira mumakipe y'umupira w'amaguru ariko akaba atotezwa kubera effeminate. Yatowe muri Filime Nziza muri ZIFF 2018, mu cyiciro cya firime ngufi mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Carthage, no muri Filime ngufi nziza muri Afurika muri Movie Academy Awards 2019. Yatsindiye igihembo cya Z\u00e9bu muri Filime ngufi ya Panafrican muri Rencontres du Film Court Madagascar 2019. "}
{"id": "10456", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10456", "title": "Mukanyirigira Didacienne", "text": "Docteur Mukanyirigira Didacienne, ni umwe mu mubagore b'abanyarwanda b'indashyikirwa akaba ari umwe mu bahanga mu myuga w'ikoranabuhanga mu Rwanda.\nUbuzima bwite.\nDocteur Didacienne Mukanyirigira ni umwarimu muri kaminuza nkuru yu Rwanda mu ishami ryikoranabuhaga, akaba n'umuyobozi w'icyiciro cy'akabiri mukigo nyafurika gishizwe interinete ikora hagati y' ibintu, uyu umugore akaba n'umubyeyi wabana 3, yagiye akora amasomo itandukanye muri urwo rwego ubu akaba afite impamyabushobozi y'icyirenga [] mu ikoranabuhanga n'itumanaho ariko mbere yibyo byose akaba atigeze arota kuzagera kuri urwo rwego.\nAmasomo yize.\nDocteur Mukanyirigira Didacienne kuri ubu ni umuyobozi w\u2019amasomo mu Ishuri rya ICT akaba n\u2019umuyobozi w'icyiciro cy'akabiri m'ikigo nyafurika gishizwe interinete ikora ku bintu (ACEIoT) muri kaminuza nkuru yu Rwanda.Yabonye impamyabumenyi ya BSc muri yakuye mu Ishuri Rikuru ry'ubumenyi n'Ikoranabuhanga rya Kigali (KIST), ubu ni kaminuza nkuru ya Rwanda, Ishuri Rikuru ry'ubumenyi n'ikoranabuhanga (UR-CST).Afite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya siyansi mu bijyanye n'amakuru n'itumanaho yakuye muri kaminuza ya Huazhong y\u2019ubumenyi n\u2019ikoranabuhanga (HUST), mu Bushinwa, na PhD mu bijyanye n\u2019amashanyarazi, ubushakashatsi bw\u2019itumanaho yakuye muri kaminuza ya Cape Town, Afurika y'Epfo. Docteru Mukanyirigira Didacienne Inyungu zubushakashatsi bwe ni ugukoresha interineti y'ibintu kugirango ibone ibisubizo by'igihugu mubibazo bitandukanye, harimo ubwikorezi, ubuhinzi, ubuzima.\nImirimo akora.\nDocteur Mukanyirigira Didacienne Kugeza ubu ni Umusesenguzi Mukuru muri Komisiyo y\u2019igihugu ishinzwe ubumenyi n\u2019ikoranabuhanga (NCST), u Rwanda akaba na Perezida w\u2019Inama y'ubutegetsi muri Rwanda Energy Group Limited."}
{"id": "10457", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10457", "title": "Mukazibera Agn\u00e8s", "text": "Mukazibea Agnes yabaye umudepite, yakiniye ni ikipe y'igihugu ya Volleyball kandi ni umwe mu bagore bafite ijambo muri siporo y'u Rwanda.\nubu asanzwe ari Visi Perezida wa mbere w'ishyirahamwe nyarwanda ry'umukino w'amagare. "}
{"id": "10458", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10458", "title": "Uwamahoro Cathia", "text": "Uwamahoro Akinira ikipe y'igihugu ya Cricket yanditse amateka atarakorwa n'undi muntu mu cyiciro cy'abari n'abategarugori yo kumara amasaha 26 aterwa udupira (Batting) ataruhutse,byatumye ahita ashyirwa mu gitabo cy'abakoze ibintu bidasazwe kw'isi,'Guinness de Records'."}
{"id": "10459", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10459", "title": "Musabyimana Penelope", "text": "Musabyimana Penelope akina Beach volleyball afatanyije na mugenzi we Munezero Valentine, ni bo banyarwandakazi ba mbere begukanye umudali [w'umulinga] wo ku rwego rw'isi nk'ikipe ubwo bari bitabiriye imikino ya Commonwealth y'urubyuriko yabereye i Bahamas muri 2017."}
{"id": "10460", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10460", "title": "Mimi Mirage", "text": "Mimi Mirage ni Umunyarwandakazi w'umunyamideli ubarizwa ku mu gabane w'uburayi mu bubiligi uyu mukobwa arakataje no kwiyerekana ariko amanika ibendera ry'u Rwanda mu bihugu byo hanze.Nk'umunyamideli wabigize umwuga, Mirage yakoranye n'ibyamamare birimo Beyonce, Davido, Nelly n'abandi."}
{"id": "10461", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10461", "title": "Agahozo Alphonsine", "text": "Agahozo Alphonsine ni umukinnyi w'umunyarwandakazi ukina umukino wo koga. Ni umwe mu bakobwa bitabiriye imikino Olempike yabereye i Londres mu Bwongereza mu 2012 no mu 2020 yabereye i Tokyo mu Buyapani, aho yari ahagarariye u Rwanda mu cyiciro cy'abagore cyo Koga metero 50 bakoresheje uburyo bwo koga bwitwa freestyle.\nUbuzima bwe n'umwuga wo koga.\nAlphonsine Agahozo yavutse tariki 18 Nyakanga mu mwaka wa 1996.\nMu mwaka wa 2012, yitabiriye imikino Olempike yabereye i Londres mu Bwongereza. Yaserukiye u Rwanda mu cyiciro cy'abagore cyo koga metero 50 hakoreshejwe uburyo bwa freestyle. Yasoje iri rushanwa ari ku mwanya wa 58, ntiyabasha kugera mu cyiciro cya kimwe cya kabiri (1/2) cy'irushanwa.\nYongeye guhagararira u Rwanda mu mikino Olempike ya 2020 yabereye i Tokyo mu Buyapani, aho yitabiriye irushanwa ry'abagore ryo koga metero 50 hakoreshejwe uburyo bwa freestyle."}
{"id": "10462", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10462", "title": "Valerie Piraino", "text": "Valerie Piraino n'umunyabugeni w'umunyarwanda ariko utuye muri Amerika umenyerewe cyane mu gushushanya no gutaka ibishushanyo. \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nYavutse muri 1981 i Kigali, mu Rwanda akurira haba mu gihugu cye ndetse no muri Amerika. Ubuhanzi bwe bugaragaza indangamuntu y\u2019amahanga kandi bukubiyemo insanganyamatsiko nko gusobanura ibintu byinshi biranga muri rusange, kurwanya ubukoloni (cyangwa kurwanya imperialism), diaspora ny'afurika. Yahawe ibihembo birenga icumi bimwemerera imikoranire, kandi yagiye agaragara mu imurikagurisha rirenga mirongo itatu muri leta umunani\u00a0za Amerika ndetse no mubindi bihugu bitatu. \nNyina wa Valerie, yari umuhanga mu kudoda mu Rwanda, yahuye na se w'umunyamerika, igihe yakoraga mu bikorwa byo gutabara no kwiteza imbere. Nyuma yo kuva mu bwana bwe akiri muto yagiye muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, no mu bindi bihugu bitatu byo muri Afurika, Valerie, kimwe n'ababyeyi be, bimukiye muri Arizona. Nyuma, umuryango we wimukiye i Baltimore, MD, aho yize muri kaminuza ya Maryland Institute of Art. Igihe Valerie yigaga i Baltimore, yasubiye mu Rwanda, aho benshi mu ruhande rwa nyina bari biciwe muri Jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda. Uru rugendo rwashishikarije umurimo we nk'umuhanzi uhuza ibihugu, harimo n'umushinga we. Mu 2005, Valerie yimukiye mu mujyi wa New York, ari naho yatangiriye MFA mu ishuri ry\u2019ubuhanzi rya kaminuza ya Columbia. Yarangije muri MFA ye mu 2009 yahise yihutira guhanga umurimo we, kuri ubu akora nk'umwarimu w'igihe gito mu ishuri rya Parsons of Design. \nIbikorwa bigaragara n'imurikagurisha.\nIkigaragara ni uko umurimo we uzwi cyane, ni urukurikirane rw'ibishusho bigizwe namapapayi yakoze ashushanyije ibice bya polystirene, hanyuma bigahisha imiterere y'ibumba ryirabura rya epoxy, irangi, resin, ibiti, ndetse rimwe na rimwe akoresha irangi rya zahabu kugirango anogereze igishushanyo. Mu kuganira ku kamaro k\u2019amabara, umukara na zahabu, Valerie avuga ko umukara na zahabu byibutsa ubucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y\u2019agaciro ndetse n\u2019ibidukikije byabereye muri Afurika kubera ubukoloni. Amabara n'imiterere nabyo byerekana uruhu rw'abaturage bava muri Afurika bakoreshejwe mu mutungo kamere wabo. \nAmapapayi ni imbuto zatoranijwe kugirango zihagararire imyumvire yo kurwanya ubukoloni kubwimpamvu ebyiri zingenzi. Iya mbere, Amapapayi yari ifunguro rya mugitondo mugihe yari umukobwa muto akiri muri Afurika. Icya kabiri, amapapayi, akomoka muri Karayibe, bagereranya nk'ubukoloni kuko \"bakurikiza inzira y'ubutegetsi bwa gikoloni \". Mu imurikagurisha ryarangiye muri Mutarama, 2017 ryiswe \"Dis Place\" mu Nzu Ndangamurage y\u2019ubuhanzi bwa Diasporan, amapapayi yasaga nkaho yakomeretse, byerekana ihohoterwa rikorerwa abagore bo muri Afurika. Mu gihe amapapayi ari bimwe mu bikorwa bya Valerie bizwi cyane, yakoze ibindi bishushanyo byinshi kandi yagiye mu imurikagurisha mu gihugu hose, ndetse anagaragara mu imurikagurisha mu bindi bihugu ku isi.\nIbihembo yatsindiye.\nValerie yakiriye ubusabane nibihembo mu myaka ye yose yo guhanga ibihangano."}
{"id": "10463", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10463", "title": "Cyuzuzo Enatha", "text": "Abagore baragenda biyongera mu kazi ko kubaka mu Rwanda, ariko ni bacye cyane baboneka bakuriye za 'chantiers', Enatha Cyuzuzo ari muri abo, ni umwihariko afite mu intara y'Iburasirazuba mu Karere ka Nyagatare.\nUmwuga.\nCyuzuzo Enatha Kubakisha inzu niwo mwuga yize muri kaminuza, ariko ni n'ibintu yakunze kuva ari muto, anabishyigikirwamo n'ababyeyi be n'abavandimwe be, nk'uko yabibwiye BBC.Mu biro bya kompanyi ye Ela Poder Construction Company, no kuri chantier imwe muzo afite i Nyagatare, Cyuzuzo akoresha abagabo n'abagore barimo n'abamuruta cyane mu imyaka.Inzu imwe muzo ari kubakisha ayigeze kure, ati: \"Ubu ndi gupinyura 'renton' ndashaka gusakara nyine\"Yongeraho ati: \"Iyo twubaka inzu tugira ibyiciro, hari icyiciro cya mberee cyo gutegura, ubundi niko kazi, ibindi ni ukubikura ku gipapuro nkabitereka ku ikibanza. \"Aha bisaba kwitonda cyane kuko Akarere kaza gusuzuma niba ibintu washushanyije aribyo wubatse.\" Mu kazi ke ko gupatana no kubakisha inzu, uyu mukobwa w'imyaka 26 ushoboye yerekera abagabo n\"abagore, akabaha amabwiriza y'ibyo bakora, akabahemba nabo bakababo.\nNtacyananira.\nCyuzuzo Enatha nk'umwubatsi (civil engineer) amaze kubakisha inzu i Kigali aho akomoka no muri Nyagatare aho yahisemo gukorera kuko yabonye ari umujyi uzakomeza gutanga akazi kenshi mu bwubatsi n'ejo hazaza. Gatete Athanase wamuhaye akazi k'inzu ubu ari kubakisha mu mujyi wa Nyagatare avuga ko yakamuhaye kuko yabonye ko afite ubushobozi. Ati: \"Azi kubaka, kandi inzu ni ikintu umuntu ashyira hariya kikagaraga ukavuga uti 'iyi inzu yubatse neza', ibikorwa rero yakoze [mbere] nibyo byivugiye, mbona afite ubushobozi, mbona afite udushya.\" Nubwo ataragira inararibonye y'imyaka myinshi muri aka akazi, Cyuzuzo avuga ko ubu amaze kwigirira icyizere, ariko ntajya yibagirwa, inzu ya mbere yubakishishe. Kubera imiterere y'aho yari iri ntibyari byoroshye, ati: \"Ni ukuvuga ngo iyi nzu yarangoye pe! Nageze aho nkajya ndara ntasinziriye.\"Ariko imaze kurangira niyo nzu yatumye nisuzuma, mpinduka undi muntu ndabyumva ko ndi gukura, iyi nzu yari ifite ibigeragezo birenze ibya etage yubatse ahantu hazima.\"Nkiyuzuza nahise mvuga nti \"ntacyananira.\"\nGuhindura imyumvire.\nCyuzuzo Enatha avuga ko Kompanyi ye ipatana kubaka amazu, ubwe ashushanya imbata z'inzu akaba ari nawe uzubakisha. Gushushanya ni imwe mu mpano yabonye ko afite kuva ari muto. Aqkazi akora kiganjemo abagabo akavuga ko ibi bituma hari ingorane ahura nazo zishingiye ku myumvire ya bamwe muri bo.Ati: \"Hari imitekerereze ya bamwe bumva ko umukobwa mutagirana 'deal' y'akazi gusa. \"Ni ukuvuga ngo gukorana n'igitsina gabo bisaba ngo wisanishe nacyo, ubereke ko nawe uri umugabo, ko ushoboye kandi ubereke ko uri umukobwa uri 'smart' niho abura aho ahera.\" Enatha Cyuzuzo afite umusore bakundana kandi ngo bazashinga urugo rwabo \"vuba\", uyu umusore ngo akunda ibyo akora ndetse \"ni imwe mu mpamvu intera ingufu zo gukora\"."}
{"id": "10464", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10464", "title": "Uwimana Consol\u00e9e", "text": "Uwimana Consol\u00e9e (yavutse 1964 mu karere ka Ngororero),ni umukinnyi w\u2019ikinamico uzwi nka Nyiramariza m\u2019 Urunana na Manyobwa muri Musekeweya n'izindi zitandukanye akaba abarizwa mu itorero Indamutsa ry' ikigo cy'igihugu gishizwe itangazamakuru (RBA). \nUbuzima bwite.\nUwimana Consol\u00e9e ni umubyeyi w'abana batanu yirerana kuko umugabo we yitabye Imana mu 1990, Consol\u00e9e yabyirutse ari umukobwa ushabutse ndetse abo biganye mu mashuri abanza bamufiteho urwibutso nk\u2019umunyembaraga wahoranaga inseko n\u2019ibyishimo ndetse akaba yari azwiho guhora akangurira bagenzi be kutigunga.\nUmwuga.\nUwimana yatangiye gukina ikinamico ari mu mashuri abanza abigiramo umwete bidasanzwe hanyuma aza kujya mu itorero Indamutsa rya RBA mu mwaka wa 1984. Uwimana yakinnye amakinamico atandukanye aho izina rye rizwi mu makinamico nka \u201cBazirunge zange zibe isogo\u201d[yakinnye ari Bazirunge] ari nayo kinamico yatangiriyeho akijya mu itorero Indamutsa,mu mwaka wa 2002 yatangiye gikina ikinamico Urunana,akomereza kuri Musekeweya, Ruteruzi ndatashye n\u2019izindi nyinshi.\nUwimana yabaye ikimenyabose mu gihugu hose nka Nyiramariza umugore wa Sitefano mu ikinamico Urunana, by\u2019agahebuzo yubatse izina mu buryo budasanzwe muri Musekeweya aho akina yitwa Manyobwa umugore wa Kibanga."}
{"id": "10465", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10465", "title": "Karekezi Uwacu Martine", "text": "Karekezi Uwacu Martine yabaye umwanditsi ukomeye w\u2019ibitabo abitewe no kubura inkuru akoresha yigisha abana. Uwacu Karekezi Martine avuga ko kwandika ibitabo no gushushanya atari impano Imana iha abagabo bonyine, gusa haracyari abagore benshi babikora bakabiherana mu ngo zabo, n'abatabona uko bakoresha impano yabo, nyamara uyu ni umwuga urimo imibereho.\nUbuzima bwite.\nUwacu Karekezi Martine, ni umwarimukazi w\u2019indimi wabigize umwuga wigisha abana bo mu mashuri y\u2019incuke kuri Green Hills Academy, mu Mujyi wa Kigali. Hejuru yo kuba umwarimukazi, ni umwanditsi w\u2019ibitabo by\u2019abana, imivugo, gushushanya n\u2019ibindi bifite aho bihuriye n\u2019ubugeni. Uyu mwarimu umaze imyaka isaga 15 mu uburezi, yavuze ko agitangira kwigisha yaje kujya ahura n\u2019ikibazo cy\u2019inkuru ziryoshye zijyanye n\u2019amasomo yabaga asabwa kwigishaabanyeshuri be. Yarebye kujya apfa kwigisha uko abonye, abona yaba ari gutatira amahame agenga umwuga w\u2019uburezi, ahitamo gutangira kwiyandikira inkuru zizajya zijyana n\u2019amasomo ashaka kwigisha abana.\nKwandika ibitabo.\nKarekezi Uwacu Martine avuga ko aka akazi ko kwa ndika ibitabo, yagatangiye agitangira kwigisha abana. Hari ukuntu ukenera kwigisha abana isomo, ukabona nta nkuru n\u2019imwe iri mu igitabo ufite yagufasha kwigisha abana.\u201dYakomeje agira ati \u201cNjye ntabwo inkuru nari nkeneye byari ngombwa ko ziba mu bitabo cyangwa ngo zimpe amafaranga, nta nubwo nari nzi ko hari uwazikunda ngo azishyire mu ibitabo ariko njye zari zinyuze n\u2019abanyeshuri banjye zikabaryohera. Nkandika inkuru yarangiza ibyo nayihimbiye nkayishyira mu kabati nkayibika.\u201d\nMu imwaka wa 2015, Uwacu yaje guhura n\u2019abashinzwe guteza imbere ibijyanye n\u2019ibitabo mu muryango Save the Children, bamusangana agatabo gato yari yariyandikiye n\u2019intoki karimo imwe mu inkuru yajyaga yifashisha yigisha abanyeshuri be. Ako gatabo baragakunze, bamwizeza kumuhuza n\u2019inzu zisohora ibitabo zikomeye zikamufasha gushyira hanze inkuru ze. Ati \u201cBampuje n\u2019inzu zisohora ibitabo ndetse n\u2019abashushanya, bakunda inkuru zanjye uyikunze akambwira ko ayigura.\u201d Mu imyaka mike amaze atangiye gusohora ibitabo, amaze gusohora ibitabo 20 birimo inkuru z\u2019abana ndetse n\u2019ibindi bine birimo imivugo. Avuga ko amafaranga ava mu bwanditsi bw\u2019ibitabo ataraba menshi nk\u2019uko bikwiriye ariko ku muntu wakuze akunda kwandika ibyo bitamuca intege. Ati \u201cAbantu bandika ibyishimo bya mbere ntabwo ari amafaranga. Inyungu ya mbere tugira ni ukubona ko hari abasomye ibyo twanditse cyangwa se akaguha igitekerezo gitandukanye. Uguhaye igitekerezo aba aguhaye inyungu iruta uwari kukigura akagishyira mu akabati.\u201d Uwacu nyuma yo gushyira hanze impano ze, yashinze Sankofa Creative Ltd, inzu ihuriza hamwe abahanzi n\u2019 abanyabugeni mu ngeri zitandukanye, bagahanga, bagakosorana bakagurisha.\nUbwanditsi bwatumye Uwacu atagihorana umutima uhangayitse, cyangwa se ngo ahore arambirije ku mushahara gusa.\nIntego.\nKarekezi Uwacu Martine Afite inzozi zo kwagura impano ye ndetse n\u2019ibikorwa bya sosiyete ye [Sankofa Creative Ltd, ubwanditsi n\u2019ubugeni bukaba umwuga utunga abawukora mu Rwanda. rero Nta igihe cyashira utumvise abavuga ko AbanyaRwanda badafite umuco wo gusoma, ko aho gusoma ibitabo bamwe bihitiramo gusoma amacupa mu tubari rero tugire umuco wo gusoma ibitabo."}
{"id": "10467", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10467", "title": "Rica Rwigamba", "text": "Rwigamba Rica ni umunyarwandakazi, inzobere mubijyanye n'ubukerarugendoyabaye umuyobozi mu ishami ry'ubukerarugendo mu ikigo k'igihugu gishinzwe iterambere RDB.\nAmashuri.\nRica Rwigamba yize amashuri yisumbuye ku ikigo cy'amashuri cya St Marys School kuva 1995 kugera 1997 mu ishami ry'ubukungu-icyongereza n'igifaransa (Economy-English literature and French), nyuma yakomereje amasomo ye muri kaminuza ya Makerere muri Uganda kuva 1998 kugera 2001 mu ishami ry'ububanyi n'amahanga. Nyuma yo gusoza kaminuza yakomerejeho ikiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza (Master of Business administration) muri Kaminuza ya Oklahoma Christian University kuva 2014 kugera 2016.\nAmateka y'umuryango ahagarariye.\nRica ubu ni umuyobozi mukuru wa gateganyo wa Mastercard Foundation mu Rwanda; ikomatanya ubuyobozi, kwihangira imirimo n'imibereho myiza. Ibi byagize ingaruka nziza ku rugendo rwe ubwo yakoraga muri guverinoma, abikorera ndetse n\u2019imiryango mpuzamahanga ishyigikira guhanga imirimo ku rubyiruko. Intandaro ya byose, ni rwiyemezamirimo kumutima. Rica yihatira kwerekana ibyiza mu bantu itanga ubuyobozi, inkunga no kubatera inkunga mu rugendo rwabo rugana ku ntsinzi.Rica usanzwe ari igihugu Umuyobozi wa Mastercard Foundation mu Rwanda; ikomatanya ishyaka ry'ubuyobozi, kwihangira imirimo n'ingaruka z'imibereho. Ibi byagize ingaruka ku rugendo rwe ubwo yakoraga muri guverinoma, abikorera ndetse n\u2019imiryango mpuzamahanga ishyigikira guhanga imirimo ku rubyiruko. Intandaro ya byose, ni rwiyemezamirimo kumutima. Rica yihatira kwerekana ibyiza mu bantu aho atanga ubujyanama m'ubuyobozi, inkunga n'ibitekerezo bibafasha kugera ku ntsinzi.\nUmwuga.\nUgushyingo 2017 kugera Werurwe 2019 ya umuyobozi wa gahunda (Program manager) muri Mastercard foundation Rwanda, uyu mwanya yawukozeho umwaka n'amezi atanu. Muri Mata 2019 kugera Kanama 2019 yabaye umuyobozi mukuru wa gahunda (Senior Program manager) muri mastercard foundation, umwanya yamazeho amezi atanu gusa. Kanama 2019 nyuma yo gusoza inshingano yari afite zo kuba umuyobozi mukuru wa gahunda muri mastercard foundation, Rica yatangiye izindi nshingano muri uyu muryango nk'umuyobozi mukuru (country director of Mastercard Foundation), amaze imyaka ibiri kuri uyu mwanya. Mu biganiro byahuje Mastercard foundation n'ikigo cy'igihugu gishinzwe iterambere n'ubukerarugendo RDB, Rica Rwigamba yagize ati; \"Ubufatanye dufitanye na RDB ni intambwe igaragara mu cyerekezo cyiza cyo kugera ku ntsinzi ya gahunda ya Hanga Ahazaza no gufasha urubyiruko gutera imbere mu bukerarugendo no mu kwakira abashyitsi mu Rwanda\"\nIbyagezweho.\nRica Rwigamba wamenyekanye cyane ayobora ishami ry'ubukerarugendo muri RDB, yanditse igitabo kitwa \"Kibuno mpa amaguru\" iki gitabo kiri mu bwoko bw'ibitabo byo gufasha abana kwidagadura hakoreshejwe ibishushanyo byinshi n'amagambo make."}
{"id": "10468", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10468", "title": "Ingoro ndangamurage y\u2019ibidukikije", "text": "Ingoro y\u2019umurage y\u2019ibidukikije ya Karongi iherere mu ntara y' iburengera zuba bw'uRwanda,iyi ngoro bise ingoro y\u2019amababa atatu kubera ibice bitatu biyigize, harimo igice cy\u2019ingufu zisaza, icy\u2019ingufu zisubiramo ndetse n\u2019icy\u2019ibimera, yubatswe ahanini na Leta y\u2019u Rwanda ariko hiyongera n\u2019igice gito cy\u2019inkuga y\u2019Ubudage n\u2019Ubububiligi yuzuye itwaye amafaranga miliyari na miliyoni miliyoni magana atatu (1,300,000000Rwf).\nAmateka y'ingoro ndangamurage y'ibidukikije.\nMu 2015 nibwo ingoro ndangamurage y\u2019ibidukikije ibitse ibikorwa bitandukanye by\u2019urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima ya mbere mu Rwanda no mu karere ko munsi y\u2019ubutayu bwa Sahara yafunguwe mu Murenge wa Bwishyura mu Karere ka Karongi, mu Ntara y\u2019Uburengerazuba mu Rwanda \nyafunguwe yibandaga ku kumurika ibijyanye n\u2019ingufu (Renewable and non renewable energy), urugendo rukorwa ngo zitange amashanyarazi n\u2019ingaruka zigira ariko nyuma yaje kongerwamo ibijyanye n\u2019inyamaswa n\u2019amabuye y\u2019agaciro byabaga i Kigali mu Ngoro y\u2019Amateka kamere izwi nko kwa \u201cKandt\u201d\nKuwa 7-10 Kanama 2019..\nIntego z'ingoro ndangamurage y'ibidukikije.\nHari zimwe mu ntego ingoro yashinzwe yiteze kugeraho ndetse zagiyihe ziyongera ari zo zikurikira:\nUmwihariko w'iyi ngoro niyo yambere y'ubatswe mu karere kibiyaga bigari ndetse na africa muri rusange ishingiye kubidukikije no kubungabunga urusobe rw'ibinyabuzima n'ibimera."}
{"id": "10469", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10469", "title": "Uwitonze Clementine", "text": "Uwitonze Clementine ni umunyarwandakazi akaba umuhanzikazi mu ndirimbo zo kuramya no guhimbaza Imana mu Rwanda uzwi kwizina rya Tonzi. \nUbuzima Bwe bwite.\nUwitonze Clementine uzwi ku izina rya Tonzi yavukiye muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Congo ariko akurira mu Rwanda, Yavukiye mu muryango ukomeye wa gikristo, yakuze atozwa kubaha Isabato ndetse kugeza ubu ararushaho kwiyagura mu murimo w\u2019Imana.Tonzi yakuranye impano yo kuririmba aho yatangiye kuririmba akiri umwana muto cyane ahagarikwa ku meza kugira ngo abantu bamubone. \nUmwuga.\nClemantine Uwitonze Yagize umuziki umwuga aho yaje gukomereza Impano yaje kwaguka ajya mu makorali atandukanye, mu mwaka wa 2004 atangira umuziki ku giti cye. Ni umwe mu bahanzi b\u2019igitsinagore baririmba indirimbo zihimbaza Imana umaze kwagura umwuga we mu buryo bukomeye.\nIbitaramo.\nNi nani: Tonzi yakoze ku mugoroba wo ku wa Gatatu tariki 18 Gashyantare mu 2012 \nEast Africa Gospel concert: Iki Nigitaramo tonzi yateguye cyahuzaga abahanzi ba Afurika y\u2019uburasirazuba.\nIbiranga Tonzi.\nTonzi arangwa n\u2019umutima utanga kuruta ibindi byose, aharanira ko yagira ikintu akorera kigashimisha umuntu kurusha uko we yagikorerwa.\nUmusanzu.\nIndirimbo Imana ishyira tonzi ku mutima zifasha abantu cyane, kumenya urukundo rw' Imana ku buzima bwacu, uburyo Imana iduhumuriza, ikaduha ibyiringiro, amahoro, ibyishimo, umunezero mbinyujije mu ndirimbo, kuko igihe cyose yatangiye gusohora indirimbo sinaburaga ubutumwa bw'abantu bampa ubuhamya bwicyo ubutumwa bwabafashije kurushaho kwegera Imana, no gukomera mu rugendo rwa buri munsi."}
{"id": "10470", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10470", "title": "Rolande Simone Pryce", "text": "Rolande Simone Pryce ufite ubwenegihugu bwa Jamayike, afite uburambe bwo gukorera banki kuva mu 2006 ahagarariye Banki mu bikorwa muri Amerika y'Epfo na Karayibe ndetse no muri Afurika yo munsi y'Ubutayu bwa Sahara no mu birwa bya pasifika\nAkazi.\nRolande Pryce ni umuyobozi wa Banki y'Isi mu Rwanda kuva 2020 yasimbuye Yasser El Gammal wakoraga kuri uwo mwanya kuva muri Gashyantare 2016.Mbere yo kwinjira muri Banki y'Isi, Madamu Pryce yabaye umujyanama mu by'amategeko muri guverinoma ya Jamayike ku mategeko mpuzamahanga rusange n'ubucuruzi mpuzamahanga mu myaka irenga icumi; kandi nkumwarimu wungirije mumategeko mpuzamahanga muri kaminuza ya West Indies\nAmashuri.\nAfite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu by'amategeko mpuzamahanga yakuye muri kaminuza ya Londere 2004 -2005. Kuva 1992 - 1995 yize amategeko muri kaminuza ya Miami, 1989 -1992 yakoreye Bachelor of Science mu bucuruzi mpuzamahanga n'imibare yakuye muri kaminuza y'Umujyi wa New York. Amashuri y'isumbuye yayize muri St Andrew High school muri 1981 kugera 1986. \"She holds a master\u2019s degree in Public International Law from the University College of London ; a Juris Doctor from the University of Miami and a Bachelor of Science in International Business and Mathematics from the City University of New York\"\nUbunyamwuga.\nYagize kandi uruhare mu gutanga ubufasha mu by'amategeko mu by'imari, ibikorwa remezo ndetse n'abikorera. Ubunararibonye afite kuri uyu mugabane burimo gukorera mu itsinda ry\u2019Afurika ryita ku ngufu aho yari ashinzwe gucunga neza ubutungo wari uhari icyo gihe ungana na miliyari 10 z'amadolari. Banki y'isi yemeje urwego rushya rw'ubufatanye mu gihugu (CPF) mu Rwanda. Urwego ruzayobora imirimo ya Banki mu myaka 6 iri imbere mu rwego rwo gushyigikira ingamba za guverinoma y\u2019u Rwanda nkuko byashyizwe mu ngamba z\u2019igihugu zo guhindura ibintu"}
{"id": "10471", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10471", "title": "Nyiranyamibwa Suzana", "text": "Nyiranyamibwa Suzana, umuririmbyi w'umunyarwandakazi w\u2019inararibonye waboneye benshi izuba mu bahanzi nyarwanda yagarutse gutura mu Rwanda by\u2019iteka nyuma y\u2019imyaka irenga 40 yari amaze mu mahanga ya kure.\nUbuzima bwite.\nNyiranyamibwa Suzana [yavutse 1943] yavuye mu Rwanda mu 1973 ahunze itoteza n\u2019ubwicanyi bwa hato na hato bwakorerwaga abatutsi. Yabanje kuba muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Congo ahava nyuma y\u2019imyaka 16 yerekeza mu Bubiligi.\nUyu muhanzi n\u2019umuryango we bahunze nyuma y\u2019uko se yishwe aroshywe mu Rusumo mu mwaka wa 1963. Nyina, Mukanzigiye Carolina na we yazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 ubwo yari avuye mu Bubiligi kwivuza no gusura umuryango we wari warahungiyeyo. yagize Ati \u201cData bamwishe muri 1963, ari muri baba bandi baroshywe mu Rusumo hariya i Kibungo ubu ni mu akarere ka Ngoma intara y'uburasirazuba, mu 1973 nibwo twavuye mu Rwanda twari abana icyenda buri wese yagiye ukwe dushaka ubuzima turakura bigenda uko.\u201d Yongeraho ati \u201cMuri Congo nahageze mu 1973, nahunganye n\u2019umugabo wanjye, mu urugo twari abana icyenda ariko buri wese yagiye ukwe tujya gushaka ubundi buzimaNahunganye n\u2019umugabo twabyaranye abana bane we yaguye muri Congo icyo gihe. Nahabaye imyaka 16 mpava njya kuba i Bruxelles ari naho nari ntuye iyo imyaka yose.\u201d\nMu Rwanda.\nNyiranyamibwa Suzana w\u2019imyaka 79 avuga ko mu myaka yamaze i Burayi atigeze ahakunda kurusha u Rwanda ari nacyo cyamushyizemo imbaraga arataha ngo asazire mu gihugu cye cyu Rwanda. Ni umwe mu abaririmbyi b\u2019imena bashinze itorero Isamaza ryagize uruhare rukomeye mu gutiza umurindi ingabo ku rugamba rwo kubohora u Rwanda. Icyo gihe yaririmbanaga n\u2019abahanzi bari bakunzwe icyo igihe barimo bakomeye mu ijyana ya kinyarwanda n\u2019abandi babyinaga cyane.Ntabwo nigeze nkunda u Burayi, nahabeshejwe n\u2019uko nari mfite abana bagombaga kwiga kandi nkaba hafi yabo nkabitaho. Ntabwo nari gushobora kuguma hariya, mu Burayi ntabwo ari ahantu ho gusazira.\u201d Yavuze ko nyuma yo kuza gutura mu Rwanda agiye gukomeza guhanga indirimbo nshya ndetse ngo nibimushobokera azongera ahuze abakecuru yaririmbanye na bo mu Isamaza bongere bahange.\nItorero isamaza.\nNyiranyamibwa Suzana ari mubashinze Itorero Isamaza ryashingiwe mu Bubiligi mu myaka igera kuri 30 ishize, ryatangiye rigizwe n\u2019abiganjemo abagore n\u2019inkumi zabyinaga hagamijwe gushakisha ubufasha bwo gushyigikira ingabo zarwanye urugamba rwo kwihobora mu 1990. Isamaze rigitangira ryabarizwagamo abahanzi b\u2019abahanga barimo nka Nyiranyamibwa Suzana, Jeanne Karigirwa Ruboneka, Anonciata Gatera, Francoise Ruboneka, Anonciata Kayisire n\u2019abandi batandukanye.\nNyiranyamibwa Suzana umwe mu bashinze Itorero Isamaza yavuze ko nyuma yo kugaruka gutura mu Rwanda ateganya kongera guhuza abakecuru bagenzi be bakiriho bakongera kuririmba nk\u2019itsinda no gukora ibitaramo by\u2019indirimbo ahanini zibutsa abantu ibihe iri torero ryagize mu myaka yashize. Ati \u201cAbo twahoranye mu itorero Isamaza benshi baracyariho ariko babivuyemo, uwari umuhanga cyane mu bo twaririmbanye yaratabarutse ni Jeanne Karigirwa abandi barashatse iby\u2019imiziki babivamo Ubwo nanjye ngiye kugerageza ndebe ko twakongera gukora ariko biragoye.\u201d\nNyiranyamibwa avuga ko hari indirimbo yahimbye ariko zitarasohoka gusa arateganya kuzazishyira hanze kuri nshya azamurika mu gihe kiri imbere. Mu kwihuza n\u2019abahoze bagize Isamaza ngo yifuza ko bakora ibitaramo bito no guhanga indirimbo nshya gusa ngo ni akazi gasaba imbaraga nyinshi. Ati \u201cAbakobwa twaririmbanye hafi ya bose iby\u2019umuziki ntibakibyiyumvamo, bari bafite amajwi meza, ni abahanga gusa ngira ngo murabazi, bamaze gushaka baba bahagaritse umuziki abandi barabiretse Nzagerageza gushaka uko nakongera kubabwira duhure twongere dukore ariko birasaba imbaraga.\u201d Iyo umubajije urwibutso afite ku Itorero Isamaza asubiza yitsitsa cyane ku bumwe no kutiganda byarangaga abaririmbyi ndetse no guharanira iterambere rya buri wese byabarangaga."}
