{"id": "10489", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10489", "title": "Kateshunga Agasaro Uwase Sandrine", "text": "Kateshunga Agasaro Uwase Sandrine, uzwi cyane ku izina rya Sacha, ni umuhanzi nyarwanda uririmba injyana zirimo RnB, Afrobeat n'izindi njyana zigezweho. Yatangiye umuziki mu mwaka wa 2012, akaba yaramenyekanye binyuze mu ndirimbo yakoranye n'abahanzi batandukanye bo mu Rwanda.\nUbuzima n'amashuri.\nKateshunga Agasaro Uwase Sandrine yavutse ku wa 4 Mata 1993. Ni umukobwa wa Kateshunga Emmanuel na Mukanshirimpaka Angelique, akaba ari umwana wa gatatu mu bana bane.Amashuri y'incuke yayize ku Ishuri rya Gisimba riherereye i Nyamirambo. Amashuri abanza yayize kuri APAPER Kicukiro, naho ayisumbuye ayatangirira kuri APE Rugunga mbere yo kuyakomereza no kuyarangiriza kuri St. Famille. Yize mu ishami rya Tourism Management (Ubukerarugendo).\nUmuziki.\nSacha yatangiye umwuga w'umuziki mu mwaka wa 2012. Indirimbo ye ya mbere yabaye \"Igikwiye\", yayiririmbanye n'umuhanzi Danny Nanone. Mu kiganiro 3 yigeze gutanga, yavuze ko mbere yo kwinjira mu muziki yakundaga kubyina, ariko Danny Nanone amushishikariza kugerageza kuririmba nyuma yo kubona ko afite impano yo kuririmba.\nNyuma y'iyo ndirimbo, yakomeje gukora izindi ndirimbo zirimo:\nIbikorwa mpuzamahanga.\nMu Ukuboza 2012, Sacha yitabiriye igikorwa cyabereye muri C\u00f4te d'Ivoire, aho yari yatowe nk'umwe mu bahanzi b'abagore bakizamuka bo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba. Muri icyo gikorwa yahuriye n'abahanzi batandukanye bazwi ku rwego mpuzamahanga, barimo Chris Brown.Mu ntangiriro za 2013, yatangaje gahunda yo gukorana indirimbo n'umuhanzi Tonnx wo muri Kampala, muri Uganda."}
{"id": "10490", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10490", "title": "Kayitare Isheja Morella", "text": "Kayitare Isheja Morella ni umwe mu banyamideli bamaze kubaka izina mu Rwanda kuko yatangiye gukorana n\u2019inzu z\u2019imideli zikomeye ku ruhando mpuzamahanga ndetse yari no muri Nyampinga Miss Rwanda 2021.\nUbuzima Bwite.\nKayitare Isheja Morella [wavutse muri 2003] ni umunyarwndakazi w'umunyamideli wiga mu mwaka wa gatanu w\u2019amashuri yisumbuye muri Lyc\u00e9e de Kigali, asanzwe abarizwa mu ishuri ryigisha ibyo kumurika imideli rya Golden Models riyoborwa na Franco Kabano ari nawe wamufashije kubona aya masezerano.\nImideli.\nKayitare Isheja Morella Ku wa 24 Mutarama 2022, ni bwo inzozi ze zabaye impamo ubwo yitabiraga Paris Fashion Week Haute Couture. Icyo gihe yabaye umwe mu banyamideli bamuritse imyambaro yakozwe n\u2019Inzu ifite izina ryo ku rwego rwo hejuru, Dior. Dior ni inzu y\u2019imideli y\u2019Abafaransa iri mu zikomeye cyane ku Isi imenyerewe mu gukora imyenda, inkweto, ibikapu, amasakoshi y\u2019abagore, imibavu n\u2019ibindi.. \nMu kiganiro n' IGIHE Isheja yavuze ko yanejejwe no kuba yamuritse imyenda ya Dior kuko yabyifuje kenshi ariko ntabone ayo mahirwe. Ati \u201cNdishimye cyane! Nifuje gukorana na Dior kuva kera. Mu 2020 nahuye n\u2019itsinda ryabo rishinzwe guhitamo abo bakorana ariko nari nkiri muto cyane ntibyakunda. \u201cMu mwaka ushize nari ndi i Burayi ngiye muri Dior nabwo nagombaga no kuba mu bamurika ariko byasubitswe ku munsi wa nyuma nsigarana amahirwe yo kuzamurika iyo bakoze yo ku rwego rwo hejuru ubu ni byo nakoze.\u201d Uyu mukobwa asanzwe akorana n\u2019Ikigo WEBEST MODEL MANAGEMENT gicunga abanyamideli batandukanye mu Rwanda ari nacyo cyamufashije guhura n\u2019ibi bigo bikomeye birimo Dior bagiye gukomeza gukorana. Kayitare Isheja Morella wanitabiriye Nyaminga Miss Rwanda 2021 amaze kubaka izina mu kumurika imideli ku ruhando mpuzamahanga kuko yitabiriye Paris Fashion Week ndetse akorana n\u2019inzu z\u2019imideli zikomeye nka Dior, Courr\u00e8ges n\u2019izindi. uretse mu mahanga Isheja Morella yakoze mu bitaramo by'imideli byinshi bitandukanye mu rwanda harimo nka collective Rwanda no mu yitwa Africa Fashion Alive yari yanitabiriye na Naomie Campbell.\nNyampinga.\nKayitare Isheja Morella wari mu bakobwa uko ari 20, bagabanyijwe mu matsinda atanu y\u2019abakobwa bane, aba bararushanyijwe buri tsinda ritanga uwa mbere wagiye mu cyiciro cya nyuma. Batanu bageze ku cyiciro cya nyuma ni Kayitare Isheja Morella nabandi Uwase Phiona, Umutesi Lea, Kayirebwa Marie Paul na Musana Teta Hense. Irushanwa rya siporo ryatsinzwe na Kayitare Isheja Morella wahize abandi yegukana atyo challenge ya mbere yatanzwe muri nyampinga Miss Rwanda 2021. Irushanwa rya siporo ryateguwe rinakoreshwa n\u2019umutoza w\u2019aba bakobwa ariwe Girumugisha Ga\u00ebl usanzwe unabakoresha imyitozo ngororamubiri muri boot camp [Nyampinga Miss Rwanda 2021]."}
{"id": "10491", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10491", "title": "Munyana chantal", "text": "Umunyana Chantal (Wavutse 1994) washinze akaba nuyobora umuyobozi wa Umubyeyi Elevate. Umubiriye Elevate Ltd.\nUbuzima bwite.\nUmunyana yavukiye mukarere ka kamonyi akaba ari pfura mubana biwabo. Munyana afite umugabo numwana wimyaka itatu.Umunyana Chantal Yasoje Amashuri ye muri kaminuza nkuru akaba ariwe washinze kandi akanayobora Umubyeyi Elevate. Umubyeyi Elevate Ltd nubucuruzi bwikoranabuhanga ryubuzima kubabyeyi bakiri bato, abagore batwite, abashaka kuba ababyeyi, nurubyiruko, bigamije kugabanya indwara nimpfu ziterwa no gutwita no kubyara kubera ubumenyi buke ninkunga ikomeye.\nUmwuga.\nChantal yize Ubuganga muri kaminuza nkuru yu Rwanda akaba yanshoje mwishuri Rikuru ry\u2019Abagore Ba Rwiyemezamirimo (AWE),rifite gahunda yo kongerera ubushobozi abagore ikorwa na Minisiteri y\u2019ububanyi n\u2019amahanga ya Leta ishinzwe uburezi n\u2019umuco.\nInama.\nUmuntu wese agomba gufata neza ubuzima bwe. Ku bijyanye n'ababyeyi, ibi bigomba gushimangirwa, kubera ko ubuzima bwabo bugira ingaruka no ku bana babyaye. Binyuze ku mbuga nkoranyambaga abagore bashobora kugera ku mbuga zitandukanye, harimo na Umubaye Elevate, zitanga amakuru ajyanye n'ubuzima, iyo akoreshejwe neza, bishobora gutuma ubuzima bwiza bugera ku babyeyi ndetse no ku rubyaro rwabo.\nIbihembo.\nIbindi wareba.\nUmubyeyi Elavate:Umubyeyi Elevate 'yatangijwe ku mugaragaro mu Gushyingo 2020. Kuva icyo gihe yatsindiye ikigega cya Young Resilient Fund 2021, yashyizwe ku rutonde rwa 15 muri Afurika Young Innovators for Health 2021, kandi yari mu bagore batatu bahanga udushya twatsindiye igihembo ndetse n'ubujyanama ku buntu. Umunyana na we yagiye muri Isiraheli mubice 20 byashinzwe gutangiza."}
{"id": "10492", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10492", "title": "Jeanne Chantal Ujeneza", "text": "Chantal Ujeneza Wavutse 30 ukuboza mu 1967 Ni umwe mu basirikare bakuru b\u2019abategarugori mu Rwanda\nUbuzima bwite.\nChantal Ujeneza Numubyeyi wabana babari \nAmateka.\nChantal Ujeneza yinjiye mu gisirikare mu 1988 akiri umukobwa muto. Indoto ze ku ikubitiro ntizari ukuba umusirikare ukomeye ahubwo yashakaga ko amasomo ya gisirikare yamufasha kwiga akaminuza.avugako bitari byoroshye kuri we muri kiriya gihe, kuko ababyeyi be batumvikanaga ku bijyanye no kuba yajya mu gisirikare dore ko mu bantu hari hakiri imyumvire ivuga ko imirimo nk\u2019iyo itagenewe abakobwa.\nUmwuga.\nShantal yize amashuri yose harimo nakaminuza yize \u2018Sociologie.\u2019muri Kaminuza Nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda yArangije yakoze amasomo menshi atandukanye hafi ya yose ajyanye n\u2019igisirikare irya nyuma akaba yararikoze mu 2015 rizwi nka \u2018senior command\u2019.Chantal Yatanze urugero rw\u2019ubutumwa bw\u2019akazi yagiyemo i Darfur mu 2008."}
{"id": "10493", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10493", "title": "Umuhoza Emma Pascaline", "text": "Umuhoza Emma Pascaline (wavutse 17 gashyantare mu 2003) Akaba arumunyamideli Ukomeye mu Rwanda \nUbuzimwa bwite.\nUmuhoza Emma Pascaline numunyamideli ukomeye cyane aho yamamriza amacampanyi agiye atandukanye.Emma yitabiriye Irushanwa rya Nyaminga Wu Rwanda 2022 aho yarari mubakobwa bafite uburanga nubwenge yakomeje muri 20 bagiye mumwiherero ndetse yongera kuboneka muri 10.Emma yaitabiriye amarushanwa yaba miss agiye atandukanye nka Miss Earth Rwanda 2021.\nUmwuga.\nUmuhoza numunyamidel muri campany yashinzwe na Mikky Jones Wilfred ya MJW Model Management akaba akora muri Kigali Protocal iri muri kompanyi zikomeye muzitanga serivisi za Protocol mu Rwanda kugeza ubu yanamaze gukatisha itike yo kuzahatana mu bihembo nyafurika bya Zikomo Awards."}
{"id": "10494", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10494", "title": "Isabelle Kamariza", "text": "Isabelle Kamariza ni umuyobozi w'ikigo cyidaharanira inyungu cyitwa Solid Africagikorera cyane cyane mu bitaro bya Kaminuza bya Kigali CHUK ndetse nahandi, akaba yarize ibijyanye n'amategeko mu Bubiligi.\n= Uburezi =\nMu mwaka wa 2010, Kamariza yakoreye impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu ishami ry'amategeko.\n= Ibihembo =\nIsabelle yahembwe n'imbuto foundation yashinzwe na Jeannette Kagame muri 2014, isabelle kandi yahembwe na Forbes nk'umugore wumuny'Africa wagize impinduka muri sosiyete muri 2021.\nMu mwaka wa 2011, Isabelle niwe wahawe igihembo cy\u2019urubyiruko mu cyiciro cy'abayobozi b\u2019abagore igihembo yahawe na Michelle Obama. Mu mwaka wa 2013, Isabelle yongeye kumenyekana ku bw'imirimo ye ubwo yahawe igihembo cyo Kwizihiza Abakiri bato bo mu Rwanda bagize uruhare mu kwesa imihigo, yagihawe n'umuryango Imbuto Foundation, umuryango wa Madamu wa Perezida wa repubulika y'u Rwanda.\u00a0 Mu Ugushyingo 2014, inkuru ya Isabelle yagaragaye kuri CNN African Voices.\u00a0Muri 2018, Isabelle yashimwe n\u2019umwamikazi Elizabeth wa II nk'uwahawe igihembo cya 55 cy'igihembo cy'umucyo.\u00a0 Kandi ni umwe mubari bagize Aspen New Voices 2019 ndetse akaba na Ambasaderi umwe ukiri muto ku isi.\u00a0Isabelle niwe wegukanye igihembo cya Forbes Woman Africa Social Impact Award mu 2021.\n= Amashakiro ="}
{"id": "10495", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10495", "title": "Queen Ndahiro Mugabekazi", "text": "Queen Ndahiro Mugabekazi (Wavutse 2003) akaba Nyaminga wifotoje kurusha abandi 2022\nUbuzima bwite.\nQueen Ndahiro Mugabekazi yavutse tariki ya 8 Nzeri 2002 avukira mu Mujyi wa Kigali mu Karere ka Kicukiro, ni umuhererezi mu muryango w\u2019abana 3, imfura iwabo ni umukobwa n\u2019aho ubuheta bukaba umuhungu. Afite ababyeyi bose (Papa na Mama). Ndahiro amashuri abanza yayize i Nyandungu kwa Hadji, icyiciro rusange cy\u2019amashuri yisumbuye (O Level) yacyize Lyc\u00e9e Notre Dame de Citeaux ni mu gihe icyiciro cya kabiri cy\u2019amashuri yisumbuye (A Level) yacyize Lyc\u00e9e de Kigali aho yize PCB (Physics, Chemistry and Biology)..\nIbihembo.\nNdahiro yabaye umukobwa wahize abandi mukwifotoza muri miss 2022. Aho Yahawe igihembo cyamafaranga 2, 400, 000 yatanzwe na Diamond Smile Dental Clinic, IGIHE, Forzza Gaming na Smart Design muri miss Rwanda 2022.\nUmushinga.\nQueen Ndahiro Mugabekazi Afite umushinga Kurwanya ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina no gutandukanya igitsina gore."}
{"id": "10496", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10496", "title": "Kazeneza Marie Merci", "text": "Kazeneza Marie Merci (wavutse mu 1997) Ni umunyeshuri muri kaminuza muri Tourism Travelling and Management\nUbuzima Bwite.\nkaneza n' umukobwa w\u2019imyaka 25 uvuka i Rubavu ari ariko uba i Kigali ku mpamvu z\u2019akazi,Nishuri, yarangije kaminuza muri Tourism Travelling and Management.Uyu mukobwa yitabiriye irushanwa Rya Nyaminga wu Rwanda 2022 akaba yarafite umushinga w\u2019Uburezi aho yashinze urubuga rwo abantu bazajya bigiraho batavuye mu rugo ariko banidagadura. Kazeneza Marie Merci yabaye Igisonga cya mbere mu irushanwa ry\u2019ubwiza ryahuje abakobwa biga muri Kaminuza y\u2019Ubukerarugendo mu 2016 (Miss UTB) akanegukana ikamba ry\u2019uzi kwifotoza neza kurusha abandi, ari guhatanira ikamba rya Miss Rwanda.\nIbihembo.\nKazeneza Marie Merci yatsindiye ikamba ry\u2019umukobwa wahize abandi mu kwifotoza muri kaminuza muri Tourism Travelling and Management"}
{"id": "10497", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10497", "title": "Ruzindana Kelia", "text": "Ruzindana Kelia (wavutse 2003) ikamba rya Nyampinga w\u2019Umurage (miss Hertage 2022)\nUbuzima Bwite.\nRuzindana Kelia\u00a0 Afite myaka 18 yavukiye mu Mujyi wa Kigali mu karere ka Nyarugenge.Kelia n'umukobwa wakuze azu bwenge.yasoje amashuri yisumbuye umwaka ushize wa 2021 muri College Saint Andre, akaba yarize MPG (Mathematics, Physics and Geography) akaba yaranujuje ikizami cya Leta gisoza amashuri yisumbuye. yize amashuri abanza kutunyenyeri Igikondo ayisumbuye yose akaba yarazize mukigo cyimwe aricyo St Andre. Kelia akaba yarafite umushinga ujyanye no gukurikirana abana bafite ibibazo batewe n\u2019amakimbirane yo mu muryango aho usanga hari na bamwe byashoye mu kunywa ibiyobyabwenge.\nIbihembo.\nRuzindana Kelia\u00a0yahawe igihembo cyamafaranga 5 000 000 kuva Bralirwa unyuze kumurongo wa Primus ndetse no gushyigikira ibikorwa byo kumenyekanisha umuco muri Miss Rwanda."}
{"id": "10498", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10498", "title": "Umugwaneza Charlotte", "text": "Umugwaneza Charlotte umwe mubakinnyi beza usanzwe ari kapiteni w'ikipe ya APR Basketball Club mu cyiciro cy'abagore, ndetse akaba arinawe kapiteni w'ikipe y'igihugu ya Basketball y'U Rwanda. \nUmwirondoro.\nUmugwaneza Charlotte (yavutse ku ya 24 Ugushyingo 1989) mu Murenge wa Gasaka, mu Karere ka Nyamagabe mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo, Umugwaneza ni we wenyine warokotse mu muryango w'abana bane - abakobwa batatu n'umuhungu umwe. Ababyeyi be Aaron Mazuru na Susan Mukagahima na barumuna be bose bishwe mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 yahitanye abantu barenga miliyoni, Umugwaneza yarezwe na nyirasenge.\nAmasomo yize.\nUmugwaneza Charlotte yize mu rwunge rwa mashuri rwa Gasaka mu akarere avukamo amashuri abanza mbere yo kwinjira muri Groupe Scholaire Notre d'Ame de la Paix Cyanika nayo iherereye mu karere ka Nyamagabe yiga mu cyiciro rusange (tronc Common O' level) kugira ngo yige bisanzwe. Ku rwego rwa masomo y'isumbuye, yinjiye muri College Saint Emmanuel de Hanika mu Karere ka Nyanza aho yize ibaruramari arangiza muri 2009. Mu mwaka wa 2010, yinjiye muri kaminuza ya Lay Adventiste ya Kigali (INILAK) akurikirana impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya mbere mu icungamari maze arangiza muri 2014. Nyuma yo kurangiza, Umugwaneza yakoranye n'amasosiyete menshi arimo MTN Rwanda nk'umucungamari. Umugwaneza, ufite uburebure bwa 1.95mh n'uburemere bw'ibiro 80, akaba ari umwe mu bakinnyi bakina hagati basketball y'abagore bo mu Rwanda neza.\nUbuzima bwite.\nUmugwaneza Charlotte ari mu bihumbi by\u2019abana basigaye badafite ababyeyi kandi batagira aho baba kubera jenocide yakorewe abatutsi mu 1994, bivuze ko atigeze agira amahirwe yo kubona urukundo n'ubwuzu bw'ababyeyi be. Nyuma y'urupfu rw'ababyeyi be na barumuna be, Yagize ati:\"narenzwe na masenge,Immaculee Mukamusonera. Mvugishije ukuri ubwana bwanjye cyari igihe kitoroshye. kuba narabuze umuryango wanjye nkiri muto cyane, nahatiwe gufata ibyo nahawe byose kandi ngomba kwiga byinshi nkiri muto\", Umugwaneza yakomeje agira ati: \u201cUmuryango wa masenge ni umuryango wegamiye ku idini nahawe uburere no gusenga nyamara nkiri muto nakundaga gukina umupira ariko masenge abyanga. nabwiye masenge kumugaragaro andeke nkurikire ibyo nkunda kuva nkiri muto, kubw'amahirwe, yanteze amatwi arabyemera. Kuva uwo munsi, natangiye gukina umupira ntatinya ingaruka.\nUmwuga.\nUmupira w'amaboko.\nUmugwaneza Charlotte ati: \"nari umukinnyi w'ingenzi muri College Saint Emmanuel de Hanika. Urebye uburebure bwanjye no gukunda siporo, mwarimu w'imikino yacu yangiriye inama yo kugerageza basketball, anyemeza ko mfite imico yo kuzaba umukinnyi mwiza wa basketball. ni uko nahisemo gukina basketball, Yanyigishije iby'ibanze, uburyo bwo kwiruka n'umupira mpita mbimenya vuba. Nyuma y'ibyumweru bike, niswe izina mu ikipe y'ishuri.\" \nMu mpera z'umwaka wa 2009, yatoranijwe kuba mu ikipe ya Basketball y'abagore ya karere ka Nyanza yitabiriye \u201cImiyoborere Cup Cup\u201d - iyi kipe yageze ku mukino wa nyuma w'igihugu ariko itsindwa na Nyarugenge. Muri iryo rushanwa niho Charles Mushumba, umutoza mukuru wa IPRC-Amajyepfo, icyo gihe akaba yaratozaga ikipe y\u2019abagore yahoze ari kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda (NUR), yaramubonye maze amwemeza ko yinjira mu ikipe ye, ari yo yarushanwaga mu bagore b\u2019igihugu. Yaje kandi kuganira na nyirasenge maze atangira kuva i Nyamagabe kugera Huye buri munsi kugira ngo yitoze, amezi atatu.\nKubaka umwuga.\nUmugwaneza Charlotte ubwo yitabiraga irishanwa rya Zone V yabereye i Kampala yashimishije umutoza mukuru wa APR, Charles Mbazumutima.Inyungu za APR zahuriranye n\u2019uko Umugwaneza yimukiye i Kigali aho yagombaga gutangira amashuri ya kaminuza muri INILAK, bityo akajya mu ikipe ya gisirikare mu 2010. Ati: Byari bigoye kubona umwanya wo gukina muri APR icyo gihe kuko bari bafite abakinnyi benshi beza kandi b'inararibonye b'abanyamahanga kandi numvaga shaka gukina cyane, ariko umutoza yakomeje kuntera inkunga kandi namaze hafi umwaka ntinjiye mu ikipe yambere. ikipe kugeza 2011 ubwo club yatangiraga gukoresha abakinnyi ba banyarwanda. iyi ikipe nayibereye kapiteni, nyobora iyi kipe mu ibikombe bitandatu bya shampiyona isanzwe, ibikombe bitandatu bya playoff, bituma iba ikipe yatsinze cyane, yagizwe umukinnyi mwiza wo hagati wumwaka. Umugwaneza Hamwe na APR, Umugwaneza yanitabiriye amarushanwa ya Afrika Zone V Club buri mwaka, abura gusa 2016.\nIbyo ashaka kugeraho.\nUmugwaneza Charlotte Agira ati: Nizera ko basketball yampinduye uwo ndiwe uyu munsi kandi sinkeka ko nzareka gukina vuba, kandi ko igihe nzajya mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru, nizera ko nzakomeza umwuga wo gutoza cyangwa umusifuzi.\nAbo ashimira.\nUmugwaneza Charlotte Mbere na mbere, ndashimira Imana kuba ndi muzima kandi ikampa impano-Ndashimira kandi masenge n'umuryango we, kuba barujuje icyuho cy'ababyeyi banjye mu buzima bwanjye, umutoza Musumba, wambonye bwa mbere kandi ndashimira abo dukorana muri APR, akaba ari umuryango wanjye wa kabiri."}
{"id": "10500", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10500", "title": "Irere Claudette", "text": "Hon. Irere Claudette ni umunyapolitiki akaba n' umunyamwuga mu ikoranabuhanga mu Rwanda, yagizwe Umunyamabanga wa Leta ushinzwe ubumenyi n\u2019amahugurwa y\u2019imyuga n\u2019ikoranabuhanga muri minisiteri y' uburezi mu Rwanda muri Gashyantare 2020. Uyu mwanya wagaruwe mu gihe Guverinoma igenda yorohereza kandi ishimangira uburezi bushingiye ku bumenyingiro no guhuza Ikoranabuhanga mu kwigisha no kwiga. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nNyakubahwa. Minisitiri Claudette yaboneye impamyabumenyi y'amashuri yisumbuye mu ishuri ry\u2019abakobwa rya FAWE, mu Rwanda. Yakomeje amashuri ye kandi abona impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu Buhanga bwa mudasobwa na sisitemu mu 2012 yakuye muri kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda. Nyuma yaho, mu 2013, yabonye buruse yo kwiga Masters Program maze ahabwa impamyabumenyi ihanitse ya siyansi n\u2019ubuhanga mu bijyanye na Computer Engineering yakuye muri kaminuza ya gikirisitu ya Oklahoma muri Amerika. \nUmwuga mbere ya politiki.\nMbere yo kwinjira muri Minisiteri, Irere Claudette yari mu bagore b\u2019abanyarwanda bayoboye iterambere ry\u2019ikoranabuhanga mu Rwanda kandi ayoboye KLab aho inzobere mu bumenyi bwa digitale mu murwa mukuru wa Kigali zifatanya mu guhanga udushya. Mbere yibyo, Yashinze hamwe n\u2019umuyobozi wa Laboratoire ya mbere y\u2019imyenda yitwa FabLab Rwanda. FabLab yari ishami rya laboratoire yubumenyi yitwa KLab. FabLab Rwanda ni laboratoire ya mbere yo guhimba digitale ya Kigali yakomotse ku gitekerezo cya FabLabs ku isi hose cya MIT's Centre for Bits na Atoms (CBA). Laboratwari za Fab zitanga uburyo bwinshi bwo gukoresha uburyo bugezweho bwo guhanga no mu Rwanda, FabLab niyambere mubwoko bwayo itanga ibikoresho bya prototyping ya 3D n'umwanya kugirango abaturage babone ubumenyi bwikoranabuhanga bugezweho. Irere, washinze FabLab Rwanda kandi yigeze kuba umuyobozi mukuru, mbere yabaye umuyobozi w\u2019umushinga mu rugereko rwa PSF-ICT, umuyobozi mukuru muri Klab, n\u2019umuyobozi w\u2019umushinga wa ICT muri Transform Africa. Irere Claudette yari umunyamuryango w\u2019abakobwa muri ICT Rwanda, umuryango w\u2019abagore babigize umwuga mu ikoranabuhanga uharanira guha imbaraga no gushishikariza abakobwa bakiri bato kwinjira mu bumenyi bwa siyansi, ikoranabuhanga, ubwubatsi n\u2019imibare (STEM) bakiri bato. \nNkumunyapolitiki.\nKu ya 19 Ukwakira 2018, Irere yagizwe umunyamabanga uhoraho (PS) muri Minisiteri y\u2019ikoranabuhanga no guhanga udushya ubwo yinjiraga muri guverinoma yavuguruwe na Perezida Paul Kagame wagabanije abagize guverinoma kuva kuri 31 ikagera kuri 26. Inama y'Abaminisitiri ni abagore 50 ku ijana; bikagira u Rwanda, na Etiyopiya, ibihugu bibiri bya Afurika byonyine byubahiriza ihame ry' uburinganire muri guverinoma zabo. Yari umwe mu bato bagize guverinoma bakoze nk' umunyamabanga uhoraho muri Minisiteri y\u2019ikoranabuhanga no guhanga udushya kugeza mu 2020 ubwo yavanwaga ku mwanya w\u2019umunyamabanga uhoraho muri Minisiteri y\u2019ikoranabuhanga no guhanga udushya agashyirwa ku mwanya wa minisitiri ushinzwe Amashuri ya tekinike. n'imyuga (TVET) muri Minisiteri y'Uburezi. Irere Claudette yabaye kandi Umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe guhanga udushya no guteza imbere ubucuruzi muri Minisiteri y\u2019ikoranabuhanga n\u2019itumanaho (MiTEC), muri Guverinoma y\u2019u Rwanda "}
{"id": "10503", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10503", "title": "Rutagengwa Nadine Kendra", "text": "Rutagengwa Nadine bakunda kwita \"Kendra\"ni umukinnyi w'ikipe ya Basketball ya The Hoops Rwanda, ni umwe mu bakobwa bigaragaza neza iyo bari mu kibuga ariko ni mwiza kuburyo ubwiza bwe bukurura benshi.\nImirimo.\nRutagengwa Nadine yatangiye gukinira ikipe y'igihugu y'umukino wa Basketball ya bagore guhera mu mwaka 2014 mu mikino y'akarere ka gatanu y'abatarengeje imyaka 18.\nAho yagiye.\nNadine yaje kwerekeza muri Botswana nabwo yambaye ibendera ry'u Rwanda mu marushanwa ya Basketball y'abakina ari (3x3)."}
{"id": "10504", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10504", "title": "Munezero Valentine", "text": "Munezero Valentine ni imwe mu mpano zikiri nto muri volleyball y'abagore mu Rwanda kandi akinira ikipe ya APR y'abagore ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu ya volleyball.\nUyu mukobwa ufite imyaka 21 ya yoboye ikipe yabatarengeje imyaka U-20 y'igihugu kandi mbere yaho yabaye kapiteni w'ikipe ya U-18."}
{"id": "10505", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10505", "title": "Albertine Uwiringiyimana", "text": "Albertine Uwirigiyemana akinira ikipe ya APR y'abagore mu mukino wa volleyball kandi akaba yari na kapiteni w'ikipe y'igihugu y'abangavu batarengeje imyaka 20 bakaba bagiye kwerekeza muri Tuniziya mu irushanwa rigiye kubabera rya CAVB Africa Club."}
{"id": "10506", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10506", "title": "Kantore Sandra", "text": "Kantore Sandra uzwi kwizina nka Do Me, ni umwe mu bakinnyi b'igitsina gore bakuzwe cyane mu Rwanda. Akinira ikipe ya REG y'abagore y'umukina wa Basketball, ni umunyarwandakazi ariko yakiniye n'ikipe y'igihugu cy'u Burundi. Ubuhanga bwe mu kibuga ndetse n'uburanga bwe byatumye yigarurira imitima y'abatari bake. Mbere yo kunga muri REG WBBC yabaje gukinira ikipe ya APR WBBC aho yanabaye umukinnyi wahize abandi muri shampiyona mu mwaka wa 2018-2019."}
{"id": "10507", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10507", "title": "Mutoni Bertille", "text": "Mutoni Bertille Ni umunyarwandakazi ariko akaba akinira ikipe y'igihugu cy'u Burundi, akinira ikipe ya UVC WVC hano mu Rwanda, ni umwe mu bakobwa bakuzwe bitewe n'imiterere ye."}
{"id": "10508", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10508", "title": "Muhoza Emerence", "text": "Muhoza Emerence ni umukinnyi wa Basketball akaba akinira ikipe ya The Hoops Rwanda."}
{"id": "10509", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10509", "title": "Dusabe Flavia", "text": "Dusabe Flavia ni umukinnyi w'umunyarwandakazi ukinira ikipe y'igihugu ya Volleyball ndetse akinira na APR. Dusabe Flavia yakiniye ikipe ya APR VFC mu marushanwa agiye atandukanye. Flavia yakinnye shampiyona y\u2019igihugu ya volleyball I tegurwa FRVB, Ishyirahamwe rya Volleyball mu Rwanda, ndetse nibindi bikombe bitandukanye harimo igikombe cy'amahoro, igikombe cya gaciro, n' igikombe gitegurwa na RRA, Rwanda Revenue Authority. Flavia yitabiriye kandi amarushanwa agiye tandukanye ku rwego rwa Afurika nka irushanwa ry'imikino ya shampiyona ya league mu mukino wa volleyball y'abagore."}
{"id": "10510", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10510", "title": "Habiyakare Chantal", "text": "Madamu Chantal Habiyakare ni umunyarwandakazi akabari n'umuyobozi ushinzwe igenzura ningaruka(Audit and Risk) muri Crystal Ventures Limited. Mbere yo kwinjira muri Crystal Ventures Limited yakoraga ku imyanya itandukanye haba mu bijyanye n\u2019imari n\u2019ubugenzuzi bw\u2019imbere mu masosiyete atandukanye kandi afite uburambe bunini muri assurance na serivisi z\u2019ubujyanama mu by'imari\nAmashuri.\nAfite impamyabumenyi y'ikiciro cya kabiri na dipolome ihanitse mu icungamari yakuye muri kaminuza ya Concordia (Montreal, Kanada). Ni umunyamuryango w'Ikigo cya Kanada cyemewe cy'abacungamari ba Leta kandi ni umunyamuryango w'Ikigo cy\u2019abacungamari ba Leta cyemewe mu Rwanda (ICPAR) hamwe nuburambe bwimyaka 15 mu bugenzuzi na serivisi zubujyanama\nAkazi.\nChantal n'umuyobozi mukuru wimari ufite uburambe bwimyaka 18 itanga ubugenzuzi, ingamba, imari, hamwe nu buyobozi bw'ibikorwa mumiryango nkigice cy'ubuyobozi cyangwa amatsinda yo kwizeza no gutanga inama.Yabaye Komiseri ushinzwe imari muri FERWAFA\nYakoze nk'umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe imari muri Banki, Rwanda Limited na RwandAir Ltd. Yabaye kandi umugenzuzi mukuru w'imbere muri RwandAir Limited kuva Kanama 2019. Mbere yo kwinjira muri Corporate world, yakoraga nka Audit Manager wa KPS Associates na Fuller Landau (Montreal, Kanada). Akora kandi nk'umuyobozi utari umuyobozi mukuru mu Nama ya Banki nkuru y'igihugu yu Rwanda na Ngali Holdings Ltd.\nIndimi akoresha.\nAkoresha: "}
{"id": "10511", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10511", "title": "Mugwaneza Pacifique", "text": "MUGWANEZA Pacifique ni umunyapolitiki w'umunyarwandakazi akaba umuyobozi Mukuru ushinzwe Ubugenzuzi bw\u2019amakoperative (Cooperatives Inspection Division Manager).\nAmashuri.\nMadamu Pacifique MUGWANEZA afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse (Masters) mu micungire ya Politiki y\u2019ubukungu yibanda ku mahame agenga ishyirwaho n\u2019ishyirwa mu bikorwa rya politiki y\u2019ubukungu mu buryo nyabwo yavanye muri kaminuza ya Auvergne - Clermont Ferrand, mu Bufaransa, na Bachelor's Degree in Science Science: Amafaranga na Banki yavanye muri Kaminuza yigenga ya Kigali (ULK),\nAkazi.\nNi umuyobozi ushinzwe kugenzura no guteza imbere amakoperative mu ikigo cy\u2019amakoperative mu Rwanda, kuva mu mwaka wa 2018: kikaba ari ikigo cya Leta gishinzwe kwandika, kugenzura no guteza imbere amakoperative: Imyaka ibiri n\u2019amezi cumi na kumwe (Mata 2018-kugeza ubu) y'uburambe bw'umwuga mubijyanye na koperative mu Rwanda (Rwanda Cooperative Association \"RCA\"). Yabaye kandi umuyobozi wa komisiyo ishinzwe imari n\u2019ubugenzuzi mu Nama y'Ubuyobozi y'Ikigo cy'Ingoro z'umurage z'u Rwanda kuva mu Gushyingo 2016 kugeza muri Nzeri 2020.\nYakoze muri MINECOFIN: Imyaka icumi (2008 -2018) y'uburambe bugenda butera imbere muri Politiki ya Macroeconomic, yibanda kuri politiki yo hanze (BOP: Balance of Payments) aho umurenge usobanura imyanya ya leta ugereranije nurwego mpuzamahanga. Kuva ku ya 10 Nzeri 2008: politiki y\u2019imari nisesengura muri politiki y\u2019ubukungu: ibi byari bikubiyemo isesengura ryingaruka nziza kurwego rwa macro, no kongera agaciro isoko ryimari yari igeze, Kuva ku ya 15 Nzeri 2009: Impuguke ya Macroeconomic Convergence, yibanda ku miterere y\u2019urwego rwo hanze no guhuza ubukungu mu karere (EAC, COMESA). \nKuva muri Nzeri 2014 kugeza muri Mata 2018, Ushinzwe Politiki yo mu Bubanyi n\u2019amahanga yibanda ku gukora amafaranga asigaye inyuma - kureba imbere no gusesengura, raporo ya buri kwezi na buri gihembwe ku buringanire bw\u2019ubucuruzi, ingaruka z\u2019ubukungu bw\u2019ubufatanye bw\u2019akarere, gusesengura uburyo bwo kwagura ibyoherezwa mu mahanga, BOP ibitekerezo n'ibitekerezo byo kunonosorwa, hanyuma isesengura ku ihindagurika ryibipimo byingenzi byubukungu.\nKuva muri Mata 2006-Kanama 2008: Ushinzwe inguzanyo muri Banki ya Agaseke (Banki ya Afurika iriho ubu), ibikorwa by'ingenzi birimo gusesengura ibyifuzo by'inguzanyo, kugenzura ibyangombwa byose bisabwa ku nguzanyo, gusuzuma ingwate zatanzwe, kugenzura imenyekanisha ry'inyandiko zose. hamwe n'umwunganizi wa guverinoma, bakora isesengura ry'inguzanyo yatanzwe, bagatanga inguzanyo.\nIzindi nshingano.\nMuri 2019, yahuzaga inama mpuzamahanga y\u2019ubufatanye bw\u2019amakoperative, yabereye mu Rwanda kuva ku ya 14 kugeza ku ya 17 Ukwakira 2019. Muri 2016, yari umwe mubagize itsinda ryashinzwe na MINECOFIN na BNR kugirango bimure urwego rwo hanze kuri Balance of Payment Manual Six (BPM6), kuko byasabwaga na IMF guhuza nindi mibare yubukungu nka sisitemu ya Konti yigihugu (SNA), imibare y\u2019amafaranga n\u2019imari (MFS), hamwe n\u2019imibare y\u2019imari ya Leta (GFS). Muri 2013, yari ashinzwe MTCP (Medium Term Convergence Program), nkuko bisabwa na GFS (Ibarurishamibare rya Leta muri EAC), aho yatanze ingamba zo kugera ku ngingo zijyanye no guhuza amafaranga muri EAC. Kuva muri Mutarama 2009 kugeza muri Kamena 2014: Umunyamuryango wa Task Force mu rwego rwo hejuru kugira ngo baganire ku masezerano mpuzamahanga y\u2019isoko rusange ry\u2019Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, Ibihugu bya EAC"}
{"id": "10512", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10512", "title": "MUKAKIRAMBA Christine", "text": "Mukakiramba Christine ni umunyapolitiki w'umunyarwandakazi akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru w'amakoperative mu ishami rishinzwe ubugenzuzi (Director of cooperatives Audit unit). mu ikigo k'igihugu gishinzwe imicungire y'ama koperative mu Rwanda (RCA)\nAmashuri.\nAfite impamyabumenyi ya MBA mu micungire y\u2019ubucuruzi yakuye muri kaminuza ya Baraton, Afurika y'Iburasirazuba. Impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu micungire y'ibaruramari yakuye muri kaminuza ya Adventiste yo muri Afurika yo hagati ndetse na Diplome mu micungire y'amakoperative yakuye muri kaminuza nkuru ya koperative yo muri Kenya.\nAkazi.\nYabaye Umuyobozi w\u2019ishami rishinzwe kugenzura amakoperative kuva mu 2008 mu kigo cy\u2019amakoperative mu Rwanda.yabaye Umuyobozi w'agateganyo w'ishami rishinzwe ubugenzuzi bwa koperative mu kigo cya koperative y'u Rwanda Kuva ku ya 1 Werurwe 2021\nUmusanzu we.\nMukakiramba yavuze ko mu zindi ngamba RCA yashyizeho mu rwego rwo kurwanya ruswa no kunyereza umutungo, ari ugukora igenzura n\u2019ubugenzuzi butunguranye."}
{"id": "10515", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10515", "title": "Umutesi Marie B\u00e9atrice", "text": "UMUTESI Marie B\u00e9atrice (yavutse 1959) ni umwanditsi w'umunyarwanda wandika mu gifaransa. Yavukiye i Byumba mu ntara ya amajyaruguru ubu ni mukarere ka Rulindo yize ibijyanye sociology, akora mu iterambere ry'icyaro. Mbere ya Genocide yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda yafatwaga nk'umuntu ushyira mu gaciro, yaje guhungira muri Kivu y'amajyaruguru muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, yahavuye muri 1996 ajya i Burayi, Umutesi yageze mu Bubiligi muri 1998. Yanditse inkuru yibyamubayeho muri \"Fuir ou mourir au Zaire.\" \"Le v\u00e9cu d'une r\u00e9fugi\u00e9e Rwandaise\" (umutwe w'icyongereza: \"Surviving the Slaughter:The Ordeal of a Rwandan Refugee in Zaire\"). \nAmashuri yize.\nYize amashuri y'ibijyanye na ni imyitwari n'imibanire ya muntu (sociology) \nUmwiga we w'ubwanditsi.\nUmwugaga w' ubwanditsi yatangiye nyuma ya jenoside yakorewe abatsutsi 1994 mu Rwanda aho inkuru ze zibanda ku nkuru z'ubuzima bwe n'ibijyanye n'ubuhungiro bwe mu karere ki ibiyaga bigari."}
{"id": "10517", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10517", "title": "Marie Chantal Rwakazina", "text": "Rwakazina Marie Chantal ni umudipolomate w\u2019umunyarwanda akaba n'umunyapolitiki ukora nka ambasaderi wa Repubulika y'u Rwanda mu Busuwisi akaba n'uhagarariye u Rwanda burundu mu Muryango w'Abibumbye. Rwakazina Marie Chantal yavutse 1973, arubatse afite umugabo,aho afite abana babiri. yize muri Kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda. Aho yari umukandida mu kuyobora umujyi wa Kigali.\nAmavu n'amavuko.\nRwakazina afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu by'ubukungu yakuye muri kaminuza nkuru y'u Rwanda (1995\u20132000) n'impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bijyanye n'iterambere yakuye muri Fondation Universitaire Luxembourgeoise, Arlon, mu Bubiligi (2001\u20132003). \nUmwuga.\nMbere yuko ahabwa inshingano, Rwakazina yagizwe kandi ambasaderi w\u2019u Rwanda muri Holy See, Repubulika ya Otirishe n\u2019indi miryango mpuzamahanga i Vienne. Ku ya 4 Ukuboza 2020, Amb. Rwakazina yashyikirije Papa Francis amabaruwa y'icyizere yo guhagararira u Rwanda i Vatican kandi ibirori byabereye mu ngoro y'intumwa mu mujyi wa Vatikani. Mbere yuko ashyirwa i Geneve, yari umuyobozi w'umujyi wa Kigali kuva 2018 kugeza 2019. Rwakazina ni impuguke mu iterambere yakoranye na gahunda y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ishinzwe iterambere(United Nations Development Programme/One), aho yari impuguke y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye i Kigali-Rwanda kuva 2013 kugeza 2018, aho yari umuhuzabikorwa w\u2019inkunga zose z\u2019Umuryango w\u2019Abibumbye mu bikorwa bya leta. \nAkazi muri Kigali.\nRwakazina Marie Chantal Arangije muri Kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda yarahigishije mu 2000-2008, nyuma ngo asanga akeneye gukora mu nzego z\u2019ibanze. Nibwo nyuma y\u2019imyaka itatu yagizwe umuyobozi wungirije wa Ralga guhera mu 2010-2013. Rwakazina Marie Chantal yatorewe kuyobora Umujyi wa Kigali ku majwi 146, Uyu muyobozi akaba kandi yaratorewe Manda y\u2019imyaka itanu, ishobora kuvugururwa rimwe igihe yongeye kugirirwa icyizere. Rwakazina yanagize uruhare mu gutegura gahunda ya Guverinoma y\u2019imyaka irindwi, mu cyiciro cy\u2019ubukungu."}
{"id": "10518", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10518", "title": "Jacqueline Mukangira", "text": "Mukangira Jacqueline ni umugore w'umunyapolitike,umudipolomate w'umunyarwandakazi. Ni komiseri mukuru w\u2019u Rwanda mu Buhinde,yahoze ari Ambasaderi w\u2019u Rwanda mu bihugu bya Nordique. \nUmwuga.\nMukangira yagizwe Komiseri mukuru mu Buhinde na guverinoma y\u2019u Rwanda ku ya 28 Ugushyingo 2019, agera mu Buhinde ku ya 4 Werurwe 2020. Ku ya 21 Gicurasi 2021, yashyikirije perezida w\u2019Ubuhinde Ram Nath Kovind ibaruwa ye y\u2019icyizere mu birori byakozwe n\u2019inama kuri videwo kubera icyorezo cya Covid 19. We na perezida biyemeje gufatanya kurushaho gushimangira umubano w\u2019ibihugu byombi no kungurana ibitekerezo hagati yu Rwanda na Malidive. Yavuze ku bintu byihariye bigize umuco w\u2019ubucuruzi w\u2019u Rwanda ndetse na bimwe mu bikorwa ibihugu byombi biteza imbere mu minsi ya vuba. \nMukangira yakoze mu nzego zitandukanye, nk'umudepite mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko (2004-2007) y'uRwanda, Ambasaderi w'u Rwanda muri Suwede (2007 kugeza 2011), n'Umuyobozi mukuru muri minisiteri y'iububanyi n'Amahanga n'ubutwererane, yahagarariye amahame remezo na ubushakashatsi muri Sena y'u Rwanda. "}
{"id": "10519", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10519", "title": "Mukaruliza Monique", "text": "Mukaruliza Monique ni umunyapolitikikazi wo mu Rwanda wabaye Umujyanama mu Minisiteri y\u2019Ububanyi n\u2019Amahanga n\u2019Ubutwererane Mpuzamahanga (MINAFETT) y'u Rwanda. \nMukaruliza kandi yanabaye mu buyobozi bwa Banki ya Kigali aho yakoze nk\u2019umugenzuzi w\u2019imari, nyuma aba umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019imari mu kigo cy\u2019impfubyi, Village d\u2019Enfants SOS Kinderdolf International-Rwanda.\n Yitabye Imana kuwa 30 Werurwe 2024 aguye i Bruxelle mu Bubiligi aho yari amaze ibyumweru bibiri arwariye.\nAmashuri Yize.\nMonique Mukaruliza yari umunyapolitiki w\u2019Umunyarwandakazi wize amasomo ajyanye n\u2019ubucuruzi n\u2019imicungire y\u2019imari, harimo ibaruramari (Accounting) n\u2019imari (Finance). Yari afite impamyabumenyi za kaminuza mu by\u2019ubucuruzi n\u2019imicungire, zamufashije gukora mu nzego zitandukanye z\u2019ubuyobozi mu Rwanda no mu rwego mpuzamahanga\nUmwuga.\nMbere yuko ashingwa cyangwa ashyirwaho, Mukaruliza yari yagizwe uwahoze ari Ambasaderi w'u Rwanda muri Zambiya. Yabaye umuyobozi w'umujyi wa Kigali mu mwaka wa 2016 Kugeza mu mwaka wa 2017, Umuyobozi wa gatatu w\u2019umugore kuva mu mwaka 1996. Yabaye kandi umuyobozi wa FPR mu Mujyi wa Kigali kandi yahoze ari Minisitiri wa mbere w\u2019umuryango w\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba minisiteri yitwa(MINEAC). Monique yatangiye imirimo nka minisitiri wa MINEAC mu mwaka wa 2008 kugeza ku taliki ya 25 Gashyantare mu mwaka wa 2013. Mbere yuko agirwa minisitiri muri minisiteri ya MINEAC, Mukaruliza yari ahagarariye Umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019Afurika muri Sudani kandi yabaye umuyobozi wungirije w\u2019umuyobozi wa komisiyo y'Ubumwe bwa Afurika AU muri Sudani hagati yu mwaka wa 2005 nu mwaka wa 2008. Yagize kandi uruhare mu ishyirwaho n\u2019ivugurura ryakurikiyeho mu kigo cy\u2019imisoro n\u2019u Rwanda igihe yakoraga nka komiseri ushinzwe ubuziranenge cyangwa (Ubugenzuzi bw\u2019imbere niterambere mu Gihugu). Afite uburambe muri serivisi z\u2019amabanki kuko yabaye Komiseri w\u2019imisoro yo mu Gihugu, Ushinzwe gusesengura imari muri Banki ya Kigali hagati yu mwaka wa 1998 nu mwaka wa 2001. "}
{"id": "10520", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10520", "title": "UWAYO Clarisse", "text": "Uwayo Clarisse yamenyekanye cyane mu makipe nka Dream fighters yakiniye kuva muri 2012-2018 mbere yo kwerekeza muri Police Taekwondo Club, izi zose akaba yarazitwayemo imidari itandukanye. Nyuma nibwo ubuhanga bwe bwaje kumwinjiza mu ikipe y\u2019Igihugu.\nAho Yagiye.\nUwayo Clarisse yatangiye gukinira ikipe y'igihugu mu mwaka wa 2013 ubwo bari muri Uganda mu marushanwa ya Ambassador's Cup Ndetse aza no kwitwara neza yegukana umundali w'i Feza (silver medal). Muri uwo mwaka yongeye kwerekeza mu gihugu cya kenya muri president's cup maze atahana umudali wa Zahabu (Gold medal)."}
{"id": "10521", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10521", "title": "Nzamukosha Oliva", "text": "Nzamukosha Oliva ni Umukinnyi wa Volleyball wamenyekanye cyane akiri muto ubwo yajyaga kwiga mu rwunge rw'amashuri rwitiye mutagatifu Aloys i Rwamagana aho yakurije impano ye yo gukina Volleyball.\nAho Akina.\nNzamukosha Oliva asazwe ari umukinnyi w'ikipe y'ikigo cy'igihugu gishizwe imisoro n'Amohoro (RRA VC), iy'ikipe yayigiyemo mu mwaka wa 2020 ubwo yari avuye mu ikipe ya Saint Aloys y'i Rwamagana Kandi akinira ni ikipe y'igihugu."}
{"id": "10522", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10522", "title": "Teta Zulphath", "text": "Teta ni umukinnyi wa Volleyball watangiye gukina volleyball cyane mu mwaka 2014 ubwo yigaga mu mashuri yisumbuye i Rwamagana mu rwunge rw\u2019amashuri rwitiriwe Mutagatifu Aloyizi (St Aloys). Yashyize imbaraga nyinshi muri uyu mukino dore ko byaje no kumuhesha guhamagarwa mu ikipe y\u2019igihugu y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 20 (U20) mu mikino nyafurika aho baje gusezerera Cameroon muri \u00bd maze bakatisha itike yo kuzakina igikombe cy\u2019isi cyabereye muri Mexco.\nAho akina.\nTeta Zulphat ni umukinnyi w\u2019ikipe ya IPRC KIGALI WVC aho yayinjiyemo mu mwaka wa 2018 ubwo yari aje kwiga mu cyiciro cya kabiri cy\u2019amashuri yisumbuye. Mu minsi ishize yari arimo gufasha ikipe ya Kigali Volleyball Club mu mikino itandukanye ariko ntaraba umukinnyi wayo burundu."}
{"id": "10523", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10523", "title": "Urujeni Martine", "text": "Urugeni Martine ni Umuyobozi w\u2019Umujyi wa Kigali wungirije ushinzwe Ubukungu n\u2019imibereho myiza. Urugeni Martine afite uburambe busabwa cyangwa bujyenewe ashingiye ku mirimo yakoze ijyanye n'imibereho myiza ya baturage binyuze mu gutanga ubutabera.\nImirimo yakoze.\nUrujeni Martine ni umugore w'umunyarwandakazi w\u2019imyaka 50. Urujeni Mertine yatorerwa kuba Umuyobozi wungirije w\u2019Umujyi wa Kigali, ushinzwe Ubukungu n\u2019imibereho myiza y\u2019abaturage, akaba yaratorewe mu matora yabaye kuru uyu wa Gatanu tariki 25 Werurwe 2022, Urujeni akaba yagize amajwi 298 kuri 397 y\u2019Inteko itora. ntabwo ari mushya mu ubuyobozi kuko amaze igihe ayobora Ishami rishinzwe kwegereza ubutabera abaturage, muri Minisiteri y\u2019Ubutabera.Yabaye kandi Umuhuzabikorwa wa gahunda yo kwegereza ubutabera abaturage (Coordinator of Maison d\u2019Access \u00e0 la Justice, MAJ), anaba umuyobozi wungirije muri MAJ ushinzwe uburenganzira bw\u2019abana no kurwanya ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina."}
{"id": "10525", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10525", "title": "Mignone Alice Kabera", "text": "Mignone Alice Kabera ni umuganga, akaba ari umuyobozi mu kuru w'itorero rya Noble Family church Rwanda ribarizwa mu Rwanda. \nUbuzima bwite.\nApotre Mignone Kabera ni umubyeyi w\u2019abana batatu yibyariye ndetse n\u2019abandi benshi nk\u2019uko abyivugira. Ni we watangije umuryango witwa Women Foundation Ministries n\u2019urusengero rwitwa Nobel Family Church. Kabera Mignone Yavukiye i Burundi aranahakurira kuko ari ho ababyeyi be bari barahungiye.\nUmwuga.\nApostle Mignone Alice Kabera ni umunyarwandakazi. Ni umwe mu bagore ba Apostle ba mbere mu Rwanda. Niwe washinze kandi akaba n'umuyobozi w'itorero rya Noble Family Church ariko azwi cyane nk'uwashinze Women Foundation Ministries, ishyirahamwe ryibanda ku guteza imbere abagore bo mu Rwanda mu bijyanye n'umwuka ndetse n'ibibazo bahura nabyo mu buzima bwabo bwa buri munsi, harimo mu rugo, ku kazi ndetse no hanze.\nIbihembo.\nUmuvugabutumwa Alice Mignonne Kabera yakiriye ibihembo byinshi. Muri byo harimo igihembo cya Sifa kubikorwa byimpuhwe, gitegurwa buri mwaka mwizina rya \"Thanksgiving. Yateguye ibirori byinshi umwaka wose kugirango yongere ubushobozi bwumugore muri societe yu Rwanda, nka \"Abagore Bose Hamwe\" hamwe ninsanganyamatsiko \"Kuva abahohotewe kugeza ba nyampinga\"Umuvugabutumwa Alice Mignonne Kabera yamenyekanye muri groove award u Rwanda kubera uruhare runini yagize mu muziki wa gospel ndetse n'itangazamakuru."}
{"id": "10527", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10527", "title": "Kariza Belise", "text": "Kariza Belise ni umunyarwandakazi akaba yari umuyobozi w'ishami ry'ubukerarugendo muri RDB (ikigo cy'igihugu cyu Rwanda gishinzwe iterambere). Belise Kariza ubu ni umuyobozi w\u2019Ikigo Nyafurika gishinzwe kwita ku binyabuzima biba mu mashyamba, AWF.\nIbiganiro yatanze.\nBelise Kariza yavuzeko nubwo u Rwanda rukomeje gutera imbere mu bukerarugendo, hakenewe gutekerezwa izindi nzego bwakorerwamo kugirango bukomeze guteza imbere igihugu. Yavibuze taliki 03 ukuboza 2020 ubwo yatahaga inzu mberabyombi iri mumudugudu ndangamuco wa Kigali (Kigali Cultural Village) wubatswe i Rebero mumujyi wa Kigali. \nIbindi.\nBelise Kariza avugako urwego rw\u2019ubukerarugendo kandi rushobora rwose gutera imbere cyane mu gihe Abanyarwanda ubwabo bafite ubushake bwo kumenya, kwiga no gusangira ubwiza igihugu cyu Rwanda giha isi, nkuko umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe ubukerarugendo mu kigo gishinzwe iterambere ry\u2019u Rwanda (RDB) yabivuze."}
{"id": "10528", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10528", "title": "Mazimpaka Hortense", "text": "Mazimpaka Hortense Ni Umuvugabutumwa muri Believe church center mu Rwanda \nAmateka.\nPasitei Mazimpaka Hortense yabaye umuyobozi wa zion temple aho bakunda kwita kwa gitwaza igihe cyingana Nimyaka 6 Nibwo Yandikiye Dr Aposlte Gitwaza Paul asezera ku umurimo mu 2017.Mazimpaka Hortense Ari mu bavugabutumwa bafite igikundiro muri iyi minsi by\u2019umwihariko bitewe n\u2019ubutumwa bukubiye mu ijambo agabura.Pasiteri Mazimpaka kandi yanashyize imbaraga mu gutanga inyigisho ziganisha ku kubaka umuryango binyuze mu nama z\u2019uburyo bwo kubaka urugo rugakomera.\nInama.\nMazimpaka Arongera yibutsa abantu Kwiringira Imana aho yagize at: Zaburi 20:8 Bamwe biringira amagare, Abandi biringira amafarashi, Ariko twebweho tuzavuga izina ry\u2019Uwiteka Imana yacu.\nIbindi Wabera.\nyoutube channel:"}
{"id": "10529", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10529", "title": "Mukarusine Claudine", "text": "Mukarusine Claudine ubana n'ubumuga bw'uruhu. Byagenze gute ngo uwo mukobwa ubana n'ubumuga bwuruhu ngo agaragare mu mashusho y'indirimbo yu muhanzi King James.\nUbuzima bwite.\nMukarusine Claudine a (yavutse mu 1991) ni imfura mu muryango w\u2019abana batanu. Abandi bane bose bamukurikira nta n\u2019umwe ufite ubumuga bw\u2019uruhu. Yize muri Kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda ishami ry\u2019Uburezi mu yahoze ari KIE ryari riherereye i Remera mu aKarere ka Gasabo, by\u2019umwihariko Indimi n\u2019Ubuvanganzo asoza mu 2017. Ni umukobwa w\u2019umuhanga kandi uganirana ubushishozi, iyo muvugana akubwira ko kugira ubumuga bw\u2019uruhu byigeze kumutera ipfunwe ariko ubu yamaze kwiyakira. Ubu ni Visi Perezida w\u2019Umuryango w\u2019Abafite Ubumuga bw\u2019Uruhu mu Rwanda, OIPPA.\nMukarusine Claudine ufite imyaka 28 wavukanye ubumuga bw'ruhu ukunda kuganira.Asanzwe ari umunyamideli ukomeye ndetse yanahagarariye u rwanda mu iserukiramuco ry'afurika ubumuga ryabereye muri Ethiyopiya 2018. ni umunyeshuri wavomye ku isoko y'umuziki, ariko aza kubiharira abandi. Yakuriye mu akarere ka kirehe mu intara y'uburasirazuba ari naho yigiye amashuri abanza n'ayisumbuye. ubu abarizwa ku akarere ka gasabo bitewe n'akazi, akaba akunze kuba mu akarere ka kayonza aho akora mu bjyanye no gufahsa mu iterambere ry'abafite ubumuga bw'uruhu.\nMu Indirimbo ya KING JAMES.\nMukarusine Claudine mu kiganiro na IGIHE yavuze ko akimara kumenya inkuru y\u2019uko King James ashaka umukobwa ufite ubumuga bw\u2019uruhu ujya mu ndirimbo, yabanje kubyibazaho byinshi. Yabajije uyu muhanzi n\u2019itsinda ry\u2019abantu bari kumufasha impamvu yatumye bifuza gukora muri ubu buryo, amaze gusobanukirwa yemera gutangira kumufasha. Yashakishije abandi bagenzi be babana n\u2019ubu bumuga ariko ngo uwo abonye agasanga hari ibyo atujuje bari bavuganye, uwo asanze abyujuje nawe agasanga kumukoresha bizasaba andi mabwiriza ahitamo kwitanga afasha King James ndetse n\u2019amashusho ayagiramo ubuntu. Ati \u201cNaje gusubira inyuma ndatekereza nsanga ibintu by\u2019ubuhanzi narabikundaga nkiri muto kuko najyaga nandika indirimbo nkanaziririmba cyangwa se ibintu by\u2019ubugeni. Kuko nabonaga bingoye kubona uwo bashakaga ndababwira nti ariko njye nshobora kubafasha nemera kujya muri iyo ndirimbo gutyo.\u201dMu bindi byagoye uyu mukobwa gufata umwanzuro, harimo ikijyanye n\u2019imyambarire iranga abakobwa bajya mu ndirimbo z\u2019abahanzi, rimwe na rimwe bambara bitandukanye n\u2019imyemerere ye.\nYari umwanditsi n'umuririmbyi.\nMukarusine Claudine Ati \u201cMu mashuri yisumbuye aho nize cyari ikigo cy\u2019ababyeyi b\u2019Abadivantisiti. Abana twiganaga iyo byaga ngombwa ko hari ibyo tujya kwerekana, hari indirimbo najyaga mbigisha kuko iyo twaziririmbaga njye numvaga amarira arimo kugwa mu mutima rimwe na rimwe yaranagwaga, zari iz\u2019agahinda\u201d. \u201cHari izindi najyaga ndirimba ngo abantu bamwe baricwa, abandi bararenganwa ariko nta muntu n\u2019umwe wajyaga abivumbura ko ariyo mpamvu\u201d.\nIbibazo bitangaje.\nMukarusine Claudine Uyu mukobwa avuga ko hari abantu bamwe bamubaza ibibazo bikamutangaza cyane, kubera kudasobanukirwa imibereho y\u2019abafite ubumuga bw\u2019uruhu. Hari nk\u2019abantu bajya bamubaza ngo ese wumva umeze neza, uzabyara umwana usa ate, umubyeyi wawe asa ate, umuntu agukozeho ntubabara n\u2019ibindi nk\u2019ibyo bigaragaza ukudasobanukirwa."}
{"id": "10530", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10530", "title": "Alice Nkulikiyinka", "text": "Alice Nkulikiyinka ni umuyobozi mukuru wa BPN Rwanda. BPN ifasha ba Rwiyemezamirimo n\u2019 abakozi babo guteza imbere ibicuruzwa na servisi byabo kugira ngo bashobore gufata umwanya ushimishije kandi urambye ku isoko. \n= Uburezi =\nMadamu Alice Nkulikiyinka afite impamyabumenyi y\u2019icyiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza mu ishami ry'ubukungu n\u2019ubumenyi bwa mudasobwa, yayikoreye muri kaminuza y\u2019ubumenyi ngiro ya Worms, mu Budage ndetse afite n'indi mpamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza mu ishami rya siyansi no gucunga no kwita ku makuru, iyi yayikoreye muri kaminuza ya Constance, mu gihugu cy'Ubudage.\n= Imirimo =\nMadamu Alice Nkulikiyinka ni Umuyobozi mukuru wa BPN Rwanda (Business Professionals Network), ikigo gitanga serivise zishinzwe iterambere ry\u2019ubucuruzi, mu Rwanda kuva mu mwaka wa 2011. Mbere yo gusubira mu gihugu cye, yakoze hafi imyaka cumi n'itanu mu rwego rw\u2019amabanki mu bigo byo mu Busuwisi Telekurs (Itsinda rya gatandatu) na Avaloq.\u00a0Nk'umuyobozi w'umushinga, Umuyobozi w'ibicuruzwa n'uyobora ishami, yayoboye amakipe mpuzamahanga i Zurich, London na New York City, n'ahandi hantu.\u00a0Ku masezerano yo mu mahanga, yayoboye kandi imishinga ya Banki muri Hong Kong na Singapore.\nInama y'Ubutegetsi abarizwamo.\nRDB (ikigo cya leta gifite inshingano zo kwihutisha iterambere ry\u2019ubukungu bw\u2019u Rwanda mu gutuma iterambere ry\u2019abikorera ritanga umusaruro batanga raporo ku biro bya Perezida) hamwe n\u2019umuyobozi w\u2019Inama Njyanama ya I&amp;M Bank (imwe mu ma banki y'ubucuruzi ateye imbere)."}
{"id": "10533", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10533", "title": "Hope Azeda", "text": "Hope Azeda (wavutse 1972) ni umugore watangije itorero mashirika na ubumuntu arts festival.\nUbuzima Bwite.\nHope Azeda yavukiye uganda, Amashuri abanza yayize ahitwa Nengo Primary School nyuma aza kujya muryitwa Namasagali College ryari ury'umupadiri w'umwongereza niho yavumbuye kwari umuhanzi akomereza Makerere University iherereye Kampala aho yakurikiranye ibintu bijyanye n'ubuhanzi.\nIbihembo yahawe.\nHope Azeda yahawe igihembo cya Arts Patron of the decade byateguwe na Rwema Arts biterwa inkunga na American Institute of Arts. Yongeye guhabwa ibihebwo byiswe Segal Center Awards muri 2021 nkumuhanzi wakomeje gufasha abantu kutigunga no mugihe cya Covid-19 ibi bihembo bitegurirwa mumujyi wa New York."}
{"id": "10534", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10534", "title": "Urwibutso Nicole", "text": "Ubuzima bwa mbere.\nNicole ni umukobwa wavukiye mu Karere ka Gasabo mu 1994, avuka ari umuhererezi mu muryango w'abantu batatu. Yabyaranye n'umukobwa n'umugabo we wakuriye mu nzozi za siporo na siyansi. Nicole yeguye ku butegetsi ahita yegukana igikombe cya shampiyona avuye i Kigali, atsinda APR WBBC. Mu 2019 yasubiye mu ikipe ya Kaminuza y'u Rwanda i Huye aho yigaga, akaba yari anashinzwe iterambere rya siporo muri kaminuza. Nicole akimara kurangiza kaminuza mu 2020 yasubiye mu ikipe yakiniraga ya IPRC HUYE. \nUmwuga.\nYatangiye gukina imikino itandukanye ku ishuri rye, ariko yibanda ku mukino wa Basketball cyane. Yitabiriye amarushanwa yo ku ishuri nka Ecole Notre Dame de la Providence Karubanda. Nicole yabaye kapiteni w'ikipe ye mu 2018. Ikipe yahise yegukana igikombe cya shampiyona i Kigali, itsinze APR WBBC. Mu mwaka we 2019 yasubiye mu ikipe ya Kaminuza y'u Rwanda i Huye aho yigaga ndetse akaba yari anashinzwe iterambere rya siporo muri kaminuza (Minisitiri wa Siporo). Nicole akimara kurangiza kaminuza mu 2020 yasubiye mu ikipe ya IPRC HUYE. "}
{"id": "10535", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10535", "title": "Musanabageni Claudine", "text": "Musanabageni Claudine yavutse kuwa 28/8/1996 ni umwe mu banyarwandakazi bakina Beach Volleyball kandi akaba akinira ikipe y'igihugu ya Beach Volleyball."}
{"id": "10536", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10536", "title": "Rita M. Kamanzi", "text": "Rita ni Umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe abakozi muri AOS Ltd kuva muri Nzeri 2015. Icyo yibandaho cyane ni ibikorwa by\u2019abakozi muri sosiyete. Yabanje gukorana n\u2019ibigo bizwi cyane byigenga n'ibigo bya Leta birimo KT Rwanda Network, Ikigo gishinzwe iterambere m\u2019u Rwanda (RDB), Ikigo gishinzwe ikoranabuhanga mu Rwanda (Rwanda Information Technology Authority) n\u2019Ishuri Rikuru Nderabarezi rya Kigali.\nAmashuri.\nAfite impamyabumenyi y'ikiciro cya kabiri muri Computer Science (kaminuza ya Bangalore) na MSc.IT, ishami rya Computer Science &amp; Software Engineering yo muri kaminuza yu Rwanda.\nInshingano.\nRita yabaye umuyobozi wa e-guverinoma mu gihe guverinoma y\u2019u Rwanda yashyiraga mu bikorwa ingamba zitandukanye za e-Guverinoma kandi inshingano ze zari uguhuza ibyo bikorwa byose ku rwego rw\u2019igihugu. Kuva icyo gihe yagize uruhare runini mu iterambere ry'u Rwanda muri ICT; bikubiyemo ibice byo gucunga imishinga, gushyiraho politiki, igenamigambi rikorwa no gushyira mu bikorwa, kimwe na M&amp;E. Yakoze cyane cyane mu nzego za Leta z\u2019u Rwanda mu bijyanye na ICT mu nzego zitandukanye kandi yiyemeje gukorera abikorera ku giti cyabo, hamwe n'uburambe n'ubumenyi afite."}
{"id": "10537", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10537", "title": "Akayesu Shalon Manzi", "text": "Akayesu Shalon yavukiye Kibagabaga kuwa 23 Ukuboza 2002, akaba amaze kuba kimenyabose ku mbuga nkoranyambaga ndetse no mu mashusho y'indirimbo z'abahanzi b'abanyarwanda. Dore ko uyu mukobwa yumvikanye bwa mbere mu ifungwa rya bimwe mu byamamare byo mu Rwanda birimo Davis D, ndetse yongera kutavugwaho rumwe ku mbuga nkoranyambaga ubwo yagiraga uruhare mu kwirukanisha umunyezamu Kwizera Olivier mu ikipe y\u2019Igihugu Amavubi."}
{"id": "10538", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10538", "title": "Riziki Chantal", "text": "Riziki Chantal nI Umuvugabutumwa mu Rwanda \nUbuzima bwite.\nRiziki Numukobwa wavukiye icyangugu akaba yaravutse aruku mugaturika ndetse akaba yarabaye numubikira mbere yuko yakira agakiza muri ADEPER.Riziki nyuma yaho yaje guhitama kuva mu kibikira aba umuvugabutumwa.Afite youtube channel yee avygiraho ubutumwa nyuma yuko atemeranyaga Nitorero kubuhanuzi Riziki Chantal imana yamutegetse kubwira abantu ko igihe cyuko abagabo bagiye kwifuza kwambara amajipo kigiye kugera. Riziki Imana yaramwiyetse imubwirako icyacumi ntamaturo ntaho birikwandikwa.\nUmwuga.\nUmuvugabutumwa Riziki Chantal ni umwe mu bantu bagiye bakorana n\u2019Imana imirimo n\u2019ibitangaza, azwi cyanee ku gitangaza Imana yamukoresheje ubwo Imana yamwoherezaga gutwika akabari kitwaga KADILAKE (cadillac) kagashya kagakonkoka.Umuvugabutumwa Rizki yigishije ijambo riboneka muri Matayo 25:31, havuga hati \u201c Umwana w\u2019umuntu ubwo azazana n\u2019abamarayika bose afite ubwiza bwe, nibwo azicara ku ntebe y\u2019Imana.\nIbindi wareba.\nvideo "}
{"id": "10540", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10540", "title": "Fiona Kamikazi Rutagengwa", "text": "Fiona Kamikazi Rutagengwa (Wavutse 1991)Ni niwe ushizwe comminikasiyo byumwihariko muri I&amp;M Bank Rwanda.\nUbuzima bwite.\nFiona Kamikazi ni we professional model hamwe na Premier Modeling Agency. Yavutse ku ya 20 Ukwakira 1991 i Kampala, muri Uganda, ni umwana wa mbere wa nyakwigendera Christopher Rutagengwa na Oriane Barahira. Kamikazi yize amashuri abanza kuri St. Joseph Kicukiro, icyiciro rusange yacyizel ku ishuri ry\u2019abakobwa rya FAWE naho icyo bakunze kwita A level ayiga muri Group Scolaire Karubanda.yakomeza amashuri ye muri kaminuza mu Ishuri ry\u2019Imari n\u2019amabanki (SFB) Gikondo.\nUmwuga.\nFiona ni inzobere mu by'itumanaho muri I&amp;M Bank Rwanda akaba n'umujyanama wa Digital Marketing ku masosiyete atandukanye yo mu Rwanda. Yabanje gukora mu buvugizi bwa Talent n'imibanire y'abakiriya mu burezi, itumanaho, ndetse n'amabanki. Numuntu uharanira imibereho, igice cyigihe cyo kwandika &amp; umusizi, numukunzi wa politiki."}
{"id": "10541", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10541", "title": "Karen Bugingo", "text": "Karen Bugingo (wavutse 1992) ni Umwanditsi w'ibitabo akaba akaba yarakize kanseri akanayandikaho igitabo cyitwa My name is Life.\nUbuzima Bwite.\nKaren bugingo yavukiye i kigali ababyeyi be bapfuye muri Genocide yakorewe abatutsi, amashuri abanza yayize muri La Colombiere ayisumbuye ayarangiriza muri Lycee de kigali, kaminuza ayiga Mount kenya aho yize ibyerekeye itangazamakuru.\nIbyerekeye igitabo cye.\nIgitabo cye kivuga kurugendo rwe nurugamba yarwanye rwa kanseri yarwanye kugeza ayikize avugako mubusanzwe akunda kwandika My name is Life akaba aricyo gitabo cya mbere yanditse akaba yararwaye kanseri yo mubwoko bwa Lymphoma izwi nka kanseri yo mumaraso. "}
{"id": "10542", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10542", "title": "Tina uwase", "text": "Tina uwase (Wavutse 1995) ni Rwiyemeza mirimo mu Rwanda \nAmateka.\nUwase Clementine (Miss Tina) yitarbiriya amarushanwa ahagarariye u Rwanda mu irushanwa rya Miss Supranational 2018,aza nokuba Igisonga cyambere cya miss Supranational 2018.Uyu mukobwa yubatse izina mu kumurika imideli akaba ubu abarizwa muri Pologne. akaba yaratangiye akora amakote yo mu bwoko butandukanye, yaba ikote n\u2019ipantalo bisa, ikote n\u2019ijipo ndetse n\u2019amakote maremare yonyine. Tina yagize igitekerezo cyo gutangira cyo gukora iyi myambaro nyuma ya 2018 ubwo yajyaga mu Rwanda, agashaka ikote ryiza ryo kwambara akaribura.\nUmwuga.\nUwase Clementine yatangije brand yise \u2018Tina Classic Suits\u2019 izajya ikora amakote (Suits) y\u2019abago\nIbindi wareba \nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nlSkMoWWFSg"}
{"id": "10544", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10544", "title": "SHIMWE CLAUDETTE", "text": "SHIMWE CLAUDETTE (Wavutse 2005) ni umukinnyi wo mumazi cyangwa se koga \nUmwuga.\nISHIMWE CLAUDETTE w\u2019imyaka 17 ubarizwa mu ikipe ya Cercle Sportif Karongi yitabiriye imikino Nyafurika y\u2019umukino wo koga yiswe \u201c14th CANA AFRICA SWIMMING CHAMPIONSHIP\u201d yabereye muri Ghana taliki 11 kugeza 16 Ukwakira 2021 akoresha amasegonda 46 n\u2019ibice 90 mu koga metero 50.Ishimwe usanzwe abarizwa muri Cercle Sportif de Karongi, ni umwe mu bakinnyi barindwi bakoze amakosa yatumye ibihe bari bakoresheje biteshwa agaciro mu masibo (heats) umunani yakinnye ku wa Kane.\nIbindi Wareba.\nhttps://www.newtimes.co.rw/sports/trio-gears-fina-world-championship"}
{"id": "10545", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10545", "title": "Marie Claire Mukasine", "text": "Mukasine Marie Claire (yavutse 1959) ni umunyamategeko w'umunyarwandakazi, umunyapolitiki n'umukozi wa Leta. Kuva mu 2011 kugeza 2019 yari umwe mu bagize Sena y'u Rwanda, kandi yabaye umunyamabanga uhoraho muri Minisiteri y'Ibikorwa Remezo mu Rwanda. Muri 2020 yagizwe Perezida wa Komisiyo y'igihugu ishinzwe uburenganzira bwa muntu mu Rwanda (NHCR). Mukasine Marie Claire kandi yakoze muri Sosiyete sivile nk'umunyamuryango uharanira uburenganzira bw\u2019umugore n\u2019umwana, Haguruka, yawuyoboye hagati yo mu mwaka 1994-1996, ndetse yabaye umwunganizi mu bigo bitandukanye bya leta yu Rwanda, Ku ya 8 Gicurasi 2020, Nirere yashyikirijwe inshigano nk'uwahoze ari Visi Perezida wa Komisiyo yitwa Silas Sinyigaya, amaze gukora manda ye imwe, yashizweho n' inama y'Abaminisitiri aho yari iyobowe na Perezida Paul Kagame ku ya 16 Kamena 2020.\nUburezi.\nMukasine afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu by'amategeko, impamyabumenyi ebyiri z'icyiciro cya kabiri mu micungire n'imiyoborere, na PhD mu by'amategeko. \nUmwuga.\nMukasine yagiye akora mu nzego zitandukanye z'ubuyobozi nk'umunyamabanga nshingwabikorwa wa Haguruka, umuryango utabara imbabare uharanira no kurengera uburenganzira bw'umugore n'abana. Yabaye umunyamabanga uhoraho muri Minisiteri y\u2019uburinganire n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019umuryango mu Rwanda. Yabaye kandi umuyobozi mukuru wa Rwanda Investment Group(RIG), n\u2019umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019isosiyete y\u2019ubwishingizi Sonarwa. Muri 2013 yari umuyobozi w'ikigo cy'igihugu cy'ubwishingizi. \nMu 2011, Mukasine yatorewe kujya muri Sena y'u Rwanda nk'uhagarariye Intara y'Amajyepfo, aba umusenateri kugeza muri 2019. Muri 2017 yari mu basenateri basaba ko imishinga y'iterambere mu karere yakurikiranwa vuba. Yabaye umwe mu bagize komisiyo ihoraho ya Senateri ishinzwe ibibazo bya politiki n\u2019imiyoborere myiza, maze mu 2018 yagaragaje ko ari ngombwa gutegura gahunda yo gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe abahoze ari imfungwa bahamwe n'ibyaha bya jenoside \nMukasine yabaye kandi perezida w\u2019umutwe w\u2019u Rwanda umutwe w\u2019abadepite bo muri Afurika barwanya ruswa (APNAC). \nKu ya 29 Kamena 2020, Mukasine yarahiriye kuba Perezida wa Komisiyo y'igihugu ishinzwe uburenganzira bwa muntu mu Rwanda (NHCR). Mu Kwakira 2020, yasabye Inteko Ishinga Amategeko kongera ingengo y\u2019imari ya NHCR no kuyiha icyicaro gihoraho i Kigali. "}
{"id": "10546", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10546", "title": "Alexia Mupende", "text": "Alexia Uwera Mupende (17 Ugushyingo 1984 - 8 Mutarama 2019) yari umunyamideli w\u2019umunyarwandakazi, umukinnyi w\u2019amafirime n\u2019inzobere mu bijyanye n\u2019isiporo rusange z'ifasha umubiri, igihe yapfaga, yari umuyobozi mukuru muri \"Waka Fitness\", i Kigali, umurwa mukuru w\u2019u Rwanda. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nAlexia Uwera yavukiye muri Kenya. Yize amashuri muri Uganda, ahabwa impamyabumenyi y'amashuri makuru muri Namasagali College mu Karere ka Kamuli. Yakomeje kubona impamyabumenyi y'amashuri yisumbuye muri St. Lawrence College, muri Uganda. Nyuma yibyo yimukiye mu Rwanda aho yarangirije impamyabumenyi ya Bachelor of Information Technology yakuye muri kaminuza y'u Rwanda. \nUmwuga.\nAlexia Mupende yari umunyamideli mpuzamahanga, wari uhagarariye u Rwanda, mu birori by'imyambarire yabereye i Kampala muri Uganda, Geneve mu busuwisi, Dubai, United Arab Emirates, Colombo, Sri Lanka na Mumbai, mu Buhinde. Kugira ngo yongere amafaranga yinjiza, yabaye umuyobozi mukuru wa \"Waka Fitness\", club ya fitness mu mujyi wa Kigali. \nUrupfu.\nKu mugoroba wo ku wa kabiri, 8 Mutarama 2019, umurambo wa Alexia Uwera Mupende wabonetse muri kimwe mu byumba byo kuraramo kwa se mu Murenge wa Nyarugunga, mu Karere ka Kicukiro, mu nkengero z'umujyi wa Kigali. Yari yatewe icyuma inshuro nyinshi. Abashinzwe umutekano mu Rwanda batangaje ko barimo gushakisha Antoine Niyireba, ufite imyaka 23, wari umukozi wo mu rugo kwa nyina wa nyakwigendera. Niwe wakekwagaho ubwicanyi. \nIbindi bitekerezo.\nIgihe yapfaga, yateganyaga gushyingirwa muri Gashyantare 2019, kandi ubutumire bw'ubukwe bwari bwashyizwe ahagaragara. "}
{"id": "10547", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10547", "title": "Kanyange Louise", "text": "Kanyange Louise umukobwa umaze imyaka irenga itanu akora ubugeni, umwuga yize, amaze gushushanya ibihangano byinshi, asanzwe anabimurika mu bigo bitandukanye.\nUbuzima bwite.\nKanyange Louise (yavutse mu 1999) ni umuhanzi w'umunyaRwandakazi ukunda gushushanya, gusiga irangi, kudizayininga, gushushanya, nibindi byose bijyanye na visual arts.Ubuzima, inzozi, ibidukikije, kwibuka, ninkuru zabantu bitera imbaraga mubyaremye.Kuva yiga ubuhanzi muri \u00c9cole d'Arts de Nyundoo (Ishuri rya Nyundo ryubuhanzi n\u2019umuziki), yagiye mu nzira yo kugera ku nzozi ze zo gutanga umusanzu we nk'umuhanzi kugirango ejo hazaza habe heza kurushaho.\nAho wamusanga.\nKanyange Louise Akunda gushyikirana n'abantu benshi binyuze mu kwerekana amarangi ya Live ndetse no mu imurikagurisha mu Rwanda no ku rwego mpuzamahanga, ibikorwa bye byerekanwe, cyane cyane ahabaye ibikorwa bya Baho Neza in Rwanda, umushinga wa Kabgayi Eye Unity in Rwanda, mu ihuriro rya Luanda Biennial Pan African for Culture and Peace muri Angola, \nIbihangano.\nKanyange Louise umukobwa umaze imyaka irenga itanu akora ubugeni, umwuga yize, amaze gushushanya ibihangano byinshi.\nIbihembo.\nKanyange Louise Muri 2017 yahawe igihembo na Imbuto foundation mu ubugeni Imbuto Foundation. Muri 2018 yaje mubahanzi 70 batoranyijwe mu gihugu hose in ArtRwanda-Ubuhanzi competition. Yakoranye na galeries na sitidiyo zitandukanye zirimo Inshuti Arts and Culture Centre iherereye mu akarere ka Musanze, Tuko Girls Arts kuri Kuuru Art Space i Kigali, ArtRwanda-Ubuhanzi na Envision Rwanda mu umujyi wa Kigali."}
{"id": "10549", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10549", "title": "Nirere Madeleine", "text": "Nirere Madeleine (Wavutse 1968) ni Umuvinnyi Mukuru \nUbuzima Bwite.\nNirere yize kaminuza akaba afite imanyabushobozi ya Bachelor mu mategeko hamwe na\u00a0 Mastazi muri Public Administration. Nirere afite burambe mu by'amategeko, mu burenganzira bwa muntu no mu buyobozi kimwe n'ishyaka ryo guharanira guteza imbere no kurengera uburenganzira bwa muntu byampaye ubuhanga bwo gusaba kuba umwe mu bagize itsinda ry\u2019imirimo ku kibazo cyo kuvangura abagore mu mategeko no mubikorwa, Ibihugu bya Afrika. akunda ibibazo byuburenganzira bwa muntu. afite uburambe burenga 5 mubikorwa byuburenganzira bwa muntu nkorera kurwego rwigihugu, kurwego rwakarere ndetse no kurwego mpuzamahanga. Byongeye kandi, yumva Sisitemu y'Uburenganzira bwa Muntu. yagize uruhare mu biganiro byo hejuru ku burenganzira bwa muntu byateguwe na ICC ubu GANHRI na OHCHR. Mubyongeyeho, ameze neza mu magambo no mu Cyongereza no mu Gifaransa.Ibi byose byongereye ubumenyi bwee mu makuru no kunganira. Mfite impamyabumenyi ya Bachelor mu by'amategeko, impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga mu buyobozi bwa Leta kandi yabonye muri kanama 2017 akaba afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu by'amategeko mpuzamahanga arengera uburenganzira bwa muntu n'ubutabera mpanabyaha, aho ubu ndimo gukora isomo ryanjye ku \u201ckurengera mu buryo bwemewe n'amategeko abagore bahohotewe. urugomo mu Rwanda \u201c. Ni umuryango cyane muburenganzira bwa muntu kandi nkagira uruhare mu kurengera abagore. "}
{"id": "10550", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10550", "title": "Julianne K. Kayonga", "text": "Julianne K. Kayonga ni umunyarwandakazi akaba umuyobozi wa Starbucks FSC Rwanda kuva muri 2016. \nAmashuri.\nJulianne afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bijyanye no guteza imbere umutungo kamere, yakuye muri kaminuza ya Texas A&amp;M, Inyemezabumenyi ihanitse y\u2019ububanyi n\u2019amahanga yakuye Ishuri rya Leta rya Bush n\u2019abakozi ba Leta muri kaminuza ya Texas A&amp;M, n'impamyabumenyi y'ikiciro cya kabiri mu by'amategeko yakuye muri kaminuza nkuru y'u Rwanda.\nAkazi.\nJulienne yabaye umuyobozi wa Starbucks kuva 2016.Mbere yo kwinjira muri Starbucks, yakoraga muri ACDI / VOCA u Rwanda mu kuzamura umutekano w\u2019ibiribwa mu gihugu Yagishije inama ku isuzuma ritandukanye ry\u2019ibidukikije ku mishinga ya USAID, kandi mbere yibyo, yakoraga nk'inzobere mu by'imari yo mu cyaro muri USAID Rwanda"}
{"id": "10551", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10551", "title": "Eugenia Kayitesi", "text": "Eugenia Kayitesi ni Umuyobozi mukuru w'ikigo gishinzwe gusesengura politiki n'ubushakashatsi (IPAR Rwanda) kuva muri Gashyantare 2014.\nAmashuri.\nAfite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu bumenyi bw'imibereho yakuye muri kaminuza ya Makerere, kandi afite impamyabumenyi ya MBA mu ishuri ry'imiyoborere rya Maastricht, mu Buholandi, ubu akaba akurikirana impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga ya PhD mu bijyanye n'ubucuruzi (Strategic Management) yakuye muri kaminuza y'ubuhinzi n'ikoranabuhanga ya Jomo Kenyatta.\nAmahugurwa.\nEugenia afite kandi inyemezabumenyi yiterambere ryumwuga mu micungire y\u2019ibyago muri Banking i Stockholm (Suwede) hamwe n\u2019ishuri ry\u2019imari n\u2019amabanki Kigali Rwanda. Yagiye agaragara mu mahugurwa yo mu karere no mu mahanga ndetse no mu nama haba nk'umwitabira ndetse n'umujyanama. Ubu ni Perezida wa Komite ishinzwe Politiki Nyafurika (ACBF) ishinzwe ubumenyi (PIC). Yerekanye impapuro mu nama z\u2019akarere n\u2019amahanga kandi yayoboye amahugurwa y\u2019igihugu, ibiganiro nyunguranabitekerezo hamwe n\u2019inama zimenyesha gufata ingamba.\nAkazi.\nUmuyobozi mukuru wa Ikigo gishinzwe gusesengura politiki n'ubushakashatsi (IPAR-Rwanda) kuva gashyantare 2014 kugera ubu. Akora mu kanama ngishwanama ka Portal Nyafurika ububiko bwubushakashatsi n\u2019ikigo cy\u2019isesengura ry\u2019impuguke ku bibazo bya Afurika giherereye muri Afurika yepfo kandi yicaye mu kanama k\u2019igihugu kigenga (NIRP) ku kigo gishinzwe gutanga amasoko ya Rwanda (RPPA) kuva mutarama 2014. Yabanje gukorana na Banki y\u2019ubucuruzi y\u2019u Rwanda mu gihe cy\u2019imyaka 10 aho yagiye akora imirimo itandukanye, harimo ariko itagarukira gusa, Ushinzwe gusesengura inguzanyo, Ushinzwe Inguzanyo, Ushinzwe iyubahirizwa n\u2019Ubuyobozi, hamwe n\u2019umuyobozi ushinzwe gucunga ibyago."}
{"id": "10552", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10552", "title": "Mukakayange Ang\u00e8le", "text": "Mukakayange Ang\u00e8le yari umunyapolitiki w'umunyarwandakazi. Niwe mugore wa mbere watorewe kuba umudepite mu Nteko Nshingamategeko y'u Rwanda. Ang\u00e8le Mukakayange yatorewe kuba Depite wa MDR-Parmehutu uhagarariye Butare mu matora rusange y'abadepite mu Rwanda 1965. Nyuma yatakaje umwanya mu matora yo mu 1969. \nIbyo yakoze.\nMukakayange Ang\u00e8le yari muri Repubulika ya mbere ari umunyarwandakazi wayoboye ibigo by\u2019amashuri yisumbuye, Aha ninaho Repubulika ya mbere bazanze Depitekazi Mukakayange Angela yaba umudepite aho yakomokaga i Butare. Ninaho aha rero ngo \u00a0haje gususzumwa basanga abagore bakwiye kuzamurwa mu ntera hashyirwaho n\u2019undi aba Minisitiri icyo gihe ngo hari taliki 06 Mutarama 1964."}
{"id": "10553", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10553", "title": "Kanyangeyo Agnes", "text": "Kanyangeyo Agnes, uzwi cyane nka Aggie, yavutse ku italiki ya 8 Ukuboza 1976 i Kasubi mu Mujyi wa Kampala, muri Uganda. Ni umwana wa gatandatu mu bana barindwi bavukiye mu muryango wa Bwana Kanyangeyo Marcel na Madamu Kanyangeyo Mukagasana Rosette.\nAgnes yari umunyarwandakazi w\u2019umunyapolitiki n'inararibonye mu nshingano za Leta., yabaye Umuyobozi w\u2019Ishami rishinzwe Ubushakashatsi n\u2019Igenamigambi mu Kigo cy\u2019Imisoro n\u2019Amahoro cy\u2019u Rwanda (RRA).Ku ya 26 Gashyantare 2022, nibwo Agnes yitabye Imana azize indwara ya kanseri y\u2019ibere yari amaranye imyaka itatu ayirwanaho kigabo. Yasize icyuho gikomeye mu muryango we ndetse no mu gihugu cyamwizeraga mu nshingano zitandukanye..\nAmashuri.\nYize amashuri y'incuke ya Namirembe, ishuri ribanza rya Mengo na Makerere College ya Makere ku rwego rwa O-level 'na A-level. Nyuma yize muri kaminuza ya Makerere aho yakuye impamyabumenyi y'ikiciro cya kabiri mu mibare(statistics) na Masters mu by'ubukungu bw'iterambere yakuye muri Williams College, Massachusetts muri Amerika.\nAkazi yakoze.\nMu gihe Agnes yari akiriho, yari Umuyobozi w\u2019ishami rishinzwe igenamigambi n\u2019ubushakashatsi mu Kigo cy\u2019imisoro mu Rwanda; akoroshya igenamigambi ryibigo, akabishyira mu bikorwa no gukurikirana amashyirahamwe yihaye intego mu gihe harebwa amakuru meza kandi yakoraga ubushakashatsi ku bibazo bikenewe kugira ngo imikorere inozwe.\nImibanire ye.\nAgnes yubahwaga cyane na bagenzi be; Agnes yari umuyobozi ugaragara muri urwo rwego nk'isesengura rya politiki y\u2019ubukungu kabuhariwe muri politiki y\u2019imisoro ndetse no gucunga imisoro. Yari afite uburambe bw'imyaka irenga cumi n'umunani, yakoranye n'abaterankunga benshi mu bushakashatsi no kwandika impapuro za politiki y'imisoro hamwe n'incamake kubafata ibyemezo.\nUbuhamya.\nAgnes yasobanuwe nk'icyitegererezo. Mugenzuzi wa ICTD Fabrizio Santoro ati \"Agnes yamfashije kwigirira icyizere muri njye no mu bandi bose bagize itsinda rye ry'ubushakashatsi - kuko numvaga ashimwa kandi akunzwe ku kazi. Umuyobozi witonda kandi wihangana, watanga ibitekerezo kandi akumva ibitekerezo bya buri wese. Nzahora nza ku mwibuka kandi ngerageze uko nshoboye kugira ngo nkurikize indangagaciro ye n'urugero rwe\""}
