{"id": "10561", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10561", "title": "Mukeshimana Assumpta", "text": "Mukeshimana Assumpta umunyarwandakazi ukora ibiganiro bya siporo mu Rwanda.\nAssumpta yatangiye gukora siporo muri 2011.bavugako umubare w\u2019abagore bakora mu itangazamakuru ugereranyije n\u2019uw\u2019abagabo uracyari hasi. Ibi bituma usanga hari n\u2019ibiganiro bimwe na bimwe bisa n\u2019ibyahariwe abanyamakuru b\u2019abagabo. Muri ibyo biganiro twavuga nk\u2019ibijyanye na Politike, ubukungu ndetse na Siporo.\nAssumpta Mukeshimana, umunyamakuru w\u2019umugore ukora mu ishami rya Siporo kuri TV1, akaba amaze imyaka isaga itanu akora aka kazi.yafashe icyemezo cyo gukora ibyo bagenzi be bamwe batinye, inzitane yahuye nazo n\u2019ibindi.\nImibereho y'umwuga.\nMukeshimana Assumpta abavugako umukobwa ukora ibya sport aba yarananiranye, abavugako aba ari umugore w\u2019 abakinnyi bose n\u2019abatoza, ni byinshi ariko umuntu iyo ukora akazi ugakunze, ibyo byose biza ubirebesha amaso, ubundi ugakomeza kubaho kandi unakora cyane..Mukeshimana avugako bitaba byoroshye ariko yasanze mu buzima bwose bisaba gukora amahitamo y\u2019ibyangombwa mu buzima. Kubihuza ntakundi ni ugukora akazi mu gihe cyako hanyuma mu mwanya karangiye akita no kurugo rwe. Nirinda kujya mu bintu byinshi byatuma mpuga kugirango umwanya mbonye nabo mu rugo bambone.Ikindi abwira igitsina gore icya mbere bakwiye kwiyumvamo ko bashoboye kandi bakirinda kugumana ibitekerezo bibabwira ko batakora neza, badafite ubuhanga. Ikindi bagakora cyane kuko ntabwo kuba umunyamakuru mwiza byizana bisaba gukora no gushirika ubute. Hanyuma byaba bibabaje U Rwanda ruri mu bihugu biha urubuga abagore, maze mu banyamakuru hakaba hakiri abacyumva ko badashoboye kandi barahawe umwanya.\nAho akora ubu.\nMukeshimana Assumpta ubu Akora muri CANAL PLUS RWANDA"}
{"id": "10562", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10562", "title": "Jane Uwimana", "text": "Jane Uwimana Umunyarwandakazi ukora umwuga Witangaza makuru ndetse akaba numuririmbyi usubiramo indirimbo bizwi nka\"karaoke\".\nJane Uwimana Kuva 2005 nibwo yatangiye Umwuga Witangaza makuru Kugeza nubu ariko 2008 Nibwo yatangiye kubifatanya Nogusubiramo indirimbo bizwi nka karaoke Nubu akibikora\nAho yavukiye..\nJane Uwimana yavukiye Inyamirambo.\nAho yakoze..\nYatangiye Akora kuri Radio Umucyo Aho yavuye ajya kuri City Radio(2006-2008).\nAho yanatangiye gukora Karaoke\nJane Uwimana Amaze Imyaka 14 akora karaoke Avugako biba bigoye kuku arakazi gakorwa ninjoro Abenci bakibeshya ko Ari uburaya, Abenci mubagabo Bamusaba ko batahana Bakeka ko Yigurisha\nJane Uwimana Yamenyekanye cyane akora kuri Radio10,(2008-2013).\nMuri Gicurasi 2013 Aho yaje guhagarika itangaza makuru kubera gutwita.\nYaje kurigarukamo muri 2014 Irangira, Agaruka akora kuri Lemigo TV, Ahava ajya kuri Royal FM, Aho yavuye 2016 Ajya kuri Kiss Fm, arinaho Akora Ubu."}
{"id": "10564", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10564", "title": "Mugabo Anna", "text": "Mugabo Anna ni umuyobozi w\u2019umurimo muri Minisiteri y\u2019abakozi ba Leta n\u2019umurimo mu Rwanda, arangwa no gushishikariza urubyiruko rwinshi kujya mu mahugurwa y\u2019ubuhanga kugira ngo babe abashoramari.\nUmusanzu.\nGashyantare 19 /2011 Mugabo Anna yahuye na Trivets Deepak hamwe n'abakozi mirongo itatu na batatu birukanwe kugirango bumvishe Deepak ko igomba gusubiza abakozi akazi kabo muri UTEXRWA. Mugabo yasobanuye ko guhagarika imirimo y'abakozi mirongo itatu na batatu ari ukurenga ku ngingo ya 33 y'itegeko ry'umurimo. Mu mategeko agenga umurimo ingingo ya 33 ivuga ko, \u201curutonde rwo kwirukana rugomba gukorwa hakurikijwe imikorere, impamyabumenyi y'umwuga, igihe umara mu kigo, n'inshingano z'imibereho.\u201d Amategeko agenga umurimo asobanura kandi ko umuyobozi yari akwiye gutanga integuza y'ukwezi mbere yo kurangiza kandi agaha abakozi inyungu zabo zanyuma, abakozi mirongo itatu na batatu ntibakire. "}
{"id": "10565", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10565", "title": "Nkuranga Lynder", "text": "Nkuranga Lynder ni umugore w'umunyarwandakazi wari ukuriye ubutasi mu mahanga mu rwego rw'u Rwanda rishinzwe Umutekano ubu ni umukuru w'urwego rushinzwe abinjira n'abasohoka.\nUbuzima bwite.\nAssistant Commissioner of Police (ACP) Nkuranga Lynder [wavutse muri 1982], niwe mugore wa mbere uyobora uru rwego rushinzwe imipaka, abinjira n'abasohoka, uburenganzira bwo gukorera mu Rwanda, inyandiko z'inzira, ubwenegihugu n'ibindi.\nNkuranga Lynder, ufite imyaka 40, afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bijyanye n'amahoro n'amakimbirane ndetse anitabira amasomo mu ishuri rya polisi rya Musanze. Amaze imyaka irenga icumi akora muri Polisi y'igihugu y'u Rwanda Umwuga we wabaye mwiza kandi byihuse kugeza ubu.\nImiromo yakoze.\nNkuranga Lynder yazamutse vuba mu mapeti mu gipolisi mu myaka igera ku 10, mu 2018 we n'abandi bagore babiri Rose Muhisoni na Teddy Ruyenzi bahawe ipeti rya ACP (Assistant Commissioner of Police). Lynder Nkuranga yari amaze umwaka umwe akuriye ishami ry'ubutasi mu mahanga mu rwego rw'u Rwanda rushinzwe umutekano National Intelligence and Security Services (NISS). Icyo gihe nibo bagore ba mbere bari bageze hejuru cyane mu mapeti y'igipolisi mu Rwanda, nyuma ya Mary Gahonzire wageze ku rwego rwa komiseri. Nkuranga yakoze imirimo itandukanye muri polisi irimo:"}
{"id": "10568", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10568", "title": "Mary Gahonzire", "text": "Ubuzima.\nGahonzire Mary yavukiye mu Rwanda, 1962. Yakuriye muri Uganda.Mu 1987, Gahonzire amaze kurangiza kaminuza, yasabye kwinjira mu gipolisi muri Uganda ayishyamo. Yabaye kandi Komiseri Mukuru mu gipolisi cy'u Rwanda.\nImirimo yakoze.\nGahongayire Mary yabaye umuyobozi mukuru w'apolisi y'igihugu mbere yuko agirwa komiseri mukuru w'ungirije b'urwego rushinzwe amagereza mu rwanda. ubu yahagaritse imirimo akaba Yagiye mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru."}
{"id": "10570", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10570", "title": "Sophie Nyirabakwiye", "text": "Sophie Nyirabakwiye, amaze imyaka irenga 15 mu iterambere ryigihugu ndetse n\u2019amahanga. yakoreye UNDP Niger aho yari ibidukikije ninzobere mu bijyanye n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere. Imyaka itatu akorera muri Nigeriya no gufatanya nizindi gahunda mubihugu duturanye byamuhaye kwerekana imiterere y\u2019ibinyabuzima n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe mu karere ka Sahel. \nAmashuri.\nSophie Nyirabakwiye Afite impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga mu bijyanye no gucunga ibidukikije yakuye muri kaminuza ya Cape Town. \nAkazi.\nSophie Nyirabakwiye, afite uburambe bwimyaka irenga 13 mu kazi mu iterambere ry\u2019igihugu ndetse n\u2019amahanga binyuze muri gahunda z\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye. Yakoze kandi muri UNDP u Rwanda nk'umuyobozi w'itsinda rishinzwe kurwanya ubukene na gahunda y'ibidukikije imyaka itanu. Muri kiriya gihe, Sophie yatsindiye ibihembo mpuzamahanga byo guhanga udushya kandi ashyigikira igipimo cyayo cyiza kugeza ku mugabane wa Afurika muri 2017 (YouthConnekt Africa). Iki gipimo cyari cyarakusanyije abafatanyabikorwa nka UNCTAD, AfDB, KOICA, AU, Fondasiyo ya Tony Elumelu, n'andi masosiyete. y'abikorera ku giti cyabo n'imiryango yo mu karere &amp; mpuzamahanga.\nYakoze muri Nigeria, Madagasikari, u Rwanda, Afurika y'Epfo na Senegali mu nshingano zinyuranye guhera ku nzobere mu bya tekinike kugeza ku muyobozi w'itsinda mu bice bitandukanye cyane cyane kubungabunga urusobe rw'ibinyabuzima, kuvugurura urusobe rw'ibinyabuzima, kurwanya ubucuruzi bw'ubuzima butemewe n'amategeko, kwangirika kw'ubutaka, imihindagurikire y'ikirere, ubukungu bw'icyatsi n'ubururu, guhangana n\u2019amazi y\u2019amazi, kugabanya ubukene binyuze mu mirimo y\u2019urubyiruko, kubona imari, gukora neza, imibereho irambye, n\u2019ibindi bice byiterambere ry\u2019ubukungu.\nUbuyobozi.\nYayoboye imiyoborere yizindi gahunda zagenze neza zirimo Imari y\u2019ibinyabuzima, gahunda yo kurwanya imihindagurikire y\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere, Iterambere ry\u2019imidugudu iteza imbere, Ubukungu bw\u2019ibidukikije bwagiye bukurikirana ibiganiro bya Politiki yo mu rwego rwo hejuru, Ubukene n\u2019ibidukikije, Ikigega cy\u2019ibidukikije, Ikigega cy\u2019ubutaka n\u2019ibidukikije, n'ibindi... Muri Madagasikari, akora nk'umujyanama wa tekiniki ushinzwe ibidukikije n'imihindagurikire y'ikirere. Yashyigikiye ishyirwaho rya gahunda yo kurwanya imihindagurikire y'ikirere, guteza imbere umushinga wo kwitegura (GCF), na gahunda igamije kurwanya icuruzwa ry\u2019ibinyabuzima bitemewe, imari y\u2019ibinyabuzima, ibinyabuzima byo mu nyanja no ku nkombe zo kubungabunga / kubungabunga ibidukikije, yashyigikiye ishyirwa mu bikorwa rya NDC, guteza imbere umutungo wa GCF., ibiganiro ku bukungu bwubururu."}
{"id": "10571", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10571", "title": "Yvonne Umulisa", "text": "Yvonne Umulisa ni inzobere mu by'ubushakashatsi, akaba n'umwalimu w\u2019ubukungu muri kaminuza y'u Rwanda mu ishami ry\u2019ubukungu.\nAmashuri yize.\nYvonne Umulisa afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu by'ubukungu mpuzamahanga n'iterambere yakuye muri Acad\u00e9mie Universitaire Louvain, mu Bubiligi na PhD mu by'ubukungu yakuye muri kaminuza ya J\u00f6nk\u00f6ping, Suwede (mu cyongereza: International and Development Economics from, Belgium and a PhD in Economics from J\u00f6nk\u00f6ping University, Sweden)\nAkazi akora.\nYvonne Umulisa yakoze muri MINECOFIN nk'umukozi ushinzwe Isesengura rya Politiki y'iterambere n'inzobere mu bushakashatsi (mu cyongereza: Development Policy Analyst and Research Expert\nMINECOFIN) Oct 2012 - Oct 2014. Kanama 2016 - Kugeza ubu ni umwalimu muri Kaminuza y'u Rwanda.\nUbushakashatsi.\nUbushakashatsi bwe bwibanze ku bukungu bwo guhuza amafaranga mu Karere ka. Kubera iyo mpamvu, yatewe inkunga n\u2019igitekerezo cy\u2019ahantu heza h\u2019ifaranga, ubushakashatsi bwe kugeza ubu bwibanze ku bukungu bw\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba (EAMU), kugira ngo butange ibimenyetso bifatika byo kumenyesha abafata ibyemezo by\u2019iterambere ry\u2019ejo hazaza. Ubushakashatsi bwe kugeza ubu bwasohotse mu kinyamakuru cyo kwishyira hamwe mu bukungu no muri Afurika y'Iterambere. Inyinshi mu myigishirize ye ikubiyemo Microeconomic Intermediate Microeconomics, Operations Research, Advanced Macroeconomics th\u00e9orie, Politiki y\u2019ifaranga n\u2019amafaranga na Banki haba muri kaminuza ndetse na master's program.\nIbitabo yanditse.\nUmulisa Yvonne muri (2016); Ingaruka z'ifaranga rusange ku bucuruzi hagati y'Akarere muri Afurika (Mu icyongereza: Effects of a Common Currency on Intra-Regional Trade in Africa).Ibitekerezo by'ubumwe bw'umuryango w'ibihugu bya Afrika y'Uburasirazuba. Muri Almas Heshmati (Iv.) Kwishyira hamwe mu bukungu, Ihuriro ry\u2019ifaranga, hamwe n\u2019iterambere rirambye kandi ryuzuye muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba (p. 77-96). Gusohora mpuzamahanga. DOI: 10.1007 / 978-3-319-30432-8_5.Umulisa, Y., &amp; Habimana, O. (2018). Inzira yubucuruzi Guhuza hamwe na Core-Periphery Ibishushanyo mubihugu bya Afrika yuburasirazuba: (mu icyongereza: Business cycle Synchronization and Core-Periphery Patterns in the East African Community)A wavelet approach, \"Journal of Economic Integration\", 33(4). 629-658. DOI: 10.11130/jei.2018.33.4.629Umulisa, Y. (2020). Kugereranya inyungu z'ubucuruzi bw'umuryango w'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba ziteza imbere ubucuruzi hagati y'Akarere, Isuzuma ry'iterambere rya Afurika, 32 (1), 55-66. DOI: 10.1111 / 1467-8268.12414 (mu Icyongereza: Estimation of the East African Community\u2019s trade benefits from promoting the intra-regional trade, \"African Development Review\", 32(1), 55-66. DOI: 10.1111/1467-8268.12414)\nIBYO YATANZE (Submissions).\nUmulisa, Y., (2020). Guhuriza hamwe mu bucuruzi no kuzunguruka mu bucuruzi Guhuza ibihugu bya Afrika y'Uburasirazuba. yashyikirijwe Ikinyamakuru mpuzamahanga cy'ubucuruzi (mu Icyongereza: Trade integration and Business Cycles Synchronization among East African Community Countries. submitted to \"the International Trade Journal.)\"\nHacker, S. na Umulisa, Y., (2021). Ibisanzwe mu nzego no ku kigero cy\u2019ibiciro by\u2019ifaranga mu bihugu byo m'Uburasirazuba bwa Afurika. Byoherejwe ku masoko Yimari n'ubucuruzi, Ikinyamakuru (mu Icyongereza: Commonalities in the levels and movements of inflation rates among countries in the East African Community. Submitted to \"the Emerging Market Finance and Trade Journal)\"\nHabimana, O., Sesay, V.A., Umulisa, Y., (2021). Ubucuruzi bw'inzira y'ubucuruzi muri ECOWAS: Intangiriro na peripheri. Byoherejwe mu kinyamakuru cya Asimmetries y'ubukungu (mu Icyongereza: Business cycle synchronicity within ECOWAS: The core and the periphery. \"Submitted to the Journal of Economic Asymmetries.)\""}
{"id": "10572", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10572", "title": "Mukantabana Mathilde", "text": "Mukantabana Mathilde (wavutse 1958) ni umunyapolitiki n'umudipolomate w'umunyarwandakazi wavukiye i Butare, kuri ubu akora nka ambasaderi w'u Rwanda muri Amerika akaba na Ambasaderi uhagarariye Mexico, Burezili, na Arijantine. Ni Perezida akaba ari nawe washinze umuryango udaharanira inyungu Friends of Rwanda Association (F.O.R.A). \nIbyo Yize.\nMukantabana Mathilde yize amateka n'ubumenyi bw'isi aho yabonye impamyabushobozi mu cyiciro cya kabili cya kaminuza muri kaminuza nkuru yu Burundi, yakomeje yiga amateka abona icyiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza hamwe na social work muri kaminuza ya Carifornia State univerisity iri sacramento muri Carifornia muri Amerika, akaba afite imypamyabushobozi y'ikirenga mu ndimi yakuye muri Carifornia State univerisity sacramento.\nIByo YAKOZE.\nMukantabana Mathilde afatanyije na UNDP Batangije umuryango social work, umuryango utigenga muri kaminuza nkuru y'u Rwanda mu myaka 1999, aho yari n'umwarimu muri kaminuza, akomeza no kuba muri mu nama y'ubutegetsi ya Sonoma State university, aho yigishaga amasomo ajyanye na genocide."}
{"id": "10573", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10573", "title": "Kantegwa Judith Heard", "text": "Kantengwa Judith Heard, ni umunyarwandakazi umaze kubaka izina mu kumurika imideli yegukanye ikamba rya Nyampinga atadukanye.\nUbuzima.\nKantegwa Judith Heard Uyu mugore w\u2019imyaka 34 y\u2019amavuko afite inkomoko mu Rwanda ariko uri Uganda ari naho atuye. akaba ari umunyamideli ukorera muri Uganda, yegukanye igihembo cya Nyampinga bitadukanye. Judith Heard ni Umunyarwandakazi uzwi mu kwerekana imideli, yubatse izina muri Uganda. Ni umubyeyi w\u2019abana barimo umwe yafashe akiyemeza kumurera ndetse n\u2019impanga yabyaranye n\u2019umugabo we, Umunyamerika Dr. Alex Heard unamwongerera imbaraga mu bikorwa bye byo kumurika no guhanga imideli. Gusa baje gutandukana mu 2019 nyuma y\u2019imyaka 13 babana. \nAmakamba yegukanye.\nKantengwa Judith Heard usanzwe abifite inkomoko mu Rwanda ndetse na Uganda, kuko afite se umubyara ari w'umunyarwanda akagira undi nyina w'umugandekazi. Ubwo yajyaga muri Nyampinga Miss Elite yavuzeko ahagarariye Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba kuko ababyeyi be bavuka mu bihugu bitandukanye rero hombi baramushyigikiye.\nAri umuyobozi.\nuyu Kantegwa yitabiriye urushanwa ryo guteka rya gorolla Highland Silverchef Competition 2019 ryabereye muri Five Volcanoes Boutique Hotel iri mu akarere ka Musanze rihuze abatetsi 13 baturutse mu bihugu nku Rwanda, Uganda, na Repubulika Iharanira Demukarasi ya Congo.Akaba yari umwe mubagize akanama nkemurampaka katanganga amanota harimo umunyarwandakaziuba muri uganda. Uyu mubyeyi w\u2019icyamamare muri Uganda Kantegwa Judith Heard asanzwe azwi mu kumurika imideli. "}
{"id": "10576", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10576", "title": "Mukabaranga Agnes", "text": "Mukabaranga Agnes ni Umunyarwandakazi w'Umunyapolitiki. ni umwe mu bagize Ishyaka Riharanira Demokarasi ya Gikristo (PDC) akaba n'umwe mu bagize Inteko ishinga amategeko ya Pan-Afurika ndetse akaba yarahoze mu Nteko Nshinga amategeko no muri Sena y'u Rwanda. Ni umunyamategeko wabigize umwuga. \nUmwuga wa politiki.\nMukabaranga yagizwe umunyamuryango wa mbere mu Nteko ishinga amategeko muri Leta y\u2019inzibacyuho nyuma ya jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda mu mwaka 1994 Mu mwaka 2003, itegeko nshinga rihoraho ryemejwe mu gihugu ryashyizeho igihugu cy\u2019amashyaka menshi gifite inteko ishinga amategeko igizwe na sena n\u2019umutwe w\u2019abadepite. Mukabaranga yagizwe senateri nyuma yo gutorwa kwa Perezida Paul Kagame agatorerwa kuba perezida wa mbere mu itegeko nshinga rishya. Yari umwe mu bagore 39 batowe cyangwa bashyizwe mu nteko ishinga amategeko muri uwo mwaka, ugereranije n'abagabo 41. Yarahiriye guharanira ubutabera n'ubwiyunge mu gihugu nyuma ya jenoside, yashimangiye uruhare rw'umugore muri iki gikorwa, agira ati: \"Abagore biteguye kurushaho kumvikana, bakunda amahoro kandi bafasha mu bwiyunge. Mu mwaka 2013, mbere yo kuva muri sena, Mukabaranga yatorewe manda y'amezi atandatu nk'umuvugizi w'ihuriro ry\u2019igihugu ngishwanama ku mashyaka ya politiki (National Consultative Forum), uruhare yagize ku bufatanye na Sylvie Mpongera wo mu ishyaka rya Gisosiyalisiti ry\u2019u Rwanda (Rwanda Socialist Party, PSR).\nUbuzima bwite.\nMukabaranga Agnes yabuze abavandimwe be muri jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda, kandi ni umubyeyi w'Abana bane. "}
{"id": "10577", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10577", "title": "Teta Gisa Rwigema", "text": "Teta Gisa Rwigema Umukobwa wa Maj Gen Fred Rwigema umuyobozi w'ishami ry'umuryango wa Afrika yunze ubumwe muri Minisiteri y'ubumwe n'amahanga n'ubutwererane yu Rwanda akaba yari aherutse gukora ubukwe nu mugabo we bakundanye kuva mu bwana witwa Marvin Manzi. Ubukwe bwitabiriwe na Peresida wu rwanda Paul Kagame. "}
{"id": "10578", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10578", "title": "Baguma Rose", "text": "Baguma Rose ni umunyarwandakazi akaba ari umugore w'ubatse urugo, Akaba ari impirimbanyi ya polikite mu burezi. Baguma rose wakoze muri minisiteri y'uburezi ubwo yari Umuyobozi Mukuru ushinzwe Politiki n\u2019Igenamigambi, ubu akaba akora mu mujyi wa kigali aho ari umunyamabanga mu nkuru w'inama y'ubutegetsi y'umujyi wa kigali.\nIbyo yakoze.\nBaguma Rose ni umwe m'ubagize urwego rw'uburezi mu Rwanda, aho guverinoma y\u2019u Rwanda yashyizeho ingamba zitandukanye, harimo wenda no kuvugurura amwe mu mategeko, bikorwa hagamijwe gukuraho inzitizi zihari zagiye zituma abantu batagira amahirwe angana mu bijyanye n\u2019uburezi, harimo wenda izishingiye ku gitsina, ku bumuga, agace umuntu aturukamo n\u2019ibindi."}
{"id": "10580", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10580", "title": "MUKAMANA Liberata", "text": "Mukamana Liberata ni umunyarwandakazi akaba umwarimu muri kaminuza y'u Rwanda, afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu by'ubukungu yakuye muri Kaminuza mpuzamahanga ya Kampala muri 2014 muri Uganda.\nAmashuri.\nLiberata MUKAMANA afite impamyabumenyi y\u2019ubukungu yakuye mu cyahoze ari kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda (2007), impamyabumenyi ihanitse muri Microfinance yakuye muri kaminuza ya Belgamo (Ubutaliyani, 2008), Impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza (mu icyongereza: Post Graduate Diploma in Gender and Local Economic Development from Makerere University (Uganda, 2011) mu bijyanye n'uburinganire n'iterambere ry'ubukungu muri kaminuza ya Makerere (Uganda, 2011), Master mu by'ubukungu yakuye muri kaminuza mpuzamahanga ya Kampala (Uganda, 2014). Kuri ubu (2018) umukandida wa PhD mu bushakashatsi bw\u2019uburinganire muri kaminuza ya Makerere, muri Uganda.\nAkazi.\nAmaze kurangiza icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza (Bachelor), yakoze nk'umukozi ushinzwe kegeranya ibimenyetso muri COPABU (Coperative des producteurs artisans de Butare) kuva 2006 kugeza 2007. Yari ashinzwe guhuza no kugenzura ibikorwa byose byo kohereza ibicuruzwa by'ubukorikori bya COPABU mu Butaliyani. Ibikorwa nyamukuru kwari ukugenzura ibikorwa by\u2019umusaruro mu cyaro, guteza imbere amahame y\u2019ubucuruzi bukwiye, gushakisha ibyangombwa byose bisabwa byoherezwa mu mahanga, gukorana n\u2019amasosiyete atwara ibicuruzwa biva mu Rwanda mu Butaliyani.\nNyuma y\u2019amasomo ya muri Microfinance mu Butaliyani, yinjiye muri kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda aho akora kugeza ubu. Yakoze kandi nk'umujyanama mu mahugurwa muri Gender Mainstreaming ku bakozi b'ikigo gishinzwe amakuru ya geografiya na Sensing ya kure (CGIS) n'ishami rya geografiya, Ishuri ry'ubumenyi n'ikoranabuhanga, kaminuza y'u Rwanda muri 2014.\nIbitabo yakoze.\nIgenzura ku mikoreshereze yinguzanyo nuburyo bwo kugabana uburinganire hagati yumurimo mubikorwa biterwa inkunga ninguzanyo: Urubanza rwa Duterimbere MFI mu Rwanda, rwasohotse muri Cogent Social Science 27 Ukuboza 2017, (mu icyongereza: Control over the utilization of the loan and the pattern of the gendered division of labor in the loan-funded activity: A case of Duterimbere MFI in Rwanda, published in Cogent Social Sciences 27 December 2017)\nGuteza imbere uburinganire bw\u2019umugabo mu kubona inguzanyo ziciriritse binyuze mu buryo bworoshye bwo gutanga inguzanyo ku bagore byibasira MFIs: Ibimenyetso byatanzwe na Duterimbere MFI yo mu Rwanda, byasohotse mu kinyamakuru mpuzamahanga cy\u2019ubucuruzi n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019ubukungu Vol. 4 No 3 Ugushyingo 2016 (mu icyongereza: Promoting gender equality in access to microcredit through flexible lending approaches of female targeting MFIs: Evidence from Duterimbere MFI of Rwanda, published in the International Journal of Business and Economic Development Vol. 4 No 3 of November 2016) \nMicrocredit yo guteza imbere ubushobozi butanga umusaruro wabakene: imyumvire yuburinganire mubakiriya ba Duterimbere MFI mu Rwanda yasohotse mu kinyamakuru mpuzamahanga cy\u2019ubuhanzi n\u2019ubumenyi rusange, Vol. 3 No 6 Kanama, 2015 (mu icyongereza: Microcredit for promoting the productive capacity of the poor: a gender outlook among the clients of Duterimbere MFI in Rwanda published in International Journal of Liberal Arts and Social Science, Vol. 3 No. 6 of August, 2015) \nUmusanzu w\u2019amashyirahamwe y\u2019abagore mu kuzamura ubukungu bw\u2019abategarugori muri Uganda, ubushakashatsi bwakozwe ku ishyirahamwe ry\u2019imiryango y\u2019abagore muri Uganda (Nawou), bwasohotse mu kinyamakuru cy\u2019u Rwanda Umubumbe wa 26, Urukurikirane B: 2012 Ubumenyi bw\u2019imibereho (mu icyongereza: The Contribution of Women Organizations to the Economic Empowerment of Craftswomen in Uganda, case study of the National Association of Women Organizations in Uganda (Nawou), published in Rwanda Journal Volume 26, Series B: 2012 Social Sciences) "}
{"id": "10581", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10581", "title": "Nishimwe Marie Grace", "text": "Nishimwe Marie Gr\u00e2ce ni umugore w'umunyarwandakazi akaba ari umunyapolitikekazi ukora mu mujyi wa kigali. Ni umuyobizi w'inama njyanama wungirije w'umujyi wa Kigai, akaba yaratowe muri 2021. Nishimwe Marie Gr\u00e2ce ni inzobere kandi akaba ari kabuhariwe mu bijyanye n\u2019imitunganyirize y\u2019umujyi n'imirwa mikuru, yabyize muri Kaminuza ikomeye ku isi y\u2019Ikoranabuhanga yo muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika (muri Massachusetts Institute of Technology). Afite Impamyabumenyi ihanitse ya kaminuza mu by\u2019amategeko n\u2019ubushabitsi (Masters\u2019s degree). Nishimwe Marie Gr\u00e2ce afite inararibonye mu gukemura amakimbirane ashingiye ku butaka, akaba yaragize uruhare rugaragara mu gutegura Politiki n\u2019amategeko mu bijyanye n\u2019ubutaka. \nIbyo Yakoze.\nNishimwe Marie Grace akora mu ishami rishinzwe imicungire y\u2019ubutaka mu cyigo gishinzwe ubutaka, aho yageze hariho ihame ryitwa iterambere ryiyongera, aho nk'urugero, avugako niba umuntu afite gahunda yo kubaka inyubako y\u2019amagorofa 15, atazasabwa kuyazamurira rimwe yose."}
{"id": "10583", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10583", "title": "Umutesi Geraldine", "text": "Umutesi Geraldine ni umugore w'umunyepolike w' umunyarwandakazi. uyu Umutesi Geraldine akaba akora mu umujyi wa Kigali, akaba kandi ari umuyobozi mukuru w'ungirije w'imbuto Foundation mu Rwanda.\nUbuzima bwite.\nUmutesi Geraldine ni umubyeyi ufite umugabo ndetse n'abana babili. Umutesi Geraldine yize amashuri y'isumbuye yiga amasomo ajyanye n'uburezi, ndetse azano gukomeza kwiga ibijyanye n'uburezi mu mashuri y'akaminuza. Umutesi Geraldine arangije kwiga yakoze ku bw'ibutso rwa genocide ku gisozi (Kigali Genocide Memorium)."}
{"id": "10584", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10584", "title": "Jeanne d'Arc Uwimanimpaye", "text": "Jeanne d'Arc Uwimanimpaye (yavutse 15 Kanama 1978) ni umunyarwandakazi w'umunyapolitiki. Yabaye umunyamuryango w'inteko ishinga amategeko Umutwe w\u2019abadepite kuva mu 2008. Kuva mu 2013 kugeza 2018, yabaye Visi Perezida w\u2019Umutwe w'abadepite. Uwimanimpaye Jeanne d'Arc yagiye agira ibwirwa ruhame zizi kandi zikomeye nkaho yavuzeko, igihugu cyacu cy\u2019u Rwanda cyari gisanzwe gifite ubundi ikirere kiza ndetse ko ari na byo byatumye abantu benshi birara ntibashyireho ingamba zihamye kandi zifatika zo guhangana n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere, yibasira ibihugu bitandukanye mu biyaga bigari birimo n\u2019u Rwanda hatari ikibazo cy\u2019 inzara atari byo namba, ahubwo ko icyabaye ahubwo ari ibura ry\u2019umusaruro w\u2019ubuhinzi uhagije mu baturage bigatuma abantu batabona amafunguro menshi kandi meza, nk\u2019uko byari bisanzwe, bakabifata nk\u2019ikibazo cy'inzara ariko atari byo.\nUbuzima.\nUwimanimpaye Jeanne d'Arc yarangije muri Economics muri kaminuza nkuru y'u Rwanda. Mbere yo kwinjira mu Nteko, yakoraga nk'umwarimu w\u2019ishuri ry'isumbuye, ndetse no mu nzego z'ibanze nk'umugenzuzi w'imbere mu karere akaba n'umukozi ushinzwe imibanire rusange.\numwuga.\nUwimanimpaye yinjiye mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko mu matora y\u2019abadepite yo mu Rwanda mu 2008, nk'umwe mu bahagarariye abagore batandatu mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba. Mu mwaka wa 2010, yagiye mu Bwongereza nk'indorerezi y'amatora ya Commonwealth ku matora rusange yo mu Bwongereza 2010. \nMu matora y\u2019abadepite 2013, Uwimanimpaye yasubijwe mu mutwe w\u2019abadepite nk'uhagarariye abagore mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba. Mu Kwakira 2013, yatorewe kuba Visi Perezida wungirije ushinzwe kugenzura no gushyiraho amategeko, ahabwa amajwi 70 kuri 80. Nk\u2019Umuvugizi wungirije, yerekanye icyifuzo cyo kwemerera Perezida Kagame kwiyamamariza manda ya gatatu, nyuma y\u2019uko icyifuzo cyari kimaze gusinywa na miliyoni 3.8\nUwimanimpaye yatoranijwe nk'umukandida wa FPR-Inkotanyi mu matora y'abadepite yo mu 2018, atorerwa guhagararira Akarere ka Gatsibo mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba. Yeguye ku mwanya wa Perezida wungirije, asimburwa na Edda Mukabagwiza wa FPR-Inkotanyi. Muri Nzeri 2019, Uwimanimpaye yasabye ko hakorwa iperereza ku kibazo cy\u2019amafaranga cyerekeranye n\u2019amasoko yatanzwe n\u2019ikigo cy\u2019ubuhinzi cy\u2019u Rwanda, kandi anenga amasoko yatanzwe n\u2019ikigo gishinzwe amakoperative mu Rwanda. "}
{"id": "10585", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10585", "title": "Rwigamba bella", "text": "Rwigamba Bella ni umunyarwandakazi akaba ari y\u2019UUmukozi wa Minisiteri burezi (MINEDUC) aho ushinzwe ikoranabuhanga, Bella RWIGAMBA ni Umuyobozi mukuru wa Digital ushinzwe uburezi muri minisiteri y'uburezi. Mbere yo kwinjira muri Minisiteri y\u2019Uburezi, yakoranye mu rwego rw\u2019ingufu na Bboxx isosiyete ikorera mu Bwongereza aho yakoraga nka Master Data Analys ndetse no mu rwego rw\u2019imari aho yakuriye ishami ry\u2019Ubucuruzi muri RSwitch National e-payment switch ishami ryu Rwanda. \nAmashuri.\nRwigamba Bella afite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza mu iterambere rya sisitemu no gutanga amakuru yakuye muri kaminuza ya HAN yomu Buholandi na BBA impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabili cya kaminuza mu micungire y'amakuru (Information Management) yakuye muri kaminuza y'Abadiventisti bo muri Afurika yo hagati (Adventist University of Central Africa)."}
