{"id": "10591", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10591", "title": "Amelia Umuhire", "text": "Amelia Umuhire (yavutse 1991) ni umuyobozi wa firime yu Rwanda nu Budage, producer, n'umwanditsi.\nUbuzima.\nUmuhire yavukiye i Kigali, mu Rwanda mu 1991. Afite bashiki be babiri, Anna Dushime, umunyamakuru muri Buzzfeed, na Amanda Mukasonga, bakinnye na Umuhire. Nyina Esther Mujawayo numurwanashyaka kandi uvura ihahamuka. Muri jenoside yo mu Rwanda 1994, ise na nyirasenge barishwe bazira ko bari abatutsi. Umuhire yahungiye mu Budage akiri \u0431\u0430\u0448, yiga kandi ahabwa umuhanga kUbudage \u0441\u0441 11. Amaze gukura, \u043d\u0438\u0437\u0438\u043d\u0433 \u043d\u0438\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0433\u043c\u0430 n'intego mumico nyafurika na Amerika.Umuhire yimuk i i Vienne mat matari i Berlin.Muri 2015, yerekanwe bwa mbere mubuyobozi hamwe nurubuga ruzwi cyane rwa \"Polyglot\". Yakiriye igihembo cyiza cyurubuga rwubudage. Umuhire yayoboye film ngufi \"Mugabo\" muri 2016. Ifata amashusho i Kigali, igaragaramo Afro-Burayi ifata uruzinduko mu Rwanda ku nshuro ya mbere kuva jenoside yo mu 1994.Yayoboye videwo yashinzwe ikoreshwa nkigikorwa cyo kuzenguruka isabukuru yimyaka \"20 ya Miseducation ya Lauryn Hill\"Muri 2018, Umuhire yayoboye podcast yubuzima bwa se.Yiswe \"Vaterland\", yatowe muri Prix Europa. Yayoboye amashusho ya \"King Who\", yafatiwe amashusho kwa nyirasenge, muri 2019. Umuhire yahawe igihembo cya Villa Romana muri 2020Yakoze amajwi yubushakashatsi hamwe namashusho ya \"Kana\" kubyerekeranye nubuzima kuri Mars muri 2020\nbikorwa bye byerekanwe mu birori byinshi bya firime, harimo MOCA Los Angeles, MCA Chicago, Iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Tribeca, Iserukiramuco rya Filime ry\u2019Abanyamerika muri Smithsonian, Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filimi Rotterdam."}
{"id": "10593", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10593", "title": "Masinzo alice", "text": "Masinzo Alice ni Umunyamakuru w'umusiporitifu wo kuri Radio Rwanda ushimisha abamukurikiye kubera amagambo avuga ari mu kiganiro kuri radiyo akaba akora kuri Mgic Fm. Uyu mukobwa ufite n\u2019impano yo kuririmba cyane munjyana ya gakondo avuga ko yabikuye kuri papa we, avuga ko avuka mu muryango avukamo ariwe wanyuma yakuze ari umwana ufashwe neza cyane ko yavutse ari n\u2019umukobwa umwe. kuba ari munini ntacyo bimutwara."}
{"id": "10595", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10595", "title": "Kentha Kirezi", "text": "Kentha Kirezi akaba ari umwe mu banyarwandakazi w'umunyamideli kuri ubu ubarizwa muri London kubera impamvu z'akazi."}
{"id": "10596", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10596", "title": "Jennifer Girukwishaka", "text": "Jennifer Girukwishaka yari mu banyamideli batanu bagaragaye mu cyumweru cy\u2019imyambarire ya Paris umwaka ushize. Yagaragaye mu gitaramo mpuzamahanga cyo guhaguruka ku nshuro ya mbere mu Kwakira i Paris, mu Bufaransa. Ari munsi yikigo cyerekana imideli kuva mubutaliyani, Ubwongereza, Ubufaransa, USA na Uno ikorera muri Barcelona na Madrid."}
{"id": "10597", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10597", "title": "Habimana Mugwaneza Claudette", "text": "Habimana Mugwaneza Claudette ni umunyarwandakazi akaba ari umubyeyi, umuyobozi, umutoza, akaba azwi ku izina rya Bucumu muri Basketball ya bagore. Habimana Mugwaneza Claudette akaba yarakiniye ikipe zitadukanye hano mu Rwanda harimo n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Basketball ya bagore, ubu akaba ari umuyobozo numujyanama w'ibyatekinike wa FERWABA (ishyiramwe ry'umukino wa basketball ya bagore mu Rwanda)."}
{"id": "10600", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10600", "title": "Makeda", "text": "Makeda Mahadeo yavukiye muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe Z'Amerika mu 1987.\nUbuzima bwe bwite.\nMakeda yakuriye muri Jamaica ari naho yigiye kugeza muri Kaminuza avanayo impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya Kaminuza mu Buvanganzo bw'Icyongereza, Umugabo we akaba yitwa Haguma Sacha.\nNI umukobwa wabyawe na se w'umunyarwanda Aloys Karamuheto(wamamaye nka Bongoman) naho Nyina w'umunya -Jamaica Ann Marie Witter, Bongoman umubyeyi wa Makeda wari umuhanzi akaba n'umu DJ wamamaye mu Rwanda mu njyana ya Reggae, yacurangiye mutubyiniro twakunzwe cyane mu Mujyi wa Nairobi ndetse n'i Kigali.\nMakeda avukana n'abavandimwe be barimo uwitwa Gicari na Jeffrey, uyu mukobwa yaje kuba mu Rwanda amaze kuba mukuru kuburyo mu myaka mike ahamaze atarabasha kumenya kuvuga ikinyarwanda gusa mubyo akora yihata cyane kwiga kukivuga.\nUmwuga.\nMakeda yanyuze kuri contact FM aho yakoraga ikiganiro THe Switch yakoreye Televisiyo y'u Rwanda yisanzura mu kiganiro \"Rise and Shine Rwanda \". yaanakore Journal.rw ubu akorera CNNB Afurika.Muri 2019 Makeda yabaye umukemurampaka muri East African Got Talent."}
{"id": "10601", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10601", "title": "Christine Baingana", "text": "Bayingana Christine ni umunyarwanda kazi, akaba ari umuyobozi mukuru wa Urwego Bank ikorera mu Rwanda, aho yatangiye kuyiyobora muri 2017. Christine Bayingana akaba yaratoranijwe nkumwe mu bakozi yagize b\u2019inyangamugayo. \nAmashuri yize.\nBayingana Christine yize amashuri yisumbuye muri Kibuli H. School yo muri uganda mu ishami ry'imibare n'ubukungu, amasomo ya Kaminuza yayakomereje mu Cavendish College ndetse na New Port University zo mu Bwongereza. Aha yahakuye impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya Kaminuza muri Business Administartion.\nYize kandi muri Havard University Kennedy School of Government, aho yakuye impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu cya Kaminuza muri \" Public Administration\".\nIbyo Yakoze.\nBayingana Christine kandi yakoze imyaka irindwi mu yahoze ari Banki y\u2019ubucuruzi iterambere n\u2019inganda mu Rwanda yitwaga BCDI. Aha yahakoze nk\u2019umuyobozi ushinzwe ibijyanye n\u2019amakarita y\u2019ikoranabuhanga, nyuma yaho aza kugirwa umuyobozi ushinzwe abakiliya bakiri bato, muri ya 2002 na 2005 yabaye umuyobozi mukuru wa Imprimerie Nouvelle du Rwanda, kuva muri 2006 kugeza mu 2009 aba umuyobozi ushinzwe gahunda muri Tulane University yo muri Amerika. Yamaze imyaka 11 kandi ari umukozi w\u2019umuryango wa gikirisitu, Hope International, aho yakoze nk\u2019umuyobozi ushinzwe Ibikorwa by\u2019ubucuruzi nyuma aza kuba umuyobozi mukuru muri Afurika.\nIbihembo.\nBayingana Christine yari mu bagore 10 bari kugira uruhare rukomeye mu guteza imbere no kuvugurura imikorere y\u2019Urwego rw\u2019Imari ku mugabane w' Afurika, aho yaje ku mwanya wa gatandatu kurutonde rugaragaraho abagore bo muri Afurika bakora mu nzego zitandukanye z\u2019imari, zirimo ibigo by\u2019ishoramari, amabanki n\u2019ibigo by\u2019ubwishingizi bizwi nka \u2018Angaza Awards\u2019."}
{"id": "10602", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10602", "title": "Murekatete Bella", "text": "Umunyarwandakazi Murekatete Bella wakoze amateka akomeye mu mukino wa Basketball y'abagore. \nUbuzima.\nMurekatete Bella avuka mu aKarere ka Huye ho mu intara y\u2019amajyepfo yakiniye ikipe y\u2019igihugu y\u2019abangavu\u00a0 baterengeje imyaka 16 ibyo byamuhesheje amahirwe yo guhita abona ikipe muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika.\nBasketball.\nMurekatete Bella\u00a0 ubusanzwe ni umukinnyi w\u2019ikipe y\u2019igihugu ya Basketball y\u2019abagore\u00a0 kuri ubu yamaze gusinyira ikipe ya Washington University, isanzwe ikina muri Women NBA, aya ni aba amahirwe kuri we atarigeze akorwa n\u2019undi munyarwandakazi\u00a0 uwo ariwe wese ukina uyu mukino. Murekatete Bella ni we munyarwanda wa mbere ugiye gukina Women NBA. Yasinyishijwe niyi kipe y\u2019i Washington\u00a0 amasezerano y\u2019imyaka\u00a0 4 akinira iyi kipe iri muzikomeye mu mukino w\u2019intoki\u00a0 wa basketball\u00a0 muri Women NBA hariya muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika, Bella azakinira iyi kipe ya kaminuza akazaba yiga no muri iyi kaminuza."}
{"id": "10603", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10603", "title": "Therese Bishagara Kagoyire", "text": "Therese Bishagara Kagoyire (25 Ukuboza 1952 - 8 Nyakanga 2019) yari umunyarwandakazi w'umunyapolitiki. Kuva mu 2011 kugeza 2019, yabaye umwe mu bagize Sena y'u Rwanda. Yari umunyamuryango wa Rwanda Patriotic Front (FPR).\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nBishagara yakuriye muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo aho yakuye impamyabumenyi ihanitse. Yari afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bumenyi bw\u2019ibinyabuzima. \nUmwuga.\nBishagara yakoze ubushakashatsi muri Programme de la Lutte Contre le SIDA et les Infection Indwara zandurira mu mibonano mpuzabitsina,kandi yabaye n\u2019ubunyamabanga buhoraho bwa komisiyo y\u2019igihugu ishinzwe kurwanya SIDA, Yabaye Umuyobozi w'Ikigo cy'ubuvuzi cya Kigali (1996\u20132004). Yabaye umwarimu w'igihe gito muri kaminuza nkuru y'u Rwanda (1999\u20132003). \nYakoze nka Resident Advisor Feature International / Easure Evaluation / USAID kuva 2006 kugeza 2007. Yabaye umujyanama wa tekinike muri Save the Children UK mu 2006, ndetse no muri PSI - Ibiranga gukumira VIH (2005\u20132006). Kuva mu 2008 kugeza 2011, Bishagara yari umuyobozi wa gahunda y'igihugu ya Jhpiego / MCHIP International, umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta ukorana na kaminuza ya Johns Hopkins (USAID). \nYakoze mu myanya y'abagize inama y'ubutegetsi muri White Ribbon Alliance for Motherhood Safe (2007\u20132011), Universit\u00e9 Libre de Kigali (2008\u20132011) hamwe n'ikigega cyo gutera inkunga iterambere ry\u2019u Rwanda, Rwanda Local Development Support Funds (2007\u20132011). Yari umunyamuryango wa Association d'Ex\u00e9cution des Travaux d'Int\u00e9r\u00eat Public (ASSETIF). Yabaye perezida wa Profemmes Twese -Hamwe na COCAFEM / Ibiyaga Bigari (2007\u20132011). Bishagara yinjiye mu nteko ishinga amategeko mu mutwe wa Sena y'u Rwanda muri 2011, nk'uhagarariye Intara y'Iburengerazuba. \nUrupfu.\nBishagara yararwaye muri Mata 2019. Yapfuye ku ya 8 Nyakanga 2019 mu bitaro bya Johns Hopkins, Baltimore, Maryland, muri Amerika Yashyinguwe mu irimbi rya Rusororo i Kigali. "}
{"id": "10604", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10604", "title": "Kubwimana Masimbi Sonia", "text": "Sonia Kubwimana n'umuyobozi w'ubucuruzi bw'u Rwanda afite umwuga mubukungu, abakozi n'Ubuyobozi Rusange bumara imyaka 25. Mu mibereho ye yose, yagiye akora mu ubuyobozi bukuru bw'imari muri Bralirwa Plc,Isosiyete ikora Heineken mu Rwanda.\nAmashuri.\nSonia afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu by'ubukungu n'ubuyobozi yakuye muri kaminuza y'i Uburundi n'uburezi bukuru (executive education) yakuye muri INSEAD, IMD, London Business School n'Ishuri ry'ubucuruzi rya Harvard (Harvard business school).\nIndimi.\nAzi neza I Kinyarwanda, Igifaransa n'Icyongereza.\nAmateka na Kazi.\nAmateka.\nMu gihe yari umuyobozi ushinzwe abakozi muri Bralirwa (2009-2017), Sonia yatsinze yayoboye gahunda ya Rubanda na Organisation yasabwaga gutera inkunga Isosiyete ubwihindurize kuva kumwanya wambere wiganje kumasoko kugeza kurushanwa no kubakoresha guhangana na Sosiyete. Impinduka zakozwe zirimo kuvugurura Umuryango muri byose amashami, guteza imbere imikorere, imiyoborere n'ubuyobozi mu Ishirahamwe kimwe no guha abakozi imyitwarire ikenewe kugirango batsinde mu bucuruzi.\nByongeye kandi, mugihe kimwe, nubwo kwiyongera kubuhanga mu Rwanda no hanze, Bralirwa yashoboye gukomeza umwanya wa \"Umukoresha wo guhitamo\" no gukurura kandi ushake abanyamwuga babishoboye kurwego rwabato, hagati na bakuru mugihe nabo bakomeza ibyiza urwego rwo gusezerana mumuryango. Na none kandi umwe mubagize komite nyobozi ya Bralirwa,yagize uruhare rukomeye kandi ruha agaciro ubujyanama.\nAkazi.\nKuri ubu Sonia ni umuyobozi w'ubucuruzi mu nzego za kawa n\u2019ubukerarugendo mu Rwanda, umujyanama n'umutoza wigenga wabigize umwuga wo gutoza nyobozi no korohereza serivisi binyuze muri Breakfast Club Afrika, umuryango w'abanyamuryango ba Panafrican ufite intego imwe yo gufasha abayobozi b'imiryango kuba abayobozi beza, bityo bikagirira akamaro imiryango yabo n'abakozi. Breakfast Club africa (BCA) ifite abanyafurika benshi mubihugu birimo Siyera Lewone, Gana, Nijeriya, Malawi, Kenya, u Rwanda, Afurika y'Epfo, n'icyerekezo cyo kurushaho kwaguka kumugabane wa Afrika yose.\nByongeye kandi, Sonia ari mumashyirahamwe atandukanye yabanyamuryango babigize umwuga harimo Ihuriro Mpuzamahanga rya bagore Kawa Ihuriro (Umutwe wu Rwanda), Ubukerarugendo nu Ishyirahamwe mu Rwanda (RTTA), Ishyirahamwe ryakira abashyitsi mu Rwanda (RHA), Abagore b'Abanyafurika Gahunda yo kwihangira imirimo (AWEP) na Rotary International (RI). Akorera kandi ku Inteko rusange yimidugudu yabana ba SOS Rwanda kandi yahoze mubuyobozi bw' Inama y\u2019umurimo mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "10605", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10605", "title": "Tierra Monay Henderson", "text": "Tierra Monay Henderson Ni umukobwa ni umukinnyi w\u2019Ikipe y\u2019Igihugu ya bagore ya Basketball akaba yatowe muri batanu beza b\u2019irushanwa u Rwanda kwitabira.\nUbuzima.\nTierra Monay Henderson w\u2019imyaka 34, avuka i Pasadena muri Californiya. Yatangiye gukinira u Rwanda mu myaka 11 ishize nk\u2019umwe mu bakinnyi b\u2019abanyamahanga bitabajwe ngo bafashe amakipe y\u2019Igihugu mu byiciro bitandukanye.Tierra Monay Henderson usanzwe ukinira Phoenix Constanta yo muri Romaniya."}
{"id": "10607", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10607", "title": "Mutoni Saranda Oliva", "text": "Mutoni Saranda Olive ni umukobwa wimyaka 19 w'umusizi n'umunyamakuru, akaba n'umurwanashyaka wa Imfura Arts For Peace, wavukiye kandi akurira mu Rwanda, Saranda yari afite imyaka 13 gusa ubwo yatangiraga kwandika ibisigo bye SUGAR DADDY ni kimwe mubisigo bye byagize ingaruka nziza mubuzima bw'abantu.\nAmashuri na Kazi.\nOliva mutoni ni umunyeshuri wifuza gucunga neza kwakira abashyitsi no mu bukerarugendo kuba, akora cyane ashishikajwe no gucuruza abashyitsi ndetse n'ubukerarugendo, ashishikajwe no kwiga no kugira ubumenyi bushya. Byaragaragaye ko ari umutungo w'agaciro ufite umwuka wo gukorera hamwe no gushakisha amahirwe murwego rwo kwakira abashyitsi n'ubukerarugendo aho ubumenyi bwanjye n'ubuhanga byanjye byakoreshwa mugihe cyo kwiga. ni umukinnyi wa filime ufite urukurikirane rukomeje ruzwi nkibanga rinyura kumurongo wa interineti uzwi nka topline TV, ni umuvugizi wa rubanda muri Orators Africa akaba n'umurwanashyaka wa imfura ubuhanzi bwamahoro u Rwanda byongeye kandi ko akora ibisigo. Gukorana ubunyangamugayo ni ihame rye. Ahanini ashishikarizwa nabantu batsinze bakoze cyane kugirango bagere kuntego zabo. Kubwibyo, ntagitinya ibibazo ahubwo, yihatira kubitsinda ejo hazaza heza.\nAmateka n'ibitekerezo.\nSaranda agira ati: \u201cGutwita kw'ingimbi ni kimwe mu bibazo u Rwanda ruhura nacyo, ku gitekerezo cye yabonye ko abagabo bashakanye ari bo basenga cyane uruhare rw'izo nda zitifuzwa kubaho binyuze mu guha ibintu bihenze abakobwa bakiri bato kandi kuko na bo bumva bashimishijwe cyane no kubonana nabo bityo bigatera ibibazo byinshi. \nBinyuze mu kwandika iki gisigo we nubwo gishobora byibura kugabanya ijanisha ryaba bangavu batwite aho Sugar daddy izahagarika kunyerera yiruka inyuma yingimbi zingana neza nabakobwa babyaye.\nSaranda ati \"Ntabwo bintangaje iyo umuntu avuze ko akazi kanjye kamufashije. Nahoraga ntekereza kwandika nkikiza ubwanjye aribyo kandi rimwe na rimwe nkavugira abandi. Ndagerageza gukuraho iyi ngeso yo gupfobya ingaruka zanjye.\nHagati aho, nubwo, ubutumwa bwose nakiriye bushima akazi kanjye bimpa umunezero kandi ibyo ntibigera bishimisha. Sinzi inshuro nakinguye inbox cyangwa ndarira. Abantu basangira ninshi mubuzima bwabo kandi ndicishijwe bugufi kandi noroheje kubwibyo.\nImibonano mpuzabitsina yambukiranya ibisekuruza yakemuye yabayeho mumateka yabantu, urugero rwabo kubijyanye nimyitwarire yimibonano mpuzabitsina ijyanye na 'Sugar daddy' cyangwa 'Sugar mummy' yakuze ihinduka inganda zitanga ibikoresho kubakobwa bato nabahungu. umukino wo gukoresha imibonano mpuzabitsina kubagabo bakuze."}
{"id": "10608", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10608", "title": "Niyomukesha Euphrance", "text": "Niyomukesha Euphrance umukinnyi w\u2019ikipe ya Rwanda Revenue Authority Women Volley Club. (RRA WVC) n\u2019ikipe y\u2019igihugu ya Volleyball mu bagore, tariki ya 12 Werurwe 2021 yakoze ubukwe na Mucyo Philbert akaba umunyamabanga w\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umukino wa Volleyball mu Rwanda, Federation Rwandaise de VolleyBall (FRVB). Tariki ya 4 Werurwe 2021 akaba ari bwo basezeranye imbere y\u2019amategeko uMurenge wa Niboye mu akarere ka Kicukiro."}
{"id": "10609", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10609", "title": "Jeannette Kawera", "text": "Professional Background.\nJEANNETTE KAWERA also known as KAJETTE is a Rwandan Professional and Passionate Journalist, Writer and Content Creator who on a special note in 2024 was invited to go to Baku, Azerbaijan for the COP29 organised by UNFCCC and reported about COP29 on various media platforms while there. She went to Europe, in The Netherland and got certified by RNW in Media Training for Advocacy and Social Change Campaign in the Netherlands and is now an RNTC Alumni. She acquired some Reuters Training Courses on Digital Journalism, she was also trained by the US Agency for Global Media/The United States Broadcasting Board of Governors and is a certified Environmental and Climate Change Journalist. Kawera has been to different training offered by FEMNET in Kenya and Tanzania for Excellent Journalists aiming to boost their skills. She went to Nairobi Summer School on climate Justice and expressed her extraordinarily skills in journalism and reporting on environment and climate crises. She later went Kenya for a Some Fine Day Pix workshop on Journalism Film Reviews as an Entertainment Journalist. She graduated from YALA Women International Journalism Academy and has worked for several big Media Houses including InyaRwanda Ltd. and she has currently been working with The NewTimes Publication, Rwanda as a Journalist/Reporter.\nEducation Status.\nShe is currently pursuing her Master\u2019s Degree in Journalism, Media and Communications, and she holds a First Class Honors\u2019 Degree in Bachelors of Arts in Mass Media and Communications from Mount Kenya University. She also majored in Hospitality Management and Leadership at Akilah Institute for Women. Kawera wrote for Dedza Films, a boutique film distributor and hybrid consulting agency dedicated to bringing nuanced films by underrepresented filmmakers to new audiences, as well as the likes of Akilah Stars Magazine amongst other international ones.\nAwards.\nShe won twice as the Female Entertainment Journalist of the Year 2022 Awards from Karisimbi Events and holds two Special Recognition Awards: The 2021 Humanitarian Award Winner in the Consumers Choice Awards due to her 'Fight Against Period Poverty Campaign' and the 2022 Excellence Service Award from B4B. Kawera is more of a Social Media Manager and Content Creator, she also works as The Communications Officer at Rwanda Climate Change and Development Network (RCCDN) and SURF/FR. She is passionate about Event Planning as well as helping in the organization and implementation of various social activities. She worked with RSW Australia-based Ministries in organizing and implementing the Gospel Talent Hunt Competition. Jeannette Kawera always fights for better changes in the community she belongs to, especially for women's empowerment."}
{"id": "10610", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10610", "title": "Hajara Batamuliza", "text": "Hajara Batamuliza ni umunyarwanda kazi kandi akaba Komiseri ushinzwe Imisoro yo mu Gihugu (mu icyongereza: Commissioner for Domestic Taxes) Rwanda Revenue Authority. \nAmashuri.\nHajara Batamuriza kandi afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu Imisoro mpuzamahanga yakuye mu kaminuza ya Canberra yabonye 2011\nAkazi.\nKomiseri ushinzwe Imisoro yo mu Gihugu mu kigo gishinzwe kwinjiza imisoro n'amahoro (RRA), afite uburambe bwimyaka 17 mu kwegeranya imisoro.\nUburambe.\nUburambe bwimyaka 16 muri RRA. Inshingano: Umugenzuzi, Ushinzwe iperereza, umuyobozi wo hagati hamwe n\u2019umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe igenzura ry\u2019imishinga minini, gushyiraho imisoro mpuzamahanga no kwimura ibiciro by\u2019ubucuruzi, amasezerano yumushyikirano, umutoza, guharanira guhanahana amakuru"}
{"id": "10611", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10611", "title": "Meliane Unesha", "text": "Meliane Unesha ni rwiyemezamirimo wo mu Rwanda wahoze ayobora ingendo none akaba akora ubukerarugendo nyuma yo gukina firm ye Salama Afrika.\nAmashuri.\nYize Ibaruramari muri Baptiste College Gacuba 2.\nAmateka.\nAkora umwuga we mu bukerarugendo. Meliane Unesha yabanje gutangira ari umucuranzi nk'umuhanzi wa Gospel nyuma aza kurangiriza mu muziki w'isi aho yakoreye 'Aranankunda' na 'Abantu' barimo Sintex. Mu nkuru ye mu bijyanye n'ubukerarugendo, nubwo akora Business ntabwo yize ubukerarugendo, ahubwo yize Ibaruramari muri Baptiste College Gacuba 2. Nubwo akunda ibidukikije, ntabwo yari azi ko yarangiza akayobora ingendo cyangwa mu bukerarugendo no kubungabunga ibidukikije.\nUnesha ati \u201cMuri Mata 2014, numvise ko Parike y'Akagera irimo gushaka abayobora ingendo nshya njyayo ngerageza amahirwe. Ntabwo nari nzi neza ko nshobora kubikora ariko yego narabikoze. Kuva icyo gihe, nagiye mu mahugurwa atandukanye kugira ngo mbe umuyobozi wabigize umwuga kandi ngumayo imyaka 6 nyobora ba mukerarugendo mpuzamahanga. Muri Werurwe 2020 nabonye andi mahirwe yo gukomeza amasomo yanjye muri Amerika muri Madison College ntiyabasha kuhajya kubera ubwiyongere bwa Covid 19.\nIbihangano.\nYakoze indirimbo yitwa nzaguma mu ihema ryawe Mana"}
{"id": "10612", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10612", "title": "Butera Hope", "text": "Butera Hope ni umunyarwandakazi w' umukinnyi wa Basketball mu bagore, aho ukomoka muri Amerika akaba akina umukino ukina mu b'imbere. Ni umwe mu bagaragaye mu m'akipe y'igihugu y'abato bu Rwanda. \nMuri BasketBall.\nButera Hope muri 2016 aho yari mu ikipe ya Basketball y'abagore bafite munsi ya 18 y'u Rwanda yarangije ku mwanya wa kane muri Shampiyona y'abagore ya FIBA munsi y'abafite imyaka 18. Kugeza ubu, afite imyaka 22, aho umukino wa basketball muri kaminuza mpuzamahanga ya Florida. akina hagati mu kibuga. afite uburebure bwa metero 1.9, arashobora gutanga byinshi mu kibuga hagati kimwe no kubona amanota. \nMuri kaminuza.\nButera Hope kandi yinjiye muri Vandals nyuma y'ibihe bibiri muri kaminuza mpuzamahanga ya Florida yinjiyemo, nyuma y'imyaka ibiri hamwe na Tech yepfo ya Tech. Butera Hope Yarangije amashuri yisumbuye nyuma yi gihembwe cya kabiri muri FIU. Muri sezo ebyiri, Butera yagaragaye mumikino igera kuri 62, atsindira amanota 182, atwara repounds zigera kuri 278 reba. Butera Hope muri shampiyona ye ya nyuma muri FIU, Butera yarife imbaraga zo kwirwanaho, ayoboye Panthers yagaruye imyanya 181 muri shampiyona. Yakinnye muri buri mukino kuri Panthers mugihe atangiye 19, ugereranije ni iminota 19.8 ku mukino.\nMuri FIU.\nMbere ya FIU, yamaze imyaka igera kuri ibibiri muri South Georgia Tech kurwego rwa JUCO. Muri South Georgia Tech, Butera yagaragaye mu mikino 57 aza gutangira akina mu mikino igera kuri itandatu. Yagize Imbaraga zatumye aza imbere yegeraho imbere reboundi zigera kuri 277, afite asisiti zigera 21, akora bloke 25, n'amanota 259 mu gihe cya Lady Jet."}
{"id": "10613", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10613", "title": "Oda Gasinzigwa", "text": "umubyeyi Oda Gasinzigwa ni umunyamuryango, Inteko ishinga amategeko ya Afurika y'Iburasirazuba; wavutse 1966.\nAmashuri.\nIkigo cyigisha imiyoborere, Tanzaniya, Impamyabumenyi ya Bachelor, Inzego z'ibanze; Ikigo cya Kigali cyuburezi, MA, Uburinganire niterambere (mu icyongereza: Inst. of Development Management, Tanzania, Bachelor's Degree, Local Gov.; Kigali Inst. of Education, MA, Gender and Development)\nAmateka.\nOda Gasinzigwa yahoze ari minisitiri w\u2019uburinganire n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019umuryango yatorewe kuba Inteko ishinga amategeko y\u2019Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba (EALA), inteko ishinga amategeko y\u2019akarere aho avuga ko azakomeza guharanira guharanira uburenganzira bw\u2019umugore. uyu mugore w'imyaka 49 yatowe n'Inteko ishinga amategeko, asimbuye Christophe Bazivamo mu nteko ishinga amategeko y'akarere.\nAkazi.\nUmunyamabanga akaba na perezida winama yigihugu yabategarugori. mu 2004 umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe uburinganire,\n2008-13; Minisitiri w\u2019umuryango &amp; kuzamura uburinganire mu biro bya Minisitiri w\u2019intebe, \n2013-16; Mem, Inteko ishinga amategeko ya Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, \n2012-; aderesi y'ibiro: Inteko ishinga amategeko y\u2019Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, POB 1096, Arusha, Tanzaniya\n2023:Inama yab'Abaminisitiri Yagize Oda Gasinzigwa Perezida wa komisiyo yamatoro m'urwanda.(NEC)\nIcyifuzo cye.\nGasinzigwa avuga icyifuzo cye cyo guteza imbere no guharanira uburinganire n'ubwuzuzanye bw'abagore, avuga ko ari imwe mu nkingi z'ingenzi z\u2019amasezerano ya EAC. Numwanya kandi wo kurenga imipaka no gusangira ubunararibonye nabandi no kunganira bimwe mubibazo bijyanye n\u2019ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina, ubukene, icuruzwa ry\u2019abantu, n'ibindi. Numwanya wo kwiga no kugarura uburambe kubantu bange\nInyandiko.\n9.https://www.kigalitoday.com/amakuru/amakuru-mu-rwanda/article/oda-gasinzigwa-yagizwe-perezida-wa-komisiyo-y-amatora-impinduka-mu-nzego-z-ubuyobozi"}
{"id": "10614", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10614", "title": "Ibishanga mu Rwanda", "text": "Mu mwaka wa 2014 ubuyobozi bwa REMA mu Rwanda bwatangaje ko mu Rwanda ibishanga byabangamirwaga bikabije mumyaka yo hambere\nkuko Leta yariho icyogihe yarekaga abaturage bakabituramo abandi bakabikoreramo ibyobashaka abandi bakubakamo ugasanga bibangamira cyane. Kuko bari batarasobanukirwa akamaro k'ibishanga kubaturage ndetse n'igihugu ubwacyo. \nIbishanga muri ikigihe.\nMu Rwanda ni hamwe mu bihugu bifite ibishanga byinshi kandi bitandukanye mumpande zose z'igihugu mubyaro ndetse no mumujyi wa Kigali,ubwawo harimo ibishanga. \nIbishanga nibimwe mumutungo kamere ariko akamaro kabyo gatangiye kumenyekana ubu kuko mbere bititabwagaho uko bikwiye nkuko Madamu Dr Rose Mukankomeje yabitangaje muri Kamena 2014 itariki 3, agira ati ikibabaje nuko ibishanga byo mu Rwanda\nbyatuwemo,ibindi bituzwamo inganda ndetse bishyirwamo nibitagomba kujyamo akaba ariyo mpamvu leta yu Rwanda yashizeho ingamba zo kubungabunga ibishanga mu Rwanda. \nHari igihe abanyarwanda batwikiraga amatafari mubishanga mugihe kizuba abandi bagakuramo inkwi\nbigatuma twangiza amazi ava muri ibyo bishanga ndetse tukangiza numwuka uva mukirere kubera iryo twika rya hato na hato mu bishanga\nAkamaro k'ibishanga.\nibishanga nibimwe mu mumutongo kamere w'igihugu kuko bifite akamaro kanini ku baturage ndetse n'igihugu ubwacyo\nibishanga bifite akamaro gakomeye kuko ibishanga bibika amazi noneho igihe imvura yabaye nkeya bikayohereza mu migezi\nikindi kandi ayo mazi aba ayunguruye kuburyo byorohera abayakoresha muburo bwose. sibyo gusa kuko hari ibishanga mu Rwanda\nbyagenewe guhingamo imyaka,ibigori,imbingo cyangwa ibiryo by'amatungo tworora mu Rwanda.ibishanga kandi byitaweho neza \nbyatanga umusaruro kuko bitanga amazi meza, umuriro,ndetse bikanahingwamo nkuko twabibonye haruguru.\nAmoko y'ibishanga mu Rwanda.\nmuri Rusange mu Rwanda hari ibishanga bibarirwa mubyiciro bitatu (3) aho ikiciro ocyambere kibarirwamo ibishanga nka\nKamiranzovu,Rugezi, Ibishanga bya Rweru nibindi byo muri Pariki ya Kagera byose byemejwe ko bigomba kubungabungwa\nkubera akamaro bifitiye igihugu.\nikiciro cya kabiri (2) ndetse nicya gatatu (3) kigizwe nibishanga bishobora guhingwamo ndetse bikanabyazwa umusaruro\nmuburyo butandukanye ariko ntibyubakwemo kandi bigahabwa n'umukandara w'ubuhumekero utuma amazi ahita neza.\nKubungabunga Ibishanga.\nmurwego rwo kubungabunga ibishanga mu Rwanda hafashwe ingamba zikarishye zo kurengera ubutaka bwose bubarwa \nnk'ibishanga ubwo hafatwaga ingamba zo kwimura ibikorwa byose bikorerwa kuri ubwo butaka hari hamwe hubatswe inganda\nahandi hari amazu yubucuruzi ahandi hari ububiko ndetse nibikorwa byubwubatsi icyogikorwa cyangangiriye mu mujyi wa Kigali\nubwo inganda zimurirwaga mucyanya cyahariwe inganda cya Masoro mumujyi wa kigali\nUbuso bw'ibishanga.\nMuri Rusange mu Rwanda habarirwa ibishanga bisaga 900 biri kubuso bwa 10% bw'igihugu"}
{"id": "10616", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10616", "title": "Amashyamba n'imihindagurukire y'Ikirere", "text": "Amashyamba yo mu Rwanda abarirwa ku buso bwa hegitari 724,695 zingana na 30.4% by\u2019ubuso bwose bw\u2019igihugu nk\u2019uko bitangazwa muri raporo ya vuba igaragaza ubutaka buriho amashyamba (Rwanda Forest Cover Mapping Report/2019) muri ayo mashyamba 53% ni ayatewe, 21 ni aya cyimeza ari mu mukenke, 19% ni amashyamba ya cyimeza yo mu misozi ibonekamo imvura nyinshi \u00a0 mu gihe 6.2% ari ibihuru. Bimwe mu byagezweho muri Gahunda y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019Ubukungu Butangiza Ibidukikije, by\u2019umwihariko mu mushinga urambye wo gutera ibiti no kubungabunga amashyamba ni ibi bikurikira: \n1.Ubuso bw'amashyamba.\nMu mwaka wa 2011, ni bwo u Rwanda rwihaye intego yo kugarura amashyamba kuri hegitari miliyoni ebyiri yahozeho akaba yarangijwe bitarenze mu 2020. Imbaraga u Rwanda rwashyize mu kubungabunga amashyamba ariho, gutera amashyamba mashya, kuvugurura amashyamba mu bice bitandukanye by\u2019Igihugu no guharanira kugera ku ntego za Bonn Challenge ni byo byatumye u Rwanda rugera ku ntego yo kugira 30.4% by\u2019ubuso bw\u2019Igihugu buriho amashyamba. Izo nzego zifite akamaro gakomeye ko gushimangira uruhare rw\u2019u Rwanda mu guhangana n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere.\n2.Ibiti n\u2019Umuganda.\nLeta y\u2019u Rwanda yashoye akayabo mu gutera amashyamba mashya no kuyasubiza aho yari asanzwe binyuze muri gahunda ngarukamwaka yo gutera ibiti n\u2019amashyamba. Nko mu gihembwe cy\u2019umwaka wa 2020/2021 Abanyarwanda bateye ibiti miliyoni 25 byagize uruhare mu kuvugurura amashyamba muri gahunda yo guhangana n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere. \nMuri icyo gihembwe, hegitari 7,400 zateweho ibiti bisanzwe, izindi hegitari 900 zihingwaho ibiti mu mashyamba ya cyimeza ndetse haterwa n\u2019ibiti byeraho imbuto 77,000. Hanavuguruwe hegitari 500 z\u2019amashyamba ahingwamo ibiti bicanwamo amakara mu rwego rwo kongera umusaruro. \n3. Abikorera n'amashyamba.\nBinyuze muri gahunda y\u2019Igihugu yo kwegurira abikorera ibikorwa bimwe, Leta y\u2019u Rwanda yagiranye ubufatanye n\u2019urwego rw\u2019abikorera mu guharanira imicungire iboneye y\u2019amashyamba ya Leta. \n4. Pariki ya Gishwati.\nU Rwanda ruherutse guhanga Pariki y\u2019Igihugu ya Gishwati-Mukura, imwe muri Pariki nshya muri Afurika, mu rwego rwo kurinda amashyamba kimeza ya kera n\u2019inguge ziyacumbitsemo.Iyo Pariki igizwe n\u2019amashyamba abiri ari yo irinini rya Mukura n\u2019irito rya Gishwati aherereye ku musozi ugabaya icyogogo cy imigezi ya Congo na\u00a0 Nili, agakurikira urwunge rw\u2019ibibaya by\u2019Albertine (Albertine Rift) bigizwe n\u2019urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima rutandukanye.\n5. Pariki y\u2019Ibirunga.\nU Rwanda rwatangiye umushinga ukomeye wo kwagura Pariki y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019Ibirunga no guharanira ahazaza heza h\u2019ingagi zo mu misozi zita mu rugo ishyamba ry\u2019Ibirunga. Iyi gahunda y\u2019imbonekarimwe igamije kwagura pariki ku kigero cya 23% ikiyongeraho kilometero kare 37.4, ubunini bwayo bukava kuri kilometero kare 160 bukagera kuri kilometero kare 197.4."}
{"id": "10618", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10618", "title": "NCHR YAGARAGAJE KO IBIROMBE BYANDUZA IMIGEZI N\u2019INZUZI", "text": "Bimwe mu byavuye \"mu bushakashatsi bwakozwe na Komisiyo y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019Uburenganzira bwa muntu (NCHR)\"\", buherutse kugaragaza ko mu rwego rw\u2019ubucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y\u2019agaciro,\" 49.4% by\u2019ibirombe biri mu gihugu byanduza imigezi n\u2019inzuzi cyangwa andi mazi. Ni mu gihe 70.93% by\u2019ibyo birombe ari byo bifite uburyo bwizewe bwo gucunga ibisigazwa by\u2019imyanda iva mu bucukuzi. Kurwanya ihumana ry\u2019umwuka wo mu kirere urimo n\u2019uw\u2019abantu bahumeka biri ku gipimo cya 75.82%. Ibirombe bifite ubushobozi bwo gufata amazi byakoreshejwe, ni 64.4%.\nIbi ni bimwe mu byatumye Komisiyo y\u2019Uburenganzira bwa Muntu, isaba Leta gukaza ubugenzuzi mu bucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y\u2019agaciro kugira ngo ibidukikije ndetse n\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019abatuye mu nkengero z\u2019ahacukurwa amabuye y\u2019agaciro, budahonyorwa.\nPerezida wa Komisiyo y\u2019Uburenganzira bwa Muntu, Mukasine Marie Claire, avuga ko kugeza ubu ibyavuye mu shakashatsi bakoze, hatanzwe inama kandi zigahabwa ikigo gishinzwe ubucukuzi. Ati: \u201cImpamvu ari bo twabihaye nuko ari bo bahagarariye Leta kandi Leta niyo ifite inshingano zo gutuma imirimo ikorwa mu rwego rw\u2019ubucukuzi hakurikijwe amategeko n\u2019amabwiriza aba yatanzwe. Kugira ngo yubahirizwe ni uruhare rwa Leta binyuze muri icyo kigo. Amategeko arahari ameze neza ariko twasanze hari aho bidakorwa neza. Kuba bidakorwa neza hakenewe ijisho ribikurikirana\u201d. Uretse ibi bibazo ubushakashatsi bwa Komisiyo y\u2019Uburenganzira bwa Muntu, bwagaragaje ko mu bucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y\u2019agaciro hari ikibazo cy\u2019abagore bakiri bake.\nUbushakashatsi bwa NCHR bugaragaza ko ba engeniyeri muri uru rwego rw\u2019ubucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y\u2019agaciro, bangana na 26.23%. Abagore bakora ubucuruzi bushingiye ku bucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y\u2019agaciro ntibarenga 5.41%.Ikigo k\u2019Igihugu gishinzwe Mine, Peteroli na Gazi kemera ko ibi bibazo mu bucukuzi bihari kikemera ko kigiye kubishakira ibisubizo.\nDushimimana Narcisse, Umuyobozi ukuriye ishami rishinzwe iyubahirizwa ry\u2019amategeko n\u2019ubugenzuzi bwa Mine mu kigo gishinzwe Mine, Peteroli na Gazi avuga ko iki kigo kirimo kureba izo mbogamizi zose zagaragajwe, zakwitabwaho. Urwego rw\u2019Ubucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y\u2019agaciro ruza ku mwanya wa Kabiri mu nzego zinjiriza igihugu amafaranga menshi nyuma y\u2019ubukerarugendo.Mbere y\u2019umwaduko wa COVID-19 mu 2019, urwego rw\u2019ubucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y\u2019agaciro rwahaga akazi abagera ku 71,205 bavuye ku bihumbi 47,727 babonaga akazi mu bucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y\u2019agaciro mu mwaka wa 2017.\nIcyakoze kubera icyorezo cya COVID-19 abari babeshejweho n\u2019ubucukuzi bagabanutseho 19%.\nMu mwaka 2021 Leta yagobotse urwego rw\u2019ubucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y\u2019agaciro, ku buryo ababoneraga amaramuko mu bucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y\u2019agaciro bari bageze ku bihumbi 100."}
{"id": "10623", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10623", "title": "Umugezi wa Mbirurume", "text": "Mbirurume (izwi Bilirume, Biruruma, Birurume, Bitirume) ni uruzi mu burengerazuba bw'u Rwanda ni uruzi rw'umugezi wa Nyabarongo.\nUmugezi wa Mbirurume uturuka mu gace k\u2019amashyamba kari mu majyepfo y\u2019u Rwanda, mu burasirazuba bw\u2019Ikiraro cy\u2019Amazi cya bw\u2019igice cya Kongo-Nile. Umugezi wa Mbirurume uturuka mu majyaruguru ya kure ya Pariki y\u2019Igihugu ya Nyungwe, mu Karere ka Nyamagabe. Utemba ugana mu majyaruguru y\u2019iburasirazuba, ukinjira mu Karere ka Karongi, ugaca mu burengerazuba bwa Mukungu. Nyuma ukomeza gutemba werekeza mu majyaruguru y\u2019iburasirazuba ukurikira umupaka ugabanya Uturere twa Nyamagabe na Karongi. Hanyuma uhindukira ugana mu majyepfo y\u2019iburasirazuba mbere gato yo guhura n\u2019Umugezi wa Mwogo, uwinjiramo uturutse ibumoso. Imigezi ihuriweho igize uruzi rwa Nyabarongo, rutemba mu majyaruguru ku nkengero z\u2019iburasirazuba bw\u2019igice cya Nili-Kongo. \nAmashakiro.\nIncamake\u00a0\nAmasoko"}
{"id": "10626", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10626", "title": "Umugezi wa Mwogo", "text": "Umugezi wa Mwogo ni uruzi ruri mu majyepfo y'u Rwanda, rubyara umugezi wa Nyabarongo iyo ruhuye na Mbirurume. Ruturuka m'umashyamba ya nyungwe mu majyepfo y\u2019u Rwanda mu burasirazuba bwa Congo-Nile, aho runyura mumirenge ya ruramba wo mukarere ka Nyaruguru, rukomereza mumurenge wa Kitabi muKarere ka Nyamagabe,rugakomeza rujya kuri nyabukona aho intara y'iburasirazuba igabanira n'iyamajyepfo. Ruba rwanyuze Kandi Nyarusiza rwerekeza mu Karere ka Huye.\nRwerekeza mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba runyuze mu burengerazuba bw'aka karere, rwinjira mu karere ka Nyanza. Mu karere ka Nyanza rukanyura mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba, rukanyura Mweya aho uruzi rwa Gihimbi rwinjirira uhereye ibumoso. Munsi yiyi ngingo ihujwe nuruzi rwa Rukarara uhereye ibumoso. Hanyuma rugakora urubibi rw'iburengerazuba rw'akarere ka Ruhango kugeza ruhujwe uhereye ibumoso nuruzi rwa Mbirurume mumajyepfo ya Bikwa Umugezi uhuriweho witwa uruzi rwa Nyabarongo, rukomeza ruguru rujya I Kigali.\nIMIRIMO IKORERWA MUKIBAYA CYA MWOGO\nKUBUHINZI BW'UMUCERI N'IMBOGA\nIki kibaya kizwiho cyane gutunganywamo imihanda y'amazi ihingwamo umuceri, aho abaturage bishyize hamwe mu makoperative bawuhinga ku bwinshi bakawurya mungo zabo ndetse bagasagurira namasoko.\nMu bice biteramo umuceri, hahingwa ibigori, ibishyimbo, ibijumba, n'imboga zinyuranye bitandukanye nk'ubutaka bwo mu misozi.\nNanone haberamo byo kurinda igishamga no kuvomerera.Leta n'abahinzi bafatanya mu mirimo yo gukora imiringoti n'ingomero z'amazi kugira ngo ubuhinzi bukomeze mu bihe byose by'ihinga. \nUBWOROZI \nKubera icyi gishanga kigira ubwatsi buhora buba bwinshi, abaturage bahororera inka n'amatungo magufi bakoresheje uburyo bwo kuhakura ubwatsi (kwahira) cyangwa ubworozi bwa kijyambere. Nanone bifashisha amwe mumazi areka hafi y'uruzi buhira amatungo. \nIBIKORWA REMEZO \nKubera ko uyu mugezi n'ikibaya bya Mwogo bihuza uturere twinshi, harangwa imirimo ihoraho yo kubaka no gusana ibiraro bihuza imirenge n'uturere twa Nyanza, Ruhango na Nyamagabe. \nIBINDI \nNanone hakorerwamo imirimo y'uburobyi bw'amafi yo mubwoko bwa tilapiya. Ndetse no gucukura umucanga w'igihogo wifahishwa mubwubatsi. \nINGAMBA ZAFASHWE MUKUKIBUNGABUNGA. \nZimwe mungamba zafashwe harimo Gutera amashyamba y'imigano (bamboo) ku nkombe z'umugezi wa Mwogo n'imigezi iwushora bityo bigafata ubutaka Hari ingamba zo guca kandi imirwanyasuri kumisozi. \nHashyizweho itegeko n'imipaka (buffer zone) ihagarika ubuhinzi n'ubwubatsi busatira neza inkombe z'umugezi. Tutibajyiwe ko Abahinzi bo mu kibaya no mu nkengero bafashwa gutera ibiti bivangwa n'imyaka (nk'iseti, Alnus, n'ibiti by'imbuto) kugira ngo ubutaka bukomeze kugira amahumbezi n'umuco wo gufata amazi."}
{"id": "10627", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10627", "title": "Umugezi wa Rukarara", "text": "Umugezi wa Rukarara (cyangwa Lukarara) ni uruzi rwo mu burengerazuba bw'u Rwanda. ruturuka k' Umugezi wa Mwogo, na rwo rukaba umugezi wa Nyabarongo. Namazi ava kure cyane ya Nili. Rukarara izamuka ituruka m'amashyamba mu majyepfo y\u2019u Rwanda mu burasirazuba bwa Congo-Nili. Igishanga cya Kamiranzovu mu ishyamba rya Nyungwe ritanga ikigega gisanzwe cya Rukarara Inkomoko ya Rukarara ubu izwiho kuba isoko rusange ya Nili Ibi byashimangiwe n\u2019urugendo rwa 2005/2006 ruzamuka uruzi rufite ibikoresho bigezweho. "}
{"id": "10628", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10628", "title": "Umugezi wa Mukungwa", "text": "Umugezi wa Mukungwa ni uruzi rubarizwa mu igihugu cyu Rwanda mu intara y'amajyaruguru m' akarere ka Musanze."}
{"id": "10629", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10629", "title": "Umugezi w'Akanyaru", "text": "Umugezi wa Akanyaru ni uruzi runini rw'umugezi wa Nyabarongo Irazamuka mu misozi miremire yo mu burengerazuba bw'u Rwanda n'Uburundi, itemba iburasirazuba hanyuma ikerekeza mu majyaruguru ku mupaka uhuza ibyo bihugu mbere yo kwinjira mu ruzi rwa Nyabarongo. Kurambura hepfo birimo ibishanga byingenzi ariko bidakingiwe, bibangamiwe nibikorwa byabantu."}
{"id": "10630", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10630", "title": "Imigwegwe", "text": "Imigwegwe nibimwe mubyatsi cyangwa ibirabyo byimeza mu Rwanda. si ibihingwa byimeza gusa gusa bifite akamaro\nkuko nibyimeza ubu n'ingenzi kuburyo bikenewe kubungabungwa kuko byagaragaye ko harimo byinshi bifitiye igihugu\nakamaro ndetse n'abaturage. bityo imigwegwe ikaba ihingwa nabaturage benshi kubera bamaze gusobanukirwa akamaro kayo.\nImigwegwe.\nm rwego rwo kurengera ibidukikije ndetse na nyuma yo kumenya akamaro kimigano abanyarwanda batari bake batangiye \nguhinga imigano kuko bamaze gusobanukirwa akamaro kayo. Imigano ni bimwe mubihingwa byo mu Rwanda bifitiye igihugu\nakamaro ndetse nabaturage kuko hakorwamo ibintu byinshi bitandukanye harimo nka\n- Uduseke\n-Imisambi\n-Imitako myinshi itandukanye yo munzu\n-Imigara y'Intore\nndetse n'ibindi byinshi bitandukanye kandi harimo iboreshwa imbire mu Gihugu ndetse nibindi bikoherezwa hanze yacyo\nAkamaro.\nUretse kuba imigwegwe ikorwamo ibikorwa byinshi bifitiye igihugu nabaturage akamaro mu Rwanda hari amashyirahamwe\nmenshi yabagore bibumbiye hamwe bakabyaza umusaruro imigano murwego rwo kwiteza imbere babohamo uduseke twok\nbikaba byarabafashije haba abo mu mujyi wa Kigali ndetse no muntara zitandukanye zo mu Rwanda.\nzibyo g'usa kandi hari nabimwe mu bindi bihugu byavumbuye ko imigwegwe ikorwamo amoko yinzoga atandukanye nko muri Mexico\nIndi mirimo.\nhari uturere tumwe na tumwe twasobanukiwe neza ko imigwegwe atariyo kuboha uduseke gusa ahubwo bayikoresha n'ibindi\nbyinshi bitandukanye harimo nka Akarere ka Gicumbi kavumbuye uburyo bwo gushingirira ibishyimbo byabo bakoresheje \nImigwegwe."}
{"id": "10631", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10631", "title": "Umugezi wa Base", "text": "Umugezi Wa Base ni uruzi ruri mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda mu intara y'amajyaruguru mu akarere ka rurindo."}
{"id": "10632", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10632", "title": "Umugezi wa Rusizi", "text": "Umugezi wa Rusizi (nanone rimwe na rimwe yitwa Rusizi) ni uruzi, ufite uburebure bwa kilometero 117, ruva mu kiyaga cya Kivu rugana ku kiyaga cya Tanganyika muri Afurika yo hagati, rukamanuka kuri metero 1.500 (metero 4900) rukagera kuri metero 770, hejuru y'inyanja hejuru yuburebure bwayo, Imiyoboro ihanamye cyane iboneka kuri kilometero 40 za mbere, aho hubatswe ingomero z'amashanyarazi Ahagana hepfo, ikibaya cya Rusizi, gifite imisozi yoroheje gusa, kandi uruzi rutemba mu kiyaga cya Tanganyika unyuze kuri, hamwe n'umuyoboro muto cyangwa ibiri ucitsemo umuyoboro munini.\nRusizi ni uruzi rukiri ruto, rwashinzwe hashize imyaka igera ku 10,000 igihe ikirunga giturika mu imisozi ya Virunga. Imisozi yabujije ikiyaga cya Kivu ahahoze hasohokera amazi ya Nili ahubwo ihatira ikiyaga kurenga mu majyepfo ya Rusizi no mu mazi ya Congo."}
{"id": "10633", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10633", "title": "Umugezi wa Sebeya", "text": "Umugezi wa Sebeya ni uruzi ruri mu Ntara y'Iburengerazuba, u Rwanda rusohoka mu kiyaga cya Kivu giherereye mu majyepfo y'umujyi wa Gisenyi. Umugezi wa Sebeya ukomoka mu misozi y'akarere ka Rutsiro.Ipima kilometero 110 z'uburebure bwamazi irimo kilometero kare 286 y'aturere ka Rutsiro, Ngororero na Rubavu.\nSebeya yuzuye.\nUmugezi wa Sebeya iyo wuzuye usenyera amazu, igatwara imyaka \u00a0twahinze bikaduteza inzara, \u00a0sebeya iteje ikibazo cyane, kuko itwara ibintu n\u2019abantu. uganiriye na abaturage bo mumurenge wa kamana rugerero na nyundo yo mukarere ka Rubavu bakkubwirako, uyumugezi wa sebeya wari warababereye ikibazo gikomeye kuko iyo wuzuraga wabateraga ibiza bitandukanye harimo; gutwara ibihingwa, amazu ndetse nibintu."}
{"id": "10634", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10634", "title": "Umugezi wa Koko", "text": "Umugezi wa Koko ni uruzi mu Karere ka Rutsiro gaherereye mu burengerazuba bwu Rwanda utemba ugana mu kiyaga cya Kivu Ni umwe mu nzuzi nini zitwara imisozi y'iburengerazuba bw'u Rwanda mu kiyaga cya Kivu, uwundi ni umugezi wa Sebeya Mu gihe cyabakoloni uruzi rwasobanuye imbibi za perefegitura ya Kibuye na Gisenyi."}
{"id": "10635", "revid": "17699", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10635", "title": "Umugezi wa Rubyiro", "text": "Umugezi wa Rubyiro ni umugezi uri mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bw'u Rwanda ukaba uherereye ibumoso bw'umugezi wa Ruzizi. Uhura na Ruzizi, bigakora umupaka utandukanya u Rwanda na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, mu ntera ya 2 kilometero hejuru y'aho uruzi rwa Ruhwa, rukora umupaka utandukanya u Rwanda n'u Burundi, rwinjirira muri Ruzizi. [1]"}
{"id": "10636", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10636", "title": "Umugezi wa Ruhwa", "text": "Umugezi wa Ruhwa ni uruzi ruri mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bw'u Rwanda ni uruzi rw'i bumoso rw'u mugezi wa Ruzizi. Ihurira na Ruzizi, igize umupaka uhuza u Rwanda na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, nko mu kilometero 2 munsi y'aho umugezi wa Rubyiro winjira muri Ruzizi. Ruhwa igize umupaka uhuza uturere two mu burengerazuba bw'u Rwanda n'Uburundi. [1]\nReba.\nImirongo\nInkomoko"}
{"id": "10637", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10637", "title": "Umugezi koko yi Rusizi", "text": "Umugezi wa Koko ni uruzi mu Karere ka Rusizi gaherereye mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bw'u Rwanda akaba ari uruzi rw'iburyo rw'umugezi wa Ruhwa, rukaba rugabanya umupaka uhuza uturere two mu burengerazuba bw'u Rwanda n'Uburundi. Kuburebure bwayo bwose inyura muri parike ya Nyungwe."}
{"id": "10638", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10638", "title": "Icyiraro cya Ruzizi I", "text": "Ikiraro cya Ruzizi I cyangwa Pont Ruzizi I (cyangwa Ruzizi I) ni ikiraro gikora nk'imwe mu mipaka ihuza imipaka ihuza Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo mu mujyi wa Bukavu n'u Rwanda mu umujyi wa Rusizi hejuru y'umugezi rwa Ruzizi.\nIkiraro cya Ruzizi I mukucyubaka cyatewe ininkunga n'ibihugu byubumwe bwi Burayi muri gahunda y'ubukungu y'umuryango wubukungu wibihugu byibiyaga bigari. Yafunguwe na Mayor Bilubi Ulengabo Meschac ku ya 19 Kamena 2019. Ikiraro gifite metero 57 z'uburebure, ni ikiraro cya kabiri kirekire muri Bukavu, nyuma ya Ikiraro cya Ruzizi II, nacyo kikaba nk'imwe munzira Repubulika Iharanira Demukarasi ya Congo ihana imbibi n'u Rwanda.Cyubatswe bwa mbere mu 1935 kandi nyuma y'igihe kinini kirasenywa kugira ngo cyongere gusanywa mu 1974 hamwe n' ibyuma nibiti bifite ubushobozi bwo gushyigikira ibinyabiziga bifite uburemere buke cyangwa imodoko zitwara toni zitarenze 3 Byari bimaze igihe kinini bikora, mbere yo kubaka iki kiraro gishya, cgifite ubushobozi bwo gushyigikira toni zigera kuri 30, gikora neza kuva muri 2012."}
{"id": "10640", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10640", "title": "Icyiraro cya Ruzizi II", "text": "Icyiraro Ruzizi II ni kimwe mu biraro i Rusizi cyangwa Bukavu, ikora nk'imwe mu mipaka ihuza imipaka ihuza Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo mu mujyi wa Bukavu n'u Rwanda mu karere ka Rusizi hejuru y'uruzi rwa Ruzizi. Iki cyiraro giherereye inyuma yumusozi ubamo inkambi ya gisirikare yitwa \"Saio Military camp\", yubatswe mu 1943 nyuma y\u2019intsinzi y\u2019ingabo za Kongo muri Etiyopiya k' ubutaliyani babaga muri Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba ku ya 8 Kamena 1941 mu gihe cy\u2019Intambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose. Icyiraro cyahise cyubakwa kugira ngo habeho ubucuruzi hagati ya Rwanda-Urundi na Kongo Mbiligi, imirimo yabo yamaze imyaka 12 kuva 1908 kugeza 1920 Icyiraro gifite uburebure bwa metero 88, nicyo cyiraro cya mbere kirekire mu mujyi wa Bukavu, giherereye mu birometero 20 uvuye kuri Icyiraro cya Ruzizi I, kikaba ari n\u2019umupaka wa gasutamo n\u2019u Rwanda i Rusizi."}
{"id": "10643", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10643", "title": "Umusozi wa Karongi", "text": "Umusozi wa karongi ufite m 2584. Ubarizwa mu akarere ka Karongi mu intara y'uburengerazuza bw'u Rwanda."}
{"id": "10645", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10645", "title": "Gutera Igiti cy'Avoka", "text": "Mu rwego rwo kubungabunga ibidukikije no guharanira imirire myiza, Umuryango AEE watanze ibiti 2,080 bya avoka byo gutera muri Huye na Nyaruguru, biba bikeya kuko byifuzwaga na benshi.\nUmuryango AEE wabitanze ku baturage bo mu Murenge wa Mukura mu Karere ka Huye, no mu Murenge wa Ngera ndetse n\u2019uwa Ngoma mu Karere ka Nyaruguru. Byahawe abaturage bakeya batoranyijwe n\u2019inzego z\u2019ubuyobozi. Abatuye muri Mukura no muri Ngera bagiye bahabwa igiti kimwe buri wese, naho muri Ngoma bo bahabwa ibiti bitatu buri wese."}
{"id": "10647", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10647", "title": "Icyayi cya Gisovu", "text": "Icyayi Cya Gisovu ni icyayi gihingwa mu misozi ya Gisovu mu murenge wa Twumba, akarere ka Karongi intara y'iburengerazuba. Ahocyaciye agahigo mu Rwanda no kumasoko mpuzamahanga kuba aricyo cy'igurwa amafaranga menshi, aho cyaguzwe amadora 5.97, ikindi ni icyayi cya Kitabi."}
{"id": "10649", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10649", "title": "Icyayi cya Kitabi", "text": "Icyayi Kitabi ni icyayi cyahesheje igihugu cyu Rwanda ishema, aho cyaciye agahigo ko kuba cyaraguzwe amafaranga meshi ku isoko mpuzamahanga ryo muri Kenya aho cyaguze amadora asaga 6.06, hamwe ni cyayi cya Gisovu.\nAgahebuzo ki icyayi cya Kitabi.\nIcyayi cya Kitabi cyaciye agahigo cyo kugurwa amafaranga menshi ku isoko ry'icyayi mu gihugu cya Kenya, aho cyari gihagarariye u Rwanda. Kuva iri murikagurisha ryatangira mu 1956 ni ubwa mbere byari bibaye. "}
{"id": "10650", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10650", "title": "Icyayi Mu Rwanda", "text": "Mu Rwanda Icyayi cyatangiye guhingwa mu 1961. Mu mwaka wa 2018 cyakorwagamo n\u2019abahinzi 42840, gihingwa kuri hegitari 26897 mu turere 12 tw\u2019igihugu. Ingano yacyo yarazamutse iva kuri toni 14 500 mu 2000 igera kuri toni 27 824 mu 2017/2018.\nIkigo cy\u2019Igihugu gishinzwe guteza imbere ibyoherezwa mu mahanga bikomoka ku Buhinzi n\u2019Ubworozi (NAEB), kigaragaza ko mu 2016-2017 icyayi cyoherejwe mu mahanga cyari toni 25,128 zavuyemo miliyoni $74,5 mu gihe mu mwaka w\u2019ingengo y\u2019imari wa 2017-2018 habonetse toni 27 824 zasaruwemo miliyoni $88.\nMu 2018 mu Rwanda hari inganda 16 zitunganya icyayi. Mu bakoranaga na zo abagore bari 60% n\u2019abagabo 40%. Icyayi cy\u2019u Rwanda kimaze kuba ubukombe, muri Gicurasi umwaka ushize cyahawe ibihembo 11 muri 12 byatangiwe mu Nama yahuje Abahinzi b\u2019Icyayi muri Afurika, yabereye i Nairobi.\nUbwoko bw`icyayi.\nmu Rwanda haramoko menshi yicyayi harimo:\n-mild blend\n-green tea\n-gold blend\n-tangawize tea\n-ginger &amp; lemon tea\n-charmomile tea\n-peppermint\n-organic black tea\n-black tea leaves"}
{"id": "10651", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10651", "title": "Rwanda Mountain Tea", "text": "Rwanda Mountain Tea ni icyayi cyu Rwanda kizwi cyane ku isi, kubera kwinjiza no kumurika Icyayi cyo mu misozi yo mu Rwanda, gitanga icyayi kiza mu Rwanda no mu mumahanga, ishoramari mu gutunganya icyayi, gukurikirana impuguke no kuyobora mu gutanga umusaruro.\nRwanda Mountain Tea.\nRwanda Mountain Tea Ltd Guhera mu mwaka 2006, yabaye umushoramari wigenga w\u2019abasangwabutaka mu nganda z\u2019icyayi n\u2019imirima, agura imigabane myinshi mu mitungo myinshi yahoze ari iya leta, harimo, Nyabihu na Rubaya (mu burengerazuba no mu majyaruguru), Kitabi (mu majyepfo), na Gisakura na Mata (mu majyepfo y'iburengerazuba).\nKwagura Ibikorwa.\nByongeye kandi, muri gahunda yo kwagura, Rwanda Mountain Tea Ltd yashoboye gushinga uruganda rw'icyayi ahitwa Rutsiro (mu intara y'burengerazuba), kabuhariwe mu gukora CTC y'umukara, icyayi cyumukara nicyatsi kibisi Ikindi cyiyongereyeho ni uruganda rw'icyayi rwa Gatare mu karere ka Nyamasheke ruteganijwe gukoreshwa mbere yuyu mwaka.\n Rwanda mountain tea murwego ryo kwagura ibikorwa yafunguye inganda zitunganya icyayi ziherereye mubice bitandunya byigihugu.\n1.Kitabi Tea Factory\n2.Rubaya Tea Factory\n3.Rutsiro Tea Factory\n4.Gatare Tea Factory\ufffc\n5.Nyabihu Tea Factory\n6.Gisakura Tea Factory\n7.Mata Tea Factory\ufffc\nIshoramari.\nIshoramari rya Rwanda Mountain Tea Ltd mu ishoramari ry\u2019icyayi rigamije kuzamura umusaruro w\u2019icyayi binyuze mu buhinzi bwiza no kubona no kwagura imirima y\u2019icyayi mu gihugu hose. Umuzenguruko warangiye mu kuzamura no kubaka inganda z'icyayi zigezweho no gushyiraho uruganda rwicyayi ruvanga nogupakira icyayi kugirango gikemure abakoresha icyayi mu Rwanda kandi buhoro buhoro mukarere ndetse no mubindi bice bya Afrika. Rwanda Mountain Tea Ltd izwi kwisi yose kubera gukora icyayi cyiza cya CTC cyiza ku isi, kandi yatsindiye ibihembo bitandukanye by'icyayi ku isi.\nAmashanyarazi.\nUsibye gukora no gucuruza icyayi, Rwanda Mountain Tea Ltd ni umushoramari wigenga mu kongera ingufu. Kugeza ubu igomba gushyiraho inganda z'amashanyarazi 2 y'umugezi wa Giciye itanga MW 8 kuri gride y'igihugu.Ari mubikorwa byo kubaka urundi r'uganda kumugezi umwe gifite ubushobozi bwa MW 7.2. Mu bindi bikorwa bifitanye isano, Rwanda Mountain Tea Ltd yasinyanye na leta yu Rwanda amasezerano y\u2019inguzanyo ku nganda 2 zisanzwe zikoresha amashanyarazi kugira ngo zongere MW 4. Ibigo mu matsinda bivanga mu buryo bworoshye mu baturage bakoreramo, bigira uruhare mu kubaka amashuri, ibigo ndzerabuzima, imihanda igaburira, n\u2019amazu ku bakene cyane. Bagira uruhare kandi muri gahunda y'igihugu y'inka imwe ku muryango ukennye buri mwaka baha amatungo imiryango itishoboye. \nIbindi.\nRwanda Mountain Tea Ltd itanga imirimo irenga 25.000 kubaturage bo mucyaro usibye kugura ibabi ryatsi kubuhinzi-borozi, bityo bagatanga isoko ryumwaka wose kubicuruzwa byabo. Isosiyete ihuza neza n\u2019abaturage aho ikorera, igira uruhare mu iterambere ry\u2019imibereho n\u2019ubukungu by\u2019abaturage binyuze muri; kubaka amashuri, ibigo nderabuzima, umuhanda ugaburira, amazu kubakene cyane no kuzana amazi meza kubaturage.\nHanyuma, Rwanda Mountain Tea Ltd ni umusoreshwa munini kandi igashora inyungu mu gihugu, bityo ikagira uruhare mu iterambere ry\u2019u Rwanda.\nIbihembo.\nRwanda Mountain Tea Ltd, yagiye ishimirwa imikorere yayo myiza, haba muri Africa no mubindi bice bitandukanye mu isi, nk'aho munama yo mwaka wa 2019 ku italiki ya 26 kugeza ku italiki ya 28 yari yabereye i Kampala muri Uganda, Rwanda Mountain Tea Ltd n'uruganda rwayo rwa Kitabi yahembewe kuba iya mbere mugutunganya icyayi gifite ubwiza buhebuje."}
