{"id": "12590", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12590", "title": "Ikimoteri cya Nduba", "text": "Mu rwego rwo kunoza imicungire y\u2019imyanda mu Mujyi wa Kigali mu buryo butabangamiye ibidukikije n\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019abaturage, Hashyizweho ikimoteri cy\u2019imyanda i Nduba muri Gasabo mu mwaka wa 2012.\nImiterere y'Iikimoteri cya Nduba.\nIkimoteri cya Nduba kiri hejuru ku mpinga y\u2019umusozi mugari kandi muremure mu murenge wa Nduba Akagari ka Muremure, kigakora ku midugudu ibiri ya Taba na Musezero. Hari amatoni menshi y\u2019imyanda iri ku gasi, ikusanywa iva mu ngo n\u2019ibigo mu mugi wa Kigali. Ikimoteri cya Nduba gifite hegitari 52,6 harimo 28,6 ziri gukoreshwa na 24 zo kucyaguriraho. Cyakira toni zirenga 500 z\u2019imyanda ikomeye na metero kibe 150 kugeza kuri 200 z\u2019imyanda yoroshye yo mu bwiherero.\nImicungire n'imikoresherezwe y'ikimoteri.\nImicungire y\u2019ikimoteri cya Nduba iri mu maboko y\u2019Umujyi wa Kigali na WASAC itanga ubufasha mu bya tekiniki. iki kimoteri gishyirwaho hari hateganyijwe ko hazabaho uburyo bwo kubyaza umusaruro cyangwa gukora ifumbire n'ingufu mu myanda ijyanwa muri icyo kimoteri kandi hakubakwa ahantu hatunganyirizwa ibyo bishingwe habugenewe ariko ntibirakorwa bikaba bibangamira uburenganzira n' imibereho myiza y'abaturage batuye mu nkengero yi'icyo kimoteri kuko usanga hari umwuka mubi bahumeka n'amasazi ahaturuka ashobora kubanduza indwara nyinshi ziterwa n'umwanda. \nIngaruka z'ikimoteri cya Nduba.\nHaba ku bantu baturiye ikimoteri cya Nduba cyangwa ibindi binyabuzima muri rusange bigerwaho n'ingaruka mbi mu gihe icyo kimoteri kititaweho nkuko bigomba gukorwa; harimo indwara ziturutse k'umwanda no ku mwuka mubi bahumeka. Gusa icyo kimoteri kikaba gifite ningaruka nziza kuko iyo urebye mumujyi wa Kigali ubonako urangwamo nisuku nyinshi haba mu ngo ndetse no mu mihanda yo mumugi wa kigali ubonako haba hakeye cyane ugeraranyije no mumyaka yashize kuko imyanda yose ihakusanirizwa ifite aho yoherezwa ndetse ikanahatunganirizwa muburyo bwo kubyaza umusaruro iyo myanda yose ihakusanyirizwa. "}
{"id": "12591", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12591", "title": "Imbabura za Rondereza", "text": "Mu rwego rwo gukoresha ibicanwa bicye cyane cyane ibikomoka ku mashyamba, abashakashatsi na ba rwiyemezamirimo batandukanye bashatse uburyo bakoresha amakara cyangwa inkwi bicye mu buryo bifashisha bategura amafunguro, hari n'ahifashishwa imirasire y'izuba. "}
{"id": "12592", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12592", "title": "Icyungo", "text": "Icyungo.\nIcyungo ni Inkono gakondo ikoze mu ibumba, Iterambere ritaraza mu Rwanda, benshi nicyo batekeragamo. Uko iminsi ishira indi igataha,Abanyarwanda batandukanye barazizibukira bagateka mumasafuriya, bamwe mu rubyiruko bo bavuga ko batanakizi,\nIcyungo ni imwe mu nkono Gakondo babumbaga mwi ibumba akaba Igikoresho bifashishaga bategura amafunguro. Mu Rwanda ndetse no mubihugu bimwe na bimwe byo muri Afurika cyanecyane mu Rwanda rwo hambere niyo yakoreshwaga.\nIcyo Icyungo bagikundiraga muri rusange.\nBavugako isosi yatetswe mucyungo iryoha kuruta izindi sosi zatetwe mu bindi bikoresho, ikindi hari ababumbyi batunzwe nokubumba. iyo babaga babumbye ibyungo ndetse nibindi bikoresho biva mwibumba byatumaga babona amafrw bakabasha kwiteza imbere muburyo bumwe cyangwa ubundi."}
{"id": "12595", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12595", "title": "S.C. Kiyovu Sports", "text": "Kiyovu Sports Association, rizwi cyane ku izina rya SC Kiyovu Sports, Kiyovu Sports cyangwa Kiyovu, ni ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru iherereye i Kigali, mu Rwanda. Kuri ubu iyi kipe irushanwa mu gikombe cy\u2019umupira wamaguru mu Rwanda, ikina imikino yayo murugo kuri Stade Mumena cyangwa kuri Sitade Amahoro. Ikipe yabigenewe muri iki gihe irushanwa mu cyiciro cya mbere cyu Rwanda. Iyi kipe yatwaye ibikombe birindwi bya shampiyona, ibikombe bitatu by'amahoro.\nKiyovu Sport Club niyo kipe yambere yumupira wamaguru yu Rwanda yinjiye muri Shampiyona yumupira wamaguru, hagati ya 1948 na 1957. Batangiriye mu cyiciro cya mbere bamanurwa rimwe gusa, muri 2017."}
{"id": "12597", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12597", "title": "Urwanda ntirugikoresha imiheha ya pulasiki", "text": "Reta y'uRwanda yaciye ikoreshwa ry 'imihehe ya pulasitiki mu gihe hakozwe igenzura rigaragaza ko iteza umwanda kandi itabora ikaba yangiza ibidukikije n'utunyabuzima tuba mu butaka.\nImiheha ya pulasitiki.\nImihehe ni bimwe mu bikoresho bakoresha mu kunywa byifashishwaga mu makwe muri za hoteli na handi henshi hatandukanye ubu ntibikirangwa ku isoko ry'u Rwanda kuko byangiza ibidukikije sibyo byonyine harimo na amacupa ya pulasiki akoresha rimwe nayo ari kuvanwa kw'isoko.\nNigute byangiza ibidukikije.\nHashingiwe kubushakashatsi bw'ikigo k'igihugu cyirengera ibidukikije REMA hagaragajwe ko ibikoresho bya pulasitiki harimo imiheha na amacupa bikoreshwa inshuro imwe byangiza ibidukikije bitewe n'uburyo bikozemo bituma bitabora.\nByangiza ubutaka ndetse n'urusobe ryudunyabuzima tuba mu butaka sibyo gusa iyo bigeze mu nzuzi biteza umwanda ndetse bikabuza amafi n'ibindi binyabuzima byo mu mazi ubwisanzure ibindi bigapfa.\nMuri rusange ibikoresho bikoreshwa rimwe bya pulasitiki sibyiza ku bidukikije n'urusobe rw'ibinyabuzima."}
{"id": "12601", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12601", "title": "Gloria Nibagwire", "text": "Gloria Sofa Nibagwire (yavutse 14 Kanama 1982) Umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru mu Rwanda akaba na kapiteni w'ikipe y'Igihugu y'abategarugori.\nNibagwire Mw'ikipe Y'Igihugu..\nNibagwire yatsindiye u Rwanda ku rwego rwo hejuru mu majonjora yo guhatanira igikombe cya Afurika muri 2014. \nNibagwire yajyanye n'ikipe Y'Igihugu Yabagore muri Cecafa muri Uganda 2022"}
{"id": "12604", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12604", "title": "Rusine", "text": "Rukundo Patrick ni umunyarwenya wu munyarwanda, umukinnyi wa filime,numunyamakuru kuri \"kuri kiss fm Radio\" Yavukiye kandi akurira mu Karere ka Nyarugenge muri Kigali.\nUbuzima bwambere nuburere.\nYavukiye ahitwa mu Gitega iKigali. Atuye mu mujyiKigali.Yize amashuri mato kuri Ecoles primaire des Gitega. He finished\nAzwi cyane kwi Zina rya \"Rusine\". Yamenyekanye cyane mu gukina nk'umuntu wasinze."}
