{"id": "12607", "revid": "12135", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12607", "title": "It\u00e4keskus", "text": "It\u00e4keskus (izina mu kinyasuwede: \"\u00d6stra centrum\") ni akarere ka Helsinki, umurwa mukuru wa Finilande.\nAbagera kuri 12 ku ijana by'abaturage bari bafite inkomoko muri Afurika, kikaba cyari umugabane munini w'uturere twose twa Helsinki."}
{"id": "12612", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12612", "title": "Stefania Turkewich", "text": "Stefania Turkewich-Lukianovych (25 Mata 1898 - 8 Mata 1977) yari umuhimbyi wo muri Ukraine, umucuranzi wa piyano,ndetse n\u2019umuziki, uzwi nk'umugore wa mbere umugore wa mbere w'umuhimbyi muri Ukraine. Ibikorwa bye byabujijwe muri Ukraine n'Abasoviyeti.\nUbwana ndetse n'imikurire ye.\nStefania yavukiye i Lviv, Otirishiya-Hongiriya. Sekuru (Lev Turkevich), na se (Ivan Turkevich) bari abayobozi b'itororero. Nyina Sofia Kormoshiv (\u041a\u043e\u0440\u043c\u043e\u0448\u0456\u0432) yari umucuranzi wa piyano kandi yigana na Karol Mikuli na Vil\u00e9m Kurz, anafashanya na Solomiya Krushelnytska. \n\u200aUmuryango wose wari uwabanyamuziki kandi buri wese yacurangaga igikoresho cy'umuziki. Stefania yacurangaga piyano, inanga, na garonium."}
{"id": "12615", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12615", "title": "Element Eleeeh", "text": "Mugisha Fred Robinson uzwi nka Producer Element, ni imfura mu muryango w\u2019abana bane, yavukiye mu karere ka Karongi mu ntara y\u2019i Burengerazuba.\nFred Robinson Mugisha (yavutse 26 Nyakanga 2000) azwi kandi ku izina ry'urubyiniro Element Eleeeh, ni umutunganyamajwi (Record producer) akaba n'umwanditsi w'indirimbo uzwi mu gutunganya indirimbo z'abahanzi benshi barimo Bruce Melody, Mani Martin, The Ben, Meddy n'abahanzi mpuzamahanga nka WizKid, Davido n'abandi benshi. Yamenyekanye cyane kuri tagi yihariye 'Eleeeh', mu gutangira cyangwa kurangiza ibihangano bye byose. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nElement yavutse ku ya 26 Nyakanga 2000 akurira i Karongi, mu burengerazuba bw'u Rwanda. yize amashuri yisumbuye muri College Sainte Marie Kibuye. Nyuma yo kurangiza amashuri ategereje ibya kaminuza, Element yinjiye mu buhanzi. Nubwo yaririmbaga ariko yari anafite impano yo gucuranga akanakora imidundo ishyirwa mu ndirimbo.\nYaje kugira umujinya ukomeye nyuma yo gusiragizwa n\u2019aba-producer yaganaga ngo bamukorere indirimbo, afata icyemezo cyo gutangira kwikorera umuziki.Yakoze nyinshi mu ndirimbo zigezweho muri iki gihe nka; Henzapu ya Bruce Melodie, Kola ya The Ben, Kao ya Kevin Kade, Micro ya Davis D, Saa moya ya Bruce Melodie, Care ya Emmy, Ku mutima ya Uncle Austin, Mpa formula ya Juno Kizigenza n\u2019izindi nyinshi.Nyuma y\u2019igihe kitageze ku mwaka atangiye gukora indirimbo z\u2019abahanzi, kuri ubu akaba ari gukorana n\u2019abahanzi bakomeye we asanga ari amahirwe akomeye yagize, ndetse ntanatinya guhamya ko ari Imana yamuhaye umugisha.\nIbikorwa yakoze.\nMu mwuga we yabaye umutunganyamajwi mwiza aho yegukanye ibihembo birimo:\nNyuma yaho yakoze indirimbo zirimo aza kunzwe nka Kashe, Fou de toi yakoranye na Bruce Melody na Ross Kana, Milele,Maaso,Njozi yakoranye na Marioo, Tombe n'izindi nyinshi."}
