{"id": "12620", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12620", "title": "Icyinterlingue", "text": "Icyinterlingue ([inter\u02c8li\u014b\u0261we]; ISO 639 ni ukuvuga, ile), mu ntangiriro ya Occidental ([oktsiden\u02c8ta\u02d0l]), ni ururimi mpuzamahanga rwabafasha rwashizweho mu 1922 rukitwa izina mu 1949. Uwayiremye, Edgar de Wahl, yashatse kugera ku kibonezamvugo kinini n\u2019imiterere karemano.\nUbuvanganzo.\nInyandiko nyamukuru yubuvanganzo muri Icyinterlingue yagaragaye muri Cosmoglotta. Hariho kandi ibikorwa bimwe, byumwimerere kandi byahinduwe, byasohotse muri Icyinterlingue.\nBimwe mubikorwa muri Icyinterlingue ni:"}
{"id": "12624", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12624", "title": "Kigali Innovation City", "text": "Umujyi wa Kigali Innovation City (KIC) ni ihuriro ry'ikoranabuhanga ryateganijwe i Kigali mu Rwanda. Guverinoma y'u Rwanda yizeye gukurura kaminuza zo mu gihugu ndetse no mu mahanga, amasosiyete y'ikoranabuhanga ndetse n\u2019ibigo bikoresha ikoranabuhanga ry\u2019ibinyabuzima, kandi bikagira amazu y\u2019ubucuruzi n\u2019ubucuruzi. Ikaba igamije kubakwa kuri hegitari 70 z'ubutaka muri Kigali idasanzwe y\u2019ubukungu mu karere ka Gasabo.\nUmujyi wa Kigali Innovation City uri muri gahunda ya Guverinoma y\u2019u Rwanda Icyerekezo 2020 n\u2019ubufatanye bwa Leta n\u2019abikorera hagati ya Guverinoma na Afurika50. Afurika50, urubuga rw\u2019ishoramari rw\u2019ibikorwa remezo rwashinzwe na Banki nyafurika itsura amajyambere (AfDB) n\u2019ibihugu bya Afurika, ni umuterankunga n\u2019umufatanyabikorwa uzafasha guteza imbere no gutera inkunga umushinga.\nUmujyi wa Kigali Innovation wagereranijwe n\u2019umujyi wa Konza w\u2019ikoranabuhanga uteganijwe muri Kenya, watangajwe mu 2008, hamwe n\u2019itsinda ry\u2019ikoranabuhanga ryateganijwe muri Gana, ryatangajwe mu 2013."}
