{"id": "12627", "revid": "9092", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12627", "title": "Edgar de Wahl", "text": "Edgar Alexei Robert de Wahl (23 Kanama 1867 - 9 Werurwe 1948) yari umwarimu w\u2019umudage wa Baltique, imibare n\u2019indimi. Azwi cyane kubera kuba yarashizeho Icyinterlingue, ururimi rusanzwe rwubatswe rushingiye ku ndimi z'Ubuhinde n'Uburayi, rwasohotse bwa mbere mu 1922."}
{"id": "12628", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12628", "title": "NSENGIMANA Eric", "text": "NSENGIMANA Eric ni Umunyarwanda wavukiye mu rwanda mu mwaka wa 01/01/1993, intara y'iburasirazuba akarere ka kirehe, umurenge wa kigina, akagari ka rwanteru, umudugudu wa rusororo\nAMASHURI\namashuri abanza yayize mu ishuri ribanza rya KIGINA guhera 2001-2007\nIkiciro rusange yakize kuri ESIM KIRAMURUZI guhera 2008-2010\nIkiciro kisumbuye yakize kuri ES NYARUBUYE(BEETICA) guhera 2010-2013\nKaminuza yayiye muri kaminuza nkuru y'uRwanda (UR) muri College y'ubuhinzi n'ubworozi\nishami rya NYAGATARE guhera 2014-2018 aho yakuye imyamyabushobozi yo mu rwego rwa Ao"}
{"id": "12630", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12630", "title": "Amasunzu", "text": "Amasunzu ni imisatsi idasasanzwe yo mu Rwanda yahoze yambarwa n'abagabo, ndetse n'abagore batashyingiranywe kugira ngo berekane abashobora kurega ko ari ingaragu kandi bafite imyaka yo gushyingirwa,hamwe numusatsi wanditswe muri crets, ukunze gusobanurwa nka crescent. Imisatsi yerekanaga imibereho, Kandi abagabo batambaraga Amasunzu barebwaga bakekwa kugeza mu kinyejana cya 20. Imiterere nayo yambarwa nabagore batashyingiranywe nyuma yimyaka 18 \u2013 imyaka 20, byerekana ko bafite imyaka yo gushyingirwa. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nMubihe byashize, Abantu bo mu Rwanda bambaye amasunzu muburyo burenga 30 butandukanye. Byari kwerekana ubuntu nubwiza muri kiriya gihe.\nIyi misatsi idasanzwe ya Amasunzu yerekanaga uruhare rutandukanye mubyiciro mubuzima bwabagore nabagabo. Iyo abarwanyi bambaraga, ni ikimenyetso cyimbaraga nubutwari. Yambarwa nabagore,batarashyingirwa cyangwa ikaranga ubusugi. Umukobwa ukiri muto yarambaraga mbere yo gushaka. Iyo umukobwa amaze gushyingirwa, yahindura imisatsi ye kugirango ukure mubwisanzure (gutega urugori), Bisobanura ko yashakanye kandi azerekana kubaha umugabo we ndetse n'abana babo.\nIbi byafatwaga nkuburyo bwo gutunganya umubiri, kuko ikinyabupfura cyu Rwanda ubusanzwe gishingiye kumiterere yumubiri. Byongeye kandi, kwambara imisatsi yerekana ibyiciro; yatanzwe n'abayobozi bakomeye, abanyacyubahiro n'abakire.https://historydaily.org/amasunzu-hairstyle\nhttps://thisisafrica.me/arts-and-culture/amasunzu-hairstyle-rwanda/\nhttps://rarehistoricalphotos.com/amasunzu-rwandan-hairstyle-photos \nhttps://thisisafrica.me/arts-and-culture/amasunzu-hairstyle-rwanda/\nhttps://web.archive.org/web/20220726214108/https://historydaily.org/amasunzu-hairstyle"}
{"id": "12634", "revid": "11090", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12634", "title": "Ibiraribyamateka", "text": "Emmanweli Gapyisi\nEmmanweli Gapyisi yavukiye ku Gikongoro mu w\u20191953.\nMu mashuri yize iby'ubukungu, abyiga mu Bubiligi muri kaminuza yigenga ya Buruseli. \nAha kandi yanahabay umukuru w'abanyeshuri. Arangije amashuri, yasubiye mu Rwanda, ahakora imirimo itandukanye: yakoze muri BUNEP, MINITRAPE (mu Rwanda) ndetse na SHELTER (muri Kenya).\nNyuma yaje kujya gukorera muri Gineya Konakiri mu bijyanye n'imishinga ya LONI. Mu gihe cy'amashyaka menshi mu Rwanda, Gapyisi ari mu bari barangaje abarwanashyaka ba MDR.\nYaje kwicwa kuwa 18 Gicurasi umwaka w'1993."}
{"id": "12638", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12638", "title": "Uwamwezi Mugire Daphine(Bianca Baby)", "text": "Amateka ya Uwamwezi Mugire Daphine.\nUwamwezi Mugire Daphine uzwi kw'izina rya Bianca Baby ni umunyamakurukazi womu Rwanda,\nAkazi akora.\nBianca Baby yatangiye umwuga w'itangazamakuru abifashijwemo n'umunyamakuru Tuyishime Kharim uzwi nka Khenziman wamwinjije muri studio za City Radio akamwigisha akaba amaze gukorera ibitangazamakuru bitandukanye.\nBianca Baby yatangiye kuba umunyamakuru akorera kuri City Radio nyuma y'umwaka n'igice arasezera ajya kuri Flash Radio bamusaba gukora no kuri Flash TV akajya ahakora hombi nyuma y'imyaka ibiri yaje kujya kw'Isibo ari naho akorera umwuga w'itangazamakuru kugeza uyu munsi.\nIbindi bikorwa.\nBianca umunyamakurukazi ukora ikiganiro TAKEOVER aho akorana nabagenzibe aribo Mc Buryohe,Dj Diallo na Dj Trick. ikindi Bianca wamenya numunyamideri aho amaze gutegura amarushanwa kunshuro yakabira ariyo yise BIANCA FASHION HUB. "}
{"id": "12639", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12639", "title": "Rugabire", "text": "Rugabire.\nRugabire ni inkweto zikorwa muruhu akeshi zamenyekanye kwizina rya masayi.\nUkozamenyekanye..\nRugabire keshi dukunze kwita Masai ubundi zamenyekanye mu Rwanda cyane kubera ukuntu zizunguzwa nabantu bo mubwoko bwa bamassai baturuka muri Kenya na Tanzania"}
{"id": "12640", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12640", "title": "Igisabo", "text": "IGISABO.\nIgisabo ni kimwe mubikoresho byubashywe cyane mumuco nyarwanda.igisabo ni igikoresho bakoresha bacunda amata.\nIgisabo nigikoresho gikoreshwa mumuco wakinyarwanda bacunda amata kugirango bayakuremo amavuta yinka.\nIgisabo cyari igikoresho cyategurwa biturutse kugutera inzuzi hanyuma kigategurwa kigahabwa ishusho ariyo mubona kibagifite amabondo manini, Mugihe cyabaga kitarakurwa kunkonto yanyina cyabangirwa urugata bakagiterekaho kikagandariraho kizana ariya mabondo ndetse ninkondo nini ifasha abacunda kukibuganizamo amata bagafunga bakorereje umupfundikizo bakuraga mubirere by'ibaravu bigatuma amata atameneka bmugihe barigucunda.\nAhandi gikunda gukoreshwa.\nIgisabo kandi gikoreshwa mu mihango nyarwanda myishi igiye itandukanye cyane cyane nko mubirori bijyanye no mu gushyingirwa aho bagiha umukobwa wakowe ahabwa igisabo nk'impano mu majyambere ajyanye mu rugo rwe mukumwifuriza kuzatunganirwa akazahorana amata kuruhimbi.\nIgisabo mu mihango y'ubukwe.\nUbusanzwe m'umuco nyarwanda bubaha inka ndetse n'ibizikomokaho harimo nk'amavuta, amata,\nnibindi si ibyo gusa kandi umuco nyarwanda wubaha cyane n'ibikoresho bifitanye isano n'inka\ncyangwa bigira aho bihurira, nkaho usanga mumuco nyarwanda Igisabo gifatwa cyane nkigikoresho\ncyubashywe, kuko usanga bagikoresha mumihango itandukanye y'ubukwe bwa kinyarwanda\naho usanga Igisabo gihabwa umukobwa washyingiwe nk'ikimenyetso cy'umuco bisobanura \nkumwifuriza guhorana amata kuruhimbi,gutunga, ndetse no kugira abana."}
{"id": "12641", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12641", "title": "Intore", "text": "Intore.\nIntore ni izina bita umubyinnyi nyarwanda wigistina gabo ubyina umuco nyarwanda.\nIbidasanzwe biranga intore.\nIntore zizwiho techinike idasanzwe izemerera gusimbuka hejuru cyane muri 2m40 iyo zirikubyina kandi zizwiho ibyino idasanzwe bita guhamiriza aho ziba zambaye ibyo bita imigara mkumutwe wazo.\nUko zamenyekanye kwisi.\nIntore ubundi yamenyekanye kwisiyose mukubyina ubwo zitabiraga imurika gurisha mpuzamahanga ryabereye i buruseli muwi 1958."}
{"id": "12642", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12642", "title": "Amayugi", "text": "Amayugi.\nAmayugi ni igikoresho ababyinnyi nyarwanda bambara ku maguru iyo bari kubyina ibyino nyarwanda. \nImitere yamayugi.\namayugi agize nuduce twishi twibyuma tuvuga nkinzongera,byumwihariko amayugi ashobora gusobanurwa nka verisiyo ntoya yi nzogera imwe.mugihe amayugi yo agizwe nurukurikirane rwinzogera zifatanije."}
{"id": "12650", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12650", "title": "Urugori", "text": "urugori ni ikimenyetso ababyeyi bakera bambaraga mu mutwe mu Rwanda \nAkamaro.\nurugori cyari ikimenyetso ababyeyi mu Rwanda bambaraga mu birori gusa si ababyeyi bose barwambaraga \nbyasabaga kuba warashyingiwe kandi urugori mu Rwanda rufatwa nk'impano bahaga umukobwa yabyaye\nUrugori ni akantu kameze nkakaziga bambikaga umubyeyi wabyaye umugeni ukaba arinawo muhango wanyuma wakorwaga mu bijyanye n'imihango y'ubukwe!https://www.google.com/search?q=urugori&amp;oq=urugori&amp;gs_lcrp=EgZjaHJvbWUyCQgAEEUYORiABDINCAEQLhiRAhiABBiKBTINCAIQABiRAhiABBiKBTIHCAMQABiABDIHCAQQABiABDIHCAUQABiABDIHCAYQABiABDIHCAcQABiABDITCAgQLhivARjHARi6AhiABBiYBTIHCAkQABiABDIHCAoQABiABDIHCAsQABiABDIHCAwQABiABDIHCA0QABiABNIBCTEwNjU4ajBqN6gCErACAQ&amp;client=ms-android-transsion-infinix-rev1&amp;sourceid=chrome-mobile&amp;ie=UTF-8"}
{"id": "12652", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12652", "title": "Umusambi", "text": "Umusambi.\numusambi ni igikoresho abanyarwanda baboha mu migwegwe ndetse nibindi byatsi bimera mwishyamba\nno mugishanga\nAkamaro.\numusambi ni igikoresho baboha mu migwegwe ndetse no mubindi byatsi bimera mugishanga\nni gikoresho gifite akamaro kuko bakicaraho cyane cyane mubicde byo mubyaro usanga abenshi bicara\nkumisambi barya,baganira nibindi hari nibice bimwe nabimwe byo mubyaro bayisasa bakayiryamaho"}
