{"id": "12657", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12657", "title": "Isuka", "text": "Isuka.\nIsuka ni igikoresho gifitiye abaturage akamaro kw'isi hose cyane cyane mubihugu bifite ubukungu, \nUbukungu bushingiye kubuhinzi, amasuka abamo ubwoko bw'inshi hakaba barimo izihinga ndetse n'izibagara \nUbuhinzi bwa gakondo bukorwa hifashishijwe isuka \nAkamaro.\nIsuka n'igikoresho cy'ubuhinzi bakoresha bahinga Imyaka yo kurya n'ibindi byinshi bitandukanye\nIsuka kandi ikoreshwa bahinga ibishyimbo,ibijumba,ibirayi,ikawa,n'ibindi byinshi...\nAMASHAKIRO"}
{"id": "12659", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12659", "title": "Agacuma", "text": "Agacuma.\nAgacuma ni bimwe mu bikoresho by'ifashishwaga ahambere nanubu bigikoreshwa banyweramo umutobe cyangwa inzoga yo m'ubwoko bw'ibitoki cyane cyane mu Rwanda.\nInkomoko yagacuma.\nAgacuma ni ibihingwa batera byakwera bagakuramo imbuto bakagasiga irange cyangwa se bakagataka ubundi bagatangira kukanyweramo inzoga n'umutobe. Agacuma kandi ushobora kugataka muburyo bwinshi butandukanye"}
{"id": "12660", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12660", "title": "Meddy", "text": "Ngabo Medard Jobert Meddy ni umunya Rwanda w'umuhanzi uzwi ku ndirimbo z'urukundo. Meddy \u00a0avukana n\u2019abana batandatu(batatu kuri se na nyina abandi batatu kuri mukase). Uyu muhanzi avuga ko kubera ubuzima bw\u2019imiryango yabo byatumye aba bombi batabasha kubana ngo barambane n\u2019ubwo bari baratangiye bakundana cyane. Se wa Meddy yitabye Imana mu mwaka wa 2008 mu gihugu cy\u2019Uburundi aho yari \u00a0yaragiye nyuma yo gutandukana na nyina wa Meddy batigeze barambana. Mama we yitabye Imana ku wa 14 Kanama 2022 azize uburwayi aho yari arwariye muri Kenya. \nUbuzima.\nMeddy ni kenshi yavuze ko yatangiye umuziki akiri muto nyuma y\u2019uko nyina umubyara yakundaga kumwigisha gucuranga indirimbo za Bob Marley by\u2019umwihariko iyitwa Redemption song. Ababyeyi b\u2019uyu muhanzi ngo na bo bari abanyamuziki, se yari umucuranzi ukomeye wa gitari gusa uyu musore ntiyagize amahirwe yo kumubona amaso ku yandi kuko yitabye Imana Meddy akiri muto cyane. Nyina na we wakundaga umuziki cyane yatoje umwana we gucuranga ndetse amwinjiza muri korali ari naho kwiyumvamo ubuhanzi byatangiriye. Avugako kuba mu mwaka wa 2010 we na The Ben baroherejwe mu kazi muri Amerika bagafata icyemezo cyo kugumayo, ngo babikoze batagamije inabi ahubwo ngo \u2018byari ku bw\u2019impamvu zo gushaka iterambere no gushaka icyazamura umuryango.Yongeyeho ati \"Turi Abanyamerika mu mpapuro ariko turi Abanyarwanda mu maraso.\""}
{"id": "12661", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12661", "title": "The Ben", "text": "Mugisha Benjamin (The Ben) ni umuhanzi w'UmunyaRwanda wakomereje umwuga wo kuririmba muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za America.\nUbuzima bwite.\nThe Ben yavuye mu Rwanda mu mwaka wa 2010, icyo gihe yari ku isonga mu bahanzi bari bakunzwe muri icyo gihe ndetse kugeza ubu ari imbere mu bafite igikundiro.Uyu muririmbyi yakoze indirimbo nyinshi, mu zakunzwe by\u2019ikirenga mu myaka amaze muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika zirimo \u2018Give to me\u2019, \u2018Am in love\u2019, \u2018Only You\u2019, \u2018Urabaruta\u2019, \u2018Ntacyadutanya\u2019 n\u2019izindi nyinshi.Taliki 15 Ukuboza nibwo yasabye anakwa umukunzi we nyuma yaho The Ben yakoze ubukwe n'umukunzi we witwa Uwicyeza Pamella witabiriye irushanwa rya Miss Rwanda, ibirori byabereye mu Ihema riri ku Intare Conference Arena, i Rusororo mu Karere ka Gasabo byabaye taliki ya 23 Ukuboza. "}
{"id": "12662", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12662", "title": "Javan Iradukunda", "text": "Javan Iradukunda also popularly known by his stage name Javanix, he's rwandan Musical Artist, Songwriter,entrepreneur,actor and content creator,he's the founder of The Nix Entertainment.his popular songs Kore,amabia,sepera,abashu,Zamani,Ibare,rongora, and more others. \nBiography.\nJavanix was born on 16/04, 1994 in Western province of rwanda, Rusizi district he's the son of Ngirimana Sadock and Nyirangirinshuti Esther.\nJavanix attended primary school at muganza primary school and he later joined Gakenke secondary school and he has completed his Scientific studies at Groupe schoraire Kigeme in southern province, nyamagabe district in physics,Biology, Chemistry where in 2014 joined University of rwanda/College of education in 2014, Javanix had graduated in science with Education.\nHistory.\nJavanix started singing at his early age in church choir,high school worship team and in singing competitions that used to raise different young talent s at his village.\nJavanix has recorded his first song in WB record(Ubutumwa) and second one in Infinity record(Coast to Coast) this was in 2014, Javanix could not manage to promote those songs as he was preparing to join his university studies and this was his first family concern.\nAlthough he was at College but Singing and writing songs was Javanix's most important moment from 2014 to 2018 where he returned in music game as professional artist.\nThrough a song named \"Umuti\" In 2018 Javanix has colaborated with rwandan hiphop artist Mukadaff and in 2019 he came up with western collaboration \"Night love ft The Same Abiru.and this Year he was awarded as the best Performaning artist in Kivu Awards,Western province.\nFrom 2019 Javanix has released more singles and collabo and he later lounched his first album titled (Virus) in 2021 in mega concert that took place in Rusizi district, kamembe City.\nin 2020 Javanix raised The Nix Entertainment the multi showbisness company where he's currently signed."}
{"id": "12663", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12663", "title": "Paris Saint-Germain F.C.", "text": "Ikipe yumupira wamaguru ya Paris Saint-Germain (Imvugo yigifaransa:, bakunze kwita Paris Saint-Germain, Paris, Paris SG cyangwa PSG gusa ni club yumupira wamaguru wabigize umwuga ifite icyicaro i Paris, mubufaransa. Barushanwe muri Ligue 1, igice cyambere cyigifaransa Nka kipe yitwaye neza mu Bufaransa, batsindiye icyubahiro kirenga 40, harimo ibikombe icumi bya shampiyona ndetse n\u2019igikombe kimwe cy\u2019iburayi. Ikibuga cyabo ni.\nAmateka.\nAbanya Parisi bashinzwe mu 1970, nyuma yo guhuza Paris FC na Stade Saint-Germain. PSG yatsindiye icyubahiro cya mbere gikomeye, Igikombe cy\u2019Ubufaransa, mu 1982 ndetse nicyiciro cya mbere cyicyiciro cya mbere mu 1986. 1990 ni kimwe mubihe byatsinze amateka mumateka yiyi kipe; batwaye igikombe cya kabiri cya shampiyona, ibikombe bitatu by\u2019Ubufaransa, ibikombe bibiri bya Shampiyona y\u2019Ubufaransa, Ibikombe bibiri by\u2019Ubufaransa ndetse n\u2019igikombe cya UEFA Cup Winners '1996. Nyuma yo kugabanuka kwamahirwe mu myaka ya za 2000, Red na Blues bishimiye ububyutse kuva mu 2011 hamwe no kongera inkunga mu bijyanye n\u2019amafaranga, kugera ku butegetsi butagereranywa mu marushanwa yo mu gihugu, gutwara ibikombe byinshi bya shampiyona ndetse n\u2019ibikombe byigihugu. PSG nayo yabaye ibintu bisanzwe muri UEFA Champion League, igera kumukino wambere wanyuma muri 2020. "}
{"id": "12664", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12664", "title": "Patriote", "text": "Patriots.\nikipe ya Patriots Basket ball Club yamamaye ku izina rya Patriot ni Club ibarizwa mu Rwanda i Kigali\nPatriot yamamaye cyane mu mwaka wa 2014 ikinira mu rugo I Kigali ubwo yari iyambere inshuru zigera\nkuri enye (4) iwayo.\nKwamamara.\niyi kipe ibarizwa mu Rwanda i Kigali mu mwaka wa 2021 yinjiye mu irushanwa rya Afurika rizwi nka \nBasketeball Africa League (BAL) ariryo ryatumye amagana namagana yabantu kwisi hose amenya iyi\nkipe ya Basket kubera ko muri iryo rushanwa yakinishijemo icyamamare ku ISI hose cy'umuraperi cyizwi\nku Izina rya J COLE akaba ari umu raperi ukomoka mugihugu cy' Amerika\nAmateka n'inkomoko.\niyi kipe ya Patriot BBC yashinzwe mu mwaka wa 2014 mu Rwanda ishingwa nabayobozi bibigo bitandukanye\nby'ubukungu mu Rwanda nyuma yimyaka ibiri gusa ishinzwe Patriot yahise itwara shampiona yambere y'igihugu\nmu Rwanda\nInsinzi ya Patriot.\nku itariki ya 21 Nzeri iyi kipe kandi yegukanye igikombe cya kane (4) cya shampiona numa yo Gutsinda\nikipe izwi nka REG BBC mumukino wayo wanyuma ubwo yayitsindiraga muri Kigali Arena \nku itariki ya 16 Gicurasi 2021 nibwo Patriot BBC yakinnye umukino wayo wambere wa Basketball africa League\n(BAL) i Kigaki mu Rwanda. ubwo byari ibyishimo kubafana bayo itsinda ikipe izwi nka RIVERS HOOPERS\nyo mu Gihugu cya Nigeria amanota 83-60."}
{"id": "12665", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12665", "title": "Niyonzima Haruna", "text": "Niyonzima Haruna Ni Umunyarwanda ukina umupira w'amaguru mu buryo bw'umwuga. \nUbuzima bwe Mugukina Umupira w'Amaguru.\nYamenyekanye akinira Etincelles mu mwaka 2004, ari nabwo yatangiye guhamagarwa mu Ikipe y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019Abato.\nMu mwaka 2006 yerekeje muri Rayon Sports, gusa ntiyayitinzemo kuko yahise yerekeza muri APR FC mu mwaka 2007, ahava ajya muri Yanga SC mu mwaka 2011, iyi yayivuyemo mu mwaka 2017 yerekeza muri mukeba Simba SC.Mu mpeshyi yu mwaka 2019 yatandukanye na Simba SC, agaruka mu Rwanda, nyuma y\u2019amezi atandatu akinira AS Kigali, yongera kugurwa na Yanga SC. Nyuma y\u2019imyaka akina muri shampiyona ya Tanzaniya, muri 2021 nibwo yashimiwe na Yanga yakiniye igihe kinini maze agaruka mu Rwanda mu ikipe ya AS Kigali.Kugaruka gukina mu Rwanda kwe benshi babifashe nko kuba ageze mu myaka ye ya nyuma y\u2019urugendo rwe muri ruhago bamwe bemeza ko ashaje atagishoboye gukina. Muri icyo gihe nibwo yagiye abazwa niba yaratangiye gutekereza kuba yahagarika umupira w\u2019amaguru, bikajyana no kubazwa igihe azasezerera mu ikipe y\u2019igihugu.Abakurikirana umupira w\u2019amaguru mu Rwanda, kuri ubu bemeza ko Haruna ari umwe mu bakinnyi beza b\u2019abanyarwanda bakina imbere mu gihugu bitwara neza kurusha n\u2019abo bafite imyaka mike kumurusha.ni umukinnyi wo hagati akaba Kapiteni w\u2019Ikipe y\u2019Igihugu \u2018Amavubi\u2019. "}
{"id": "12666", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12666", "title": "Kwizera Olivier", "text": "Kwizera Olivier ni umusore w'Umunyarwanda ukina umupira w'amaguru akaba umunyezamu w'ikipe y'Igihugu. \nUbuzima bwe mu mupira w'amaguru.\nKwizera Olivier wazamukiye mu ikipe Isonga FC, ayikinira hagati y'umwaka 2011 n'umwaka 2013, yamenyekanye cyane ubwo yakiniraga APR FC hagati y'umwaka 2013 nuwa 2016.Nyuma yo kurekurwa n\u2019Ikipe y\u2019Ingabo mu mwaka 2016, yakiniye Bugesera FC umwaka umwe, yerekeza muri Free State Stars yo muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo mu mwaka 2017, ayikinira kugeza mu ntangiriro z\u2019uyu mwaka. Mu mwaka 2015 ni bwo yatangiye guhamagarwa mu Ikipe y\u2019Igihugu Nkuru \u2018Amavubi\u2019, gusa ntari mu ikipe yitabajwe mu mikino ibiri ya gicuti hagati y\u2019u Rwanda na Centrafrique.Mu Ukuboza mu mwaka 2019, Kwizera yasinyiye Ikipe ya Gasogi United kuyikinira amezi atandatu(6) gusa ntiyamazemo kabiri ahubwo yahise ajya muri Rayon Sports ari nayo abarizwamo kuri ubu. \nUbuzima bwe busanzwe.\nUbusanzwe Kwizera Olivier nta mukunzi afite uzwi, n\u2019ubwo mu minsi ishize hari amakuru atandukanye yavugwaga ko ashobora kuba ari mu rukundo na Miss Umutoniwase Nadia wa menyekanye cyane muri filime y'uruhererekane mu Rwanda.Umunyezamu w\u2019ikipe y\u2019igihugu Amavubi na Royon Sports Kwizera Olivier nyuma yo gushyira hanze ifoto ari kumwe n\u2019umukobwa mwiza w\u2019umuzungu benshi batangira gukeka ko ari umukunzi we mushya. "}
{"id": "12667", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12667", "title": "Muyombo thomas", "text": "Muyombo Thomas umuhanzi ny'a Rwanda uzwi kwizina rya TOM CLOSE yavutse tariki ya 28 Kanama 1986, avukira ahitwa masindi muri Uganda arinaho yatangiriye kwigira amashuri y'ikiburamwaka(NURSERY SCHOOL). Nyuma yaho ababyeyi be baje kwimukira mu Rwanda arinaho yahise atangirira amashuri ye abanza muri Remera academy, hanyuma ajya kuri LA colombiere ari naho yasoreje amashuri ye abanza.\nUbuzima bwe bw'amashuri.\nNyuma yo gusoza amashuri ye abanza muri LA colombiere Muyombo Thomas yakomereje amashuri ye yisumbuye muri kaminuza nkuru y'u Rwanda(UR) aho yize ubuganga ku isezerano yari yarahaye nyina mbere y'uko mama we yitaba Imana. Yasoje amasomo y'i sumbuye muri kaminuza nkuru y'u Rwanda muri 2013.\nAho yakoze.\nNyuma yo gusoza amasomo ye yismbuye muri kaminuza nkuru y'u Rwanda muri 2013 Muyombo Thomas uzwi kw'i zina rya Tom Close muri 2014 yahise atangira gukorera mu bitaro bya Kacyiru. Muri 2015 yahise ajya gukora mu kigo cy'ubuzima cya RBC.\nUko yazamuwe mu ntera mu kazi.\nUmuhanzi DR Muyombo Thomas uzwi nka Tom close yazamuwe mu ntera mu kazi nyuma yaho inama y'a ba minisitiri yateranye ikamugira umuyobozi w'ishami ry'igihugu rishinzwe gutanga amaraso mu kigo cy'igihugu cy'ubuzima (RBC). Tom Close yashyizwe muri uyu mwanya nyuma yuko muri Mata 2019 inama yaba minisitiri yari yaramugize umuyobizi w'i kigo gishinzwe gutanga amaraso, ishami ry'a Kigali (RCBT-Kigali). "}
{"id": "12668", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12668", "title": "Olivier Shyaka", "text": "Olivier shyaka ni umusore ukomoka mu gihugu cyu Rwanda ukinira mu ikipe ya REG BBC ikipe ikina\nBasketball iwayo mu Rwanda.\nOlivier Shyaka.\nShyaka wavutse kuya 14 kanama 1995 ni umukinnyi wa REG BBC mu Rwanda ndetse akaba numukinnyi\nmu ikipe y'Igihugu ya basketball mu Rwanda. byumwihariko kandi Olivier Shyaka yahagarariye ikipe y'igihugu\ninshuro nyinshi mu Rwanda.nko muri AfroBasket 2013 shyaka yari umwe mubakinnyi bakomeye mu Rwanda\nyatanze umusanzu we kandi nano muri AfroBasket muri 2017 no mumwaka wa 2021.\nIbyamuranze muri Championa.\nkuva mu mwaka wa 2018 Olivier Shyaka akinira ikipe ya REG BBC i Kigali mu Rwanda muri shampiona\nya 2020 na 2021 Olivier Shyaka yatsindiye shampiona ye yambere mu REG BBC ubwo yaje guhabwa MVP\nya shampiona nyuma yo gutsinda amanota 30 mumukino wambere wa final ndetse no Gutsinda 22 mumukino 2\nAmakipe yanyuzemo.\nOlivier shyaka yatangiye gukina umukino wa Basketball ubwo yigaga mumashuri yisumbuye st Joseph i Kgbayi\nari naho yavuye akomeza gukina nkumukinnyi wabigize umwuga asoje amashuri yisumbuye. Olivier Shyaka kandi\nmu mwaka wa 2011 nibwo yahamagawe mu ikipe yabato y'igihugu bwa mbere naho muri 2013 nibwo yateye intambwe\nidasubira inyuma ubwo yahamagarwaga mu ikipe yabakuru yu Rwanda ndetse akanayiyobora nka Kapiteni wayo. \nhagati yumwaka wa 2012 na 2013 yakiniye kandi Kigali city BBC igihe kingana nimyaka 2. muri 2014 kandi yaje \nkwerekeza muri ESPOIRE BBC nayo ayikinira igihe kingana nimyaka 3. mu mwaka wa 2018 nibwo yerekeje muri \nREG BBC aho yaje no kuyihesha igikombe cya shampiona nyuma yo gutsinda ikipe ya PATRIOT BBC.\nIndi mirimo nyuma yo Gukina Basketball.\nShaka Olivier nyuma yo kuba umukinnyi ukomeye wa Basketball mu Rwanda kandi ni umwe mu bakinnyi\nbakina bafite nakandi kazi kuko ari umukozi wa Banki ya Kigali ushinzwe amafaranga (BK) Cash Manager\nAmashuri yize.\nSyhaka Olivier afite impamyabumenyi mubijyanye nimari ya (bochelor's Degree in Finance) yakuye muri \nKaminuza yigenga ya Kigali (ULK)."}
{"id": "12669", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12669", "title": "Sugira Ernest", "text": "Sugira Ernest Umunyarwanda ukina Umupira w'Amaguru mu Rwanda.\nUbuzima bwe bw'Umupira w'Amaguru.\nSugira yamenyekanye cyane mu mwaka 2012 akinira AS Muhanga mbere y\u2019uko ajya muri APR FC hagati yumwaka 2013 nuwa 2014.Yakiniye AS Kigali hagati yumwaka 2015 nuwa 2016 ndetse na AS Vita Club yo muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Congo.Muri Nyakanga mu mwaka 2017 nibwo Sugira Ernest yasubiye muri APR FC ariko avunikira mu Ikipe y\u2019Igihugu \u2018Amavubi\u2019 nyuma y\u2019ukwezi kumwe. Yamaze hafi umwaka wose adakina, agaruka mu kibuga neza hagati mu mwaka w\u2019imikino wa 2018 na 2019. Kutumvikana n\u2019umutoza Adil Mohamed Erradi biri mu byatumye Sugira Ernest atizwa Rayon Sports mu Ukuboza 2019, nyuma yo kumara amezi abiri yaroherejwe gukorera imyitozo mu ikipe y\u2019abato, Intare FC."}
{"id": "12670", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12670", "title": "Groupe scolaire officielle de butare", "text": "Groupe scolaire officielle de butare ni ishuri rya leta y'u Rwanda ryatangiye mu 1929 ryubatswe na leta ya ababirigi yaririho muricyo gihe mu Rwanda. Ubundi icyi kigo cyatangiye kigamije kwigisha abanyarwanda, abarundi, n'abatuye mugace ka kivu, ni ukuvuga kamwe muduce duherereye muri leta ya repubulika iharanira demokarasi ya kongo yubu.\nAho giherereye.\nNkuko twabivuze ruguru iri shuri ryatangiye mu 1929,riherereye mu ntara y'amajyepfo, Akarere ka Huye, Umurenge wa Ngoma ni metero nkeya uvuye kumuhanda ugana kuri kaminuza nkuru y'u Rwanda. \nAbarisuye bakomeye.\nIri shuri muri 2004 ryasuwe numukuru wigihugu cyacu nyakubahwa perezida wa lepubulika y'u Rwanda Paul kagame,aho bizihizaga isabukuri yi myaka 75th cyari cyimaze gishinzwe anabashimira imikorere myiza yacyo. irishuri kandi 2012 ryongeye kwizihiza isabukuru yimyaka 83th cyarikimaze gishinzwe."}
{"id": "12671", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12671", "title": "FAWE girls school", "text": "Ishuri ry'a segonderi ryitwa FAWE girls' school ryatangijwe na perezida wa repubulika y'u Rwanda Paul kagame mu1999 ubwo yari visi perezida icyo gihe. \nIri shuri ryatangiye rifite inyego yo kuzamura umwana w'umukobwa muburezi ngo ajye kurwego rumwe nku rw'unuhungu.\nUko yagiye azamura urwego.\nFAWE Girls' school muri 1999 yatangiranye abanyeshuri 160 b'abakobwa hamwe n'abarimu 10 gusa. Muri 20009 yarimaze kugira abanyeshuri 700 hamwe nabarimu b'abagabo 23 na b'abagore 12. "}
{"id": "12672", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12672", "title": "Rugangura Axel", "text": "Rugangura Axel yavukiye i Bujumbura tariki 30 Gicurasi mu mwaka 1988. Ni Umunyarwanda ukora mugisata cy'Imikino,avuga amakuru yimikino, akanogeza umupira uwo mu Rwanda nahandi kw'isi akaba akorera ikigo cyigihugu cyi tangaza makurux mu Rwanda(RBA).\nIbyo wamenya kuri Rugangura Axel.\nRugangura amashuri abanza yayigiye mu Mujyi wa Kigali ku ishuri ribanza rya APAPER, icyiciro rusange acyigira kuri IPM (Institut Paroissial de Mukarange), ikindi cyiciro acyigira muri APADE.Kaminuza, Rugangura yayize mu yahoze ari NUR (National University of Rwanda) mu ishami ry\u2019itangazamakuru n\u2019itumanaho rizwi nka SJC (School of journalism &amp; Communication), aharangiza muri 2012.\nYakuriye Kicukiro avuga ko yakunze umupira akiri muto bitewe n\u2019uko bari baturanye n\u2019ahantu berekaniraga umupira bityo akura akunda kuwureba.Aho yareberaga imipira niho yahuriye na Mpamo Thierry wakundaga uko yaganiraga ibijyanye n\u2019imipira aho bareberaga.\nyamujyanye kuri Contact FM, ariko atangira ameze nk\u2019uwimenyereza umwuga nubwo yari afite impano. Muri urwo rugendo Rugangura yanyuze kuri Radio Autentic mbere y\u2019uko ajya mu kwimenyereza umwuga (internship) kuri KFM, radiyo yari mu zigezweho muri icyo gihe.\nUku kwimenyereza kurangiye Rugangura yaje kwerekeza kuriaho yanamenyekaniye cyane aza kuhava yerekeza kuri Radio Rwanda, agikorera kuva mu myaka ine ishize.ni umwe mu banyamakuru bakunzwe cyane kubera ubuhanga afite mu kogeza umupira w\u2019amaguru kuri ubu akaba akora mu kigo cy\u2019igihugu cy\u2019itangazamakuru (RBA). "}
{"id": "12673", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12673", "title": "Rugimbaga Th\u00e9og\u00e8ne", "text": "Rugimbaga Th\u00e9og\u00e8ne Umunyamakuru w'Imikino mu Rwanda. \nIbyo wamenya kuri Rugimbana.\nRugimbaga Th\u00e9og\u00e8ne yatangiye umwuga w\u2019itangazamakuru mu mwaka 2012, yakoreye ibitangazamakuru bitandukanye mu Rwanda birimo Flash FM, Radio 10 na Radio 1 yagezeho mu mwaka 2016.Rugimbana ni izina ryubashywe mu banyamakuru b\u2019imikino bo mu Rwanda ndetse ni umwe mu bari bamaze imyaka myinshi bogeza imikino itandukanye yiganjemo iyo ku mugabane w\u2019u Burayi. "}
{"id": "12674", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12674", "title": "Isiraheri mbonyi", "text": "Isiraheri mbonyicyambu eric uzwi kwizina nka isiraheri mbonyi nu muhanzi uririmba indirimbo z'imana akaririmba anicurangira.\nAmateka ya mbonyicyambu.\nlsiraheri yavutse tariki 20/05/1992 avukira muri Repubulika iharanira demokarasi ya congo(R.D.CONGO).,\nmu ntara ya kivu y'amajyepfo,ahobita uvira.\nMbonyi yabaye muri congo igihe gito yaje mu Rwanda mu 1997 we nu muryango we bakaba batuye kimironko\nibihangano bya isiraheli.\nMbonyi watangiye kuririmba aririmba muri korari,akanacuranga kuburyo atabonaga na mahirwe yo gutera indirimbo.\nubwo yatangiraga kuririmba yahereye kundirimbo yitwa kumugezi,zinzibagirwa,yankuyeho urubanza,ibihe, yesu n number one,\nharubuzima,icyambu."}
{"id": "12676", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12676", "title": "Adil Erradi Mohammed", "text": "Adil Mohammed Erradi w\u2019imyaka 40 Umunya Maroc,Umutoza w'ikipe y'Ingabo z'Igihugu APR FC.\nByinshi Wamenya kuri Adil.\nAdil nu mutoza ufite impamyabushobozi ya A itangwa na UEFA dore ko anafite ubwenegihugu bw\u2019u Bubiligi.Yazanwe mu Rwanda bigizwemo uruhare na Mupenzi Eto\u2019o. Mohammed Erradi yabaye umutoza wungirije muri Raja Casablanca.Yatangiye gutoza APR FC mu Mikino ya Gisirikare yabereye muri Kenya, atwara igikombe mu gihe atahiriwe mu Irushanwa ry\u2019Agaciro ryabaye muri Nzeri uwo mwaka, atsindwa n\u2019amakipe ya Mukura VS ndetse na Police FC.Urugamba nyarwo yarutangiye tariki ya 4 Ukwakira mu mwaka 2019 ubwo APR FC yanganyaga na AS Kigali igitego 1-1 mu mukino w\u2019Umunsi wa Mbere wa Shampiyona ya 2019 na 2020."}
{"id": "12677", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12677", "title": "EMERY GATSINZI", "text": "Emery Gatsinzi niwe raperi wambere ukomeye mu Rwanda ugendeye kubigwi yihariye akaba azwi kw'izina rya Riderman. Uyumuhanzi yavutse tariki ya 10 werurwe1987.\nAho yavukiye.\nRiderman yavukiye I Bujumbura mu Burundi niwe mfura mubavandimwe, bavukana ari batanu,abahungu batatu na bakobwa babiri.\nAmashuri yize.\nEmery Gatsinzi amashuri abanza yayize kuri ecole primaire kabusunzu maze ayisumbuye ayiga Muri groupe scolaire St Andre, kaminuza yayikomereje muri university Libre de Kigali mubijyanye n'ubukungu n'icunga mutungo kugeza muri 2008,aho yerekeje muri Rwanda Tourism University College mu ishami ry'ubukerarugendo n'icunga mutungo ariko ntiyaharangiriza. "}
{"id": "12678", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12678", "title": "Rayon sports fc", "text": "Rayon sports fc ni ikipe ikinira mu Rwanda ikaba iri no mu makipe akomeye muri shampiyona y'u Rwanda(Rwanda premier league).Ni ukuvuga ngo igitekerezo cyo gushinga ikipe ya Rayon Sports cyatangiye kuvuka mu ntangiriro z'umwaka wa 1960 nyuma yo kunoza neza ishingwa mu 1964 ishingiwe mucyahoze ari komini Nyabisindu muri perefegitura ya Butare, ubu ni mu murenge wa Busasamana, akarere ka Nyanza mu ntara y'Amajyepfo. Rayon Sport yaje kubona ubuzima gatozi mu mwaka 1968.\nIbigwi.\nRayon Sports yabaye ikipe ya mbere igeze mu matsinda mu mikino nyafurika, hari mu mwaka wa 2018 ni yo kipe yo mu Rwanda yaciye agahigo ko kugera mu matsinda. \nInkomoko y' izina rayons.\nIzina RAYONS ni izina iyi kipe yahawe na padiri w' umuzungu Arnot Channoire wayoboraga ishuri rya Krisitu umwami ry' i Nyanza, arikomoye ku izina yari yahawe na MUREGO Donate wari warashinze iyi kipe. Hari nyuma y' impinduramatwara ya 1961 ubwo havanwagaho ingoma ya cyami hagashyirwaho Repubulika, ari na bwo hatangiraga gushingwa kw' amakipe ashingiye kuri za komini nka kamini Kiyovu muri Kigali, Mukuraya Astrida na Komini Nyabisindu. Gusa abatuye Nyabisindu ntibigeze biyumvamo iyi kipe kuko bakundaga ikipe ya Amaregure y' umwami MUTARA III Rudahigwa. ibi byatumye uwari perezida w' urukiko rw' ikirenga rwari i Nyanza MUREGO Donate ashinga ikipe idashingiye kuri komini ayita IMIRASIRE ariyo yaje kwitwa RAYONS SPORTS."}
{"id": "12679", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12679", "title": "Nsengimana Rukundo Christian", "text": "Nsengimana Rukundo Christian ni umuhanzi w'umunyarwanda uzwi cyane ku izina rya chriss Eazy. Kuva mu 2020 Chriss Eazy yatangiye gukorana na Junior Giti muri Junior Giti management akimara gusoza amashuri yisumbuye. Amaze gukora indirimbo zakunzwe zirimo iyitwa \u2018Fasta\u2019, \u2018Amashu\u2019 inana n\u2019izindi. \nAmateka[eindura | hindura inkomoko].\nNsengimana Rukundo Christian afite indirimbo zitandukanye ziri mu rurimi rw'ikinyarwanda zikunzwe cyane mu Rwanda ndetse no mu mahanga nk'iyo yise amashu,inana nizindi, sibyo gusa kuko yatangije uruganda rw'imyenda izwi nka Ewuana Collection, yakoze kubera uburyo abantu bayikunze nyuma yo kuyifashisha mu mashusho y\u2019indirimbo ye aheruka gukorera amashusho yitwa \u2018Inana'. mu icyongereza: Ewuana Collection\u2019 irimo amakanzu y'amaboko maremare, amakabutura, amasogisi ndetse n\u2019imipira y\u2019amaboko maremare. Ibi byose bigaragara mu mabara meza atandukanye. \u00a0"}
{"id": "12680", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12680", "title": "Zion Temple", "text": "Zion Temple ni rimwe mumatorero akomeye inaha mu Rwanda ndetse n'imahanga rikaba rifite abayoboke batari bake hirya no hino ku isi. Itorero Zion Temple ryabyawe na minisiteri y'ijambo ry'ukuri (Authentic Word Ministries) iyerekwa ryahawe umukozi w'Imana Apotre DrPaul Gitwaza aho yarafite imyaka 16 mbere y'uko yinjira muri kaminuza ubwo Imana yamubwiraga ko umusore w'umu Authentique azahindura isi, ikaba yarabimubwiye mu rurimi rw'igifaransa (un geune Aunthentique transformera le monde).\nISHAIRO"}
{"id": "12681", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12681", "title": "Padiri Obaldi", "text": "Rugirangoga Obaldi wamenyekanye cyane nka Padiri Obaldi ni umunyarwanda wa vukiye mu Rwanda\nakaba yararanzwe nibikorwa byiza bitandukanye by'iyobokamana harimo nko gusengera abarwayi bagakira\nkunga abantu barebanaga ayingwe mu Rwanda kubera ibihe bibi bya Genocide yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda\nkwirukana Roho mbi mubantu nibindi byinshi bitandukanye. \nPadiri Obaldi.\nPadiri Obaldi yavukiye muri segiteri Rwabidege muri paruwasi ya Mwezi komine ya Karengera mu cyahoze ari\nPerefegitura ya Cyangugu. se yitwaga Yakobo na nyina akitwa Adela akaba umwuzukuru wa Bidadaza yavutse\nmuri Gashyantare 1955 Padiri Obaldi kandi kubera kuvukira mumuryango waba kirisitu Gaturika yabatijwe mugihe\nkingana nukwezi kumwe akivuka mu mwaka wi 1955.\nAmashuri yize n'amavuko ye.\nPadiri obaldi nkuko twabibwiwe haruguru yavutse muri Gashyantare 1955 amashuri abanza yayigiye i Rwabidege\nkuva 1962-1968 Semineri ntoya yayigiye i Mibirizi akomereza nano mu Seminari nto yitiriwe Mutagatifu Piyo wa 10\nyo Kunyundo mugihugu cyabaturanyi i Burundi kugera mu 1973 aho yari yarahungiye irondakoko ryomu Rwanda\nmu 1973 ari naho yasoreje Semineri ntoya. nyuma yaho yagarutse mu Rwanda mu 1978 akomereza mu seminari\nnkuru ya Nyakibanda. \nIhabwa rye ry'ubupadiri.\nPadiri Obaldi yahawe ububasha bwo kuba umu Padiri tariki ya 22 muri Nyakanga 1984 abuhererwa ahitwa i Mwezi\nImirimo ye nibitangaza yakoze.\nKurubu Padiri Obaldi yitabye Imana gusa Imirimo ye nibitangaza yagiye akorera hirya no hino mu Rwanda\nmu turere dutandukanye no muma paruwasi menshi atandukanye nibyo nibyo abenshi mu Rwanda no ku Isi\nhose bamwibukiraho\nIsoza ry'urugendo rwe ku Isi.\nhari ku itariki ya 8 mutarama 2021 ubwo inkuru yakababaro yakwiraga ku isi hose imenyesha urupfu rwa nyakwigendera\nPadiri Obaldi aguye muri Leta zunze ubumwe z'Amerika.ubwo bavugaga ko yazize indwara y'ibihaha yasigiwe na COVID-19"}
{"id": "12682", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12682", "title": "Nyinawambogo", "text": "Nyinawambogo.\nNyinawambogo wamamaye cye muri filimi zurwenya mu Rwanda cyane cyane yamenyekanye muri filimi\nbakundaga kwita iza Kanyombya kuko wasanganga ariwe bakinana cyane muri filimi zimwe mu Rwanda\nnyinawambogo ubusanzwe yitwa MUKANYANDWI ALPHONSINE\nUbuzima Bwite.\nNyinawambogo ubusanzwe ni umubyeyi wabana 2 babakobwa yabyaye kumugabo umwe\numwanawe wimfura afite imyaka 10 ukurikiye afite imyaka 5 gusa yatangaje ko papa wabana\nyamuhemukiye cyane kuko yamutanye nabana kandi kugeza nanubu ntabufasha bwe azi\ngusa avugako yumvako umugabo babyaranye atuye mu karere ka Rubavu"}
{"id": "12683", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12683", "title": "Ibitaro bya Butaro", "text": "Ibitaro bya Butaro ni ibitaro biherereye mu murenge wa Butaro, mu karere ka Burera mu ntara y'Amajyaruguru, Ibi bitaro byatangiye gukora 2006 bishyira 2007 bitangira bikorera mukigo ndera buzima cya Ruhondo bizanywe n'ishuti mubuzima (partner in health) ifatanyije na minisitere y'ubuzima ariko amazu ibitaro nyirizina bikoreramo akaba yaratangiye gukorerwamo muri Mutarama 2011, ni inyubako zatwaye akayabo ka miliyoni 160 za mafaranga y'u Rwanda. \nIrwara zihavurirwa.\nIbitaro bya Butaro nkuko twabivuze hejuru ibi bitaro byafunguwe kumugaragaro mu akarere ka Burera mu ntara y'Amajyaruguru, Ibi bitaro byikitegererezo bisuzuma bikanavura kanseri \"(Butaro Ambulatory Cancer Center (BACC)).\"\nImpano.\nIbitaro bya Butaro tariki ya 9 Nyakanga 2021 ubuyobozi bw' akarere ka Burera bwa shyikirije ibitaro by'a butaro imbangukiragutabara shya, izunganira abaturage mukubagabanyiriza imvune baterwaga n'urugendo rurerure bajyaga bakora bajya gushaka serivise z'ubuvuzi."}
{"id": "12684", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12684", "title": "Lague Byiringiro", "text": "Byiringiro Lague ni umwe mubakinnyi bakomeye bakinira umupira w'amaguru m'u Rwanda, uyu mukinnyi yavutse tariki 1 Mutarama 2000, akaba ari umu ny'a Rwanda ufite uburebure bwa 1,89m. \nUyumukinnyi yavukiye mu murenge wa Gitega mu akarere ka Nyarugenge. mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda\nByiringiro Lague kandi akinira imwe mu ikipe ikomeye mugihugu cy'u Rwanda ariyo APR FC.\nYingiye muriyi ekipe ya APR FC ahagana tariki 1 Mutarama 2018. Nyuma yaje gukinira Ikipe y'igihugu cy'u Rwanda Amavubi"}
{"id": "12685", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12685", "title": "Rwatubyaye Abdul", "text": "Rwatubyaye Abdul.\nRwatubyaye Abdul ni myugariro wikipe yigihugu mu Rwanda yavutse tariki ya 23 Ukwakira 1996kurubu arubatse.\nAmakipe.\nRwatubyaye yakinnye mumakipe menshi atandukanye mu Rwanda harimo nka APR FC kugeza ubu akaba abarizwa\nmu ikipe ya RAYN SPORT nyuma yigihe yaramaze adakina kubera imvune yakuye mu ikipe ya shkupi fc yo muri Macedonia \niyikipe nayo yayigiyemo nyuma yokuva gukina mu makipe ya Championa muri Leta zunze ubumwwe z'America"}
{"id": "12686", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12686", "title": "DJ Marnaud", "text": "Dj Marnaud ni umwe mubasore baamenyekanye cyane cyane mukuvangavanga imiziki hano mu Rwanda. Magingo aya uyumugabo ni umwe mubantu bazwiho ubuhanga buhanitse mukuvaganga imiziki mutubyiniriro mub\nbir ndetse n'ii,ibitaramo bigiye bitandukanye hano mu Rwa. nda\nAmateka.\nMugisha arnaud uzwi cyane kwizina ry'ubuhanzi nka Dj marnaud, yavutse tariki 26 Ugushyingo 1995.\nKumyaka ye Itanu Mugisha Arnaud yarafite ubumenyi kuri piyano kandi anakora ibyino na ma korigarafiya. Dj Marnaud mubwangavu bwe yabyinaga ibyino gakondo hamwe n'inganzo ngari culture troupe."}
{"id": "12687", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12687", "title": "Mukarujanga", "text": "Mujawamariya Hyacinthe wa menyekanye nka Mukarujanga mu Rwanda kubera ingano ye idasanzwe ndetse\nnubuhanga yagaragaje mu ma filimi atandukanye mu gihugu kuko yakinnye muri filimi nyinshi zitandukanye\nMukarujanga.\nMujawamariya Hyacenthe yamamaye nka Mukarujanga mu Rwanda yamenyekanye cyane muri Filimi\nbihe Haranira kubaho yakinaga ari umugore wa Samusure."}
{"id": "12688", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12688", "title": "Samusure", "text": "Kalisa Erneste ni umuhanzi Nyarwanda mu ngeri zitandukanye, yamenyekanyekanye cyane mu Rwanda nka Samusure ndetse no ku yandi mazina yagiye amenyekanaho nka Rulinda, na Makuta.\nkubera gukina ama filimi atandukanye. Yavutse mu mwaka wa 1977. yavukiye i Bugarama, mu karere ka Rusizi.\nIcyivugo cye nk'intore.\nIyo abajijwe uko yakwibwira abatamuzi aseruka atya \n\"Ndi Kalisa wa Butera,\nButera wa Ntamakiriro, \nNtamakiriro wa Mujyabwami, \nMujyabwami wa Mirenge, \nMirenge wa Muhimano, \nNkaba Umuzigaba w'umuzirangwe\nNkaba umusizi,\nNdi indatirwabigwi,\nUmuhanzi ubereye u Rwanda.\" \nUbuzima bwe mbere yo kwinjira muri sinema.\nKalisa Erneste yageze i Kigali mu mwaka wi 1997 mu bugarama aho avugako yahamaze imyaka 4\nakora imirimo itandukanye irimo ubunyonzi,kwirukana inyoni mu mirima,ubukarani nibindi.\nIngeri zitandukanye z'ubuhanzi akora.\nUmuririmbyi,\nUmucuranzi,\nUmushyushyarugamba,\nUmunyarwenya,\nKuvuga amazina y'inka. "}
{"id": "12691", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12691", "title": "James na Daniella", "text": "James Rugarama na Daniella Mukiza ni abanyarwanda batuye mu Rwanda, kandi ni Umuryango wabaramyi ufitanye abana babiri. Ni imwe mu zakoze umuziki ukabasha kugera ku kigero nk\u2019icyo uyu munsi bariho. Bavuga ko kuba indirimbo zabo ziri kwamamara cyane mu buryo bwihuse ari ubushake bw\u2019Imana n\u2019amasengesho yabo adasiba. \nUbuzima bwabo Bombi.\nJames na Daniella baririmbaga batarabana ubundi bagahurira mu matsinda atandukanye. bamaze kubana batangira kujya baririmbana ariko bitari mu buryo bweruye..bavuga ko urukundo rwabo rwatangiye gututumba mu mwaka 2008 cyangwa uwa 2009, mu mwaka 2012 bajya kwiga muri Uganda,umugabo yiga iby\u2019Ububanyi n\u2019Amahanga mu gihe umugore icyo gihe yigaga Ibaruramari.bati,Twamenyanye kera kuko twari abaturanyi Kimironko nyuma tugiye kwiga muri Uganda nibwo twaje kubana. Mu mwaka 2008 cyangwa uwa 2009 nibwo twamenyanye noneho mu 2012 tujya kwiga kaminuza, tuyirangiza mu 2015 aba ari nabwo tuba umuryango.\u201d mu mwaka 2019 nibwo nk\u2019itsinda ryabo bagiye muri studio bakora indirimbo ya mbere bise \u2018Mpa Amavuta\u2019. "}
{"id": "12692", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12692", "title": "CROIX ROUGE Y'U RWANDA", "text": "Croix Rouge y'u Rwanda, izwi nka RRC (Rwanda Red Cross) ni umuryango w'ubutabazi ukorera mu Rwanda washinzwe mu mwaka w'1964, ikaba ifite icyicaro gikuru mu mujyi wa Kigali \n= Uko Croix Rouge y'u Rwanda yavutse =\nku wa 21 Werurwe 1964 nibwo leta y'u Rwanda yashyize umukono ku masezerano y'I Geneva. ku wa 29 Ukuboza 1964 iteka rya perezida ritangaza Croix Rouge nk'umuryango w'ubutabazi. ku italiki 8 Ukwakira 1989 nibwo Croix Rouge y'u Rwanda yahawe ubunyamuryango n'ihsyirahamwe ry'imiryango ya croix Rouge na croissant Rouge, iba igihugu cy'130 cyinjiye muri uyu muryango\n= Amashakiro =\nhttps://web.archive.org/web/20220920173703/https://igihe.com/amakuru/u-rwanda/article/croix-rouge-rwanda-irizihiza"}
{"id": "12693", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12693", "title": "Israel Mbonyi", "text": "Israel Mbonyi ni Umunyamulenge utuye mu Rwanda ni umwe mu bahanzi bamaze kwigarurira imitima ya benshi bitewe n\u2019indirimbo zihimbaza Imana aririmba, aheruka gushyira hanze iyo yise \u2018Sitamuacha.\u2019 \nUrugendo rwe mu Kuramya no Guhimbaza.\nMuri Mata mu mwaka 2021, byari byitezwe ko Israel Mbonyi agomba gukorera urugendo muri Israel muri gahunda bise \u2018Twende Jerusalem\u2019 igamije kuzamura umubano hagati y\u2019icyo gihugu n\u2019u Rwanda no guteza imbere impano z\u2019urubyiruko n\u2019urwego rw\u2019ubuhanzi.Uru rugendo ntirwabaye kubera ibibazo byatewe n\u2019icyorezo cya Covid-19.Ku wa 20 Mata 2022 Israel Mbonyi yakoze igitaramo cye cya kabiri, cya nyuma muri bibiri yagombaga gukorera muri Israel afatanyije na Avraham Tal.Ni igitaramo cyabereye ahitwa Ariel Sharon Park mu Majyepfo y\u2019Umujyi wa Tel Aviv, ahari hakoraniye imbaga y\u2019abakunzi b\u2019umuziki na cyane ko amatike yacyo yari amaze hafi icyumweru ashize ku isoko.Ndetse yigaruriye imitima ya benshi.\nMuri iki gitaramo, Israel Mbonyi yongeye gutungurana aririmba indirimbo yo mu gitabo cy\u2019izaririmbiwe Uwiteka ariko iri mu rurimi rw\u2019Igiheburayo. Yayifatanyije na Avraham Tal.\nUretse iyi ndirimbo ariko kandi Israel Mbonyi yanyujijemo aririmba n\u2019indirimbo \u2018One love\u2019 ya Bob Marley iri mu zahagurukije abatari bake bamufasha kubyina.Uretse izi ariko uyu muhanzi yanaririmbye ize yafashwagamo n\u2019abacuranzi ba Avraham Tal. Uyu muhanzi kandi n'umwe mu bakoze ibitaramo mu nyubako ikomeye mu Rwanda BK ARENA akayuzuza inshuro 3 zikurikiranya. "}
{"id": "12694", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12694", "title": "David Bayingana", "text": "David Bayingana ni umunyamakuru wakoze kubitangazamakuru bitandukanye mu ishami ry\u2019imikino yaba ibyandika no kuri Radio 10 kurubu abarizwa kuri B&amp;B FM Umwezi.\nUbuzima bwe Bwite.\nTariki ya 21 Werurwe, Bayingana yashyingiwe imbere y\u2019umuryango na Teriteka i Bujumbura mu Burundi. Tariki ya 23 Werurwe 2013 Bayingana yashyingiwe imbere y\u2019amategeko mu biro by\u2019Ububanyi n\u2019Amahanga by\u2019u Rwanda mu Burundi. Mu mwaka 2013 nibwo Bayingana David yakoze ubukwe na Kezie Teriteka, baje gutandukana nyuma y\u2019uko bari bamaze kubyarana umwana umwe w\u2019umuhungu. Bayingana yize amategeko muri Kaminuza y\u2019u Rwanda, yatangiriye itangazamakuru kuri Radio Salus, yayivuyeho ajya kuri Voice of Africa, ayivaho ajya kuri Radio10 ubu akaba ari kuri B&amp;B FM afitemo imigabane. "}
{"id": "12695", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12695", "title": "Itorero ADEPR", "text": "Itorero rya ADEPR rimaze imyaka 82 rigeze mu Rwanda, aho ryatangiriye muntara y'uburengerazuba, kuri ubu rifte abayoboke basaga miliyoni 2."}
{"id": "12696", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12696", "title": "Stade ya Bugesera", "text": "Stade ya Bugesera ni stade iherereye mu akarere ka Bugesera mu ntara y'uburasirazuba mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "12698", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12698", "title": "Nsabimana Gisele", "text": "Nsabimana Gisele yatangiye kuririmba akiri umwana, Urugendo rw\u2019ubuhanzi yarutangiye mu 2017, asengera muri itorero ADEPR Gatenga, amenyereye ku mazina ya Gisele Precious, akaba yaramenyekanye mu ndirimbo zitandukanye zirimo: \"Imbaraga\" yamwinjije byeruye mu muziki, \"Inzira zayo\", \"Niwe\", \"Shimwa\", \"Urampagije\", \"Nashukuru\", \"Mbega urukundo\" na \"Umurasaba\"."}
{"id": "12699", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12699", "title": "Nizeyimana olivier", "text": "Olivier Nizeyimana w\u2019imyaka 48 uzwi nka Cafu wabaye umunyeshuri muri kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda akaba ari umunyemari, umuyobozi n'uwashinze sosiyete itwara abagenzi ya Volcano Ltd mu 1999 n'ibintu, akaba ari umukunzi ukomeye wa ekipe ya FC Barcelone, asanzwe kandi ari mu bayobozi b\u2019Urugaga rw\u2019Abikorera mu Rwanda (PSF), aho ayobora Ishami ry\u2019Ubucuruzi na Serivisi."}
{"id": "12700", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12700", "title": "UWAYEZU Jean Fidele", "text": "UWAYEZU Jean Fidele w'imyaka 54 yamavuko, avuka mu akarere ka nyanza, mu intara y'amajyepho yu Rwanda, aho rayon sport ikomoka akaba ariwe muyobozi wayo."}
{"id": "12701", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12701", "title": "Imfurayacu jean Luc", "text": "Imfurayacu Jean Luc ni umunyamakuru wa siporo mu Rwanda aho yamenyekanye mubiganiro bitandukanye ku marandiyo atandukanye nka Inyarwanda.com, Radio/Tv 10 ubu akaba akora ikiganiro cya siporo kuri B&amp;B UMWEZI."}
{"id": "12702", "revid": "17987", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12702", "title": "Gendahimana Eric", "text": "Ngendahimana Eric uzwi nka Gasongo ni umukinnyi ukina nka myugariro mu ikipe ya Rayon Sports fc, akaba yarakinnye mu makipe atandukanye arimo Police FC aho yakinaga nk\u2019umukinnyo wo mu kibuga hagati nyuma akaza kugirwa myugariro."}
{"id": "12703", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12703", "title": "Hirwa Jean de Dieu", "text": "Hirwa Jean de Dieu ni Umukinnyi wa Rayon Sports yayijemo avuye muri Marines FC, mbere yaho akaba yarakina mu ikipe yi intare FC yakuriyemo. Akaba ari umukinnyi ukina mu mutima wa ba myugariro. Ni umwe mu bitwaye neza ku mwanya we mu mwaka w\u2019imikino wa 2021/2022 mu Ikipe ya Marines FC yakiniraga."}
{"id": "12704", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12704", "title": "Kayiranga Jean Baptiste", "text": "Kayiranga Jean Baptiste yavukiye i Murambi muri Rwamagana, yakiniye ikipe y\u2019abana y\u2019i Gikondo na APE Rugunga, aho nyuma y\u2019imyaka ibiri gusa yahise abengukwa na Rayon Sports, Mu 1996 yakiniye Avenue Sportif de la Marsa imyaka ibiri yo muri Tunisia, yahagaritse gukina mu 2000, yakoze amahugurwa y\u2019ubutoza mu Budage, atangira ari umwungiriza, agaruka muri Rayon Sports yahesheje igikombe cya shampiyona nk\u2019umutoza mukuru mu 2005. Yatoje AS Kigali, Kiyovu Sports, Gicumbi FC, Mukura VS, P\u00e9pini\u00e8re FC, Amavubi makuru, U-20, Amavubi y\u2019abagore na Alliance Sports Club yo muri Tanzania."}
{"id": "12706", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12706", "title": "Apotre Yoshuwa Masasu", "text": "Apostle Yoshua Ndagijimana Masasu, the founder and overseer of Evangelical Restoration Church, President and Chancellor of Bible Communication Center, author of Amazon\u2019s Best Seller, \u201cDelivered from All my Fears\u201d \nHistory.\nApostle Yoshua Ndagijimana Masasu was born in 1960 in a village in Rusizi. In 1989, he married Senior Pastor Lydia Umulisa Masasu, and they have been together since then \nApostle Yoshua Ndagijimana Masasu, the founder and overseer of Evangelical Restoration Church, President and Chancellor of Bible Communication Center, author of Amazon\u2019s Best Seller, \u201cDelivered from All my Fears\u201d, Apostle Masasu is a man who has dedicated his whole life to please Jesus at any cost. This passion began when he gave his life to Jesus Christ in 1983 and began the journey of serving him wholeheartedly.\nHe is also the founder of the Bible Communication Centre (BCC), an international organization that focuses on preparing an army of consecrated Disciples, from different places and backgrounds for the purpose of making Jesus Christ the Lord of this generation.\nBCC operates in all 5 continents with more than 5000 members from various churches. Within the BCC program, He has written 7 manuals that are used for discipleship training.\nApostle Yoshua holds a bachelor\u2019s degree in Electronics and telecommunication Engineering and a bachelor\u2019s degree in Library Science.\nHe has an honorary doctorate degree in divinity from Logos University, Florida in 2015, and is currently pursuing a Master\u2019s in Theology: Christian Ethics and Leadership at the Protestant Institute of Arts and Social Sciences, Rwanda.\nApostle Yoshua is happily married to his beautiful wife and partner in ministry, Pastor Lydia Umulisa Masasu, and together they have five children: Deborah, Joshua, Caleb, Esther and Yedidia.\nThe birth of evangelical restoration churh.\nAnd the Lord answered me,and said,write the vision,and make it plain upon tables,that he may run that readeth it. The vision is yet for an appointed time,but at the end it shall speak, and not lie: though it tarry,wait for it ;because it will surely come, it will not tarry\u201d(Habbakuk 2,2-3)\nIn 1984, I visited Rwanda for the first time after decades in exile and God spoke to me about the country. In the aftermath of the 1994 Genocide against Tutsi, Rwanda was a desolate country filled with blood and bones of victims who are estimated to 1 million. God commanded me to organize a mission trip to Rwanda through the earlier created \u2018Jerusalem Ministry\u2019. The mission included among others delivering a special message of God destined to the new authorities in Kigali.\nThe Journey began when he founded \u201cJerusalem Ministry\u201d in Democratic Republic of Congo, that aimed to help his fellow Rwandan refugees to regain hope in that foreign land.\nIn 1994, he was called by God to move to Rwanda and there he founded Evangelical Restoration Church. With the vision of a Church family where those who were nearly lifeless due to the horrors of the genocide against the Tutsi, would be restored into life givers. Today, Evangelical Restoration Church has over 80 parishes in Rwanda and 10+ in other African Countries.\nOn my way to Kigali God reminded me of the words he had told me ten years earlier through Ezekiel 37:1-10 and confirmed that the time of great work among his people and nations starting from Rwanda had come. At that time, Rwanda was looking like the valley of dry bones Ezekiel saw in the vision which became a vast army by the power of the Word and the Spirit of the Lord.\nGod clearly asked us to start a church that would be a Family Church where everyone would find a father, a mother, a sister, and a brother and where dried broken hearts would be restored and equipped. The ultimate vision was to bring restoration in the World where there is spiritual, emotional, and physical death and dryness.\nReference.\n 1. https://ercfamily.org/\n 2. https://bccinternational.org/\n 3. https://cla.umn.edu/chgs/holocaust-genocide-education/resource-guides/rwanda#:~:text=Beginning%20in%201994%20and%20lasting,and%20UN%20peacekeepers%20stood%20by.\n 3. https://inyarwanda.com/inkuru/81337/apotre-masasu-81337.html\n 4. https://ercfamily.org/?zegen-team=apostle-yoshua-n-masasu-sinior-pastor-lydia-umulisa-masasu\n 5. https://www.amazon.com/Delivered-All-My-Fears-Fear-Free-ebook/dp/B0B2QDKCDT/ref=sr_1_1?dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.uf-4b3BgDE_SzanNb7Y7Tg.GdLkXW8C3euXACtqvFmzTVUO1ulO9aOaTjWOsHcnvE8&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;qid=1728526624&amp;refinements=p_27%3AApostle+Yoshua+N.+Masasu&amp;s=digital-text&amp;sr=1-1&amp;text=Apostle+Yoshua+N.+Masasu\n 6. https://books.google.rw/books/about/Delivered_from_All_My_Fears.html?id=HsBVzwEACAAJ&amp;source=kp_book_description&amp;redir_esc=y"}
{"id": "12707", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12707", "title": "Jimmy Mulisa", "text": "Jimmy Mulisa wahoze ari umukinnyi ndasimburwa mu ikipe ya APR FC ikipe y'igihugu Amavubi mu myaka yashize ni umwe mu bantu bazwi mu mupira amaguru w'u Rwanda kandi banawufitiye akamaro kuko yabaye umutoza wungirije mu ikipe y'igihugu kuva mu 2015. \nUbuzima bwite.\nJimmy Mulisa yavutse 3 mata 1984, yashyingiranywe na UMUTONI Alice mu mwaka w'2016 \nImirimo yakoze.\nyamenyekanye cyane mu ikipe ya APR FC, akomeza akina mu ikipe zitandukanye nka RAEC Mons, KRC Mechelen, RFC Tournai, KFC Hamme, T-Team FC yo muri Maleziya, akaba yarakiniye ikipe ya Amavubi akina hagati kuruhande rw'iburyo asatira isamu, yari mu ikipe yu Rwanda ya kinnye imikino y'anyuma igikombe cya Africa cyi bihugu mu 2004, yatangiriye gutoza ari mu ikipe ya SUNRISE FC ari umuyobozi wa tekinike, aza gukomeza atoza APR FC aho yaje kuba umutoza w'ungirije mu Amavubi 2015.\nyatangije Ikigo gifasha abana kuzamura impano zabo mu mupira w'amaguru cyitwa umuri "}
{"id": "12708", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12708", "title": "DJ BISSOSO", "text": "Dj Bissoso ni umugabo umaze kwamamara hano mu Rwanda mubijyanye no kuvangavanga imiziki. \nUbusanzwe yitwa Hassan sukubu akaba azwi cyane mu ruganda rw'imyidagaduro nkuvanga imiziki y'ibyamamare mu Rwanda ndetse no mumahanga."}
{"id": "12709", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12709", "title": "Karekezi Olivier", "text": "Karekezi Olivier yavutse tariki 25 Gicurasi 1983, avuka mu muryango w\u2019abana 7, abakobwa 3 n\u2019abahungu 4, akaba yarakinnye mu Rwanda nohanze kurwego mpuzamahanga, yatangiye umupira mu ikipe y\u2019Intare FC mbere y\u2019uko mu 1998 yerekeza muri APR FC kugeza 2004, ubu akaba ari umutoza."}
{"id": "12710", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12710", "title": "Ntagungira Celestin", "text": "Ntagungira Celestin nka Abega ni umugabo w'umunyarwanda wavutse tariki ya 11 Gicurasi 1966. Uyumugabo n'umuntu wamenyekanye cyane mumupira wamagaruru murwego rwubusifuzi. Ntagungira celestin yasifuye imikino myishi ikomeye kwisi harimo ibikombe by'isi. Muri 2006 yasifuye igikombe cy'isi cyabereye mu budage na 2010 muri Afurika y'Epfo, nibikombe bitatu by'Afurika(2010 muri Angola, 2008 muri Ghana na 2006 muri misiri).\nIncamake ya mateka.\nNkuko twabivuze hejuru Ntagungira Celestin \"Abega\" ahagarariye abasifuzi bo mu karere k'Afurika y'iburasirazuba mu mpuzamashyirahamwe y'umupira w'amaguru muri Afurika (CAF),akaba kandi ari nawe musifuzi w'umunyarwanda wa mbere wasifuye imikino mpuzamahanga.\nTariki 22 ukwakira 2011 Ntagungira Celestin niwe wegukanye umwanya wo kuyobora ishyirahamwe ry'umupira wamaguru mu Rwanda (FERWAFA)."}
{"id": "12711", "revid": "10599", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12711", "title": "Eugenie Nyiransabimana", "text": "Eugenie Nyiransabimana \nUmwuga.\nUmunyamakuru\nUrugendo mwitangaza makuru.\nEugenie Nyiransabimana umunyamakuru Wanabyize muri kaminuza y'URwanda (SJC)\nYabaye nu munyamakuru kuri Radio salus ibutare mwishami ryamakuru Ari naryo akoramo kuri Radio &amp;Tv10. \nAho akora.\nRadio &amp; TV10\nIbirenzeho.\nhttps://radiotv10.rw/abagabo-ntibumva-ukuntu-mugenzi-wabo-warega-umugore-ko-amuhohotera/"}
{"id": "12712", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12712", "title": "Shema Maboko Didier", "text": "Shema Maboko Didier ni umusifuzi wa basiketi balo akaba gusifura mu mikino y\u2019amajonjora ya BAL 2020 muri Madagasikari, yanabaye umuyobozi wa Tekinike igihe kirekire mu ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umukino wa Basketball mu Rwanda, akaba aherutse gusoza icyiciro cya 3 cya kaminuza mu Buyapani mu masomo ya Siporo, muri kaminuza ya Tsukuba (Univeristy of Tsukuba), yagizwe umunyamabanga uhoraho muri Minisiteri ya Siporo."}
