{"id": "12717", "revid": "17082", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12717", "title": "Clever Kazungu", "text": "Clever Kazungu Umunyarwanda Wamenyekanye cyane Mwitangaza makuru Mu Rwanda Akora Ibiganiro bya sport Aho yatangiye Itangazamakuru Muri 2005 \nAmaradiyo Yakozeho.\n1.Contact FM\n2.Flash FM\n3.Umucyo Radio\n4.Radio One\n5.Radio 10\n6.Inkoramutima Radio\n7.City Radio 8. FINE FM 93.1\n9. ISANGO STAR 91.5\nAho akora.\nKazungu Clever ubu akora Kuri SK FM 93.9\nIndi Mirimo yakoze.\nKazungu Clever yabaye Umuvugizi wikipe y'umupira w'amaguru m'URwanda APR FC Kuva mu 2017 kugeza 2021\nAho yaje no kuba umuyobozi wibiganiro bya sport kuri Radio &amp; Tv10 RWANDA\nIbirambuye.\nhttps://www.topafricanews.com/2021/02/22/rwanda-sport-journalists-association-detaches-itself-from-the-misconducts-of-radio-10-sport-journalists/\nhttps://www.mwanaspoti.co.tz/ms/kolamu/clever-kazungu-3921508"}
{"id": "12718", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12718", "title": "Kagere Meddie", "text": "Meddie Kagere (wavutse ku ya 10 Ukwakira 1986) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka mu Rwanda ukinira Singida Big Stars FC muri Shampiyona y\u2019icyiciro cya mbere cya Tanzaniya ndetse n\u2019ikipe y\u2019igihugu y\u2019u Rwanda nk'imbere. \nUmwuga.\nKF Tirana.\nKagere yasinyiye ikipe ye ya mbere mu Burayi mu mwaka wa 2014 hamwe na mlewa msasa namba 9 matata, ubwo yinjiraga mu ikipe ya KF Tirana yo muri Alubaniya Superliga, mu masezerano yi myaka ibiri nyuma yo kwemera kwishyura ikipe ye yahoze yitwa Rayon Sports FC ku madorari 10,000 yo gusesa amasezerano ye. \nKu ya 1 Mutarama muri 2015, Kagere yarekuwe na KF Tirana. \nSimba SC.\nMu gikombe cya SportPesa 2018, ubwo yari umukinnyi wa Gor Mahia FC, yatsinze igitego cya mbere yatsinze Simba SC, aba shampiyona y'icyiciro cya mbere muri Tanzaniya, maze bamusinyisha nyuma y'ibyumweru bivugwa.\nSingida Big Stars FC.\nKu ya 4 Kanama 2022, mu munsi wa Singida Big Stars Day, Kagere yagaragaye mu myitozo ya mbere y'umukino na Zanaco FC yo muri Zambiya, yemeza ibihuha bivuga ko Kagere yavuye muri Simba SC bityo Kagere akaba ari umunnyi mushya, nyuma yuko Singida Big Stars FC yazamuwe muri shampiyona ya Tanzaniya ku nshuro yambere muri 2022/2023 muyi uwo mwaka."}
{"id": "12720", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12720", "title": "Antoine Rutayisire", "text": "Rutayisire Antoine wavutse 1958, ni Umushumba Mukuru wa paruwasi ya Remera mu itorero ry'Angilikani mu Rwanda, wamenyekanye cyane munyigisho zigiye zitandukanye z'iyobokamana mu Rwanda, Ni umugabo watangiye ivugabutumwa mu 1983 akimara gukizwa, Mu 1990 yaretse akazi ko kuba mwalimu umwanya we awuharira kwigisha ijambo ry'Imana, yahise ajya kuyobora umuryango w'ivugabutumwa rishingiye kuri Bibiliya w'abanyeshuri ba kaminuza, akaba ariwe wabaye umunyamabanga mukuru wawo wa mbere kugeza mu 1994. Nyuma ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 yayoboye umuryango w'ivugabutumwa wa (AEE) mu 2008 ayobora paruwasi ya Biryogo mu itorero ry'Angilikani mu Rwanda, ahava ajya kuyobora paruwasi ya Remera ariyo arimo kugeza ubu.\nNiki avuga kunsengero zifunzwe?\nUbwo yari mu kiganiro kuri KT Radio, Pasiteri Rutayisire Antoine yagarutse ku kibazo cy\u2019insengero zimwe zafunzwe, avuga ko hari bamwe mu bakirisito byabagizeho ingaruka zirimo gusubira inyuma mu by\u2019ukwemera no kubura aho bahurira nk\u2019ahantu habafasha kuruhukira no gusenga.\nYakomeje ashimangira ko inshingano nyamukuru y\u2019itorero ari uguhindura ubuzima bw\u2019abantu no kubigisha kubaho neza mu isi, arinda umutekano, indangagaciro nziza n\u2019ubumwe. Yagaragaje kandi ko nubwo atishimiye ko insengero zifungwa, abona ko n\u2019ubwo zitaba zifunguye ibikorwa byo gukomeza ukwemera bishobora gukorwa mu bundi buryo"}
{"id": "12721", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12721", "title": "Abazimu", "text": "Mu myemerere gakondo ya Kinyarwanda, abazimu ni ijambo ririmo amagambo abiri (Abazi -Umu) bisobanura imizi yacu twe turi hano. Abazimu ni abantu bo mu muryango runaka babayeho ariko batakiriho, ni ukuvuga bitabye Imana.\nMu madini ya gikirisitu, abazimu ni ijambo rikoreshwa mu gusobanura imyuka mibi igamije inabi ku bazima, iyo basenga birukana abo bazimu. Umuzimu ni ishusho y\u2019umuntu wapfuye, bikekwa ko ashobora kugaruka cyangwa kugaragara mu isi y\u2019abazima. Mu mico n\u2019imigenzo itandukanye ku isi, abantu benshi bemera ko imyuka y\u2019abapfuye ishobora gukomeza kubaho mu bundi buryo butagaragara.\nImyemerere n\u2019Imigenzo\nMu bihugu byinshi no mu mico itandukanye, inkuru z\u2019abazimu zabayeho kuva kera. Bamwe bemera ko umuzimu aba ari umwuka w\u2019umuntu utabonye amahoro, wenda kubera urupfu rutunguranye cyangwa ibibazo yasize adakemuye. Hari n\u2019abemera ko imyuka ishobora kugaruka kurinda cyangwa gutanga ubutumwa ku bantu bakiriho. Gusa abantu bakwiye kumenya ko umuzimu cyangwa abazimu atari inabi mu muryango kubera ko igihe cyose uwapfuye akomeza kwifuriza umuryango we kugira ishya n'ihirwe. Aha twavuga nk'umubyeyi witabye Imana asize abana akomeza kumenya amakuru y'abo yasize yaba mabi cyangwa meza.Mu gihe bigaragaye ko batabayeho neza nkuko yabyifuzaga, uwo mubyeyi agaragara kenshi mu isura yahoranye mu muryango akagira n'ubutumwa atanga. Ikibazo gikomeye ni uko abenshi badakunda gusobanukirwa icyo iyo sura y'umubyeyi isobanura n'igikwiye gukorwa kugirango umubyeyi atuze.\nMu muco nyarwanda, hari imyemerere ivuga ku myuka y\u2019abakurambere, aho bamwe bemeraga ko abakurambere bakomeza kugira uruhare mu buzima bw\u2019abariho. Ariko ibyo biterwa n\u2019umuco n\u2019imyemerere y\u2019abantu ku giti cyabo.\nAbazimu mu Buvanganzo n\u2019Imyidagaduro\nAbazimu bikoreshwa cyane mu nkuru, filimi n\u2019ibitabo. Akenshi bagaragara nk\u2019ikintu giteye ubwoba mu nkuru z\u2019iterabwoba, ariko hari n\u2019aho bagaragazwa nk\u2019umwuka mwiza urinda abantu cyangwa ubayobora. Ibi bituma inkuru z\u2019abazimu zikundwa cyane mu myidagaduro no mu buvanganzo.\nIbisobanuro bya Siyansi\nNubwo hari abantu benshi bemera ko abazimu babaho, siyansi ntiyemeza ko hari ibimenyetso bifatika byerekana ko imyuka y\u2019abapfuye igaruka ku isi y\u2019abazima. Abahanga benshi basobanura ko ibihe abantu babona cyangwa bumva ibintu bidasanzwe bishobora guterwa n\u2019ubwoba, imitekerereze, inzozi cyangwa ibindi bintu by\u2019imitekerereze.\nGuterekera Abazimu\nGuterekera ntabwo ari umuhango nkezamana nk'uko benshi babivuga. Guterekera ni umuhango mbonezamubano uhuza abariho n'abakurambere babo batakiriho ari bo \"Abazimu\".\nGuterekera ni ukwibuka Abakurambere b'Intwari babayeho mu muryango nyarwanda. Ni umurimo uhuza, abariho n'Abakurambere babo batakiriho (Abazima n'Abazimu) mu rwego rwo kubibuka. Mu guterekera, hibukwaga Intwari z'Abakurambere gusa, nta bigwari byibukwaga.\nGuterekera, ni umurimo wakorwaga kenshi, nk'uko abakirisitu basenga kenshi. Nta muntu washoboraga kumara iminsi myinshi cyangwa ukwezi, adaterekereye.\nAmateka y'ijambo Guterekera.\nDukurikije ibikorwa n'imiterere y'umuhango wo guterekera mu mateka y'u Rwanda, usanga ari ijambo ry'impine ryunze amagambo abiri ari yo \"Guteka\" no \"Guterekera\". Mu Ikeshamvugo rya Kinyarwanda, guteka bivuze kwicara k'umwami cyangwa undi munyacyubahiro, na ho guterekera bikavuga gushyikiriza imbaga y'abantu bateranye bahuje n'umugambi umwe, ibiribwa n'ibinyobwa ngo basangire.\nImpamvu yo Guterekera Abazimu.\nGuterekera Abazimu byakorwaga mu buryo bwo kwibuka no kuzirikana intwari z'Abakurambere zo mu muryango uyu n'uyu, byose bigamije guha agaciro Abakurambere bubatse ishyanga iri n'iri no kuzirikana umurage basize mu iyubakagihugu cyabo.\nUburyo bwo Guterekera Abazimu muri iki gihe.\nGuterekera bikorwa mu buryo bwo kwita umwana izina ry'umukurambere w'igihangange wabayeho mu muryango uyu n'uyu. Noneho uko bamuhamagara iryo zina, bakaba banibuka uwo mukurambere w'Intwari bakomokaho, bitiriye uwo mwana. Ari nayo mpamvu mu muco w'Abanyarwanda, usanga baziririza kwita izina ridafite ibigwi, kugira ngo umwana baryita ritazamwokama.\nGuterekera kandi, bikorwa mu buryo bwo gushyiraho umunsi ngaruka mwaka wo kwibuka nyakwigendera cyangwa izindi ntwari z'igihugu, hagakorwa imigenzo runaka yo kubibuka, abantu bagasangira ari na ko bavuga amateka yabaranze."}
{"id": "12722", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12722", "title": "Manzi Thierry", "text": "Manzi Thierry w\u2019imyaka 24 y\u2019amavuko, yari Kapiteni w\u2019ikipe y\u2019ingabo z\u2019igihugu APR FC, akaba yarakiniye amakipe atandukanye hano mu Rwanda harimo Marrine, Rayon Sports Fc na APR FC, ku mugabane w'Africa ndetse no ku mugabane w'iburayi yakinnye mu ikipe y'igihugu cya Georigiya mu ikipe nshya ya Fc Dila Gori agiye gukinira mu gihe cy\u2019imyaka ibiri iri imbere, AS FAR yo muri Marroc."}
