{"id": "12726", "revid": "11486", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12726", "title": "Mucyo Biganiro", "text": "Mucyo Biganiro Umunyamakuru wo m'URwanda Wamenyekanye Mubiganiro bya sport ariko mbere yo kuza Mwitangaza makuru yabanje gukora Muri supermarket ya Nakumat no gukina Umupira w'amaguru m'URwanda mwikipe ya \"Electrogaz\" mukibuga hagati.\nUrugendo mwitangaza makuru.\nMucyo Biganiro watangiye Itangazamakuru Atangirira kuri radiyo yitorero rya Authentic ministries (Authentic Radio)\nAho yaje kuva ajya gukora kuri Televiziyo ya GoodRich Tv Ahava ajya gukora kuri Radio Flash. Ariyo naho ntiyahatinze Aho yavuye kuri Flash FM ajya gukora kuri Radio &amp;Tv10 Arinaho benci bamumenyeye akora ikiganiro Baje no kumwitirira \"Munda Y'isi\".\nmucyo Biganiro Ubu niwe unayobora Ibiganiro bya sport kuri Radio &amp; Tv10\nAho yakoze.\n1.Nakumat supermarket\n2. Authentic Radio \n3.GoodRich TV\n4.Flash FM &amp;Flash TV\n5.Radio &amp;TV10\nAho akora Ubu.\nRadio&amp;Tv10\nIbirambuye.\nhttps://www.topafricanews.com/2021/02/22/rwanda-sport-journalists-association-detaches-itself-from-the-misconducts-of-radio-10-sport-journalists/?pr=203601&amp;lang=ar\nhttps://web.archive.org/web/20220920171314/https://mobile.igihe.com/imikino/article/ukuri-ku-burwayi-bwa-antha-bivugwa-ko-yakubiswe-n-abafana-ba-rayon-sports"}
