{"id": "12750", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12750", "title": "RWISHYURA Appolinaire", "text": "Yari icyamamare mu muziki gakondo nyarwanda by'umwihariko mu gucuranga inanga. Abumvise igitekerezo cy'imihigo ya Rwabugiri na Rwanyonga, Nyamuryakanoze, umugani wa Bwoba, Nyirakaranena umugeserakazi, bazi neza ubuhanga bw'uyu muhanzi. "}
{"id": "12751", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12751", "title": "SEBATUNZI Joseph", "text": "Yari icyamamare mu muziki gakondo nyarwanda by'umwihariko mu gucurangisha inanga. Yamenyekanye cyane mu murya we wihariye mu bihangano nka Kamananga ka Sebajura, Rukara, Nyakwezi, Ikibasumba na Nyirabisabo. "}
{"id": "12752", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12752", "title": "SENTORE Athanase", "text": "Yari icyamamare mu muziki gakondo nyarwanda by'umwihariko mu gucuranga inanga. Uyu ni umwe mu bahanzi bacuranga inanga b'abahanga u Rwanda rwagize. Uyu nyakwigendera witabye Imana mu mwaka wa 2012 yatabarutse afite imyaka 80. Ni umubyeyi w'umuhanzi Massamba Intore. "}
{"id": "12753", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12753", "title": "SIBOMANA Athanase", "text": "Ni icyamamare mu muziki gakondo nyarwanda by'umwihariko mu gucuranga inanga. Uyu muhanzi wigeze no kuba umuhanzi azwi cyane kubera inanga ze nk'Umugani w'impaca, Nyirakazihamagarira n'izindi. kandi acuranga n'indirimbo zigezweho kuko hari iyamamaye cyane yitwa Assumpta yacuranze akoresheje guitar. "}
{"id": "12754", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12754", "title": "SIMPARINGOMA", "text": "Yari icyamamare mu muziki gakondo nyarwanda by'umwihariko mu gucuranga inanga.Ni umuhanzi wo hambere, bimwe mu bihangano bye ntibyamenyekanye cyane ariko azwi mu nanga ye yitwa Rozariya nakunze kera, aho yagiye kurambagiza ntiyakirwe na yombi. "}
{"id": "12755", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12755", "title": "Dominique Nshuti Savio", "text": "Nshuti Dominique Savio ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru, ubu ukina mu ikipe ya Police FC. aho yabanje gukina mu ikipe ya AS Kigali ahawe akayabo ka miliyoni 16 z\u2019amafaranga y\u2019u Rwanda, ubwo yari avuye muri APR FC, nabwo yari avuye muri ikipe ya Rayon Sports Fc, akaba afite umukobwa w'inshuti ye bakundana witwa Umutesi Tricia Tracy."}
{"id": "12756", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12756", "title": "Mazimpaka Andre", "text": "Mazimpaka Andre ni Umunyezamu wahoze akinira Rayon Sports ubu akaba ari muri Rwamagana City. Kandi kuwa Kabiri tariki ya 28 Nyakanga 2020 nibwo ikipe ya Gasogi United yasinyishije amasezerano y\u2019umwaka umwe, akaba yarakiniye kandi Musanze FC. "}
{"id": "12757", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12757", "title": "Gasogi United", "text": "Gasogi United yanditswe mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru hakurikijwe amategeko y\u2019ubucuruzi y\u2019u Rwanda ndetse akaba n\u2019umunyamuryango w\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru mu Rwanda Ferwafa, iyi kipe ikorera mu karere ka Gasabo mu murenge wa Ndera."}
{"id": "12758", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12758", "title": "Kimenyi Yves", "text": "Kimenyi Yves ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru wa Kiyovu Sports akaba ari umuzamu, yakiniye amakipe nka Rayon Sports na APR FC zose zo mu cyiciro cya mbere muri shampiyona y\u2019u Rwanda akaba kandi ari umuzamu w'ikipe yigihugu amavubi, Ni mu gihe nyampinga Muyango Uwase ariwe mugore we yamenyekanye ubwo yitabiraga irushanwa ry\u2019ubwiza rya Miss Rwanda mu 2019. Icyo gihe yegukanye ikamba rya Nyampinga uberwa n\u2019amafoto.. "}
{"id": "12759", "revid": "19167", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12759", "title": "Iradukunda Jean Bertrand", "text": "Iradukunda Jean Bertrand w'imyaka 26, wakiniraga Gasogi United, akaza gutangazwa nk\u2019umukinnyi mushya wa Township Rollers yo muri Botswana, akaba yatandukanye na APR FC muri 2016 yerekeza muri Bugesera FC yakiniye umwaka umwe ahita yerekeza muri Police FC nayo ayikinira umwaka umwe, muri 2018 yerekeje muri Mukura VS ayikinira imyaka 2 maze muri 2020 yayivuyemo yerekeza muri Gasogi United."}
{"id": "12760", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12760", "title": "Paster Niyonshuti Th\u00e9og\u00e8ne", "text": "Niyonshuti Th\u00e9og\u00e8ne mu mwaka 1995 yari umwana wo ku muhanda, icyizere cy\u2019ubuzima cyari cyarayoyotse yariyakiriye nk\u2019uzabaho mu muhanda kugeza Yesu agarutse.Th\u00e9og\u00e8ne Nyuma y\u2019imyaka 23, ubu ni umugabo wubatse, afite abana batatu yabyaranye na Uwanyana Assia ndetse yanagiriwe icyizere n\u2019Itorero rya ADEPR rimuha inshingano za gipasiteri.\nUbuzima bwe Bwite.\nAbemeramana bo bavuga ko Nyagasani ari \u2018Rutabura uko abigenza\u2019 kuko ashobora kunyuza umuntu mu bikomeye ariko amutyariza kuzavamo umuntu udasanzwe uzahangamura ibibazo bikomeye.Pasiteri NiyonshutiUbusanzwe avuka mu muryango ukomeye ariko nyuma ya Jenoside yabayeho mu buzima bugoye bwatumye ayoboka inzira yo kwicira incuro.Th\u00e9og\u00e8ne yivugira ko ari umwe mu bakozi b\u2019Imana batarya iminwa iyo bigeze ku ngingo ijyanye no gutanga ubuhamya bw\u2019ibyo banyuzemo. Muri ubwo buzima yari atunzwe no gukora mu kinamba ndetse uwarangaraga amuri hafi yasangaga amutwaye umuzigo we.Nyuma yo kurambirwa nubwo buzima bwo gushakira amahoro mu rumogi n\u2019ibindi, mu mwaka 2003 nibwo yafashe umwanzuro wo kwakira agakiza, ndetse ahamya ko akigahagazemo yemye na bugingo n\u2019ubu.\nTh\u00e9og\u00e8ne Nyuma y\u2019imyaka 23, ubu ni umugabo wubatse, afite abana batatu yabyaranye na Uwanyana Assia ndetse yanagiriwe icyizere n\u2019Itorero rya ADEPR rimuha inshingano za gipasiteri.\nUrupfu rwe.\nKu itariki 23 Kamena 2023, nibwo urupfu rw'umuvugabutumwa Theogene rwamenyekanye, aho imodoka yari arimo yagonzwe na bisi ya kompanyi ya simba mu gihe yavaga muri Uganda agana mu Rwanda, iyi mpanuka yabereye mu biri metero bine uvuye k'umupaka wa Gatuna. "}
{"id": "12761", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12761", "title": "VVOB", "text": "VVOB education development ni umuryango udaharanira inyungu, washinzwe mu mwaka 1982. Washinzwe na guverinoma ya Flemande n'Ububiligi batanga umusanzu mu ireme ry'uburezi mu bihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere.\nIcyerekezo.\nUburezi bufite ireme ni umusingi witerambere. VVOB igira uruhare mu isi iringaniye aho guverinoma zifite ubushobozi bwo kubaha, kurinda no kubahiriza uburenganzira bwo kwiga bufite ireme kuri buri munyeshuri, nta vangura iryo ari ryo ryose.\nInkomoko.\nIntandaro ya VVOB ni ubufasha bwa tekiniki mu mishinga na gahunda bikorwa mu bufatanye mu bihugu byo muri Afurika, Aziya na Amerika y'Epfo. Ibyo babikora babifashijwemo na guverinoma y'Ububiligi na Flemande, n'abandi baterankunga benshi.\nIbiro bikuru.\nIbiro bikuru bya VVOB biherereye i Buruseli mu Bubiligi. Mu mwaka 2020 VVOB ikora muri Kamboje, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Ecuador, u Rwanda, Afurika y'Epfo, Suriname, Uganda, Vietnam, Zambiya n'Ububiligi."}
{"id": "12762", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12762", "title": "Rusine Patrick", "text": "Rusine Patrick Umunyarwenya kandi akaba Umunyamakuru wa Kiss FM,Uyu musore ubusanzwe ni umunyeshuri muri Kaminuza y\u2019u Rwanda ishami rya Huye, aho yiga ibijyanye n\u2019imitekerereze ya muntu. Asigaje umwaka umwe ngo arangize icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza.\nUbuzima bwe Bwite.\nRusine yinjiye mu bijyanye no gusetsa mu mwaka 2018 anyuze muri Seka Rising Star, irushanwa ryashakishaga abanyempano bashya bakundaga gutarama mu birori bya Seka Live na Seka Festival.Rusine wari mu biganza bya Arthurnation,Mu mwaka 2020 yaje guhura na Clapton Kibonge batangira gukorana muri sinema bahereye muri filime bise Umuturanyi, ariko izina rye ryarushijeho kwamamara ubwo bakoraga iyitwa \u2019Mugisha na Rusine.Rusine Patrick uri mu banyarwenya bamaze kubaka izina rikomeye mu ruganda rwa Comedy mu Rwanda, aherutse gukora igitaramo cye cya mbere cyitabiriwe nabakunzibe kurwego rushimishije. Mubuzima busanzwe umuntu Rusine afatiraho ikitegererezo ni mama we wamutunze nta kintu afite(Amafaranga)\",Avuga ko atazi uko byagenze gusa yaje gusanga abana na Mama we gusa. Ati\" Mfite nk\u2019umwaka umwe gusa naje kwisanga mbana na mama gusa, ntago nzi uko byagenze.Kuva icyo gihe nakuze mbona mama gusa\"Yakomeje avuga ko hari igihe Mama wabo yajyaga abura n\u2019amafaranga yo kwishyura inzu babagamo ariko akigomwa ayo abonye yose akayamurihiriramo ishuri.Biragoye ko muri iyi minsi hari uwategura igitaramo cy\u2019urwenya agasohora impapuro zicyamamaza zitariho Rusine usigaye ari n\u2019umunyamakuru wa Power FM. "}
{"id": "12763", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12763", "title": "VSO", "text": "VSO mu (Voluntary Service Overseas) ni umuryango udaharanira inyungu, umuryango utegamiye kuri leta uteza imbere uburezi ufite icyerekezo cya \"isi iboneye kuri buri wese\" ninshingano yo \"guteza impinduka zirambye binyuze mubushake\". VSO itanga ingaruka ziterambere binyuze muburyo bwubwitange buvanze bugizwe nabakorerabushake mpuzamahanga, abenegihugu, nabaturage bakorera hamwe kugirango batezimbere sisitemu nibisabwa kugirango imibereho ihinduke neza Muri 2018\u201319, VSO yakoraga mu bihugu 23 byo muri Afurika no muri Aziya\nIbyo ikora.\nVSO kuri ubu ikora mubice byingenzi byibanze:\nKandi binyuze muburyo butatu bwibanze bujyanye nibice byose:\nByongeye kandi, VSO ifite icyerekezo cyurubyiruko aho urubyiruko ari rwo rwungukirwa n\u2019ibisubizo by\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019imibereho kimwe n\u2019abagize uruhare runini mu guteza impinduka.\nAmateka.\nVSO yashinzwe mu 1958 na Alec na Mora Dickson binyuze mu ibaruwa ya musenyeri yandikiye urupapuro rwa Londres Ikinyamakuru cya, nkuburambe bwo kwiga mumahanga kubarangije amashuri, ubanza abagabo gusa, mbere yo gutangira kaminuza. Abakorerabushake batanze ubufasha budafite ubuhanga mu gusubiza amacumbi y'ibanze n'amafaranga yo mu mufuka. Mu 1962, imyitozo yarahindutse ikoresha abakorerabushake barangije kaminuza Kugeza mu 1980, abakorerabushake badafite ubuhanga bari barangije burundu kandi igihe cya serivisi cyariyongereye kugeza ku myaka ibiri. Umubare w'abakorerabushake bakoraga ubanza waragabanutse ugera kuri 750, ariko mu 2003 wari waragarutse ugera ku 1.400. Kuva mu Kuboza 2004, gusaba abakorerabushake byemewe kuva ku myaka iri hagati ya 20 na 75, nabo bagomba kuba bafite uburambe nibura bwimyaka ibiri mubyo bakora."}
{"id": "12766", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12766", "title": "Kepler", "text": "Kepler Ni College Guverinoma yemereye gukorera mu Rwanda nka kaminuza yigenga, nyuma y\u2019igihe ikora nka gahunda y\u2019amasomo ifasha abanyeshuri guhabwa impamyabumenyi muri Southern New Hampshire University yo muri Leta zunze Ubumwe za Amerika.\nIbyo Wamenya kuri Kepler College.\nKepler yatangiye mu 2004 yitwa Orphans of Rwanda, mu mwaka 2008 iza guhindurirwa izina iba Generation Rwanda, ari gahunda igamije gufasha abana n\u2019abahanga bo mu miryango itishoboye, kwiga mu mashuri makuru na kaminuza zo mu Rwanda.Mu mwaka 2013 yahinduye imikorere, itangiza gahunda yari itegerejweho gufasha abanyeshuri barangiza amasomo kugira amahirwe menshi yo kubona imirimo.Nibwo yasinyanye amasezerano na Southern New Hampshire University (SNHU), itangira gufasha abanyeshuri bayo kubona impamyabumenyi y\u2019icyiciro cya mbere n\u2019icya kabiri cya kaminuza.Yakira abanyeshuri batsinze ibizamini bahabwa nyuma yo kubona impamyabumenyi zisoza amashuri y\u2019imisumbuye, baba abo mu Rwanda n\u2019abo mu Karere. Ifite amashami mu Mujyi wa Kigali no mu nkambi ya Kiziba ibamo impunzi z\u2019abanye-Congo.Mu mwaka 2021 yafunguye ishami muri Ethiopia.Icyakora kugira ngo haboneke umubare wifuzwa ujyanye n\u2019ubushobozi bw\u2019Ikigo, abemewe na Kepler bongera gukora ibizamini by\u2019ijonjora bifasha gutoranyamo abarenga 150 buri mwaka."}
{"id": "12767", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12767", "title": "African Institute for Mathematical Sciences", "text": "African Institute for Mathematical Sciences (AIMS) ni ikigo cyigisha amashuri makuru n\u2019ubushakashatsi i, muri Afurika yepfo, cyashinzwe muri Nzeri 2003, n\u2019umuyoboro ujyanye n\u2019ibigo bifitanye isano muri Senegali, Gana, Kameruni, Tanzaniya n'u Rwanda.\nAmateka.\nIkigo cya mbere cy\u2019Afurika gishinzwe ubumenyi bw\u2019imibare cyashinzwe i Cape Town na mu 2003, mu gihe yari umuyobozi w\u2019imibare y\u2019imibare muri. ni umuhungu wa, umudepite wa MP. Muri 2008 Turok yabaye Umuyobozi Nshingwabikorwa wa \nAIMS Afurika y'Epfo yashinzwe nk'ubufatanye hagati ya kaminuza zikurikira:,, na.\nGahunda ya AIMS.\nKwigisha n'ubushakashatsi.\nIbigo bya AIMS byigisha imibare y'ibanze kandi ikoreshwa, ikubiyemo ibintu byinshi bikoreshwa mu mibare muri fiziki (harimo na astrofizike na cosmologiya), ibinyabuzima byuzuye, bioinformatics, computing siyanse, imari, kwerekana ubuhinzi n'ibindi. Ko muri Senegali itanga amasomo haba mu gifaransa no mu icyongerezaUsibye gahunda zayo zamasomo, AIMS Afrika yepfo ifite ikigo cyubushakashatsi mubice bitandukanye nka cosmology, computing and finanse (reba hano hepfo). Muri 2015, AIMS Kameruni yateganyaga gutangiza ikigo cy\u2019ubushakashatsi cyakira abashyitsi ndetse no gusura abashakashatsi bo muri kaminuza zo muri Kameruni ndetse no hanze yayo.\nSerivisi rusange.\nIbigo bya AIMS bitanga serivisi zabaturage. AIMS Senegal yashyizeho uburyo bushya bwo kwigisha bw\u2019abarimu bigisha imibare yisumbuye kandi ifatanya n\u2019ubucuruzi bw\u2019ibanze gukusanya inkunga yo gushyiraho amarushanwa y\u2019igihugu ku bijyanye na porogaramu za mudasobwa no kwerekana imibare, hibandwa ku gushakira ibisubizo bishingiye ku iterambere. AIMS Afurika y'Epfo iyobora ikigo gishinzwe guteza imbere amashuri ya AIMS ku barimu bo mu mashuri abanza n'ayisumbuye, ari nacyo gitegura ibiganiro mbwirwaruhame, amahugurwa n'amasomo ya master kandi bigatera inkunga clubs z'imibare mu mashuri yo mu gihugu hose. Intiti n'abarimu bo muri AIMS Gana bahaye abarimu bo mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Biriwa Junior hamwe n'amasomo yo kwigisha agezweho"}
{"id": "12768", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12768", "title": "Uncle Austin", "text": "Tosh Luwano uzwi muruganda rwa muzika nka Uncle Austin Umunyamakuru ubifatanya n\u2019ubuhanzi.\nIbyo Wamenya kuri Uncle Austin.\nUncle Austin Uyu mugabo yatangiye itangazamakuru mu mwaka 2005 akora kuri radio zitandukanye zirimo Radio10, Flash FM na KFM yavuyeho yerekeza kuri Kiss FM mu mwaka wa 2014.Uncle Austin asanzwe ari umunyamakuru ubifatanya n\u2019umuziki ndetse akaba n\u2019umushyushyarugamba mu bitaramo n\u2019ibirori binyuranye.Uncle Austin, akaba anaherutse kugura radio yahoze yitwa Vision FM, ubu yahindutse, Power FM, yatangaje ko yitegura gufungura akabari yise \u2018Uncles Restaurant &amp; Lounge. Uncle Austin wahinduye izina rya sosiyete yakoreshaga mu gufasha abahanzi \u2018The Management\u2019 ayihindura Uncles Empire.Uretse guhindura izina ry\u2019iyi sosiyete, uncle Austin yahise atangaza ko agiye gutangira gukorana n\u2019umuhanzikazi Linda Montez ndetse na Victor Rukotana nk\u2019abahanzi batangiranye na Uncles Empire."}
{"id": "12769", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12769", "title": "MUGUNGA Yves", "text": "MUGUNGA Yves ni umukinnyi wa zamukiye mu ikipe yabato ba APR FC, ubu ni umukinnyi ngenderwaho akaba ari rutahizamu w\u2019ikipe ya APR FC muri ekipe nkuru, aho aherutse gutsinda \nUS Monastir yo muri Tuniziya igitego kimwe ku busa, ukaba warabereye kuru Stade mpuzamahanga ya Huye. Ubwo bajyaga kwishyura yagize ikibazo cy\u2019imvune mu myitozo ya nyuma iyi kipe yakoze ku mugoroba wo kuri uyu wa Gatandatu tariki 16 Nzeri 2022, yitegura guhura na US Monastir mu mikino ya CAF Champions League."}
{"id": "12770", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12770", "title": "Mugisha Gilbert", "text": "Mugisha Gilbert Yavutse muri Nyakanga 1996 avukira Imuhanga Muntara y'amajyepfo mugihugu cy'u Rwanda ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru wabigize umwuga, akaba yari umukinnyi wa APR FC mugihe cy'imyaka ibiri yasinye, akaba yarayijemo avuye muri Rayon Sports muri 2017 yayimazemo imyaka 4, nabwo yarabanje gukina muri Pepiniere FC. Ubu Mugisha Gilbert akaba ari umukinnyi wikipe y'igihugu Amavubi"}
{"id": "12771", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12771", "title": "Niyigena Clement", "text": "Niyigena Clement ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru, wakuriye mu Ishuri rya Ruhago rya APR FC yaherukagamo mu Kanama 2019, yageze muri Rayon Sports muri Nzeri 2020, Nyuma yo kwigaragaza muri iyi myaka ibiri ishize, APR FC yari yamugurishije icyo gihe, yongeye kumwisubiza, mbere yari avuye muri Marines FC naho yari intizanyo."}
{"id": "12772", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12772", "title": "Pepiniere FC", "text": "Pepiniere FC P\u00e9pini\u00e8re FC isanzwe ikina mu cyiciro cya Kabiri cy'ashampiyona y'umupira w'amaguru mu Rwanda mu marushanwa ategurwa na Ferwafa, ikinira ku Kamonyi, iri mu biganiro byo kuba ikipe y\u2019Akarere ka Kamonyi igakina ifashwa n\u2019akarere ndetse ikaba yanahindurirwa izina ikitwa Kamonyi FC. Ni ishuri rizigwamo n\u2019abana bafite kuva ku myaka 5 y\u2019Ubukure kugera kuri 17, aho icyiciro cya mbere gihera ku myaka 5-9, icya Kabiri kikava ku myaka 9-12, Icyiciro cya Gatatu kikava kuri 12-15, Icyiciro cya Kane kikava ku myaka 15-17, hamwe n\u2019icyiciro cyakwitwa icya Gatanu kizaba kirimo abo kuva ku myaka 17-21, aba banyuma ari nabo bakinnyi bazaba babarizwa nyirizina muri iyi ikipe."}
{"id": "12773", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12773", "title": "Marine FC Rwanda", "text": "Marine FC ni ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru y'abasirikare barwanira mu mazi ibarizwa ku gisenyi mu karere ka Rubavu, ikina shapiyona y'icyiciro cya mbere mu marushanwa ategurwa na Ferwafa, Ikaba iherutse gutsinda Rayon Sports."}
{"id": "12774", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12774", "title": "Bizimana Yannick", "text": "Bizimana Yannick yavutse kuwa 02/06/1998 ni umukinnyi w'umupira wamaguru ukina muri Bugesera FC mbere yaho yarari muri APR FC kuva taliki ya 22 Gicurasi 2020, Kuwa Kane taliki ya 20 Kamena 2019, aza gukina nomuri AS Muhanga nyuma nibwo yasinyiye Rayon sports fc yamutanzeho miliyoni 10 FRW zirimo 5 yahawe ndetse n\u2019izindi 5 zahawe AS Muhanga na Giticyinyoni. yabaye umujura yiba ibitego kuko bamuhaye bitugukwaha. "}
{"id": "12775", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12775", "title": "A.S muhanga", "text": "A.S.Muhanga cyangwa se ikipe ya muhanga ni ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ikina mu cyiciro cya mbere cya shampiyona itegurwa na FERWAFA. Ibarizwa mu Karere ka Muhanga, ikaba ikinira kuri sitade mpuzamahanga ya Muhanga. Ubu ifite umufatanyabikorwa mushya ariwe Hotel Saint Andr\u00e9 &amp;Lumina Kabgayi, aho bazakorana mu gihe kingana n\u2019imyaka ibiri(2)."}
{"id": "12776", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12776", "title": "Niyonzima Ally", "text": "Niyonzima Ally ni umukinnyi w'umunyamwuga w\u2019umunyarwanda ukina mu kibuga hagati wakinye muri Bumamuru FC ikina mu cyiciro cya mbere mu Burundi, yakinnye muri Arabiya sawudite yitwa Jeddah FC, na none yarakiniye amakipe atandukanye mu Rwanda arimo Mukura VS, APR FC, AS Kigali na Rayon Sports utibajyiwe na Azam FC yo muri Tanzania aho yari afite imodoka ihenze, asanzwe ari umukinnyi w\u2019ikipe y\u2019igihugu Amavubi. "}
{"id": "12777", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12777", "title": "Hakizimana Muhadjiri", "text": "Hakizimana Muhadjiri ni umukinnyi w\u2019imyaka 26, ukina nkababigize umwuga muri ikipe Al Kholood muri Sawudi Arabiya yavuye mu Rwanda nyuma y\u2019imyaka itatu akinira APR FC yari yaragezemo muri Nyakanga 2016 avuye muri AS Kigali, nayo yari yamuguze muri Mukura Victory Sports yari amazemo imyaka ibiri. Hakizimana Muhadjiri uvukana na kapiteni w\u2019Amavubi, Haruna Niyonzima, yatowe nk\u2019umukinnyi mwiza w\u2019umwaka w\u2019imikino wa 2017/18 mu Rwanda, Nyuma yo kuzamurwa n\u2019umutoza Mungo Jitiada wiyita Vigoureux, kandi yakiniye ikipe ya Etincelles na Emirates Football Club yakiniraga muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Abarabu kuva muri Nyakanga 2019."}
{"id": "12778", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12778", "title": "Mukura Victory Sports", "text": "Mukura Victory Sports cyangwa se Mukura ni Ikipe yumupira w'amaguru yababigize umwuga ikaba ibarizwa mu karere ka Huye mu intara y\u2019Amajyepfo, aho yambara imyenda yiganjemo amabara y'umuhondo n'umukara.\nIbindi.\nMukura Victory Sports et Loisirs Football Club, ibarizwa mu ntara y'amajyepfo akarere ka Huye, yashinzwe mumwaka w' 1963 mukwezi kwa Gicurasi, kuri ubu ni ikipe ibarizwa muri shampiyona y'icyiciro cya mbere mumupira w'amaguru. Iyi kipe kandi yakirira imikino yayo kuri sitade mpuzamahanga y'akarere ka Huye. ni sitade ifite ubushobozi bwo kwakira abantu basaga gato ibihumbi icumi.Guhera mumwaka wa 2021 Jean Damascene MANIRAGUHA niwe muyobozi w'ikipe ya Mukura."}
{"id": "12780", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12780", "title": "Kaminuza ya Cambridge", "text": "\u00a0Kaminuza ya Cambridge ni i. Cambridge yatangijwe mu mu mwaka 1209 ihabwa amasezerano ya na mu 1231, Cambridge ni ku isi. Iyi ya kuze mu ishyirahamwe ry\u2019intiti zakomotse muri kaminuza ya Oxford zikurikira umwanditsi wa \"suspenidum\" (kumanika intiti) mu matiku n\u2019abaturage bo muri ibyo bice. zisangiye ibintu byinshi kandi bakunze kwita \"\".\nNk\u2019uko ikinyamakuru, Cambridge iri ku mwanya wa kaminuza zizwi cyane ku isi kandi kuri ubu yicaye nka kaminuza ya kabiri nziza ku isi no mu Burayi. Nk\u2019uko iyi kaminuza ibitangaza, Cambridge yatsindiye ibihembo byinshi bya kurusha ibindi bigo byose, hamwe n\u2019abahawe igihembo cyitiriwe Nobel 121. muri kaminuza ndetse n\u2019abarimu barimo kandi bafite imidari 11 ya, 7, 47 na 14. Muri 2016, Abanyeshuri ba kaminuza bari batsindiye. \nAmateka.\nMu mpera z'ikinyejana cya 12, agace ka Cambridge kari kamaze kugira izina ry'ubumenyi na kiliziya, kubera abihayimana bo mu itorero ry'abepiskopi rya ryegereye. Icyakora, byari byabereye muri bishoboka cyane ko ari byo byatumye hashyirwaho iyi kaminuza: intiti eshatu za Oxford zamanitswe n\u2019ubuyobozi bw\u2019umujyi kubera urupfu rw\u2019umugore, batabajije abayobozi ba kiliziya, ubusanzwe bari gufata umwanya wa mbere (kandi ubabarire intiti) mu bihe nk'ibi, ariko icyo gihe zari zishyamiranye. Kubera gutinya ihohoterwa ryinshi ry\u2019abaturage bo mu mijyi, intiti zo muri kaminuza ya Oxford zatangiye kwimukira mu mijyi nka Paris, na. Nyuma yaho, intiti zihagije zagumye i Cambridge kugira ngo zibe urufatiro rwa kaminuza nshya igihe zari zimaze kuba umutekano uhagije kugira ngo amasomo asubire muri Oxford. \n Kugirango dusabe icyambere, birasanzwe ko Cambridge ikurikirana ishingwa ryayo mu masezerano 1231 yatanzwe na kuyiha uburenganzira bwo guhana abanyamuryango bayo (\"ius non-trahi extra\") no gusonerwa imisoro imwe n'imwe; Oxford ntabwo yahawe uburenganzira nk'ubwo kugeza mu 1248. \n mu 1233 cya cyahaye abarangije muri Cambridge uburenganzira bwo kwigisha \"ahantu hose mu \". Nyuma yuko Cambridge avuzwe ko ari rusange muri \"\" mu ibaruwa yanditswe na mu 1290, akemeza ko ari ya mu 1318, byabaye ibisanzwe ko abashakashatsi bo mu yandi yo mu Burayi basura Cambridge kwiga cyangwa gutanga amasomo yo kwigisha. "}
{"id": "12782", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12782", "title": "Kaminuza ya Michigan", "text": "Kaminuza ya Michigan (UM, UMich, cyangwa Michigan) ni muri. Yashinzwe mu 1817 nigikorwa cyakarere ka kera ka, nka \"\", cyangwa \"kaminuza ya Michigania\", imyaka 20 mbere yuko iba leta, iyi kaminuza niyo ya kera cyane ya.Ikigo cyimuriwe muri Ann Arbor mu 1837 40 acres (16 ha). Iyi kaminuza iyobowe n\u2019inama leta kuva mu 1850, igihe ryatangizwaga ku mugaragaro. \nIyi kaminuza igizwe na kaminuza cumi n'icyenda kandi itanga porogaramu, icyiciro cya kabiri cya ndetse cya kabiri cya kaminuza. Michigan ifite amashuri icyenda yabigize umwuga:, Ishuri,,. Ifatanya na ziherereye muri na (buri kaminuza yemerewe gutandukana) kandi ikora ikigo giherereye i. Michigan ibarizwamo n\u2019umuryango gihugu, ndetse.\nMichigan yabaye ikigo kuva 1871. Iyi kaminuza yiyandikisha ni abanyeshuri bagera ku 32,000 barangije ndetse n\u2019abanyeshuri 16,000 barangije. Kwinjira muri kaminuza byashyizwe mu byiciro \"byatoranijwe cyane.\" Hafi ya kimwe cya kabiri cy'abanyeshuri baturuka muri leta. Abanyeshuri mpuzamahanga baturutse mu bihugu bigera ku 130 bangana na 15 ku ijana by'abanyeshuri bose."}
{"id": "12783", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12783", "title": "Mukunzi Yannick", "text": "Mukunzi Yannick ni w'umunyarwanda ukinnyi umupira waaguru ukinira ikipe ya Sandvikens IF ibarizwa muri shampiyona y\u2019ikiciro cya gatatu mu gihugu cya Suwede,yavutse taliki 2 mutarama 1995, yageze muri iyi kipe muri Mutarama uyu mwaka avuye muri Rayon Sports, nabwo akaba yari avuye muri APR FC, yari yarakuriyemo. Nyuma y\u2019igihe kinini akundana na Iribagiza Joy bahisemo kubana mu buryo bwemewe n\u2019amategeko ndetse babihamya mu ndahiro bakoreye imbere y\u2019amategeko Cyumweru tariki ya 20 Mutarama 2019 ubera mu murenge wa Remera. Ku itariki ya 13 Nzeri 2016,nibwo aba bombi bibarutse umwana wabo w\u2019imfura bise Ethan Mukunzi."}
{"id": "12784", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12784", "title": "Eticnelles Fc", "text": "Etincelles fc ni ikipe y'umupira wa maguru ibarizwa i Gisenyi mu karere ka Rubavu, ikaba imenyerewe gukina shampiyona y'icyiciro cya mbere mu Rwanda, ikaba ikinira kuri stade umuganda, yakira abantu ibuhumbi 5000, ikaba ikunze kwamba imyenda irimo ibara ry'imutuku n'umweru."}
{"id": "12785", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12785", "title": "Kwizigira Jean Claude", "text": "Kwizigira Jean Claude Umunyamakuru w\u2019imikino mu Kigo cy\u2019Igihugu cy\u2019Itangazamakuru (RBA). \nIbyo Wamenya kuri Kwizigira.\nKwizigira numunyamakuru wu munyarwanda Kandi numwe mubanyamakuru b\u2019imikino bakunzwe mu Rwanda, akaba akorera ikigo cyitangaza makuru mu Rwanda(RBA) yasezeranye na Umubyeyi Clarisse tariki 12 Nyakanga mu Murenge wa Kimihurura, bari bashagawe n\u2019inshuti n\u2019abavandimwe ubukwe bwabo bwari tariki 21 Nyakanga mu mwaka 2018.Kwizigira yavuze ko imyaka 15 ari myinshi ku bantu bakundana baba baragiye banyura muri byinshi birimo no gushwana rimwe na rimwe ariko ikintu gikomeye cyatumye yumva ko ubuzima bwe agomba kubumarana na Umubyeyi ari imyitwarire ye, uburyo yihangana, amukunda kandi akanamubera umujyanama uruta abandi. Kwizigira Jean Claude usanzwe ari umunyamakuru w\u2019imikino akaba n\u2019umusesenguzi kuri RBA bakunzwe cyane mugihugu cy'u Rwanda. "}
{"id": "12786", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12786", "title": "Dusabe Alex", "text": "Dusabe Alexis Yavutse mu 1978 avukira i kigali, ni umuririmbyi w'indirimbo z\u2019ubutumwa bwiza bwa Kristo Yesu, Umuhimbyi,umwanditsi kandi ni umucuranzi wa clavier, afite abavandimwe 2, ni uwa 2 mubo bavukana, yubatse urugo na Carine INGABIRE akaba bafitanye abana 4,bombi ni abakristo b\u2019itorero rya ADEPR/NYARUGENGE, afite album 2 z\u2019indirimbo z\u2019ubutumwa bwiza MFITE IBYIRINGIRO na NJYANA I GOROGOTA, akaba yarakoze ibitaramo byinshi bitandukanye, mu buzima busanzwe akora mu kigo cy\u2019ubwishingizi kitwa CORAR."}
{"id": "12788", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12788", "title": "Mbonyicyambu Isirael", "text": "Mbonyicyambu Isirael cyangwa se Israel Mbonyi yavutse 20/05/1995 muri Repubulika Iharanira demukarasi ya congo ni umuhanzi w\u2019indirimbo ziririmbirwa Imana. akaba yaragez mu RWANDA muri1997, yaririmbye muri Chorale zitandukanye harimo Intumwa za Yesu,Amani, akaba asengera muri muri resitoresheni chashi kwa Apotre Masasu, yize Pharmacy mu gihugu cy'ubuhinde, akaba yarakuze acuranga gitari, akaba yararirimbye indirimbo nyinshi zitandukanye nka \"Uri number One\", \"Yankuyeho urubanza\",\"Kumigezi\",\"Ndanyuzwe\",\"Nzibyo nibwira\",\"Kumusabara\",\"Agasambi\" ndetse na Harimpamvu, akaba amaze gukora ibiterane, mu Bwongereza, muri Canada, mu Bubirigi, mu Buholandi, muri Finilande, mu Buhindi, muri Kenya, Uganda, Mozambike, Afrika y'epfo."}
{"id": "12789", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12789", "title": "Hagenimana Benjamin Gicumbi", "text": "Hagenimana Benjamin ni Umunyamakuru w'Imikino akaba Umusesenguzi mu Rwanda kuri radio B&amp;B FM Umwezi\nUrugendo Mwitangazamakuru.\nBenjamin Gicumbi ni umunyamakuru wakoze kuri Radio 10 mu biganiro by\u2019imikino no kogeza imipira y\u2019i Burayi, mbere gato y\u2019uko agera kuri Radio 10 yabanje gukora kuri Radio Ishingiro ikorera mu mujyi wa Gicumbi ari naho yakuye izina Gicumbi unungubu akaba abarizwa kuri B&amp;B FM. Uyu mugabo wamenyekanye cyane guhera mu mwaka wa 2016 ubwo yari avuye i Gicumbi agiye gukora kuri Radio 10, akundirwa bikomeye uko yogeza imikino y\u2019i Burayi n\u2019uburyo ageza amakuru y\u2019imikino ku bakurikira ikiganiro yumvikanamo. \nUbuzima Bwihariye.\nHagenimana yavukiye mu karere ka Nyamasheke mu ntara y\u2019Iburengerazuba mu mwaka 1989, aba ari naho akurira. Amashuri abanza yayize ahitwa Rwabidege, aza kwiga icyiciro rusange cy\u2019amashuri yisumbuye muri College Intwari de Mwezi hafi y\u2019iwabo. Arangije icyiciro rusange cy\u2019amashuri yisumbuye nibwo yagiye mu karere ka Rusizi, aho yari agiye kwiga ahitwa mu Gishoma, biba ubwa mbere yagiye mu modoka ndetse ananyura mu mujyi wa Kamembe. Nk\u2019umwana w\u2019imfura mu muryango wakuze adafite Se agasigarana na nyina na barumuna be batatu, yafashe icyemezo cyo kujya gushakisha ubuzima mu mujyi wa Kigali, yawugezemo muri 2010 acumbikirwa na mubyara we wari warahamutanze. Hagenimana avuga ko kuva yagera i Kigali yari umuntu ukunda umupira w\u2019amaguru, ku buryo amafaranga make yakoreraga icyo gihe yayifashishaga ajya kureba imipira yaba iyo mu Rwanda ndetse no hanze. Kenshi iyo yabaga areba umupira yanabaga ari mu mpaka zikomeye, anabikundirwa bikomeye n\u2019abo barebanaga umupira cyane cyane wo hanze. Byo kuganira ku mupira mu tubari byatumye hari umuntu (yagize ibanga) wamubonyemo impano, amufasha kujya kuri Radio. Hagenimana atangira itangazamakuru yahereye kuri \u201cRadio Amazing Grace\u201d, nuko uwari umuyede yinjira mu itangazamakuru mu mwaka 2012. Mu mwaka 2013 nibwo Hagenimana yagiye kuri radiyo Radio Ishingiro y\u2019Igicumbi, iki gihe yari agikorera no kuri Amazing Grace. Igikombe cy\u2019Isi cya 2014 yacyogeje ari umwe cyose arakirangiza, iki gihe nibwo izina rye ryatangiye gukomera mu matwi y\u2019abakunzi be. Icyo gihe Radio Rwanda yari ifite Rutamu, Flash ifite Rugangura na Rugimbana, Radio10 ifite ba Fuadi, Castar, Bayingana na Jean Luc ariko byampaye imbaraga zo gukora cyane kugira ngo mbashe kwigarurira abakunzi b\u2019imikino b\u2019i Gicumbi.\u201d Muri 2016 nibwo Radio 10 yaje gushima uyu musore bahita bamurambagiza, bamujyana gufatanya na Fuadi Uwihanganye mu kiganiro cy\u2019imikino cyitwa \u201c10 Zone\u201d ndetse no kogeza imipira itandukanye. Fuadi ni we wamuhamagaye ambwira ko hari umuntu uri bumuhamagare ngo baganire, nyuma y\u2019akanya Castar na we yaramuhamagaye amubwira ko amushaka, yaje kujya kumureba baremeranya atangira akazi gutyo. Mu mwaka 2019 amaze imyaka ibiri kuri Radio10, uyu wari umusore yaje kubona imwe mu nkumi zari zije mu mirimo kuri iki gitangazamakuru, Umuhoza Delphine, bemeranya kubana, bararushinga. Hagenimana Benjamin yagize ati \u201cNyuma y\u2019imyaka ine ndashimira Radio/TV10, mwampaye amahirwe yo gukoresha impano yanjye no kugaragara kurushaho. Mu minsi mike iri imbere turahurira mu kindi gitangazamakuru cy\u2019imikino nikokijya kuri B&amp;B FM.\u201d"}
{"id": "12790", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12790", "title": "Uwiringiyimana Theogene", "text": "Uwiringiyimana Th\u00e9og\u00e8ne uzwi nka Bosebabireba cyangwa Babireba ni umuhanzi wamenyekanye mu ndirimbo zihimbaza Imana mu itorero ADEPR ku mudugudu wa Kicukiro Shell, Mu 2018 yahagaritswe muri ADEPR azizwa ubusambanyi akaba amaze imyaka icumi n\u2019imisago aririmba. yakoze indirimbo zakanyujijeho zirimo \"Ikiza urubwa\",\"Ibigeragezo si karande\", \"Bosebabireba\",\"Ingoma\". Yarwariye mu gihugu cya Uganda nyuma yo gukubitwa n\u2019abagizi ba nabi."}
{"id": "12791", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12791", "title": "Chorale Hoziana", "text": "Chorale Hoziana yitwaga Korali Gasave mbere ikaba yaravutse mu 1978 ubu ifite abaririmbyi 133, ni imwe mu makorari akomeye hano mu Rwanda, ikaba imaze imyaka myinshi ikora umurimo w\u2019ivugabutumwa bwiza mu ndirimbo zihimbaza Imana n\u2019ibikorwa by\u2019urukundo birimo gufasha ababaye, ibarizwa muri Paruwasi ya Nyarugenge, umudugudu wa Nyarugenge, yosohoye umuzingo w'alubumu wa 12 uriho indirimbo 11 ukaba witwa \u201cTwatsindishirijwe n\u2019amaraso ya Yesu\u201d, irakunzwe kubera indirimbo zabo, zagiye ziba umusemburo wo kwakira agakiza kuri benshi mu gihugu ndetse no hanze yarwo. Korali Hoziana yatangiranye n\u2019itorero rya Pentekote mu Rwanda, ubwo ryatangiraga ivugabutumwa mu mujyi wa Kigali, ikaba yaratumye itorero ADEPR irushaho kwaguka."}
{"id": "12793", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12793", "title": "Mani Martin", "text": ", akaba n'umwanditsi w'indirimbo, umukinnyi wa filime. Yatsindiye ibihembo byinshi. Ijwi rye ryihariye rya muzika mu njyana ya Afro-fusion, amajwi yo mu njyana zigezweho ndetse no mu muco gakondo kandi uyu muhanzi yavukiye ahitwa Ntura i Rusizi(ahahoze hitwa Cyangugu).\nAmateka.\nAho yavukiye.\nMani Martin yavutse ku ya 24 Ukuboza 1988 mu Ntara y'Uburengerazuba mu karere ka Rusizi. Yakuriye mu rugo rw'abagiraneza.\nUrugendo rwa musika.\nImpano ye yavumbuwe afite imyaka icyenda, yahimbye indirimbo ye ya mbere yise \"Barihe\" mu rwego rwo kurekura ibibazo bitagira ingano mu mutwe w\u2019umwana w\u2019inzirakarengane mu Rwanda nyuma y'imyaka itatu nyuma y\u2019amateka mabi yo mu 1994 Itsembabwoko ryibasiye abatutsi. Mani Martin ku myaka 12 yari amaze ku recordinga kasete(cassette) ye ya mbere. Impano idasanzwe yaje kubonwa na Niyibizi Gaston wacuruzaga kasete mu isoko rya hose ari irya Nyarugenge. Mani Martin, yakomoje ku nzira y\u2019umusaraba yanyuze ava Kigali yerekeza muri Uganda mu mushinga w\u2019indirimbo yari afitanye na Eddy Kenzo wo gusubiramo indirimbo \u2018Afro\u2019 yakunzwe na benshi ikongererwa igikundiro cyayo n\u2019amashusho yafashwe aho yaje gufungirwa muri Uganda."}
{"id": "12794", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12794", "title": "Miss Iradukunda Elsa", "text": "Iradukunda Elsa ni umunyarwandakazi wavutse taliki 25 Werurwe 1998 i Kigali mu Rwanda mu bitaro byo kwa Nyirinkwaya. Ni umwana wa Kane mu muryango w'iwabo aho ugizwe n'abana umumani, abahungu babiri n'abakobwa batandatu.\nIncamake y'amateka.\nIradakunda Elsa yize amashuri y'ncuke ku ishuri rya \"Le petit prence\" ndetse ahigira n 'amashuri abanza. Ageze mu wa kane w'amashuri abanza kugeza mu wa gatandatu yiga kuri \"centre scolaire Utunyenyeri\". Imyaka ibiri yambere y'amashuri y'isumbuye yayize kuri \"International Window Imbarara muri Uganda mbere gato ko yerekeza kuri King David i Kigali. Kuva mu wa gatatu w'amashuri y'isumbuye kugeza ayasoje aho yarangirije mu ishami rya \"literature, Economics, na Geography mu mwaka w'amashuri wa 2016.\nIradukunda Elsa yabaye nyampinga w'u Rwanda mu mwaka wa 2017 taliki 25 Gashyantare ubwo yambikwaga Ikamba ku mugaragaro.\nUko yafunzwe muri gereza.\nMiss Iradukunda Elsa yatawe muri yombi ku italiki 8 Gicurasi 2022,Urwego rw'ubugenzacyaha (RIB) rumukurikiranyeho icyaha cyo gukoresha inyandiko mpimbano no kubangamira iperereza rifitanye isano n'ibyaha byashijwaga Ishimwe Dieudonne. Iradukunda Elsa aritaba urukiko mu kuburana ku byaha ashinjwa yagaragaye mu rukiko bwa mbere taliki 24 Gicurasi.Gusa nyuma urukiko rw'ibanze rwa Kicukiro rwa tangaje isomwa ry'urubanza rwe ku ifungwa n'ifungurwa ry'agateganyo byabaye taliki 25 Gicurasi 2022.\nUbukwe bwe.\nIradukunda Elsa akaba yarabaye Nyampinga w\u2019u Rwanda 2017, hari mu mwaka wa 2017, kuwa Kane taliki ya 02 Werurwe 2023 yasezeranye byemewe mu mategeko hamwe n'umugabo we Ishimwe Dieudonn\u00e9 uzwi nka Prince Kid. Umuhango wo gusezerana mu bukwe bwabo ukaba warabereye mu Murenge wa Rusororo homu Karere ka Gasabo. Aho Umunyamabanga Nshingwabikorwa w\u2019Umurenge wa Rusororo witwa Desir\u00e9 Nsabimana yabasezeranije nk'umugabo n'umugore."}
{"id": "12795", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12795", "title": "Chorale Ambasada", "text": "Korare ambasada (Ambassadors of Christ Choir) yashinzwe mu 1995, korari iririmba indirimbo z'ihimbaza Imana n'abantu, ibarizwa mu Itorero ry'Abadiventisti b'Umunsi wa Karindwi wa Remera mu mujyi wa Kigali. ikaba ifite indirimbo nyinshi ziririmbye mu kinyarwanda, icyongereza n'urugande."}
{"id": "12796", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12796", "title": "Abadiventisti b'Umunsi wa Karindwi", "text": "Amateka y'Itorero ry'abadivantisti.\nItorero cyangwa se idini ry'abadivantisti b'umunsi wa karindwi, yatangijwe na Ellen G White aho yigishaga kububahiriza i sabato nk'umunsi wa karindwi w'icyumweru.\nItorero ry'Abadivantisti mu Rwanda.\nAbadiventisti b'Umunsi wa Karindwi cyangwa se Abadiventiste b'Umunsi wa Karindwi ryazanye ubutumwa bw\u2019itorero ry\u2019Abadiventiste bwageze mu Rwanda hagati yu mwaka wi 1918 n\u2019u mwaka wi 1919 buzanywe n\u2019Umubirigi witwaga DELHOVE waje kunganirwa na MONNIER Heneriko, muri icyo gihe hari mu gihe cy\u2019intambara ya mbere y\u2019isi, aba misiyoneri bandi b\u2019abaporotesitanti bari barasubiye iwabo, aba Abadiventisiti basigara bigisha bonyine, bigisha n\u2019abo bari baratawe nabandi, Aho bagarukiye ba DELHOVE na MONNIER bajya inama yo kugabana uturere, MONNIER ajya Mu BUGANZA, DELHOVE ajya i NYANZA, Umuntu wa mbere wabatijwe ni Yohana RUVUGIHOMVU mu 1924 akurikirwa na RUKANGARAJUNGA Petero muri uwo mwaka. Mu 1924 kandi nibwo MONNIER Heneriko yafunguye ishuri aza kurifashwamo n\u2019abarimu bari bamaze kumenya kwandika gusoma no kubara."}
{"id": "12798", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12798", "title": "Charly na Nina", "text": "Charly na Nina ni itsinda ry'abanyarwandakazi ni abakobwa babiri bihurije hamwe mu ntangiriro z'umwaka wa 2014 aho bari basanzwe bafasha abahanzi baririmba mu irushanwa rya Primus Guma Guma SuperStar. amazina nyakuri yabo ni Muhoza Fatuma na Charlotte Rulinda. Muhoza Fatuma (Nina) na Charlotte Rulinda (Charly). \nAmateka yabo.\nBavukiye muri Uganda ku babyeyi b'Abanyarwanda, basubira mu Rwanda nyuma ya jenoside yo mu 1994. Bombi batangiye kuririmba bakiri bato mu nsengero maze mu 2011 Nina atangira kuririmbana n'itsinda, Nyuma yaje kwinjira mu marushanwa yo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba yitwa tusker project fame muri 2009/2010 mugihe Charly yatangiye ari umuririmbyi winyuma kubahanzi batandukanye.\nUrugendo rwa Muzika.\nCharly na Nina batangiye kumenyakana ubwo baririmbaga muri Guma Guma super star baririmbira abandi bahanzi (backing) muri 2012 baza kwihuza no gukorana muri 2013. Bahise batangira gukorera muri Decent Entertainment, inzu ifasha abahanzi yashinzwe na Muyoboke Alex usanzwe umenyerewe mu byo gucunga inyungu z\u2019abahanzi no kubagira inama, harimo ibyo kubamenyekanisha no kubashakira ibitaramo. Muyoboke wari umujyanama wabo (Manager) baje gutandukana muri 2018. Charly na Nina bamusezeye bavuga ko biyemeje kwicungira ibikorwa byabo by\u2019ubuhanzi."}
{"id": "12799", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12799", "title": "Amateka ya kiliziya", "text": "Kiliziya Gatorika ni idini yabanje mu Rwanda, mu mwaka 1900 nibwo kiliziya gatorika yageze mu Rwanda byeruye mu butumwa bwazanwe n' abapadiri bera (Pere Blanc).\nAmateka yo hambere.\nMbere yo mu mwaka 1900 u Rwanda rwabarizwaga mu gace k' iyogezabutumwa ka Afurika yo munsi ya koma y' isi, kari karashyizweho na papa Leon wa 13 muri 1878. ako gace yaje kukaragiza umuryango w' abapadiri bera wari warashinzwe na calidinali Ravijeri mu mwaka 1868, abo ba misiyoneri bageze muri Uganda muri Gashyantare mu mwaka 1879 bahashinga misiyoni yaje kuba Vikaliyati Apositolike ya Vigitoliya _ Nyanza mu mwaka 1883. "}
{"id": "12800", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12800", "title": "Mpazimaka Rafiki", "text": "Mpazimaka Rafiki ni umugabo w'umunyarwanda beshi bakunze kwita Rafiki coga style, uyumugabo yamamaye cyane mujyana bita coga (Kinyarwanda dancehall) kandi akaba ari nawe wayizanye mu Rwanda ndetse bakanayimwitirira \"Umwami wa coga style\".\nAmateka.\nMpazimaka Rafiki beshi bakunze kwita Rafiki coga style yavukiye muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi y'a Congo 1984 akaba ari ipfura mumuryango w'abana batanu ba Tuganishuri Rubango na Francoise Balinda."}
{"id": "12801", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12801", "title": "Emmy", "text": "Nsengiyumva Emmanue uzwi nka Emmy mu muziki ni umwe mu bahanzi b\u2019abanyarwanda babarizwa muri Amerika ari naho akorera muzika.\nUrugendo rwa muzika.\nEmmy usazwe ukora ingana ya Afro Beat. yavuye mu gihugu mu 2012. Yagiye mu gihe yari atangiye kumenyekana aho yari amaze kwitabira irushanwa ryari rikomeye mu Rwanda ryitwa Primus Guma Guma Super Star(PGGSS 2). Yamenyekanye cyane mu Rwanda mu ndirimbo ze zitandukanye nka Nsubiza, Kuki, Ntibigishobotse, Ese urinde, n'izindi nawe akaba ari umwe mu bahanzi nyarwanda bakundwa n'abatari bacye bitewe n'uburyo aririmbamo."}
{"id": "12802", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12802", "title": "Ashimwe Dominique", "text": "Dominic Ashimwe ari nayo mazina ye yose yiswe n'ababyeyi, ni umunyarwanda ufite ubwenegihugu bw'u Rwanda. Ni umuririmbyi w'indirimbo zo kuramya no guhimbaza Imana. \nYavukiye mu ntara y'i Burengerazuba bw'u Rwanda. Ni umwana wa mbere mu muryango w\u2019abana 6. Papa we umubyayara yitwa Mbonigaba Anselme naho mama we umubyara yitwa Kamashyuza Veronique. Dominic Ashimwe yakuze aririmbana na bagenzi be biganaga mu mashuri y'isumbuye, ayobora amatsinda yo kuramya no guhimbaza Imana mu bigo yigagamo kugeza ubwo Imana imuhamagariye gukora indirimbo ze ku giti cye mu mwaka wa 2010 ari nabwo yashyize hanze umuzingo we wambere wari ugizwe n'indirimno 8. Kugeza ubu akaba afite imizingo 4 y'indirimbo.\nIbihembo yegukanye ibihembo binyuranye harimo: East African Music Awards, Moriah Entertainment Awards, Salax Music Awards, Groove Awards n'ibindi."}
{"id": "12804", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12804", "title": "Evangelical Restoration Church", "text": "Evangelical Restoration Church iri torero rya shizwe na Apotre Yoshuwa Masasu akaba ariwe mushyumba mukuru wiri torero ku isi, rikaba rifite amashami menshi atandukanye haba mu Rwanda no mumahanga, nka Masoro, Gikondo no kucyicaro Kimisagara nahandi."}
{"id": "12805", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12805", "title": "Jules sentore", "text": "Umuhanzi Jules Sentore umunyerewe cyane mu ndirimbo za Kinyarwanda mu njyana za gakondo, yavukiye mu gihungu cy'u Burundi mu mwaka w'i 1989 Ukwakira, hari nyuma y'uko se yari amaze kwitaba Imana azize impanuka agasiga nyina amutwite afite inda y'amezi atatu.\nAmeteka.\nUbuzima bwite.\nNyuma yo kuvuka, Jules sentore yakuze abaza mama we aho se aba maze arabimusobanurira byose. Jules yaje kujya kurererwa kwa Sekuru ari we Sentore Athanse, ari na ho yakuriye mbere y'uko bagaruka mu Rwanda. Amashuri abanza yayize kuri EP Kacyiru, naho ayisumbuye ayarangiriza mu ishuri rya Academy Solidality mu ishami ry'Amateka, Ubukungu,n'Ubumenyi bw'isi(HEG).Mu ijoro ryo ku italiki ya 17 Mutarama 2015 nibwo Nyampinga Innocente yibarutse umwana w'umukobwa mu bitaro bya Polisi Kacyiru, imfura ya Jules Sentore.\nUrungendo rwa muzika.\nJules mu gihe yari afite imyaka itanu ni bwo yatangiye kwiga kubyina no kwivuga bya Kinyarwanda, yakomeje kujya ataramana mu rugo bikagenda neza nyuma yiga kuvuza inanga no kuyibwira(kuririmba ucuranga inanga). Si ibyo gusa kuko inganzo ya Jules Sentore yayikomereje mu rusengero ari na ho yakuye umuhamagaro wo kwinjira mu buhanzi ku buryo bweruye."}
{"id": "12806", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12806", "title": "Kabera Simon", "text": "Kabera Simon ni Umuhanzi w\u2019umunyarwanda akaba n'umuvugizi wi ingabo, ni umugabo w\u2019umugore umwe n\u2019abana babiri, ni umwe mu bahanzi bakuru, ni umwe mubahanzi bakomeye kandi bubashywe usanzwe aririmba indirimbo zihimbaza Imana mu itorero rya ADEPR mu njyana ikunzwe na benshi ya Country, wigaruriye imitima y\u2019abatari bake bitewe n\u2019uburyo yicisha bugufi ugereranyije n\u2019abandi bahanzi, Ni umwe mu bahanzi basoje amashuri makuru kandi unafite icyubahiro mu ngabo z\u2019u Rwanda dore ko kuri ubu afite ipeti rya lieutenant colonel. Afite indirimbo zitandukanye hari na alubumu \u201cMunsi yawo\u201d agiye kumurikira amashusho, yo yayimuritse mu mwaka wa 2010 ikaba ari alubumu yagaragayeho zimwe mu ndirimbo z\u2019uyu muhanzi zakunzwe cyane nka \u201cMfashe inanga\u201d, \u201cMunsi yawo\u201d, \u201cUkwiye amashimwe\u201d, \u201cHejuru y\u2019ubwenge\u201d, \u201cTuri abana b\u2019Imana\u201d n\u2019izindi."}
{"id": "12807", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12807", "title": "Ikigo Nyarwanda cy'Ubuzima Bushingiye Ku Muco", "text": "Ikigo Nyarwanda cy'Ubuzima Bushingiye Ku Muco mu cyongereza(Rwanda Cultural Health Center), Ni ikigo cyo mu Rwanda gikora ibikorwa by'ubuvuzi gakondo bushingiye ku muco cyashinzwe na RUTANGARWAMABOKO mu mwaka wa 2011 giherereye mu karere ka Gasabo.\nAmavu n'amavuko.\nRutangarwamaboko avuga ko iki kigo cyashinzwe nk'umusaruro wavuye mu bushakashatsi yakoze ubwo yigaga muri kaminuza Nkuru y'u Rwanda, ubushakashatsi yakoze kuri \"Kirazira \nz'umuco Nyarwanda.\"\nSerivisi zitangirwa muri iki kigo.\nMu kwerekana ibijyanye n'imibereho y'Abanyarwanda mu Rwanda rwa kera hibandwa cyane ku mihango n'imigenzo mikuru yakorwaga muri icyo gihe uhereye ku kuraguza, kubandwa no guterekera ndetse n'umuhigo; Bimurikwa n'itorero ryashinzwe n'iki kigo ryitwa Ababeramuco kandi abarigize nibo bigisha umuziki gakondo n'ibicurangisho byose bya Kinyarwanda bigizwemo uruhare na Mushabizi.\nIntego z'ikigo.\nIki kigo Nyarwanda cy'ubuvuzi bushingiye ku muco cyashinzwe hagamijwe gutoza abanyarwanda kubaho mu buryo bushingiye ku muco Nyarwanda."}
{"id": "12808", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12808", "title": "Tuyizere Papi Clever", "text": "Tuyizere Papi Clever yavukiye i Rusizi ku wa 18 Nzeri 1992 avuka kuri Nzeyimana Elie na Mushonganono Jeanne, Se yaje gupfa muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi ubwo yari afite imyaka ibiri gusa, Yasigaranye na nyina, amurerana n\u2019abandi bavandimwe babiri; mukuru we na murumuna we, Yatangiye kuririmba yiga mu wa Gatanu w\u2019amashuri abanza muri korali y\u2019abakuze baramurera akuriramo atyo, yasoje amashuri yisumbuye muri Aparude Ruhango aho yakurikiye Ishami rya Computer &amp; Electronics, Kaminuza yayize mu Ishuri rikuru ry\u2019Imyuga n\u2019Ubumenyingiro rya Kigali (IPRC). Yarangije amashuri yisumbuye ajya kwiga umuziki muri Kigali Music School mu 2012 ariho yanatangiriye umuziki nk\u2019umwuga mu 2014, Yagiye yandika indirimbo nyinshi zirimo n\u2019iza Hyssop Choir yo muri ADEPR Kiruhura aho yazamukiye, nyuma aza no gutangira kwandika ize bwite.Akaba yarahamije isezerano ryo kubana akaramata na Ingabire Dorcas bamaze igihe bakundana nku mugabo n'umugore, yakoze indirimbo nyinshi zirimo \u201cUgendane Nanjye\u201d, \u2018\u2018Narakwiboneye\u2019\u2019, \u2018\u2018Uburyohe\u2019\u2019, \u2018\u2018Ahari Kurira\u2019\u2019, \u201cUtwumvire\u201d, \"Uvuze Yego\", \"Uri uwo Kwizerwa\" na \u201cImpamvu z\u2019Ibifatika\u2019\u2019 aheruka gushyira hanze aho amaze no kuririmba indirimbo nyinshi zo mugitabo. "}
{"id": "12809", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12809", "title": "Ange na Pamella", "text": "Ni itsinda rigizwe n'abanyarwandakazi babiri bavukana kandi b'impanga aribo NDAYISHIMIYE Angel na BAMUREKE Pamella, bakora umuziki nk'umwuga by'umwihariko injyana gakondo.\nInkomoko y'inganzo.\nAnge na Pamella nk'izina bakoresha ku rubyiniriro batangiye kuririmba guhera biga mu mashuri y'inshuke, aho baririmbaga mu itorero ry'umuco ry'ikigo ndetse bakomeje kuriririmbamo bageze no mu mashuri abanza. \nImpano yabo yo kuririmba bayitahuye ku myaka 12, igenda ibungabungwa ndetse ari nako bafashwa mu kuyikuza. Ubuhanga bwabo mu kuririmba iyii njyana byagiye bibafasha kubona ibigo by'amashuri bigaho nta kiguzi bibasabye kabikesha iyo mpano. Kugeza ubu, ni abahanzi by'umwuga ku buryo biyandikira indirimbo zabo bwite.\nIyi mpano yo kuririmba bakaba bayisangije mu muryango bavukamo, dore ko nta wundi babikomoraho, ibituma bifuza kuzayiraga abazabakomokaho. \nIbindi bikorwa.\nAnge nubwo akora umuziki, ariko abifatanya no gukora ibijyanye n'imideri, aho afite inzu y'imideri yitwa Hodan Fashion ijya inabambika igihe bari gufata amwe mu mashusho y'indirimbo zabo.\nAho wakura ibihangano byabo nuko wababona.\nAnge na pamella ibihangano byabo byose biboneka ku rubuga nkoranyambaga rwa YouTube unyuze ku muyoboro wabo yitwa Angel na Pamella\nUkeneye kubavugisha wakifashisha uburyo bw'ikoranabuhanga bwa imeyili, ukabandikira kuri email yabo: angelnapamellabooking@gmail.com"}
{"id": "12810", "revid": "19167", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12810", "title": "Women Foundation Ministries", "text": "Women Foundation Ministries cyangwa se Nobel Family Church ni itorero ryatangijwe Apotre Mignone, Ubundi ababyeyi be bamwise Umunezero Alice ariko baza kumuhimba Mignone, ni umugore wa Eric Kabera wamamaye muri sinema nyarwanda babyaranye abana batatu.\nUko byaje.\nApotre Mignone Ati \u201c Yaje mu ishusho y\u2019umuntu iramvugisha hanyuma irambwira ngo ndashaka ko ujya kumpera abagore amaboko. Numvaga ibyo bintu bidasobanutse hanyuma ndireba ndebye ayanjye nsanga nayo ni ibice, irambwira iti \u2018singira iyi nkoni (isobanura ubutware) noneho negerejeho ya maboko yanjye y\u2019ibice mbona araje noneho ndafata, arambwira ngo genda iyi nkoni uyikoze kuri buri mugore wese ubona\u201d.\nAbagore.\nApotre Mignone Imana yamutumye \u00a0guha abagore mu buryo butatu harimo mu buryo bw\u2019umwuka (kwigisha ijambo ry\u2019Imana), mu buryo bw\u2019amarangamutima (komora ibikomere) no mu bifatika, Nyuma y\u2019imyaka itandatu agize iyerekwa, dore ko yari asanzwe ibyerekeye ubujyanama, Apotre Mignone yashyizeho gahunda y\u2019amasengesho yo ku wa gatanu ahereye ku ntebe 25 bagenda baguka kugeza babonye aho bakorera habo.\nUrusengero.\nApotre Mignone Ni we watangije umuryango witwa Women Foundation Ministries hamwe n\u2019urusengero rwitwa \"Nobel Family Church\"."}
{"id": "12811", "revid": "16714", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12811", "title": "Sam karenzi", "text": "Sam karenzi Umunyarwanda wavukiye Inyamata muntara y'ibirasira zuba.wize Itangazamakuru Unarikora. \numwuga.\nUmunyamakuru\nUrugendo mwitangaza makuru.\nSam karenzi wize Itangazamakuru akanayobora amaradiyo atandukanye yayoboye radiyo:radio salus, radio 10 na radio Fine FM.\numuryango.\nSam karenzi yashanye na Irakoze Ariane\nhttps://web.archive.org/web/20220920180711/https://mobile.igihe.com/imikino/article/sam-karenzi-yasezeye-kuri-radio-10-agiye-gutangiza-ikiganiro-urukiko-rw== ibirushijeho ==\nhttps://umuryango.rw/ad-restricted/urukundo/article/umunyamakuru-sam-karenzi-nyuma-y-imyaka-ibiri-ateye-ivi-yerekanye-undi-mukobwa"}
{"id": "12812", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12812", "title": "Niyondora Vedaste Christian", "text": "Niyondora Vedaste Christian ni umuramyi usengera mu itorero rya ADEPR Gatenga Murambi, mu mujyi wa Kigali akaba ari umugabo w'umugore 1 w\u2019abana 2, yavukiye i Nyamasheke mu Ntara y\u2019Iburengerazuba, akaba ategura igiterane cyitwa \"Uzi gukunda Live Concert 2\" ni Igitaramo cyabereye muri Dove Hotel ku mugoroba wo ku Cyumweru tariki 7 Kanama 2022, Akaba azwi mu ndirimbo zitandukanye nka Uzi gukunda, Merci Papa, Umfate, Muri Gakondo akaba afite izindi ndirimbo zirenga 15, dore ko amaze imyaka irenga 24 yandika indirimbo z'iramya Imana akaba yaratangiye kuririmba no kwandika muri 1998."}
{"id": "12813", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12813", "title": "RUMAGA Junior", "text": "Ni umunyarwanda w'umusizi wavutse ku itariki 3 Nyakanga 1999, avukira mu Karere ka Ruhango i Mutakara na Nyamagana, mu muryango w'abana batatu (3), nyuma umuryango we wimukiye mu Karere ka Muhanga ari naho utuye ubu gusa Rumaga we akaba aba i Kigali kubera impamvu z'akazi.\nInkomoko y'inganzo.\nAbantu benshi bakunda gukeka ko yaba ari umwuzukuruza wa Nyirarumaga (umugore bita nyina w'ubusizi bw'u Rwanda) wari umusizi ku ngoma ya Ndahiro II Cyamatare se wa Ruganzu II Ndoli. Gusa sibyo, Rumaga avuga ko inganzo ye ari ingabire y'Imana cyane ko ntawe yarebeyeho mu muryango ngo inganzo ye imumurikire iremye iye.\nMu gukura kwe yakundaga gutega amatwi ibitaramo no gukurikirana amateka y'abami, akaba uwo kwibera muri izo mfuruka. Ubwo yigaga mu mwaka wa kabiri w'amashuri yisumbuye bahawe umukoro wo kuvuga icyivugo ugahabwa amanota, uwo mukoro niwo wakongeje ikibatsi cy'impano ye.\nAho wakura ibihangano bye.\nIbihangano bye wifashishije uburyo bw'ikoranabuhanga wajya kuri shene ye ya YouTube yitwa Junior RUMAGA hakaba haribyo yakoranye na Aline sano,Bruce melode,Juno kizigenza,n'abandi benshi cyane.\nKandi ibihangano bye byose ushobora kubibona unyuze ku rubuga rwa murandasi rwe yahanze runyuraho ibihangano bye ndetse n'abandi basizi ari rwo SigaRwanda"}
{"id": "12815", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12815", "title": "City Light Foursquare Gospel Church", "text": "City Light Foursquare Gospel Church ni urusengero rwa shinzwe n'umushumba w\u2019Itorero Bishop Prof. Fid\u00e8le Masengo, ni rusengero ruri Kimironko mu Mujyi wa Kigali, abahateranira bafashwa, bagaha Imana icyubahiro mu buryo butandukanye, Mu kuramya kwabo, hari aho baririmba basirimba, abiruka mu rusengero n\u2019ubundi buryo nko kuryama butuma abantu bumva ko bunze ubumwe n\u2019Imana."}
{"id": "12816", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12816", "title": "Umurenge wa Gatenga", "text": "Umurenge wa Gatenga ni umwe mu mirenge 10 igize Akarere ka Kicukiro, mu Mujyi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Gatenga wari utuwe n'abaturage 67 084. Ugizwe n'utugari 4.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbuso n'utugari.\nUmurenge wa Gatenga ni umwe mu mirenge 10 y'Akarere ka Kicukiro. Ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 12,44. Ugizwe n'utugari 4:\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Gatenga wari utuwe n'abaturage 48 640. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 67 084. Abagabo bari 34 465. Abagore bari 32 619. Abaturage bose batuye mu mujyi."}
{"id": "12817", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12817", "title": "Umuganga sacco", "text": "Umuganga SACCO ni ikigo cy'imari cyo kuzigama no kuguriza cyashyiriweho abaganga mu Rwanda.Ikigega cy\u2019imari \u201cUmuganga SACCO\u201d cyashyize igorora abanyamuryango bayo aho bagiye bahabwa inguzanyo zitandukanye mu rwego rwo guteza imbere abanyamuryango bayo.Byagarutsweho mu Nteko rusange isanzwe yabaye kuri taliki 24 Werurwe 2022, aho yibanze ku kwiga uko imari yari ihagaze umwaka ushize.Imishahara y\u2019abakozi bo mu rwego rw\u2019ubuzima izajya inyuzwa mu Umuganga SACCO mu gihe ibyangombwa bitangwa na Banki Nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda bizaba bibonetse.Ubuyobozi bwa Koperative Umuganga SACCO buvuga ko mu kimina abaganga bo mu bigo by\u2019ubuzima byigenga batari bemerewe.Sitati nshya ivuga ko umuntu wese ukora mu rwego rw\u2019ubuzima mu Rwanda yemerewe kuba umunyamuryango apfa kuba afite aho ahuriye n\u2019uru rwego. Kugeza ubu Ikigo cy\u2019Igihugu gishinzwe amakoperative (RCA) cyamaze guha ubuzima gatozi Umuganga SACCO. \nAmashakiro.\nhttps://web.archive.org/web/20220920173038/https://hssmag.rw/\nhttps://www.kigalitoday.com/ubukungu/ishoramari/article/abakora-mu-rwego-rw-ubuzima-bashyiriweho-umuganga-sacco"}
