{"id": "12819", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12819", "title": "Bull dogg", "text": "Ndayishimiye Malik Bertrand yamenyekanye ku mazina menshi gusa iryamamaye ni Bull Dogg yavutse kuwa 16 Nzeri 1988. Ni umuraperi wamenyekanye mu njyana ya Hip-Hop y\u2019umwihariko wa Old School-(ishuri rya kera). Icyakora muri iyi minsi yinjiye mu njyana ya New School. Uyu muraperi yakuriye mu itsinda rya Tuff Gangs aho yakoranaga na Fireman, Jay Polly, Green P ndetse na P Fla gusa nyuma baza kwitandukanya bitewe n'amakimbirane yagiye avuka hagati yabo.\nAmateka.\nUrugendo rwa muzika.\nBull Dogg yamenyekanye cyane mu mwaka wa 2008 ubwo yasohoraga indirimbo \"Umunsi w\u2019Imperuka\" igakundwa cyane bitewe no gukoresha amagambo bita \u2018slang\u2019 amenyerewe ku banyamerika. Iyi ndirimbo yakunzwe bikomeye n'abafana b\u2019injyana uyu muraperi yabarizwagamo, nyuma yahise asohora iyitwa \u201cImfubyi\u201d yaririmbanye na The Ben irakundwa cyane ndetse irakinwa ku ma radio atandukanye haba mu Mujyi wa Kigali ndetse na hanze yawo. \nIzina Bull Dogg rihita ritangira kwamamara rityo. Uyu muraperi wakunze gukora ku giti cye nubwo yari ari mu itsinda rya Tuff Gangz yakunze kugira amahirwe yo gusinya amasezerano mu nzu zinyuranye zitunganya muzika aho muri 2014 uyu muraperi yinjiye muri Infinity Record icyakora nyuma y\u2019imyaka ibiri gusa\u00a0 ni ukuvuga muri 2016 akaza kuyivamo yerekeza muri Touch Record aho aherutse kuva dore ko atamazemo n\u2019umwaka aha akaba yarahamaze amezi atandatu gusa mu gihe yari afite amasezerano y\u2019imyaka ibiri yose."}
{"id": "12820", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12820", "title": "Social Mula", "text": "Lambert Mugwaneza wamenyekanye ku izina Social Mula, azwiho ijwi ry\u2019ubuhanga n\u2019inyikirizo zikundwa na benshi. Yatangiye urugendo rw\u2019umuziki mu 2012, buri mwaka yavuzweho mu nkuru zitandukanye. \nAmateka.\nUbuzima bwite.\nYasubitse Kaminuza kugira ngo arusheho kwita ku rugendo rwe rw\u2019umuziki. Amaze guhatana mu marushanwa akomeye y\u2019umuziki nka Primus Guma Guma Super Stars, yanashyizwe mu bahataniye ibihembo bya Salax Awards.\nUrugendo rwa Muzika.\nSocial Mula yatangiye umuziki mu 2013, Yakoranye n\u2019abahanzi batandukanye bo mu Rwanda no muri Uganda. Yaririmbye mu bitaramo bikomeye hose aserukana ishema n\u2019isheja. Uyu muhanzi arateganya gushyira hanze album muri 2020. Social Mula yakunzwe mu ndirimbo nka \u201cKundunduro\u201d yamwaguriye igikundiro, \u201cAgakufi\u201d, \u201cAbanyaKigali\u201d n\u2019izindi."}
{"id": "12821", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12821", "title": "Kaminuza ya Oxford", "text": "Kaminuza ya Oxford ni muri, mu Bwongereza. Hariho ibimenyetso byerekana ko bigisha kuva mu 1096, ikaba kaminuza ya kera cyane ku na. Yakuze vuba kuva 1167 igihe yabuzaga abanyeshuri b'icyongereza kujya muri. Nyuma y\u2019amakimbirane hagati y\u2019abanyeshuri n\u2019umujyi wa Oxford mu 1209, abize bamwe bahungiye mu majyaruguru y\u2019iburasirazuba berekeza muri aho bashinze icyahindutse. zisangiye ibintu byinshi zisanzwe kandi zitwa \"\". Oxford iri muri kaminuza zizwi cyane ku isi. \nIyi kaminuza igizwe na kaminuza, ibyumba bitandatu, hamwe n\u2019amashami atandukanye y\u2019amasomo ateguwe mu bine. Amashuri makuru yose ni ibigo byigenga muri kaminuza, buriwese ugenzura abanyamuryango bayo hamwe nimiterere yimbere nibikorwa. Abanyeshuri bose ni abanyamuryango ba kaminuza. Ntabwo ifite ikigo gikuru, kandi inyubako n'ibikoresho byanyanyagiye mu mujyi rwagati. muri Oxford agizwe ninyigisho, -matsinda mato muri za kaminuza na salle, amahugurwa, akazi ka laboratoire ndetse rimwe na rimwe andi masomo yatanzwe n'amashami n'amashami ya kaminuza nkuru. gitangwa ahanini hagati. \nOxford ikora ya kera cyane ku isi, hamwe ku isi hamwe na sisitemu nini y\u2019ibitabo by\u2019amasomo mu gihugu hose. Mu mwaka w'ingengo y'imari urangira ku ya 31 Nyakanga 2019, kaminuza yinjije amafaranga angana na 45 2.45miliyari, muri zo 624.8miliyoni yavuye mu nkunga y'ubushakashatsi n'amasezerano. \nOxford yigishije abanyeshuri benshi bazwi cyane, barimo ndetse n\u2019abakuru b\u2019ibihugu na guverinoma benshi ku isi. Kugeza mu Kwakira 2020, abatsindiye igihembo cyitiriwe Nobel 72, Abamidari 4 ba Fields, hamwe n\u2019abatsindiye ibihembo 6 bya Turing Award barize, barakora, cyangwa bakoze ubusabane bwo gusura muri kaminuza ya Oxford, mu gihe abayirangije batsindiye imidari 160. Oxford ni inzu ya bourse nyinshi, harimo na, imwe muri gahunda za kera za bourse mpuzamahanga. \nAmateka.\nItariki yo gushinga kaminuza ya Oxford ntiramenyekana. Birazwi ko kwigisha muri Oxford byabayeho muburyo bumwe nko mu 1096, ariko ntibisobanutse igihe kaminuza yatangiriye. Intiti yigishije Oxford mu ntangiriro ya 1100s. \nYakuze vuba kuva 1167 igihe abanyeshuri b'icyongereza bagarukaga muri. Umuhanga mu by'amateka yigishije intiti nk'izo mu 1188, maze intiti ya mbere izwi cyane mu mahanga, igera mu 1190. Umuyobozi wa kaminuza yari afite izina rya kuva byibura 1201, kandi ba shebuja bamenyekanye nka \"Universitas\" cyangwa isosiyete mu 1231. Iyi kaminuza yahawe amasezerano ya cyami mu 1248 ku ngoma y'Umwami. \nNyuma y\u2019amakimbirane hagati y\u2019abanyeshuri n\u2019umujyi wa Oxford mu 1209, abize bamwe bahunze urugomo bajya i, nyuma bashinga kaminuza ya Cambridge. "}
{"id": "12823", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12823", "title": "Junior Giti", "text": "Bugingo Bony ukunda kwiyita Junior The Premier kurubu akabayarongereyeho Giti kumazina ye akoresha mumwuga wamamaye mu gusobanura filime myinshi zigiye zitandukanye.Junior uri mu b\u2019imbere mu gusobanura filime zikunzwe zirebwa hano mu Rwanda.\nUbuzima bwa Junior.\nBugingo ukunda kwiyita Junior The Premier ari na we washinze ikompanyi ya African Movie Market yacuruzaga igafasha mugusakaza filime basobanuraga yasabye anatanga inkwano mu muryango wa Muhoza Angel mu birori byabereye iwabo mu Murenge wa Gitega mu Mujyi wa Kigali tariki ya 22 Nyakanga mu mwaka 2017. Junior ni murumuna wa Younger ufatwa nk\u2019inkingi ya mwamba mu byo gusobanura filime, mu muryango wabo bavukana ari abana bane ndetse bose bakora uyu mwuga kandi bawubakiyemo izina.Mukuru wabo witwa Mike ni we wabanje kwinjira mu byo gusobanura filime akurikirwa na Younger wahise wigarurira imitima ya benshi nyuma hazakuza Junior na we abyinjiramo hanyuma murumuna we Sankara na we abijyamo ndetse ni wo mwuga ubatunze bose. \nJunior Giti kurubu Ahagaze Gute.\nJunior Giti akaba murumuna wa Yanga, yashyize hanze amashusho ya nyuma mukuru we yagaragayemo ubwo yari muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo agiye kwivuza mbere gato yo kwitaba Imana.Junior Giti mu mwaka 2021 yafunguye Label yise 'Junior Giti Business Group' ahita anashyiramo abahanzi babiri bazwi nka Chris Eazy ndetse na Ao Beats banashyira hanze indirimbo yabo ya mbere bari muri label bayita 'Yozefina'. kurubu wavugako abahanzi amaze kubageza kurwego rurihejuru mu Rwanda bari mubakunzwe."}
{"id": "12824", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12824", "title": "Rocky Kimomo", "text": "Uwizeye Marc uzwi mu gusobanura filime nka Rocky Kirabiranya cyangwa se Kimomo ni umunyarwanda uba mu Rwanda wavuga ko afite igikundiro.\nIbyinshi Wamumenyaho.\nUmusobanuzi w'ama Filime Uwizeyimana Marc wamamaye nka Rocky Kirabiranya,ariko kurubu akaba yiyita Rock kimomo akaba n\u2019umuyobozi w\u2019inzu irebera inyungu z'abahanzi \u2018Rocky Entertainment\u2019 yari isanzwe ibamo umuhanzi uri gukora indirimbo ziri gushimwa n'abatari bacye nka Papa Cyangwe. Rocky ni umwe mu basobanuzi bagezweho cyane mu bijyanye no gusobanura filime mu rurimi rw\u2019ikinyarwanda izo bita 'Agasobanuye' mu buryo buryoheye amatwi bunakunzwe cyane. Mu bakunda uburyo asobanuramo filime, ku isonga hari urubyiruko kubera imvugo ziba zitamenyerewe akoresha ndetse ugasanga hamwe na hamwe ziri gukoreshwa mu buzima bwa buri munsi. Rocky yagiye yamamariza ibigo bitandukanye nka Itel Rwanda nyuma y\u2019abandi bakoranye na yo barimo Butera Knowless ndetse na Nishimwe Naomie waherukaga gusinyana amasezerano n\u2019iyi sosiyete. Rocky Kirabiranya yahawe igihembo cy\u2019uwahize abandi basobanuzi mu mwaka wa 2019,kuri ubu ni umusobanuzi wa filime ukunzwe na banyarwanda."}
{"id": "12825", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12825", "title": "Habyarimana Desire", "text": "Habyarimana Desire ni umugabo wubatse urugo hamwe na Kiyange Adda- Darl\u00e8ne, bafite abana babiri Divin na Dan, akora umurimo w\u2019 Ubushumba nkorera umurimo w\u2019 Imana mw\u2019 itorero rya ADEPR Kicukiro- Rwanda."}
{"id": "12826", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12826", "title": "Kaminuza ya Tulane", "text": "Kaminuza ya Tulane, ku mugaragaro kaminuza ya Tulane ya Louisiana, ni muri. Yashinzwe nka Koleji y\u2019Ubuvuzi ya Louisiana mu 1834 n\u2019abaganga barindwi b\u2019ubuvuzi, yahindutse kaminuza rusange ya kaminuza nka kaminuza ya Louisiana n\u2019inteko ishinga amategeko ya leta mu 1847. \n Ikigo cyabaye icyigenga ku nkunga ya na mu 1884 na 1887. Tulane ni kaminuza ya 9 ya kera yigenga mu. na, ni ishuri rya 12 rya kera ry\u2019amategeko ndetse n\u2019ishuri rya 15 ry\u2019ubuvuzi rya kera muri Amerika. Tulane yabaye umunyamuryango w\u2019ishyirahamwe rya za kaminuza zo muri Amerika kuva 1958 kandi ashyirwa muri \"R1: Kaminuza za Doctorat - Igikorwa cy\u2019ubushakashatsi cyane\". "}
{"id": "12827", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12827", "title": "Zigirinshuti Michael", "text": "Zigirinshuti Michael ni umugano w'umuvugabutumwa mu itorero rya ADEPR, ufite umugore n'abana, usanzwe ari Pasiteri cyangwa Umushumba muri Paruwasi ya Gasave, kandi akaba yari ashinzwe ivugabutumwa muri iryo torero."}
{"id": "12828", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12828", "title": "Abahamya ba Yehova", "text": "Abahamya ba Yehova ni dini rifite inkomoko muri Amerika rikaba rifite abayoboke bangana na miliyoni 8 ku isi hose.\nAmateka.\nMu kinyejana cya 19 mu mwaka wa 1870; abanyeshuri bo muri Amerika bafite inkomoko mu ishuri rya bibiliya ryitwaga Abigishwa ba Bibiliya ryashinzwe na Charles Taze Russell na bagenzi be Nyuma yaho Charles Taze Russel hamwe n'itsinda rye bashinze ikinyamakuru cyabaga gikubiyemo inyigisho za gikirisito cyitwa umunara w'umurinzi.\nAbahamya ba Yehova mu Rwanda.\nAhagana mu mwaka wa 1970, muri werurwe nibwo abahamya ba Yehova batangiye gukora umurimo wo kubwiriza mu Rwanda.Umuvugizi w\u2019Abahamya ba Yehova mu Rwanda,yitwa Habiyaremye Jean d\u2019Amour.\nIbarura ry\u2019abaturage mu Rwanda ryo mu 2002 ryagaragaje ko amadini ahagaze ryashyizeho ko Abahamya ba Yehova banganaga na 4%.\nUburyo babwiriza.\nAbahamya ba Yehova babwiriza hifashijwe Bibiliya, ibikoresho by'ikoranabuhanga n'ibitabo. "}
{"id": "12829", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12829", "title": "Ifunguro rya saasita ku ishuri", "text": "Gufatira ifunguro rya saasita ku ishuri ni uburyo bwiza bwashyizweho na leta ifatanije na minisiteri y'uburezi mu rwego rwo kuzamura imyigire n'imibereho myiza y'umwana.Aho usanga abanyeshuri biga mu burezi bw'ibanze bw'imyaka 9 na 12 ndetse n'amashuri ya tekinike bafatira ifunguro rya saasita ku shuri bagakomeza imyigire yabo ya nimugoroba nta kibazo cy'inzara bafite."}
{"id": "12830", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12830", "title": "Gakunzi Makuza Willy", "text": "Gakunzi Makuza Willy usanzwe akorera umuziki uhimbaza Imana muri Canada akaba ari mu bashinze Umuryango Heart of Worship in Action ugamije guhindura imibereho y\u2019abaturage."}
{"id": "12831", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12831", "title": "Uwimana Jean Francois", "text": "Uwimana Jean Francois ni padiri muri kiriziya Gatolika ubu uri kwiga mu Budage, yashyize hanze indirimbo yise \u2018Uwacu\u2019 iherekejwe n\u2019amashusho, aho agaragaza urukumbuzi n\u2019amazina ya bamwe mu bakomeye babayeho mu mateka y\u2019u Rwanda."}
{"id": "12832", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12832", "title": "Korali JEHOVAH JIREH", "text": "Korali Jehovah jireh yavutse mu 1998 ari abaririmbyi 15 itangiranye na CEP ULK (umuryango w\u2019apantekote biga muri za kaminuza n\u2019amashuri makuru b\u2019itorero ADEPR), ikora umurimo w\u2019Imana kandi ikawukora mu gihe ubona bigoranye cyane ku buryo usanga bafite iminota 20 (mu kiruhuho cya saa moya n\u2019igice z\u2019ijoro) bakoraga repetition kabiri mu cyumweru ariko nyuma yo gusohora alubumu tariki 25/07/2010 bagiye gusohora album ya mbere ya mashusho yitwa \"\u201cIngoma ya Kristo ntizahanguka\u201d\" tariki 22/05/2011."}
{"id": "12833", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12833", "title": "Uwimana Aim\u00e9e", "text": "Uwimana Aimee azwi nka Bishop Aime, umugore n\u2019umwana, yatangiye gukora umuziki mu 1994 amaze kwakira Kristu nk\u2019umwami n\u2019umukiza we, aho yakundaga kuririmba ariko akabura aho abihera n\u2019ubwo ngo kugeza magingo aya ataragera aho yifuza kugera, uzwi ku ndirimbo nka Muririmbire Uwiteka, Une Lettre d\u2019Amour, Ngwino mukiza twibanire, Iminsi yose, Urwibutso, Inkovu z\u2019urukundo, n\u2019izindi avuga ko yibanda ku njyana zituje zirimo Slow, Country, Zouk na Salsa, n\u2019ubwo ngo Slow ariyo imukoraho cyane."}
{"id": "12834", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12834", "title": "Zaninka Kabaganza Liliane", "text": "Zaninka Kabaganza Liliane uzwi nka Kabaganza Liliane Yavutse ku itariki ya 11 Kamena 1975, avukira ahitwa Bibogobogo mu Ntara ya Kivu y\u2019amajyepfo muri Repubulika iharanira Demokarasi ya Congo (RDC), Papa we umubyara ni Umushumba mu Itorero ryitwa Healing Heart mu Ntara y\u2019Amajyepfo akaba yitwa Mukiza Leonard naho mama we yitwa Nyabaziga Odette bakaba barabyaranye abana 6, ni umuririmbyikazi akaba n\u2019umwanditsi w\u2019indirimbo zihimbaza Imana, afite ubwenegihugu bw\u2019ubunyarwanda, uburebure bwa metero 1.51, ni umudamu yashakanye na Dusabemungu Ntabajyana Celestin mu mwaka 1999 I Kigali, Liliane yamenyekanye cyane muri Chorale Rehoboth,mu ndirimbo nka \"Imana ni byose, Iyo ntekereje umugabo witwa Yesu, Getsemani, Habwa ikuzo, Bakundwa n\u2019izindi\" Ubu Liliane Kabaganza amaze kwandika indirimbo 68. Indirimbo yanditse mbere ikaba yitwa i Bethelehemu iri kuri Alubumu ya mbere ya Rehoboth Ministries yitwa \u201cAbafite inyota ni muze\u201d."}
{"id": "12835", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12835", "title": "Agakingirizo", "text": "Agakingirizo ni igikoresho kigabanya amahirwe yo kwanduzanya indwara zandurira mu mibonano mpuzabitsina ndetse no gusama inda zitateganijwe. Habaho agakingirizo k'abagabo n'aka abagore. Hamwe n'imikoreshereze ikwiye - kandi gakoreshwa mubikorwa byose by'imibonano mpuzabitsina -.Abagore nabo bashakanye bakoresha agakingirizo k'abagabo bashobora kugira amahirwe ya 2% yo gusama. Hamwe n'imikoreshereze isanzwe, igipimo cyo gutwita kingana na 18% ku mwaka. Imikoreshereze yako igabanya cyane ibyago byo kurwara gonorrhea, chlamydia, trichomoniasis, hepatite B, na VIH / SIDA. Zirinda kandi ku rugero ruto kwirinda indwara ya herpes, papillomavirus ku muntu (HPV), ndetse na sifilis.\nAgakingirizo k'umugabo kaba kazungurutse ku gitsina gihagaze mbere yo gukora imibonano kandi kigakora mu gukora inzitizi y'umubiri ibuza amasohoro kwinjira mu mubiri w'uwo muhuje igitsina. Udukingirizo twabagabo dukorwa muri latex, kandi mubisanzwe, kuva polyurethane, polyisoprene, cyangwa amara y'intama. Udukingirizo tw'abagabo dufite ibyiza byo koroshya imikoreshereze, byoroshye kubigeraho n'ingaruka nke. Abafite allergie ya latex igomba gukoreshwa polyurethane cyangwa izindi verisiyo yubukorikori. Agakingirizo k'abagore gakozwe muri polyurethane kandi karashobora gukoreshwa inshuro nyinshi.\nUdukingirizo nk'uburyo bwo gukumira indwara zandurira mu mibonano mpuzabitsina zakoreshejwe kuva byibura 1544. Agakingirizo ka reberi kabonetse mu 1855, gakurikirwa n'udukingirizo twa latex muri 1920. Ari kurutonde rw' rw'ishami ry'umuryango w'Abibumbye ryita ku buzima ku isi, urutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi. Igiciro cyinshi mu gihugu cy'iterambere kiri hafi 0.03 kugeza US $ 0.08 buri umwe. Muri Leta zunzubumwe z'Amerika,ubusanzwe agakingirizo kagura amadolari y'Amerika 1.00. Kw'isi yose munsi ya 10% y'abakoresha kuringaniza imbyaro bakoresha agakingirizo. Ibiciro byo gukoresha agakingirizo biri hejuru mu bihugu byateye imbere. Mu Bwongereza agakingirizo ni uburyo bwa kabiri bukunze kugaragara mu kuboneza urubyaro (22%) mu gihe muri Amerika ari ubwa gatatu bukunze kugaragara (15%). Hafi miliyari esheshatu kugeza icyenda zigurishwa ku mwaka."}
{"id": "12836", "revid": "10902", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12836", "title": "Paracetamol", "text": "Paracetamol, izwi kandi nka acetaminophen, ni umuti ukoreshwa cyane mu kugabanya ububabare n'umuriro. Ufatwa mu kanwa, mu kibuno cyangwa mu rushinge mu mutsi.\nWakozwe bwa mbere mu 1877, kandi uri ku rutonde rw'imiti y'ingenzi y'Ishami ry'Umuryango w'Abibumbye ryita ku Buzima.\nIkoreshwa mu buvuzi.\nParacetamol, izwi kandi nka acetaminofeni, ni imiti ikoreshwa mu kuvura ububabare n'umuriro. Ubusanzwe ikoreshwa muburyo bworoshye bwo kugabanya ububabare. Ibimenyetso bivanze kubikoresha kugirango bigabanye umuriro mubana. Bikunze kugurishwa bifatanije nindi miti, nko mumiti myinshi ikonje. Paracetamol ikoreshwa kandi mububabare bukabije, nk'ububabare bwa kanseri n'ububabare nyuma yo kubagwa, bufatanije n'imiti y'ububabare bwa opioid. Ubusanzwe ikoreshwa haba kumunwa cyangwa kugororoka, ariko iraboneka no guterwa mumitsi. Ingaruka zimara hagati yamasaha abiri nane.\nIngaruka mbi n'uko ikora.\nParacetamol muri rusange ifite umutekano mugihe gikenewe. Icyifuzo ntarengwa cya buri munsi kumuntu mukuru ni garama eshatu kugeza enye. Umubare munini urashobora gutera uburozi, harimo no kunanirwa kwumwijima. Ni gake cyane ibisebe byuruhu bishobora kubaho. Bigaragara ko bifite umutekano mugihe cyo gutwita no konsa. Ku bafite uburwayi bwumwijima, irashobora gukoreshwa, ariko mukigero cyo hasi. Byashyizwe mubikorwa byo gusesengura byoroheje. Ntabwo ifite ibikorwa byingenzi byo kurwanya inflammatory. Uburyo ikora ntabwo isobanutse neza.\nAmateka n'igiciro.\nParacetamol yakozwe bwa mbere mu 1877. Niwo muti ukoreshwa cyane mu kubabara no kugira umuriro muri Amerika ndetse n'Uburayi. Ari kurutonde rwumuryango wubuzima ku isi urutonde rwimiti yingenzi. Paracetamol iraboneka nkumuti rusange, hamwe namazina yikirango arimo Tylenol na Panadol nibindi. Igiciro cyinshi mugihugu kiri mu nzira y'amajyambere kiri munsi ya kuri dose. Muri Amerika, igura kuri dose. Muri 2017, yari imiti ya 25 ikunze gutangwa muri Amerika, hamwe na miliyoni zirenga 24 zandikiwe."}
{"id": "12837", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12837", "title": "Paludisme", "text": "Malariya cyangwa malariya, nanone yitwa \" umuriro wo mu gishanga ni indwara yandura iterwa na parasite yo mu bwoko bwa \"Plasmodium\", ikwirakwizwa no kurumwa n'ubwoko bumwe na bumwe bw'imibu ya Anopheles.\nMuri 229 millions n\u2019abarwayi 409 000 d\u00e9c\u00e8s muri 2019, malariya ikomeje kuba ikomeye kandi yibasira cyane cyane abana bari munsi y\u2019imyaka itanu n\u2019abagore batwite. 95 % by'imanza zanditswe mu bihugu makumyabiri n'icyenda, cyane cyane muri (27) % muri Nijeriya, 12 % muri DR Congo, 5 % muri Uganda, 4 % muri Mozambike) (cf. igice kirambuye: \u201c Epidemiologiya \").\nIndwara ya malariya yandura cyane cyane nijoro iyo irumwe n'umubu w'igitsina gore wo mu bwoko bwa \"\", ubwayo yanduye nyuma yo kuruma umuntu urwaye malariya. Parasite yanduza selile yumwijima yuwahohotewe hanyuma ikazenguruka mumaraso, ikoroniza (erythrocytes cyangwa selile yamaraso itukura) ikabasenya.\nEtymology.\nIjambo \"malariya\" riva mu kilatini \"palus\", \" igishanga\u00bb.Ijambo \"malariya\" rikomoka kuri \"mal'aria\" yo mu, \" umwuka mubi\u00bb. Iri jambo rikoreshwa cyane ku isi, cyane cyane abavuga Icyongereza."}
{"id": "12838", "revid": "10902", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12838", "title": "Malaria", "text": "Malariya Consortium ni umuryango udaharanira inyungu, mu kurwanya isi ya n'izindi ndwara zanduza - cyane cyane izibasira abana bari munsi y\u2019imyaka itanu. Icyicaro cyacyo kiri mu Bwongereza. Ryakozwe mu 2003, rikora muri Afurika no muri Aziya. Urutonde rwa nkimwe mumiryango icyenda ikoresha amafaranga menshi kwisi.\numuryango.\nUyu muryango ukorana cyane na gahunda z\u2019igihugu zo kurwanya malariya, Umuryango w\u2019ubuzima ku isi, ndetse n\u2019ubuyobozi bw\u2019ubuzima bwa Leta, uturere n\u2019uturere muri buri gihugu. Iterwa inkunga cyane cyane n\u2019impano zatanzwe n\u2019abaterankunga n\u2019abantu ku giti cyabo, nka Fondasiyo ya Bill-na-Melinda-Gates\nIbikorwa.\nMalariya Consortium igabanya ikwirakwizwa rya malariya binyuze muri gahunda yo kwirinda imiti y\u2019ibihe byasabwe n\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubuzima ku isi. Uyu muryango urasaba guha ubu buvuzi abana mu gihe cya malariya, mu turere usanga ari ibihe. Abana barenga miliyoni 25 bafite hagati y\u2019amezi 3 na 59 bari kungukirwa no kwirinda Uyu muryango ukwirakwiza ibiyobyabwenge, uhugura inzobere mu buzima, kandi ukurikirana aho usanga kurwanya imiti igabanya ubukana ari byinshi. Irasuzuma kandi akamaro ko kuvura cyangwa kugenzura ibikoresho binyuze mu bushakashatsi bwasohotse mu binyamakuru byasuzumwe\nIriburiro "}
{"id": "12839", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12839", "title": "Bizimana Patient", "text": "Bizimana Patient ni umuramyi umaze gushinga imizi mu ndirimbo zo kuramya no guhimbaza Imana, Umuziki yawutangiye akiri muto akiyumvamo impano yatangiye kwihatira kwiga gucuranga piano mu rusengero hanyuma bigeze mu 2007 asohora indirimbo ye bwite yitwa \u2018Andyohera\u2019 ari nabwo benshi batangiye kumubwira ko afite ijwi ryiza, Yakunzwe bidasanzwe mu ndirimbo ze nka \u2018Iyo neza\u2019, \u2018Amagambo yanjye\u2019, \u2018Menye neza\u2019, \u2018Ikimenyetso\u2019, \u2018Ubwo buntu, \u2018Ndaje\u2019 n\u2019izindi nyinshi, akaba yarashakanye na Karamira Uwera Gentille bitegura kurwubaka nk\u2019umugabo n\u2019umugore."}
{"id": "12840", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12840", "title": "Indwara zandurira mu mibonanompuzabitsina", "text": "Indwara yandurira mu mibonano mpuzabitsina (STI) cyangwa indwara zandurira mu mibonano mpuzabitsina (STI) muri Kanada ni yandura hagati y\u2019abafatanyabikorwa mu buryo butandukanye bwo. Iyi ndwara irashobora kubyara, yahoze yitwa indwara ziterwa na virusi, izina rikomoka kuri, imana y'urukundo.Imibonano mpuzabitsina yose irimo guhuza igitsina cyangwa umunwa-guhuza igitsina nundi muntu, cyangwa amazi yimyanya ndangagitsina, bifatwa nkibyago byo kwandura indwara zandurira mu mibonano mpuzabitsina. Buri STI ifite ibyago bitandukanye nurwego rwuburemere. Urebye kwandura buco-faecal, guhuza umunwa-anal byoroheje bitera ibyago byo kwandura parasitike Indwara irashobora kuba myinshi (ibintu byinshi byanduza icyarimwe). Bikunze kugaruka mugihe gitoBitewe n'ubwoko bw'ubwandu, ibyago byo kwandura birashobora kugabanuka no gukingirwa, bikagabanya umubare w'abafatanyabikorwa no gukoresha uburinzi bukwiye harimo, cyane cyane agakingirizo k'abagabo n'abagore ku ndwara zandurira mu myanya ndangagitsina no mu gitsina ndetse.\nAmagambo.\nKugeza mu ntangiriro ya za 1980, imvugo y'Igifaransa \" indwara zifata imyanya ndangagitsina ibyo bisigo byerekanaga imana ya kera ya migani ya Venusi. Kuva mu myaka ya za 90, izina MST (kuri \" indwara zandurira mu mibonano mpuzabitsina \u201d) Cyangwa MTS (kuri\u201c indwara zandurira mu mibonano mpuzabitsina \u201d) Bakoreshwa. Kuva mu 1999, ijambo MST ryagiye risimburwa buhoro buhoro n'iri IST na ITS, (\u201c indwara zandurira mu mibonano mpuzabitsina\u00bb na\u00abindwara zandurira mu mibonano mpuzabitsina \"), kubera ko ijambo\" kwandura \"aho kuba\" indwara\u00bbIfata neza neza ko indwara zimwe na zimwe zidafite ibimenyetso (nta bimenyetso bigaragara, zishobora kutamenyekana, ntizitabe ibisobanuro byijambo ryindwara mururimi rwa buri munsi). Indwara zimwe zandurira mu mibonano mpuzabitsina zishobora kwandura binyuze mu maraso (hepatite B) cyangwa amata yonsa (SIDA). Noneho, muri Kanada, turavuga cyane cyane kuri STBBIs: \u201c kwandura mu mibonano mpuzabitsina no kwandura amaraso\u00bb \nKwirinda.\nAmahirwe yo kwandura indwara binyuze mubikorwa byimibonano mpuzabitsina aratandukanye cyane na patologi yandi kandi biterwa nubusambanyi. Imikorere imwe n'imwe itarimo guhuza igitsina cyangwa umunwa (urugero, kwikinisha, gutunga urutoki cyangwa gukubita), hamwe no gukoresha agakingirizo, ingomero z'amenyo cyangwa gants, bigabanya ibyago byo kwandura. Iyi myitozo ivugwa nkimibonano mpuzabitsina itekanye.\nAgakingirizo.\nBitewe n'indwara ireba, inzobere mu buzima ziragira inama imibonano mpuzabitsina ikingiwe n'udukingirizo mu gihe cyo kuryamana n'abantu bashobora kwandura. Agakingirizo kagaragaza ko ari ingirakamaro cyane mu gukumira kwanduza indwara zandurira mu mibonano mpuzabitsina no mu gitsina ndetse n'amasohoro, ariko ntizirinda indwara zandurira mu mibonano mpuzabitsina zigaragara ku ruhu rw'igitsina. Agakingirizo rero gakoreshwa neza mugihe cyimibonano mpuzabitsina no kwinjira, niyo yonyine yo kuboneza urubyaro irinda kwandura virusi itera sida na hepatite B. Icyakora, ntabwo irinda neza izindi ndwara zandurira mu mibonano mpuzabitsina itera abantu benshi bapfa, nka sifilis cyangwa papillomavirus ya muntu, ishinzwe ubwoko butandukanye bwa kanseri harimo na kanseri y'inkondo y'umura kandi ikingira gusa. Hanyuma, ntirinda kandi imyanya ndangagitsina ishinzwe ingaruka zikomeye zo mumitekerereze n\u2019imibereho y\u2019umuntu wanduye kandi kwanduza akayoya mu gihe cyo kubyara, bita neonatal herpes, bitera impfu zikomeye hamwe n\u2019urukurikirane rukomeye."}
{"id": "12842", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12842", "title": "Bahari Alphonse", "text": "Bahari Alphonse wavuste mu mwaka 1974 ariko uwo mwaka ukaba awushidikanywaho kubera ko atigeze abona ababyeyi be kugira ngo bamubwire igihe nyacyo yavukiye, akaba yaravukiye ahitwa Kalehe muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Congo, ni umunyarwanda utuye i Gisenyi, yashakanye na SALAMA Diane, bafitanye abana 3 Abakobwa 2 n\u2019umuhungu 1, aririmba indirimbo zihimbaza Imana, ni umwe mu bahanzi bamaze kubaka amateka akomeye mu mitima y\u2019abanyarwanda mu buryo budasubirwaho."}
{"id": "12843", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12843", "title": "WHO", "text": "WHO Numuryango w'Abibumbye ryita ku Buzima (OMS) ni ikigo cyihariye cy'Umuryango w'Abibumbye gishinzwe ubuzima rusange cyashinzwe mu 1948. Biterwa n\u2019inama y\u2019ubukungu n\u2019imibereho y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye kandi icyicaro cyayo giherereye i Pregny-Chamb\u00e9sy, muri kanton ya Geneve, mu BusuwisiDukurikije itegeko nshinga ryayo, OMS igamije kugera ku rwego rwo hejuru rw\u2019ubuzima rushoboka ku baturage bose bo mu bihugu bigize uyu, ubuzima busobanurwa muri iyo nyandiko imwe na \u00abimiterere yimibereho myiza yumubiri, iy'ibitekerezo n'imibereho myiza ntabwo ari ukubura indwara cyangwa ubumuga gusa \nImikorere.\nImikorere ya OMS izenguruka ku cyicaro gikuru i Geneve, amatsinda atandatu y\u2019imiterere y\u2019imiterere n\u2019ubunyamabanga iyobowe n\u2019Umuyobozi Mukuru.\nImiterere.\nInteko yubuzima ku isi.\nInteko y\u2019ubuzima ku isi n\u2019urwego rukuru rufata ibyemezo bya OMS. Ubusanzwe iteranira i Geneve muri Gicurasi buri mwaka kandi ikagira intumwa ziturutse mu 194 \u00c9tats. Buri munyamuryango afite ijwi rimwe. Inshingano zayo nyamukuru ni ukwemeza ingengo yimishinga ya OMS yimyaka ibiri ikurikira no guhitamo icyerekezo nyamukuru cya politiki cyumuryango. Aya mabwiriza yatowe n\u2019Inteko y\u2019ubuzima ku isi ku bwiganze bwa benshi kandi atangira gukurikizwa ku bihugu byose bigize Umuryango keretse iyo banze cyangwa bagashyiraho umwanzuro mu gihe giteganijwe kubimenyeshwa. Yemejwe na bibiri bya gatatu byamasezerano mashya yubuzima kugirango yuzuze icyuho mubice bitandukanye. Amasezerano yose agomba kwemezwa na buri gihugu kugirango gitangire gukurikizwa. Kurugero, rwemeje Amasezerano ya OMS yerekeye kurwanya itabi, 6 \u00c9tats gusa ntizemeza. Inteko ishyiraho politiki n'ingengo y'imari ya OMS."}
{"id": "12844", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12844", "title": "Hagumamahoro Isaac", "text": "Hagumamahoro Isaac cyangwa Mahoro Isaac amazina y'ubuhanzi, ni umusore w\u2019umuhanzi uririmba indirimbo zihimbaza Imana, yatangiye kuririmba afite imyaka 15, aririmba mu ma korali atandukanye, Ubwo yigaga mu mashuri yisumbuye mu mwaka wa 2006, atangirira ku ndirimbo y\u2019icyunamo, arinako akomeza kuririmba hirya no hino mu nsengero zitandukanye z\u2019itorero ry\u2019abadivantisti b\u2019umunsi wa karindwi dore ko ariho asengera, yasohoye indirimbo zindi iyitwa \u201cYarambohoye\u201d hamwe na \u201cShimwa Yesu\u201d,\u201cAmahoro\u201d, mu buzima busanzwe ni umunyeshuri muri kaminuza yigenga ya Kigali (ULK), aho yiga mu mwaka wa gatatu icungamutungo, akaba ari n\u2019umukozi ushinzwe inguzanyo mu murenge Sacco wa Nyamata mu Karere ka Bugesera akabifatanya n\u2019ubucuruzi ndetse n\u2019ubuhanzi."}
