{"id": "12846", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12846", "title": "Misigaro Adrien", "text": "Misigaro Adrien ni umuramyi w\u2019Umunyarwanda ukorera umuziki muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika akaba hashize imyaka 17 aririmba, akaba yarakoze igitaramo cy\u2019amateka yateguye bagitangiye batambira Imana, barinda basoza ubona bakinyotewe, Ni cyo cya mbere cyasubitswe ubwo Covid-19 iki cyorezo cyageraga mu Rwanda ku nshuro ya mbere, Yakoze indirimbo nyinshi zagiye zikundwa zirimo \u2019Ntacyo Nzaba,Nkwite Nde,Twarahuye na Mfite Impamvu\u2019."}
{"id": "12847", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12847", "title": "Nshuti Bosco", "text": "Nshuti Bosco ni umuririmbyi wamenyekanye cyane mu bahanzi bo kuramya no guhimbaza Imana ubarizwa mu Itorero rya ADEPR, akaba ari mu baririmbye mu gitaramo cyo kumurika album nshya ya Gisubizo Ministries cyiswe \u2018Worship Legacy Season 3\u2019. Nshuti nawe afite ikindi gitaramo yiteguriye cyitwa \"\u201cIBYO NTUNZE Live CONCERT\u201d.\""}
{"id": "12848", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12848", "title": "Nitezeho Aim\u00e9e Frank", "text": "Nitezeho Aim\u00e9e Frank ni umwe mu baramyi beza dufite mu ivugabutumwa mu Rwanda, aho akunzwe mu ndirimbo zitandukanye nka \"Ubuhamya bwejo\",\"Umugisha\" nizindi, akaba akorera umurimo mu Itorero rya FourSquare Gospel Church Kimironko, akaba abarizwa mu Upendo Ministries, akaba yaritabiriye ibitaramo byinshi harimo Icyo yakoreye muri Kenya. Frank Ndetse yanitabiriye nicyindi gitaramo cyiswe \u2018Worship Legacy Season 3\u2019 cyateguwe na Gisubizo Ministries."}
{"id": "12849", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12849", "title": "Gisubizo Ministries", "text": "Gisubizo Ministries imaze imyaka irenga 18 yashingiwe i Gikondo mu Mujyi wa Kigali, ni umuryango wa gikirisitu imaze kumenyekana mukumara ipfa abakunzi b\u2019umuziki wo kuramya no guhimbaza Imana, aho wakoze igitaramo cyitwa \u2018Worship Legacy Concert Season 3\u2019 cyamurikiwemo alubumu yawo ya gatatu, indirimbo baririmbye zirimo \u2018Humura\u2019 baherutse gusohora, n\u2019izindi zirimo \u2018Abagufite ntibazakena\u2019, \u2018Ku musaraba\u2019, \u2018None ubwo bimeze bityo\u2019, \u2018Ntayindi Mana twabona\u2019 na \u2018Ebenezer\u2019."}
{"id": "12851", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12851", "title": "Agasaro Tracy", "text": "Agasaro Tracy ni umunyamakuru ukora kuri KC2 Ishami rya Kabiri rya Televiziyo y\u2019u Rwanda. Ni umuramyi ukomeye aho asengera muri FourSquare Gospel Church riherereye Kimironko, akaba ari umugore wa Iradukunda Ren\u00e9 Patrick usengera muri The Love of Jesus Christ Church.\nUbuzima Bwite.\nMu buzima bwe mu rukundo bwamenyekanye cyane cyane ku wa 17 Nyakanga 2020, ubwo Ren\u00e9 Patrick yasabye Agasaro ko yamubera umugore."}
{"id": "12852", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12852", "title": "Iradukunda Rene Patrick", "text": "Iradukunda Rene Patrick ni umuramyi, umuyobozi, Kandi nin'umwe mu bahanzi b\u2019indirimbo zo kuramya no guhimbaza Imana usengera muri The Love of Jesus Christ Church, akaba ari umugabo wa Agasaro Tracy umunyamakuru ukora kuri KC2 Ishami rya kabiri rya Televiziyo y\u2019u Rwanda. Azwi mu ndirimbo nka \u2018Arankunda\u2019, \u2018Uko wahoze\u2019, \u2018Jehovah\u2019, \u2018Mfite Impamvu\u2019 na \u2018Ni byiza.\u2019 akaba ari nawe washinze Tehillah W.M ihugura abaramyi bakiri bato mu by\u2019imiririmbire."}
{"id": "12853", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12853", "title": "The Love of Jesus Christ Church", "text": "The Love of Jesus Christ Church uri ni urusengero ruherereye hano kigali, aho umugabo wa Agasaro Tracy asengeramo witwa Iradukunda Rene Patrick akaba ari umuramyi muri urwo rusengero mu ndirimbo zitandukanye nka \u2018Arankunda\u2019, \u2018Uko wahoze\u2019, \u2018Jehovah\u2019, \u2018Mfite Impamvu\u2019 na \u2018Ni byiza.\u2019"}
{"id": "12854", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12854", "title": "Ibitaro bya Muhima", "text": "Ibitaro bya muhima byahoze ari ishami byibitaro bikuru bya kaminuza CHUK. ishingano nyamukuru yabyo yari ukubyaza. nyuma byaje kugirwa ibya karere ka nyarugenge. Ibitaro bya Muhima ni ibitaro biherereye mu Rwanda mu Karere ka Nyarugenge aho ubu byatangiye gutanga nizindi serivisi zubuvuzi. \nUmwihariko w' ibitaro bya Muhima.\nIbitaro bya Muhima nkuko twabivuze haruguru biherereye mu Karere ka Nyarugenge, ni ibitaro bifite umwihariko wo kwita ku bagore batwite n'abana ariko bitanga n'izindi serivisi z'ingenzi mu buvuzi ku bivuza bataha.\nSerivisi zitangwa n'Ibitaro bya Muhima:"}
{"id": "12855", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12855", "title": "Ibitaro bya Masaka", "text": "Ibitaro bya Masaka ni ibitaro bizwiho kwakira abarwayi bagiye batandukanye kandi barwaye indwara zitandukanye. Ibiibitaro biherereye mu Rwanda mu kagari ka Gako mu Murenge wa Masaka mu Karere ka Kicukiro."}
{"id": "12856", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12856", "title": "Imikurire y' umwana mu Rwanda", "text": "Mu Rwanda ibipimo by' imikurire y' abana bato bigaragaza ko hari impinduka ikomeye yabaye mu mikurire hashingiwe k' ubushakashatsi bwakozwe k' ubuzima n' imibereho by' abaturage mu mwaka 2020. \nIbipimo by' imikurire y' abana bato.\nKugeza ubu mu Rwanda 13% y' abana bavuka bafite ibiro bike biri munsi ya 2.5, 33% by' abana bari munsi y' imyaka itanu bafite ikibazo cyo kugwingira, 93% by' abana bari hagati y' amezi 6 na 23 nibo bahabwa inkingo zose zagenwe. \nIgwingira.\nIgwingira ni ikibazo gihangayikishije igihugu n' isi muri rusange,Mu Rwanda igwingira ryigaragaza muburyo 3 aribwo kugwingira mu mikurire, mu mitekerereze no mu mbamutima. URwanda rwafashe ingamba zinyuranye mu kurwanya no kurandura igwingira mu bana bato, gahunda z' amarerero y' abana bato,gahunda mbonezamikurire y' abana bato na gutanga inyongeramirire. "}
{"id": "12857", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12857", "title": "Afrique", "text": "Afrique ni umwe mubahanzi nyarwanda bakunzwe nabatari bake mu Rwanda ndetse nohanze yarwo. Uyu musore wamenyekanye cyane kundirimbo yitwa \"Agatunda\" yavutse mumwaka 2000. Ubundi ubusanzwe y'itwa Kayigire Josue, akabaya yaravukiye I Gikondo mumujyi was Kigali. \nAmateka.\nUmuhanzi kayigire Josue uzwi kwizi a rya Afrique wamenyekanye ku ndirimbo bita \"Agatunda\" arimubakoze amateka murwanda aho nawe indirimbo ye \"Agatunda\" yarebwe nabarenga Million mugihe kitari kinini.uyumuhanze yakoze umuziki ubwo yahuraga numujinnyi was film witwa Njuga.\nAfrique yerekanye ubuhanga buri hejuru anyura abo yarataramiye kurubyiniriro mugitaramo ubwo yaririmbaga live na semi-live"}
{"id": "12858", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12858", "title": "Amasiganwa y'Imodoka mu Rwanda", "text": "Irushanwa ngarukamwaka ry\u2019amasiganwa mu modoka ryitiriwe Ingagi z\u2019imisozi miremire y\u2019uRwanda ryatangijwe ku mugaragaro mu mwaka 2012 na Minisitiri y\u2019Umuco na Siporo, Mitali Protais.\nIbyo Wamenya kwaya Masiganwa.\nNi isiganwa ryitabiriwe n\u2019imidoka 13 zo mu Rwanda no muri Uganda, igikorwa cyatewe inkunga y\u2019ibigo n\u2019amasosiyete atandukanye y\u2019ubucuruzi mu Rwanda. umuyobozi mukuru wa KBC ishami ry\u2019u Rwanda, yatangaje ko yishimiye ko igikorwa bateguye gitangiye anasobanura ko ari n\u2019inshingano zabo muguteza imbere imibereho myiza y\u2019abaturage. Umuterankunga mukuru yari Banki y\u2019ubucuruzi y\u2019Abanyakenya (KCB) n\u2019abandi bafatanyabikorwa nka ENGEN, PSF, Phoenix, Coca Cola, Airtel, Brussels Airlines, Sulfo Industries, Rwanda Motors, SONATUBES Ltd, AZ IPEX, RAC n\u2019Umubano Hotel."}
{"id": "12859", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12859", "title": "NYAXO", "text": "Umugabo w'umunyarwenya nyarwanda uzwi ku izina rya nyaxo akaba ari umwe mubasore bakunzwe mu Rwanda amazina ye bwite nyakuri yiswe nabanyeyi be ni KANYABUGANDE olivier yavutse 1996 akaba akora umwuga wurwenya ndetse na filime nyarwanda ubu akaba Ari umwe mubanyarwenya bakomeye mugihugu cyu Rwanda\nAkabafite umukunzi uzwink'aisha bakunda gukinana comedy amazina ye bwite yitwa inkindi aisha.\nAMASHAKIRO"}
{"id": "12860", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12860", "title": "Iyamuremye Serge", "text": "Iyamuremye Serge ni umuramyi, umuyobozi, ni umwe mu bahanzi b\u2019indirimbo zo kuramya no guhimbaza Imana, akaba yerekeje muri Amerika gusura umukunzi we Uburiza Sandrine bitegura gukora ubukwe."}
{"id": "12861", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12861", "title": "Misigaro Gentil", "text": "Misigaro Gentil ni Umucuranzi hamwe nabakorerabushake, akomoka muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo akorera mu Rwanda agatura muri Canada."}
{"id": "12862", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12862", "title": "Tuyishime Thacien", "text": "Tuyishime Thacien wamenyekanye nka Thacien Titus mu muziki wo kuramya no guhimbaza Imana wo mu itorero rya ADEPR, yamamaye mu ndirimbo zitandukanye zirimo \u201cAho ugejeje ukora\u201d, \u201cUzaza ryari Yesu\u201d, \u201cUzampe iherezo ryiza\u201d, \u201cMpisha mu mababa\u201d, \u201cRwiyoborere\u201d, \u201cHaburaho gato\u201d, \u201cImpanuro\u201d, \u201cNshyigikira\u201d n\u2019izindi, akaba yaratunguye umugore we Mukamana Christine amuha impano y\u2019imodoka yo mu bwoko bwa Rav4 mu birori byo kwizihiza isabukuru y\u2019imyaka umunani bamaze bamenyanye ndetse n\u2019irindwi y\u2019urushako."}
{"id": "12863", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12863", "title": "Sahabo Hakim", "text": "Sahabo Hakim yavutse kuwa 16 june 2005, ni umukinnyi ukina ku ruhande asatira mu ikipe ya Lille FC y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 19 mu Bufaransa, yavuze ko atewe ishema no gukinira ikipe y\u2019igihugu y'u Rwanda(Amavubi,) ibintu byazamuye amarangamutima ya benshi, avuka kuri nyina y\u2019umunyarwandakazi ndetse na se w\u2019umurundi, ni ku nshuro ya mbere yari ahamagawe mu ikipe y\u2019igihugu."}
{"id": "12864", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12864", "title": "Irene Murindahabi", "text": "Irene Murindahabi ni umugabo w'umunyarwanda wamenyekanye cyane mugisata cyimyidagaduro aho azwiho gufasha abahanzi nyarwanda aho bamwe muribo bafite impano abaha amahirwe yokuzamuka mwiterambere ryabo. Uyu mugabo kandi azwi cyane kurubuga rwa YouTube aho aba afiteho ibiganiro byishi nabahanzi naba sitari bagiye batandukanye arinabyo akeshi byatumye amenyekana akaba icyamamare. \nUmwuga Akora.\nIrene Murindahabi ni Umunyamakuru wakoreye imwe muri televiziyo zizwi cyane mu Rwanda yitwa \"Isibo Tv\". Ibitangazamakuru yanyuzemo @magicfmrwanda @isangostarofficial [@sundaynightshow) @isibotvofficial @thechoice_live. Ibyo yakoraga nibindi byose ubu yabikomereje Kuri Platform ya @mie_empire.rw.Irene Murindahabi anafasha abahanzi batandukanye harimo uwitwa Niyo Bosco mwakunze cyane mu ndirimbo nka ubugenzute, seka hamwe n\u2019izindi, akanafasha itsinda rya Vestine na Dorcas bazwi mu ndirimbo zihimbaza Imana nka Adonai, Sibayali hamwe n\u2019izindi. \nUyu munsi akaba afasha abahanzi n'abadi"}
{"id": "12865", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12865", "title": "Sven Kalisa", "text": "Sven Kalisa ni umunyarwanda ukina mukibuga hagati, ukinira Etzella Ettelbruck yo mu cyiciro cya mbere muri Luxamburuge ufana Rayon Sports yo mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "12866", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12866", "title": "Mutsinzi Ange Jimmy", "text": "Mutsinzi Ange Jimmy ni myugariro mpuzamahanga w\u2019umunyarwanda ukinira ikipe ya CD Trofense muri Portugal iri mu cyiciro cya Kabiri, akaba yaravukiye imuhanga mu 1997 ugushyingo 15 akaba afite uburebure bwa 1,92m. akaba yarakiniye ikipe ya APR FC imyaka 2 ndetse na Rayon Sports imyaka 4. \nkuruhando mpuzamahanga.\nMutsinzi Ange yakiniye amakipe atandukanye ku kugabane w' uburayi, ubu akinira ikipe ya Zira FK yo mu gihugu cya Azerbaijan mu cyiciro cya mbere, muri 2024 iyi kipe yitabiriye amajonjora ya UEFA Europa league ari nabwo Mutsinzi Ange Jimmy yagaragaye k'urutondo rw' abakinnyi bagombaga kwifashishwa muri iyo mikino w'ikipe y'igihugu Amavubi. "}
{"id": "12867", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12867", "title": "Phil Peter", "text": "Nzeyimana philbert ni umugabo w'umunyarwanda wamamaye cyane mugisata cy'imyidagaduro kwizina rya Dj Phil Peter kuva mumwaka wa 2011. Uyumugabo yatangiye nkumunyamakuru, nyuma yinjira mu umwuga w'ubushyushyarugamba \"MC\" Nyuma yinjira mu kuvangavanga imiziki \"DJ\".\nAmateka.\nNzeyimana Philbert uzwi cyane kwizina rya Dj pil Peter amashuri abanza yayize mubigo bigiye bitandukanye aho ayisumbuye ya yasoreje mu ikigo cya G. S GAHINI mu karere ka Kayonza aho yakuye amanota meshi mu ishami ry'ibijyanye na siyansi mu gace k'ibinyabuzima \"Biology\" / n'ubutabire \"Chemistry\". Amanota yabonye akaba yaramuhesheje amahirwe mu bambere yo kwerekeza muri kaminuza nkuru y'u Rwanda,maze yiga ibijyanye n'ubuvuzi \"Allied Health Science \" hari mumwaka wa 2008 asoza mu mwaka wa 2013.\nN'ubwo yize ibyo byose inyota n'umuriro udasize n'umuhamagaro wo gukora ibijyanye n'itangazamakuru rijyanye n'imyidagaduro byatumye muri 2011 yinjira mu itangazamakuru ahera mu \"ISANGO STAR\" Aho yahakoreye imyaka ikabakaba 8 ahava yerekeza ku \"ISIBO TV\" Muri 2020. \nUyu muhanzi akaba numu Dj abifatanyije n'ubunyamakuru indirimbo ye yakoranye numuhanzikazi nyarwanda uzwi kwizira rya Marina yitwa \"Bimpame\" yakoze amateka mu Rwanda aho yanyujijwe kuri televisiyo ikomeye cyane muri Afurika bita \"Trace Africa\""}
{"id": "12868", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12868", "title": "Ishimwe Gilbert", "text": "Ishimwe Gilbert w\u2019imyaka 21 ni Umukinnyi wa \u00d6rebro Syrianska IF mu cyiciro cya 3 muri Suwede, akina mu kubiga hagati ariko asatira afasha ba rutahizamu gushaka ibitego wahamagawe bwa mbere mu ikipe y\u2019igihugu Amavubi, avuka ku babyeyi b\u2019abanyarwanda baba muri Suwede "}
{"id": "12869", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12869", "title": "Rwabugiri Umar", "text": "Rwabugiri Umar ni Umunyezamu wanyuze muri Mukura VS nyuma yo gukinira amakipe nka Musanze FC, nyuma muri 2019 yahise ajya muri APR FC ayikinira imyaka 2, yayivuyemo ajya muri Police FC yakiniye umwaka umwe, avuga ko ibihe azahora yibuka mu rugendo rwe rwa ruhago ari igihe yakiniraga ikipe ya Mukura VS kuko ahamya ko we na bagenzi be bayandikiyemo amateka n\u2019ubu itarabasha gusubiramo."}
{"id": "12870", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12870", "title": "Yampano", "text": "Yampano ni umuhanzi umaze kwamamara muri muzika nyarwanda, amazina ye bwite ni Florien Uworizagwira,akaba yaravutse mu mwaka wa 2005 avukira mu karere ka Nyamasheke, mu ntara y'iburengerazuba bw'u Rwanda \nUrugendo rwe mu muziki.\nYampano ni umwe mubahanzi bakizamuka muri muzika nyarwanda. uyu ni umuhanzi wagaragaje ko afite impano ibihangano bye byakunzwe nabataribake mu Rwanda. Uyu muhanzi ubu abarizwa munzu y'umuziki wa \"TB Music Entertainment \".\nAmakimbirane.\nYampano yagiranye Amakimbirane n'inshuti bivugwa ko babanaga mubuzima bwa buri munsi ari nawe umufatira amashusho yo gusakaza kumbuga nkoranyambaga ibyo bikaba byaratuma iyo nshuti ye izwi kwizina rya Pazzo icyekwaho kugira Uruhare mu mugukwirakwiza amashusho yuyu muhanzi ari gutera akabariro nuwo bashakanye ibyo bamwe bita amashusho ayurukuzasoni"}
{"id": "12871", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12871", "title": "Ganijuru Elie", "text": "Ganijuru Ishimwe Elie ni Umunyarwanda ukina umupira wamaguru wavutse taliki 23 Nyakanga 1998.\nGanijuru yagaragaye mu marushanwa atangukanye Yimbere mugihugu ndetse no hanzee y'Urwanda.\nAmarushanwa Yimbere mu Rwanda harimo Shampiyona yikiciro cyambere mupira wamaguru(Rwanda Premier League),Igikombe cyamahoro(Peace Cup) Ganijuru Kandi yitabiriye amarushanwa mpuza mahanga Ari kumwe na Rayon sports Fc mu marushanwa ny'Africa ya Makipe yabaye Ayambere mugihugu byabo (CAF Confederation cup).\nIkipe akinamo ubu.\nRayon Sports Fc\nAmakipe yakiniye.\nBugesera Fc, Vision FC Amavubi \nIbirushijeho.\nhttps://mobile.igihe.com/imikino/football/article/ganijuru-yongereye-amasezerano-muri-rayon-sports"}
{"id": "12872", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12872", "title": "Police Fc", "text": "Police Fc yatangiye gukina muri 2000, ni ikipe umupira w'amaguru yegamiye kuri Police y'igihugu cyu Rwanda, ifite icyicaro i Kigali, kandi kuri ubu ikina irushanwa yose ategurwa na Ferwafa, ikaba yaratangiriye mu cy'iciro cy'akabiri, ubu iri mu cyambere."}
{"id": "12873", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12873", "title": "Pasiteri Ezra Mpyisi", "text": "Pasiteri Ezra Mpyisi ni umugabo w'umunyarwanda wavutse mu mwaka 1922,avukira hafi y'i Nyanza ahari hari umurwa w'u Mwami. Uyumugabo yamenyekanye cyane kubera gutebya kwe, mu magambo nka \" Wa Njiji we\". Akaba anazwi cyane mukwigisha ijambo ry'Imana aho abarizwa mu Itorero ry'Abadivantisiti bumusi wa karindwi.\nAmateka.\nPasiteri Ezra Mpyisi amashuri abanza yayize RWAMATA mu ishuri ry'abadivantisiti ariho hari iwabo, amashuri y'isumbuye ayiga i Gitwe mu misiyoni y'abadivantisiti. Mpyisi yarakomeje ariga kugeza ubwo yabaye mwarimu.\nEzra Mpyisi Kaminuza yayize muri Zimbabwe ajyanyweyo nabazungu kuko nibo bategekaga icyo gihe, Ezra yaje kujya mumahanga aho yasoje kwiga mu mwaka 1964. Ezra Yaje kugaruka mu Rwanda mu mwaka 1997.\nEzra Mpyisi niwe mudivantisiti wambere wabonye icyangobwa cy'icyiciro cya kabiri cya Kaminuza mubijyanye n'iyobokamana (\"theologian\") haba ari mu Rwanda, Burundi ndetse na kongo. Ezra Mpyisi yahawe ubu pasiteri mu mwaka 1951.\nAmagambo akomeye pasiteri ezra mpyisi yavuze ku Rwanda.\nEzra Mpyisi avugako ubwo bahaga abanyarwanda ubwigenge mu mwaka 1962, we avugako babuhaye abatari babukeneye kubera ko nyuma yuko Umwami Rudahigwa atanze Mu mwaka (1959) Kigeli agahungira muri America abavugagako badashaka ubwigenge babwiye ababiligi ati turashakako mudutegeka nkuko byahoze ariko mudufashe kwica Abatutsi ubundi mudutegeke kugeza aho muzashakira. Uko niko Kayibanda nabe bavugaga ubundi Ezira we ahamyako ibintu byagiye gupfa ubwo ubwigenge babuhaga abongabo bataribabukeneye, ubwo ababusabye n'ababurwaniye baribarapfuye abandi barabaye impunzi."}
{"id": "12874", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12874", "title": "Musanze Fc", "text": "Musanze Fc ni ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ibarizwa mu karere ka Musanze, Iyi kipe ikina mu kiciro cya mbere cya shampiyona y'u Rwanda aho imikino yo murugo iyakirira kuri Stade Ubworoherane ishobora kwakira abantu 4000 bicaye neza."}
{"id": "12875", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12875", "title": "Rutsiro Fc", "text": "RUTSIRO FC ni ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru, ifite icyicaro mu Ntara y\u2019Iburengerazuba, Akarere ka Rutsiro. Iyi kipe iri mu nshingano z'aka karere kandi ikina mu mikino ya shampiona itegurwa na FERWAFA."}
{"id": "12876", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12876", "title": "Espoir Fc", "text": "Espoir Fc ni ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ikina mu cy'iciro cy'ambere mu Rwanda mu marushanwa ategurwa na Ferwafa, ikaba ibarizwa mu intara y'uburengerazuba mu karere ka Rusizi, ikaba imaze no kubona Umutoza Mushya wu Murundi ndetse inzu abakinnyi babagamo zaje gushya."}
{"id": "12877", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12877", "title": "Gorilla Fc", "text": "Gorilla Fc ni ikipe ikina Shampiyona y\u2019icyiciro cya mbere mu marushanwa ategurwa n'ishyirahamwe ry'umupira wa maguru Ferwafa mu Rwanda, muri uyu 2022-2023 wimikino."}
{"id": "12878", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12878", "title": "Bugesera Fc", "text": "Bugesera Fc ni ikipe ikina mu cyiciro cy'ambere cya marushanwa ategurwa na Ferwafa, yarangije umwanya wa 8 muri shampiyona yu Rwanda 2021-2022 n'amanota 37 mumikino mirongo itatu ikaba iherereye mu ntara y'uburasirazuba mu akarere ka Bugesera."}
