{"id": "12880", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12880", "title": "Gicumbi Fc", "text": "Gicumbi FC ni ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru iherereye mu Karere ka Gicumbi, Intara y'Amajyaruguru mu Rwanda, ubu ikaba iri mu cyiciro cy'akabiri cya shampiyona mu marushanwa ategurwa na Ferwafa.Ah"}
