{"id": "12882", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12882", "title": "Rwamagana Fc", "text": "Rwamagana FC iyi kipe isigaye yitwa muhazi united nyuma yo guhindura izina imwe mu makipe yabashishe gitsinda APR FC m'ugikombe cy'amahoro igitego 1-0. Rwangamaga FC ikaba ari ikipe imwe muziri gukina shampiyona y icyiciro cy'ambere hano mu Rwanda mu marushanwa ategurwa na Ferwafa kanda iyi kipe ikaba isoje muriyi sezo irikumwanya wa 12 mucyiciro cyambere ikaba ifite ninego yokuguma mucyiciro cyambere"}
{"id": "12883", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12883", "title": "Sunrise Fc", "text": "Sunrise Fc ni ikipe izamutse mu cyiciro cya mbere muri shampiyona itegurwa na Ferwafa mu Rwanda, aho yaguze umukinnyi uturutse mu gihugu cya Uganda."}
