{"id": "12885", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12885", "title": "Vision Jeunesse Nouvelle", "text": "Vision Jeunesse Nouvelle (VJN) ni umuryango udaharanira inyungu (NGO) washinzwe mu mwaka wa 2002 na Abihayimana b\u2019Abanyabirigi bo mu Ihuriro ry\u2019Abavandimwe b\u2019Uburezi bwa Gikristu (Fr\u00e8res de l\u2019Instruction Chr\u00e9tienne \u2013 FIC) [FIC]. Uherereye mu Karere ka Rubavu, mu Mujyi wa Gisenyi, mu Ntara y\u2019Uburengerazuba, mu Rwanda. Intego yawo ni uguteza imbere urubyiruko binyuze mu bikorwa by\u2019umuco, siporo, uburezi, ubumwe n\u2019ubwiyunge, ubuzima, n\u2019ubukungu, hagamijwe guteza imbere imibereho myiza n\u2019iterambere rirambye.\nOfficial Website of Vision Jeunesse Nouvelle\nAmashakiro.\nhttps://visionjeunessenouvelle.org.rw/"}
{"id": "12886", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12886", "title": "Amagaju Fc", "text": "Uko yashinzwe.\nIyi ni imwe mu makipe ya mbere afite amateka maremare kandi ashaje cyane mu mupira w\u2019amaguru mu Rwanda. Yashinzwe ahagana mumwaka 1935.: Amagaju FC yashinzwe n\u2019Umutware \"Rutaremara\" ubwo yari amaze kugabirwa ubutware bw\u2019Intara cyangwa ubutware bwa Bufundu (ubu akaba ari mu Karere ka Nyamagabe mu Ntara y'Amajypfo mucyahoze ari Gikongoro). Umupira w'amaguru muri icyo gihe wari umaze kumenyekana mu gihugu binyuze mu mashuri, cyane cyane ababyirukaga n'abigaga i Kabgayi bigishwaga n'abamisiyoneri b'abazungu. \nIbigwi n'amateka.\nMu mateka y\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru mu Rwanda, Amagaju FC ntabwo ari ikipe izwiho gutwara ibikombe bya shampiyona y'ikiciro cyambere, ahubwo ibigwi byayo bishingiye ku mateka yayo maremare, kuba kera yaratsindaga amakipe akomeye nka Rayon sport, Mukura Victory Sports,Kiyovu Sports ndetse na Panth\u00e8res Noires Kigali yaje gusenywa bityo Amagaju bikayaviramo kwitwa \"Inkuba Zesa\", no kuba ari yo kipe ya mbere mu Rwanda yahimbiwe indirimbo iyirata ibigwi ariyo \"Dore Inganji Iturutse i Bufundu\", yahimbwe na Musenyeri Aloys Bigirumwami, ishingiye ku kurata ibigwi by'ikipe n'imihigo yayo.\nUkoyiteguye umwaka wimikino.\nNyuma y\u2019uko mu ntangiriro z\u2019umwaka ikipe itandukanye n\u2019umutoza Niyongabo Amars wari umaze imyaka ibiri n'igice, Amagaju FC yinjiye mu cyerekezo gishya cyo gushaka abatoza bafite amashagaga nka Sghir Hammadi hamwe n'abatoza bunganira barimo [Imurora Hakizimana Japhet]. Komite y\u2019iyi kipe ikunze kwibanda kuzana abakinnyi bafite imbaraga bakura mu bihugu bituranye nka u Burundi na DR Congo, ndetse n'abakinnyi bakiri bato mu gihugu kugira ngo hubakwe urwego rurambye kandi ruzigamye mu bukungu bw'ikipe. "}
