{"id": "12891", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12891", "title": "Kenny Sol", "text": "https://www.facebook.com/share/16peh1gApz/\nhttps://youtube.com/@twesetv3827?si=UGJXLUQmr2sj2hYq\nhttps://www.facebook.com/share/16peh1gApz/\nIRADUKUNDA Patrick ni umwe mu abasore nyarwanda bakunzwe cyane muri kuruhando mpuzamahanga ndetse ninaha murwanda. Niba utekereza ko waba utamuzi umva iyi nkuru yakuriye muri cartien ya biryogo muri tarinyota aho ni hafi yaho bitaga ku itara yarafite impano nyinshi aho nyuma yagiye gukaza ubumenyi bwe mugutunganya umusaruro ukomoka kubuhinzi nubworozi mucyahoze ari EAV KABUTARE muntara yamajyepfo mukarere ka Huye aza gukomereza amashuri ye muri RP-Musanze collage ubu ni intiti itereye ahongaho uyu musore ubu yabaye icyamamare cyane cyane kubwindirimbo aheruka gushyira hanze yitwa mumeze mute maniga yange yo muri eave akaba yarasohoye amashusho yayo kwa Bob pro nyima aza kujya mu icyerekezo cyo gukora ibyegeranyo kumateka yaba star batandukanye bakora akazi kamwe muri Hollywood akaba ubu aganje abantu bose bazwi mu Rwanda muri make ni Byose wabibaza Lucky Arter hamwe nurukweto yambara ruratambura ejobundi rugahengama ikibitera ni capati turya muve mubujuga"}
