{"id": "12903", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12903", "title": "Shadrack Kabango", "text": "Shadrack Kabango uzwi ku izina rya Shad, umwe mu bahanzi b\u2019abanyarwanda bakomeye ubarizwa mu gihugu cya Canada,\nAmateka.\nUbuzima bwite.\nShadrach Kabango yavukiye muri Kenya ku itariki ya 18 Nyakanga 1982. Avuka ku babyeyi b\u2019abanyarwanda. Yakuriye i Londres na Ontario kubera akazi k\u2019 ababyeyi be.Album ze nka When This Is Over (2005), The Old Prince (2007), TSOL (2010) na Flying Colours (2013) zaraguzwe cyane. Kuri album When This Is Over, hariho indirimbo yise I will not understand igaruka kuri Jenoside, iriho n\u2019imivugo yanditswe na nyina Bernadette Kabango. Nyinshi mu ndirimbo ze zarebwe inshuro zisaga 1,000,000."}
