{"id": "12920", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12920", "title": "Mbata Dology", "text": "MUSENGIMANA Eugene uzwi ku mazina ya Mbata Dology, ni umunyarwanda ukora umwuga w'itangazamakuru akaba akunze gukora ibiganiro by'imyidagaduro\n= Amashakiro ="}
{"id": "12921", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12921", "title": "Ciza Hussein Mugabo", "text": "Mugabo Ciza Hussein ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru ufite inkomoko mu Burundi ariko ufite ubwenegihugu bw\u2019u Rwanda, amaze imyaka 6 akinira ikipe ya Mukura VS ndetse yabaye na kapiteni wayo none ubu yasinyiye ikipe ya Rayon Sports, Ciza yatangiriye umupira mu ikipe y\u2019abana ya Etoile de Bwiza afite imyaka 10, ahamara imyaka ibiri ajya mu ikipe yo mu cyiciro cya gatatu ya se wa Ndikumana Hamadi Katauti, Ciza yakiniye Dynamic umwaka umwe mbere yo kubengukwa na Atl\u00e9tico Olympique ayikinira imyaka itanu, Umutoza Kaze C\u00e9dric wamutozaga ni we wamuzanye muri Mukura muri 2013."}
{"id": "12922", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12922", "title": "Nzisabira Joselyne", "text": "Nzisabira Joselyne ni umunyarwandakazi w'umusizi \n= Ubuzima Bwite =\nNzisabira Joselyne yavukiye mu karere ka Gasabo mu mujyi wa Kigali. akaba yaratangiye umwuga w'ubusizi yiga mu mwaka wa Gatanu w'\u00e1mashuri mashuri abanza\nyakomeje ubusizi aho yagiye akora ibisigo bitandukanye harimo: \"Niwe Nabaye\", \"Kuki Njye?\", \u201cEnlightened by Mom\u201d, \u201cThat child\u201d, na \u201cShe took her life for it\u201d, ubu ni umunyeshuri muri Kaminuza ya Global Health Equity. \nMu mwaka w'2020 Nzisabira Joselyne yagize uruhare mu gutangiza ihuriro ryitwa \"Intare Surgery Interest Group\" rihuriwemo n\u00e1banyeshuri biga ubuvuzi rifite intego yo gushishikariza abanyeshuri biga ubuvuzi gukoresha ubumenyi mu bwanditsi no mu buvuzi mu guhindura ubuzima."}
{"id": "12923", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12923", "title": "Mbarushimana Abdou", "text": "Mbarushimana Abdou ni umwe mu batoza bamaze igihe batoza umupira w\u2019amaguru mu Rwanda aho amaze imyaka 20, akaba yaratoje amakipe atandukanye arimo na Rayon Sports, Volcanic Gorillas, Electorgaz, Kibuye, AS Muhanga na Bugesera FC, Uretse kuba ari umutoza yanakinnye umupira akinira amakipe atandukanye aho yakiniye abato ba Rayon Sports, akinira Miroplast, Mukungwa asoreza muri Volcanic Gorillas. Mbarushimana Abdou avuga ko umwe mu bakinnyi yatoje bamushimishije ari rutahizamu wa APR FCBizimana Yannick."}
{"id": "12924", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12924", "title": "Ntwari Jean Pierre", "text": "Amazina ye nyakuri ni Mucumbitsi Ntwari Jean Pierre. Ni umuhanzi w\u2019Umunyarwanda uba mu Bubiligi, azwi ku izina rya \u201cJALI\u201d mu muziki. Ni umwe mu bahanzi bakomeye u Rwanda rufite i Mahanga ariko ibikorwa bye ntibirasakara ino go agaragare byimbitse mu bitaramo n\u2019ibindi.\nAmateka.\nJali afite indirimbo nyinshi zikunzwe i Burayi harimo \u201cUn jour ou l\u2019autre\u201d, iyi imaze kurebwa inshuro 1,200,000 kuri YouTube, Iyitwa Espanola yo imaze kurebwa inshuro zirenga 1,700,000. Uyu muhanzi kandi, yanabaye umuhanzi w\u2019umwaka wa 2012 mu Bubiligi."}
{"id": "12925", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12925", "title": "Jay Polly", "text": "Tuyishime Joshua yari umugabo w'umunyarwanda wari waramamaye cyane mujyana ya hiphop aho yari yarigaruriye imitima yabatari bake mu Rwanda kubera ubuhanga bwe mubihangano yakoraga.uyu mugabo yatangiye kwamamara muri 2008 aho yasukaga hanze ibihangano bye byuzuye ubuhanga bwishi aho yasohoye indirimbo zatumye amenyekana cyane nka \"Ndacyariho, Umupfumu uzwi, Rusumbanzika ndetse nizindi nyishi. \nAmateka yaranze nyakwigendera jay polly.\nJay Polly yavutse ku wa 5 Nyakanga 1988 akaba yaritabye Imana mu mwaka wa 2021 Nzeri aguye mu bitaro bya Muhima.\nJay Polly yavukiye I Gikondo mumujyi wa Kigali (ahazwi nka kicukiro centre)nubwo haraba vugako yavukiye mu Kinigi ho mu karere ka Musanze mu ntara y'Amajyaruguru. Uyu mugabo yavukaga mumuryango w'abana batatu aho we yavukaga ari uwa kabiri kubabyeyi bombi aribo Nsabimana Pierre na Mukarubayiza Marienne.\nTuyishime Joshua yize amashuri y'incuke mukigo cy'a Kinunga, ayisumbuye ayiga mu kigo cya E. S. K giherereye mu karere ka Kicukiro mu mujyi wa Kigali mu ishami ry'ubukorikori. "}
{"id": "12926", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12926", "title": "Nkusi Arthur", "text": "Nkusi Arthur ni umugabo wumunyarwanda akaba ari umunyarwenya wakunzwe nabataribake hano mu Rwanda ndetse n'imahanga. Uyu mugabo yavutse tariki 22 Mutarama 1990,ni mwene Mpazimaka Jones Kennedy na Kibuuka Herriet akaba avuka mumuryango w'abana 6.kuri ubu uyu musore yamaze kurushinga na Miss Mutoni Fiona Naringwa. \nAmateka amuranga.\nNkusi Arthur akomoka mumuryango w'ibyamamare uhereye kuri se umubyara Mpazimaka Kennedy wa menyekanye mu ikinamico na sinema ndetse no gusobanura filime mu Kinyarwanda.ndetse na mukuruwe Sintex umaze kwiyegurira imitima yabeshi mu Rwanda.\nUyumusore ubundi yizihiza isabukuru ye yamavuko ishuro ebyeri mu mwaka.ubundi yavutse tariki 22 Mutarama 1990 ariko mugihe papa we yuzuzaga ama fishi yaribeshye yandika 22 Nyakanga 1990.kuberako nawe ariko yakomeje kujya ayuzuza ahantu heshi hatandukanye byatumye abashuti biwe bayizihiza kwiyo tariki nawe arabereka ubwo akaba ayizihiza kabiri mu mwaka \nUyu mugabo wakunzwe nabatari bake yakoraga kuri radiyo yarikunzwe cyane mu Rwanda yitwa \"KISS FM\"gusa mu ijoro ryo kuwakane tariki 23 Ukoboza 2021 nibwo yaje gutangaza kumbuga nkoranyambaga ziwe ko atakiri gukorera kurino radiyo ya \"KISS FM\" ibitarishimiwe nabakunze gusa nawe nago yaraziko harigihe kizagera akaba atakibarizwa kwiyo radiyo. "}
{"id": "12927", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12927", "title": "King James", "text": "Ruhumuriza James uzwi nka King James (yavutse kuwa 1 Mata 1990), Ni Umuhanzi Nyarwanda wandika akanaririmba indirimbo mu njyana ya R&amp;B ndetse na AfroBeats. King James azwi cyane mu kuririmba indirimbo z'urukundo n'izisanamitima, aho n'izindi njyana nka zouk na Pop atabura kuzihangamo. King James ni mwene Consolatie Kazizi na Issac Murihano. \nAmateka.\nKing James yavutse 1990, avukira mu bitaro bya CHUK, mu mujyi wa Kigali. Akaba ari umwana wa 6 mu bana 7 bavukana, akaba asengera mu itorero ry'Abadiventiste. \nYasoje amashuri yisumbuye muri Ecole APE Rugunga, kuva 2013 yize muri Mount Kenya University mu bijyanye n'itangazamakuru n'itumanaho (Journalism and Mass Communication). King James akiri umwana yari afite inzozi zo kuzaba Umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru wabigize umwuga, Gusa nyuma aza kumva indirimbo z'umuhanzi w'umunyamerika ukora injyana ya R&amp;B zimutera ishyaka ryo gutangira guhanga no guhimba indirimbo ze bwite.\nUmwuga.\nKing James yatangiye umwuga wo kuririmba muri 2006 ahera ku ndirimbo itarahise yakirwa neza, gusa ntiyacika intege akomeza kwisunga abahanzi bari bamaze kumenyekana abigiraho, nibwo mu mwaka 2009 mo hagati yasohoye indirimbo yose \"\"Intink\"i\" imuzamura kurundi rwego, mu mpera za 2010 King James yigaragaje nk'umuhanzi w'icyamamare uyoboye abandi mu njyana ya R&amp;B aho yari asigaye ahanganye n'abahanzi bakomeye bariho nka Tom Close, Meddy cyangwa The Ben.\nKwamamara no Kumenyeka.\nKing James asa nk'uwagize amahirwe, ubwo abahanzi Meddy na The Ben bari bagezweho mu mwaka wa 2010 bimukiraga muri Amerika. Yahise asa nk'usigaye wenyine ku isoko ry'abaririmbaga indirimbo z'urukundo bimuhesha kwamamara cyane, asinya amasezerano n'inzu itunganya umuziki ya Kina Music ahita asohora umuzingo we wa mbere (album) ayita \"\"Umugisha\" kuwa 24 ukuboza 2010. mu mwaka wakurikiyeho mu kuboza 2011 asohora iya 2 ayita \"Umuvandimwe\"\" yariho indirimbo zakunzwe cyane nka \"Narashize, Birandenga, Ese warikiniraga\" n'izindi.. ayikorera igitaramo cyo kuyimurika i Butare muri kaminuza y'u Rwanda kuwa 13 Mutarama 2012. Ku mugoroba kuwa 25/12/2014, King James ku nshuro ye ya kabiri, yongera kumurikira album ye ya 3 yise \"Ntibisanzwe\" mu mujyi wa Musanze, anaha Noheri abatuye muri uwo mujyi.\nMu Myaka yakurikiyemo, King James warumaze kuba izina ritoroshye mu ruganda rw'umuziki mu Rwanda ndetse n'i mahanga yakomeje gusohora indirimbo zikunzwe aha twavuga \"Yantumye\", \"Ndagukunda\" \"Naramukundaga\" zabaye indirimbo ziremereye mu gihugu cy'u rwanda. Muri Kanama 2016 yasohoye indirimbo \"The Girl Is Mine\" arikumwe n'umuhanzi w'icyamamare ukomoka muri Vincentian soca witwa Kevin Lyttle.\nKing James amaze gushyira hanze imizingo (Album) nyinshi zirimo, Umugisha, Umuvandimwe, Ntibisanzwe, Meze neza, Ubushobozi yasohotse kuwa 10 Ukwakira 2021 ndetse n'izindi, akaba atangaza ko arimo gutegura iya 8 yise \"Gukura\"\nInyungu z'umuziki no Gufasha.\nKing James ni umwe mu bahanzi bahiriwe cyane n'urugendo rwe rw'ubuhanzi kuko uretse gukundwa kw'ibihangano bye, kuva 2013 King James yabaye wa muhanzi utumirwa no mu bitaramo bikomeye nko gutaramira muri Rwanda day iya London, \u00a0Amsterdam, Atlanta, San Francisco, Ghent and Bonn n'iyo mu bubiligi yabaye mu mwaka wa 2017 usibye n'aho akunze kwifashishwa no mu bikorwa bya politiki, agataramira n'imbere y'abayobozi bakomeye, imbere mu gihugu.\nKing James yagize ijwi rifatika mu mitima y'urubyiruko yaba abahanzi bato bakizamuka, ndetse n'abandi bataba mu ruganda rw'imyidagaduro nka bandebereho (influencer) ndetse n'intangarugero (role model) ko bishoboka ko inzozi zawe wihanganye ugashyiramo imbaraga zawe zose uzigeraho, nk'uko King James akunda kubitangaza yagize ati: \"urubyiruko ntirukwiye kugira akazi na kamwe basuzugura kuko ikintu cyose umuntu akoze ashyizeho umutima kimubyarira umusaruro\" ibi yabikomoje ubwo yari mu kiganiro n'ikinyamakuru Isimbi TV avuga ko uretse ubuhanzi yanagerageje byinshi bimwe birakunda ibindi bikanga, kuko King James yahinze umuceli, yacuruje imodoka, ndetse kur'ubu afite iduka yise Mango Super Market, yagize uruganda rukora ifu y'ibigori yise \"ihaho\" yafunguye mu mwaka wa 2020, ndetse King James afite inzu y'amagorofa 2 yujuje ku Kamonyi ati: ibi byose mbikesha umuziki.\nKuwa 12 ukuboza 2021 King James yamuritse urubuga yise Zana Talent ruzajya rwifashishwa n\u2019abakora filme, indirimbo, imideli n\u2019ibindi bijyanye n\u2019imyidagaduro. Mu gutekereza gushinga uru rubuga yibutse imvune abahanzi bakiri bato batari bamenyekana bagira mu kwamamaza ibihangano byabo kugirango bigere kure kandi bibonwe na benshi, niko gushaka igisubizo nk'umuhanzi mukuru umaze kugira byinshi ageraho. Mu kiganiro yagiranye n'itangazamakuru kuwa 1 Ukuboza 2021 yatangaje ko Zana Talent ije nk'igisubizo ku buhanzi, ku bahanzi kandi n'abamaze kugira izina ibihangano byabo byemewe ko babishyiraho, ndetse by'umwihariko ko album ye \"Ubushobozi\" yabaye intangiro y'izindi azajya acishaho.\nIbihembo.\nKing James yahawe ibihembo byinshi mu rugendo rwe rw'umuziki, cyane cyane mu bihembo bya Salax Awards na. Mu mwaka wa 2012, King James yatsindiye umwanya wa mbere mu irushanwa rikomeye rya Primus Guma Guma Super Star (PGGSS) ryari ribaye ku nshuro yaryo ya 2, ryategurwaga na Bralirwa, akaba ari kimwe mu bihembo binini byaranze umuziki we. \nMu bihembo bikomeye byo mu Rwanda bihemba Abahanzi b'indashyikirwa mu muziki \"salax Awards\" nabyo yabihatanyemo ku bwinshi uretse ibyo muri 2016 nibyo yasezeyemo kubera impamvu z'akandi kazi yari afite abonako bitamukundira kubifatanya. Gusa mu bihembo yatsindiye mu myaka yayibanjirije harimo:\nUbuzima bwite.\nKing James ni Umuhanzi udakunda kuvuga cyane ku buzima bwe bwite cyangwa ku mubano we wo gukundana n'undi muntu (relationship) kuko azwiho kugira ibanga rikomeye kuri ayo mabanga, akenshi akavuga ko ahugiye ku muziki we n'indi mishinga y'ubucuruzi afite. Mu biganiro bitandukanye, King James avuga ko ubuzima bwe bwite, cyane cyane ibijyanye n'umugore cyangwa umukunzi, ari ibanga rye bwite. Yemeza ko atari ngombwa ko abantu bose babimenya. \nMu mwaka wa 2019, mu bitangazamakuru bitandukanye hakwirakwiriye ibihuha bivuga ko King James agiye gukora ubukwe, cyane ko yari amaze igihe atagaragara cyane.Gusa abihakana yivuye inyuma, avuga ko nta gahunda y'ubukwe afite vuba, ariko ko bishoboka mu gihe kizaza. King James yagiye ahanahanwa n'abakobwa batandukanye, barimo n'abahanzi bagenzi be nka Knowless na Priscilla, ndetse n'umukobwa w'umunyarwandakazi uba muri Amerika witwa Meek Rowland. Gusa, King James yagiye abihakana byose, akavuga ko ari incuti zisanzwe cyangwa abafatanyabikorwa mu muziki. \nKing James ashimangira ko ubuzima bwe bw'umwuga n'ubucuruzi aribwo abantu bakwiye kwitaho, kuruta iby'urukundo rwe."}
{"id": "12928", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12928", "title": "Fally Merci", "text": "Fally Merci ni umunyarwanda w\u00famunyarwenya, amazina ye ya nyayo ni NDARUHUTSE Merci. \n= ubuzima bwite =\nFally Merci ni umwana wambere mu bana bane, akaba yaravukiye ku Gitwe mu karere ka Musha. \nyatangiye urugendo rwo rwo gukora umwuga w'urwenya mu mwaka w'2017, ku nshuro ya mbere yagaragaye mu gitaramo cy'urwenya cyiswe \"Ijoro rya rutura\", yitwaye neza muri iki gitaramo bimuhesha amahirwe yo kwitabira ikindi gitaramo cyiswe \"Seka Live and Seka Fest\" byateguwe na Arthur Nkusi \n= Amashakiro =\nhttps://www.newtimes.co.rw/entertainment/comedy-fally-merci-living-dream"}
{"id": "12929", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12929", "title": "Madebeats", "text": "Mucyo David uzwi nka Madebeats mu gisata cy'Imyidagaduro mu Rwanda ni umunyarwanda ukora umwuga wo gutunganya indirimbo.Uyu mwuga akaba yarawutangiye amaze gusoza amashuri yisumbuye mu ishami rya Electrical engeneering mu ishuri rya SOS Technical High School riherereye i Kagugu mu karere ka Gasabo \nUbuzima Bwite.\nMadebeats w\u2019imyaka 26, ni umuhanga mu gutunganya indirimbo. Muri iyi minsi ni umwe mu bakoranye n\u2019abahanzi bafite amazina akomeye mu muziki w\u2019u Rwanda no mu karere. Yinjiye muri uyu mwuga abifashijwemo na Producer Nicolas afata nk\u2019umusingi w\u2019ibikorwa bye. Muri iyi minsi ni umwe mu basore bamaze kubaka izina mu mitima y\u2019abakunzi ba muzika mu Rwanda cyane mu batunganya indirimbo ni umusore mu muziki umaze igihe gito amaze gukora indirimbo nyinshi zamamaye hano mu Rwanda kandi z\u2019abahanzi b\u2019ibyamamare.\n= amashakiro =\nhttps://web.archive.org/web/20220922043635/https://www.igihe.com/imyidagaduro/article/producer-madebeats-agiye-kwimukira-mu-bwongereza"}
{"id": "12931", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12931", "title": "Gael Faye", "text": "Umuhanzi w\u2019Umunyarwanda wavukiye mu Uburundi mu mwaka 1982, se ni Umufaransa nyina akaba Umunyarwandakazi. Muri Mata mu mwaka 2014 yaje kwifatanya n\u2019Abanyarwanda mu kwibuka abazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu mwaka 1994. Garl afite indirimbo \u2019Petit Pays\u2019 avugamo uRwanda n\u2019Uburundi.\nAmateka.\nGa\u00ebl Faye ni umuhanzi umaze kubaka izina mu kuririmba, kwandika ibitabo no mu ruganda rwa sinema by\u2019umwihariko ku Mugabane w\u2019u Burayi cyane cyane mu Bufaransa. Yerekeje i Paris afite imyaka 13 nyuma aza gutura mu Rwanda amaze kurushinga. Ni n\u2019umwanditsi w\u2019ibitabo akaba ari we wanditse agatabo kakomotseho filime \u2018Petit Pays\u2019 kamuhesheje ibihembo bitandukanye mu mwaka 2016 no mu mwaka 2017.\nIbyerekeye filime yanditse.\nIyi filime ishingiye ku nkuru y\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019umwanaGa\u00ebl Faye wavukiye mu Uburundi abyarwa n\u2019umunyarwandakazi w\u2019impunzi n\u2019umuzungu w\u2019Umufaransa. Uwo mwana avuga uko yabonaga ubuzima muri icyo gihe n\u2019ibibazo by\u2019amoko y\u2019Abahutu n\u2019Abatutsi. Nyuma y\u2019ingendo za mbere z\u2019ibitaramo uhereye igihe Covid-19 yadukiye, Ga\u00ebl Faye yagiranye ikiganiro kirambuye na Jeune Afrique agaruka ku ngingo zitandukanye zirebana n\u2019ibibera mu Karere muri iki gihe."}
{"id": "12932", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12932", "title": "Munyanshoza Dieudonne", "text": "Munyanshoza Dieudonne uzwi ku izina rya Mibirizi ni umwe mu bahanzi bakomeye mu muziki nyarwanda, ni umuhanzi wamenyekanye cyane kubera indirimbo \"Mibirizi\" yakoreye aho avuka hishwe abatutsi beshi muri jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu mwaka 1994.\nKuri ubu Munyanshoza abarizwa muri Orchestre Impala zongeye kwihuza.\n= Ubuzima bwite =\nMunyanshoza Dieudonne yavutse ku wa 25 Nzeri mu mwaka 1975 yavukiye ahitwa Kimbogo mu ntara y'iburengerazuba, yize amashuri abanza i Mibirizi, nyuma ahabwa amahugurwa y'ububaji mu kigo cya Kibogora. atangira kubikora nk'umwuga mu mwaka 1989. \nMu mwaka 1993 nibwo yinjiye mu gisirikare cy'Inkotanyi afite imyaka 17 y'Amavuko. aza gusezererwa mu mwaka 2016 kubera imyaka y'ubukure \nMunyanshoza Dieudonne ubu arubatse afite umugore n'abana\n= Amashakiro ="}
{"id": "12933", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12933", "title": "Neza Da Songbird", "text": "Neza Da Songbird Uyu ni umunyarwandakazi wavukiye i Kinshassa. Avuga indimi enye neza zirimo Ikinyarwanda, Igifaransa, Icyongereza n\u2019Ilingala. Neza akorera umuziki we i Toronto muri Canada ari naho abana n\u2019abavandimwe be.\nAmateka.\nNeza Da SongBird, umunyarwandakazi ukorera umuziki muri Canada yatoranijwe mu bahatanira igihembo \u00a0cy\u2019umuhanzi mwiza utanga icyizere cy\u2019ejo hazaza muri muzika ya \u00a0Afurika mu bihembo bigiye gutangwa ku nshuro ya kane bya Afrima. Neza akora injyana zishingiye kuri R&amp;B, Pop, Afro-Dancehall n\u2019izindi zigezweho ziganjemo izituje, \u00a0yagiye muri studio bwa mbere mu mwaka 2000, ari nabwo yakoze indirimbo ye ya mbere. Uyu muhanzikazi ari mubatanga icyizere mu kuzamura umuziki nyarwanda ku rwego mpuzamahanga. \nAmarushanwa.\nSi ubwa mbere Neza yitabiriye amarushanwa mpuzamahanga y\u2019abanyamuziki kuko no mu mwaka 2012, yaje kwitabira \u00a0amarushanwa ya African Entertainment Awards yabereye muri Canada. Akaza guhabwa igihembo cya \u00a0\u201cBest Female Artist\u201d."}
{"id": "12934", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12934", "title": "Eric Senderi", "text": "AMATEKA YA SENDERI HIT... Ni muntu ki?\nEric Senderi Nzaramba ni umuhanzi nyarwanda uririmba injyana ya Afro Beat, wamenyekanye cyane ku mazina ya \"Eric Senderi\" cyangwa \"Senderi International Hit\". uyu muhanzi akaba ari umwe mu bakunze kwifashishwa mu bitaramo birimo gahunda za Leta n'ibindi bitaramo.\nEric Senderi Nzaramba, yavukiye mu Ntara y\u2019I Burasirazuba mu Karere ka Kirehe, Umurenge wa Nyarubuye, Akagari ka Nyarutunga ubu akaba atuye mu mujyi wa Kigali.\nYavutse ku itariki ya 15 Werurwe 1977. Avuka mu muryango w\u2019abana icyenda, ubu hasigaye babiri. Se yitwa Ndikumwami Yohana, Nyina akitwa Mukaderevu Esperanse. Amashuri abanza yayigiye I Nyarubuye n\u2019ay\u2019imyuga atatu.\nNyuma yaje kujya mu gisirikare cy\u2019inkotanyi gutabara, yaje kuva mu gisirikare mu 2007.\nYinjiye mu buhanzi akiri muto ari mu itorero ry\u2019aho yari atuye hitwa Nyarutunga gusa no mu gisirikare yari utera indirimbo (Ossi Morale) ari nabyo byaje kumufasha mu buhanzi bwe. Atangira guhimba indirimbo zivuga kuri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi 1994.\n Yakoze nk\u2019iyitwa \"Intimba y\u2019Intore z\u2019Imana, Humura ntibizongera, Nyarubuye Iwacu, Twigirire Icyizere\" n\u2019izindi nyinshi zigera kuri 42. Izi ndirimbo zikaba zinafite amashusho yazo.\nNyuma yaje gukora n'indirimbo zivuga ku buzima busanzwe, nk\u2019iyitwa \"Turi mu muvuduko, Cyimbagira, Abanyamujyi, Abanyarwanda Twaribohoye, Abasore Bariho Nta Cash, Reka Jarousie, Ndanyuzwe, Sofia, Umunyana, Kora, Abareyo, APR Fc, Sukura Umujyi,\" n\u2019izindi nyinshi.\nYahawe ibikombe\nSenderi yagiye hegukana ibikombe harimo icyo yahawe n\u2019Umujyi wa Kigali cy\u2019indirimbo yitwa Sukura Umujyi. Iki gikombe cyamuhesheje itike yo gutembera muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo na Madagascar. Yaje no gutoranywa mu bahanzi batatu muri Afurika bafite indirimbo zishobora guhoza abana bahuye n\u2019imitingito ku isi, imyuzure, Jenoside n\u2019ibindi biza.\nYahawe igihembo na Perezida wa Repubulika Paul Kagame cyo kujya muri America(muri Mexico) gushyigikira ikipe y\u2019igihugu y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 17 aho yari iri mu gikombe cy\u2019isi. Aha yahawe n'umwanya wo kuririmba muri icyo gikombe cy'isi.\nSenderi ni umwe mu bahanzi bitabiriye irushanwa rya 'Primus Guma Guma Super Star' inshuro eshatu zikurikiranya. Yitabiriye itangwa ry'ibihembo bya 'Salax Awards' abyegukana inshuro eshatu.\nYabashije no kwegukana ibihembo nk'umuhanzi ukunzwe cyane n'abaturage muri 'Kalisimbi Awards' naho yacyegukanye inshuro eshatu.\nKugeza ubu ni umwe mu bahanzi Nyarwanda babashije kuririmba muri Stade Amahoro ivuguruye yakira abantu ibihumbi 45.\nSenderi ni umuhanzi wagiye arangwa n'udushya twinshi haba mu bitaramo ndetse no mu buzima busanzwe harimo no kuba yarigeze kwitwa musaza wa Miss Rwanda 2015 Kundwa Doriane.\n= amashakiro =\nhttps://web.archive.org/web/20250702120437/https://mambo1.com/udushya-nibyaranze-ubuzima-bwa-senderi-mu-muziki-ugiye-kwizihiza-imyaka-20-aririmba/"}
{"id": "12935", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12935", "title": "Nicole Musoni", "text": "Nicole Musoni Ni umukobwa wa \u00c9variste Musoni, umuhanzi nyarwanda ukorera umuziki we muri Canada ari naho umuryango wabo wose utuye.\nAmateka y'urugendo rwa muzika.\nNicole Musoni, ni umuhanzikazi w\u2019ijwi rigororotse ubasha kuririmba injyana zitujye kandi zibyinitse nka Pop na Soul. Uyu mukobwa yatangiye umuziki mu myaka irindwi ishize. Amaze gusohora indirimbo zirimo \u2018Interlude\u2019, \u2018Die with me\u2019, \u2018La Panique\u2019 n\u2019izindi. Uyu muhanzikazi kandi anakunze gusubiramo indirimbo z\u2019abahanzi barimo Childish Gambino, Julia Michaels, The Weekend n\u2019abandi. Nicole Musoni amaze kwitabira amarushanwa atandukanye y\u2019umuziki arimo nka \u2018Secondaire en Spectacle\u2019, \u2018Star Acad\u00e9mie\u2019 n\u2019andi.\nUyu mukobwa yavukiye mu Rwanda, ku myaka ibiri y\u2019amavuko we n\u2019umuryango we bajya gutura muri Canada kugeza n\u2019ubu.\nUbuzima bwite.\nYatojwe na nyina kubyina imbyino za Kinyarwanda ndetse na we ageze muri Canada atangira kubyigisha amatorero atandukanye. Yagiye atumirwa mu mijyi yo muri Canada kugira ngo asangize ubu bumenyi abanyamahanga n\u2019Abanyarwanda batabashije kubyigira mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "12936", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12936", "title": "Mike Lookee", "text": "Ange Michel Ntwali w\u2019imyaka 33 yarabonye izuba mu mwaka wi 1989 avukira mu Ngagara ho mu mujyi wa Bujumbura aza gukurira i Kigali mu murwa mukuru w'u Rwanda ari naho yavuye yerecyeza mu gihugu cya Norvege. akoresha izina ry\u2019ubuhanzi rya Mike Lookee ni umwe mu bahanzi baririmba mu njyana ya Hip-Hop urimo kwitwara neza mu gihugu cya Norv\u00e8ge.\nAmateka y'Ubuzima bwe bwite.\nUyu muhanzi avuka ku mubyeyi umwe w\u2019Umurundi undi w\u2019Umunyarwanda.Yavukiye mu gihugu cy\u2019u Burundi akurira mu Rwanda baza kwimuka nya bajya muri Norv\u00e8ge.\nLookee afite indirimbo zikunzwe cyane ndetse ni umwe mu bafite indirimbo zirebwa cyane kuri Youtube. Iyitwa Get Back Up imaze kurebwa n\u2019abasaga 15,000,000.\nUrungendo rwa muzika.\nubuhanzi bwe bwatangiye kugaragara kera akiri muto, ubwo yajyaga mu bakaraza i Burundi, aho yatangiye gukunda cyane iby\u2019umuziki n\u2019ubuhanzi muri rusange. Bruce avuga ko uyu muhanzi yaje gukunda cyane abahanzi bakomeye nka Sisqo, usher na Michael Jackson. Indirimbo ye ya mbere yise My style yatumye akundwa cyane ndetse atangira no kwibona mu baraperi bo mu gihugu cya Norvege aho aba ubu. Iyi ndirimbo yari imwe mu ndirimbo zigize mixtape yise \u201cthe outsider\u201d. Mu minsi itatu gusa, iyi Mixtape The outsider yamanuwe kuri interineti (Download) inshuro zigera ku 3000."}
{"id": "12937", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12937", "title": "Enric Sifa", "text": "Nshimiyumuremyi Eric (yavutse ku ya 24 Ukuboza 1988), uzwi ku izina rye ry'ubuhanzi Enric Sifa, ni umuririmbyi n'umwanditsi w'indirimbo wo mu Rwanda akaba n'umuvugizi mu ruhame akayobora na Filimi. Muri 2002, yatsindiye amarushanwa yo kuririmba mu Rwanda yatangije umwuga we wa muzika kandi amuha radiyo na televiziyo mu Rwanda. Muri 2006. umuryango udaharanira inyungu ukomoka mu mujyi wa Portland ; Oregon ukorera mu Rwanda w'amushyize mu itsinda ryazengurutse Amerika kugira ngo riteze imbere gutera inkunga abana. Nyuma yo kuzenguruka yagumye muri Portland kuva asohora alubumu eshatu za studio.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nSifa yavutse ku ya 24 Ukuboza 1988, avukira mu mudugudu wo mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba, u Rwanda mu muryango wo hagati. Se yagurishije ibicuruzwa biva mu nganda, kandi umuryango we wari ufite imodoka kandi ukoresha abakozi kugira ngo bahinge ikawa yabo. Igihe Sifa yari afite imyaka itanu, ise na mukuru we biciwe muri jenoside yo mu Rwanda. Sifa na murumuna we batandukanijwe na nyina na mushiki wabo w'uruhinja kandi birinda urugomo bahungira mu ishyamba bamarayo amezi atatu. Nyuma yo guhura n\u2019inzara mu ishyamba, Sifa yahisemo gushyira mu kaga ko yicwa maze asubira mu mudugudu aho we na murumuna we bahuriye na nyina na mushiki wabo kuri sitasiyo ya Croix Rouge. Basubiye mu nzu yabo, basanga umuyobozi wamunzwe na ruswa yafashe imitungo yabo, bityo babana mu kazu gato imyaka myinshi kugeza igihe nyina wa Sifa yaboneye impapuro zikenewe na guverinoma y'u Rwanda kugira ngo yambure umutungo we. Igihe yegera umukozi wa leta ku bijyanye n'umutungo we, yahaye akazi agatsiko ko kumukubita maze apfa nyuma y'ibyumweru bibiri azize gukubitwa. \nNyirasenge wa Sifa yajyanye murumuna we na mushiki we ariko kubera ko atari afite ubushobozi bwo kumutunga, yatangiye kubana n\u2019umuturanyi. Kuba mu mudugudu umwe aho umuryango we wishwe byari bigoye kuri Sifa ku mutima, nuko arahunga aba impfubyi yo mu muhanda. Sifa yamaze imyaka itandatu arokoka mumuhanda aririmbira abanyamahanga kumuhanda kugirango bahinduke, bafasha abacuruzi, gutwara imizigo, no gukina urusimbi kuri marble hamwe nabandi bana bo mumuhanda. \nSifa yakomeje kuririmba indirimbo za nyina kugira ngo ahumurize ndetse n'abandi bahungu, kandi yahaga agaciro umuziki cyane ku buryo yakwinjira mu tubyiniro nubwo yari muto mu buryo bwemewe n'amategeko. Umunsi umwe nijoro nyuma yo kwizitira uruzitiro kugirango abone kwinjira muri club nijoro, bouncers baramukubita, Sifa yumva yumvise Imana imutegeka kujya igihe kinini cyo kubyina. Bukeye bwaho, yagiye mu rusengero ahinduka Umukristo. \nYakundaga umuziki ku rusengero, kandi umuryango w'itorero wamuretse akaguma mu rugo rwabo. Umugore ukorana na Africa New Life Ministries, umuryango udaharanira inyungu ukomoka muri Portland, Oregon, yashakaga kumushyigikira amuha gitari kuko yari azi ubushobozi bwe bwa muzika. Mu 2002, umwaka nigice nyuma yo gutura mumuhanda, Sifa yatsindiye amarushanwa yigihugu yo kuririmba kwandika indirimbo yindirimbo yise Urukundo na sida. Sifa yamenyekanye cyane mu Rwanda kuri televiziyo na radiyo maze atumirwa gukina imbere ya Perezida Paul Kagame.\nUbuzima bwite.\nKu ya 9 Kanama 2014, Sifa yashakanye n'umugore we Whitney Ferrin, bahuriye muri Warner Pacific College. Muri Gicurasi 2015, Sifa yahawe impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bucuruzi yakuye muri Warner Pacific kandi arateganya gushinga imishinga myinshi ihuriweho na MyiBOBO LLC kugira ngo ishyigikire umwuga we wa muzika. "}
{"id": "12938", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12938", "title": "Nkusi Thomas", "text": "Nkusi Thomas wamenyekanye cyane ku izina rya Yanga yavutse mu mwaka w' 1980 yitaba Imana mu 2022\nAmateka.\nNkusi Thomas wamenyekanye cyane ku izina rya Yanga yavutse mu 1980. Nkusi thomas yashakanye na Eriko umugore w'umuyapanikazi mu mwaka w'2011 babyarana abana 2.\nImirimo.\nMu 1998, Yanga yatangiye gusobanura amafilime abitangirira aho bita kuri 40 i Nyamirambo kwa Mayaka. Yanga yakomeje kubikora nk'umwuga akabikorera mubice bitandukanye nka Remere, Kicukiro, Kabeza na Kanombe hari ahantu abantu bahurira bakareba izo filime yasobanuye. Yanga nubwo yatangiye mu 1998 yamenyekanye cyane kuva mu mwaka wa 2000 kugeza mu mwaka wa 2013."}
{"id": "12939", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12939", "title": "Umuryango Nyarwanda w'abafite ubumuga bwo kutumva no kutavuga(RNUD)", "text": "RNUD mu icyongereza: (Rwanda National Union of the Deaf) ni umuryango w\u2019imiryango itegamiye kuri Leta Wanditswe (Reg No 69/05) uhuza ibyiciro byose by\u2019abatumva kugira ngo bakemure ibibazo byabo mu mibereho, ubukungu, umuco na politiki. RNUD yashinzwe mu 1989 n\u2019abantu bafite ubumuga bwo kutumva hagamijwe kwishyira hamwe, kumenyekanisha ibibazo / impungenge n\u2019uburyo byakemuka.\nAmateka.\nAbatumva bashinze RNUD nyuma yo kubona ko ibyo bakeneye hamwe n\u2019ibibazo byabo birengagijwe n\u2019umuryango mugari. Inshingano y'ibanze ya RNUD ni ukureba inyungu z'abatumva, kuvugana mu rurimi rw'amarenga kugira ngo babaha serivisi, bakemure ibibazo byabo kandi babe nk'inzobere mu kutumva. Icyakora, Ishyirahamwe ryarasenyutse biturutse kuri jenoside yibasiye u Rwanda, mu 1994 aho benshi mu banyamuryango bashinze biciwe.\nAbatumva bo mu Rwanda bahura n\u2019urubuga rugoye rw\u2019ibibazo kuva ku mibereho, ubukungu, umuco n\u2019iterambere, imyumvire mibi y\u2019abaturage ku batumva, inzitizi z\u2019itumanaho. Ubukene burusheho gutesha agaciro abatumva kugera ku cyubahiro n\u2019ubumwe no kubona akazi n\u2019uburere aho batuye kandi ibyo bikababuza kwishimira byimazeyo uburenganzira bw\u2019ibanze bwa muntu buhabwa abantu bose. RNUD yiyemeje guharanira amahirwe angana y\u2019Abanyatumva batumva ndetse n\u2019uburenganzira bwabo bwa muntu nk'uko bigaragara mu mategeko mpuzamahanga ndetse n\u2019igihugu.\nRNUD ni umunyamuryango w\u2019amashyirahamwe y\u2019igihugu y\u2019abafite ubumuga mu Rwanda (NUDOR) kandi yifatanije n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abatumva (WFD). RNUD ikora kandi ku bufatanye na serivisi ishinzwe ubushake mu mahanga (VSO) u Rwanda, Malmo Deaf club - Suwede, Ikigega cy\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga na Fondasiyo(Foundation)ya Kentalis n\u2019ubuyobozi bw\u2019ibanze."}
{"id": "12940", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12940", "title": "Kayitare Wayitare Dembe", "text": "Kayitare Wayitare Dembe wamamaye mu ndirimbo yakunzwe n\u2019abanyarwanda batari bake izwi nka \"abana b'afurika\" n\u2019izindi zivugira imfubyi zasizwe iheru heru na Sida.\nAmateka.\nKayitare Wayitare Dembe nyuma yo kumara igihe kingana n\u2019imyaka icumi nta gihangano cye cyumvikana,ubu aho agarukiye akaba amaze gushyira hanze indirimbo ebyiri zifite n\u2019amashusho ari zo \u2019Anita na Fata Kumano\u2019 aho bimaze kugaragara ko atigeze yibagirana mu mitwe y\u2019abakunzi b\u2019umuziki nyarwanda."}
{"id": "12941", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12941", "title": "Sintex", "text": "Umuhanzi Kabera Arnold uzwi ku izina rya Sintex, akaba na murumuna w\u2019umunyarwenya Nkusi Arthur. Sintex ni umuhanzi ufite imbaraga n\u2019ubuhanga ndetse n\u2019umuziki uryohera benshi mu bakunda injyana ya Dancehall. ubu ni CEO w'inzu itunganya umuziki ya Afurica Calabash.\nyakoze zimwe mundirimbo nka Twifunze,Hand of God,You,Por Favor\u2026n\u2019izindi.\nAmateka.\nUrungendo rwa muzika.\nSintex yatangiye muzika mu mwaka wa 2012. \u00a0Aririmba injyana ya Afro music. Kugeza ubu amaze kugira indirimbo nyinshi harimo: Indoro, akabazo, Blessed, Chocolate, African Beauty na Money, hashize imyaka isaga ine ubwo yakoraga indirimbo yise \u2018Why\u2019. Yavuze ko yagiye mu muziki abizi neza ko buri kintu kibamo ingorane.\nUmuhanzi Sintex akaba amaze kwitabira ibitaramo binyuranye harimo na \u00a0Kigali Up 2014. Ibitaramo aheruka kwitabira abifashijwemo na Company imutera inkunga ya U5, harimo igitaramo cyabereye mu kabyiniro ka Le Must yahuriyemo n\u2019abahanzi bakomeye ba hano mu Rwanda ndetse n\u2019igitaramo yakoreye I Rubavu cyari kigamije gususurutsa ba mukerarugendo bari baturutse mu bihugu bya Kenya n'Ubugande."}
{"id": "12942", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12942", "title": "Scilla", "text": "Umuhanzikazi Umuratwa Priscillah uzwi nka Princess Priscilah uba muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za America,\nAmateka y'Urungedo rwa Muzika.\nUyu mukobwa yamenyekanye mu ndirimbo nka \u2018Mbabarira\u2019, \u2018Itangazo\u2019, \u2018Nkeneye umukunzi\u2019, \u2018You and I\u2019 yakoranye na Jay Polly, muri \u2018Bagupfusha ubusa\u2019 yagaragayemo aba stars benshi n\u2019izindi. Princess Priscillah amaze \u201cimyaka\u201d icyenda n\u2019imisago muri Amerika, aba i Texas. Yagiyeyo muri Nyakanga mu mwaka 2013 agiye kuhakomereza amasomo ya kaminuza. Priscilla ni umuhanzikazi ufite impano, kandi umaze kumenyekana mu ndirimbo z\u2019urukundo \u201cIcyo ubarusha\u201d n\u2019izindi z\u2019urukundo usanga zikora ku marangamutima y\u2019abafana be cyane cyane abagore."}
{"id": "12943", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12943", "title": "Rwasamanzi Yves", "text": "Rwasamanzi Yves ni umutoza w\u2019ikipe y\u2019igihugu AMAVUBI y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 23. ubusazwe akaba ari umutoza w\u2019ikipe ya Marines FC, Yves Rwasamanzi avuga ko ari amahirwe kuba atoza ikipe iyobowe n\u2019abasirikare kuko ifite uko yubakitse uko byagenda kose itazamo akavuyo. Aba kandi yarigeze nogutoza ikipe ya La Jeunesse Fc."}
{"id": "12944", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12944", "title": "Dream Boyz", "text": "Dream Boys ni itsinda Nyarwanda rikora injyana ya R&amp;B na Afrobeat rigizwe na Nemeye Platini uzwi nka Platini P ndetse na mugenzi we Mujyanama Claude uzwi nka TMC Ni tsinda bashinze muri 2009, riza kumenyekana cyane bakora ibitaramo hirya no hino mu Rwanda no hanze yarwo cyane cyane mu bihugu bibarizwa muri East Africa Community (EAC). Dream Boys yegukanye irushanwa rya Primus Guma Guma Super Star ubwo ryabaga ku nshuro ya karindwi. Ni mu birori bikomeye byabereye kuri Petit Stade byasojwe mu ijoro ryo ku wa 24 Kamena mu mwaka 2016.\nAmateka.\nAbagize itsinda.\nPlatini na TMC bagize iri tsinda bamaze kwitabira iri rushanwa inshuro esheshatu mu nshuro indwi rimaze kuba.\nAmateka kuri buri umwe.\nPlatini.\nPlatini ubundi yitwa Nemeye Platini akaba yaravutse muri nzeli mu mwaka 1988 I Bukavu kuko niho ababyeyi be bari barabaye bahamaze igihe kirekire. Nyuma yaho yaje gutahuka nk\u2019abandi banyarwanda bose atangira amashuri ye abanza abiri yayize muri Congo, akomereza kuri ecole Primaire ya Nyanza ya Kicukiro. Icyiciro rusange cy\u2019amashuri yagikomereje kuri Ecole secondaire de Gasange I Byumba, akomereza mu rwunge rw\u2019amashuli rwa leta i Butare. Yaje gukomereza muri Kaminuza Nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda mu ishami ry\u2019itangazamakuru. Platini akiri umwana yaririmbaga muri Korari aza kuhava atangira gukora muzika ye. Ubu Platini, wakoze gake kuri Radio Salus, akora rimwe na rimwe kuri Radio Isango Star mu biganiro nka Isango na Muzika.\nTMC.\nMujyanama Claude [TMC] ni undi musore ubarizwa mu itsinda rya Dream boys. TMC akaba yarabonye izuba taliki ya 25 Nzeli mu mwaka 1988 na we avukira Uvila muri Congo. Yaje kuza mu Rwanda nyuma yu mwaka 1994 atangira amashuli ye abanza kuri Ecole Primaire de Kicukiro akomereza ayisumbuye kuri Ecole Secondaire de Kicukiro yaje guhinduka E.T.O Kicukiro.\nTMC yaje kujya kwiga muri GSOB (Group Scolaire Officiel de Butare) mu ishami ry\u2019imibare n\u2019ubugenge, Kaminuza ayiga muri KIST. Kimwe na Platini, TMC na we yabanje kuririmba muri korari ayivamo ajya kwiririmbira ku giti cye.\nMu mwaka wa 2007, TMC arangije amashuli yisumbuye ni bwo yakoze indirimbo ya mbere ayikorerwa na BZB The Brain ayikorera muri The Future Production ariko iki gihe yaririmbaga injyana ya Hip hop. Muri 2008, Platini akirangiza amashuli yisumbuye yahuye na TMC bari bariganye i Butare mu mashuli yisumbuye ndetse bakaba bari banaturanye ibyo bikaba byaratumye bakora itsinda baryita \"Dream Boys\" kugeza n\u2019uyu munsi ni ko ryitwa.\nGuhera ku gitaramo cya mbere nibo bahanzi bagarutsweho cyane ku myambarire myiza yabaranze n\u2019uburyo bitwara kuri stage n\u2019ababyinnyi babo. Ibi bikajyana n\u2019uburyo bahuza amajwi yabo, banavugisha abafana babo mu gihe barimo kuririmba.\nUko Platini na TMC bahuye bashinga Dream Boyz.\nMu mwaka 2008, Platini akirangiza amashuri yisumbuye yahuye na TMC bari bariganye I Butare mu mashuri ndetse ko bari banaturanye byatumye bakora itsinda baryita Dream Boyz. Gusa bakunze guhurira cyane mu ishuri. Muri uyu mwaka nibwo barebye Lick Lick atangira kubakorera ariko ababwira ko byaba byiza bakoze mu njyana ya bongo, nibwo TMC yavuye mu njyana ya hip hop atangira kuririmba bisanzwe. Dream Boyz yaje gukora indirimbo yabo yitwa \u201cNirizingua\u201d yo mu njyana ya bongo irakundwa, ariko iyatumye Deam boys ikundwa ikanamenyekana cyane ni \u201cMagorwa\u201d. Nyuma yaho Dream Boyz yakoze izindi ndirimbo nyinshi zivugisha abantu menshi nka si inzika n\u2019izindi nyinshi. Mu ndirimbo z\u2019aba bahungu humvikanamo ubutumwa busa nkaho ari ubuzima busanzwe ndetse n\u2019amaganya ndetse abantu akaba ari yo mpamvu babakunda kuko bavuga ibiriho.\nUko Platini na TMC batandukanye.\nKera kabaye Nemeye Platini wakoranaga na mugenzi we TMC mu itsinda rya Dream Boyz yeruye avuga ko ibya Dream Boyz bishobora kuba amateka kuko we yatangiye gukora muzika ku giti cye ndetse akaba yahinduye izina akitwa P. Mujyanama Claude ukoresha TMC mu muziki wanabarizwaga mu itsinda rya Dream Boys yagiye gutura muri Amerika, nyuma y\u2019igihe havugwa itandukana ry\u2019abagize iri tsinda, bikanavugwa ko yagiye adasezeye mugenzi we bamaranye imyaka 11 mu muziki anabanaga mu nzu. "}
{"id": "12945", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12945", "title": "Ruremesha Emmanuel", "text": "Ruremesha Emmanuel umutoza umaze gutoza amakipe menshi mu Rwanda.\nUbuzima bwite.\nRuremesha Emmanuel yavukiye ku Mumena, yize amashuri abanza kuri EP Cyivugiza ayasoreza kuri Camp Kigali mu karere ka Nyarugenge, yakomeye ayisumbuye mu Burundi, nyuma Ya jenocide yakorewe Abatutsi yaje gusoreza amashhuri kuri ET Muhazi mu ishami ry'ubucuruzi.\nMuri ruhago.\nRuremesha Emmanuel yakinishaga ku ruhande agakinisha akuguru kuburyo, yatangiye gukina ubwo yakiniraga ku Mumena, Nyuma ajya mu ishuri ry'umupira rya Panthere mu 1989,avamo ajya mu irerero rya Rayon sports fc ryatozwaga na Nsoro, Kubera Kwiga Ruremesha Emmanuel yerekeje muro Repubulika Iharanira Demukarasi ya Congo ariko aza mu myitozo kwa Vigure mu karere ka Rubavu, mu 1992 yagiye kuba mu Burundi yerekeza mu ikipe ya Coca-Cola Fc yo mubuyenzi, avamo yerekeza mu ingimbi za Vital'O, Nyuma ya Genocide yerekeje muri Mukura V.S.\nMu gutoza.\nRuremesha Emmanuel ari muri Mukura kuko arinaho yatangiriye akazi ko gutoza kuva muri 2003 yahawwe gutoza abana ndetse anabifatanya no gutoza ikipe ya Kaminuza yu Rwanda yitwa Ur Fc, nyuma yabaye umutoza mukuru wa Mukura, muri 2007 yerekeje muri Kibuye Fc aho yamenyanye na Ntagwabira Jean Marie bari bavanye mu mahugurwa muri Gabon, yatoje nk'umutoza wungirije wa ATRACO FC, akomereza muri Rayo sports fc, akomereza muri La jeunesse Fc yavuye agaruka muri Mukura V.S muri 2013 avayo ajya muri Espoir Fc, akomeza ajya muri Gicumbi Fc na Enticelles Fc ayihesha umwanya wa 4, akomeza ajya muri Musanze Fc aza guhagarikwa yerekeza muri Kiyovv Sports yavuymo ajya muri Gorilla Fc avayo asubira muri Mukura V.S akaba ariyo yatozaga mbere yo kwerekeza muri Rwamagana Fc.\nIbikombe yatwaye.\nRuremesha Emmanuel yatwaye igikombe cya CECAFA yakuye hanze ubwo yari muri ATRACO FC ubwo yari yungirije nyakwigendera Ntagwabira Jean Marie."}
