{"id": "12947", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12947", "title": "Active Again", "text": "Active Again ni itsinda nyarwanda ririmba injyana ya Afrobeat na R&amp;B, rigizwe n'abasore batatu aribo Derek Sano, Tizzo na Olivis. Ni Itsinda bashinze kuwa 25 Nyakanga 2013 bigizwemo uruhare na Bagenzi Bernard watunganyaga amajwi n\u2019amashusho muri icyo gihe.\nUmwuga.\nItsinda rya Active Again rikivuka ryaje risanga andi matsinda yari akomeye arimo nka Dream Boyz ndetse na Urban Boyz yari yarigaruriye imitima y\u2019abafana b\u2019umuziki Nyarwanda, Active iza ari itsinda rifite byinshi rihuriyeho birimo kuba ari ababyinnyi beza bagiye banyura mu matsinda abyina anyuranye. Ntibyatinze kuri iri tsinda ngo ribashe kugaragaza ubuhanga ndetse ibitangazamakuru byibanda ku myidagaduro bitangira kubashyira mu nkuru nyamukuru cyane cyane ubwo basohoraga indirimbo yabo \u2018Udukoryo twinshi\u2019 itaravuzweho rumwe ku bw\u2019ibyamamare bagiye bagarukaho byatumye bigarurira imbaga nini y\u2019urubyiruko rwakundaga indirimbo zibyinitse ndetse bagakundirwa n\u2019uburyo basusurutsa abantu ku rubyiniro. \nIgihe cyarageze itsinda rya Active riza gutandukana n\u2019inzu ifasha abahanzi ya Incredible Records ya Bagenzi Bernard wagize uruhare mu guhuriza hamwe abagize iri tsinda berekeza muri New Level bagamije kwagura ibikorwa byabo.Umunsi ku wundi Active nk\u2019itsinda ni ko ryakuraga ndetse batangira gukorana n\u2019abahanzi banyuranye bo hakurya y\u2019imbibi indirimbo nka Waga waga bakoranye na Vampino, Amafiyeri bakoranye na Barnaba Classic ndetse na Go Mama bakoranye na Mwana FA ziri mu byabafunguriye imiryango mu Karere ka Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba.\nUretse gukora indirimbo nziza zibyinitse, ikibatsi cy\u2019urukundo rwa Derek na Miss Teta Sandra ndetse na Olivis hamwe na Miss Vanessa nubwo rwaje kuyonga ni bimwe mu byagiye bifata imitwe y\u2019inkuru nyamukuru z\u2019ibitangazamakuru bikora inkuru z\u2019imyidagaduro mu Rwanda.\nIbyatumye havuka agatotsi hagati yabo.\nUmwaka wa 2018 wasize Derek, umwe mu bagize iri tsinda afashe umwanzuro wo gusubira ku ntebe y\u2019ishuri akajya kwiga muzika ku Nyundo asize bagenzi be bakoranaga mu itsinda. N\u2019ubwo byari ikintu cyiza haba kuri we ndetse no ku itsinda, bisa nk\u2019ibitarigeze biganirwaho hagati yabo kugira ngo barebere hamwe uko imyigire ye itagira ingaruka ku buzima bw\u2019itsinda. Byaje gusa n\u2019ibyatumye havuka agatotsi hagati yabo, ibihangano byabahuzaga birabura ndetse bamwe ntibatinya kwemeza ko iri tsinda riri mu marembera cyo kimwe n\u2019andi anyuranye yagiye atandukana nyuma yo gucika intege no kutumva ibintu kimwe mu bayagize."}
{"id": "12948", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12948", "title": "Hakizimana Adolphe", "text": "Hakizimana Adolphe ni umunyezamu w\u2019ikipe y\u2019igihugu y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 23, avugako mu Rwanda bagiye muri Libiya kwerekana icyo bashoboye kuko babizi neza ko iyi mikino ari n\u2019imwe mu nzira yo kubafungurira imiryango mu ikipe y\u2019igihugu nkuru Amavubi, umusazwe akaba ari umunyezamu w\u2019ikipe ya Rayon sports fc.."}
{"id": "12949", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12949", "title": "Kitoko", "text": "Musabwa Patrick bakunze kwita Kitoko yavutse tariki 12 Nzeri 1985, avukira ahitwa Kazibwa mu burasirazuba bwa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Congo mu cyahoze ari Zaire. Kitoko ni umuhanzi nyarwanda uririmba indirimbo zikunzwe na benshi mu Rwanda ndetse no mu karere. \nAmateka y'ubuzima bwe.\nKitoko yatangiye amashuri y'incuke I Nimazita, Mu karere ka Nyabikere mu gihugu cy' Uburundi nyuma aza kurangiriza amashuri y'isumbuye I Nyanza mu ntara y'Amajyepfo mu Rwanda, akomereza amashuri y'isumbuye mu kigo cya Espanya cyo mu mugi wa Nyanza mu ntara y'Amajyepfo, ari naho yarangirije mu ishami ry'icunga mutungo, uretse umwaka umwe wo muwa gatanu yavuzeko yagiye kwiga mu cyahoze ari Cyangugu kubera impamvu ze. \nKitoko yaje gutangira muzika mu mwaka wa 2008 ubwo yarasoje kwiga amashuri y'isumbuye. Kitoko yaje gusohora indirimbo muri uwo mwaka yitwa \"Ikiragi\" ariyo yamushyize ku rwego rukomeye muri muzika nyarwanda.\nUko yatunguwe n'abanyarwanda nyuma yo kugaruka mu gihugu.\nKitoko ubundi utarusanzwe akibarizwa mu Rwanda aho yagiye mu bwongereza mu mwaka wa 2013 aho yari yaragiye gukomereza ibijyanye n'amasomo ye, yaje kugaruka mu mwaka wa 2017, ubwo yageraga ku kibuga mpuzamahanga cy'indege cya Kigali i Kanombe yakiranywe urugwiro n'inshuti n'abavandimwe ndetse na bamwe mu bahanzi.\nUrugendo rw'urukundo rwe.\nUyu muhanzi ukundwa n'abatari bake mu Rwanda, ariko cyane cyane igitsina gore kubera igihagararo cye ndetse n'ijwi ryiza afite ubu abarizwa mu bwongereza. bwa mbere na mbere yerekanye amafoto asomana n'umukobwa bakundana kumugaragaro binavugwa ko baribafitanye ubukwe mu mwaka wa 2020 "}
{"id": "12950", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12950", "title": "Imirire", "text": "Imirire (uhereye ku ntungamubiri z'ikilatini: kugaburira) ni urutonde rwibikorwa nuburyo ibinyabuzima bikira kandi bigahindura ibintu (atome, ion, molekile, birimo cyangwa bitari mubiribwa) kugirango bikore neza. Imirire nubumenyi butandukanye, hamwe abiri yingenzi. Ku ruhande rumwe, yimirire ivuga uburyo umubiri ukora uburyo bwo guhindura, nukuvuga inzira ya metabolike. Ibi bikubiyemo kwiga ku ruhare rwa na micronutrients kurwego rwa mikorobe ya biohimiki ya selile, ningaruka ku ngingo zubusumbane hagati yingufu zinjizwa ningufu zikoreshwa n\u2019ibinyabuzima. Kurundi ruhande, psychologiya yimirire isesengura imyitwarire yo kurya kumuntu cyangwa itsinda. Yibanze ku bibazo nka \" Kuki turya ? \"Aho?\" twahitamo dute ibiryo byacu ? \". Mu bantu, ibyo bibazo bifitanye isano n\u2019imibereho n\u2019ibidukikije nkibidukikije byubatswe, itangazamakuru na politiki y\u2019ubuzima, ndetse n\u2019umwihariko wabo nk'ibyo binjiza cyangwa umuco wabo.\nIbisobanuro by'ibiryo.\nKubera ko imirire ijyanye isano iri hagati y\u2019ibinyabuzima byayo, ni ngombwa gusobanura ibifatwa nkibiryo. Hano hari ibisobanuro bibiri, bitewe nuburyo bwa physiologique cyangwa psychologique. Mubwa mbere, ibiryo birimo ibintu byose bifite intungamubiri, ni ukuvuga, muri byo. \" kuribwa birakenewe kugirango ubeho, ubuzima bwiza no gukura kwabana\u00bb. Uburyo bwo mu mutwe burakumirwa, urebye ko \" ibintu bifite intungamubiri nyinshi ntibishobora kubarwa nkibiryo niba ntawe ubiriye [kuko] abantu badakunze gutekereza kubyo barya mubijyanye nintungamubiri\u00bb. Muyandi magambo, ibiryo muburyo bwubuzima bwa buri munsi biterwa numuco: nk'urugero, amaso ya baleine afite intungamubiri kubera ko arimo proteyine na vitamine A ariko umuntu ku giti cye ntashobora kubifata nk'ibiryo byemewe.\nReferances "}
{"id": "12951", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12951", "title": "Imirire y'ababyeyi", "text": "Imirire y'ababyeyi (PN) ni ukugaburira umuntu ibiryo byintungamubiri kumitsi, kurenga inzira isanzwe yo kurya no gusya. Ibicuruzwa bikozwe ninganda zikora. Umuntu yakira imvange yintungamubiri akurikije amata arimo glucose, umunyu, aside amine, lipide na vitamine hamwe nubunyu ngugu.\u00a0 Yitwa imirire yuzuye y'ababyeyi (TPN) cyangwa intungamubiri zose (TNA) mugihe nta mirire ihambaye iboneka munzira zindi, hamwe nimirire yababyeyi igice (PPN) mugihe imirire nayo yinjiye mubice. Yitwa imirire yababyeyi (PPN)\u00a0 mugihe itanzwe binyuze mumitsi yinjira mumubiri aho kunyura mumitsi yo hagati nkimirire yimitsi yo hagati (CVN).\nGukoresha ubuvuzi.\nIndyo yuzuye y'ababyeyi (TPN) itangwa mugihe inzira ya gastrointestinal idakora kubera guhagarara mukomeza (irahagaritswe, cyangwa ifite ibibyimba -) cyangwa kuberako ubushobozi bwayo bwo kwangirika bwangiritse. Yakoreshejwe kubarwayi ba, nubwo kugaburira munda mubisanzwe ari byiza, kandi ntibikunze guhura nibibazo. Imirire y'ababyeyi ikoreshwa mu gukumira imirire mibi ku barwayi badashobora kubona zihagije binyuze mu nzira cyangwa mu nda. Umuryango w\u2019ubuvuzi bukomeye (SCCM) hamwe n\u2019umuryango w\u2019abanyamerika ushinzwe imirire y\u2019ababyeyi n\u2019imirire irasaba gutegereza kugeza ku munsi wa karindwi wo kwita ku bitaro. \nIbimenyetso byuzuye kuri TPN.\nIndwara zisaba gukoresha TPN zirimo:\nIndwara ya Gastrointestinal.\nTPN irashobora kuba inzira yonyine ishoboka yo gutanga imirire kubarwayi badafite inzira zifata gastrointestinal cyangwa bafite ibibazo bisaba kuruhuka amara byuzuye, harimo no kubura amara, syndrome de mara, gastroschisis, impiswi ndende tutitaye kubitera, indwara ikomeye ya Crohn cyangwa colitis ulcerative colitis, hamwe nindwara zimwe na zimwe zabana ba GI harimo kuvuka kwa GI anomalies hamwe na enterocolitis enterocolitis. "}
{"id": "12952", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12952", "title": "BWACYE", "text": "Kwashiorkor KWOSH Bikekwa ko biterwa no gufata kalori ihagije, ariko hamwe no gukoresha proteine idahagije (cyangwa kubura proteine nziza), itandukanya na marasmus. Ubushakashatsi buherutse gukorwa bwerekanye ko kubura mikorobe ya antioxydeant nka \u03b2-karotene, lycopene, izindi karotenoide, na vitamine C kimwe no kuba aflatoxine ishobora kugira uruhare mu iterambere ry\u2019indwara. Ariko, impamvu nyayo itera kwashiorkor ntiramenyekana. Ibiribwa bidahagije bifitanye isano no kwashiorkor; kugaragara mubihugu byinjiza amafaranga menshi ntibisanzwe. Bibaho hagati yonsa abana bafite imyaka igera kuri itanu. \nIbintu bisa na kwashiorkor byanditswe neza kwisi yose mumateka. Icyakora, bo muri Jamayike, Cicely Williams, yatangije iryo jambo mu 1935, nyuma yimyaka ibiri atangaje ibisobanuro by\u2019indwara ya mbere. Williams niwe wambere wakoze ubushakashatsi kuri kwashiorkor no kuyitandukanya nubundi buke bwimirire. Niwe wambere watanze igitekerezo ko ibyo bishobora kuba bike bya poroteyine. Iri zina ryakomotse ku rurimi rwa Ga rwo ku nkombe za Gana, bisobanurwa ngo \"indwara umwana agira iyo umwana mushya aje\" cyangwa \"indwara y'umwana wimuwe\", kandi ikagaragaza iterambere ry'uburwayi ku mwana mukuru wabaye konsa kuva mu ibere iyo murumunawe aje. Amata yonsa arimo aside amine ingirakamaro mumikurire yumwana. Mu baturage bafite ibyago, kwashiorkor irashobora gukura nyuma yuko abana bonsa amata yonsa bagatangira kurya indyo yuzuye karubone, harimo ibigori, imyumbati cyangwa umuceri. \nIbyiciro.\nAbana bafite imirire mibi ikabije bafite ibyago byinshi byo kurwara no gupfa.\nKwashiorkor ni bumwe mu buryo nyamukuru bw\u2019imirire mibi yo mu bwana iba mu bihugu bikennye kandi byinjiza amafaranga make. Kwashiorkor ni kenshi byitwa imirire mibi ikabije (SAM). Ubwoko bukabije bwimirire mibi buramenyekana, harimo stunting, marasmus, na kwashiorkor. Kwashiorkor na marasmus byombi bigwa munsi yumutungo muto witwa protein - imirire mibi (PEM). Izi ndwara zikunze kuganirwaho hamwe, ariko zishobora gutandukanywa. Kwashiorkor ishyirwa mubikorwa na proteine idahagije mugihe marasmus ifitanye isano no kubura ingufu rusange no guta imitsi bikabije. Kwashiorkor nayo itandukanijwe na marasmus kuberako hari edema. Hariho na marasmic kwashiorkor aribwo kubura karori no muri proteyine. Nubwo byombi ari ubwoko butandukanye bwimirire mibi ikabije, habayeho kunywa cyane antioxydants, vitamine, namabuye y'agaciro bigaragara kubafite kwashiorkor ugereranije nabafite marasmus. \nIbyiciro bya Wellcome.\nIbyiciro bya Wellcome ni uburyo bwo gushyira mu byiciro imirire mibi ya protein-ingufu mu bana ukurikije uburemere bwimyaka yabo kandi bishingiye ku kuba hari indurwe. Ibindi byiciro birimo Gomez ishyirwa mubikorwa na Waterlow. \nIbimenyetso n'ibimenyetso.\nIkimenyetso gisobanura kwashiorkor mu mwana ufite imirire mibi ni (cyane cyane kubyimba amaboko n'ibirenge). Bitandukanye na, aho umwijima nizindi ngingo zingenzi zigabanuka mubunini, kwashiorkor irangwa n \"umwijima munini wumwijima, fibrosis, hamwe nudukorwa twingingo nyinshi (nk'umwijima, impyiko, na sisitemu y'imitsi)\". Ibindi bimenyetso birimo inda yagutse, kunanuka umusatsi, gutakaza amenyo, uruhu cyangwa umusatsi, hamwe na dermatite. Abana bafite kwashiorkor bakunze kurakara no kubura anorexia. Mubisanzwe, indwara irashobora kuvurwa hongerwamo proteine mumirire; icyakora, irashobora kugira ingaruka ndende kumikurire yumubiri no mubitekerezo byumwana, kandi mubihe bikomeye bishobora kuviramo urupfu. \nMu bihe byumye, marasmus nindwara zikunze kugaragara zijyanye nimirire mibi. Indi syndrome yimirire mibi irimo cachexia, nubwo akenshi iterwa nindwara zishingiye. Ibi nibitekerezo byingenzi mukuvura abantu bafite kwashiorkor. \nicyibitera.\nEtiologiya isobanutse ya kwashiorkor ntisobanutse neza. Hatanzwe ibitekerezo byinshi bifitanye isano no gusobanura bimwe, ariko ntabwo aribintu byose bigize pathophysiologiya ya kwashiorkor. Harimo, ariko ntibigarukira gusa kubura protein itera hypoalbuminemia, kubura aside amine, guhagarika umutima, no guhindura mikorobe yo mu nda. "}
{"id": "12953", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12953", "title": "Rwaka Claude", "text": "Rwaka Claude ni umwe mu bakinnyi bazwi mu Rwanda bakiniye iyi kipe nka La Jeunesse Fc, aho ubu asigaye uri umutoza w'ungirije nka muri Rayon Sports fc, Kiyovu sports, police Fc ndetse na Mukura V.S aho hose aba yungirije umutoza mukuru Haringingo Francis Christia ukomoka mu Burundi."}
{"id": "12954", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12954", "title": "Imikino yokwiruka", "text": "Imikino yo kwiruka ni itsinda ry'imikino irimo kwiruka, gusimbuka, guta, no kugenda. Ubwoko bw'imikino ngororamubiri ikunze kugaragara ni kwiruka, no gusiganwa ku maguru.\nbisubizo by'ibirori byo bigenwa no kurangiza umwanya (cyangwa igihe, aho bipimye), mugihe gusimbuka no gutera byatsinzwe ugera kubipimo byo hejuru cyangwa kure cyane uhereye kubigerageza. Ubworoherane bw'amarushanwa, no kubura ibikoresho bihenze, bituma siporo imwe mu ubwoko bwa siporo ikunze kugaragara ku isi. Imikino ngororamubiri ahanini ni siporo ku giti cye, usibye gusiganwa ku marushanwa n'amarushanwa ahuza ibikorwa by'abakinnyi ku manota y'amakipe, nka cross country.mikino ngororamubiri yateguwe kuva mu kuva 776 mbere ya Yesu. Amategeko n'imiterere y'ibihe bigezweho muri siporo byasobanuwe mu Burayi bw'i Burengerazuba no muri Amerika y'Amajyaruguru mu kinyejana cya 19 no mu ntangiriro z'ikinyejana cya 20, hanyuma bikwira mu bindi bice by'isi. Amateraniro menshi yo murwego rwo hejuru agezweho abera ayobowe na World Athletisme, urwego nyobozi ku isi ya siporo yimikino ngororamubiri, cyangwa abanyamuryango bayo ku mugabane wa federasiyo ndetse n\u2019igihugu. \nInama y'imikino ngororamubiri niyo nkingi y'imikino. Inama mpuzamahanga ya mbere yimikino ngororamubiri ni Shampiyona yisi yimikino ngororamubiri, ikubiyemo gusiganwa ku maguru, kwiruka muri marato no kugenda n'amasiganwa. Andi marushanwa yo ku rwego rwo hejuru mu mikino ngororamubiri arimo Shampiyona y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri ku isi ndetse na Shampiyona yisi ya Marathon. Abakinnyi bafite ubumuga bwumubiri barushanwe mu mikino Paralympike yo mu mpeshyi na Shampiyona y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri.\nIjambo siporo ryakomotse ku kigereki cya kera (athl\u0113t\u0113s, \"umurwanyi mumikino rusange\") (athlon, \"igihembo\") cyangwa (athlos, \"amarushanwa\"). Ku ikubitiro, ijambo ryasobanuye amarushanwa ya siporo muri rusange - ni ukuvuga amarushanwa ya siporo ashingiye cyane cyane kubikorwa byumubiri byabantu. Mu kinyejana cya 19, ijambo siporo ryabonye ibisobanuro bigufi mu Burayi kandi biza gusobanura siporo irimo kwiruka mu marushanwa, kugenda, gusimbuka no guta. Ubu busobanuro bukomeje kugaragara mu Bwongereza no mu cyahoze ari. Amagambo ajyanye n'indimi z'ikidage na romance nayo afite ibisobanuro bisa.\nAhenshi muri Amerika ya ruguru, \"siporo ngororamubiri\" ni kimwe na siporo muri rusange, ikomeza gukoresha amateka y'iryo jambo. Ijambo \"siporo ngororamubiri\" rikoreshwa gake mu kwerekana siporo ngororamubiri muri kano karere. \"Umukino wo\" gusiganwa ku maguru urakunzwe, kandi ukoreshwa muri Amerika na Kanada mu kwerekana imikino ngororamubiri, harimo kugenda n'amasiganwa no kwiruka muri marato (nubwo kwiruka mu bihugu bisanzwe bifatwa nk'imikino itandukanye). \nAmateka.\nKera.\nAmarushanwa y'imikino ngororamubiri mu kwiruka, kugenda, gusimbuka no guta biri mu bya kera cyane mu mikino yose kandi imizi yabyo ni. Ibirori by'imikino ngororamubiri byerekanwe mu mva za i, hamwe n'amashusho yo mu iserukiramuco rya Heb Sed no kugaragara mu mva guhera mu 2250 mbere ya Yesu. yari umunsi mukuru wa kera w\u2019abaselite muri Irilande, washinzwe ahagana mu 1800 mbere ya Yesu, kandi inama yiminsi mirongo itatu yarimo kwiruka no gutera amabuye mumikino yabyo. Ibirori byumwimerere kandi byonyine mumikino olempike yambere muri 776 mbere ya Yesu byari ibirori byo kwiruka kuri stade bizwi nka \"stadion\". Ibi nyuma byaragutse birimo gushiramo no gusimbuka ibyabaye muri pentathlon ya kera. Amarushanwa y'imikino ngororamubiri yabereye no mu yindi mikino ya Panhellenic, yashinzwe nyuma ya 500 mbere ya Yesu. "}
{"id": "12955", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12955", "title": "Uwimana Jean d\u2018Amour", "text": "Uwimana Jean d\u2018Amour yavutse 26 ukwakira 1988, yavukiye mu mujyi wa Kigali, ni umwe mu bakinnyi bazwi mu Rwanda bakiniye iyi kipe nka La Jeunesse Fc, aho yakinnye mu ikipe y'igihugu yu Rwanda \"Amavubi\", akabaya yarakiniye amakipe atandukanya nka Police Fc, Kiyovu Sports, Rayon Sports fc, A.S Kigali, ATRACO FC. akaba yarakinnye imikino ya CECAFA ndetse nindi y'agicuti y'ikipe y'igihugu. "}
{"id": "12956", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12956", "title": "Erik Spoelstra", "text": "Erik Spoelstra, yavutse1Ku ya 1 Ugushyingo 1970 i, ni umutoza wa basketball. Kuri ubu ni umutoza wa francise ya. Niwe Munyamerika wambere watoje ikipe (NBA) kandi yegukana igikombe cya.\nKuva mu 2001 kugeza 2008, Spoelstra yari umutoza wungirije hamwe na Heat franchise, mbere yo kuzamurwa nk'umutoza mukuru. Aherekejwe na Chris Bosh, LeBron James na DwyaWade, yagaragaye inshuro 4 zikurikirana muri kuva kugeza, yegukana ibikombe 2 muri na.\nUbuzima bwahambere.\nSpoelstra yamaze ubuzima bwe i, muri, nyuma i. Spoelstra yize mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Jesuit iBeaverton, aho yitwaye neza nk'umuzamu w'ikipe ya basketball Yambara numero 30 mumashuri yisumbuye nyuma akaza muri kaminuza mucyubahiro Terry Porter, umwe mubakinnyi akunda Mbere y\u2019umwaka we mukuru, Spoelstra yagiye mu kigo cya Nike All-Star cya Sonny Vaccaro i Princeton, ari kumwe n\u2019abakinnyi bazaza nka Alonzo Mourning, Shawn Kemp, Billy Owens, na Bobby Hurley \nSpoelstra yahawe buruse, amaherezo yemera kujya muri, mu mujyi yavukiyemo. Yagereranije amanota 9.2, afasha 4.4, na reba 2,4 kuri buri mukino. Ni umunyamuryango wa club amanota 1000 kandi ni umuyobozi mubyiciro byinshi byibarurishamibare Spoelstra yabonye impamyabumenyi mu itumanaho.\nAmaze kubona impamyabumenyi, yahawe akazi maze amara imyaka ibiri mu cyiciro cya kabiri cya Shampiyona ya Basketball mu Budage nk'umutoza-wungirije w\u2019umukinnyi wungirije wa TuS Herten, ikipe y\u2019umukino wa Basketball wabigize umwuga mu Budage ifite icyicaro i Westphalie, mu Budage. Ni muri urwo rwego Spoelstra yabonye akazi ke ka mbere ko gutoza, nk'umutoza w'ikipe y'urubyiruko yaho. Yatangiye kugira ibibazo byumugongo arangije umwaka wa kabiri. Mu 1995, Spoelstra yahawe andi masezerano yimyaka ibiri niyi kipe, ariko Miami Heat nayo yamuhaye akazi."}
