{"id": "12976", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12976", "title": "Ingaruka Zitabi", "text": "Kunywa itabi bigira ingaruka mbi cyane kubuzima bwabantu no guhangayikishwa n'ingaruka z'ubuzima bwi'tabi bifite amateka maremare. Ubushakashatsi bwibanze ahanini ku kunywa itabi. Umwotsi w'itabi urimo. Itabi ririmo kandi, ikaba ari ibiyobyabwenge byangiza cyane. Iyo itabi rinyweye, nikotine itera kwishingikiriza kumubiri no mubitekerezo. Itabi rigurishwa mu bihugu bitaratera imbere usanga rifite ibipimo byinshi, kandi ntibishobora kuyungurura, bikaba byongera ingaruka ziterwa n\u2019itabi ry\u2019indwara ziterwa n\u2019itabi muri utwo turere. Kunywa itabi nimwe mu mpamvu zikomeye ku isi. Hafi ya kimwe cya kabiri cyabantu bakoresha itabi bapfa bazize ingorane zo gukoresha itabi. Ishami ry'Umuryango w'Abibumbye ryita ku Buzima (OMS) rivuga ko buri mwaka itabi ritera impfu zigera kuri miliyoni 6 (hafi 10% by'impfu zose) hamwe 600.000 muri zo zikaba ziboneka mu batanywa itabi kubera umwotsi w\u2019itabi. Bivugwa ko itabi ryahitanye abantu miliyoni 100 mu kinyejana cya 20. Muri ubwo buryo, Ikigo cyo muri Leta zunze ubumwe z\u2019Amerika gishinzwe kurwanya no gukumira indwara kivuga ko ikoreshwa ry\u2019itabi ari \"imwe mu ngaruka zikomeye zishobora kwirindwa ku buzima bw\u2019abantu mu bihugu byateye imbere ndetse n\u2019impamvu ikomeye y\u2019urupfu rutaragera ku isi.\" Kugeza ubu, umubare w'abantu bapfa imburagihe muri Amerika bazize kunywa itabi ku mwaka uruta umubare w'abakozi bakoreshwa mu nganda z'itabi kuri 4 kugeza kuri 1. Nk\u2019uko byagaragajwe mu mwaka wa 2014 mu \"\", itabi rizahitana abantu bagera kuri miliyari imwe mu kinyejana cya 21 niba ubu itabi rikomeje, kimwe cya kabiri cyabo mbere y\u2019imyaka 70.\nKumenyekanisha.\nMu 1953, abahanga bo mu kigo cya mu mujyi wa New York berekanye ko itabi ry\u2019itabi ryanditswe ku ruhu rw'imbeba ryateye kanseri yica. Iki gikorwa cyashimishije cyane itangazamakuru; ikinyamakuru \"New York Times\" \"n'Ubuzima\" byombi byagaragaje ikibazo. \"Umusomyi Digest\" yasohoye ingingo yise \"Kanseri na Carton\". Ku ya 11 Mutarama 1964, Raporo bwa Leta zunze ubumwe z\u2019Amerika yashyizwe ahagaragara; ibi byatumye abantu babarirwa muri za miriyoni banywa itabi ryabanyamerika bareka, kubuza kwamamaza bimwe, hamwe nibisabwa kubirango biburira ibicuruzwa byitabi. Ibisubizo byemerwa bwa mbere mu buvuzi, kandi bitangazwa mu baturage muri rusange, hagati ya za 1960. Umuryango w\u2019abaganga wanze igitekerezo kivuga ko itabi ryateje indwara ryatewe no kubogama kw\u2019abaganga baterwa na nikotine, agashya k\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019imihindagurikire y'ikirere ikenewe kugira ngo hakoreshwe uburyo bwa epidemiologi na heuristique ku ndwara zitandura, ndetse n\u2019igitutu cy\u2019inganda z\u2019itabi.\nIngaruka zubuzima bwitabi zagize uruhare runini mugutezimbere siyanse ya. Nkuko uburyo bwa kanseri butera cyangwa radiologiya, ingaruka zirakomeye. Ibisobanuro bisobanutse birashobora gutangwa gusa kubijyanye no kwiyongera cyangwa kugabanuka amahirwe yo kwandura indwara runaka. Ku muntu runaka, ntibishoboka kwerekana byimazeyo isano iri hagati yo guhura nuburozi bwa radiomimetike nkumwotsi w itabi na kanseri ikurikira; imvugo nkiyi irashobora gutangwa gusa kurwego rusange rwabaturage. Amasosiyete y\u2019itabi yifashishije iyi myumvire ya filozofiya kandi akoresha ugushidikanya kw\u2019abaganga batekereza ko ari abantu ku giti cyabo, ku isano iterwa no kwerekana uburozi nk\u2019indwara nyirizina.\nUbushinwa bufite abaturage benshi banywa itabi, bukurikirwa n'Ubuhinde. Ubuhinde bufite abaturage benshi bahekenya itabi ku isi. Abantu 154 bapfa buri saha mu Buhinde bazira itabi. \nIngaruka zubuzima bwitabi.\nKunywa itabi bikunze gutera indwara zifata umutima kandi bikunze kwibasira ahantu nk'amaboko cyangwa ibirenge. Ibimenyetso bya mbere by\u2019ibibazo by\u2019ubuzima bijyanye n\u2019itabi bikunze kugaragara nko kunanirwa ku mpera, aho kunywa itabi ari byo bintu nyamukuru bitera, (COPD), na, cyane cyane kanseri y'ibihaha, kanseri yo mu muhogo na umunwa, na kanseri y'urwagashya. Muri rusange icyizere cyo kubaho nacyo kigabanuka mubanywa itabi igihe kirekire, ugereranije ko kuva kumyaka 10 kugeza 17.9 ugereranije nabatanywa itabi. Hafi ya kimwe cya kabiri cyigihe kirekire cyitabi ryabagabo bazapfa bazize indwara kubera itabi. Ihuriro ryitabi na kanseri yibihaha rirakomeye, haba mubitekerezo bya rubanda ndetse na etiologique. Mu banywi b'itabi b'abagabo, ibyago byo kubaho kwa kanseri y'ibihaha ni 17.2%; mu banywi b'itabi b'abagore, ibyago ni 11,6%. Izi ngaruka ziri hasi cyane kubatanywa itabi: 1,3% kubagabo na 1.4% kubagore. "}
{"id": "12977", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12977", "title": "Muhire Hassan", "text": "Muhire Hassan yatangiye gutoza umupira w'amaguru muri 1998, yatoje amakipe atandukanye nka Kiyovu sports, Enticelles Fc, Ur Fc, Kist Fc, Gasabo Fc, Bugesera Fc, Miroplast Fc, Rugende Fc yatoje ikipe y'igihugu y'batarengeje imyaka 20 muri 2007 ubwo yungirije umutoza Roger Parmergren, ni umwe mubatoza bane bagiye bwa mbere mu mahugurwa y'ubutoza mu gihugu cyu Budage ku mugabane w'i Burayi ari kumwe na Seninga Innocent utoza Sunrise Fc, Habimana Sostene na Mashami Vincent."}
{"id": "12978", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12978", "title": "Ubuzima Bwamenyo Murirusange", "text": "Ubuzima bw'amenyo rusange aribwo Dental Public Health(DPH) mundimi zamahanga ni para-clinique yihariye bujyanye no gukumira indwara zo mu kanwa no guteza imbere ubuzima bwo mu kanwa. Ubuzima rusange bw'amenyo bugira uruhare mugusuzuma ibikenerwa byubuzima bw amenyo kandi bikazana ibisubizo bifatika byateza imbere ubuzima bw amenyo yabaturage aho kuba abantu kugiti cyabo. Ubuzima rusange bw'amenyo burashaka kugabanya ibisabwa muri sisitemu yubuzima hifashishijwe uburyo bwo kohereza umutungo mu bice byihutirwa. Ibihugu ku isi byose bihura nibibazo bisa bijyanye n'indwara z'amenyo. Ishyirwa mu bikorwa rya politiki n'amahame biratandukanye bitewe no kubona \nibikoresho. Kimwe nubuzima rusange, gusobanukirwa nibintu byinshi bigira ingaruka kubuzima bizafasha gushyira mubikorwa ingamba zifatika.\nIndwara ziterwa n amenyo zirashobora kwirindwa cyane. Ubuvuzi bw'amenyo rusange bukorwa muri rusange binyuze muri gahunda zatewe inkunga na leta, zikaba ahanini zerekeza ku bana bo mu mashuri ya Leta bizera ko imyigire yabo mu isuku yo mu ari yo nzira nziza yo kugera ku baturage muri rusange. Icyitegererezo kuri gahunda nk'izo mu bihe byashize ni abakora amenyo basura buri mwaka ku ishuri kugira ngo batange ibiganiro kandi berekane uburyo bukwiye bwo koza amenyo. Mu myaka ya za 70, hagaragaye gahunda irambuye. Harimo icyumweru cy'isaha imwe yo kwigisha, kwerekana, n'ibibazo n'ibisubizo, bikozwe na muganga w'amenyo n'umufasha w'amenyo kandi bafashijwe na mwarimu wari warahawe amasaha menshi yo kwigisha. Ikoreshwa ryakozwe kandi muri gahunda yo kwigisha amenyo yubuzima bw'amenyo kuri tereviziyo, ababyeyi bashishikarijwe kuyubahiriza.\nIbikorwa.\nIkigo cy\u2019Abanyamerika gishinzwe ubuzima bw\u2019amenyo (ABDPH) cyateguye urutonde rwubushobozi bwinzobere mu buzima bw\u2019amenyo rusange bagomba gukurikiza. Inzobere mu buzima bw'amenyo ni itsinda ryatoranijwe ry\u2019amenyo yemewe. Ubushobozi icumi butuma iterambere no kwigira kubantu no gushyiraho ibizaba ejo hazaza. Ibyiza byo gushushanya nuko bishyirwa mubikorwa kurwego rwisi. Urutonde ruvugururwa buri gihe. "}
{"id": "12979", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=12979", "title": "AMASO", "text": "Ibara ry'ijisho ni ya igenwa n'ibintu bibiri bitandukanye: pigmentation y'imboni ry'ijisho, hamwe n'inshuro biterwa no umucyo ukoresheje uburyo bwa turbid muri. Mu bantu, pigmentation y'imboni ry'iisho iratandukanye kuva mubururu bwijimye ugahinduka umukara bitewe n'ubunini bwa muri epitelium ya iris pigment (iherereye inyuma ya iris). Ibirimo melanin biri muri stroma (irimo imbere y'imboni ry'ijisho), hamwe n'ubucucike bwa selile ya troma. Kugaragara kw'amaso y'ubururu, icyatsi, na hazel biva muri urumuri muri troma, ibintu bisa nk'ibibara ubururu bw'ikirere bwitwa. Ntabwo ibara ry'ubururu cyangwa icyatsi kiboneka muri iris ya muntu cyangwa amazi ya ocular. Ibara ry'ijisho rero ni urugero rw'ibara ry'imiterere kandi riratandukanye bitewe n'uburyo bwo kumurika, cyane cyane ku maso y'amabara yoroshye.Amaso afite amabara meza y'ubwoko bwinshi bw'inyoni aturuka ku kuba hari izindi pigment nka, na. Abantu n'andi matungo bifite fenotipiki itandukanye mu buryo bw'amaso.\nGenetic.\nIbara ryijisho ni uruhererekane rukomoka ku turemangingo dutandukanye. Utu turemangingo dushakishwa hifashishijwe amashyirahamwe kugira ngo yihindure mato mato ubwayo no muturemangingo bituranye. Izi mpinduka zizwi nka polymorphism imwe-nucleotide imwe cyangwa SNPs. Umubare nyawo w'uturemangingo ugira uruhare mu ibara ry'amaso nturamenyekana, ariko hari abakandida bake. Ubushakashatsi bwakorewe i Rotterdam (2009) bwerekanye ko bishoboka guhanura ibara ry'amaso hamwe n\u2019ibice birenga 90% byukuri byijimye ni ubururu ukoresheje SNP esheshatu gusa. Hariho ibimenyetso byerekana ko uturemangingo tugera kuri 16 dushobora kuba nyirabayazana w'amaso y'abantu, icyakora, Uturemangingo tubiri nyamukuru tujyanye no guhinduranya amabara y'amaso ni ' na ', kandi byombi biherereye muri Chromosome 15. \nGuhindura ibara ry'amaso.\nAbana benshi bavutse bafite ibisekuruza by'abanyaburayi bafite amaso yibara. Mugihe umwana akura, melanocytes (selile ziboneka mumatwi y'umuntu, kimwe n'uruhu n'umusatsi) bitangira kubyara. Kuberako melanocyte selile ikomeza kubyara pigment, mubitekerezo ibara ry'amaso rishobora guhinduka. Ibara ry'amaso akuze rishyirwaho hagati y'amezi 3 na 6 y'amavuko, nubwo ibi bishobora kuba nyuma. Kurebera imboni y'ijisho ry'umwana kuva ku ruhande ukoresheje urumuri rwanduye gusa ntirugaragaze inyuma y'imboni, birashoboka kumenya ahari melanine nkeya cyangwa aho zitari. Imboni y'ijisho igaragara mubururu muri ubu buryo bwo kwitegereza birashoboka cyane kuguma ari ubururu uko uruhinja rukura.Imboni igaragara nka zahabu irimo melanine ndetse no muri iyi myaka mike kandi birashoboka ko izahinduka ubururu igahinduka icyatsi cyangwa hazel nkuko uruhinja rugenda rukura."}
