{"id": "13009", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13009", "title": "Ibicurane", "text": "Ibicurane bisanzwe, bizwi kandi nk'ibicurane, ni indwara yandura iterwa na virusi mu gice cyo hejuru cy'ubuhumekero, ikaba yibasira cyane cyane izuru. Umuhogo, sinuses, na larynx nabyo bishobora kwangizwa. Ibimenyetso bishobora kugaragara mu minsi itarenze ibiri nyuma yo kwandura virusi. Ibi bishobora kuba birimo gukorora, kubabara mu muhogo, kuva mu mazuru, kwitsamura, kuribwa umutwe, n'umuriro. Abantu basanzwe bakira mu minsi irindwi kugeza ku icumi, ariko ibimenyetso bimwe na bimwe bishobora kumara ibyumweru bitatu. Hari igihe abafite ibindi bibazo by'ubuzima bashobora kurwara umusonga.\nUbwoko bwa virusi zirenga 200 nizo zitera ibicurane bisanzwe, aho virusi z'inkura ari zo zikunze kugaragara cyane. Bikwirakwira mu kirere, akenshi iyo bihuye n'abantu banduye, cyangwa mu buryo butaziguye binyuze mu gukora ku bintu biri mu bidukikije, hanyuma bigashyirwa mu kanwa cyangwa mu mazuru. Ibintu bishobora gutera ingorane birimo kujya mu bigo byita ku bana, kudasinzira neza, no guhangayika mu mutwe. Ibimenyetso ahanini biterwa n\u2019uko ubudahangarwa bw\u2019umubiri butera kwandura aho guterwa n\u2019ubwandu bwa virusi ubwazo. Ibimenyetso bya grippe bisa n'iby'ibicurane, nubwo akenshi biba bikomeye cyane kandi ntibikunze kuba birimo no kuva izuru riva.\nNta rukingo rw'ibicurane bisanzwe ruhari. Uburyo bw'ibanze bwo kwirinda ni ugukaraba intoki; kudakora ku maso, ku mazuru cyangwa mu kanwa n'intoki zitakarabye; no kwirinda kwegera abarwayi. Hari ibimenyetso bimwe bishyigikira ikoreshwa ry'udupfukamunwa. Nta gipimo gihari cyo kugabanya igihe cy'indwara, ariko ibimenyetso birashobora kuvurwa. Zinc bishobora kugabanya ubukana bw'ibimenyetso iyo bitangiye nyuma gato y'uko ibimenyetso bitangiye. Imiti igabanya ububabare itari iya steroide (NSAIDs) nka ibuprofen ishobora gufasha mu kugabanya ububabare. Nyamara, imiti igabanya ubukana bw'indwara zandura ntigomba gukoreshwa, kandi nta kimenyetso gifatika kigaragaza ko imiti y'inkorora igira akamaro.\nIbicurane ni indwara yandura ikunze kugaragara mu bantu. Umuntu mukuru asanzwe arwara ibicurane bibiri cyangwa bitatu mu mwaka, mu gihe umwana asanzwe ashobora kurwara ibicurane bitandatu kugeza ku munani. Kwandura indwara akenshi bibaho mu gihe cy'itumba. Izi ndwara zabayeho mu mateka y'abantu. "}
{"id": "13010", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13010", "title": "Igituntu", "text": "Igituntu ni indwara y\u2019igikatu iterwa na bagiteri yitwa Mycobacterium tuberculosis. Iyi bagiteri yibasira ubusanzwe ibihaha, ariko na none ishobora gukwirakwira mu mubiri inyuze mu maraso no mu yandi matembabuzi, ikaba yakwangiza izindi ngingo nk\u2019impyiko, urutirigongo cyangwa ubwonko. \n= amashakiro ="}
{"id": "13011", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13011", "title": "Mikonazole", "text": "Mikonazole ni umuti uvura indwara ziterwa na mikorobi zo mu bwoko bw\u2019imiyege (champignons/fungi). Uyu muti uzwi no ku izina rya Daktarin.\nUyu muti uboneka mu buryo butandukanye harimo umuti w\u2019ifu, uw\u2019amavuta, uw\u2019amazi, kimwe n\u2019ibinini bishyirwa mu gitsina. gusa muri ayo moko yose uyu muti ubonekamo nta na bumwe bunyobwa/bunyuzwa mu kanwa"}
{"id": "13012", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13012", "title": "Coartem", "text": "Coartem (soma: Kwaritemu) ni umuti ukozwe n\u00edmiti ibiri ariyo Artemeteri (Artemether) na rimenfatirine (Lumefantrine). kwaritemu ni izina ry'\u00faruganda rwahawe uru rukomatane rw\u00edyi miti ibiri. urwo ruganda rwitwa NOVARTIS ruherereye ku mugabane w'\u00edburayi mu gihugu cy'Ubusuwisi. \nUyu muti uboneka mu buryo bw'\u00edbinini gusa bikaba bivura malariya kuva ku bana bapima ibiro 5 kugeza ku bakuru "}
{"id": "13013", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13013", "title": "Indwara y'Ibibari", "text": "Ibibari ni ubumuga bufata umwana akiri mu nda ya nyina kuko biravukanwa. ubu bumuga bufata igice cyo hejuru cy\u2019umunwa hagasaduka. \n= ibyiciro by'indwara =\nIbibari birimo ibice bitatu: \nUbu bumuga usanga butera ipfunwe uwabuvukanye, nyamara ni ubumuga bukosorwa umuntu agakira, by\u2019umwihariko iyo avuwe hakiri kare.\n= Ibitera iyi ndwara =\nNta mpamvu ihamye izwi yaba itera ibibari nta n\u00faburyo buzwi umuntu ashobora kubirinda umwana azabyara, ariko hari ibintu byongera ibyago byo kubyara umwana ufite ibibari. Aha twavuga:\n= Amashakiro ="}
{"id": "13014", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13014", "title": "Dicynone", "text": "Dicynone (soma; disinone), ni umuti ugizwe na Etamsylate, wakorewe kugabanya igihe umuntu amara ava ndetse ukanagufasha gukama vuba. uyu muti ukoreshwa akenshi n'abagore bari mu mihango yanze gukama, nyamara uyu muti sicyo wakorewe gusa. \nUyu muti ushobora no gukoreshwa haba mbere cyangwa nyuma yo kubagwa cyane cyane inyama zo mu nda, gukurwa amenyo, kubagwa ubyara,Gukorora hakazamo amaraso,kuruka amaraso, ishinya iva, kuva mu mazuru ntukamen\u2019ahandi biboneka ko imitsi iri bukomereke ari myinshi\nDicynone iboneka ari ibinini bipfundikiye bya 250mg na 500mg cyangwa umuti uterwa mu rushinge ukaba ari 250mg/2ml "}
