{"id": "13017", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13017", "title": "Ikigo nderabuzima", "text": "Ikigo nderabuzima, muri rusange, ahantu hose hatangirwa ubuvuzi. Ibigo nderabuzima biva ku mato no kugeza ku bigo byita ndetse binini bifite n\u2019ibigo by\u2019ihungabana. Umubare nubwiza bwibigo nderabuzima mu gihugu cyangwa mu karere ni kimwe mu bipimo rusange byerekana ko ako karere gatera imbere n\u2019ubuzima bwiza. Mu bihugu byinshi, ibigo nderabuzima bigengwa ku rugero runaka n\u2019amategeko; uruhushya rwikigo gishinzwe kugenzura rusabwa akenshi mbere yuko ikigo gishobora gufungura ubucuruzi. Ibigo nderabuzima birashobora gutunga no gukoreshwa nubucuruzi bugamije inyungu, imiryango idaharanira inyungu, guverinoma, ndetse rimwe na rimwe n\u2019abantu ku giti cyabo, ibipimo bitandukanye bitewe n\u2019igihugu. Reba kandi impapuro zisubiramo ziherutse, \nIbikorwa byubuzima.\nImirimo yikigo nderabuzima ikoreshwa kenshi kugirango yerekane ubunini bwayo. Ibigo nderabuzima binini nibyo bifite umutwaro munini w'abarwayi.Muri Ositaraliya akazi k'ikigo nderabuzima gakoreshwa mu kumenya urwego rw'inkunga ya leta ihabwa icyo kigo. Guverinoma ipima ikigo (cyangwa imyitozo yubuzima) ukurikije ibipimo bisanzwe by\u2019abarwayi bose (SWPE). Kubara SWPE bigenwa nisesengura ryabarwayi bitabira icyo kigo. Kubara hitabwa ku kigereranyo cya serivisi z'ubuzima (mu madorari) yatanzwe kuri icyo kigo ugereranije n'abandi buri murwayi yitabira. Harimo ibintu biremereye bishingiye kuri buri barwayi demografiya kugirango babaze urwego rutandukanye rwa serivisi zisabwa n'abarwayi bitewe n'uburinganire n'imyaka yabo. Ikibanza cyo kuremera ni uko abarwayi bakeneye serivisi zitandukanye zubuzima bitewe nimyaka yabo nuburinganire. Kurugero, impuzandengo yumurwayi wumugabo isaba inama nke ugereranije na bakuru be nimpinja. Imbonerahamwe yerekana ibintu biremereye bikoreshwa muguhuza imirimo.\nUbwoko bwikigo nderabuzima.\nIbitaro.\nIbitaro ni ikigo cyita kubuzima gitanga ubuvuzi bwihariye (cyangwa nijoro). Ibitaro bimwe byakira cyane cyane abarwayi bafite cyangwa ububabare runaka, cyangwa bigenewe gusuzuma no kuvura indwara zifata imyaka runaka. Abandi bafite manda yaguka irenze gutanga serivisi zita kubuvuzi no gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe kugira uruhare mu kuzamura, gukumira no kwigisha mu rwego rw'ubuvuzi bw'ibanze. Muri iki gihe, ibitaro ubusanzwe biterwa inkunga na leta, imiryango y\u2019ubuzima (cyangwa idaharanira inyungu), n\u2019ubwishingizi bw\u2019ubuzima cyangwa n\u2019abagiraneza ndetse n\u2019impano. Amateka ariko, akenshi yashinzwe kandi agaterwa inkunga namategeko y\u2019amadini cyangwa abantu n\u2019abagiraneza n\u2019abayobozi. Muri iki gihe ibitaro bikorerwamo n'abaganga, abaforomo, abaganga b'inkeragutabara babigize umwuga, n'ibindi, mu gihe mu mateka, ubusanzwe iki gikorwa cyakorwaga n'amabwiriza ashingiye ku idini cyangwa abakorerabushake.\nIkigo nderabuzima.\nIbigo nderabuzima, birimo, ibigo byita n\u2019ibigo nderabuzima bya, bibera umwanya wa mbere w\u2019inzobere mu buzima kandi bitanga ubuvuzi bw\u2019ubuvuzi, ubuforomo, amenyo, n\u2019ubundi bwoko bwa serivisi zita ku barwayi. \nLaboratoire y'ubuvuzi n'ubushakashatsi.\nLaboratoire yubuvuzi cyangwa laboratoire ni ikorerwa ibizamini ku ngero z\u2019ibinyabuzima hagamijwe kubona amakuru y\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019umurwayi. Laboratwari nk'izo zishobora kugabanywamo amashami atandukanye nka mikorobe, indwara ya hematologiya, ibinyabuzima by\u2019ubuvuzi, immunologiya, serologiya, amateka y\u2019amateka, cytologiya, cytogenetike, cyangwa virusi. Mu bihugu byinshi, hari ubwoko bubiri bwingenzi bwa laboratoire itunganya ubwinshi bwubuvuzi. Laboratoire y'ibitaro ifatanye n'ibitaro, kandi ikora ibizamini kuri aba barwayi. Laboratoire yigenga cyangwa iy'abaturage yakira ingero z'abakora ibikorwa rusange, amasosiyete y'ubwishingizi, n'andi mavuriro y\u2019ubuzima kugira ngo babisesengure.\n= Referances ="}
{"id": "13018", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13018", "title": "Ishusho ya Michael Jackson", "text": "Michael Jackson (29 Kanama 1958 - 25 Kamena 2009) yari umunyamerika wishimisha yamaze imyaka isaga mirongo ine mumaso ya rubanda, abanza kuba umwana wumwana hamwe nyuma akaza kuba umuhanzi wenyine. Kuva mu myaka ya za 1980 rwagati, isura ya Jackson yatangiye guhinduka cyane. Impinduka mu maso ye, cyane cyane izuru rye, zatumye abantu benshi bavuga ko babaga, kandi uruhu rwe rwabaye rworoshye. Yasuzumwe indwara ya y'uruhu, bivamo ibara ryera ku ruhu no kumva izuba. Kugira ngo avure iyo ndwara, yakoresheje maquillage y'amabara meza kandi birashoboka ko amavuta kugira ngo ahishe ibara ritaringaniye riterwa n'uburwayi. Amavuta yari kurushaho kumworohereza uruhu. Uruhu rworoheje rwamuviriyemo kunenga ko yashakaga kugaragara cyera. Jackson yavuze ko atigeze abuza uruhu rwe nkana kandi ko atagerageje kuba ikintu cyose atari cyo. \nJackson na bamwe muri barumuna be bavuze ko bahohotewe ku mubiri no mu mutwe na se. Mu 2003, Joe yemeye ko yabakubise akiri abana, ariko yanze yivuye inyuma ibirego by'ihohoterwa bimaze igihe kirekire. Ibiboko byahahamutse cyane Jackson kandi birashobora kuba byaratumye havuka ibindi bibazo byubuzima nyuma yubuzima bwe. Abaganga bakekaga ko afite. \nIgihe kimwe mu myaka ya za 90, byagaragaye ko Jackson yari yarabashingiye ku miti yandikiwe, cyane cyane imiti igabanya ububabare ndetse n\u2019imiti ikomeye. Nyuma yo gukoresha ibiyobyabwenge byahujwe no gutwika icyiciro cya kabiri n'icya gatatu yari afite imyaka myinshi mbere. Buhoro buhoro Jackson yagiye atungwa nibi biyobyabwenge, ubuzima bwe burangirika. Yagiye mu buzima busanzwe mu 1993. \nImpinduka Ry 'Ibara ry'uruhu Rwa Jackson.\nUruhu rwa Jackson rwari rwijimye-rwijimye mu busore bwe, ariko guhera mu myaka ya za 1980 rwagati rwakuze. Ihinduka ryatangaje ibitangazamakuru byinshi, harimo no kuvuga ko yaba. Inzobere mu kuvura indwara z\u2019uruhu rwa Jackson, Arnold Klein, yavuze ko mu 1983 yabonye ko Jackson yari afite, indwara yaranzwe n\u2019ibibyimba by\u2019uruhu bitakaza pigment. Yagaragaje kandi discoid lupus erythematosus muri Jackson. Yasuzumye Jackson indwara ya lupus muri uwo mwaka, na vitiligo mu 1986. Ingaruka zikomeye za Vitiligo ku mubiri zirashobora gutera intimba. Jackson yakoresheje maquillage yamabara meza, kandi birashoboka ko amavuta yanduza uruhu, kugirango ahishe ibara ritaringaniye ryatewe nuburwayi. Amavuta yari kurushaho kumworohereza uruhu, kandi, hamwe no kwisiga, yashoboraga kugaragara neza. [13] Impamvu ya vitiligo ntiramenyekana, ariko bikekwa ko biterwa no kwandura ingirabuzima fatizo ziterwa n\u2019ibidukikije ku buryo indwara ya autoimmune ibaho. Taraborrelli yavuze ko lupus iri mubisubizo. \nImpinduka z'umubiri za Jackson zamenyekanye cyane mu bitangazamakuru kandi bituma abantu banengwa. Bamwe mu bahanga mu by'imitekerereze y'Abanyafurika n'Abanyamerika bavuze ko Jackson ari \"urugero rwiza ku rubyiruko rw'abirabura\". Dr. Dennis Chestnut yavuze ko Jackson yahaye \"urubyiruko rw'abirabura kumva ko bashobora kugeraho\", ariko ko ashobora kubashishikariza kwizera ko bagomba kuba abanyamurwango kandi batagira ubwenge. Dr. Halford Fairchild yavuze ko Jackson n'abandi byamamare bo muri Afurika n'Abanyamerika bazagerageza \"kumera nk'abazungu kugira ngo babone filime no kuri televiziyo\". Jackson nawe yagiye ahura nigisubizo cyabantu bamukikije. Umukinnyi wa filime John Landis, wayoboye Jackson amashusho abiri y\u2019indirimbo, yavuze ko igihe Jackson yamweretse igituza cye cyahumanye, amubwira ko umuganga wabikoze ari umunyabyaha. \nUbuzima bwumubiri.\nMu ntangiriro za 1984, umusatsi Jackson wafashwe n'inkongi y'umuriro mu gihe cyo kurasa mu bucuruzi. Jackson yavuze ko inkongi y'umuriro yatewe n'ibisasu bya magnesium flash ibisasu biturika kuri metero ebyiri gusa uvuye ku mpande z'umutwe we, birengagije rwose amategeko y'umutekano. Nyuma y'uwo munsi, ibitaro byatangaje ko Jackson ameze neza kandi ko akora neza. Umuvugizi yavuze ko umurwayi yatwitse igihanga cya kabiri ku gihanga cye kandi ko azoherezwa mu ishami ry\u2019ubuvuzi ryihariye rya Brotman. Jackson yavuze ko yagize uburibwe bwo mu rwego rwa gatatu ku mutwe we byari hafi kunyura mu gihanga cye, kandi ko byamuteye ibibazo byinshi. Mugihe cyimyaka itari mike hashyizwemo ballon kugirango irambure ahantu hafashwe kandi ikata inkovu kugirango agarure umusatsi. Mu Gushyingo 1993, Jackson yatangaje ko iseswa ry\u2019uruzinduko rusigaye kubera gushingira ku miti igabanya ububabare yari yarateganijwe nyuma yo kubagwa mu mutwe vuba aha. Imbaraga zo kugarura umusatsi zarananiranye maze Jackson amaherezo ahitamo kwambara agati. "}
{"id": "13020", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13020", "title": "Mbabazi Gerard", "text": "Rweme Mbabazi Gerard uzwi cyane nka Gerard Mbabazi ni Umunyarwanda ukora umwuga w'itangazamakuru akaba n'umukinnyi wa film. Rweme azwi cyane mu itangazamakuru ry'imyidagaduro n'ubuzima rusange. Yavukiye mu bitaro bya Kaminuza i Butare; avuka kuri Se Mbabariye Siliyane na Nyina Kangabe Helene. \nUbuzima bwe Bwite.\nRweme (Mbabazi Gerard) yize amashuri abanza i Cyarwa mu mujyi wa HUYE aho kuva akiri umwana muto yakuze afite inzozi zo kuzaba umunyamakuru cyangwa kuvuganira ababaye; yaje kwinjira mu itandazamakuru mu mwaka wa 2008 ubwo yasozaga amashuri yisumbuye muri Christ-Roi i Nyanza. \nRweme yize itangazamakuru muri Kaminuza nkuru y'u Rwanda mu ishami ry'itangazamakuru n'itumanaho mu mwaka 2008 kugeza muri 2011. Mu mwaka wa 2008 nibwo yatangiye gukora nk'umunyamakuru w'umukorerabushake muri Radio HUYE aho yamaze amezi make kuko muri uwo mwaka yatangiye gukora kuri radio Salus kugeza muri 2010.\nRweme yavuye kuri radio salus yerekeza mu IGIHE yakoze nk'umwanditsi ariko akaba n'umuyobozi w'ibiganiro bya IGIHE tv ikorera kuri murandasi. Mu mwaka wa 2012 yasezeye mu IGIHE yinjira muri Kigal Today kugeza mu ntangiriro za 2014 ku itariki ya 1 Mata aho yinjiye mu kigo cy'igihugu cy'itangazamakuru (RBA) aho yamenyekanye cyane mu biganiro bitandukanye bya Magic Fm, Television Rwanda (RTV) by'umwihariko mu kiganiro 'Zoom In' cyakunzwe cyane mu gihugu kubera abatumirwa bacyo babaga barimo babazwa n'uyu munyamakuru ku buzima bwabo bwite; aha twavuga nk'ikiganiro yakoranye na Pr Ezra Mpyisi, Hon Rucagu, Hon Tito Rutaremara, Pr Antoine Rutayisire, Hon Odette Nyiramirino, Bosenibamwe, umwanditsi Yolanda Mukagasana n'abandi benshi.\nRweme yamenyekanye cyane kandi mu biganiro bya Radio Rwanda; iyi akaba ari radio yakuze yumva. Kwisanga kuri iyi Radio mu biganiro nka 'Samedi detente' byabaye nko kurotora inzozi ze yatangiye kugira ari umwana w'imyaka itanu; ubwo yatangiye kujya afata amajwi abandi bana aho yari atuye n'umuryango we i Cyarwa mu mujyi wa Butare; ubu ni mu mujyi wa Huye.\nRweme kandi ni umunyamakuru winjiye ku murongo wa youtube aho afite ikiganiro atambutsa cyizwi nka 'Inkuru yanjye'. Iki kiganiro 'inkuru yanjye' cyabaye umwanya mwiza we wo kuganira n'ingeri zitandukanye z'Abanyarwanda cyane cyane abashegeshwe n'amateka igihugu cye cyaciyemo. Ajya gutangiza iki kiganiro yakunze kumvikana mu itangazamakuru avuga ko u Rwanda ari igihugu cy'imisozi y'igihumbi ariko kandi cy'inkuru ibihumbi kandi ko zigomba kumenywa n'Isi. \nRweme (Mbabazi Gerard) ni umwana wavutse mu muryango w'abana benshi. Yavukiye mu mubitaro bya kaminuza i Butare kuri Se witwaga Mbabariye Siliyane na nyina Kangabe Helene bose bakomoka mu karere ka Nyaruguru. Rweme ni umubyeyi w'abana yabyaranye n'umugore we yitwa Uwase Lice, tariki 12 Werurwe mu mwaka 2021 nibwo basezeranye mu mategeko mu murenge wa Kimihurura mu mujyi wa Kigali, naho tariki 05 Mata muri uwo mwaka basezeranye na Uwase imbere y'Imana muri Kiliziya ya Regina Pacis i Remera. \nRweme yakinnye film zirimo iyitwa JABO yakinnyemo ariwe mukinnyi w'imena witwaga Jabo; iyi film yasohotse mu mwaka wa 2013; nubwo atongeye kugaragara muri cinema kuva uwo mwaka Rweme avuga ko bikiri mu mishinga ye y'ahazaza. "}
{"id": "13021", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13021", "title": "Ubuzima Bwo mumutwe mugihe cya c0vid 19", "text": "' cyagize ingaruka ku buzima bwo mu ' ku isi. Icyorezo cyateje impungenge nyinshi, kwiheba, n'ibimenyetso by'ihungabana nyuma yo guhahamuka. Nk\u2019uko ikigo cy\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye cyita ku buzima kibitangaza, mu mwaka wa mbere w\u2019icyorezo cya COVID-19, ubwiyongere bw\u2019ibibazo bisanzwe nko kwiheba \nno guhangayika, bwazamutseho hejuru ya 25%. Icyorezo cyangiritse ku mibanire myiza, kwizerana mu bigo ndetse no mu bandi bantu, cyateje impinduka mu kazi no kwinjiza amafaranga, kandi gishyiraho umutwaro munini wo guhangayika no guhangayikisha abaturage. Abagore n'urubyiruko bahura n'ingaruka zikomeye zo kwiheba no guhangayika. COVID-19 yakajije umurego ibibazo biterwa no (SUDs). Icyorezo cyibasiye cyane abantu bafite SUD. Ingaruka z'ubuzima bwa SUDs (urugero, -damura, diyabete yo mu, hamwe na, hamwe n'indwara zo mu mutwe), hamwe n'ibibazo bifitanye isano n'ibidukikije (nko guhungabana kw'amazu, ubushomeri, no kugira uruhare mu butabera mpanabyaha), bifitanye isano nubwiyongere bwokwandura COVID-19. Amategeko agenga ibisobanuro, kimwe n\u2019ubushomeri n\u2019ingamba zo kugabanya ingengo y\u2019imari mu gihe cy\u2019icyorezo ndetse \nn\u2019icyakurikiyeho, birashobora kandi kugira ingaruka ku isoko ry\u2019ibiyobyabwenge bitemewe n\u2019uburyo bukoreshwa mu bakoresha ibiyobyabwenge bitemewe.Ingamba zo kugabanya ubukana (ni ukuvuga intera y'umubiri, akato, no) birashobora kongera irungu, ibimenyetso by'ubuzima bwo mu mutwe, ibimenyetso byo kwikuramo, hamwe n'ihungabana ryo mu mutwe.\nImpamvu.\nImpamvu zizwi zitera ibibazo byubuzima bwo mu mutwe mugihe cyicyorezo harimo gutinya kwandura, gusebanya bijyana no kwandura, (byashyizweho nabantu bihungira bonyine cyangwa kubahiriza gufunga), hamwe na masike. Abantu babarirwa muri za miriyari bimukiye mu kokuri interineti, ubushomeri bw'agateganyo, yo mu cyangwa amashuri ya kure, no kutagira aho bahurira n'abagize umuryango, inshuti ndetse na bagenzi bawe. \nAbitazwi.\nIgihe icyorezo cyatangiraga, ibyago ntibyari bizwi. Mugihe abantu barwaye binjiye mubitaro kandi inama zemewe zagiye zihinduka, kubura amakuru byongera imihangayiko no guhangayika. Ibidashidikanywaho byinshi byagose intangiriro y\u2019icyorezo, harimo kugereranya ibyago byanduye, ibimenyetso bifitanye isano hagati ya COVID-19 nibindi bibazo byubuzima. \nAgasuzuguro.\ngihe icyorezo cyatangiraga, umuntu wese wasangaga abantu banduye yagombaga gukemura ikibazo cy\u2019uko bashobora kuba baranduye bityo bakaba bashobora guteza umuryango wabo ndetse n\u2019abandi. Rimwe na rimwe wasangaga basuzugurwa. "}
{"id": "13022", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13022", "title": "Ubuforomo bwuburwayi bwo mutwe", "text": "Ubuforomo cyangwa ubuforomo bwo mu mutwe ni umwanya washyizweho winzobere mu buzima bwo mu, kandi yita ku bantu b'ingeri zose bafite cyangwa ibibazo. Muri byo harimo: indwara ya neurodevelopmental disorders, schizophrenia, schizoaffective disorder, ihungabana ryumutima, ibiyobyabwenge, ihungabana, imiterere mibi, kurya nabi, ibitekerezo byo kwiyahura, psychose, paranoia, no kwikomeretsa.Abaforomo bo muri kano karere bahabwa amahugurwa yihariye yubuvuzi bwo mu, kubaka ubumwe bwo kuvura, guhangana, hamwe n\u2019imiyoborere.Mu bihugu byinshi, nyuma ya za 90, umuforomo w\u2019indwara zo mu mutwe yagombaga kubona impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bijyanye n'ubuforomo kugira ngo abe, kandi azobereye mu buzima bwo mu mutwe. Impamyabumenyi ziratandukanye mu bihugu bitandukanye, kandi bigengwa n\u2019amabwiriza yihariye y\u2019igihugu. Muri Reta zunze ubumwe z'amerika umuntu arashobora kuba RN, numuforomo windwara zo mumutwe, arangije porogaramu ya dipolome, impamyabumenyi (ASN), cyangwa impamyabumenyi (BSN). Kugeza mu myaka ya za 90 Urwego 5 GCSEs / O rwari ruhagije kandi nta mpamyabumenyi cyangwa izindi mpamyabumenyi z'ubuforomo zari zisabwa.\nGutabara.\nIbikorwa byubuforomo birashobora kugabanywamo ibyiciro bikurikira: \nImiti yubu rwayi bwo mu mutwe.\n ni uburyo bukoreshwa cyane kandi bo mu mutwe bafite uruhare mu micungire y\u2019imiti, haba mu kanwa (urugero nka tablet cyangwa amazi) cyangwa no. Abaforomo barashobora kwandika imiti. Abaforomo bazakurikirana ingaruka nibisubizo kuri ubwo buvuzi bakoresheje isuzuma. Abaforomo bazatanga kandi amakuru ku miti kugirango, aho bishoboka, umuntu ubishinzwe ashobora guhitamo neza, akoresheje ibimenyetso byiza bishingiye ku buvuzi bihari."}
{"id": "13023", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13023", "title": "Indwara ya Tirikomunasi", "text": "IIndwara ya Tirikomunasi ni indwara yandurira mu mibonano mpuzabitsina itewe n'agakoko bita Tricomonas vaginalis. iyi ndwara igaragaza ibimenyetso bitinze kuko abahanga mu by'ubuvuzi bagaragaza ko ibimenyetso byayo bishobora kwigaragaza hashize imyaka myinshi \n= Ibimenyetso by'indwara ya Tirikomunasi =\n= Uko Tirikomunasi yandura =\n= Amashakiro ="}
