{"id": "13025", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13025", "title": "Indwara yo Kumurika", "text": "Indwara yo Kumurika ni uburwayi buzwi ku izina rya hemorrhoid, ikaba ari indwara iterwa no kubyimba ku imitsi itwara amaraso iherereye mu kibuno \n= Ibyiciro by'indwara ya Hemorrhoid =\nIndwara yo kumurika ikaba igabanyijwemo ibice\u00a0 bibiri: \numuntu umwe kuri batatu aba ashobora kugira ikibazo cyo kumurika igihe cyose yahura n\u2019impamvu zakongera ibyago byo gufatwa n\u2019indwara yo kumurika\n= Amashakiro ="}
{"id": "13026", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13026", "title": "Indwara y'impiswi", "text": "Impiswi ni indwara iterwa no kurya ibyo kurya byandujwe na bagiteri zimwe na zimwe cyangwa virusi, bityo mu gifu igogorwa ntirigende neza. iyi ndwara ishobora guterwa kandi n\u2019imiti imwe n\u2019imwe ya antibiyotike, ndetse n\u2019izindi ndiririzi (parasites) zinyuranye.\nIkiranga impiswi ni uko ujya ku musarane inshuro nyinshi ku munsi kandi ukituma umwanda worohereye cyane, rimwe na rimwe bikaba ari nk\u2019amazi \n= Amashakiro ="}
