{"id": "13048", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13048", "title": "Indwara y'Ise", "text": "Ise ni imwe mu ndwara zifata uruhu, iterwa n\u2019agakoko ko mu bwoko bw\u2019imiyege (fungi) kitwa Malassezia furfur. \nAka gakoko mu busanzwe kaba ku mubiri w\u2019umuntu ku ruhu, gusa nta kibazo gatera mu mubiri ndetse kakaba kanafasha kurinda zimwe mu ndwara z\u2019uruhu\nMu gihe aka gakoko gashobora kwiyongera mu bwinshi ari nabyo biza gutera indwara y\u2019ise. Icyo gihe nibwo ku ruhu hatangira kugaragara amabara yijimye cyangwa se yerurutse bitewe n\u2019uko uruhu rwawe rusa. Ise ikunda gufata mu gituza, ku nda, mu maha no ku bibero. Ishobora no gufata ahandi nko mu isura no kuruhu rw\u2019umutwe.\nIyo ise ifashe mu isura yonona isura y\u2019umuntu akaba arinayo mpamvu ihangayikisha abantu benshi bayirwaye \n= Ibimenyetso by'Indwara y'Ise =\n= Ibitera Indwara y'Ise =\n= Amashakiro ="}
{"id": "13049", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13049", "title": "Nitrofurantoin", "text": "Nitrofurantoin ni umuti wagenewe kuvura ubwandu bw\u2019umuyoboro w\u2019inkari (urinary tract infection/infection urinaire), ukaba ari umuti uboneka ari ibinini bipfundikiranyije cyangwa se ibinini bisanzwe. Ushobora kuboneka ari 50mg, 100mg cyangwa se 300mg, uretse ko n\u2019ibindi bipimo bishobora kuboneka nk\u2019umuti uvangwa n\u2019amazi uba uri ku gipimo cya 25mg/5ml. Uza mu mazina atandukanye nka Furadantine, Sterantoine, Furadoine, Martifur, Macrodantin, Uribid n\u2019ayandi bitewe n\u2019uruganda. \n= Amashakiro ="}
{"id": "13050", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13050", "title": "Kuboneza Urubyaro", "text": "Kuboneza urubyaro ni ugukoresha uburyo butandukanye bubuza umugore gusama (Gutwara Inda). \n= Uburyo bwo kuboneza urubyaro =\nhabaho uburyo bubiri bwo kuboneza urubyaro: \n= Amashakiro ="}
{"id": "13051", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13051", "title": "Amavuta ya Elayo", "text": "Amavuta ya Elayo ni ubwoko bw'amavuta bwifitemo ubushobozi bwo kurinda uturemangingo tw\u2019umubiri kwangirika nubwo gusana utwangiritse.\n= Uko akoreshwa =\nAmavuta ya Elayo nyuma yo gukamurwa ashobora gukoreshwa mu kuyateka,mu kuyisiga hagamijwe kongera ubwiza mu buvuzi butandukanye ndetse no kurinda umubiri wawe.\nnanone abantu ba kera bayakoreshaga mu kuyacana mu matara ya kera.\nAya amavuta akungahaye ku byitwa antioxidant bifasha mu gusukura umubiri,gusohora uburozi bukomoka ku binyabutabire bya antioxidant,bityo umuntu uyisiga n\u2019uyarya bigatuma bahorana ubuzima bwiza \n= Amashakiro ="}
{"id": "13052", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13052", "title": "Igikonjo", "text": "Igikonjo ni ururimi rwavugwaga n'abantu bitwa abakonjo bo mu bwoko bw'abanyoro uru rurimi rukaba ari narwo rukoreshwa n'abaragura(abapfumu), ababandwa n'abaterekera \n= Amashakiro ="}
{"id": "13053", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13053", "title": "Ryangombe", "text": "Ryangombe ni umugabo waje mu Rwanda akomotse mu burengerazuba bwa Uganda mu karere ka Kitara cya Murilo. \nyagaragaye mu Rwanda bwa mbere ku ngoma y'umwami Ruganzu II Ndoli ahasaga mu mwaka w'1510 akaba yaraje mu Rwanda aje Kwamamaza idini rye \n= Ubuzima Bwite =\nSe wa Ryangombe yitwaga Babinga wa Nyundo, Nyina akitwa Nyiraryangombe w\u2019Umusumbakazi, umugore we akitwa Nyirakajumba. \nRyangombe yavutse ari ikinege abyara abana batanu ari bo Binego, Ruhanga, Nyabirungu, Mashira na Kagoro\nAkomoka mu bwoko bw\u2019Abanyoro mu muryango witwa Abakonjo bakunze gukoresa ururimi rw\u2019igikonjo, Icyo azwiho cyane ni uko yabaye inkomoko yo kubandwa no guterekera kuko mbere yo gupfa kwe bitabagaho \n= Amashakiro ="}
