{"id": "13055", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13055", "title": "Indwara y'impyiko", "text": "Indwara y\u2019impyiko \u201cCalculs r\u00e9naux\u201d ni uburwayi buterwa n\u2019imyanda nyinshi iba yagiye mu mubiri ivuye ku ntungamubiri zitandukanye ziva mu biribwa,mu binyobwa hamwe, kunywa amazi make no kunywa inzoga nyinshi \n= Ibitera iyi ndwara =\n= Ibimenyetso by'indwara y'impyiko =\n= Amashakiro ="}
{"id": "13056", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13056", "title": "Indwara y'agahinda", "text": "Indwara y\u2019agahinda niuburwayi bufata abantu bakagaragazwa no kuba barahungabanye, bakagaragara ko badafite ingufu ndetse bakaba badashobora gukomeza ibyo baba barimo. Bakunda guhora bahuzagurika, bakaba bagaragara nk\u2019abatishimiye ubuzima bigaragazwa no kwiheba bikabije cyane \n= Amashakiro ="}
