{"id": "13059", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13059", "title": "Alain Mukuralinda", "text": "Alain Mukuralinda ni umuhanzi w'umunyarwanda akaba n\u2019umwe mu bareberera inyungu z\u2019abahanzi (Manager). akagira n'izindi nshingano muri politike zo kuba umuvugizi wa Leta y'u Rwanda. \n= Ubuzima bwite =\nAlain Mukuralinda yize amashuri y\u2019incuke mu Rugunga, akurikizaho amashuri abanza 8 nyuma y\u2019uko hari habayeho impinduramatwara(R\u00e9forme), aza kujya kwiga amashuri yisumbuye i Rwamagana mu Icungamutungo (Economique) imyaka 6, mu kwezi kwa gatandatu mu mwaka 1990 asoza ayisumbuye abona buruse yo kujya kwiga muri Kaminuza y'U Rwanda mu kwezi kwa Cyenda ku mwaka 1991, yaje kujya kwiga mu bya Science Politique et Sociale ariko baza kuvangamo abandi biga Sciences Economiques mu gihugu cy'ububuligi biza gutuma asaba guhindurirwa ibyo yari yahisemo kuko bigaga imibare kandi we ayanga ahita ajya Kiga amategeko. Yapfuye ku ya 3 Mata 2025.\n= Imirimo yakoze =\n= Amashakiro ="}
{"id": "13060", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13060", "title": "Tour du Rwanda", "text": "Tour du Rwanda ryatangiye mu mwaka 1988 mu Rwanda, ni irushanwa riri ni urwego rwa 2.1 mu irushanwa rya UCI Africa Tour, Ifite ibyiciro 8 (\u00e9tapes) inyuramo, Umwaka ushize (2022), Cristian Rodriguez yatsinze neza icyiciro cya nyuma nicyiciro rusange.\nIsiganwa ry'amagare mu Rwanda.\nmu Rwanda ni igihugu kimaze gutera imbere mu mikino myinshi cyane cyane mumagare"}
{"id": "13062", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13062", "title": "Siti True Karigombe", "text": "Munyurangabo Steven yamenyekanye ku izina rya Siti True Karigombe akaba umuhanzi nyarwanda,Ni umwe mu banyeshuri barangije ku ishuri rya muzika ku Nyundo yize ibijyanye no kuvuza ingoma (drums) ndetse na rap y\u2019ibyivugo.\nUbuzima Bwite.\nUmuraperi Siti Karigombe ukunze kuvanga injyana ya Hip Hop na Gakondo, ni umwe mu batanga icyizere muri iyi njyana wanabishimangiriye mu bitaramo bigiye bitandukanye nka European street fair cyabaye tariki 08 Kamena mu mwaka 2019 kibera muri Car free zone mu Mujyi wa Kigali.Siti True Karigombe yagiye aririmba mu bitaramo bya \u201cIwacu Muzika Festival\u201d,Karigombe uherutse kumurikira isi Album amaze imyaka 5 atunganya nk\u2019uko aheruka kubitangaza, avuga ko yatangiye kuyikoraho mu mwaka wa 2017,yaje gushyigikirwa n\u2019abandi baraperi barimo Fireman, Bull Dogg n\u2019umwami w\u2019ibisumizi Riderman umubereye nk\u2019umubyeyi n\u2019umujyanama mu muziki, kimwe n\u2019abahanzi nka Yvan Mpano na Ben Adolphe. Ni album avuga ko yiyushye akuya mu kuyikora kuko mu ikorwa ryayo yirwanagaho atagira umujyanama cyangwa ushoramo amafaranga, icyakora ku rundi ruhande ahamya ko byamwigishije byinshi. \u2018Ikirombe cya Karigombe\u2019 ni album iriho indirimbo 14 zirimo izo yakoranye n\u2019abahanzi nka; Bull Dogg, Mani Martin, Nema Rehema, Oda Paccy na Irakoze Hope.Iyi album yakozweho n\u2019aba producers 10 barimo; Trakslayer, Evy, Knox beats, Bob pro, Junior Multisystem, Real Beats, Nexus, Admin Pro, Samu Top Hit, Igor Mabano iriho indirimbo zikozwe mu buryo bw\u2019amashusho eshanu."}
{"id": "13063", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13063", "title": "Mugisha Moise", "text": "Mugisha Mo\u00efse ni umunyonzi w'igare, ukinira ProTouch yo muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo yegukanye Agace ka Munani ka Tour du Rwanda 2022 kasorejwe kuri Canal Olympia ku i Rebero nyuma yo gusiganwa intera y\u2019ibilometero 75,3 akaba yaherukaga no kwegukana irindi rushanwa rizwi nka Grand Prix Chantal Biya ryabereye muri kameruni mu mwaka wa 2020, aba umunyarwanda wa kabiri wegukanye Tour du Cameroun nyuma ya Bonaventure Uwizeyimana wayegukanye mu mwaka 2018."}
{"id": "13064", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13064", "title": "FERWACY", "text": "Ishyirahamwe nyarwanda ry\u2019amagare mu Rwanda rizwi nka FERWACY (Rwanda cycling Federation) niryo rishizwe amagare mu Rwanda. Amarushanwa akinwa mu Rwanda ni nka:"}
{"id": "13065", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13065", "title": "Iradukunda Emmanuel", "text": "Iradukunda Emmanuel ni umukinnyi w\u2019umukino wo gusiganwa ku magare akaba yarabaye uwa mbere mu batarengeje imyaka 23 muri uwo mukino mu marushanwa ategurwa na FERWACY, akaza nomu baserukiye u Rwanda muri Shampiyona y\u2019Isi y\u2019Amagare mu Batarengeje imyaka 23 muri Ausitraliya. Iradukunda yabaye kandi uwa kabili muri Shampiyona y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019Amagare ya 2022 aturuka mu ikipe ya Nyabihu Cycling Team."}
{"id": "13066", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13066", "title": "Rumaga wa Nsekanabo", "text": "Umusizi Hakizimana Joseph umaze kumenyekana nka Rumaga Junior wa Nsekanabo mu busizi wiyita Rumaga Junior, umusizi w'imyaka 23 y\u2019amavukoni umwe mu basizi b\u2019abahanga bari mu Rwanda kandi bakiri bato. Ni musore w\u2019umunyempano utarigeze yiga ubuvanganzo cyangwa ngo abe hari aho yabikomoye mu muryango w\u2019iwabo.\nAmateka Aho ako mpora impano.\nUyu musore uvuka mu karere ka Ruhango avuga ko iwabo nta musizi w\u2019ibigwi wahigeze, nta n\u2019ishuri yigeze abyigamo. Yize siyansi mu gihe muri kaminuza yiga imikino. Rumaga yatangiye kubona ko impano ye yagira akamaro ubwo yigaga mu wa kabiri w\u2019amashuri yisumbuye. Yari umusore ukunda gutebya no kuganira cyane mu bandi, kenshi iyo yabaga ateruye ikiganiro ngo yabonaga bagenzi be bizihiwe ariko ataramenya ko ari impano iri kumukirigita.\nKuvanga ibisigo n'umuziki.\nIbisigo Rumaga amaze gusohora birimo ubuhanga bwo kuvanga umuziki n'ubusizi, si ikintu gishya ariko ni bacye bakora ubu buhanga mu nganzo mu Rwanda, gusa intego ye ni ikindi\u2026 Rumaga abona ko abasizi bakoranye n'abahanzi byafasha cyane kuzamura ubu bwoko bw'ubuhanzi mu by'ukuri butabonekamo urubyiruko rwinshi muri iki gihe nk'uko ruri muri muzika.\nAho ubuhanga bwe abugaragariza.\nUbuhanga bwe abugaragariza mu myandikire ye, ijwi rye riremereye rituma abamukunda batavayo, ndetse n\u2019uburyo akoramo amashusho y\u2019ibisigo nk\u2019ikintu kitari cyimenyerewe mu buhanzi bw\u2019ubusizi Nyarwanda bituma abantu bamukunda cyane, yewe hari n\u2019abavuga ko bakunze ubusizi kubera we. "}
{"id": "13067", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13067", "title": "Victor Rukotana", "text": "Rukotana ni umwe mu bahanzi b\u2019igisekuru gishya mu muziki wagize izina rikomeye abicyesha indirimbo nka \u2018Promise\u2019, \u2018Warumagaye\u2019, \u2018Sweet Love\u2019, \u2018Se Agapo\u2019, \u2018Umubavu\u2019, \u2018Romance\u2019 n\u2019izindi zigera kuri 12 yakubiye kuri Album ye ya mbere atarabonera izina...\nAmateka.\nUyu muhanzi yatangiye urugendo rw\u2019umuziki we mu 2017 asohora indirimbo zubakiye ku rukundo mu bihe bitandukanye, aririmba mu birori n\u2019ibitaramo bikomeye. Yari amaze iminsi ahugiye mu gutegura no gutunganya Album ye ya mbere ataratangaza izina yakoze yifashishije aba-producer batandukanye barimo Li John wayihaye umugisha."}
{"id": "13068", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13068", "title": "Nick Dimpoz", "text": "Umuhanzi Ndayizeye Emmanuel uzwi nka Nick Dimpozu sanzwe ari umukinnyi wa filime akaba n'umuhanzi.\nAmateka.\nUbuzima bwite.\nUyu muhanzi ufite umugore uhanga ariko yibanda kuri Gakondo gusa avuga ko muri gahunda afite vuba harimo no kuba bakorana indirimbo dore ko banahuriye mu itorero rimwe ry\u2019Intayoberana.\nImpano afite.\nUyu mugabo ukina amafilm, agakora umuziki akanabyina cyane Kinyarwanda ngo byose abikorera abafana kuko babyishimira kandi nta na kimwe yareka."}
{"id": "13069", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13069", "title": "Uhiriwe Byiza Renus", "text": "Uhiriwe Byiza Renus yavutse 1 Mata mu mwaka 2001, ni umunyarwanda ukina umukino w\u2019amagare mu Rwanda, Ferwacy, akaba yaregukanye umudali wa zahabu muri Shampiyona ny'afurika y\u2019amagare mu cyiciro cy\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 23, mu gusiganwa umuntu ku giti cye."}
{"id": "13070", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13070", "title": "Mico The Best", "text": "Turatsinze Prosper nk\u2019amazina ye nyakuri cyangwa Mico The Best amazina akoresha mu buhanzi, avuka i Gikondo gusa ababyeyi be bakomoka mu ntara y\u2019Amajyepfo ahahoze hitwa Nyakizu. \nAmateka.\nUrugendo rwa muzika.\nUyu muhanzi yatangiye kuririmba muri 2007 gusa nkuko we abyivugira indirimbo ye ya mbere yamenyekanye ni iyitwa \u2018Umuzungu\u2019 yakozwe na Nyakwigendera Dr Jacques muri F2K Studio. Uyu musore yakoze nyinshi mu ndirimbo zagiye zikundwa zirimo: Umuzungu, Umugati, Umutaka, Akabizu, Kule kimwe n\u2019izindi nyinshi zo ha mbere icyakora no muri iyi minsi afite iziri kugenda zikundwa zirimo;Amarangamutima, Uwo muntu ndetse n\u2019Indahiro.\nUbuzima bwite.\nYasezeranye imbere y\u2019amategeko n\u2019umukunzi we Clarisse ukunze gukoresha amazina ya Clarisse Khloe Dubnx ku mbuga nkoranyambaga. Ni mu muhango wabaye kuri uyu wa Kane tariki 19 Kanama 2021. Byabereye mu murenge wa Nyarugenge mu Mujyi wa Kigali. Kuwa 26 Nzeri 2021 yasezeranye kubana akaramata na Clarisse mu birori byasusurukijwe n\u2019abahanzi batandukanye, byanabaye hubahirizwa amabwiriza yo kwirinda icyorezo cya COVID-19, ndetse anagabirwa inka n\u2019ibyamamare bitandukanye.\nHanze y\u2019umuziki avuga ko ikintu cyamubabaje cyane ari urupfu rwa se witabye Imana muri 2013 azize indwara y\u2019umutima, ariko na none nk\u2019umunyarwanda wese yababajwe na Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994.\nMuri muzika ye ikintu cyamubabaje.\nMuri muzika ye ikintu cyamubabaje ni uko abantu batinze kumumenya ariko na none yishimira ko baje kumwakira nyuma yo kumenya icyo ashoboye."}
{"id": "13072", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13072", "title": "Mutabazi Diallon", "text": "DJ DIALLO is a Rwandan Dj, His real Name is MUTABAZI DIALLON, This young man started showing his talent as a DJ (DJ) since 2014\ncarrie LifeTime.\nDj Diallo has performed at Le Must Pub in 2015, Rosty plus club in 2016, Spring club in 2016, Chillax Club in 2016, Ozone club in 2017, The Junction Lounge in 2017, k-club in 2017, Cocobean Club in 2018, BougainVilla in 2019, Voltage Club in 2019 and elsewhere. \nDiallo has worked for various media including Family Tv, FlashFM and currently working at ISIBOTV.\nDj Diallo is one of the contestants for The Choice Awards 2020 for the first time even won the award for best DJ. And for the second time of these awards he was among the contenders.\nStuff You Should Know.\nDj Diallo is one of the DJs who have long prioritized opening in other countries in order to approach the international market. \nIn 2018 Dj diallo Started Attending Events In DRC, And in Kenya In 2021 At \u201cBclub\u201d. it ended in a concert held in the city of Dubai In 2022 and 2023"}
{"id": "13073", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13073", "title": "Nsengimana Jean Bosco", "text": "Nsengimana Jean Bosco yavutse 4 Ugushyingo mu mwaka 1992 mu karere ka Nyabihu, ni umunyarwanda waje kwegukana umwanya wa gatatu mu bakuru muri Shampiyona ny'afurika y\u2019amagare yegukana umudali wa Bronze mu mukino w\u2019amagare iri kubera mu misili, akaba yaraje kwegukanye Tour du Rwanda mu mwaka 2015, aho yakiniraga Benediction Excel Energy Club itozwa na Sempoma Felix, aho mu Misiri ninaho Umunyarwanda ukinira naweBenediction Excel Energy Club ku mazina ya Uhiriwe Byiza Renus yegukanye umwanya wa mbere mu batarengeje imyaka 23 ahita yambikwa n\u2019Umudali wa zahabu."}
{"id": "13074", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13074", "title": "Benediction Excel Energy Club", "text": "Benediction Excel Energy Club n\u2019ikipe yo mu Karere ka Rubavu, iri ku rwego rwa Afurika, aho itozwa na Sempoma Felix yabaye ikipe ya mbere yo mu Rwanda igiye muri icyo cyiciro izanaseruka muri Tour du Rwanda 2019, aho yemejwe n\u2019impuzamashyirahamwe y\u2019umukino w\u2019amagare ku isi, UCI."}
{"id": "13075", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13075", "title": "Emmalito", "text": "Murenzi Emmanuel uzwi mu itangazamakuru nka Emmalito,Umunyamakuru wa ISIBO TV.\nUbuzima bwite.\nEmmalito avuga ko itangazamakuru yarikunze kuva akiri muto arikundishijwe n\u2019umunyamakuru Ellen DeGeneres wo muri Amerika, biba akarusho ubwo yari arangije amashuri yisumbuye mu mwaka 2009. Icyo gihe nibwo yatangiye gukora ku giti cye, agaha inkuru ibinyamakuru(freelancer). Emmalito ntiyakoraga nk\u2019umukozi uhoraho, ahubwo yafashaga abanyamakuru kubaha inkuru zitandukanye kuri radiyo Flash FM, City Radio na Contact Fm, nyuma mu mwaka 2014 nibwo yaje kubona akazi kuri Royal Fm.Umunyamakuru Murenzi Emmanuel, umaze kumenyekana mu itangazamakuru nka Emmalito na we yinjiye mu ruhando rw\u2019abahanga imideli, aho yatangije inzu iyihanga nyuma yo gutegura ibitaramo byo kuyimurika akarushaho no kuyikunda. Emmalito watangije iyi nzu ya Lito Ris Design, yateguye ibitaramo bitandukanye bikomeye by\u2019imideli by\u2019abandi bantu birimo Rwanda Cultural Fashion Show mu mwaka 2013, Kigali Fashion Week mu mwaka 2014.\nIbindi Wamenya.\nYabaye igisonga cya mbere cya Rudasumbwa wa Mount Kenya mu mwaka 2012 azwi cyane mu itangazamakuru ndetse arimazemo imyaka 11. Yakoreye ibitangazamakuru bitandukanye birimo Tv1, Royal Tv na Royal FM ndetse ubu akora ku ISIBO TV mu kiganiro Chapa Chapa akorana na Kety. tariki 2 Kanama mu mwaka 2022, nibwo Emmalito yambitse impeta umukunzi we Umwali.yavuze ko imyaka itanu ishize ari mu rukundo n\u2019uyu mukobwa.Umwali asanzwe atuye mu Mujyi wa Ottawa muri Canada. Emmalito avuga bitari byoroshye gukundana n\u2019umuntu uri kure, ariko byarashoboka hamwe no kwizera."}
{"id": "13076", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13076", "title": "Sempoma Felix", "text": "Sempoma Felix umutoza w'ikipe yu Rwanda mu magare, aho yatoje agatwara muri Shampiyona nyafurika ya magare atwara imidari itatu, wamenyekanye cyane mu ikipe ya Benediction Excel Energy Club y\u2019i Rubavu atoza ikipe y\u2019igihugu y\u2019u Rwanda (Team Rwanda) yanatoje amarushanwa mpuzamahanga arimo Grand Prix Chantal Biya Ugushyingo 2020, La Tropicale Amisa Bongo 2021 na Tour du Rwanda 2021."}
{"id": "13078", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13078", "title": "Platini", "text": "Nemeye Platini umaze kubaka izina mu muziki w\u2019u Rwanda,ni Umuhanzi nyarwanda.\nUbuzima Bwite.\nPlatini Nemeye yari umukinnyi mwiza ukina ku ruhande rw\u2019iburyo aho yakundaga guca agatsinda n'ibitego, ibyatumye atoranywa mu bana batarengeje imyaka 15 bagombaga kujyanwa muri Sweden na Roger Palmgren wari umutoza w'ikipe y'igihugu mu mwaka 2004 nuwa 2006. Platini wacaga kuri karindwi agatsinda ibitego yashimwe bikomeye n'uyu muzungu ndetse aza kugera ku rwego rw'igihugu aviramo ahatoranyijwe abandi bana bakajyanwa muri Sweden mu myitozo yari yagenewe abana bato bagaragazaga impano hano mu Rwanda ku gitekerezo cya Roger Palmgren wari umutoza w'ikipe y'igihugu Amavubi washakaga kuzamura abana. Nemeye Platini ukoresha amazina y\u2019ubuhanzi ya Platini P yinjiye mu muziki by\u2019umwuga mu mwaka wa 2009, atangira akorana na mugenzi we TMC nk\u2019itsinda (Dream Boys) baje gutandukana buri umwe agakomeza ukwe.\nIbindi Wamenya.\nTariki 06 Werurwe mu mwaka 2021 ni bwo ku mbuga nkoranyambaga hasakaye amafoto ya Platini P n'umukunzi we witwa Olivia Ingabire basezeranye imbere y'amategeko mu muhango wabereye mu Murenge wa Remera mu Mujyi wa Kigali.Gusezerana kwa Platini P na Olivia byatunguye benshi na cyane ko inkuru y'urukundo rwabo itigeze imenyekana mu itangazamakuru. Ku rundi ruhande ariko ni inkuru yashimishije benshi by'umwihariko abakunzi b'uyu muhanzi n'abanyamuziki batandukanye barimo umuhanzikazi Knowless Butera. Uyu muhanzi kandi nyuma y\u2019amezi ashize we n\u2019umuryango we bimukiye mu nzu nshya, yubatse ahitwa Mukarumuna. Yavuze ko amafaranga yubakishije iyi nzu yavuye mu muziki. Kuva mu myaka ibiri ishize, uyu muhanzi yashyize hanze indirimbo zakunzwe zirimo nka \u2018Veronika\u2019, \u2018Atensiyo\u2019, \u2018Ntabirenze\u2019, \u2018Helena\u2019 n\u2019izindi nyinshi.Platini ni umwe mu bafashwa mu muziki na Sosiyete yo muri Nigeriya yitwa One Percent Managers, izwi mu kumenyekanisha ibihangano by\u2019abahanzi n\u2019abandi. "}
{"id": "13079", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13079", "title": "Team Rwanda cycling", "text": "Team Rwanda cycling ni Ikipe y'Amagare yu Rwanda yashinzwe mu 2006, Uyu munsi Ikipe y'u Rwanda igizwe n' abasiganwa ku magare barenga 30 abagabo n'abagore, ubu ibarizwa mw'ishyirahamwe Nyarwanda ry\u2019Umukino wo gusiganwa ku Magare mu Rwanda (FERWACY)."}
{"id": "13081", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13081", "title": "Mugisha Samuel", "text": "Mugisha Samuel afite imyaka 24 ni umukinnyi w' igare, avuka ku Mukamira mu karere ka Nyabihu, ni we Munyarwanda uheruka kwegukana Tour du Rwanda ubwo yakinwaga bwa nyuma iri kuri 2,2 mu 2018 ari muri Team Rwanda, ni we mukinnyi rukumbi w\u2019Umunyarwanda witabiriye Shampiyona y\u2019Isi y\u2019Amagare yabereye mu Mujyi wa Imola mu Butaliyani Mu 2020. Mugisha wakiniraga Pro Touch yo muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo mu gusiganwa ku magare, yatorokeye muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika aho yari yitabiriye isiganwa."}
{"id": "13084", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13084", "title": "Uwizeyimana Bonaventure", "text": "Uwizeyimana Bonaventure ni umukinnyi w'igare aho ari kumwe na Team Rwanda yegukanye irushanwa rya Tour du Cameroun ryari rimaze icyumweru kirenga ribera mu bice bitandukanye bya kameruni, Niwe munyarwanda wa mbere utwaye iri siganwa. Aba umunyarwanda wa kabiri ukuye irushanwa riri mu rwego rwa tour mu mahanga, nyuma ya Areruya Joseph wegukana La Tropicale Amissa Bongo yo muri Gabon. akaba yari umwe mubanyarwanda 3 bari ku rutonde rw\u2019abahatanira igihembo cy\u2019umukinnyi mwiza muri Afurika ndetse akaba yaragiye yegukana agace ka tour nka ka 1 na 5 muri Tour du Rwanda 2017."}
{"id": "13085", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13085", "title": "Munyaneza Didier", "text": "Munyaneza Didier wiyita Mbappe yavutse 1 ukuboza 1998, umukinnyi w'igare watangiye gusiganwa ku magare muri 2016 akinira ikipe ya Benediction excel enegy Club y\u2019i Rubavu yegukanye Tour du Senegal yari imaze imyaka 10 yarananiye Abanyafurika, aho yafashe umwambaro w\u2019umuhondo muri iri siganwa kuva ku munsi kuwa mbere w\u2019 isiganwa kugeza azote irushanwa. ni nyuma aho yabaye uwa kabiri mu gace ka mbere ka Tour du Cameroun. Munyaneza niwe wegukanye shampiyona y\u2019u Rwanda yo gusiganwa ku igare umuntu ku giti cye mu Bugesera aho yakoresheje ku ntera ya Km 34 asimbura Areruya Joseph wari watsinze iyo mu 2019. Yabaye kandi umukinnyi ukiri muto witwaye neza kurusha abandi muri La Tropicale Amissa Bongo."}
{"id": "13086", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13086", "title": "Fearless", "text": "Umuraperi Niyonsenga Keza Amina uzwi nka Fearless.\nAmateka.\nFearless ubusanzwe ni umuhanzikazi uririmba munjyana ya hip hop, akunze kwiyita Lady Boss cyangwa se Badgal aho ahamya ko ariwe mukobwa uyoboye abandi mu njyana ya hip hop hano mu Rwanda nubwo hari benshi batabyumva kimwe nawe. Uyu mukobwa azwi mu ndirimbo yise \u201cNtibabizi\u201d, I like you, Icyerekezo afatanyije na Queen Cha, Abantu afatanyije na Tough Gangz nizindi."}
{"id": "13087", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13087", "title": "Kigali Boyz (KGB)", "text": "KGB ni impine y\u2019amagambo Kigali Boys. Ryari itsinda rigizwe n\u2019abasore babatu ari bo Skizzy, MYP na Henry. Itsinda KGB rigizwe na Mister Skizzy, Henry na MYP rikaba rizwi ku ndirimbo nyinshi cyane harimo \u201cArasharamye\u201d, \u201cAbakobwa b\u2019i Kigali\u201d, \u201cIbiremwa by\u2019umwijima\u201d, \u201cByasaze\u201d n\u2019izindi.\nAmateka.\nurugendo rwa muzika.\nItsinda rya KGB ryabayeho kuva mu ntangiroro z\u2019umwaka wa 2000 kugera mu 2012. Ryarakunzwe cyane mu ndirimbo zitandukanye nka \u201cArasharamye\u201d, \u201cWarukurahe\u201d, \u201cAbakobwa b\u2019i Kigali\u201d, \u201cNdagukunda\u201d n\u2019izindi. KGB mu bihe byabo bakoze umuziki mwiza ndetse babera urugero abandi binjiye mu muziki nyuma yabo. Niryo tsinda ryabashije kwegukana igihembo cya PAM Awards byatangirwaga muri Uganda. Idirimbo yabo ya mbere nyuma y\u2019uko bagarutse bayise Ruhurura ivuga ku buzima bw\u2019abana bo mu muhanda.\nUko byarangiye.\nHari ku wa Gatandatu tariki 1 Ukuboza 2012, niubwo inkuru itari nziza yageraga ku bakunzi b\u2019umuziki ndetse n\u2019Abanyarwanda muri rusange ko uwahoze ari umuhanzi ndetse akaba ikirangirire Hirwa Henry wamenyekanye muri KGB yitabye Imana arohamye muri Muhazi. Iby\u2019iri tsinda byarangiye ubwo umwe mu bari barigize Hirwa Henry yitabaga Imana mu Ukuboza 2012 arohamye mu kiyaga cya Muhazi. Abandi bahise bacika intege umuziki bawureka gutyo."}
{"id": "13088", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13088", "title": "Health insurance", "text": "Ubwishingizi bw'ubuzima cyangwa ubwishingizi bw'ubuvuzi (bizwi kandi nk'ubuvuzi muri Afurika y'Epfo) ni ubwoko bw'ubwishingizi bukubiyemo ibintu byose cyangwa igice cy'ibyago by'umuntu ufite yo kwivuza. Kimwe nubundi bwoko bwubwishingizi, ibyago bisangirwa mubantu benshi. Mugereranije ingaruka rusange ziterwa hamwe n\u2019amafaranga arenga kuri pisine, umwishingizi arashobora guteza imbere imiterere yimari isanzwe, nka premium buri kwezi cyangwa, kugirango atange amafaranga yo kwishyura inyungu zubuzima zivugwa mu bwishingizi; amasezerano. Inyungu itangwa n\u2019umuryango wo hagati, nkikigo cya leta, ubucuruzi bwigenga, cyangwa ikigo kidaharanira inyungu.\n rivuga ko ubwishingizi bw\u2019ubuzima busobanurwa nk \"ubwishingizi buteganya kwishyura inyungu biturutse ku burwayi cyangwa ibikomere. Harimo ubwishingizi bw'igihombo cyatewe n'impanuka, amafaranga yo kwivuza, ubumuga, cyangwa urupfu rutunguranye no gutandukana \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nInshingano z'umuntu ku giti cye zishobora gufata uburyo butandukanye:.\nPremium: Amafaranga abafite politiki cyangwa umuterankunga wabo (urugero umukoresha) yishyura gahunda yubuzima yo kugura ubwishingizi bwubuzima. (Amerika yihariye) Dukurikije amategeko y\u2019ubuzima, igihembo kibarwa hakoreshejwe ibintu 5 byihariye bijyanye n\u2019uwishingiwe. Izi ngingo ni imyaka, aho biherereye, ikoreshwa ry itabi, umuntu ku giti cye nu kwiyandikisha mumuryango, hamwe nicyiciro cyateganijwe uwishingiwe ahitamo. "}
{"id": "13089", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13089", "title": "Umutima", "text": "Umutima w'umuntu uherereye muri, ku rwego rwa T5 - T8. agace y'ibice bibiri yitwa Gakikije umutima kandi ifata mediastinum. Ubuso bw'inyuma bw'umutima buryamye hafi y'inkingi ya, naho ubuso bw'imbere buzwi nk'ubuso bwa sternocostal bwicaye inyuma y'igitereko. Igice cyo hejuru cy'umutima nigitekerezo cyo guhuza imiyoboro minini yamaraso- venae cavae, aorta nigitereko cyimpyiko. Igice cyo hejuru cy'umutima giherereye ku rwego rwa gatatu ruhenze. Umutwe wo hasi w'umutima, apex, uryamye ibumoso bw'inyuma (8 kugeza 9\u00a0cm kuva ku murongo wo hagati) hagati y'isangano y'imbavu ya kane nuwa gatanu hafi ya articulation hamwe na karitsiye ihenze. \nUmutima usohora amaraso hamwe nigitekerezo cyagenwe nitsinda rya muri. Ibi bibyara umuyoboro utera umutima kwandura, ukanyura kuri no muri. Mu bantu, amaraso ya dexygene yinjira mu mutima binyuze muri atrium iburyo uhereye kuri venae cavae isumba iyindi kandi ntoya hanyuma ikayigeza kuri ventricle iburyo. Kuva aha, byinjizwa mu kw'ibihaha kugera mu bihaha, aho byakira ogisijeni kandi bigatanga dioxyde de carbone. Amaraso ya Oxygene noneho asubira muri atrium ibumoso, anyura muri ventricle yi bumoso hanyuma asohorwa muri aorta mu kuzenguruka kwa sisitemu, agenda anyura mu mitsi, arterioles, na capillaries - aho intungamubiri n\u2019ibindi bintu bihanahana imiyoboro y'amaraso na selile, bikabura ogisijeni na kubona dioxyde de carbone-mbere yo gusubizwa mumutima binyuze mumitsi no mumitsi. [8] Umutima utera ku kigero cyo kuruhuka hafi 72 gukubita ku munota. ngororamubiri yongera umuvuduko by'agateganyo, ariko igabanya umuvuduko w'umutima kuruhuka mu gihe kirekire, kandi ni byiza ku buzima bw'umutima. \nImiterere.\nimiterere Ibyumba byumutima.\nUmutima ufite ibyumba bine, ebyiri zo hejuru, ibyumba byakira, hamwe na ebyiri zo hepfo, ibyumba bisohora. Atriya ifunguye mumashanyarazi ikoresheje, igaragara muri. Iri tandukaniro rigaragara no hejuru yumutima nka coronary sulcus. Hariho imiterere imeze nkugutwi muri atrium yo hejuru iburyo yitwa umugereka wiburyo wa atrial, cyangwa auricle, nundi muri atrium yo hejuru ibumoso, umugereka wibumoso. [19] Atrium iburyo hamwe na ventricle iburyo hamwe rimwe na rimwe byitwa umutima wukuri. Mu buryo nk'ubwo, atrium ibumoso hamwe na ventricle ibumoso hamwe rimwe na rimwe byitwa umutima wibumoso.] Umutima utandukanijwe hagati ya septum interventricular septum, igaragara hejuru yumutima nka sulcus ya longitudinal imbere na sulcus interventricular sulcus. "}
{"id": "13090", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13090", "title": "Inkeragutabara", "text": "Inkeragutabara(cyangwa se ambilanse) ni imodoka ifite ibikoresho byose bikenewe mu buvuzi itwara abarwayi ku bigo nderabuzima ndetse n'ibitaro bitandukanye. Ni ubuvuzi hanze y'ibitaro buhabwa umurwayi mugihe ajyanywe ku bitaro cyangwa ku kigo nderabuzima.\nAmateka y'inkeragutabara.\nAmateka y'inkeragutabara yatangiye mu gihe cya kera,aho hifashishwaga amagare yo gutwara abarwayi badakira ku ngufu. Ambilanse cyangwa inkeragutabara yakoreshejwe bwa mbere mu buvuzi bwihutirwa mu mwaka wa 1487 n\u2019Abesipanyoli, abandi bantu batandukanye batangiye kuyikoresha mu myaka ya za 1830. Ikoranabuhanga ryo mu kinyejana cya 19 na 20 ryatumye ambilansi igezweho ikoreshwa.\nIbikoresho biba mu nkeragutabara.\nMu nkeragutabara(ambilanse) habamo ibikoresho bitandukanye byifashishwa mu gutanga ubutabazi bwihuse mu gihe umurwayi ajyanywe kwa muganga, harimo ibi bikurikira:\n1. Igikoresho gitanga umwuka.\nNi kimwe mu bikoresho by'ibanze mu biba muri ambilanse kuko gutanga umwuka bikenerwa cyane mu butabazi bwihutirwa nko kubantu barokotse inkongi y'umuriro, abarwayi bafite ibibazo mu \nbuhumekero nk'abarwayi ba asima."}
{"id": "13091", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13091", "title": "Hadi Janvier", "text": "Hadi Janvier w\u2019imyaka 26 uyu musore yari\u00a0 kapiteni w\u2019ikipe y\u2019igihugu y\u2019u Rwanda yo gusiganwa ku magare muri Tour du Rwanda za 2014 na 2015, yari yarasezeye umukino w\u2019amagare avuga ko akandamizwa n\u2019abayobora ikipe y\u2019igihugu Ferwacy na Team Rwanda ariko nyuma y\u2019umwaka yasabye imbabazi avuga ko ashaka kongera gukina, wari umaze no kugera ku rwego rwo gukina mu ikipe y\u2019ababigize umwuga ku mugabane w\u2019u Burayi ya Stradalli-Bike Aid yo mu Budage."}
{"id": "13092", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13092", "title": "Just famil", "text": "Just famil ni itsinda ry' abahanzi ryitwa,rigizwe n'abahanzi batatu aribo: jimmy, Bahati, croidja iri tsinda ryagiye rihangana mu ruhando rwa muzika mu Rwanda.\nAmarushanwa.\niri tsinda rya Just Family ryitabirye amarushanwa ya salax award na Primus Guma Guma Super Star (PGGSS) abera mu mugi wa Kigali, ibyo ni ibimenyetso by'uko ryakora kandi ko indirimbo zabo ziririmbwa mu Rwanda no hanze yarwo.\nAmateka.\nJust Family rero yaje gutangira kugira ibibazo aho umwe muribo wasaga nkaho ariwe nkingi ya mwamba mu buvugizi n'ubujyanama bwayo witwaga Kim Kizito aretse iyo mirimo yakoranaga na just Family,uhereye icyo gihe hakomeje kuzamo imvururu no gutandundukana kwabagize itsinda, habanje Bahati asezera muri Just Family nyuma ye haje kuburirwa irengero rya mujyenzi we Croidja bivugwa ko yagiye muri Afrika yepfo bitunguranye kubera ko itsinda ryabo ryari rimaze kugira utubazo twinshi harimo n'amadeni. \nNyuma yigihe baje kongera kwihuza 2017 ndetse, bongera gukora muzika nshyashya,uwitwa Croidja wari udahari yaragiye muri africa yepfo bamusimbuza uwitwa Chris, bakora indirimbo zinyuranye harimo: Nashiriyemo,Nasara,hummer... ni izindi mu mwaka wa 2018 iri tsinda ryamenyesheje abakunzi baryo ko ari igiti gitangiye gushibuka muri muzika, ko bazakomeza gukora neza nkuko bahoze mbere kandi ko bagiye kongera kwigarurira abakunzi babo, muri uwo mwaka niho basohoye indirimbo yabo Bise\" BENZ\" kongera kwihuza kwabo nk'itsinda byatumye batangira gukora indirimbo,nubwo bitoroshye guhita basubirana abafana bababo nkuko byahoze mbere, bafite ikizere ko bizakomeza kuza bagasubira mubihe byabo."}
{"id": "13093", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13093", "title": "Joseph Areruya", "text": "Joseph Areruya w\u2019imyaka 24 wavukiye mu karere ka Kayonza, Umukinnyi mpuzahanga w\u2019umunyarwanda wo gusiganwa ku magare wazamukiye muri Les Amis Sportif yi Rwamagana, agakina nk\u2019uwabigize umwuga muri Dimension Data for Qhubeka yo muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo na Delko\u2013Marseille Provence yo Bufaransa wegukanye amasiganwa akomeye arimo Tour du Rwanda yatwaye 2017, La Tropicale Amissa Bongo yatwaye 2018, yegukana Tour de L\u2019Espoir mu mwaka wa 2018, Areruya ukinira Benediction Ignite ni we wegukanye Irushanwa ryo gukunda Igihugu ryakinwe mu mihanda ya Kimihurura-Remera."}
{"id": "13094", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13094", "title": "Les Amis Sportif", "text": "Les Amis Sportif yi Rwamagana ni ikipe mpuzamahanga mu mukino wo gusiganwa ku magare mu Rwanda, ikaba yarashizwe na Rugambwa Jean Baptiste wari Perezida wayo akanayibera umutoza, akaba yaritabye Imana azize impanuka yakoze ubwo yavaga mu Karere ka Rubavu ahasorejwe isiganwa ritegura Tour du Rwanda 2018."}
{"id": "13097", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13097", "title": "Rugambwa Jean Baptiste", "text": "Rugambwa Jean Baptiste wari Perezida wa Les Amis Sportifs y\u2019i Rwamagana, anayibereye umutoza, yitabye Imana azize impanuka yakoze na Moto ubwo yavaga mu Karere ka Rubavu ahasorejwe irushanwa ritegura Tour du Rwanda 2018, Rugambwa yazamuye abakinnyi benshi mu mukino w'igare bakomeye barimo Ndayisenga Valens ukina muri Pays Olonne Cycliste C\u00f4te de Lumi\u00e8re, Areruya Joseph ukinira Delko\u2013Marseille Provence KTM yo mu Bufaransa, Mu ugushyingo 2017, Muhabwampundu Esther wakinaga muri Les Amis Sportif na we yitabye Imana agonganye n\u2019imodoka ubwo yari mu mwiherero i Musanze."}
{"id": "13098", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13098", "title": "Ahazaza Independent school", "text": "Ahazaza ni ishuri ryigenga riherereye mu karere ka Muhanda. Ahazaza ni ishuri ririmo amashuri y' inshuke ndetse n'amashuri abanza, riherereye mu Rwanda, Akarere ka Muhanga umurenge wa Nyamabuye mu mugi wako karere, rikaba ari ishuri mpuzamahanga rifite imikoranire n'ibindi bihugu.\nAmateka Yaryo.\nIri shuri ryatangijwe n' umuyobozi waryo Madamu Raina Luff, mu mwaka wa 2006 ritangira rifite abarimu babiri(2) ndetse n'abanyeshuri 14 bafite icyumba kimwe cy'ishuri gusa, ariko kugeza ubu ishuri ryagiye ryaguka cyane kugeza kubanyeshuri basaga 450 abarezi basaga 19, ibyumba by'amashuri birenga 15, inzu y'imyidagaduro,isomero ry' ibitabo, ibibuga by' imikino itandukanye, nibindi byinshi.\nImikorere yaryo.\nIryo shuri riracyakomeza kwaguka uko bwije nuko bukeye kandi ryitwaye neza mu burezi bw' amashuri abanza aho burimwaka riza mumashari atanu ya mbere mugihugu mugutsindisha abana neza mubizamini bya leta bisoza amashuri abanza, ikindi nuko bafite imyigishirize myiza ugereranije nibindi bigo by'amashuri aho bo badashobora kurenza abana 25 mu ishuri rimwe.\nIshuri ry'Ahazaza mu mwaka 2020-2021 batsindishije abana ku kigero cyingana 100% ndetse umwana wa mbere mu gihugu yari uwaho, naho mu myaka yindi yagiye itambuka ni inshuro nyinshi babaye abambere mugihugu mu ntara ndetse no mu Karere k Muhanga ikigo giherereyemo.\nIshuri ryigenga Ahazaza ritoza abana kuvuga indimi ebyiri z'amahanga, icyongereza n' igifaransa ibyo bita Belangue mu rurimi rw'amahanga.Ibyo bituma abana bahiga bavuga izo ndimi zose neza, ndetse nubundi bumenyi n' uburere ni indashyikirwa."}
{"id": "13099", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13099", "title": "Muhabwampundu Esther", "text": "Muhabwampundu Esther w\u2019imyaka 21 Umukinnyi w\u2019ikipe yo gusiganwa ku magare ya Les Amis Sportifs y\u2019i Rwamagana wari mu mwiherero i Musanze, aho yagonze imodoka ari mu myitozo ahita yitaba Imana, wari umaze imyaka ibiri atangiye gukina umukino wo kurushanwa ku magare, yari amaze iminsi mu kigo cya Africa Rising Cycling Center kiri i Musanze mu myitozo ari kumwe na Ingabire Beatha bakaba biteguraga kuzasohokera igihugu muri Shampiyona ya Afurika yo gusiganwa ku magare izaba mu ntangiriro z\u2019umwaka nk\u2019uko Umutoza wa Les Amis Sportif, Rugambwa Jean Baptiste yabivuze."}
{"id": "13100", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13100", "title": "Africa Rising Cycling Center", "text": "Africa Rising Cycling Center ni urugo rw'amagare rwa Team Rwanda kandi kubera ubwiyongere mu bunini ubu dufite ubushobozi bwo kwakira no guhugura abanyonzi benshi bo mu Rwanda, ubu ibindi bihugu bya Afurika byohereza abakora imyitozo yo ku rwego rwo hejuru kandi icyi kigo kizaba ihuriro ryi terambere rya magare ny'afurika."}
{"id": "13102", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13102", "title": "Ingabire Beatha", "text": "Ingabire Beatha yavutse 27 ukuboza 1995, umaze kuba ubukombe mu bari n\u2019abategarugori muri uyu mukino wo gusiganwa ku igare, aho akinira ikipe Les Amis Sportifs yi Rwamagana aherutse kwegukana shampiyona y\u2019igihugu yo gusiganwa ku magare haba ku gusiganwa ku muntu ku giti cye ndetse no gusiganwa mu muhanda. akaba yarababajwe cyane n'urupfu rw'umutoza we Rugambwa Jean Baptiste."}
{"id": "13103", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13103", "title": "Ndabaga Impact", "text": "Ndabaga Impact ni umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta washinzwe mu mwaka w'2015 n'abanyeshuri bigaga mu mashuri yisumbuye, uyu muryango waje gutangira ibikorwa byawo ku mugaragaro mu kwezi Kamena umwaka w'2018.\nuyu muryango ukaba ukora ibikorwa by'ubushakashatsi, ubujyanama, kongerera urubyiruko ubumenyi ku buhanzi n'ibiganirompaka bihuza amatsinda y'urubyiruko n'abakuru bagasangizanya ubumenyi n'uburambe bukomatanyije \nuyu muryango ubu uyoborwa na Gisele Sandrine Irakoze \n= Amashakiro ="}
{"id": "13104", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13104", "title": "Isiganwa Ryo Gukunda Igihugu", "text": "Irushanwa Ryo Gukunda Igihugu ni irushanwa ritegurwa n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umukino wo gusiganwa ku magare FERWACY ryiswe iryo Gukunda igihugu niryo siganwa rya mbere ribaye nyuma yaho icyorezo cya Koronavirusi kigeze mu Rwanda aho ibihembo bya twawe mu bagabo na Areruya Joseph ukinira Les Amis Sportif y\u2019i Rwamagana ndetse mu kiciro cy\u2019abagore ibihembo byatwawe na Ingabire Diane ikipe ukinira Benediction excel energy Club."}
{"id": "13105", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13105", "title": "Bayisenge Emery", "text": "Emery Bayisenge (wavutse kuya 2 Ugushyingo 1994) numukinnyi mpuzamahanga w'umupira w'amaguru w'umunyarwanda ukina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati mw' ikipe ya Gor Mahia yomuri Kenya.\nUmwuga w'ikipe.\nBayisenge wavukiye Huye, yakinnye umupira wamaguru muri Amagaju, Isonga, APR, KAC K\u00e9nitra, JS Massira, na USM Algeria. Muri Nyakanga 2015 yari hafi yo kwerekeza mwi ikipeya LASK Linz yomuri Otirishiya. \nMuri Mutarama 2019 yasinye amasezerano n'ikipe ya Saif yomuri Bangladesh. Yagarutse mu Rwanda muri AS Kigali muri Nzeri 2020. \nYongeye kwiyandikisha kuri Saif muGushyingo 2021. \nMuri Gashyantare 2023 yemeye gusinyira ikipe ya Gor Mahia yomuri Kenya, arangiza muri Werurwe 2023. Yakinnye nk'umukinnyi wa kabiri ukina inyuma muriyi kipe mumwaka we wambere w'imikino, ariko avuga ko ashaka kongera amasezerano ye. Yatwaye igikombe cya shampiyona muriyo kipe muri uwomwaka w'imikino. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nYayoboye ikipe y'u Rwanda y'abatarengeje imyaka 20. \nYakinnye umukino we wambere mpuzamahanga mw' ikipe y\u2019u Rwanda muri 2011, kandi yakinnye imikino yo gushaka itike yogukina igikombe cy\u2019isi cya FIFA. \n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo bigaragaza amanota y'u Rwanda ku isonga.\" "}
