{"id": "13108", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13108", "title": "Indwara y'umuhondo", "text": "Indwara y\u2019umuhondo (Neonatal Jaundice) ni uburwayi bukunze kwibasira abana bakivuka ikaba iterwa no kuba ababyeyi bafite amaraso adashobora kwivanga [Rhesus Incompatibility], uburwayi umubyeyi utwite asanganywe cyane cyane nko ku bagendana ubwandu bw\u2019agakoko ka Virusi itera Sida badafata imiti igabanya ubukana,iyi ndwara kandi ishobora kuba uruhererekane ku bafitanye isano-muryango. \n= Amashakiro ="}
{"id": "13109", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13109", "title": "Umuti wa Paracetamol", "text": "cParacetamol (parasetamoro) ni umuti ukoreshwa ahanini bashaka kugabanya ububabare bworoheje kandi nanone ushobora gukoreshwa bagabanya umuriro ku muntu urwaye \nUbusanzwe uyu muti wa parasetamoro ni umuti mwiza kandi utagaragaza ingaruka nyinshi ku wawukoresheje, nyamara nkuko bigaragara mu bushakashatsi bwakorewe mu bwongereza bugasohoka mukinyamakuru cyitwa Rheumatic Diseases, igihe uyu muti ufashwe kungano irenze uza kumwanya wambere mu miti ishobora kwangiza umwijima kugeza naho bisaba ko umwijima usimbuzwa aribyo bita (greffe h\u00e9patique/La transplantation h\u00e9patique mururimi rw`igifaransa) ndetse rimwe narimwe ukaba wahitana uwawufashe. "}
{"id": "13110", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13110", "title": "Idini rya Shitani", "text": "Idini rya Shitani ni itsinda ry\u2019abantu bavuga ko basenga shitani rifite icyicaro mu mugi wa Masusisheti (Massuchusetts) mu gihugu cya Leta zunze ubumwe z\u2019Amerika, muri mata 2019 ryaba ryaremewe nk\u2019idini n\u2019ikigo cya Leta gishinzwe\u00a0 iby\u2019imisoro\u00a0 (Internal Revenue Service (IRS) muri Leta zunze ubumwe za Amerika. \niri dini rigizwe n\u2019abayoboke bagera mu bihumbi ijana rikaba ryarashinzwe n\u2019abantu bari basanzwe batemera ko Imana Ibaho aribo bazwi nka ath\u00e9istes\n= Amashakiro ="}
{"id": "13111", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13111", "title": "Ndayisenga Valense", "text": "Ndayisenga Valens yavutse 1 mutarama 1994 yavukiye i Rwamagana aza kwigarurira imitima ya benshi mu Rwanda kubera ukuntu yatwaye ibikombe byinshi harimo na Tour du Rwanda ari muri Team Rwanda no muri Dimension Data for Qhubeka yo muri afurika y'epho, agakinira amakipe akomeye yo mu Rwanda ndetse no mumahanga, ubu ari mubuzima busazwe aho atuye muri Amerika, afite agahigo ko kuba ariwe munyarwanda wenyine watwaye Tour du Rwanda ubwo yari ku rwego rwa 2.2 mu mwaka wa 2014 na 2016, "}
{"id": "13112", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13112", "title": "IGITERANE AFRICA HAGURUKA", "text": "Afurika Haguruka ni igiterane ngaruka mwaka gitegurwa n' Umuryango Authentic word Ministry ukorera mu itorero rya zion Temple mu Rwanda\namateka.\nAfurika haguruka ni igiterane ngaruka mwaka kimaze imyaka kiba, bivuga ko cyatangiye mu mwaka wa 2000, kugeza ubu cyagiye kizana mpinduka mubuzima bw'abantu benshi cyane cyane abakirisitu,mubijyanye n'iyobokamana ndetse n'indi misozi yose abantu babamo mubuzima busanzwe, afurika haguruka iba buri mwaka mu mezi y'impeshyi,igiterane kibera no mubindi bihugu bya afurika ndetse kijyenda gihindura insanganyamatsiko bitewe n'umwaka.\nUmuyobozi mukuru wa Authentic word Ministry Intumwa Paul Dogiteri Gitwaza yahwe iryo yerekwa mu mwaka1995, avuga ko iki giterane gifitiye abanyafurka akamaro kanini cyane cyane kubijyanye ni iterambere ry,umugabane wa afurika ndetse no guhembuka kuyu mugabane muburyo bwose bijyanye no gusobunukirwa neza umugambi imana ifitiye afurika.\nIbindi Wamenya.\nAfurika haguruka rero ni ihuriro rusange ry'abanyafurika bizera Imana bahuzwa no gusengera hamwe,no kwiga ibyakorwa kugirango uyu mugabane ubohoke kdi abawutuye bagire mpinduka mu misozi irindwi ariyo: Iyobokamana. Umuryango,Politiki, ubucuruzi, uburezi,Imikino n'Imyidagaduro, izo nyigisho kuri iyo misozi zahabwa abakirisitu bose ba zion temple ndetse n'inshuti zose zibasha kwitabira ayo mahugurwa ngaruka mwaka atangwa muri icyo giterane, buri mwaka izo nyigisho zitangwa mu gitondo ku rusengero rwa zion temple mu Gatenga amasaha y' igitondo, mugihe igiterane cy'ububyutse kiba ni mugoroba muri sitade. uyu mwaka rero wa 2022 igiterane cyabereye kumusozi mpindura mateka uherereye mu mudugudu wa Giheka, akagali ka Kagugu, umurenge wa Kinyinya, mu karere ka Gasabo akaba ariho zion Temple yubatse sitade yabereyemo igiterane.\nIki igiterane uko kibaye burimwaka, hagiye habaho guhindukira kwabantu benshi baza kuri christo ndetse no guhindura amatwara y'abanyarwanda n'abanyafurika muri rusange bitewe n' inyigisho bagenda bahabwa mugihe cya afurika haguruka.\nIki giterane rero cyabaye nkaho gifunguye ibikorwa by'iterambere byari byarateganijwe igihe kinini na Zion temple kuri uyu musozi umaze igihe waraguzwe. \nUmuyobozi mukuru wa zion Temple Intumwa Paul Dogiteri Gitwaza avuga kandi ko bazahahindura umusozi wamasengesho, aho abantu baza kuruhukira no guhembukira, abantu benshi bazajya bava mubihugu bitandukanye baze kuhakorera umwiherero n'imiryango yabo, avuga kdi ko hazategurwa neza kuburyo buri muntu wese azahisanga akaryoherwa ki agahembuka mu muburiri no mumwuka."}
{"id": "13113", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13113", "title": "Bahari Ruth", "text": "Bahari Ruth ni umunyarwandakazi w'umusizi wamenyekanye cyane mu gisigo \"Ayabasore\" cya Rumaga Junior, akaba yaranitabiriye irushanwa ry'ubwiza (Miss Rwanda) ry'umwaka w'2022 \n= Reba =\nhttps://inyarwanda.com/inkuru/114471/umusizi-bahali-ruth-wakinnye-mu-gisigo-ayabasore-yahataniye-ikamba-rya-miss-rwanda-2022-am-114471.html"}
{"id": "13114", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13114", "title": "Umuzimu", "text": "Mu kwemera gakondo kwa Kinyarwanda, umuzimu ni umuntu wavuye mu bazima, akajya mu isanzure akaba ashobora kugira uruhare mu buzima bw\u2019abazima\nMu madini ya gikristu, umuzimu ni ijambo rikoreshwa mu gusobanura imyuka mibi igamije inabi ku bazima, iyo basenga birukana abo bazimu \n= Amashakiro ="}
{"id": "13115", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13115", "title": "Imbuga y'Amabonekerwa", "text": "imbuga y'Amabonekerwa ni agace gaherereye ku butaka butagatifu bw'i Kibeho mu karere ka Nyaruguru, Mu ntara y'amajyepfo mu Rwanda ku ngoro yitiriwe Bikira Mariya ya Kiliziya Gatolika. Iyi mbuga y\u2019Amabonekerwa yakomotse ku Ishuri ry\u2019abakobwa ryashinzwe mu 1968 i Kibeho aho Bikira Mariya yabonekeye agatanga ubutumwa bugenewe isi akabuha uwitwa Mukamazimpaka Nathalie,lponsine Mumureke na Mukangango Marie Claire. ako gace gaherereye neza neza imbere y'icyumba abo bakobwa bararagamo kuva tariki ya 15 Kanama 1982 kugeza kuri 28 Ugushyingo 1989 \n= Amashakiro ="}
{"id": "13116", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13116", "title": "TBB", "text": "Itsinda rigizwe n\u2019abahanzi batatu Mc Tino, Bob, na Benjah, rikora umuziki waryo mu njyana eshatu \"Dancehall\", \"R\u2019n\u2019B\" na \"Hip-Hop\" na ryo ryamaze gusenyuka nyuma y'aho Mc Tino yavuze ko agiye gukora ku giti cye. kuva mu mwaka wa 2011 nibwo bihuje nk\u2019itsinda.\nAmateka.\nUrugendo rwa muzika.\nTBB yamenyekanye mu ndirimbo \u2018Unshyira High\u2019, \u2019Ndashaka Urukundo\u2019 n\u2019izindi bagiye bakorana n\u2019bahanzi bakomeye mu Rwanda.\nIrushanwa rya Guma Guma.\nNk\u2019itsinda rije muri iri rushanwa bwa mbere, bavugaga ko byinshi bitabagoye cyane kubera ko n\u2019ubundi yari azi neza icyo bisaba ngo witware neza kubera igihe yari amaze /ariwe MC muri iri rushanwa. "}
{"id": "13117", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13117", "title": "Byukusenge Patrick", "text": "Byukusenge Patrick yavutse 1 kamena 1991 umukinnyi w'igare akaba umusore ukinira ikipe ya Benediction ignite niwe wagukanye irushanwa rya Central Race ryatangiriye i Musanze rigasorerezwa i Muhanga, yanatwaye Rwanda Cycling Cup, yegukanye kandi amarushanwa 2 ariyo Muhazi Challenge na Rubavu- Musanze, Byukusenge yarangije ku mwanya wa 5 ku rutonde rusange rwa Tour du Rwanda y\u2019uyu mwaka aho yasizwe iminota 3 n\u2019amasegonda 08 na Areruya Joseph wayegukanye."}
{"id": "13118", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13118", "title": "Manizabayo Eric", "text": "Manizabayo Eric uzwi nka Karadio yavutse 10 Mutarama mu mwaka 1999 umukinnyi w'igare ukinira Benediction Ignite nyuma yo gutwara shampiyona mu ngimbi mu mwaka 2017, yakoze amateka anatwara Shampiyona Nyarwanda y\u2019Umukino wo gusiganwa ku magare y\u2019umwaka wa mu mwaka 2022 y'abagabo nyuma y\u2019imyaka itanu, akaba kandi yaratwaye irushanwa ryiswe Kibugabuga Race icyiciro cya kabiri. Manizabayo Eric akaba kandi yaregukanye umwanya wa gatatu mu gace ka kane ka Tour du Rwanda mu mwaka 2021 niwe wabaye uwa mbere mu irushanwa ryahagurutse i Kigali risoreza i Gicumbi."}
{"id": "13120", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13120", "title": "Kibugabuga Race", "text": "Kibugabuga Race n'irushanwa ryabaye ku bufatanye bw\u2019Ishyirahamwe Nyarwanda ry\u2019Umukino wo gusiganwa ku magare, Ferwacy, n\u2019Akarere ka Bugesera, rikaba ari irushanwa ngaruka mwaka aho baturuka muri Kicukiro mu mihanda yerekeza mu bugesera, uritwaye akegukana ibihumbi ijana, kushuro yaryo yambere ryatwawe mu bagabo na Manizabayo Eric uzwi nka Karadiyo mu bagore ni Tuyishime Jacqueline.\nIntego yirushanwa.\nGuhuza abakinnyi b\u2019amagare batandukanye mu rwego rwokuzamurira abakinnyi amarushanwa\nGuteza imbere impano z\u2019abanyarwanda mu gusiganwa ku magare no kuzamura abakiri bato\nGutegura abakinnyi ku rwego rwo hejuru bategura amarushanwa mpuzamahanga\nAbatsinze Kibugabuga Race Mu myaka itandukanye.\n2021 (Edition ya mbere).\nAbagabo (Men Elite): Mugisha Samuel \nAbagore (Women Elite): Mukashema Josiane\nAbakiri bato (Juniors): Ndayisenga Valens (mu cyiciro cy\u2019abakiri bato)\n2022 (Edition ya kabiri).\nAbagabo (Men elite) Manizabayo Eric\nAbagore (Women Elite): Tuyishime Jacqueline\nAbakiri bato (Men Juniors): Hakimu Tuyizere\nAbangavu (Women Juniors): Uwera Aline"}
