{"id": "13123", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13123", "title": "Tuyishime Jacqueline", "text": "Tuyishime Jacqueline yavutse 28 ugushyingo 1999 avuka mu karere ka Nyabihu, inkumi inyonga igare ukinira ikipe ya Benediction excel Energy Club yatwaye igihembo cy'umukinnyi mwiza muri shampiyona y'amagare mu Rwanda mu cy'iciro cya bagore b'asiganwa n'igihe muri 2018, Yatsindiye kandi imidari itatu, harimo imidari ibiri ya feza n'umuringa umwe muri shampiyona nyafurika y'amagare yabereye muri Egiputa ubwo yari muri Team Rwanda. Tuyishime kandi yatwaye irushanwa rya Kibugabuga Race. Tuyishime yari mubazahagararira u Rwanda mu marushanwa ya siporo ahuza ibihugu bivuga ururimi rw\u2019Icyongereza mu Icyiciro cy\u2019abasiganwa ku magare mu bagore.\nAmakipe yakiniye.\nBenediction club / Benediction Ignite ndetse n\nikipe y'igihugu yo gusiganwa kumagare (TEAM RWANDA)"}
{"id": "13125", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13125", "title": "Ingabire Diane", "text": "Ingabire Diane yavutse 17 nyakanga 2001 ukinira ikipe ya Benediction excel energy club niwe wabaye uwa mbere mu isiganwa ryahagurutse i Kigali risoreza i Gicumbi, akaba yari yatsinze n\u2019isiganwa ryo gukunda gihugu Ryazengurukaga Kimihurura Ndetse Na Remera. Akaba kandi yari mubakinnyi bazahagararira u Rwanda mu marushanwa ya siporo ahuza ibihugu bivuga ururimi rw\u2019Icyongereza Icyiciro cy\u2019abasiganwa ku magare mu bagore muri Team Rwanda.\nIrushanwa.\nIngabire Diane ni umukinnyi wa ikipe y'amagare yitwa Canyon / SRAM Generation mu Bagore, aho yegukanye Umunsi wa Mbere w\u2019Isiganwa ry\u2019Amagare ryitiriwe Umunsi wo Kwibohora ryakiniwe mu intara y'amajyepfo rikaza rigasorezwa i Kibeho mu Karere ka Nyaruguru kuya tariki ya 2 Nyakanga 2023 ryitwa Nyaruguru Liberation Day Race."}
