{"id": "13128", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13128", "title": "Tuff Gangs", "text": "Tuff Gangs ni itsinda ry\u2019abaririmbyi bo mu njyana ya Hip Hop mu Rwanda, rigizwe n\u2019abarimo Jay Polly witabye Imana muri 2021, P Fla, Bulldogg, Green P na Fireman. Ni ryo tsinda ryashinze ibirindiro by\u2019umwihariko mu kuririmba iyi njyana.\nUmwuga.\nIri tsinda ryatangiye kumenyekana cyane mu mwaka 2008 biturutse ku ndirimbo bise \u2018Kwicuma\u2019 nyuma yayo ryagiye rikora izindi ndirimbo nyinshi nazo zakunzwe.\nP Fla muri Tuff Gangs.\nP Fla wari mu bari abaraperi ngenderwaho muri Tuff Gangs ariko wakunze guhora mu mahari na bagenzi be byanatumye bamwereka umuryango. Yatandukanye na Tuff Gangs muri Mutarama mu mwaka 2012, icyo gihe yahise ashinga itsinda yise \u201cImperial Mind State\u201d, yaje guhinduka \"Imperial Mafia Land\" aho yari ari kumwe na El Poeta bari baranabyaranye.\nTuff Gangs nshya ya Jay Polly.\nMu mwaka 2015 benshi batunguwe no kumva inkuru yavugaga ko Jay Polly yatandukanye na bagenzi be ndetse agahita yinjiza amatwara mashya mu itsinda akanashyiramo amaraso mashya. Tuff Gangs ya Jay Polly yari irimo Khalifan Ghovinda, Romeo na Young T bahoze mu itsinda rya Home Boyz; mu ndirimbo ya mbere bakoze bise \u2018Wiyita Iki?\u2019 batangiranye amashagaga bereka abari bagize Tuff Gangs ya mbere ko nta buhangange bari bafite bwatuma bigira ibyatwa. Bulldogg, Fireman na Green P nabo bahise bashinga itsinda bise Stone Church bahise bongeramo na Nick Breezy.\nGreen P, umwe mu baraperi batangije itsinda rya Tuff Gangs, kuri ubu we na bagenzi be Bull Dogg na Fireman bakaba barashinze icyo bise Stone Church nyuma y\u2019ubwumvikane buke bwagiye bugaragara hagati yabo na Jay Polly wari n\u2019inshuti magara ye, ubwo batugezagaho iyi ndirimbo nshya ya Stone church yagize icyo avuga ku makuru amaze iminsi avugwa kuri Stone Church na Tuff Gangs nshya ya Jay Polly."}
