{"id": "13139", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13139", "title": "Ubuforomo", "text": "Ubuforomo ni umwuga mu rwego rw'ubuzima wibanda ku kwita ku bantu, imiryango, ndetse n'abaturage kugira ngo bashobore kugera, kubungabunga, cyangwa kugarura ubuzima bwiza n'ubuzima buzira umuze. Bafite kandi uruhare rukomeye mu kwigisha, gusuzuma uko ibintu bimeze, bakanatanga ubufasha. Ubuforomo ni urufunguzo rw'ubuzima bw'igihugu. Ubuforomo bukubiyemo guteza imbere ubuzima, gukumira indwara, no kwita ku barwayi, abamugaye n'abapfa.\nInshingano z'abaforomo.\nAbaforomo gukurikirana kandi bagusuzuma abarwayi, abaforomo bagomba kuba abanyabwenge, bahuza n'imitekerereze n'ibyo bize kandi bafite ubumenyi buhagije mu bijyanye n'umwuga bakora. Ibi ni bimwe mubyo abaforomo bakora buri munsi:\nAho ubuforomo bukorerwa.\nAbaformo bashobora gukorera ahantu henshi hatandukanye, muri ho twavuga:"}
