{"id": "13142", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13142", "title": "Bugesera Cycling Team", "text": "bugesera cycling team n'ikipe yabayeho biturutse mu bitekerezo by\u2019Akarere ka Bugesera, ikaba yaravutse ndetse igenda ikura intambwe ku yindi ibifashijwemo n\u2019ako karere n\u2019abafatanyabikorwa bako nka Gasore Serge Foundation na Jibu, imwe mu makipe amenyerewe mu mukino w\u2019amagare aho ibarizwa mu banyamuryango ba Ferwacy, ishyirahamwe Nyarwanda ry\u2019Umukino wo gusiganwa ku Magare mu Rwanda. Ikaba yitabira amarushanwa menshi atandukanye:Irushanwa rya Gisaka, Heroes Cycling Cup."}
{"id": "13143", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13143", "title": "Karongi Vision Sports Center", "text": "Karongi Vision Sports Center Ikipe y\u2019umukino w\u2019amagare yi Karongi, ikaba ije gususurutsa no gukura mu bwigunge Akarere ka Karongi katagiraga undi mukino uhabarizwa, ifite intego zo kuzamura impano z\u2019abanya Karongi mu mukino w\u2019amagare. Iyi nimwe mu makipe manshyashya mu mukino w\u2019amagare aho nayo ibarizwa mu banyamuryango ba Ferwacy, ishyirahamwe Nyarwanda ry\u2019Umukino wo gusiganwa ku Magare mu Rwanda."}
