{"id": "13152", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13152", "title": "Muhoza Eric", "text": "Muhoza Eric yavutse 30 kamena 2002 ukinira VC Essartais yatwaye isiganwa rya Tour du Pays de Chantonnay mu Bufaransa, n'isiganwa rikinwa n\u2019amakipe atarabigize umwuga. Muhoza akaba yarabaye 3 mu irushanwa Kigali-Gicumbi akurikira Manizabayo Eric wabaye uwa mbere na Mugisha Moise wabaye uwa kabiri."}
