{"id": "13157", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13157", "title": "Umukino wa Cricket", "text": "Cricket ni umukino wa ukinwa hagati yamakipe abiri yabakinnyi cumi numwe kumurima rwagati rwagati ni ikibuga 22-yard (20-metre) gifite kuri buri mpera, buri kimwe kigizwe nimpande ebyiri zingana kuri stump eshatu. Uruhande rwumukino watsinze rwiruka mukubita umupira watsindagiye kuri wiketi hanyuma ukiruka hagati yikibuga, mugihe uruhande rwo gukinira hamwe numwanya rugerageza kuburizamo (mukubuza umupira kuva mukibuga, no kugeza umupira kuri wiketi) no kwirukana buri bateri (nuko \"basohotse\"). Mu buryo bwo kwirukanwa harimo gukubitwa, iyo umupira ukubise igishyitsi ukanatanga ingwate, kandi kuruhande rwikibuga haba gufata umupira nyuma yo gukubitwa, ariko mbere yuko ikubita hasi, cyangwa gukubita wiketi umupira mbere bateri irashobora kwambuka igikoma imbere ya wiketi. Iyo abakinnyi icumi basezerewe, imipira irangira kandi amakipe ahinduranya inshingano. Umukino ucibwa babiri, bafashijwe numusifuzi wa gatatu numusifuzi wumukino mumikino mpuzamahanga. Bavugana nabatanga amanota abiri hanze yikibuga bandika amakuru yimibare yimikino.\nUmuco.\nIngaruka mubuzima bwa buri munsi.\nCricket yagize uruhare runini ku muco uzwi, haba muri n'ahandi. Nkurugero, ryagize ingaruka bihugu, cyane cyane ururimi rwicyongereza, hamwe ninteruro zitandukanye nka \"iyo ntabwo ari cricket\" (ibyo birenganya), \"yagize imipira myiza \" (yabayeho igihe kirekire) na \" wiketi ifatika \". \"Kuri wiketi ifatanye\" (\"bita\" \"imbwa ifatanye\" cyangwa \"inkono ya kole\") ni ikigereranyo gikoreshwa mu gusobanura ibintu bitoroshye. Yatangiye nkijambo ryibihe bigoye byo gukina muri cricket, biterwa nikibuga cyoroshye kandi cyoroshye. \nMubuhanzi numuco uzwi.\nCricket ni ingingo yibikorwa byabasizi b'icyongereza bazwi, barimo na. \"Kurenga Umupaka\" (1963), wanditswe na Trinidadian, ukunze kwitwa igitabo cyiza kuri siporo iyo ari yo yose yanditswe. "}
{"id": "13158", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13158", "title": "Ugutwi'", "text": "Ugutwi ni rushoboza kandi, mubinyabuzima zikoresha. Mu nyamaswa z\u2019inyamabere, ubusanzwe ugutwi gusobanurwa nkibice bitatu -. Ugutwi kwinyuma kugizwe na pinna numuyoboro wamatwi. Kubera ko ugutwi kwinyuma nigice cyonyine kigaragara cyamatwi mu nyamaswa nyinshi, ijambo \"ugutwi\" akenshi ryerekeza ku gice cyo hanze cyonyine. Ugutwi rwagati kurimo tympanic cavity na ossicles eshatu. Ugutwi kw'imbere kwicara muri labyrint ya bony, kandi karimo ibyubaka urufunguzo rw'ibyumviro byinshi: imiyoboro ya semicircular, ituma habaho kuringaniza no gukurikirana ijisho iyo bigenda; utricle na saccule, ituma habaho kuringaniza iyo ihagaze; na cochlea, ifasha kumva. Amatwi yintegamubiri ashyizwe muburyo bumwe muburyo bwimpande zombi zumutwe, gahunda ifasha amajwi yumvikana.\nImiterere Yugutwi.\nUgutwi kwu muntu kugizwe n'ibice bitatu - ugutwi kw'inyuma, ugutwi hagati no gutwi imbere. Umuyoboro w ugutwi w ugutwi kwinyuma utandukanijwe numwuka wuzuye tympanic cavit yo mumatwi yo hagati na eardrum. Ugutwi rwagati kurimo amagufwa atatu mato - ossicles - yagize uruhare mu guhererekanya amajwi, kandi agahuzwa n'umuhogo kuri nasofarynx, binyuze mu gufungura umuyoboro wa Eustachian. Ugutwi kw'imbere kurimo ingingo za otolith - utricle na saccule - hamwe n'imiyoboro ya semicircular ya sisitemu ya sisitemu ya vestibular, hamwe na cochlea ya sisitemu yo kumva. \nUkogukora.\nMugihe cya ugutwi gukura nkuburyo butatu butandukanye: ugutwi kwimbere, ugutwi rwagati nugutwi kwinyuma. Buri miterere ikomoka kumurongo wa mikorobe itandukanye:, na. "}
{"id": "13159", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13159", "title": "Indwara Ya Kanseri", "text": "Kanseri ni iterwa no ziba kandi. Utugingo ngengabuzima twahinduwe rimwe na rimwe turangiza tugakora misa yitwa. Ingirabuzimafatizo za kanseri zikunda kwibasira ingirabuzimafatizo hafi kandi zikitandukanya n'ikibyimba cy'umwimerere. Baca bimuka biciye mumitsi yamaraso hamwe nimiyoboro ya lymphatique kugirango bakore ikindi kibyimba (metastasis).\nUbwoko Bwindwara ya Kanseri.\nKanseri (izina mu cyongereza na gifaransa: \"cancer\")\nBimwe mubitera Canseri.\nGuhinduranya bisanzwe.\nUbushakashatsi bw\u2019Abanyamerika kubwibyo ntibifitanye isano nizungura cyangwa ibidukikije. Ibisubizo ariko byateje impaka kandi ntabwo byishimira ubwumvikane. OMS ivuga ko 30% kugeza kuri 50% bya kanseri zishobora kwirindwa, hashingiwe ku mpamvu zizwi ubu \nKwirinda.\nHagomba gukorwa itandukaniro hagati yo \"gukumira\", ishaka kugabanya indwara ziterwa no kurwanya ibitera, no \"gusuzuma\", ishaka kwerekana indwara hakiri kare kugira ngo iyivure byoroshye.\nKwirinda kanseri bishingiye:"}
{"id": "13161", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13161", "title": "Breast Cancer Research and Treatment", "text": "Breast Cancer Research and Treatment ni ikinyamakuru cya cyibanda ku bushakashatsi no kuvura kanseri y'ibere. Igenewe abantu benshi bashakashatsi ku mavuriro, epidemiologiste, immunologiste cyangwa abahanga mu binyabuzima bashishikajwe na kanseri y'ibere.\nUbwoko bw'ubushakasats zemewe muri iki kinyamakuru zirimo: ubushakashatsi bw'umwimerere, gusubiramo abashyitsi, kuganira ku bibazo bitavugwaho rumwe, gusubiramo ibitabo, raporo z'inama, amabaruwa yandikiwe umwanditsi, hamwe n'ubwanditsi. Inyandiko zandikishijwe intoki zaciwe kugirango zemerwe nitsinda ryabasifuzi mpuzamahanga kandi banyuranye. Keretse niba iyo bih yarabonye tittys nini noneho usige iyo bih nta cap bro yabonye kuba thicc nka fuhh ku mana niba yarabonye iyo ndwara ya titty shi noneho usige iyo bih. IYI UKURI NTA CAP"}
{"id": "13162", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13162", "title": "World Vision International", "text": "World Vision International ni umuryango mpuzamahanga, washinzwe ku ya 22 Nzeri 1950 na, Ifite ibiro mu bihugu 90 ku isi. Icyicaro cyayo mpuzamahanga gifite icyicaro i Londere mu Bwongereza naho umuyobozi wacyo ni Andrew Morley.\nAmateka yahambere.\nMu 1947, (Bob) yavuyeho nk'umunyamakuru w'intambara muri Aziya. Mu ruzinduko rwe mu, yahuye na Tena Hoelkedoer, umwarimu amumenyesha umwana wataye Hoelkedoer adafite uburyo bwo kwita ku mwana, abaza Pierce icyo yamukorera. Yatanze 5\u00a0 yanyuma kandi yiyemeza kohereza amafaranga angana buri kwezi kugirango afashe kurera umwana. Ubukene, imibabaro y\u2019abantu n\u2019imiterere y\u2019abana b'imfubyi birwanya Pierce, kandi asezeranya ko azakangurira gusubira muri Amerika kugira ngo akemure ibyo bakeneye. Ni yo mpamvu, mu 1950, Pierce yashinze World Vision International izaba mu myaka mike ishize imwe mu miryango ikomeye itabara imbabare. Mu 1979, yafashije gushinga Inama y\u2019ivugabutumwa ishinzwe imari Muri 2020, ku rubuga rwayo, ivuga ko ikorera mu bihugu 90 kandi ifite abakozi 37.000.\nUbufatanye.\nWorld Vision ikora ku bufatanye na n'ibigo byayo nk'Umuryango bashinzwe imishinga y'iterambere. Niwo muntu wa mbere ukwirakwiza ibiribwa bitangwa na gahunda y\u2019ibiribwa ku isi \nIbisubizo na bije.\nItangaza raporo ya buri mwaka ibazwa, isobanura imikoreshereze y'amafaranga muri buri gahunda, amafaranga y'ubuyobozi, umushahara w'abayobozi, umubare, umubare w'inkunga itaziguye.\nImpamyabumenyi.\nWorld Vision yakiriye ibyemezo byubuyobozi bwiza nimiryango yigenga nka na.Umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta utabara imbabare ni umukono ku mahame agenga imyitwarire ya Croix-Rouge n'Umushinga wa Sphere, byemeza cyane cyane kutabogama no kwigenga ku bikorwa byacyo.: ni umurimo wabantu bose, nta gutandukanya ubwoko, inkomoko, igitsina cyangwa idini.\nkwemezwa nkumunyamuryango.\nUyu muryango ni umwe mu bagize."}
{"id": "13163", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13163", "title": "Save the Children", "text": "Save the Children ni umuryango utegamiye kuri leta urengera ku isi. Uyu muryango urigaragaza nka umuryango munini wigenga ku isi ukorera abana \".\nImiterere.\nYashizeho ihuriro mpuzamahanga (Alliance International Save the Children) ubunyamabanga bwayo bukaba i Londres kandi bugenzura kandi bugahuza ibiro 27 by\u2019igihugu Save the Children. Buri biro bikora bifasha abana mugihugu cyacyo, ariko no mumahanga.I, na, Save the Children ifite ibiro politiki\u00bbYagize uruhare mu guhindura imirimo, haba ku Muryango w\u2019abibumbye cyangwa ku Muryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Uburayi, kugira ngo huzuzwe imikoranire n\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye n\u2019abandi.\nAmateka.\nGutangira.\nAmateka ya Save the Children itangirira i Londres mu, hashyizweho ishyirahamwe ryambere \"Save the Children\". Umwaka ukurikira. ubumwe mpuzamahanga \"ishingiye. Azaba ku isonga mu guharanira uburenganzira bw'abana ku rwego mpuzamahanga, kubera ko ari we uzategura \". Itangazo rya Geneve \u201d, Yemejwe n'Umuryango mu 1924 kandi ibanziriza amasezerano wo mu.Mu gihe, Save the Children yakomeje ibikorwa byayo, cyane cyane tubikesha imiryango yo mu bihugu bidafite aho bibogamiye yakoraga mu izina ry'abo mu bihugu by'intambara.Ihuriro mpuzamahanga ni bisanzwe \u00a0ryakozwe muri Kamena 1989, amezi ane mbere yuko iyemezwa, riba ishingiro ry\u2019ibikorwa byose Save the Children.Umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta wahagaritse ibikorwa byawo muri Koreya ya Ruguru mu mwaka wa 2018, ukaba utagishoboye gutanga ubufasha bw'ikiremwamuntu kubera ibihano mpuzamahanga."}
{"id": "13165", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13165", "title": "UNICEF", "text": "Ikigega cy\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye cyita ku bana, gikunze kuvugwa mu magambo ahinnye UNICEF (nanone cyitwa Unicef), ni ikigo cy\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye (UN) kigamije guteza imbere no guteza imbere imiterere y\u2019abana. Igihe yaremwaga11Ku ya 11 Ukuboza 1946, izina ryayo ryahoze ari Ishami ry\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ryita ku byihutirwa byita ku bana (Fonds d'urgence international des Nations un pour l'enfants), izina ryayo ryagumanye igihe ryakoreshaga izina ryaryo muri, igihe rihinduka urwego ruhoraho Igira uruhare runini mu gutegura, gutegura no guteza imbere (CRC), yemejwe mu nama yabereye ku20Ku ya 20 Ugushyingo 1989. \nIntego.\nUnicef yihaye intego zambere \nUrukingo.\nNk\u2019uko Unicef ibivuga, inkingo zagize uruhare runini mu kuzamura ubuzima bw'isi mu 20 derni\u00e8res ishize. Gahunda yo gukingira kandi yemerera izindi ngamba nko gukwirakwiza inyongeramusaruro, kuvura indwara ziterwa n'imibu. UNICEF ivuga ko hiyongereyeho ibyo bikorwa bituma izo gahunda zikora neza cyane. kirimo kwiyongera muri iki gihe kandi kigira ingaruka mbi kuri serivisi z'ubuzima zijyanye no gukingira. Birashobora kugaragara ko umubare wabana bakingiwe ugenda ugabanuka cyane ; umubare utari muto w'abana bahura n'indwara ziteje akaga. Kuva mu 2016, umubare w'impfu wiyongereyeho kimwe cya kabiri. Ubukangurambaga bwo gukingira bwarahagaritswe mu bihugu byinshi kubera icyorezo cya Covid-19.\nIbihembo.\nUnicef yakira kuri26Ku ya 26 Ukwakira 1965 "}
{"id": "13166", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13166", "title": "LODA", "text": "NIkigo gishinzwe iterambere ry\u2019inzego z'ibanze (LODA) ni Ikigega cya Leta kiyobowe na MINALOC. Yashyizweho n\u2019itegeko n \u00b0 62/2013 ryo ku wa 27 kanama mu mwaka 2013 rishyiraho ikigo gishinzwe iterambere ry\u2019inzego z\u2019ibanze (LODA) no kugena inshingano zacyo, imitunganyirize n\u2019imikorere.\nInshingano n'intego za LODA\nInshingano n'intego za LODA.\nkigo gishinzwe iterambere ry\u2019ibigo by\u2019ibanze (LODA) ni ikigo cya Leta kiyobowe na Minisiteri y\u2019ubutegetsi bw\u2019ibanze (MINALOC). LODA yibanze ku iterambere ry\u2019ubukungu n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019abaturage, kurengera imibereho, no kongerera ubushobozi inzego z\u2019ubuyobozi mu nzego z\u2019inshingano zayo.\nImikorere Ya LODA kubuzima Bwabaturage.\nLeta itanga amafaranga agera kuri miliyari 67 ku mwaka avuye mu Ngengo y\u2019Imari, akagenerwa gahunda zose zigamije kuvana abaturage kurwanya imirire mibi nokuteza imbere ariko ngo hari abagenerwabikorwa bayakoresha ibitabateza imbere hamwe n\u2019abayobozi batayafashisha abaturage bakennye."}
{"id": "13169", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13169", "title": "First Aid", "text": "Imfashanyo yambere nubufasha bwambere kandi bwihuse buhabwa umuntu uwo ari we wese ufite uburwayi bworoheje cyangwa cyangwa, ubwitonzi butangwa kugirango ubuzima burinde ubuzima, gukumira indwara nabi, cyangwa guteza imbere gukira. Harimo gutabarwa kwambere mubihe bikomeye mbere yubuvuzi bwumwuga bwaboneka, nko gukora resipisiyumu yumutima (CPR) mugihe utegereje ambulance, ndetse no kuvura byimazeyo ibintu bito, nko gukoresha plaque kumukata. Imfashanyo yambere ikorwa numuntu ufite amahugurwa yibanze yubuvuzi. Ubuzima bwo mu mutwe ubufasha bwambere ni kwagura igitekerezo cyubufasha bwambere kugirango ubuzima bwo mu mutwe, mugihe ubufasha bwambere bwimitekerereze bukoreshwa nko kuvura hakiri kare abantu bafite ibyago byo kwandura. Imfashanyo ya mbere y\u2019amakimbirane, yibanda ku kubungabunga no kugarura imibereho y\u2019umuntu ku giti cye cyangwa imibanire myiza, irageragezwa muri Kanada.\nIbindi wamenya.\nHariho ibihe byinshi bishobora gusaba ubufasha bwambere, kandi ibihugu byinshi bifite amategeko, amabwiriza, cyangwa ubuyobozi, byerekana urwego ntarengwa rwo gutanga ubufasha bwambere mubihe bimwe. Ibi birashobora kubamo amahugurwa yihariye cyangwa ibikoresho bizaboneka kumurimo wakazi (nka), gutanga infashanyo yambere yinzobere mubiterane rusange, cyangwa amahugurwa yubufasha bwambere buteganijwe mumashuri. Imfashanyo yambere, ariko, ntabwo isaba byanze bikunze ibikoresho runaka cyangwa ubumenyi bwambere, kandi irashobora gushiramo impinduka hamwe nibikoresho biboneka muricyo gihe, akenshi nabantu badahuguwe. \nAmahame ya Fist Aider.\nNinde mufasha wambere cg se first aider mundimi zamahanga: ni umuntubashoboye gutanga ubufasha kuri umuntu wahahamutse cyangwa urwayemu rwego rwo kumukomezamubuzima no kwirindaimiterere yomuhungabanya. Umufasha cg fisrt aider\u00a0 agomba kuba afite ubuhanga, abizi\u00a0 neza neza icyo agomba gukora kandi a kora atuje kandi afite\u00a0 ubushobozi.We:yiinda ibikomere by'inyongera cg se kuba ya Gira uruhare mu kurokora ubuzima\u00a0 akarinda imiterere yuwahohotewe kubonabibi"}
{"id": "13171", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13171", "title": "First Aid Nursing Yeomanry", "text": "Imfashanyo ya mbere y\u2019ubuforomo Yeomanry mu magambo ahinnye yiswe FANY, ni ishami ry\u2019abategarugori bigenga b\u2019abongereza n\u2019abagiraneza, rifatanije ariko ntirigizwe z\u2019akarere. Ijambo \"\" (abanyamafarasi) ryerekeza ku kuba mu ntangiriro abagore bari abayoboke bayo batwaraga amafarasi.\nAmateka.\nIntangiriro.\nmu. Kuva mu ntangiriro, yari ishinzwe guhuza ibitaro byo mu murima n'imirongo y'imbere mu rwego rwo gutabara byihutirwa. Mu, yatanze serivisi zikomeye hamwe na za modoka zayo zitwara abarwayi mu Bufaransa no mu Bubiligi. \nuruhare rwa First Aid Nursing Yeomanry Mu Ntambara.\nNyuma y'intambara, sitati zayo zaravuguruwe. Mu 1927, umurambo wamenyekanye bwa mbere na Minisiteri y\u2019intambara. Yatangiye kugaragara mu gitabo cya gisirikare mu \"mashyirahamwe y\u2019abagore\" imaze gushyira ibikorwa byabo mu gisirikare mu bukangurambaga. Yahinduye uruhare rwe mu gutanga abashoferi ba ambulance y\u2019abagore ajya mu butumwa rusange bwo gutwara abantu, byagaragaye mu guhindura izina rye.: muri 1937 yabaye \"Serivisi ishinzwe gutwara abantu (FANY)\"."}
{"id": "13172", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13172", "title": "Shampiyona y\u2019igihugu y\u2019amagare", "text": "Shampiyona y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019Amagare 2022 mu Rwanda ni shampiyona itegurwa n'ishyirahamwe rya magare mu Rwanda Ferwacy, aho riherutse gutwarwa na: \n1. Manizabayo Eric\n2. Iradukunda Emmanuel wa Nyabihu Cycling Team\n3. Munyaneza Didier wa Protouch\n4. Muhoza Eric"}
{"id": "13174", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13174", "title": "Biramahire Abeddy Christophe", "text": "Bamwe bamwitaga Biramahire Christophe abandi bakamwita Biramahire Abeddy hakaba n'ababikusanyiriza hamwe bakamwita Biramahire Christophe Abeddy. Kuri ubu uyu musore ukinira ikipe y'igihugu amavubi, aremeza ko yitwa Biramahire Abeddy kuko yanabiboneye ibyangombwa. Uyu musore yavutse Kuwa 04 ukwakira mu mwaka 1998 avukira mu munjyi wa Kigali.\nUrugendo rwa ruhago.\nBiramahire Abeddy yaciye mu ikipe ya Bugesera FC barananiranwa agaruka muri Interforce anayifasha kugera mu mikino ya \u00bd cy\u2019irangiza mu cyiciro cya kabiri cy\u2019umwaka w\u2019imikino 2015-2016 aho bakuwemo na Pepinieres FC. Yaje kugana mu ikipe ya Police FC akinamo umwaka w\u2019imikino 2016-2017 atsinda ibitego birindwi (7). Ibi byaje bisanga ibitego bibiri (2) yatsindiye ikipe y\u2019igihugu y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 20 yashakaga itike y\u2019igikombe cya Afurika. Igitego kimwe yagitsinze Uganda ikindi acyinjiza Misiri kuri penaliti.\nMu mwaka w\u2019imikino 2017-2018 yari amaze kubonera Police FC igitego kimwe (1) yatsinze FC Musanze mbere yuko abona igitego mu ikipe y\u2019igihugu Amavubi nkuru. Igitego yatsinze Ethiopia kuwa 5 Ugushyingo 2017 i Addis Ababa.\nAsinya mu ikipe yo muri Oman.\nBiramahire Abeddy Christophe uheruka gufata rutemikirere, yerekeza muri Oman mu ikipe ye nshya AL SUWAIQ CLUB yamaze gusinya amasezerano,aho yahise anerekanwa ku mugaragaro. Biramahire Abeddy yari asoje amasezerano muri AS Kigali yari amasezerano y\u2019imyaka ibiri."}
{"id": "13175", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13175", "title": "Tour de Huye", "text": "Tour de Huye ni irishanwa mu mukino wa magare ribera i Huye, aho abasiganwa bazenguruka inshuro icumi imihanda ya Karubanda bakaza no kuzenguruka umujyi wa Huye inshuro eshanu, aho yatwaye na Ruberwa Jean Damascene ukina mu ikipe Nyabihu Cycling Team hamwe na Habimana jean Eric wa Fly Cycling Club mu cyiciro cy'abakiri bato."}
{"id": "13176", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13176", "title": "Ishimwe Patrick", "text": "Ishimwe Patrick umukinnyi mu mukino wo gusiganwa ku magare wakiniraga ikipe ya Cine Elmay yahitanwe n\u2019impanuka ubwo yari mu myitozo mu Karere ka Kamonyi, nkuko byavuzwe n' Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019Umukino w\u2019Amagare mu Rwanda, Ferwacy. "}
{"id": "13177", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13177", "title": "Usengimana Danny", "text": "Danny Usengimana yavutse tariki 10 Werurwe 1996 ya kiniye APR FC n\u2019ikipe y\u2019igihugu Amavubi.\nUrugendo rwa ruhago.\nDanny w\u2019imyaka 26 y\u2019amavuko, yatangiriye umupira w\u2019amaguru mu makipe y\u2019abato ya Gasabo United na SEC Academy, akomereza mu Isonga FC na Police FC. Nyuma kuva muri Police FC, uyu rutahizamu wakiniye Amavubi muri CHAN 2016, yerekeje muri Singida United yo muri Tanzania, ayikinira umwaka umwe. Mu 2018, Danny yerekeje muri Tersana Sporting Club yo mu Misiri, ariko ntiyahatinze kuko mu ntangiriro za 2019 yagarutse muri APR FC kugeza magingo aya niyo agikinira.\nIkipe ari gukinamo.\nUsengimana usanzwe akinira Police FC. \nIbyo gusezera gukina umupira.\nHari n\u2019amakuru yigeze kuvugwa ko Danny yaba agiye gusezera gukina umupira w\u2019amaguru agasanga umugore we muri Canada ariko nyuma yaje kuyahakana."}
{"id": "13178", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13178", "title": "Imanishimwe Emmanuel", "text": "Myugariro w\u2019ikipe y\u2019igihugu y\u2019u Rwanda Amavubi uzwi nka Mangwende, wavutse ku ya 2 Gashyantare 1995\nAmateka.\nUrugendo rwa ruhago.\nImanishimwe Emmanuel yari amaze imyaka ine (4) akinira, APR FC nayo yagezemo avuye muri Rayon Sports yakiniye imyaka ibiri kuva 2015 kugeza 2017\nUrugendo rwo muri Serbia.\nKu wa 03 Gashyantare 2019 ni bwo uyu musore yahagurutse i Kigali yerekeza muri FK Napredak Kru\u0161evac yo muri Serbia. Ni ikipe uyu musore yemeje ko yari yarangiwe na Dr Petrovic wahoze amutoza muri APR FC. Mangwende wari witezweho gusinyana na FK Napredak Kru\u0161evac amasezerano y\u2019imyaka itatu, yageze muri Serbia ubuyobozi bw\u2019iriya kipe busaba ko yayikinira nk\u2019intizanyo mu gihe cy\u2019amezi atandatu; ibintu APR FC yakiniraga yanze.\nAho ubu abarizwa.\nImanishimwe yahagurutse ku Kibuga Mpuzamahanga cy\u2019Indege cya Kigali i Kanombe saa saba z\u2019ijoro rishyira ku itariki ya 1 Kanama 2021, yerekeza i Rabat muri Maroc.\nUyu mukinnyi w\u2019imyaka 26, wari ugifite amasezerano muri APR FC, yaguzwe ibihumbi 130$ (agera kuri miliyoni 130 Frw) mu gihe we ubwe yahawe ibihumbi 300$ (miliyoni 300 Frw) ku masezerano y\u2019imyaka itatu. Mbere yo guhagaruka i Kigali, Imanishimwe yashimiye ubuyobozi bwa APR FC ku mahirwe bwamuhaye yo kujya gukomereza urugendo rwe rwo gukinira umupira w\u2019amaguru muri Shampiyona ya Maroc isanzwe ari iy\u2019abanyamwuga."}
{"id": "13179", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13179", "title": "Nsoro Tiote", "text": "Uwimana Emmanuel uzwi nka Nsoro Tiote, wakiniye amakipe atandukanye arimo AS Kigali,\nAmateka.\nUwimana Emmanuel watangiriye umupira w\u2019amaguru muri Centre Sportif de Rwamagana, yaje kubengukwa n\u2019abatoza ba Academy ya FERWAFA (Isonga FC) muri 2009 amaramo imyaka itatu (3). Muri 2012 yaje gushimwa na Kayiranga Baptiste amujyana muri Kiyovu Sport akinamo igice cya kabiri cya shampiyona y\u2019umwaka w\u2019imikino 2012-2013.\nUbwo AS Muhanga yahuraga na Rayon Sports.\nShampiyona 2012-2013 irangiye yahise anyarukira muri AS Kigali ubwo yari igitozwa na Cassa Mbungo Andre. Uyu musore yaje kugenda agira ibibazo by\u2019imvune zikomeye bigera n\u2019aho ajya kubagwa. Nyuma yaje gutizwa muri Etincelles FC mbere yo kugarurwa muri AS Kigali hagati muri shampiyona 2015-2016 mbere yo kujya muri Espoir FC kuko imyaka ine yari afitanye na AS Kigali yari irangiye.\nNyuma yo kuva muri AS Kigali, Uwimana yahise agana muri Espoir FC mu 2017 asinyayo amasezerano y\u2019umwaka umwe (2017-2018). Nyuma asoje nibwo yahise ajya muri Sunrise FC asinya imyaka ibiri. Gusa ntabwo iyo myaka yayimaze muri Sunrise FC kuko yahamaze umwe (2018-2019) undi wa 2019-2020 awukina muri FC Musanze.\nNyuma yo gusoza 2019-2020 muri FC Musanze, Uwimana yahise akina umwaka w\u2019imikino 2020-2021 muri AS Muhanga, ikipe avuyemo agana muri Rwamagana City."}
{"id": "13180", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13180", "title": "Bashunga Abouba", "text": "Bashunga Abouba Umunyezamu w\u2019umunyarwanda wakiniraga ikipe ya Rayon Sports, wageze muri Rayon Sports muri 2015 avuye muri Gicumbi FC.\nAmateka.\nUrugendo rwa ruhago.\nBashunga Abouba yakuriye mu ishuri ry\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru rya APR FC, akinira Marines FC na Gicumbi FC mbere yo kwerekeza muri Rayon Sports yamazemo imyaka ibiri mbere yo kujya muri Kenya mu ikipe ya Bandari FC yamazemo umwaka, Buildcon FC yo muri Zambia na Mukura VS yikojejemo ntiyayikinira. Si ikipe ya mbere yo hanze y\u2019u Rwanda yaba agiye gukinira kuko yakiniye ikipe ya Bandari FC yo muri Kenya ndetse na Buildcon yo muri Zambia.\nUbu aho ari kubarizwa.\nUmunyezamu w\u2019umunyarwanda wakiniraga ikipe ya Rayon Sports, Bashunga Abouba yamaze gusinyira umwaka umwe ikipe ya FC Setubal yo muri Portugal. Tariki ya 19 Mutarama 2022 nibwo uyu munyezamu yafashe rutimikerere yerekeza muri iki gihugu kurangizanya n\u2019iyi kipe aho byavugwaga ko agiye mu igeragezwa ariko akaba ntaryo yakoze. Yamaze gusinyira iyi kipe ikina mu cyiciro cya 3 amasezerano y\u2019umwaka umwe ariko akaba yari atarahabwa release letter (urupapuro rumurekura)."}
{"id": "13181", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13181", "title": "Hategekimana Bonheur", "text": "Hategekimana Bonheur ni umunyezamu wa Rayon Sports yaguze mu ikipe ya Espoir FC yo mu karere ka Rusizi. \nAmateka.\nUrugendo rwa ruhago.\nHetegekimana Bonheur umunyezamu waciye muri Kiyovu Sport mbere yo kugana muri AS Kigali, kuri ubu yari amaze igice cy\u2019umwaka w\u2019imikino nta masezerano afite. Gusa magingo aya yahawe amasezerano y\u2019imyaka ibiri muri AS Kigali n\u2019ubundi asanzwemo. ubu akaba ari muri Rayon Sports."}
{"id": "13182", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13182", "title": "Tuyizere Hashim", "text": "Tuyizere Hashim umukinnyi mu mukino w'igare, ubarizwa mu ikipe ya Les Amis Sportifs yi Rwamagana akaba yarabaye uwa mbere muri irushanwa rya Kibugabuga mu ingimbi."}
{"id": "13183", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13183", "title": "Mushimiyimana Jean Bosco", "text": "Mushimiyimana Jean Bosco umukinnyi mu mukino w'igare, ubarizwa mu ikipe ya Les Amis Sportifs yi Rwamagana akaba yarabaye uwa kabili mu ingimbi m' irushanwa rya Kibugabuga race."}
{"id": "13185", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13185", "title": "Nkundabera Eric", "text": "Nkundabera Eric yavutse 1 mutarama1997 ni umunyarwanda, umukinnyi mu mukino w'igare, ubarizwa mu ikipe ya Les Amis Sportifs yi Rwamagana akaba yarabaye umwe mubitabiriye irushanwa rya Kibugabuga race. ni umukinnyi wafate umwanya wa 16 mu gusiganwa ku magare mu bagabo muri shampiyona y'igihugu cyu Rwanda mu 2022."}
{"id": "13186", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13186", "title": "Tuyizere Etienne", "text": "Tuyizere Etienne yavutse 12 kanama 2003, umukinnyi mu mukino w'igare, ubarizwa mu ikipe ya Benediction Ignite akaba yarabaye umwe mu bitabiriye irushanwa rya Kibugabuga race. Akaba yarabaye uwatsinze irushanwa ryingimbi muri Shampiyona nyafurika 2021."}
{"id": "13187", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13187", "title": "Benediction Ignite", "text": "Benediction Ignite n' imwe mu ikipe zikina zikoresheje amagare, ikaba arimwe mu makipe azahatanira irushanwa rikomeye mu gihugu-Tour du Rwanda nandi marushanwa aba mugihugu no hanze yacyo kuko ari mumakipe yemewe na UCI, bamwe mu bakinnyi ikoresha ni: Areruya Joseph, Byukusenge Patrick, Munyaneza Didier, Manizabayo Eric, Nzafashwanayo Jean Claude, Nkurunziza Ivan na Gahemba Bernabe."}
{"id": "13188", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13188", "title": "Uwera Aline", "text": "Uwera Aline umukinnyi mu mukino w'igare, ubarizwa mu ikipe ya Bugesera cycling club akaba yarabaye uwa mbere mu bangavu mu irushanwa rya Kibugabuga race."}
{"id": "13189", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13189", "title": "Umwamikazi Djazila", "text": "Umwamikazi Djazila umukinnyi mu mukino w'igare, ubarizwa mu ikipe ya Les Amis Sportif yi Rwamagana akaba yarabaye uwa kabili mu bangavu mu irushanwa rya Kibugabuga race aho yahembwe ibihumbi 80 Frw."}
{"id": "13190", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13190", "title": "Nzafashwanayo Jean Claude", "text": "Nzafashwanayo Jean Claude yavutse 04 kanama 2000 umukinnyi w'igare yegukanye agace ka gatandatu k\u2019irushanwa Tour internationale de Cameroon, ukinira kandi Benediction Excel Energy Club yegukanye isiganwa rizenguruka Repubulika iharanira Demukarasi ya Congo ryabaga ku nshuro ya karindwi."}
{"id": "13191", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13191", "title": "Hategeka Gasore", "text": "Hategeka Gasore umunyarwanda ukinira\u00a0Nyabihu Cycling Team yatsinze irushanwa rya Rwanda Cycling Cup 2018 ryitiriwe kuzirikana umuco nyarwanda,agace gasoza iri siganwa ka Nyanza-Rwamagana."}
{"id": "13192", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13192", "title": "Gahemba Bernabe", "text": "Gahemba Bernabe 7 mata 2001 umukinnyi w'igare akaba umuvandimwe wa Areruya Joseph, akaba ari umwe mubakinnyi Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umukino w\u2019amagare mu Rwanda, FERWACY ryagaragaje bazakina Tour du Rwanda 2021 bari muri ikipe ya Team Rwanda."}
{"id": "13193", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13193", "title": "Uwizeye Jean Claude", "text": "Uwizeye Jean Claude ni umwe mu bakinnyi batanu bazahagararira u Rwanda bari muri ikipe ya Team Rwanda muri Tour du Rwanda, Mugisha Samuel, Areruya Joseph na Nsegimana Jean Bosco, hakaza ndetse kandi na Gahemba Bernabe (murumuna wa Areruya Joseph). "}
{"id": "13194", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13194", "title": "Nkurunziza Ivan", "text": "Nkurunziza Ivan umukinnyi mu mukino w'igare, ubarizwa mu ikipe ya Benediction Ignite akaba yarabaye uwa mbere muri batangiranye niyi kipe mu marushanwa yo ku mugabane w'afurika."}
{"id": "13195", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13195", "title": "Inzira y'ubwiru ya Rukungugu", "text": "Inzira y'ubwiru ya Rukungugu mu myemerere gakondo y'abanyarwanda yari inzira yakorwaga hagamijwe kurwanya amapfa yateye mu gihugu havugwa amagambo agamije kwirukana ayo mapfa mu gihugu, ariko igakorwa mu buryo bumeze nko kwishima. Ayo magambo yavugwaga aboneka mu gisisigo cya Nyakayonga ka musare \u201cUrugumye rukanga umwami\u201d. \n= Amashakiro ="}
{"id": "13196", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13196", "title": "Inzira y'ubwiru ya Kivu", "text": "1.Inzira y'ubwiru ya Kivu ni inzira y'Ubwiru yakorwaga iyo mu gihugu habaga haguye imvura y\u2019amahindu. Hicwaga umwe mu bavubyi bikozwe n\u2019abiru akaba igitambo cyo kuba iyo mvura itakumiriwe kandi abavubyi babifitiye ubushobozi. \n2. Inzira ya Kivu: Iyi nzira yakorwaga iyo mu gihugu habaga haguye imvura y\u2019amahindu. Hicwaga umwe mu bavubyi bikozwe n\u2019abiru akaba igitambo cyo kuba iyo mvura itakumiriwe kandi abavubyi babifitiye ubushobozi.\nIy\u00f3 Kiv\u00fa yateey\u00e9 Ib ar \u00edimv\u00fara y'ik\u00edvu Ikarumby imy\u00e1ka Ikarumby amasak\u00e15 N \u00fabur\u00f3 n \u00edbishy\u00edmbo\u00a0 Abarag\u00faza b \u00e1ab\u00ediru bakajya kuraguriza Nk\u00edma na Cy\u00e1bak\u00e1nga na B\u00fatare Uwat\u00e9ey ibyo mur\u00ed b\u00f3 Im\u00e1ana yeer\u00e1 bakajya kw\u00faubak urug\u00f310 Kur\u00ed Nyir\u00e1bwanacyambwe\u00a0 Bagatumiz imf\u00edizi n \u00edngumba Bagatumiz inzog\u00e1 y \u00edntur\u00edre n \u00ediy \u00faub\u00fauki Bagatumiz abarembo bakaaza Bagatumiz umutw\u00e1kazi w \u00edmpen\u00e9beere15 Cy\u00e1ngw\u00e1 w \u00edgic\u00e1mby\u00e1ro Mu b\u00f3 kw iishyamba b Abah\u00e9ra Badatuur ibwami N \u00edhen\u00e9 y \u00e1gakara Bigahagarara ku kaarubanda 20 Bakaazan inzog\u00e1 mu bany\u00e1nzog\u00e1 N \u00edimb\u00fato y \u00fabur\u00f3 n \u00edngororero Ar\u00ed kwaa Cy\u00edrim ar\u00ed kwaa M\u00fatara Aherewe bakaaz aho Z\u00e1a nk\u00e1 na y\u00e1a mf\u00edizi25 N \u00edngumba na z\u00e1a nzog\u00e1 Bigahagarar aho mu rug\u00f3\u00a0 Wa\u00e1 mutw\u00e1kazi na b\u00e1a barembo na y\u00e1a hen\u00e9 Bigahagarar inyuma y \u00edir\u00e9mbo Nuuk umutsoob agafat ingororero30 Umwam agashyir imb\u00fato mu z\u00ediko Imb\u00fato y \u00fabur\u00f3 n \u00ednzog\u00e1 Ati seka kaanaka Ati tsindir igih\u00fagu Ts\u00ednda Kiv\u00fa35 Tsind ikirumbo\u00a0 D\u00f3r imf\u00edizi ya k\u00e1anaak\u00e1 Dor inzog\u