{"id": "13197", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13197", "title": "Inzira y'ubwiru y'umuhigo", "text": "Inzira y\u2019Umuhigo: mu myerere gakondo y'abanyarwanda, Iyi nzira yakorwaga n\u2019umwami igihe yabaga yitegura kujya guhiga, agira ngo azabone umuhigo ndetse we n\u2019abo bajyanye guhiga bazahahe baronke mu rugendo rwo guhiga bagiyemo \n= Amashakiro ="}
{"id": "13198", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13198", "title": "Inzira y'ubwiru y'Inzuki", "text": "Inzira y\u2019Inzuki: mu myemerere gakondo y'abanyarwanda Iyi nzira y'ubwiru yakorwaga n\u2019abavumvu ku rutare rw\u2019inzuki, barutera ibyuhagiro bakavuga ko ubwo inzuki zigiye gusohoka mu rutare zizinjira mu mizinga, zikazatanga ubuki buhagije; inzuki ziri mu gihugu zigatanga umusaruro uzabeshaho abaturage aho kugira ngo zibadwinge gusa \n= Amashakiro ="}
{"id": "13199", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13199", "title": "Inzira y'Ubwiru ya Muhekenyi", "text": "Inzira ya Muhekenyi:ni inzira y'ubwiru yakorwaga n\u2019aborozi b\u2019amatungo atandukanye nk\u2019inka n\u2019ayandi, bagira ngo bakumire imize mu matungo, by\u2019umwihariko indwara yari yarateye mu matungo iturutse mu Bugande yitwa \u201cUburenge\u201d. \n= Amashakiro ="}
{"id": "13200", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13200", "title": "Inzira y'ubwiru y'umuriro", "text": "Inzira y\u2019Umuriro ni inzira y'ubwiru yakorwaga iyo habaga hagiye kwimikwa umwami uzitwa Yuhi kuko yabaga ari umwami w\u2019umuriro, byaramaze kugenwa n\u2019abiru bafatwaga nk\u2019abanyamabanga b\u2019i Bwami \n= Amashakiro ="}
{"id": "13201", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13201", "title": "SEMIVUMBI SIMAKE", "text": "Yari intore y'intyoza mu guhamiriza kwa Rudahigwa i Nyanza mu Rukari. Akaba ari sekuru w'umuhanzi gakondo by'umwihariko akaba umukirigitananga w'icyamamare mu Rwanda witwa Daniel NGARUKIYE.\nSemivumbi yari umuhanga mu mihamirizo yahamirizanyije na Butera bwa Nturo na Sentore Athanase Rwagirizabigarama wabaye mu itorero ry'umwami i Nyanza mu Rukari."}
{"id": "13202", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13202", "title": "Daniel NGARUKIYE", "text": "Ni umunyarwanda w'umuhanzi mu njyana gakondo by'umwihariko akaba ari umukirigitananga. ni umugabo wubatse akaba afite umugore witwa Lavinia Orac wo mu gihugu cya Romania bashyingiranwe mu mwaka wa 2015. Ubu akaba atuye mu gihugu cy'Ubufaransa (France) ahitwa Avignon, akaba ahatuye guhera mu mwaka wa 2015.\nInkomoko y'inganzo.\nNgarukiye ni umwe mu bahanzi mu bahanzi bake bafite ubuhanga buhanise mu gucuranga inanga, ikaba ari impano akomora kuri Semivumbi Simake wari intore y'intyoza mu guhamiriza kwa Rudahigwa i Nyanza mu Rukari. gusa we mu mabyiruka ye ntago yari aziko azaba umuhanzi ariko yakuze akunda cyane ubuhanzi bushingiye kuri gakondo kuko ari impano yo mu muryango avukamo."}
{"id": "13203", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13203", "title": "Vivendi Group", "text": "Ni ikigo cyo mu Bufaransa, gishamikiye kuri Bollore Holdings, niyo ifite inzu itunganya filime ya canal+ Group ndetse n'Ikigo cya GVA gicuruza internet ya fiber ya CanalBox, inzu y'ibitabo ya Editis, Ikigo cy'Itumanaho cya Havas, Ikigo cy'Imikino cya Gameloft n'urubuga rushyirwaho amashusho rwa Dailymotion."}
{"id": "13204", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13204", "title": "Kigali Cultural Village", "text": "Ni umushinga uzakorerwa ku musozi wa Rebero uzaba ugizwe n'umudugudu urimo inyubako zakira ba mukerarugendo, ibikorwa by'ubucuruzi bugaragaza umuco Nyarwanda, ibibuga by'imyidagaduro, ubusitani bwiza burimo ibihangano bya Kinyarwanda, amateka n'ibindi. "}
{"id": "13205", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13205", "title": "IYARWEMA Simon", "text": "Ni umunyarwanda w'umubyinnyi ukomeye mu Rwanda, akaba akora mu kigo cya Canal Olympia Rebero, akaba ariwe uyobora umukino wa Escape Game ukinirwa mu kigo cya Canal Olympia Rebero akoramo. Uyu mukino ukaba ari umukino udasanzwe uba mu Rwanda, ukaba warazanywe na Canal Olympia Rebero.\nNi umwe mu bagize uruhare mu ikorwa rya filime zikomeye zirimo iya Ga\u00ebl Faye yitwa Petit Pays."}
{"id": "13206", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13206", "title": "Inganji Performing Arts Awards", "text": "Ni igikorwa cyo guhemba abari mu inganda ndangamuco bahize abandi mu gihe cy'umwaka. Bitegurwa kandi bigatangwa na Talents care, Performing arts, media and films Ltd. Byatangijwe mu mwaka wa 2020.\nAbahembwe mu byiciro bitandukanye mu mwaka wa 2020.\n1.Best Radio Drama actor of the year\nUmugabo: TUYISHIME Jadon Fils, Umugore: KAYITESI Mediatrice\n2.The Most Popular Radio Drama Actor of the Year\nUmugabo: MUKESHABATWARE Dismas, Umugore: INGABIRE MimiMarthe\n3.Best Stage Drama Actor of the Year\nUmugabo: MAZIMPAKA Jonnes Kennedy, Umugore: UWAMAHORO Antoinette\n4.Upcoming Stage Drama Actor of the Year\nUmugabo: MANISHIMWE Diedonne, Umugore: TUYISHIMIRE Teddy\n5.Best Script writer of the Year\nKUBWIMANA Seraphine\nAbegukanye ibihembo mu cyiciro cy\u2019urwenya.\n1.Best Comedian of the Year\nUmugabo: NIYITEGEKA Gracien, Umugore: NAHIMANA Clemance/Feu rouge\n2.Best Acting Comedian of the Year\nUmugabo: Ramadhan/Bamenya, Umugore: UWIMPUNDU Sandrine/Rufonsina\n3.Best Stand-up Comedian of the Year\nUmugabo: MUYENZI naifa John\n4.The Most Popular Comedian of the Year\nUmugabo: NIYITEGEKA Gracien, Umugore SUGIRA Florence\n5.Upcoming Comedian of the Year\nUmugabo RavaNelly, Umugore TETA Grace\n6.Award of Creativity: UMUTURANYI Series\n7.Supporting Comedian of the Year: REGERO Norbert\n8.The best Creative Comedian of the Year: UWIHOREYE Mustafa\nAbahembwe mu mivugo.\n1.The Most Popular Poet of the Year\nUmugabo: GASIZI KA SINZA, Umugore: MANIRAGUHA Carine\n2.Best Poet of the Year\nUmugabo: TUYISENGE Olivier, Umugore: KARANGWA Natasha\nAbahembwe mu mbyino z\u2019ubu.\n1.The most Popular Dancer of the Year\nUmugabo: KAMANZI NdoriYannick, Umugore: IMWIYITIRE Phoebe/Fofo Dancer\n2.The Best Modern Dancer of the Year\nUmugabo: TITI Brown, Umugore: KIRENGA Sidney Albina\nAbatsinze mu mbyino za Gakondo.\n1.The best Traditional Dance of the Year: ICAKANZU Francoise Contente\n2.The Best Traditional Dance Troupe of the Year: IMENA CULTURE Troupe\n3.The Best Young Traditional Dance Troupe of the Year: Ingemwe z\u2019Umuco: GARUKUREBE "}
{"id": "13207", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13207", "title": "Florence MUGISHA", "text": "Ni umushumba w'ungirije mu itorero rya New Life Bible Church, akaba umugore wa Rev. Dr Charles BUREGEYA MUGISHA. Afatanije n'umugabo we bashinze umuryango Africa New Life Ministries.\nUbuzima bw'ishuri.\nAfite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya mbere cya kaminuza muri Tewologiya (Theology) yakoreye muri kaminuza ya Multnomah University. "}
{"id": "13208", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13208", "title": "Charles BUREGEYA MUGISHA", "text": "Dr. Charles BUREGEYA MUGISHA ni umushumba mukuru w'itorero rya New Life Bible Church akaba n'uwarishinze, ndetse akaba yarashinze n'umuryango wa Africa New Life Ministries. Afite umugore bashyingiranwe witwa Florence MUGISHA, bakaba bafitanye abana batanu aribo: Isaac, Jonathan, Sarah, Bella, na Joseph.\nUbuzima bw'ishuri.\nImpamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya mbere cya kaminuza yize Tewologiya (Theology) Ku ishuri ryitwa Reformed Theological College iherereye mu gihugu cya Uganda mu murwa mukuru i Kampala;\nYakomeje amasomo ye mu cyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza yiga Amasomo y'ivugabutumwa n'ubugenzuzi (Pastoral Studies and management kuri kaminuza ya Multnomah University muri Portland ahitwa Oregon.\nYabonye impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga (Doctorate) muri kaminuza ya Gordon-Conwell Theological Seminary muri Charlotte mu Majyaruguru ya Carolina (North Carolina.) \nImvano y'umuhamagaro wo gukorera Imana.\nDr. Charles yakuze arererwa mu muryango wemera imyemerere gatolika (Catholic) bituma ariyo myemerere akurana bityo akaba yari afite ibyiyumviro ko umunsi umwe nawe azaba padiri. Nyuma agize imyaka 17, yemeye ubutumire yahawe bwo kwitabira amateraniro mu itorero ry'abaporotesitanti (Protestant) ryari riherereye aho bari batuye, Nibwo yabashije kumenya byimbitse umubano nyawo uba hagati y'umuntu n'Imana, umubano udasaba umuntu kwatura ibyaha imbere ya padiri cyangwa gusenga binyuze mu kwiyambaza abatagatifu. Ibi byatumye atangira umurimo mwiza w'ivugabutumwa ry'ijambo ry'Imana ribohora aho yabwirije mu bihugu bitandukanye bigize Isi, gusa nyuma akaza gukorera umuhamagaro we mu gihugu cye cy'u Rwanda.\nImbarutso y'ibikorwa bye bigamije ivugabutumwa no guhindura ubuzima bw'abantu.\nDr. Charles wavutse ku babyeyi b'abanyarwanda bari babayeho mu buzima bw'ubuhunzi mu gihe gikabakaba imyaka mirongo itatu n'itanu (35) batari mu gihugu cyabo, byamuvubuyemo urukundo mu mutima we ndetse no kumva byimbitse impunzi cyane ko nawe yari azi uburibwe n'imbogamizi zo gukura nk'impunzi mu gihugu kiganjemo intambara za hato na hato."}
{"id": "13209", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13209", "title": "Ibitaro bya kabgayi", "text": "Ibitaro bya Kabgayi.\nBiherereye mu ntara y'Amajyepfo mu Karere ka Muhanga, ni ibitaro bya kiliziya gatorika ariko bifashwa na leta y'u Rwanda., bimaze igihe kinini bitanga serivisi z'ubuvuzi kuko byatangiye gutanga 'ubuvuzi 1937 kugeza nanubu.bifasha abanyarwanda muri rusange, baba abatuye muri ako karere ka Muhanga ndetse nabandi baturutse ahatandukanye mu bigo nderabuzima bya Ruhango Kamonyi ndetse nahandi mugihugu. Kugeza ubu bikaba bifite ibigonderabuzima cumi na bitandatu (16) birebera hamwe na gereza ya mjhanga aribyo:\nMUSHISHIRO HC, SHYOGWE HC, RUTOBWE HC, RUGENDABARI HC, GIKOMERO HC, GASAGARA HC, GASOVU HC, BURAMBA HC, GITARAMA HC, NYARUSANGE HC, KABGAYI HC, KIVUMU HC, NYABINONI HC, GITEGA HC, MATA HC. \nNa gereza ya MUHANGA.\nIbitaro bya Kabgayi bifite ubuvuzi butandukanye bwo kuvura indwara nyinshi, harimo kubyaza ababyeyi, kubaga, kuvura amaso, ubuvuzi rusange n' ibindi byinshi.\nImikorere Yaryo.\nIryo vuriro rivugwaho gutanga serivise neza kubarigana, nubwo akanshi bagira imbogamizi z' umubare mwinshi wabarigana bityo bigatuma batabasha kwakirwa abrwayi byihuse, hakaba gutonda imirongo no gutegereza igihe kinini. \nIbitaro bya Kabgayi kubera kumara igihe kirekire bikora, bigaragara ko bishaje kdi umubare wababigana wiyongera umunsi kuwundi, ugasanga rero ababyeyi bajya kuhabyarira batakirirwa ahantu heza, kandi n' umubare wabo byakira uri hejuru cyane y'ubushobozi bwibyo bitaro.\nkwaguka kw'ibitaro bya Kabgayi.\nMinisteri y'ubuzima ifatanije na Dioseze ya kabgayi irimo kubaka inyubako nshyashya igezweho kandi nini, iteganywa kutwara akayabo ka Miliyali 5 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda, inyubako yamaze gutangirwa iri hafi gusoza,kandi bavuga ko iyo nyubako izaba irimo ibitanda 180 byakira ababyeyi, mugihe iyo ishaje yari irimo ibitanda 98 gusa. Ni igisubizo rero kuri ba babyeyi bacurikiranaga mubitanda cg bakarara hanze kubera kubura ibyumba n'ibitanda barwariramo cg babyariramo.\nUmuyobozi wibi bitaro yishimira ko bigiye koroha kwakira ababyeyi baje kubyara, bagahabwa ibishoboka byose,kuko iyo nyubako izaba yujuje ibyangombwa byose. ndetse ko hazaba harimo naho bakirira indembe muri rusange. mugihe ubundi bajyaga bohereza indembe CHUB na CHUK."}
{"id": "13210", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13210", "title": "Canal Olympia Rebero", "text": "Ni ikigo kiberamo ibikorwa by'imyidagaduro bitandukanye birimo kwerekana filime, ibitaramo n'imikino itandukanye. Cyamuritswe ku mugaragaro ku italiki 06 Ukuboza 2020. Giherereye mu Mujyi wa Kigali, Akarere ka Kicukiro, Umurenge wa Gatenga mu kagali ka Nyarurama mu mudugudu wa Rebero. Umuyobozi w'iki kigo yitwa Aim\u00e9e Umutoni. \nInkomoko y'umushinga.\nKubaka iki kigo cya canal Olympia Rebero byari bikubiye mu masezerano Vivendi Group yasinyanye n'urwego rw'igihugu rw'iterambere RDB, yo gushora imari mu mushinga uzwi nka Kigali Cultural Village (KCV) no kuwubyaza umusaruro.\nImiterere y'ikigo.\nIki kigo gifite inyubako ifite imyanya 300 y'abantu bicaye neza, yerekanirwamo filime.\nIfite ahantu hagari habera ibitaramo hakwakira abantu ibihumbi 15.\nIki kigo gishobora no kwakira inama.\nIki kigo gifite ibibuga bya minifoot na minigolf.\nIki kigo gifite urubuga rw'imikino itandukanye y'abana.\nIki kigo gifite ahantu hatandukanye hakifashishwa na sosiyeti zitandukanye zishaka kuhakorera ikiganiro n'abanyamakuru cyangwa ikindi gikorwa runaka.\nIbindi bikorwa by'imyidagaduro.\nIki kigo gifite umwihariko w'umukino witwa Escape Game, ugenekereje mu kinyarwanda ni umukino wo gutoroka cyangwa kurokoka, ukaba ukinwa mu itsinda ry'abantu bari hagati ya babiri na batanu, umukinnyi wemerewe gukina uyu mukino aba afite imyaka iri hagati ya cumi n'itatu kuzamuka.\nNi umukino utangira umukinnyi ari mu bihe by'aha hise mu mwaka wa 1970 ku itariki ya 4 Kanama, ari mu bitaro bivura indwara zo mu mutwe bya Nsanga Psychiatric Center, umuganga witwa Dr. Rurangwa aba agiye kumuhindura mu mubiri we ku buryo ubuzima bwo mu mutwe abwangiza, umukinnyi aba asabwa gucika ibyo bitaro. \nUmwihariko w'ikigo mu kurengera ibidukikije.\nIki kigo gifite umwihariko w'uko muri buri bikorwa byabo byose, bazajya bakoresha ingufu zikomoka ku mirasire y'izuba, mu rwego rwo kwirinda kwangiza ibidukikije no gukoresha neza ingufu."}
{"id": "13211", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13211", "title": "BENIMANA Ramadhan", "text": "BENIMANA Ramadhan ni umunyarwanda wavutse mu mwaka wa 1992, akaba yaramamaye cyane mu mwuga akora wo gukina filime aho azwi cyane ku izina BAMENYA akina yitwa muri filime y'uruhererekane yitwa BAMENYA akinamo nk'umukinnyi w'imena. ndetse akaba n'umukinnyi ukunzwe cyane mu Rwanda aho bigenda binagaragarira mu bihembo bitandukanye agenda ahabwa, urugero mu mwaka wa 2021 yawutangiye ahagaze neza cyane ko ari mu bakinnyi ba filime 5 bakunzwe mu Rwanda mu cyiciro cy'abagabo.\nImirimo yakoze.\nYagaragaye muri filime nyinshi zitandukanye zakunzwe na benshi mu Rwanda harimo Nkuba, Ingurane y'ubusugi, Catherine n'izindi...\nAkaba yarabaye umunyamakuru w'igitangazamakuru Flash Tv mu kiganiro cyitwaga Taxis Moto aho yagikoranaga n'ikindi cyamamare Isimbi nawe w'umukinnyi wa filime."}
{"id": "13212", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13212", "title": "Mitima Isaac", "text": "Myugariro Mitima Isaac akina inyuma mu kibuga akaba yarinjiye mu ikipe ya Rayon Sports nyuma yo gutandukana na Sofapaka FC yo muri Kenya.\nAmateka y'Urugendo rwa ruhago.\nMitima yagize ibihe byiza akinira Police Fc.\nMitima yari amaze igihe kigera ku mezi 10 atagera mu Rwanda nyuma yo gusinya amasezerano y'imyaka ibiri mu ikipe ya FC Sofapaka yo muri kenya avuye muri Police FC yari yaratijwe na APR FC. \nMitima yerekeza muri Kenya.\nMu mikino 26 shampiyona ya Kenya imaze gukinwa Sofapaka iri ku mwanya\u00a0 wa 12 n'amanota 30, Mitima akaba yarakunze gukoreshwa mu bwugarizi ndetse n'imbere ho gato aho bita kuri 6."}
{"id": "13213", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13213", "title": "Western African Ebola virus", "text": "Incamake.\nicyorezo cya virusi ya Ebola (bakunze kwita \"Ebola\") yavuzwe bwa mbere mu 1976 mu byorezo bibiri icyarimwe muri n'icya. Icyorezo cya 2013\u20132016, cyatewe na virusi ya Ebola (EBOV), ni cyo cya mbere ku isi yose kitagenzuwe neza Ibyorezo byabanje byari byaragenzuwe mugihe gito cyane., gahunda zita ku buzima zidakora neza, kutizera guverinoma nyuma y\u2019intambara imaze imyaka myinshi, no gutinda kwitabira amezi menshi, byose byagize uruhare mu kunanirwa kurwanya iki cyorezo. Ibindi bintu, nkuko byatangajwe mu bitangazamakuru, harimo imigenzo yo gushyingura yaho yo koza umurambo ndetse no gukwirakwira kwa Ebola mu mijyi ituwe cyane. \nIgihe iki cyorezo cyagendaga gitera imbere, ibitangazamakuru bivuga ko ibitaro byinshi, bifite abakozi bake ndetse bifite n'ikibazo cy'ibikoresho bike, byarengewe kandi bigafungwa, bituma bamwe mu bahanga mu by'ubuzima bavuga ko kutabasha kuvura. ibindi bikenerwa mu buvuzi bishobora kuba byarateje \"umubare w\u2019abandi bantu bapfa. ni] birashoboka kurenza icyadutse ubwacyo \". Abakozi b'ibitaro, bakoranye cyane n\u2019amazi yanduye cyane y\u2019abahohotewe, bibasiwe cyane na virusi; muri Kanama 2014, OMS yatangaje ko 10% icumi ku ijana by'abapfuye bari abakozi b'ubuzima. Muri Nzeri 2014, byagereranijwe ko ubushobozi bw\u2019ibihugu byibasiwe no kuvura abarwayi ba Ebola bidahagije bihwanye n\u2019ibitanda 2,122; ariko, mu Kuboza 2014 hari ibitanda bihagije byo kuvura no gutandukanya imanza zose zavuzwe, nubwo ikwirakwizwa ry\u2019imanza ridahwitse ryateje ikibazo gikomeye mu turere tumwe na tumwe. \nEpidemiologiya.\nIcyorezo.\nMuri rusange abantu bemeza ko umuhungu w'umwaka umwe cyangwa ibiri, nyuma yaje kwitwa, wapfuye mu Kuboza 2013 mu mudugudu wa M\u00e9liandou, Perefegitura ya Gu\u00e9ck\u00e9dou, muri Gineya, ni cyo cyerekezo cyerekana cy'icyorezo cya Afurika y'Iburengerazuba. Nk\u2019uko ibitangazamakuru bibitangaza, abahanga mu bya siyansi bavuze ko ibibabi bigira uruhare mu ikwirakwizwa rya virusi, kandi, ku bw'impanuka, urugo rw\u2019umuhungu rwari hafi y\u2019abakoloni nini b\u2019ibibabi by\u2019umurizo by\u2019ubusa Angola. Nyina, mushiki we, nyirakuru, nkuko byatangajwe mu bitangazamakuru nyuma yaje kurwara ibimenyetso nk'ibyo arapfa; abantu banduye izi ndwara zambere bakwirakwiza indwara muyindi midugudu. Muri C\u00f4te d'Ivoire hari ubumenyi bwa \"virusi ya Tai Forest\", bikaba byaratumye umuntu yandura umuntu mu 1994. Ni yo mpamvu, izi ndwara zo hambere zasuzumwe nk'izindi ndwara zikunze kugaragara muri ako gace kandi indwara yari ifite amezi menshi yo gukwirakwira mbere yuko imenyekana nka Ebola. "}
{"id": "13216", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13216", "title": "Imirire Mibi Mu Rwanda", "text": "Incamake.\nAbahanga ku mirire zo muri Afurika bagaragaje ko imibare yerekana ko ibihugu byose by'Afurika yo munsi y'ubutayu bwa Sahara biri mu bihe bidasanzwe ku mirire mibi cyane mu bana, zivuga ko imibare y'u Rwanda iri hejuru cyane.\nImirire mibi yibasiye abana benshi batarageza ku myaka itanu mu bihugu byose by'Afurika yo munsi y'ubutayu bwa Sahara, nk'uko bivugwa n'izi nzobere zo muri Afurika mu nama izihurije i Kigali. Ikigero gifatwa nk'icyakwihanganirwa mu mirire mibi izi nzobere zivuga ko ari 20%, iki kigero mu Rwanda kigeze kuri 38%. \nIngamba zo kurwanya Imirire mibi.\nAbaturage Bu Rwanda Biyemeje kurwanya imirire mibi Ah Gatsibo Biyemeje kurandura imirire mibi murundu.Abaturage bose mu Murenge wa Mushonyi mu Karere ka Rutsiro, bavuga ko kurwanya imirire mibi bishoboka bakaba bamanura imibare ikomeje kuboneka muri ako karere gafite 44.4%, gusa ngo ku bufatanye n\u2019ubuyobozi biyemeje gukemura burundu icyo kibazo."}
{"id": "13217", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13217", "title": "Ubuzima Mu Rwanda", "text": "Agaciro Kubuzima mu Rwanda bwabaye amateka mabi cyane, haba mbere na nyuma ya jenoside yo mu 1994 yakorewe abatutsi.Mu 1998, abana barenze umwe kuri batanu bapfuye mbere yimyaka 5. akenshi bazize malariya. Ariko mu myaka yashize u Rwanda rwateye imbere ku bipimo byinshi by\u2019ubuzima. Hagati ya 2005 na 2013, icyizere cyo kubaho cyiyongereye kiva kuri 55.2 kigera kuri 64.0, impfu z\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 5 zagabanutse ziva kuri 106.4 zigera kuri 52.0 ku bana 1.000 bavutse ari bazima, kandi indwara y\u2019igituntu yavuye kuri 101 igera kuri 69 ku bantu 100.000. ry\u2019igihugu mu buvuzi ryatangajwe n\u2019ibitangazamakuru mpuzamahanga n\u2019abagiraneza. \"\" yahaye ingingo \"Ubuzima bw\u2019amateka y\u2019u Rwanda\". Abafatanyabikorwa mu Buzima basobanuye inyungu z\u2019ubuzima \"mu bintu bitangaje isi yabonye mu myaka 50 ishize\". \nUbuzima bw'ababyeyi n'umwana.\nU Rwanda ruri mu nzira zo gusohoza 4 na 5. Ukurikije umubare w'abana bapfa bapfa bavuka, wagabanutse uva ku bantu 1,400 bapfa ku 100.000 bavutse ari bazima mu 1990 ugera ku 320 bapfa ku 100.000 bavutse ari bazima muri 2013. Ibi byari bifite impuzandengo yumwaka yo kugabanuka kugera kuri 8,6 kuva 2000 kugeza 2013. Bitewe n'impamvu zitandukanye nk'ubukene, imihanda mibi kubera ubutayu bw'imisozi mu cyaro, kuyobya imyizerere gakondo ndetse n'ubumenyi budahagije ku bibazo bijyanye no gutwita, 31 ku ijana by'abagore barangiza bakabyarira mu rugo nubwo bafite gahunda y'ubwishingizi bw'ubuzima rusange. Bimwe mu bisubizo byashakishijwe ku mbogamizi zirimo amahugurwa y\u2019abakozi benshi bashinzwe ubuzima bw\u2019abaturage (amatsinda y\u2019ubuzima bwo mu mudugudu) kugira ngo bakangurire abaturage, hejuru yo kubaha telefoni zigendanwa kugira ngo bavugane n\u2019ibigo nderabuzima mu bihe byihutirwa nko kuva amaraso. Umubare wa ambilansi kuri bimwe mu bigo nderabuzima byo mu cyaro nawo wariyongereye. Raporo iheruka gukorwa na OMS benshi mu bagore batwite bapfa bazize kuva amaraso (25%), hypertension (16%), gukuramo inda na sepsis (10% buri umwe) kandi umubare muto bapfa bazize embolisme (2%). \nIcyifuzo cyo kuboneza urubyaro cyujujwe kuri 71% muri 2010; umubare w\u2019abagore bagiye gusura mbere yo kubyara inshuro enye cyangwa zirenga wazamutse ugera kuri 35% mu mwaka wa 2010, bikaba bishobora kuba byaratumye ubwiyongere bugaragara bw\u2019umubare w\u2019abagore batwite bashaka umufasha w\u2019inzobere mu kubyara uva kuri 26% mu 1992 ugera kuri 69% muri 2010. Mu rwego rwo gukumira virusi itera SIDA ku babyeyi kugeza ku mwana, mu mwaka wa 2010 ijanisha rya virusi itera sida n'abagore batwite bahabwa imiti igabanya ubukana bwa virusi itera SIDA ryazamutse riva kuri 67% rigera kuri 87% muri 2012. 45 ku ijana by'abagore bari hagati y\u2019imyaka 15 na 49 koresha uburyo bwo kuboneza urubyaro. Ugereranyije, abagore bo mu Rwanda, \nbabyara abana 4,6 mu buzima bwabo bwose (RDHS 2010).\nVIH / SIDA.\nMu bihe bya nyuma ya jenoside, Ikigega cy\u2019isi gishinzwe kurwanya SIDA, Igituntu na Malariya (Global Fund) hamwe na gahunda yihutirwa ya Perezida wa Leta zunze ubumwe z\u2019Amerika ishinzwe kurwanya SIDA (PEPFAR) byakoreshejwe cyane cyane muri gahunda za virusi itera SIDA mu Rwanda. Muri Kamena 2012, abantu 113 barwaye virusi itera SIDA mu Rwanda bahawe imiti igabanya ubukana bwa virusi itera SIDA, bituma u Rwanda (hamwe na Botswana ikize cyane) ruba kimwe mu bihugu bibiri byo muri Afurika yo munsi y'Ubutayu bwa Sahara kugira ngo bigere ku ntego z'umuryango w'abibumbye zo kugera kuri bose imiti igabanya ubukana bwa virusi itera SIDA.. Icyorezo cya SIDA mu Rwanda cyagumye ku kigero cya 3% mu myaka irindwi ishize. Kubyerekeranye nigishushanyo cya gapminder, igereranya hagati yicyizere cyo kubaho numubare wabantu banduye virusi itera sida (umubare, imyaka yose). Irerekana ko hagati ya 1989 na 1990, umubare w'ababana na virusi itera SIDA wari 181.838 bafite icyizere cyo kubaho imyaka 48. Muri jenoside yo mu 1994, umubare wariyongereye ugera ku 200.000 ufite imyaka 6 yo kubaho. Mugihe cya nyuma ya jenoside, 1995 imibare yari ikiri imwe ariko icyizere cyo kubaho cyariyongereye kugeza ku myaka 40 kuko ubu gahunda ya sida yari yatangiye buhoro buhoro. Muri 2011, imibare yari ikiri imwe ariko icyizere cyo kubaho cyarashwe kugeza ku myaka 63 yerekanaga ko umubare wabantu bahabwa anti-virusi kandi wariyongereye bigatuma abantu benshi babaho igihe kirekire.\nMalariya.\nbaturage bose b'u Rwanda bafite ibyago byo kurwara malariya. ni mesoendemic (kugira kwanduza ibihe bisanzwe) mubibaya kandi bikunze kwibasirwa n'ibyorezo mubibaya birebire n'imisozi. Mu turere tw\u2019icyorezo, kwandura malariya bibaho umwaka wose hamwe n\u2019ibihe byinshi muri Gicurasi - Kamena na Ugushyingo - Ukuboza. U Rwanda rwateye intambwe ishimishije mu kurwanya malariya kuva mu 2005 kugeza 2012, muri icyo gihe hagabanutseho 86% by\u2019abanduye malariya naho 74% by\u2019impfu za malariya. Icyakora, hagati ya 2012 na 2016, u Rwanda rwiyongereyeho inshuro zirenga 8 ubwandu bwa malariya. Ubwiyongere bwagaragaye mu gihugu cyose ariko bunini mu ntara z\u2019iburasirazuba n\u2019Amajyepfo. Nubwo indwara ya malariya yiyongereye ku buryo bugaragara, ubwiyongere buke bwonyine bwagaragaye mu bantu bakomeye no mu rupfu, aho byagabanutse cyane ku bipimo by\u2019impfu byerekana imicungire ikomeye ya malariya. \nIgituntu.\nKwagura no kuzamura uburyo bwo kuvura butaziguye Amasomo magufi (DOTS) mu ngingo esheshatu zo guhagarika igituntu (TB) zasobanuwe na Laserson na Wells zashyizwe mu bikorwa mu Rwanda na gahunda ihuriweho na minisiteri y\u2019ubuzima gahunda yo kurwanya ibibembe n\u2019igituntu kuva mu 1990. Ibi byatumye ibipimo byo gutsinda bivura biva kuri 58% (2003) bigera kuri 81% mu mpera za 2006. Mu 2005, ijanisha ryo kwandura igituntu ryari 24%, rikaba riri munsi y\u2019intego yo gutahura indwara. "}
{"id": "13220", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13220", "title": "Ubumuga Muri Burezile", "text": "Ubumuga muri Burezile busobanurwa mugihe abantu bahanganye cyangwa badashoboye kurangiza imirimo isanzwe ya buri munsi. Ibi bipimwa n'ibipimo byubuzima byibikorwa bya buri munsi no kugenda kumubiri. Gusobanura ubumuga buratandukanye ukurikije amategeko y\u2019ibidukikije bitandukanye n\u2019urwego rw\u2019intege nke. Burezili ni kimwe mu bihugu bituwe cyane ku isi kandi ni cyo gihugu kinini muri Amerika y'Epfo, gituwe n'abaturage miliyoni 212.56 mu 2020. Bitewe n\u2019igipimo cy\u2019abaturage, muri Burezili hari abantu bagera kuri miliyoni 16 bafite ubumuga. Muri ibyo, miliyoni 9 muri zo zifite imyaka yo gukora, naho miliyoni imwe iri mu bakozi. Muri Burezile, ubumuga bupimirwa nukuri hamwe namakuru ashingiye kumyaka, kwitabira siporo, amakuru, ingaruka mubuzima bwa buri munsi hamwe na serivisi zifasha / ibibazo byo kubona.\nUkuri.\nImibare.\nHariho ubwoko bwinshi bwubumuga muri Berezile. Ubumuga bushobora kubaho ku mubiri, binyuze mu gukomeretsa mu,, kumenya, imyitwarire yo kwiga, imitekerereze cyangwa itagaragara. Muri Burezile, abantu bagera kuri 34% bakuze bafite ubumuga bugira ingaruka kumibereho. Abagabo bahagarariye imibare irenze iy'abagore kuri 1,3%. Indwara bikunze kugaragara muri Berezile kandi birashobora gutuma abantu bagera ku bumuga. Buri muntu ku giti cye agira ubumuga butandukanye, aho bamwe bahagaze, abandi batera imbere kandi uburemere buratandukanye. Muri Berezile, abantu bakomeza amashuri make ndetse n\u2019abasaza bakunze kwibasirwa n\u2019ubumuga, bityo bakagera ku bushobozi buke ku kigero cyo hejuru. Kugira amashuri yisumbuye bishimangira ibyiza byubuzima binyuze mugutezimbere ibikoresho byubuzima hamwe namakuru yubuzima agezweho, bituma abantu babaho ubuzima bwiza kandi bagashaka ubufasha bwubuvuzi mugihe bibaye ngombwa Guhura nubumuga bukora nkumuntu ukuze ukomoka muri Berezile birasanzwe nubwo aribyo ibibi abantu ku giti cyabo nkuko benshi batitabira ibigo byuburezi, ntibashobora kurangiza amasomo yuburezi kandi bashobora kubura ubushobozi bwo gusoma. \nAmatsinda yimyaka.\nAmahirwe yo kugera ku bumuga muri Berezile ariyongera uko umuntu agenda akura. Guteza imbere ubumuga birashobora kubaho mubusaza, kuko intege nke zigaragara kandi ibyago byo kurwara cyangwa ni byinshi. Ibyago byiyongera iyo abantu bageze ku myaka 40, kandi ubumuga bwo kutabona buramenyerewe. Mubuzima bwose, niba abantu bahuye cyangwa ibihe bitameze neza, ubumuga bushobora kubaho kare. "}
{"id": "13222", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13222", "title": "Nyarwaya Innocent", "text": "Nyarwaya Innocent wa menyekankanye cyane kwizina rya \"YAGO\" ni umunyamukuru w'umunyarwanda uri muri bamwe bakomeye mu Rwanda. uyu munyamakuru yakoreye ibitangaza makuru bigiye bitandukanye birimo Goodrich Tv, Radio&amp;Tv10 ubu akaba afite umuyoboro we wa youtube channel aho yawitiriye izina rye \"YAGO TV SHOW\" Ubu iri muri eshatu zambere zikunzwe cyane mu Rwanda. \nUyu muyoboro wa Nyarwaya Innocent waje gusibwa kumuyoboro wa youtube aho hari abamuregaga ibintu byishi bigiye bitandulanye bakaza gutuma channel ye isibwa burundu kuri YouTube. gusa nubwo yaje gusibwa Yago yakomeje arwana intambara arebako yagaruka kumuyoboro we aho yarafite groupe yabantu bari bari kumufasha ngo bayigaruze nyuma tariki 15 Mutarama 2022 umuyoboro we waje kugaruka ahita ana nyuzaho ikiganiro cye bwite asobanura byishi kubyihishe inyuma yi hagarikwa ry'umuyoboro we. "}
{"id": "13223", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13223", "title": "Murungi Sabin", "text": "Murungi Sabin ni umunyamakuru uzwi cyane muruhando rw'itangaza makuru mu Rwanda aho amazina ye bwite yitwa \"Munyengabe Murungi Sabin\" uyu umunyamakuru amaze imyaka irenga icumi mu mwuga w'ubunyamakuru hano mu Rwanda akaba kandi anakorera ibinyamakuru birimo \"Inyarwanda, Igihe.com ubu akaba ari we muyobozi wa Isimbi Tv hamwe na Isimbi.rw."}
{"id": "13224", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13224", "title": "Rwandan Epic", "text": "Rwandan Epic irushanwa mpuzamahanga ry\u2019amagare yo mu misozi, itegurwa na Rwanda Alternative Riding Events (RAR Events) ku bufatanye n\u2019Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019Umukino w\u2019Amagare mu Rwanda (FERWACY), ubu ryari rigizwe n\u2019uduce dutanu aho ryatwawe n'umunyarwanda HABIMANA Jean Eric ndetse n\u2019umudage Karl Platt."}
{"id": "13226", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13226", "title": "Abagore bapfa babyara Mu Rwanda", "text": "U Rwanda ruri mu nzira zo gusohoza intego z'ikinyagihumbi 4 na 5. Ukurikije umubare w'abana bapfa bapfa bavuka, wagabanutse uva ku bantu 1,400 bapfa ku 100.000 bavutse ari bazima mu 1990 ugera ku 320 bapfa ku 100.000 bavutse ari bazima muri 2013. \u00a0Ibi byari bifite impuzandengo yumwaka yo kugabanuka kugera kuri 8,6 kuva 2000 kugeza 2013. \u00a0Bitewe n'impamvu zitandukanye nk'ubukene, imihanda mibi kubera ubutayu bw'imisozi mu cyaro, kuyobya imyizerere gakondo ndetse n'ubumenyi budahagije ku bibazo bijyanye no gutwita, 31 ku ijana by'abagore barangiza bakabyarira mu rugo nubwo bafite gahunda y'ubwishingizi bw'ubuzima rusange. Bimwe mu bisubizo byashakishijwe ku mbogamizi zirimo amahugurwa y\u2019abakozi benshi bashinzwe ubuzima bw\u2019abaturage (amatsinda y\u2019ubuzima bwo mu mudugudu) kugira ngo bakangurire abaturage, hejuru yo kubaha telefoni \nzigendanwa kugira ngo bavugane n\u2019ibigo nderabuzima mu bihe byihutirwa nko kuva amaraso. Umubare wa ambilansi kuri bimwe mu bigo nderabuzima byo mu cyaro nawo wariyongereye. \u00a0Raporo iheruka gukorwa na OMS benshi mu bagore batwite bapfa bazize kuva amaraso (25%), hypertension (16%), gukuramo inda na sepsis (10% buri umwe) kandi umubare muto bapfa bazize embolisme (2%). \nIgabanyuka zipfu nyuma yimyaka 26.\nNyuma yimyaka 26 ishize u Rwanda rwibohoye, abagore barashimiri iguhugu ndetse nabaganga kuko umubare w'abapfa babyara wagabanutse cyane, intego ikaba ari uko umubare ugera mu munsi y'impfu 70 mu bagore ibihumbi 100 bitarenze mu 2030. \u00a0Ubuhamya bwa bamwe mu bagore bwumvikanisha uburyo ubuzima bw'umubyeyi butari bworoshye mu myaka yo hambere mbere y'uko u Rwanda rubohorwa.Umubyeyi witwa Mukankusi Rachel aravuga uburyo mu myaka yo hambere abagore benshi babyariraga mu ngo. nubwo tumwe muturere twu Rwanda hakigaragaramo Ipfu zababyeyi bapfa babyara kurugero rutari hejuru cyane ukurikije nimyaka yashije. iyo urebye mu Karere ka Gatsibo haracyagaragara ikibazo cy\u2019impfu z\u2019abana n\u2019ababyeyi bapfa babyara, Akarere ka Gatsibo kakaba kari gushyira ingufu cyane mu kureba icyakorwa ngo icyo kibazi gishire."}
{"id": "13228", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13228", "title": "Massamba Intore", "text": "Amateka.\nMassamba Intore Butera yavutse ahagana mu mwaka w'1969 ku itariki 15 z'ukwezi kwa 8, avukira i Bujumbura mu gihugu cy'u Burundi. Se umubyara yitwa Sentore Athanase Rwagiriza naho nyina akaba Mukarugagi Ancilla akurira mu karere ka Nyaruguru. Massamba Intore akaba ari umwana wa kabiri mu bana icyenda.\nUrugendo m'umuziki.\nMassamba Intore ni Umuhanzi ubikora kinyamwuga akaba ari umucuranzi, umwanditsi w'ibihangano, umukinnyi(actor) akaba ndetse ari n'umutoza w'imbyino gakondo Nyarwanda mu itorero rikuru ry'igihugu ryitwa Urukerereza, akaba ari umwe mu bahanzi bamamaye mu Rwanda mu gukora ibihangano byibanda ku muco Nyarwanda.\nIndi mirimo.\nMu Kuboza mu mwaka wa 2018, Massamba Butera Intore yagizwe impuguke mu bijyanye n'umuco muri Minisiteri y'umuco na siporo. Massamba Butera yahawe inshingano muri Minisiteri y'umuco na siporo zo kuvugira abahanzi ndetse akaba n'umutoza mukuru w'itorero ry'igihugu Urukerereza."}
{"id": "13229", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13229", "title": "Indwara yo Kuva", "text": "Mu bihugu 75 byihariye, 95% by\u2019abagore bapfa babyara n\u2019abana bapfa bari munsi y\u2019imyaka itanu, yerekana ko u Rwanda ruri mu bihugu bine byabashije kugera ku ntego z\u2019ikinyagihumbi ziteganya ikigero impfu z\u2019abana n\u2019ababyeyi zigomba kuba zaragabanutseho muri 2015.\nMu Rwanda.\nndwara yo kuva (Haemorrhage) ihitana 25% by\u2019abagore bose bapfa babyara mu Rwanda, umuvuduko w\u2019amaraso ugahitana 16% byabo naho gukuramo inda bigahitana 10%.Umuvugizi wa Minisiteri y\u2019Ubuzima, Nathan Mugume avuga kuri iyi raporo, yabwiye IGIHE ko nta byinshi yayitangazaho kuko atarayibona gusa yemeza ko u Rwanda ari igihugu cyateye intambwe ishimishije mu kugabanya imfu z\u2019abagore bapfa babyara nubwo \u2018ari urugendo rugikomeje\u2019."}
{"id": "13230", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13230", "title": "Anemie", "text": "nemia cyangwa anemia (Icyongereza cyo mu Bwongereza) ni indwara iterwa n'amaraso aho amaraso afite ubushobozi buke bwo gutwara bitewe n'umubare muto ugereranije n'uturemangingo tw'amaraso atukura, cyangwa kugabanuka kwa hemoglobine. Iyo amaraso make aje gahoro gahoro, ibimenyetso akenshi ntibisobanutse, nko kunanirwa, intege nke, guhumeka nabi, buke bwo gukora siporo.\nIyo kubura amaraso make, ibimenyetso bishobora kubamo urujijo, kumva ko umuntu agiye gushira, guta ubwenge, no kugira inyota. Anemia igomba kuba ingirakamaro mbere yuko umuntu ahinduka ibara. Ibimenyetso byinyongera birashobora kubaho bitewe nimpamvu yabyo. Kubura amaraso make birashobora kongera ibyago byo guterwa amaraso nyuma yo kubagwa. Anemia irashobora kuba iyigihe gito cyangwa kirekire kandi irashobora gutandukana kuva byoroheje bikabije.\nIbimenyetso.\nAnemia ifatwa nkindwara ikunze kugaragara. Umuntu ufite ikibazo cyo kubura amaraso make ntashobora kuba afite ibimenyetso bitewe nimpamvu yabiteye, kandi nta bimenyetso bishobora kugaragara, kuko kubura amaraso byoroheje, hanyuma ibimenyetso bikarushaho kuba bibi uko amaraso make akomera. Umurwayi ufite ikibazo cyo kubura amaraso make arashobora kuvuga, afite intege nke, ubushobozi bwo kugabanuka, kandi rimwe na rimwe imbaraga. \nIbimenyetso byo kubura amaraso birashobora kuza vuba cyangwa buhoro. Kera hakiri ibimenyetso bishobora kuba bike cyangwa ntabimenyetso. Niba amaraso make akomeje buhoro (karande), umubiri urashobora guhinduka no kwishyura izo mpinduka. Muri iki gihe, nta bimenyetso bishobora kugaragara kugeza igihe amaraso make akabije. Ibimenyetso bishobora kubamo kumva unaniwe, intege nke, kuzunguruka, kubabara umutwe, kubura imbaraga zumubiri (biherekejwe no guhumeka neza no gutera umutima byihuse), guhumeka, ingorane zo guhugukira, gutera umutima bidasanzwe cyangwa kwihuta kumutima, amaboko n'ibirenge bikonje, guhora wumva bikonje, ububabare bwururimi, uruhu rwera cyangwa umuhondo, isesemi, ubushake buke, gukomeretsa byoroshye no kuva amaraso, intege nke z'imitsi. Anemia ikura vuba, akenshi, ifite ibimenyetso bikomeye, harimo, kumva ucitse intege, kubabara mu gatuza, kubira ibyuya, inyota yiyongera, no kwitiranya ibintu. Hashobora kubaho ibimenyetso byinyongera bitewe nimpamvu yabyo. \nIcyiyitera.\nImpamvu zitera amaraso make zishobora gushyirwa mubikorwa nko kwangirika kwamaraso atukura (RBC), kwiyongera kwa RBC (anemia hememia), gutakaza amaraso no kurenza urugero rwamazi (). Benshi muribo barashobora gukorana kugirango batere amaraso make. Impamvu zikunze gutera kubura amaraso ni ugutakaza amaraso, ariko mubisanzwe ntabwo bitera ibimenyetso biramba keretse niba umusaruro wa RBC ugereranyije ugereranije niterambere, naryo, cyane cyane kubura iron. "}
{"id": "13231", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13231", "title": "Cyusa Ibrahim", "text": "Umuhanzi Cyusa Ibrahim umuziki we wubakiye ku ndirimbo za Gakondo.\nIbyo wamenya kuri Cyusa Ibrahim.\nCyusa Ibrahim yabanje kuba umwe mu baririmbyi bafashaga C\u00e9cile Kayirebwa, Cyusa avuga ko Kayirebwa yishimiye iyi ndirimbo, ndetse ahita amusaba ku mufasha mu kuririmba mu gitaramo yari agiye gukorera muri Kigali Serena Hotel.Uyu muhanzi yavuze ko ubwo bombi bahuriraga mu gitaramo cya East African Party cyinjije Abanyarwanda mu mwaka 2021, ari urwibutso rudasaza yasigaranye. Ati \u201cGuhura na Mama Cecile ku rubyiniro rumwe, ni indi shusho irenze. Ni ugukura.Biramurenga akabura icyo arenzaho.\u201dwa ku rubyiniro yaserukagaho mbere y\u2019uko atangira urugendo rw\u2019umuziki nk\u2019umuhanzi wigenga."}
{"id": "13232", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13232", "title": "Igitunu", "text": "Igituntu ni ikunze guterwa na bagiteri ya ' (MTB). Igituntu muri rusange gifata, ariko gishobora no gufata ibindi bice byumubiri. Indwara nyinshi ntizigaragaza ibimenyetso, muricyo gihe izwi nkigituntu cyihishe. Hafi ya 10% yanduye yihishe itera indwara zikomeye iyo zitavuwe, zica hafi kimwe cya kabiri cyabanduye. Ibimenyetso bisanzwe byigituntu gikora ni inkorora idakira hamwe na mucus irimo amaraso, umuriro, ibyuya nijoro, no kugabanya ibiro. Mu mateka yavuzweho kurya kubera gutakaza ibiro bifitanye isano n'indwara. Kwanduza izindi ngingo birashobora gutera ibimenyetso byinshi. \nIrwara yigitunu Mu Rwanda.\nKwagura no kuzamura uburyo bwo kuvura butaziguye Amasomo magufi (DOTS) mu ngingo esheshatu zo guhagarika igituntu (TB) zasobanuwe na Laserson na Wells zashyizwe mu bikorwa mu Rwanda na gahunda ihuriweho na minisiteri y\u2019ubuzima gahunda yo kurwanya ibibembe n\u2019igituntu kuva mu 1990. Ibi byatumye ibipimo byo gutsinda bivura biva kuri 58% (2003) bigera kuri 81% mu mpera za 2006. Mu 2005, ijanisha ryo kwandura igituntu ryari 24%, rikaba riri munsi y\u2019intego yo gutahura indwara. \nicyiyitera.\nMycobacteria.\nmpamvu nyamukuru itera igituntu ni \"\" (MTB), ntoya, aerobic, idafite moteri. Ibinini byinshi bya lipide biri muri iyi virusi bitera byinshi mubiranga ivuriro. Igabanya buri masaha 16 kugeza kuri 20, nigipimo cyihuta cyane ugereranije nizindi bagiteri, ubusanzwe zigabanywa mugihe kitarenze isaha. Mycobacteria ifite membrane yo hanze lipid bilayeri. Niba ikaramu ya Gram ikozwe, MTB ishobora kuba ifite intege nke \"Gram-positif\" cyangwa ntigumana irangi bitewe na lipide nyinshi hamwe na aside mycolike yo murukuta rwayo. MTB irashobora kwihanganira imiti yica udukoko kandi ikabaho mugihe cyicyumweru. Muri kamere, bagiteri irashobora gukura gusa mu ngirabuzimafatizo y\u2019ibinyabuzima, ariko \"M. igituntu\" gishobora guterwa muri laboratoire. "}
{"id": "13233", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13233", "title": "Farumasi", "text": "Farumasi ni yubuvuzi ihuza siyanse yubuvuzi na kandi ishinzwe kuvumbura, gukora, kujugunya, gukoresha neza kandi neza, no kugenzura. Hari na Farumasi nkurubuga rwikoranabuhanga ruhuza abarwayi nama farumasi afite imiti bifuza. Urwo rubuga rwa FARUMASI ruboneka kuri farumasi.com aho ushobora gusanga imiti wifuza kugiciro gitoya bitewe nuko ubasha kwihitaramo farumasi wifuza utavuye aho uri.\nkompanyi yitwa E-PHARMA Services Rwanda ltd niyo yakoze uru rubuga rwa FARUMASI murwego rwo gufasha abanyarwanda kubona imiti muburyo bworoshye bitabasabye kuzenguruka ama farumasi menshi. FARUMASI kandi ifasha andi ma farumasi kwagura isoko ryubukiruzi bakabasha gufasha nabarwayi bakure. \nKurundi ruhande, Imyitozo ya farumasi isaba ubumenyi buhebuje bw'ibiyobyabwenge, uburyo bw'ibikorwa, ingaruka, imikoranire, kugenda n'uburozi. Mu gihe kimwe, bisaba ubumenyi bwo kuvura no gusobanukirwa inzira y'indwara. Impuguke zimwe z'aba farumasi, nkiz\u2019aba farumasi b\u2019amavuriro, zisaba ubundi buhanga, urugero ubumenyi bujyanye no kubona no gusuzuma amakuru yumubiri na laboratoire. \nIbikorwa Bya Farumasi.\nIbikorwa bya farumasi bikubiyemo inshingano gakondo nko no gutanga imiti, kandi ikubiyemo serivisi zigezweho zijyanye no kwita ku buzima, harimo serivisi z\u2019amavuriro, gusuzuma imiti y\u2019umutekano n\u2019ingirakamaro, no gutanga amakuru y\u2019ibiyobyabwenge. rero, ni inzobere mu kuvura ibiyobyabwenge kandi ni inzobere mu buzima bw\u2019ibanze zitezimbere gukoresha imiti ku nyungu z\u2019abarwayi.\nAbabigize umwuga.\nIshami rivuga ko ku isi hari byibuze miliyoni 2.6 z'aba farumasi n'abandi bakozi ba farumasi. \nAbafarumasiye.\nAbafarumasiye ni inzobere mu zifite uburezi n\u2019amahugurwa yihariye bakora imirimo itandukanye kugira ngo abarwayi babone umusaruro mwiza binyuze mu gukoresha imiti neza. barashobora kandi kuba ba rwiyemezamirimo bato, bafite farumasi bakoreramo. Kubera ko abafarumasiye bazi uburyo bwimikorere yibiyobyabwenge runaka, ningaruka za metabolisme ningaruka za physiologique kumubiri wumuntu kuburyo burambuye, bigira uruhare runini mugutezimbere imiti ivura umuntu.\nAbatekinisiye ba farumasi.\nAbatekinisiye ba farumasi bashyigikira umurimo w\u2019aba farumasi n\u2019abandi bahanga mu buzima bakora imirimo itandukanye ijyanye na farumasi, harimo gutanga imiti yandikiwe n\u2019ibindi bikoresho by\u2019ubuvuzi no kubigisha kubikoresha. Barashobora kandi gukora imirimo yubuyobozi mubikorwa bya farumasi, nko gusuzuma ibyifuzo byandikirwa mubiro byubuvuzi hamwe n\u2019amasosiyete yubwishingizi kugirango imiti ikwiye itangwe kandi ubwishyu bwakiriwe."}
{"id": "13234", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13234", "title": "FAWE", "text": "Forum for African Women Educationalists(FAWE) n\u2019umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta w\u2019Africa washinzwe mu 1992 na minisitiri w\u2019abagore batanu bashinzwe uburezi hagamijwe guteza imbere uburezi muri Afurika yo munsi bareba ko bafite amashuri kandi barashobora kurangiza amashuri yabo no kuzuza ubushobozi bwabo, bijyanye nuburezi bwa UNESCO kubantu bose. Abagize uyu muryango barimo abaminisitiri b\u2019uburezi, abayobozi bungirije ba kaminuza, abafata ibyemezo by\u2019uburezi, abashakashatsi, inzobere mu buringanire n\u2019abaharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu.\nAmateka.\nMu 1992, Ihuriro ry\u2019Abanyafurika bashinzwe uburezi mu bagore ryashinzwe na minisitiri w\u2019uburezi w\u2019abategarugori batanu: muri Gana, Fay Chung (in) muri, Simone Testa muri Seychelles, Paulette Moussavon-Missambo muri Gabon na Alice Tiendrebengo muri Burkinafaso.\nUmuryango.\nFawe ifite ubunyamabanga bwayo i Nairobi. Kugeza ubu ifite ibice 34 by\u2019igihugu mu bihugu 33, birimo Benin, Gabon, Gambiya, Gana, Gineya, Liberiya, Nijeriya, u Rwanda, Senegali, Siyera Lewone, Uganda na Togo, n'ibindi.\nNibiro by\u2019abafatanyabikorwa mpuzamahanga kuri gahunda ya Fondasiyo ya Fondasiyo ya n\u2019umuryango w\u2019abafatanyabikorwa w\u2019ishyirahamwe nyafurika ry\u2019abagore bashinzwe ubushakashatsi n\u2019iterambere."}
{"id": "13238", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13238", "title": "Tajudeen Abdul-Raheem", "text": "Tajudeen Abdul-Raheem, impirimbanyi y' ubumwe bw' Afurika yavutse 1961 atabaruka 2009, ni umunyafurika wavukiye muri Nigeria. \nAmateka.\nUyu mugabo yavutse muri 1961, yabaye impirimbanyi y' ubumwe bw' Afurika mubyerekeranye na politike, ubukungu n' uburezi. yabaye umunyamabanga mukuru wa Pan- African movement ndetse n' umuyobozi mukuru muri Afurika yunze ubumwe ushinzwe ubutabera. yitabye Imana mu kwezi kwa gatanu 24 muri 2009 mu murwa mukuru wa Kenya azize impanuka y' imodoka ubwo, yerekezaga ku kibuga cy' indege, yari agiye mu rugendo mu Rwanda aho yari aje guhura na Nyakubahwa perezida wa repubulika y' u Rwanda Paul KAGAME. Tajudeen Abdul-Raheem yari umunyamakuru n' uwanditse w' umwuga. "}
{"id": "13239", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13239", "title": "Judith Allen Heard", "text": "Judith Allen Heard bakunze kwita \"Judith Heard\" (wavutse ku ya 13 Werurwe 1986) ni umunyamideli wo muri Uganda kandi wateguye ibirori. Yambitswe ikamba rya Miss Africa muri Miss Elite Awards 2021 avuye mu Misiri na Miss Environment International Africa 2022 i Mumbai, mu Buhinde. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nYavutse mu 1986 i Gulu, muri Uganda kugeza kuri John Musana Judith yize mu ishuri ribanza Parents Primary School, Kigali Parents School, Ishuri ryisumbuye rya Fawe Girls Secondary School and later Ndera Secondary School in Kigali Rwanda. \nUmwuga.\nJudith Heard nicyitegererezo kubwumwuga. Ashingiye ku ibyanditswe na Bryan Morel, Judith yimukiye muri Uganda atangira gukorana n\u2019isosiyete ikora imideli ya Sylivia Owori maze aba isura y\u2019ikinyamakuru African Woman Magazine mu 2002. Yagiye mu nzira zitandukanye nko mu cyumweru cy\u2019imyambarire ya New York, cy\u2019imyambarire ya Paris. Muri Nzeri 2020, Judith Heard yatumiwe guhagararira Uganda mu marushanwa ya Miss Elite 2020 mu Misiri. \nUbuzima bwite.\nJudith Heard yashakanye na Richard Heard mu 2003 baratandukana muri 2014. Ni nyina w'abana 3; Brandon Richard Yumvise, Branda Jolie Yumvise na Briana Bella Yumvise. \nIbindi wareba.\nMuri Gashyantare 2019, Judith yatangije umunsi wa mbere ku isi umuryango uharanira inyungu ushaka gukumira ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina no gufata ku ngufu mu bagore. Yakoranye nabana ba Sanyu murugo i Kampala. "}
{"id": "13241", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13241", "title": "Alain Gee", "text": "MUHIRE Guy Alain usanzwe uzwi nka Alain Gee ni umuyobozi wo kuramya mu itorero rya New Life Bible Church. Afite umugore bashyingiranwe witwa Lynca AKACU.\nUbuzima bw'ishuri.\nAfite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya mbere cya kaminuza mu ishami ry'ibinyabuzima yakoreye muri kaminuza y'u Rwanda.\nUbuzima busanzwe.\nAlain akunda kuririmba no kwandika indirimbo."}
{"id": "13242", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13242", "title": "Brenda KAYITESI", "text": "Ni umuyobozi ushinzwe imiyoborere mu itorero rya New Life Bible Church. Afite umugabo witwa Albert, bafitanye abana batatu.\nUbuzima bw'ishuri.\nAfite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya mbere cya kaminuza mu ishami ry'amategeko yakoreye muri kaminuza y'u Rwanda. \nUbuzima busanzwe.\nBrenda akunda kuririmba, gusenga ndetse yishimira no gutanga ubujyanama. "}
{"id": "13243", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13243", "title": "BUTERA bwa NTURO", "text": "Butera bwa Nturo akaba yari intore y'icyogere yabyinaga mu itorero ry'umwami Mutara III Rudahigwa akaba yaragaragaye no mu mashusho ya filimi yitwa \"King Solomon's mine ugenekereje mu Kinyarwanda ni \"Ikirombe cy'umwami Salomo.\""}
{"id": "13244", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13244", "title": "Celestin BAHIZI", "text": "Ni umudiaykoni mu itorero rya New Life Bible Church, akaba ariwe ushinzwe ubugenzuzi bw'itorero, niwe ukurikirana ishyirwamubikorwa ry'imishinga y'itorero. Afite umugore bafitanye abana batatu aribo Liza, Adony na Anca.\nUbuzima bw'ishuri.\nAfite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya mbere cya kaminuza mu ishami rya Tewologiya (Theology).\nUbuzima busanzwe.\nCelestin akunda gusoma ibitabo, akunda gukorera Imana kandi akunda kubaho yishimye cyane ko arangwa no guhora aseka."}
{"id": "13245", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13245", "title": "Frank KAREMERA", "text": "Ni umushumba wungirije mu itorero rya New Life Bible Church. Afite umugore witwa Janet KAREMERA, bafitanye abana batatu aribo Manzi, Shami na Gwiza.\nUbuzima bw'ishuri.\nAfite impamybumenyi y'icyiciro cya mbere cya kaminuza mu ishami ry'ubugeni mu burezi ykoreye muri kaminuza ya KIE (Kigali Institute of Education).\nUbuzima busanzwe.\nFrank mu buzima busanzwe akunda kuririmba, kuyobora ndetse no gukorera Imana."}
{"id": "13246", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13246", "title": "Fred KATAGWA", "text": "Ni umushumba mukuru w'ungirije muri New Life Bible Church. Afite umugore\u00a0 witwa Anna KATAGWA, batuye mu mujyi wa Kigali mu Rwanda, bafite abana batatu aribo: Deborah, Daniel na\u00a0 Destiny.\nUbuzima bw'ishuri.\nAfite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya mbere cya kaminuza mu ishami ry'uburezi, yayikoreye muri kaminuza ya Makerere.\nAfite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu ishami ry'amasomo y'ivugabutumwa aho yaminuje mu miyoborere y'amatsinda cyangwa umuryango, yayikoreye muri kaminuza ya Multnomah University yo muri Portland, Oregon muri Amerika.\nAfite n'indi mpamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu ishami ry'imiyoborere y'imishinga (Business Administration) yakoreye muri kaminuza ya Oklahoma Christian University.\nUbuzima busanzwe.\nMu buzima busanzwe Fred akunda kuganiriza urubyiruko cyane ndetse no kuyobora, kandi akunda no gukorera Imana. Akunda gutanga imbwirwaruhame ndetse no kwigisha."}
{"id": "13247", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13247", "title": "Oliver TUSIIME", "text": "Oliver Tusiime uzwi cyane nka Olivia ni umuhuzabikorwa w'itangazamakuru n'isakazamakuru mu itorero rya New Life Bible Church.\nUbuzima bw'ishuri.\nAfite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya mbere cya kaminuza mu ishami ry'itangazamakuru ryagutse n'isakazamakuru yakoreye muri kaminuza ya Mount Kenya University.\nUbuzima busanzwe.\nOlivia ni umwanditsi w'ibitabo, akunda kwandika ndetse no gutanga ibitekerezo byuje ubugeni."}
{"id": "13248", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13248", "title": "Muyango Jean Marie", "text": "Ni umuhanzi uririmba injyana gakondo Nyarwanda, wavukiye i Burundi akaza kuza mu Rwanda mu 1986. Ni umuhanzi wagize uruhare runini rwo kumenyekanisha umuco Nyarwanda abinyujije mu bihangano bye. Akomora inganzo kuri sekuru witwaga Butera bwa Nturo akaba yari intore y'icyogere yabyinaga mu itorero ry'umwami Mutara III Rudahigwa akaba yaragaragaye no mu mashusho ya filimi yitwa \" King Solomon's mine \" ugenekereje mu Kinyarwanda ni \"Ikirombe cy'umwami Salomo.\" \nIbihe by'ingenzi.\nAkiri i Bujumbura mu Burundi:.\n&gt;Yigishijwe kubyina gakondo Nyarwanda na se Rwingenza\n&gt;Yigishijwe kuririmba injyana gakondo na Sentore\n&gt;Yabyinnye umuco gakondo Nyarwanda \n1970-1976:.\n&gt;Yaririmbye mu itorero Ibihangange ryari riyobowe na Sentore\n&gt;Yabyinnye mu itorero Indashyikirwa\n1976-1978.\n&gt;Yafashije mu kubyina no gutoza mu itsinda Indashyikirwa\n&gt;Yanditse bwa mbere indirimbo yaririmbwe n'itorero Ibihangange\n1979-1985.\n&gt;Yashinze itorero ry'abakobwa babyina abita Amaliza, ashinga n'iryabahungu aryita Imanzi. Ni nabwo yahise atangira inshingano zo kwandika indirimbo, kuririmba, kubyina ndetse no gutoza kubyina."}
{"id": "13249", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13249", "title": "Moriah Entertainment Group", "text": "Ni sosiyete ifasha abahanzi bakora umuziki wo kuramya no guhimbaza Imana. Umuyobozi w'iyi sosiyeti yitwa Eric Mushukano. \nUmwihariko mu kubahiriza ihame ry'uburinganire.\nIyi sosiyeti ifite umwihariko wo gufasha abakobwa cyangwa igitsina gore bagaragaza impano, bakabafsaha kuyizamura."}
{"id": "13250", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13250", "title": "MBABAZI Madine", "text": "Ni umunyarwandakazi ukora umuziki wo kuramya no guhimbaza Imana. Akaba asengera mu itorero rya Zion Temple Kibagabaga, yatangiye gukora umuziki mu mwaka wa 2021. Akaba abarizwa muri sosiyeti ya Moriah Entertainment Group.\nUbuzima bw'ishuri.\nYize Civil Engineering.\nInkomoko y'inganzo.\nAkiri muto yakuze akunda umuziki cyane, byumwihariko yakundaga umuziki wo kuramya no guhimbaza Imana, bituma akurana inzozi zo kuzaba umuhanzi ukomeye ukora indirimbo zo kuramya no guhimbaza Imana.\nIbihangano bye.\nAfite indirimbo yakunzwe na benshi yitwa Urakunzwe, wayibona unyuze ku rubuga rwe rwa YouTube MBABAZI Madine"}
{"id": "13251", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13251", "title": "Janvier Katabarwa", "text": "Ni umunyarwanda wavutse mu Ugushyingo, mu mwaka wa 1986, yavukiye mu karere ka Nyamagabe mu ntara y'Amajyepfo. Ubu akaba atuye mu gihugu cya Canada. Akaba ari umukinnyi wa filime ubarizwa mu ishyirahamwe ry'abakinnyi ba sinema muri Canada ryitwa ACTRA (\"The Alliance of Canadian Cinema, Television and Radio Artists\"). \nFilime yakozeho.\nAherutse kugaragara muri filme y\u2019imirwano (action) yitwa \"Bullet Proof\" akaba ari umwe mu bakinnyi baza ku Isonga muri iyo film, yakinnye nk'umukinnyi ugaragaza imirwanire muri filime zitandukanye ndetse anagaragara muri filime zitandukanye nk'umukinnyi usimbura abandi bakinnyi ahantu hagoranye (Stunt Man).\nFilime yakozemo iki gikorwa cyo gusimbura abandi bakinnyi zirimo Peacemaker, Arrow, Superman &amp; Lois, The Flash, Super girl n\u2019izindi."}
{"id": "13252", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13252", "title": "Danny Nanone", "text": "Umuraperi Ntakirutimana Danny uzwi nka Danny Nanone \"umuhanzi ukora injyana ya HipHop\" \"wamenyekanye cyane ubwo yakoranaga indirimbo \u201cAkamunani\u201d n\u2019umuhanzi King James.\"\nAmateka.\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku itariki ya 28 Kanama 1990, atuye i Nyamirambo mu mujyi wa Kigali. 2009 yafashe icyemezo yinjira muri Studio bwa mbere akora indirimbo yise akamunani, iyi ikaba yarakunzwe ndetse inakirwa neza mu bantu ibi biha imbaraga uyu muraperi wari ukiri muto icyakora impano yo yaramukuriyemo. Amaze kwitabira irushanwa rya Primus Guma Guma Super Star (PGGSS) inshuro zigera kuri ebyiri nubwo atagenda agira amahirwe yo kuryegukana. Indirimbo yise \u2018Narya dance\u2019 ni imwe mu ndirimbo zatumye uyu muraperi akundwa cyane.\nIbihembo.\nPirimusi gumaguma super star ku nshuro yayo ya karindwi ubwo ibintu byari ibicika i Kigali umuraperi Danny Nanone yegukanye icyo gihembo ku mugaragaro."}
{"id": "13253", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13253", "title": "Kamichi", "text": "Adolphe Bagabo umuhanzi akaba n\u2019umunyamakuru uzwi ku izina rya Kamichi wakoraga injyana ya Afrobeat mu Rwanda, yagiye muri Leza Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika tariki 15 rishyira kuwa 16 Mata 2014 akaba ariho yimuriye n\u2019ibikorwa bye by\u2019umuziki.\nAmateka.\nKamichi ni umwe mu bahanzi bakunzwe n\u2019abatari bake kuva yatangira umuziki mu ndirimbo zitandukanye zirimo 'Aho ruzingiye', 'Kabimye', 'Zoubeda' yakoranye na The Ben n\u2019izindi zitandukanye."}
{"id": "13254", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13254", "title": "Sebanani Andre", "text": "Sebanani Andr\u00e9 yari umuhanzi, umunyamakuru, n'umucuranzi ukundwa cyane ndetse ugikundwa na benshi n\u2019ubwo atakiriho. Indirimbo nka \u2019Urabaruta\u2019, \u2019Karimi ka shyari\u2019, \u2019Zuba ryanjye\u2019, \u2019Urwo ngukunda ni cyimeza\u2019, \u2019Mama Munyana\u2019, \u2019Nkumbuye umwana twareranywe\u2019, \u2019Susuruka\u2019 yaririmbanye n\u2019umufasha we n\u2019izindi ziri mu rwibutso rukomeye yasigiye Abanyarwanda n\u2019abandi.\nAmateka.\nUbuzima bwite.\nNyakwigendera Sebanani Andr\u00e9 wishwe muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 yari yaravutse mu 1952, avukira mu cyahoze ari Komini Kigoma Perefegitura ya Gitarama, ubu akaba ari mu arere ka Nyanza, Intara y\u2019Amajyepfo.\nTariki ya 01 Nzeli 1979 ni bwo Sebanani Andre yashakanye na Mukamulisa Anne Marie, babyarana abana bane ari bo: Sheja Eliane, wavutse mu 1981, Damarara Diane, wavutse mu 1984, Shyengo Frida, wavutse mu 1985 na Songa Aristide ariwe bucura wavutse mu 1988, ndetse uyu bucura nyina akaba yaravugaga ko atazi se neza kuko agize imyaka ibiri mu 1990, Sebanani yahise afungwa mu bo Leta yariho yitaga ibyitso by\u2019inkotanyi.\nAmashuri yize.\nAmashuri yisumbuye yayize i Shyogwe nyuma aza gukomereza muri \u201cColl\u00e8ge Officiel de Kigali: COK\u201d gusa yaje kwirukanwa mu ishuri ajya gukora ubucungamari muri TRAFIPRO i Kabgayi.\nUko yamenyekanye.\nYamenyekanye cyane mu ikinamico zitandukanye yakinanye ubuhanga n\u2019ubu izo kinamico abantu baracyazikunda. Zimwe mu ikinamico azwimo ni iyitwa \u201cNzashira ingurugunzu nkiri ingagi\u201d; \u201cIcyanzu cy\u2019Imana (Uwera)\u201d, n\u2019izindi. Nyakwigendera Sebanani yaje gukora kuri Radiyo Rwanda muri gahunda ya \u201cDiscoth\u00e8que-Phonot\u00e8que\u201d ya Radiyo Rwanda, akora muri gahunda yari ijyanye n\u2019urwenya \u201cUbuvanganzo bw\u2019umwimerere nyarwanda\u201d, kandi yari umukinnyi w\u2019ikinamico mu itorero \u201cIndamutsa\u201d.\nUko yakoze tangazamakuru.\nNk\u2019uko tubikesha icyahoze ari Inama y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019Itangazamakuru, Sebanani yaje gukora kuri Radiyo Rwanda muri gahunda zitandukanye zirimo: \u201cDiscoth\u00e8que-Phonot\u00e8que\u201d ya Radiyo Rwanda, Urwenya\u201d Ubuvanganzo bw\u2019umwimerere Nyarwanda\u201d, Umukinnyi w\u2019ikinamico mu itorere \u201cIndamutsa\u201d.\nUrukundo Sebanani Andre n'Umufasha we.\nKubera urukundo rwamurangagwaho byatumye umufasha we amutura indirimbo y\u2019urwibutso yise \u201cUracyariho\u201d. Mukakalisa wari wagize amahirwe yo kurokoka Jenoside ariko akaba yaraje guhitanwa n\u2019indwara muri Nzeli 2015, yavugaga ko iyi ndirimbo yayikoze mu rwego rwo kugaragaza ko n\u2019ubwo Sebanani yavuye mu bamukunda, ariko ko bakimuzirikana kandi ko umuhanzi adapfa kuko ibihangano bye bituma aguma mu mitima y\u2019abari bamuzi aho usanga abantu benshi bamwibukira mu ndirimbo ze ndetse n\u2019amakinamico atandukanye.\nUyu mufasha we yakomezaga avuga ko kuba Sebanani atakiriho bitavuze ko yazimye kuko yasize abana baseruka mu izina rye, kandi ngo yapfuye mu buryo bw\u2019umubiri ariko roho ye iracyari kumwe n\u2019umuryango we ari na yo mpamvu yamutuye iyo ndirimbo.\nIzindi mpano Sebanani yari afite.\nSebanani kandi yari afite impano yo kwicurangira akoresheje ibyuma bya kizungu nka piano, gitari kuvuza ingoma n\u2019ibindi. Mu mwaka wa 1973 ni bwo yinjiye mu itsinda (orchestre) ryitwaga \u201cVox Populi\u201d nyuma yaho Sebanani na bagenzi be batangije orchestre \u201cImpala\u201d yakunzwe ndetse kugeza n\u2019ubu igikungwa na benshi, kuva icyo gihe ngo banahise bamuha akazina k\u2019akabyiniriro ka \u201cP\u00e9p\u00e9 la Rose\u201d."}
{"id": "13255", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13255", "title": "Bizimana Loti", "text": "Uyu mugabo ni umwe mu bahanzi b\u2019abahanga u Rwanda rwabuze muri Jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu 1994. Yari umuhanga mu gushyenga mu bihangano bye ari nako atanga inyigisho. Wumvise nk\u2019indirimbo ze zirimo \u2018Nsigaye ndi umuzungu\u2019 na \u2018Nta munoza\u2019 wumva ziganjemo ibyitwenge ariko zirimo inyigisho nyinshi. Abantu bari bazi uyu muhanzi mu buzima busanzwe, bavuga ko yari umuntu ukunda kuganira, azi gusetsa cyane."}
{"id": "13256", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13256", "title": "Karemera Rodrigue", "text": "Karemera Rodrigue ni umwe mu bihangange by\u2019umuziki mu baririmbaga ku giti cyabo. Nyakwigendera azwi mu ndirimbo \u2018Kwibuka\u2019, \u2018Ubarijoro\u2019 n\u2019izindi. Karemera afite umuhungu witwa Iradukunda Val\u00e8re Karemera na we w\u2019umunyamuziki, uyu yamenyekanye cyane mu ndirimbo \u2018La Conta\u2019 [Ihorere Munyana], yayihimbiwe n\u2019umubyeyi we mu 1990."}
{"id": "13257", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13257", "title": "Emmanuel Sekimonyo", "text": "Uyu yari umuririmbyi ukomeye ku giti cye yari azwi ku mazina ya Manu Matabaro. Yari azwi cyane mu ndirimbo \u2018Umwana w\u2019umunyarwanda\u2019, \u2018Imbabazi bambe\u2019 n\u2019izindi zitandukanye. Emmanuel Sekimonyo yavutse mu 1948 ahitwa Matyazo muri Ngororero mu Ntara y\u2019Uburengerazuba. Yari atuye mu Mujyi wa Kigali i Remera ndetse yiciwe mu 1994."}
{"id": "13258", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13258", "title": "Uwimbabazi Agnes", "text": "Umuhanzikazi Uwimbabazi Agn\u00e8s wamenyekanye cyane aririmbana n\u2019umugabo we Bizimungu Dieudonn\u00e9, bombi bishwe muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 bagenda bakiri bato, kuko Bizimungu yari afite imyaka 35, Uwimbabazi 34, basiga umwana umwe w\u2019umukobwa witwa Akayezu No\u00eblla na we waje kuba umuhanzikazi.\nAmateka.\nMu ndirimbo Uwimbabazi yaririmbanye na Bizimungu harimo: \u2018Ibango ry\u2019Ibanga\u2019, \u2018Inzovu y\u2019imirindi\u2019, \u2018Urujeje rw\u2019imisozi 1000\u2019, \u2018Ikirezi\u2019 n\u2019izindi, ariko Uwimbabazi na we yaririmbye ize yihariye cyane cyane izisingiza Bikiramariya zirimo iyitwa \u2018Imbabazi\u2019. Hari n\u2019iyo bahimbiye umwana wabo (Akayezu No\u00eblla) wari ukiri akana gato bayita \u2018Akanyange\u2019, ihabwa igihembo mu marushanwa yitwaga \u2018Agaseke k\u2019amahoro\u2019 n\u2019ubwo indirimbo yabo yari igamije gutaka umwana wabo."}
{"id": "13259", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13259", "title": "Gatete Sadi", "text": "Uyu muhanzi yari azwi muri Orchestre Abamararungu. Iyi niyo yaririmbye indirimbo nka \u2018Ijambo ry\u2019uwo ukunda\u2019, \u2018Julienne\u2019 \u2018Urugo rw\u2019umugabo\u2019 n\u2019izindi. Uyu nawe ari mu bahanzi bishwe muri Jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu 1994."}
{"id": "13260", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13260", "title": "Rugerinyange Eug\u00e8ne", "text": "Uyu muhanzi Rugerinyange yaririmbaga muri Orchestre Ingeli. Twavuga ko abahanzi bazize Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi muri Mata 1994 ni benshi cyane harimo kandi, nka; Emmanuel Sekimonyo, Iyamuremye Saulve waririmbaga muri Korali Indahemuka, Rwakabayiza Berchmas na Kayigamba Jean de Dieu baririmbaga muri Chorale de Kigali, Kalisa Bernard waririmbaga muri Chorale Ijuru, n\u2019abandi."}
{"id": "13261", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13261", "title": "Murebwayire Mimir", "text": "Uyu mubyeyi yaririmbaga muri Orchestre Les Citadins. Iyi izwi mu ndirimbo nka \u2018Ancila\u2019 \u2018Rugori Rwera\u2019 n\u2019izindi. Nyuma ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatusti, ntawibwiraga ko u Rwanda ruzongera kuzanzamuka mu buhanzi ngo rwongere rugire abacuranzi n\u2019umuziki rufite ubu. Mu kwiyubaka u Rwanda rwagize mu myaka 20 ishize, ntawatinya kuvuga ko no muri muzika hari byinshi byakozwe kandi bitanga icyizere ko ejo hazaza hazaba ari heza."}
{"id": "13262", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13262", "title": "Ndizeye Samuel", "text": "Ndizeye Samuel, umwe mu bakinnyi ba Rayon Sports baherutse gukiruka indwara ya Covid-19 avuga ko mbere y\u2019uko ayandura yavugaga ko itabaho ariko nyuma yo kuyirwara, arasaba Abanyarwanda kuyirinda ngo bigabanye ubwandu maze umupira uzagaruke abantu basubire ku bibuga bishime."}
{"id": "13263", "revid": "17987", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13263", "title": "Rwanda Polytechnic", "text": "Politekinike y\u2019u Rwanda (RP) ni ikigo cy\u2019amashuri makuru ya leta cyashinzwe mu mwaka wa 2017. Intego yacyo nyamukuru ni uguteza imbere imyuga n'ubumenyi ngiro (TVET) mu Rwanda, gukora ubushakashatsi no gufasha abanyeshuri guhanga udushya no kwihangira iimirimo.\nPolitekinike y'u Rwanda igizwe na Koleji 8 zikurikira:\nInshingano.\nMu nshingano za Politekinike y\u2019u Rwanda harimo:"}
{"id": "13264", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13264", "title": "Habimana Hussein", "text": "Habimana Hussein ni myugariro ukina mu mutima w'ubwugarizi w'ikipe ya Rayon Sports FC akaba n'umwe mu bakinnyi bafite ibigango bari muri shampiyona y'u Rwanda. Usibye kuba akina nka myugariro, Hussein rimwe na rimwe ashobora kwifashishwa nk'umukinnyi wo hagati mu kibuga (Midfilder). Habimana Hussein wageze muri Rayon Sports FC avuye muri Police FC yakiniye andi makipe akomeye mu Rwanda arimo ikipe ya Mukura VS na Etincelles FC. Habimana Hussein yahamagawe mu ikipe y'igihugu Amavubi mu 2019."}
{"id": "13265", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13265", "title": "Mujyanama Fidele", "text": "Mujyanama Fidele wari kapiteni w\u2019iyi kipe yamanutse mu cyiciro cya kabiri, yasinyiye Rayon Sports amasezerano y\u2019imyaka ibiri azayikinira. Uretse gukinira Heroes FC, uyu musore ukiri muto akaba kandi yaranakinnye muri Mukura Victory Sports yo mu karere ka Huye."}
