{"id": "13307", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13307", "title": "URUBYIRUKO RWO MURI MEDITERANE", "text": "Imiyoboro y'urubyiruko rwa Mediterane byatangiye muri 2014 kugeza 2017 yari umushinga w'imyaka itatu washyizwe mu bikorwa na UNESCO kandi uterwa inkunga n\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019ibihugu by\u2019i Burayi ku rubyiruko rwo mu karere ka Mediterane y\u2019Uburayi. \nIntego.\nImiyoboro n'intego y'urubyiruko rwa Mediterane, ni zayo kwari ugutezimbere umurimo w'urubyiruko no kugira uruhare mu rubyiruko mu guha imbaraga amashyirahamwe y'urubyiruko guhangana na guverinoma z'igihugu ibitangazamakuru by'igihugu ndetse n'itangazamakuru ryo mu karere. \nImpamvu.\nUyu mushinga waje mu rwego rwo gusubiza ibibazo rusange bihuriweho n\u2019ibihugu byo mu majyepfo ya Mediterane bijyanye no kwinjiza imibereho mu rubyiruko. Ibi birimo, mubindi, kudashishikarira kwishora mubikorwa byabaturage; guhagararirwa bidahagije mu nzego rusange na politiki, ndetse no mu bitangazamakuru bisanzwe; ubushomeri bukabije no kugira uruhare runini rwabagore ku isoko ryumurimo. "}
{"id": "13308", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13308", "title": "Uruganda rw'icyayi rwa Gisovu", "text": "Uruganda rw'icyayi rwa Gisovu ni uruganda rukora i\"cyayi rukitwa\" uruganda rwa Gisovu, ruherereye mu intara y'iburengerazuba mu akarere ka Karongi hafi y'ishyamba rya Nyungwe, ni uruganda rwakoze icyayi cyabaye icyambere, n\u2019 ibiciro cyacyo cyiri hejuru ku isoko rya Mombasa kuko bahatanye n'inganda hafi 200 zihanyuza icyayi, ni\u00a0icyayi\u00a0 cyaguzwe neza\u00a0 kuko cyitungura uruganda\u00a0 gusa\u00a0 ahubwo ngo\u00a0 n\u2019 abaturage\u00a0 bakorana\u00a0 cyangwa\u00a0 bashora\u00a0 icyayi\u00a0 kuri\u00a0 urwo\u00a0 ruganda\u00a0 babyungukiramo\u00a0 igiciro kikazamuka\u00a0 kandi\u00a0 bakazabona\u00a0 n\u2019 agahimbazamusyi."}
{"id": "13309", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13309", "title": "Icyayi cy'icyatsi", "text": "Icyayi ni ikimera\nIcyayi gitera umubiri imbaraga kandi hari byinshi cyungura ubuzima nko gutuza no kuruhuka.mu gihe wumva icyayi kitaryohereye, ushobora gushyiramo ubuki aho kugirango ushyiremo isukari nyinshi.\nIbyiza byo kunwa icyayi.\nIcyayi ni ikinyobwa cya kabiri kinyobwa cyane kurusha ibindi ku isi nyuma y\u2019amazi, gusa igishishikaje kuri iki cyayi cya mukaru ni uko gishobora gutegurwa hifashishijwe ibimera bitandukanye byose bikaba byarushaho gutuma kigira akamaro gakomeye kuri benshi harimo no kukurinda uburwayi butandukanye nka diyabete.\nUruganda rutunganya icyayi mu Rwanda n'imwe.\nRwanda Mountain Tea Ltd Guhera mu mwaka 2006, yabaye umushoramari wigenga w\u2019abasangwabutaka mu nganda z\u2019icyayi n\u2019imirima, agura imigabane myinshi mu mitungo myinshi yahoze ari iya leta, harimo, Nyabihu na Rubaya (mu burengerazuba no mu majyaruguru), Kitabi (mu majyepfo), na Gisakura na Mata (mu majyepfo y'iburengerazuba)."}
{"id": "13310", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13310", "title": "Rugabano Tea Company", "text": "Rugabano Tea Company ni uruganda rw'icyayi\nAho ruri.\nruherereye mu Karere ka Karongi mu Murenge wa Rugabano, mu intara y'uburengerazuba mu akarere ka Karongi, ni uruganda rwatashywe na Perezida Paul Kagame Perezida wu Rwanda.\nAbo rufasha.\nrukaba rufasha abahatuye kwiteza imbere binyuze mu buhinzi bwacyo no gukora mu ruganda, ni uru ruganda rufitiye akamaro abatuye Karongi kuko rwahaye akazi abagera ku 2,000 bakora mu mirimo itandukanye, mu gihe rwafashije abahinzi bagera ku 4,000 ndetse abaturage bimuwe ahubatse uruganda bubakiwe umudugudu ugezweho,\nUbushobozi.\nUruganda rw\u2019icyayi rwa Rugabano rufite ubushobozi bwo gutungaya toni 1000 ku mwaka, ndetse rufite gahunda yo kongera 3% ku musaruro rwohereza hanze y\u2019u Rwanda.\nAmarushanwa.\nUruganda rw\u2019icyayi rwa Rugabano ni urwa gatatu muri aka Karere k\u2019imisozi miremire, rukaba rukurikira izindi nka Gisovu, ruherereye mu Murenge wa Twumba n\u2019urwa Gasenyi rubarizwa mu Murenge wa Gitesi."}
{"id": "13313", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13313", "title": "Mc Tino", "text": "Martin Kasirye (aka MC TINO), azwi nka MC Tino ni umuhanzi, Umu DJ, umushyushyarugamba akaba n\u2019umunyamakuru yavutse italiki 28/11/1984, avukira mu karere ka Jinja muri Uganda. Avuka kuri Baramaze John na nyina we Veronique Tebasurwa\nAmateka.\nMC Tino\u00a0yize muri Kaminuza y\u2019u Rwanda mu ishami rya Business Administration (Marketing), mu mwaka wa 2010. Yakomereje amasomo mu Buhinde, mu ishuri ryitwa Indian institute of Mass Communication, aho yabonye diplome muri Mass communication.\nYasohoye album ye yambere muri 2018 yitwa Umurima. Hariho indirimbo zakuzwe cyane nka 1. Umurima 2. Njyewe Nawe 3. MULA\n. Ubu akora ikiganiro kitwa DUNDA kuri KT Radio.Yabaye Mc mubitaramo binini byose byabaye mu Rwanda. Harimo nibyagiwe bitegurwa na MTN Rwanda\nAkunda gusetsa cyane iyo ari kumwe n\u2019abantu akaba anacisha bugufi mu buzima busanzwe.\nMc Tino: Akaba ariwe watangije group TBB yari igizwe nabasore batatu Tino, Bob and Benja\nMc Tino: Batandukanye nyuma ya \"PGGS\" season 6 ari nabwo yatangiye solo career."}
{"id": "13316", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13316", "title": "Icyayi cya tangawizi", "text": "icyayi cya tangawizi icyayi ni kimwe mu byokunywa binyobwa hakonje umubiri ukagarura ubushyuhe, ubundi kivura ibicurane n\u2019inkorora, ndetse hari n\u2019abakinywa bashaka gutakaza ibiro.\nItangiriro.\nIcyayi cya tangawizi nkuko izina ribivuga ni icyayi gikorwa hifashishijwe ibijumba bya tangawizi byakaswemo uduce, byasekuwe se, cyangwa ifu yakozwe n\u2019ubundi muri bya bijumba.\nIbigize tanggawizi.\nicyayi cya tangawizi ni icyayi ginkize kuri vitamin zinyuranye nka vitamin C, ibisohora uburozi n\u2019imyanda mu mubiri ndetse n\u2019imyunyungugu nka manyeziyumu.\nAkamaro.\nbyaba ari ikibazo uramutse wifuza gutakaza ibiro ntukoreshe iki cyayi. ikicyayi kikaba gifite ubushobozi bwuko umubiri utakaza\ningufu cyane bitewe nuko gifite ingufu zo kuwushyushya, bigatuma umubiri utwika ibinure byawo bigakurikirwa no kugabanuka kwawo.\nKurwanya no kurinda kanseri.\nicyi cyayi kandi kigufasha gusohora imyanda mu mubiri no ku wongerera ubudahangarwa bitwo bikadufasha mu guhangana \nna kanseri ni isesemi ndetse kikaba ari kiza mubuzi bwa muntu ndetse nomu mubiri wacu \nIgikorwa gute.\nTangawizi yihate ukatemo uduce duto cyangwa se uyisekure. Uyicanire mu mazi ibikombe bibiri,ibire mugihe cy\u2019iminota byibuze 10. Nyuma umimine ukamuriremo indimu, wongeremo n\u2019ubuki. Niba ushaka amata, indimu wayireka.\nNiba ushaka icyayi cy\u2019abantu benshi, wagendera kuri iki gipimo."}
{"id": "13317", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13317", "title": "Gatare Tea Company", "text": "Gatare Tea Company ni uruganda rw' icyayi ruba mu murenge wa Karambi wo mu karere ka Nyamasheke barashimira Perezida Kagame kuko uruganda rw\u2019 icyayi bamusabye barubonye ndetse ruri kubafasha kwikura mu bukene, byahuriranye no kwizihiza umunsi mpuzamahanga w\u2019 umuhinzi w\u2019 icyayi kuri uyu wa Kane tariki 20 Ukuboza 2018, ni uruganda rwubatse na Rwanda Mountain Tea."}
