{"id": "13320", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13320", "title": "Uruganda rw` icyayi", "text": "uruganda rw`icyayi.\nInganda z`icyayi zo mu Rwanda zegukanye ibihembo bitanu, mu nama ihuje abahinzi b`icyayi bo mukarere iteraniye i kampala muri Uganda,\nyatangiye ku wa Gatatu. u Rwanda ni narwo rwavuyemo uwegukanye igihembo kiruta ibindi mu bahinzi b`icyayi muri afurika, cyahawe Rwanda Mountain Tea.iyi nama izwi nka`4th African tea Convention` yateguwe n` umuryango w`bacuruzi b`icyayi muri afurika y` iburasirasuba, yitabirwa n`abasaga 500 baturutse mu bihugu bisaga 25. yafunguwe kumugaragaro na Minisiteri w`Intebe wa Uganda, Dr Ruhakana Rugunda."}
{"id": "13321", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=13321", "title": "Kitabi tea factory", "text": "kitabi tea factory ni uruganda rw'icyayi ruba mu akarere ka Nyamagabe mu intara y'amajyepfo, rukaba rwarubatse naRwanda Mountain Tea, rukaba rukora ibiro miriyoni 1.7 byicyayi, umuyobozi mukuru wa Rwanda Mountain Tea yavuzeko uru ruganda rwaguzwe miliyali 2.3 amafaranga y'u Rwanda, hakaba hari izindi nganda zizahabwa abikorera ni nka Mulindi, Gisovu, Mata, Gisakura na Shagasha."}
